#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:4:0:57"
msgid "収穫を手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать урожай?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 頼んだよ！
#. de: Worauf wartest du?
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Je compte sur vous<nbsp>!
#. column 56: 君！　収穫を手伝ってくれないか！急がないと大切な果実をオポオポに取られてしまうよ！
#. column 57: 収穫を手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: そうかい。じゃあ、ほかの人に頼むよ。
msgctxt "FateEvent:4:0:60"
msgid "頼んだよ！"
msgstr "Полагаюсь на тебя!"

#. ja: そうかい。じゃあ、ほかの人に頼むよ。
#. de: Pah, ich finde schon jemand anderen, keine Sorge.
#. fr: Vous n'êtes pas très sympa, dites donc.
#. column 56: 君！　収穫を手伝ってくれないか！急がないと大切な果実をオポオポに取られてしまうよ！
#. column 57: 収穫を手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: 頼んだよ！
msgctxt "FateEvent:4:0:62"
msgid "そうかい。じゃあ、ほかの人に頼むよ。"
msgstr "Ну что ж, тогда попрошу кого-нибудь другого."

#. ja: 果実を持ってきてくれたのかい？
#. de: 果実を持ってきてくれたのかい？
#. fr: Vous m'apportez des prunes<nbsp>?
#. column 60: ありがとう！
#. column 62: おや、違うのかい。
msgctxt "FateEvent:5:0:56"
msgid "果実を持ってきてくれたのかい？"
msgstr "Принёс плоды?"

#. ja: ありがとう！
#. de: ありがとう！
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>!
#. column 56: 果実を持ってきてくれたのかい？
#. column 62: おや、違うのかい。
msgctxt "FateEvent:5:0:60"
msgid "ありがとう！"
msgstr "Спасибо!"

#. ja: おや、違うのかい。
#. de: おや、違うのかい。
#. fr: Ah non<nbsp>? Dommage.
#. column 56: 果実を持ってきてくれたのかい？
#. column 60: ありがとう！
msgctxt "FateEvent:5:0:62"
msgid "おや、違うのかい。"
msgstr "Ой, нет? Жаль."

#. ja: 果実を集めて持ってきてくれ！
#. de: 果実を集めて持ってきてくれ！
#. fr: Récupérez les prunes qui jonchent le sol et apportez-les-moi<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:6:0:56"
msgid "果実を集めて持ってきてくれ！"
msgstr "Собери плоды и принеси мне!"

#. ja: ぐぬぬ、小賢しい密猟者め！<br>奴ら、獲物を隠して密猟行為をしらばっくれるつもりだ。
#. de: Ihr haltet euch wohl für besonders schlau? Wir werden euch das Wildern schon austreiben!
#. fr: Maudits braconniers<nbsp>! Ils essaient de cacher les fourrures qu'ils ont chassées pour les récupérer quand nous serons partis.
#. column 57: We must stop them at any cost! Please, good <if $gn4>lady<else>sir</if>. Lend us your blade!
#. column 58: Assist in recovering the poached hides?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Good luck, and may the Matron bless you!
#. column 62: Very well. We shall see to this task on our own.
msgctxt "FateEvent:7:0:56"
msgid "Vile poachers! They seek to hide their trophies so that they might return and collect them once we have gone."
msgstr "Проклятые браконьеры!<br>Спрятали добычу, чтобы вернуться за ней, когда мы уйдём."

#. ja: 我々鬼哭隊の目は欺けんぞ！<br>冒険者よ、密猟者から証拠の品を集めるために<br>我らに力を貸してくれ！
#. de: Komm schon, hilf uns! Nimm diesen Dreckskerlen Beweise ab, dass sie unerlaubt Tiere jagen!
#. fr: Nous devons les stopper à tout prix<nbsp>! Je vous en prie, joignez-vous à moi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Vile poachers! They seek to hide their trophies so that they might return and collect them once we have gone.
#. column 58: Assist in recovering the poached hides?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Good luck, and may the Matron bless you!
#. column 62: Very well. We shall see to this task on our own.
#. macro: <if $gn4>lady<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:7:0:57"
msgid "We must stop them at any cost! Please, good <if $gn4>lady<else>sir</if>. Lend us your blade!"
msgstr "Надо остановить их любой ценой! Прошу вас, любезный <if $gn4>госпожа<else>господин</if>, помогите нам!"

#. ja: 証拠を集めてきますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Bist du bereit, Beweise zu sammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Récupérer les fourrures braconnées<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Vile poachers! They seek to hide their trophies so that they might return and collect them once we have gone.
#. column 57: We must stop them at any cost! Please, good <if $gn4>lady<else>sir</if>. Lend us your blade!
#. column 60: Good luck, and may the Matron bless you!
#. column 62: Very well. We shall see to this task on our own.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:7:0:58"
msgid "Assist in recovering the poached hides?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь вернуть шкуры, добытые браконьерами?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: よし、頼んだぞ！
#. de: Sehr gut! Dann los!
#. fr: Bonne chance, et que Nophica vous garde<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Vile poachers! They seek to hide their trophies so that they might return and collect them once we have gone.
#. column 57: We must stop them at any cost! Please, good <if $gn4>lady<else>sir</if>. Lend us your blade!
#. column 58: Assist in recovering the poached hides?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Very well. We shall see to this task on our own.
msgctxt "FateEvent:7:0:60"
msgid "Good luck, and may the Matron bless you!"
msgstr "Удачи! Да благословит тебя Матрона!"

#. ja: ううむ、仕方ない……。<br>我々だけでも証拠を掴んでみせる！
#. de: Mist! Dann müssen wir die Sache selbst erledigen!
#. fr: Bien, dans ce cas je me chargerai de cette tâche moi-même.
#. column 56: Vile poachers! They seek to hide their trophies so that they might return and collect them once we have gone.
#. column 57: We must stop them at any cost! Please, good <if $gn4>lady<else>sir</if>. Lend us your blade!
#. column 58: Assist in recovering the poached hides?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Good luck, and may the Matron bless you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:7:0:62"
msgid "Very well. We shall see to this task on our own."
msgstr "Что ж, ничего не поделаешь...<br>Сами добудем доказательства!"

#. ja: 密猟の証拠を持ってきてくれたのか？
#. de: Hast du Beweise für das Wildern gefunden?
#. fr: Avez-vous pu reprendre des fourrures aux braconniers<nbsp>?
#. column 60: You have my thanks, adventurer, but there may still be more poachers in the area.
#. column 62: The area is still crawling with poachers. See if you cannot find them before they escape!
msgctxt "FateEvent:8:0:56"
msgid "Were you able to recover any of the poached hides?"
msgstr "Удалось вернуть шкуры, добытые браконьерами?"

#. ja: よくやった。また見つけたら持ってきてくれ。
#. de: Ausgezeichnet! Das lob ich mir. Immer weiter so, je mehr Beweise, desto besser.
#. fr: Je vous remercie, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>, mais il reste peut-être des braconniers dans les environs.
#. column 56: Were you able to recover any of the poached hides?
#. column 62: The area is still crawling with poachers. See if you cannot find them before they escape!
msgctxt "FateEvent:8:0:60"
msgid "You have my thanks, adventurer, but there may still be more poachers in the area."
msgstr "Благодарю тебя, искатель приключений. Но браконьеры могут быть ещё где-то поблизости."

#. ja: そうか、見つけたらすぐ持ってきてくれ。
#. de: Hmpf. Falls du ganz zufällig doch auf was stößt, bring es mir. Je mehr Beweise, desto besser.
#. fr: La zone grouille encore de braconniers. Chargez-vous d'eux avant qu'ils ne s'enfuient<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Were you able to recover any of the poached hides?
#. column 60: You have my thanks, adventurer, but there may still be more poachers in the area.
msgctxt "FateEvent:8:0:62"
msgid "The area is still crawling with poachers. See if you cannot find them before they escape!"
msgstr "Понятно. Если найдёшь что-нибудь, сразу принеси мне."

#. ja: 密猟者が狩りを行った証拠を持ってきてくれ！
#. de: Beweise brauchen wir, verstehst du? Sonst können wir diese Wilderer nicht überführen.
#. fr: Faites vite<nbsp>! Nous devons récupérer les fourrures avant que les braconniers puissent les cacher<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:9:0:56"
msgid "Hurry, adventurer! We must recover the hides before the poachers can hide them!"
msgstr "Скорее, искатель приключений! Надо вернуть шкуры, пока браконьеры их не спрятали!"

#. ja: おのれゴブリン族め……<br>油断していたとはいえ、商品を根こそぎ奪われるとは……。
#. de: Diese verdammten Gnome! Dass uns die Goblins die gesamte Ware abjagen würden!
#. fr: Ah, ces fichus Gobelins<nbsp>! J'vous jure... Alors que je me soulageais en vitesse contre cet arbre, ces stupides créatures en ont profité pour me voler mes mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses.
#. column 57: I am but a humble merchant, untrained in the ways of battle. Might I ask of your assistance in reclaiming my livelihood? I shall make it worth your while.
#. column 58: Assist in reclaiming the stolen merchandise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Show them what it means to cross an Ul'dahn!
#. column 62: I shall remember this act of unkindness, adventurer!
msgctxt "FateEvent:10:0:56"
msgid "Filthy goblins! I merely stopped to relieve myself behind one of these trees, only to find my wares missing when I returned!"
msgstr "Проклятые гоблины! Я всего-то отошёл за дерево по нужде, а вернулся — товара и след простыл!"

#. ja: そこの冒険者！<br>にっくきゴブリン族どもから、<br>私の商品を取り戻してきてくれないか！？
#. de: He! Lass mal deine Abenteuer ruhen und hilf uns, unsere Waren zurückzuholen!
#. fr: Je ne suis qu'un modeste marchand<nbsp>; la bagarre, c'est pas mon truc. Pourrais-je vous demander de récupérer mes biens<nbsp>? Je vous récompenserai, bien entendu.
#. column 56: Filthy goblins! I merely stopped to relieve myself behind one of these trees, only to find my wares missing when I returned!
#. column 58: Assist in reclaiming the stolen merchandise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Show them what it means to cross an Ul'dahn!
#. column 62: I shall remember this act of unkindness, adventurer!
msgctxt "FateEvent:10:0:57"
msgid "I am but a humble merchant, untrained in the ways of battle. Might I ask of your assistance in reclaiming my livelihood? I shall make it worth your while."
msgstr "Я всего лишь скромный торговец и драться не умею. Не поможете вернуть мои товары? Я вас щедро отблагодарю."

#. ja: 商品を取り戻してきますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Beschaffst du die Waren wieder?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le marchand à récupérer ses mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Filthy goblins! I merely stopped to relieve myself behind one of these trees, only to find my wares missing when I returned!
#. column 57: I am but a humble merchant, untrained in the ways of battle. Might I ask of your assistance in reclaiming my livelihood? I shall make it worth your while.
#. column 60: Show them what it means to cross an Ul'dahn!
#. column 62: I shall remember this act of unkindness, adventurer!
