#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:10:0:58"
msgid "Assist in reclaiming the stolen merchandise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь вернуть украденные товары?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: やつらに思い知らせてやってくれ！
#. de: Recht so. Nur nicht zimperlich sein - die sind es schließlich auch nicht.
#. fr: Montrez-leur qu'on ne se moque pas d'un Uldien impunément<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Filthy goblins! I merely stopped to relieve myself behind one of these trees, only to find my wares missing when I returned!
#. column 57: I am but a humble merchant, untrained in the ways of battle. Might I ask of your assistance in reclaiming my livelihood? I shall make it worth your while.
#. column 58: Assist in reclaiming the stolen merchandise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I shall remember this act of unkindness, adventurer!
msgctxt "FateEvent:10:0:60"
msgid "Show them what it means to cross an Ul'dahn!"
msgstr "Покажи им, что бывает с теми, кто связывается с ульданцем!"

#. ja: ふん、お前の顔、覚えておいたからな！
#. de: Dein Gesicht merke ich mir, nur dass du's weißt.
#. fr: Et moi qui croyais que les aventuriers étaient d'une nature généreuse, je me trompais...
#. column 56: Filthy goblins! I merely stopped to relieve myself behind one of these trees, only to find my wares missing when I returned!
#. column 57: I am but a humble merchant, untrained in the ways of battle. Might I ask of your assistance in reclaiming my livelihood? I shall make it worth your while.
#. column 58: Assist in reclaiming the stolen merchandise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Show them what it means to cross an Ul'dahn!
msgctxt "FateEvent:10:0:62"
msgid "I shall remember this act of unkindness, adventurer!"
msgstr "Хм! Я тебя запомнил, искатель приключений!"

#. ja: おお、私の商品たちは無事か？
#. de: Was ist mit unserer Ware? Alles gesichert?
#. fr: Mes mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses étaient-elles intactes<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Yes, but there was more... Much more. I beg of thee, return to me what is rightfully mine!
#. column 62: Then why are you here talking with me!? Find my crates!
msgctxt "FateEvent:11:0:56"
msgid "Were my wares unharmed?"
msgstr "Мой товар не пострадал?"

#. ja: もっとあったはずだ！<br>全部、取り戻すんだ！
#. de: Gut! Das ist aber noch nicht alles. Such weiter.
#. fr: Oui, mais il y en avait d'autres... Bien plus<nbsp>! Je vous en supplie, retrouvez ce qui m'appartient<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Were my wares unharmed?
#. column 62: Then why are you here talking with me!? Find my crates!
msgctxt "FateEvent:11:0:60"
msgid "Yes, but there was more... Much more. I beg of thee, return to me what is rightfully mine!"
msgstr "Но ведь там было больше... Гораздо больше! Умоляю, верни всё, что принадлежит мне!"

#. ja: ええい、口を動かすな！　手を動かせ！
#. de: Du traust dich mit leeren Händen zu mir? Allerhand.
#. fr: Alors que faites-vous là<nbsp>!? Du nerf, bon sang<nbsp>! Vous devez récupérer mes mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Were my wares unharmed?
#. column 60: Yes, but there was more... Much more. I beg of thee, return to me what is rightfully mine!
msgctxt "FateEvent:11:0:62"
msgid "Then why are you here talking with me!? Find my crates!"
msgstr "И чего ты здесь со мной разговариваешь?! Иди ищи мои ящики!"

#. ja: ゴブリンに奪われた商品を取り戻してくるんだ！
#. de: Hol die gestohlenen Waren von den Goblins zurück!
#. fr: Hâtez-vous avant que les Gobelins ne s'enfuient avec mes mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:12:0:56"
msgid "Make haste before the goblins make away with my crates!"
msgstr "Поторопись, пока гоблины не скрылись с моими ящиками!"

#. ja: キミの持っている、その石の欠片……<br>ワタシに譲ってくれないかね？
#. de: Du hast da aber einen interessanten Stein. Würdest du ihn mir überlassen?
#. fr: Ce gros rocher que t'as là prend de la place dans ton sac. J'peux t'en débarrasser, si tu veux.
#. column 57: Give the golem fragment to the prospector?
#. column 60: Aye... This'll do jus' nicely. If ye happen upon any more, I'll be here a-waitin'.
#. column 62: And what do <i>you</i> need with that ol' rock anywise?
msgctxt "FateEvent:13:0:56"
msgid "That big rock ye have there be takin' up an awful lot o' space in yer bag, like. Might be that I could take it off yer hands."
msgstr "Камень-то у тебя здоровенный, места в сумке много занимает. Может, мне его забрать?"

#. ja: 譲りますか？
#. de: Gibst du das Steinstück her?
#. fr: Donner le fragment de golem au prospecteur<nbsp>?
#. column 56: That big rock ye have there be takin' up an awful lot o' space in yer bag, like. Might be that I could take it off yer hands.
#. column 60: Aye... This'll do jus' nicely. If ye happen upon any more, I'll be here a-waitin'.
#. column 62: And what do <i>you</i> need with that ol' rock anywise?
msgctxt "FateEvent:13:0:57"
msgid "Give the golem fragment to the prospector?"
msgstr "Отдать осколок голема старателю?"

#. ja: ふむ……いい石だ。<br>もっと見つけたら、また譲ってくれ。
#. de: Oh ja, das ist ein perfektes Stück von einem Golem. Sag, könntest du mir noch mehr bringen?
#. fr: Parfait. N'hésite pas à revenir me voir si jamais t'en trouves d'autres, je ne compte pas bouger d'ici.
#. column 56: That big rock ye have there be takin' up an awful lot o' space in yer bag, like. Might be that I could take it off yer hands.
#. column 57: Give the golem fragment to the prospector?
#. column 62: And what do <i>you</i> need with that ol' rock anywise?
msgctxt "FateEvent:13:0:60"
msgid "Aye... This'll do jus' nicely. If ye happen upon any more, I'll be here a-waitin'."
msgstr "Ага... То что надо. Найдёшь ещё — приноси, я буду здесь."

#. ja: そうか、残念だ。
#. de: Das ist wirklich schade. Du weißt gar nicht, wie sehr du der Wissenschaft mit den Golemsteinen helfen würdest!
#. fr: Tss... Quel<if $gn4>le</if> radin<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>! Et qu'est-ce que tu comptes faire de ce vieux rocher, de toute manière<nbsp>? Le manger<nbsp>!?
#. column 56: That big rock ye have there be takin' up an awful lot o' space in yer bag, like. Might be that I could take it off yer hands.
#. column 57: Give the golem fragment to the prospector?
#. column 60: Aye... This'll do jus' nicely. If ye happen upon any more, I'll be here a-waitin'.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:13:0:62"
msgid "And what do <i>you</i> need with that ol' rock anywise?"
msgstr "И что <i>ты</i> собираешься делать с этой старой каменюкой?"

#. ja: ゴーレムの体を構成する石材……<br>ワタシが今、もっとも注目しているモノだ。
#. de: Steine aus dem Körper eines Golems ... Es muss Spuren der Veränderung geben, die der Funke des Lebens in dem einst toten Gestein hinterließ. Wenn ich sie fände ...!
#. fr: Tu vois comme les pierres des golems s'attirent entre elles<nbsp>? J'suis sûr qu'elles contiennent du métal.
#. column 57: Fetch me a few fragments and I'll prove it!
msgctxt "FateEvent:14:0:56"
msgid "Ye see how them golem stones is drawn to one another like a crow is to carrion? I reckon it's 'cause the stones is carryin' metal within."
msgstr "Видишь, как камни големов тянутся друг к другу, словно вороны к падали? Думаю, всё дело в металле внутри."

#. ja: もし見つけたら持ってきてほしい。<br>よろしく頼むよ。
#. de: Das Geheimnis des Lebens! Nur einige Golemsteine noch, und ich werde die Schöpfung verstehen. Hilf mir dabei!
#. fr: Trouve-moi quelques fragments et je pourrai le prouver<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ye see how them golem stones is drawn to one another like a crow is to carrion? I reckon it's 'cause the stones is carryin' metal within.
msgctxt "FateEvent:14:0:57"
msgid "Fetch me a few fragments and I'll prove it!"
msgstr "Найдёшь несколько осколков — принеси мне, и я это докажу!"

#. ja: これだけあれば十分だろう。
#. de: Das dürfte ausreichen.
#. fr: Voilà qui devrait suffire.
msgctxt "FateEvent:15:0:56"
msgid "Yes, this should be more than enough."
msgstr "Да, этого должно хватить с избытком."

#. ja: 十分な数が集まった。ありがとう。
#. de: Hervorragend. Das müsste genug sein. Vielen Dank!
#. fr: Mes éclaireurs n'ont pas repéré de braconniers dans les environs. Ça ira pour le moment. Je vous remercie.
msgctxt "FateEvent:16:0:56"
msgid "My scouts report no more poachers in the area. This will have to do for now. You have my thanks, adventurer."
msgstr "Разведчики говорят, поблизости больше нет браконьеров. Пока хватит. Спасибо тебе, искатель приключений."

#. ja: ひぃ、ふぅ、みぃ……こんなもんか。
#. de: Eins ... zwei ... Ist das alles? Na gut.
#. fr: Un... deux... trois... J'aurais juré en avoir plus... Bon, tant pis. Je n'ai qu'à augmenter mes prix.
msgctxt "FateEvent:17:0:56"
msgid "One... Two... Three... I could have sworn I carried more... Oh, well. That is of no matter. I shall merely increase my prices!"
msgstr "Раз... два... три... А я был уверен, что у меня их больше... Ну да ладно. Просто подниму цены!"

#. ja: いい石が揃った。満足したよ。
#. de: Ja ... Das ist genau, was ich brauche. Es wird gelingen ...
#. fr: Hé hé hé<nbsp>! Je vais rapporter ces fragments dans ma cabine. Et que je ne te voie pas me suivre<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:18:0:56"
msgid "Heh heh. I'll be takin' these fragments back to me cabin now. And don't ye think of followin' me now, either!"
msgstr "Хе-хе. Заберу-ка я эти осколки к себе в каюту. И не вздумай за мной увязаться!"

#. ja: ……あ、あの、今いいです？
#. de: Darf ich dich kurz stören?
#. fr: Je... euh... Je peux vous demander un service<nbsp>?
#. column 57: I'm supposed to be participating in a group training exercise for Order of the Twin Adder recruits...but my party is short a...few members, and...
#. column 58: Would you mind joining me? It would only be for a few moments.
#. column 59: Join the serpent recruit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: If there was only a simple and convenient way to search for a party...
msgctxt "FateEvent:19:0:56"
msgid "I...uh... Excuse me..."
msgstr "Я... э-э... Извините..."

#. ja: 次の試験が、教官との模擬戦なんですが、<br>その、班行動でってルールで、その……
#. de: Wir haben da bald so ein Training, und äh, wir müssen Gruppen bilden ... und gegen den Ausbilder antreten. Ein sadistischer Wahnsinniger!
#. fr: Je dois participer à un exercice d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment des recrues de l'ordre des Deux Vipères, mais mon groupe a perdu... quelques membres.
#. column 56: I...uh... Excuse me...
#. column 58: Would you mind joining me? It would only be for a few moments.
#. column 59: Join the serpent recruit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: If there was only a simple and convenient way to search for a party...
msgctxt "FateEvent:19:0:57"
msgid "I'm supposed to be participating in a group training exercise for Order of the Twin Adder recruits...but my party is short a...few members, and..."
msgstr "Я должен участвовать в групповом учебном бою для новобранцев ордена Двух Змей... Но в моей группе не хватает... нескольких человек, и..."

#. ja: ちょっと、たまたま人数が合わなくて、<br>組む相手を待ってるんですけど、<br>どうですかね……？
#. de: Und ... ich bin irgendwie übrig geblieben, und jetzt bräuchte ich unbedingt einen Partner, sonst kann ich mein Testament schreiben. Hilfst du mir ...?
#. fr: Vous voulez bien vous joindre à moi<nbsp>? Ça ne prendra pas longtemps.
#. column 56: I...uh... Excuse me...
#. column 57: I'm supposed to be participating in a group training exercise for Order of the Twin Adder recruits...but my party is short a...few members, and...
#. column 59: Join the serpent recruit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: If there was only a simple and convenient way to search for a party...
msgctxt "FateEvent:19:0:58"
msgid "Would you mind joining me? It would only be for a few moments."
msgstr "Не могли бы вы присоединиться? Это всего на пару минут."

#. ja: 組んであげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Stellst du dich als Übungspartner zur Verfügung?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Participer à l'exercice avec la recrue<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I...uh... Excuse me...
#. column 57: I'm supposed to be participating in a group training exercise for Order of the Twin Adder recruits...but my party is short a...few members, and...
#. column 58: Would you mind joining me? It would only be for a few moments.
#. column 62: If there was only a simple and convenient way to search for a party...
