msgctxt "FateEvent:19:0:59"
msgid "Join the serpent recruit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Присоединиться к новобранцу Двух Змей?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: はぁ……<br>もう班行動とかやめてほしい……。
#. de: Ach ... Wenn es doch diese blöden Gruppenübungen nicht geben würde! Ich bin geliefert.
#. fr: (soupire)... Si seulement je pouvais retrouver mon groupe...
#. column 56: I...uh... Excuse me...
#. column 57: I'm supposed to be participating in a group training exercise for Order of the Twin Adder recruits...but my party is short a...few members, and...
#. column 58: Would you mind joining me? It would only be for a few moments.
#. column 59: Join the serpent recruit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:19:0:62"
msgid "If there was only a simple and convenient way to search for a party..."
msgstr "Вот бы найти группу быстро и без хлопот..."

#. ja: このあたりのツリースラッグは、<br>ミツバチにとって大切な花を<br>どんどん食べちゃうんですよ。
#. de: Die Baumschnecken in dieser Gegend machen den Honigbienen das Leben schwer.
#. fr: J'espère ne plus jamais voir de limace arboricole<nbsp>!
#. column 57: The repugnant creatures come down from the sentinels to feed on all the flowers, then retreat to the treetops before we can slice off their slimy heads.
#. column 58: There's only so much a beekeeper can do...but you! A mere slug (or thirty) wouldn't be a match for <i>your</i> skill and cunning. What do you say?
#. column 59: Assist the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, and just in time, as well! Look, here they come!
#. column 62: Without any flowers, how will our bees make any honey...?
msgctxt "FateEvent:20:0:56"
msgid "If I never see a tree slug again it will be too soon!"
msgstr "Если я ещё хоть раз увижу древесного слизня, то слишком рано!"

#. ja: 最近は数もどんどん増えていて、<br>集団でやってくるようになったんです。<br>今日もそろそろ来るんじゃないかな……。
#. de: Sie fressen alle Blüten ab und vermehren sich rasant! Sie werden gleich wieder hier einfallen, du wirst sehen.
#. fr: Ces répugnantes créatures descendent des hauteurs pour dévorer toutes les fleurs, puis dis<shy>pa<shy>rais<shy>sent avant qu'on ait pu leur couper la tête.
#. column 56: If I never see a tree slug again it will be too soon!
#. column 58: There's only so much a beekeeper can do...but you! A mere slug (or thirty) wouldn't be a match for <i>your</i> skill and cunning. What do you say?
#. column 59: Assist the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, and just in time, as well! Look, here they come!
#. column 62: Without any flowers, how will our bees make any honey...?
msgctxt "FateEvent:20:0:57"
msgid "The repugnant creatures come down from the sentinels to feed on all the flowers, then retreat to the treetops before we can slice off their slimy heads."
msgstr "Эти мерзкие твари спускаются с верхушек, пожирают цветы, а потом снова забираются наверх, пока мы не успеем отрубить им склизкие головы."

#. ja: 冒険者さん、なんとかしてくれませんか？
#. de: Du fürchtest dich doch sicher nicht vor ein paar Schnecken, oder?
#. fr: Je ne suis qu'un pauvre apiculteur, mais vous... Les limaces n'ont aucune chance contre votre ruse et vos compétences<nbsp>! Qu'en dites-vous<nbsp>?
#. column 56: If I never see a tree slug again it will be too soon!
#. column 57: The repugnant creatures come down from the sentinels to feed on all the flowers, then retreat to the treetops before we can slice off their slimy heads.
#. column 59: Assist the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, and just in time, as well! Look, here they come!
#. column 62: Without any flowers, how will our bees make any honey...?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:20:0:58"
msgid "There's only so much a beekeeper can do...but you! A mere slug (or thirty) wouldn't be a match for <i>your</i> skill and cunning. What do you say?"
msgstr "Пчеловод и сам кое-что может... но ты! Да ты хоть с десятком слизней справишься благодаря <i>своему</i> мастерству и хитрости. Ну как, берёшься?"

#. ja: なんとかしてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du helfen, die Schnecken zu bekämpfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'apiculteur<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: If I never see a tree slug again it will be too soon!
#. column 57: The repugnant creatures come down from the sentinels to feed on all the flowers, then retreat to the treetops before we can slice off their slimy heads.
#. column 58: There's only so much a beekeeper can do...but you! A mere slug (or thirty) wouldn't be a match for <i>your</i> skill and cunning. What do you say?
#. column 60: Oh, and just in time, as well! Look, here they come!
#. column 62: Without any flowers, how will our bees make any honey...?
