msgctxt "FateEvent:20:0:59"
msgid "Assist the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь пчеловодам?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おおっ、さすが！<br>ほらほら、さっそく来ましたよ！
#. de: Ah, vielen Dank. Ich wusste, dass du Mut hast. Uah, da glitschen sie schon heran ...!
#. fr: Oh, vous tombez à point nommé. Regardez, les voilà<nbsp>!
#. column 56: If I never see a tree slug again it will be too soon!
#. column 57: The repugnant creatures come down from the sentinels to feed on all the flowers, then retreat to the treetops before we can slice off their slimy heads.
#. column 58: There's only so much a beekeeper can do...but you! A mere slug (or thirty) wouldn't be a match for <i>your</i> skill and cunning. What do you say?
#. column 59: Assist the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Without any flowers, how will our bees make any honey...?
msgctxt "FateEvent:20:0:60"
msgid "Oh, and just in time, as well! Look, here they come!"
msgstr "И как раз вовремя! Гляди, вот они!"

#. ja: このままだと蜂蜜の量にも影響が……。
#. de: Wenn wir nichts unternehmen, ist der Bienenbestand ernsthaft gefährdet!
#. fr: Sans fleurs, comment nos abeilles vont-elles pouvoir fabriquer notre précieux miel, hein<nbsp>!?
#. column 56: If I never see a tree slug again it will be too soon!
#. column 57: The repugnant creatures come down from the sentinels to feed on all the flowers, then retreat to the treetops before we can slice off their slimy heads.
#. column 58: There's only so much a beekeeper can do...but you! A mere slug (or thirty) wouldn't be a match for <i>your</i> skill and cunning. What do you say?
#. column 59: Assist the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, and just in time, as well! Look, here they come!
msgctxt "FateEvent:20:0:62"
msgid "Without any flowers, how will our bees make any honey...?"
msgstr "Как же пчёлы будут делать мёд, если цветов не останется?.."

#. ja: ツリースラッグをやっつけちゃってください！
#. de: Beseitige die Baumschnecken!
#. fr: Je vous en prie<nbsp>! Tuez ces limaces<nbsp>! Pensez aux pauvres abeilles<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:21:0:56"
msgid "Please! You must slay the slugs! Think of the bees!"
msgstr "Прошу! Убей этих слизней! Подумай о пчёлах!"

#. ja: 君！　冒険者だな！？<br>助けてくれ、もう限界だっ！
#. de: Ah! Die Rettung! Du kommst gerade recht!
#. fr: Je vous en prie, aidez-moi<nbsp>! Spenser, un habitué du bar, est devenu in<shy>con<shy>trô<shy>la<shy>ble.
#. column 57: There's a good reason they call him Spenser of the Bottomless Cup. I don't believe the sot's been sober a day in his life.
#. column 58: And now he's taken a fancy to pounding in the face of any poor sod who happens to even breathe in his direction...myself included. I beg you, put the pissed tosspot in his place!
#. column 59: Deal with Spenser?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then who ever will save us!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:22:0:56"
msgid "You! You must do something about that besotted brute! He's out of control!"
msgstr "Эй, ты! Разберись с этим пьяным громилой! Он совсем вышел из-под контроля!"

#. ja: あの酒癖の悪い「スペンサー」のことだ。<br>酒を呑むと、必ず暴れまわって手がつけられなくなる。<br>あいつめ、酒場の掟を知らんはずがなかろうに！
#. de: Spenser, dieser Trunkenbold, schlägt hier noch alles kurz und klein. Da wankt er eben noch ganz friedlich herum, und plötzlich rastet er aus!
#. fr: Ce n'est pas pour rien qu'on l'appelle le “Boit-sans-soif”. Il ne sait pas s'arrêter, et il change du tout au tout quand il boit.
#. column 56: You! You must do something about that besotted brute! He's out of control!
#. column 58: And now he's taken a fancy to pounding in the face of any poor sod who happens to even breathe in his direction...myself included. I beg you, put the pissed tosspot in his place!
#. column 59: Deal with Spenser?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then who ever will save us!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:22:0:57"
msgid "There's a good reason they call him Spenser of the Bottomless Cup. I don't believe the sot's been sober a day in his life."
msgstr "Не зря его прозвали Спенсером Бездонная Чаша. Кажется, он ни дня в жизни трезвым не был."

#. ja: 今までは、俺が殴られて収まるならと思ってたが、<br>もう我慢できん……！<br>頼む、あいつにキツく灸を据えてやってくれ！
#. de: Einen kleinen Stoß in die Rippen kann ich ja vertragen, aber langsam platzt mir die Hutschnur. Irgendwer muss dem Rüpel Manieren beibringen!
#. fr: Ivre, il s'en prend à tous ceux qui passent par là, amis comme inconnus. Je vous en prie, maîtrisez-le<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You! You must do something about that besotted brute! He's out of control!
#. column 57: There's a good reason they call him Spenser of the Bottomless Cup. I don't believe the sot's been sober a day in his life.
#. column 59: Deal with Spenser?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then who ever will save us!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:22:0:58"
msgid "And now he's taken a fancy to pounding in the face of any poor sod who happens to even breathe in his direction...myself included. I beg you, put the pissed tosspot in his place!"
msgstr "Теперь он лупит каждого, кто просто посмотрит в его сторону... Меня тоже! Умоляю, поставь этого пьянчугу на место!"

#. ja: 引き受けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du den Trunkenbold Spenser in die Schranken weisen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Maîtriser Spenser<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You! You must do something about that besotted brute! He's out of control!
#. column 57: There's a good reason they call him Spenser of the Bottomless Cup. I don't believe the sot's been sober a day in his life.
#. column 58: And now he's taken a fancy to pounding in the face of any poor sod who happens to even breathe in his direction...myself included. I beg you, put the pissed tosspot in his place!
#. column 62: Then who ever will save us!?
