#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:22:0:59"
msgid "Deal with Spenser?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Разобраться со Спенсером?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そ、そんな……。
#. de: Na ja, ist ja auch nicht dein Bier ... Bis er dich mal am Kragen hat! Du wirst schon sehen!
#. fr: Pitié<nbsp>! J'ai une femme et des enfants<nbsp>! Vous devez m'aider<nbsp>!!
#. column 56: You! You must do something about that besotted brute! He's out of control!
#. column 57: There's a good reason they call him Spenser of the Bottomless Cup. I don't believe the sot's been sober a day in his life.
#. column 58: And now he's taken a fancy to pounding in the face of any poor sod who happens to even breathe in his direction...myself included. I beg you, put the pissed tosspot in his place!
#. column 59: Deal with Spenser?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:22:0:62"
msgid "Then who ever will save us!?"
msgstr "Так кто же нас спасёт?!"

#. ja: あの酔っ払いをなんとかしてくれ～！
#. de: Bring diesen Säufer zur Vernunft!
#. fr: Débarrassez-nous de ce sac à vin<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:23:0:56"
msgid "I don't know how much more of this I can take!"
msgstr "Сколько же ещё это терпеть!"

#. ja: レッドベリー砦の中に入りますか？
#. de: Willst du das Rotbauch-Nest betreten?
#. fr: Entrer dans le Guêpier des Ventrerouge<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Pass through the gates?
msgctxt "FateEvent:24:0:56"
msgid "Enter Redbelly Hive?"
msgstr "Войти в улей Краснобрюхов?"

#. ja: 中に入りますか？
#. de: Eintreten?
#. fr: Passer les portes<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Enter Redbelly Hive?
msgctxt "FateEvent:24:0:57"
msgid "Pass through the gates?"
msgstr "Пройти через ворота?"

#. ja: 我々は「密猟者」の取り締まりを行っている。<br>ここより南方にて、密猟者とゴブリン族が、<br>取り引きをしていることを突き止めた。
#. de: Wir sind zur Bekämpfung von Wilderern hier. Anscheinend hatte die Bande, hinter der wir her sind, einen Handel mit den Goblins vor - an einem Lagerplatz südlich von hier.
#. fr: Nos éclaireurs indiquent que des marchands gobelins s'entendent avec des braconniers dans un camp non loin pour vendre des fourrures qu'ils ont volées.
#. column 57: The talks, however, do not seem to be going well, as the two parties have begun fighting. This provides us with the perfect opportunity to strike two birds with one stone.
#. column 58: Good adventurer. Would you assist my unit in our ambush of the outlaws?
#. column 59: Aid the Wood Wailers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent. Hurry to the campsite while there is still chaos.
#. column 62: And so you would sit idly by and allow these malefactors to defile the forest? I will never understand you adventurers...
msgctxt "FateEvent:25:0:56"
msgid "Our scouts report that goblin merchants have met with a band of poachers at a nearby camp to parley the sale of unlawfully obtained hides."
msgstr "Мы преследуем браконьеров. Разведчики выяснили, что южнее отсюда в лагере гоблины-торговцы ведут переговоры с ними о покупке незаконно добытых шкур."

#. ja: 密猟者とゴブリン族は、交渉に失敗したのか<br>小競り合いを始めたようだ。<br>……これは好機だぞ。
#. de: Aber offenbar haben sie sich in die Haare gekriegt, hehe. Das ist die Gelegenheit zum Zuschlagen!
#. fr: Cependant, les négociations ne semblent pas se dérouler comme prévu, les deux camps ayant commencé à en venir aux mains. C'est l'occasion de frapper un grand coup<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Our scouts report that goblin merchants have met with a band of poachers at a nearby camp to parley the sale of unlawfully obtained hides.
#. column 58: Good adventurer. Would you assist my unit in our ambush of the outlaws?
#. column 59: Aid the Wood Wailers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent. Hurry to the campsite while there is still chaos.
#. column 62: And so you would sit idly by and allow these malefactors to defile the forest? I will never understand you adventurers...
msgctxt "FateEvent:25:0:57"
msgid "The talks, however, do not seem to be going well, as the two parties have begun fighting. This provides us with the perfect opportunity to strike two birds with one stone."
msgstr "Похоже, переговоры пошли не по плану: обе стороны уже дерутся. Отличный шанс одним ударом покончить и с теми и с другими."

#. ja: 冒険者、手を貸してくれ。<br>両者の隙をついて攻め入り、<br>森の掟を乱す不逞の輩を、きつく成敗してやるのだ！
#. de: Und weil du nun schon hier bist, kannst du dich auch nützlich machen. Hilf uns, das ganze Pack zu beseitigen - Wilderer und Goblins.
#. fr: Acceptez-vous d'aider mon unité à tendre une embuscade aux contrebandiers Griffecoeurl<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Our scouts report that goblin merchants have met with a band of poachers at a nearby camp to parley the sale of unlawfully obtained hides.
#. column 57: The talks, however, do not seem to be going well, as the two parties have begun fighting. This provides us with the perfect opportunity to strike two birds with one stone.
#. column 59: Aid the Wood Wailers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent. Hurry to the campsite while there is still chaos.
#. column 62: And so you would sit idly by and allow these malefactors to defile the forest? I will never understand you adventurers...
msgctxt "FateEvent:25:0:58"
msgid "Good adventurer. Would you assist my unit in our ambush of the outlaws?"
msgstr "Доблестный искатель приключений, поможешь моему отряду устроить засаду на этих преступников?"

#. ja: 手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du mit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les vigiles sombres<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Our scouts report that goblin merchants have met with a band of poachers at a nearby camp to parley the sale of unlawfully obtained hides.
#. column 57: The talks, however, do not seem to be going well, as the two parties have begun fighting. This provides us with the perfect opportunity to strike two birds with one stone.
#. column 58: Good adventurer. Would you assist my unit in our ambush of the outlaws?
#. column 60: Excellent. Hurry to the campsite while there is still chaos.
#. column 62: And so you would sit idly by and allow these malefactors to defile the forest? I will never understand you adventurers...
