msgctxt "FateEvent:25:0:59"
msgid "Aid the Wood Wailers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь Лесным Стражам?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: よし、頼んだぞ！
#. de: Das ist ein Wort! Los geht's!
#. fr: Excellent. Hâtons-nous de battre le fer tant qu'il est chaud.
#. column 56: Our scouts report that goblin merchants have met with a band of poachers at a nearby camp to parley the sale of unlawfully obtained hides.
#. column 57: The talks, however, do not seem to be going well, as the two parties have begun fighting. This provides us with the perfect opportunity to strike two birds with one stone.
#. column 58: Good adventurer. Would you assist my unit in our ambush of the outlaws?
#. column 59: Aid the Wood Wailers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: And so you would sit idly by and allow these malefactors to defile the forest? I will never understand you adventurers...
msgctxt "FateEvent:25:0:60"
msgid "Excellent. Hurry to the campsite while there is still chaos."
msgstr "Отлично! Скорее к лагерю, пока там не утихла суматоха."

#. ja: 森に尽くす機会を逃すとは……。<br>冒険者とは、わからぬものだな。
#. de: Für euch Abenteurer sind Recht und Ordnung Fremdwörter, was?
#. fr: Alors, vous laisseriez ces bandits poursuivre leur contrebande sans lever le petit doigt<nbsp>? Je ne comprendrai jamais les aventuriers...
#. column 56: Our scouts report that goblin merchants have met with a band of poachers at a nearby camp to parley the sale of unlawfully obtained hides.
#. column 57: The talks, however, do not seem to be going well, as the two parties have begun fighting. This provides us with the perfect opportunity to strike two birds with one stone.
#. column 58: Good adventurer. Would you assist my unit in our ambush of the outlaws?
#. column 59: Aid the Wood Wailers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent. Hurry to the campsite while there is still chaos.
msgctxt "FateEvent:25:0:62"
msgid "And so you would sit idly by and allow these malefactors to defile the forest? I will never understand you adventurers..."
msgstr "И ты будешь стоять в стороне, пока эти негодяи оскверняют лес? Никогда мне не понять вас, искателей приключений..."

#. ja: 森に仇なす不逞の輩を成敗するのだ！
#. de: Befrei den Wald von diesen üblen Subjekten!
#. fr: Montrez à ces hors-la-loi qu'ils n'ont rien à faire dans notre forêt<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:26:0:56"
msgid "Let these outlaws know there is no place for them in our forest!"
msgstr "Покажите этим преступникам, что в нашем лесу им не место!"

#. ja: 冒険者か！？<br>いいところに！　手を貸してくれ！
#. de: Endlich Hilfe! Meine Gebete wurden erhört!
#. fr: Je vous en prie, aidez-moi<nbsp>!
#. column 57: It's those damnable imps! Not only are they pinching the honey from all our hives, but they're killing the precious bees in the process.
#. column 58: Please, you must lend us your blade!
#. column 59: Aid the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Think of all the unruly tosspots who'll venture out into the forest if they don't get their mead! Please reconsider!
msgctxt "FateEvent:31:0:56"
msgid "An adventurer! Oh, I never thought I'd be so happy to see one of your lot!"
msgstr "Искатель приключений! Как же я рад тебя видеть! Помоги нам!"

#. ja: ウチの蜂蜜が「インプ」に目をつけられちまったんだ。<br>奴ら、蜂蜜を奪うだけじゃなく、蜜を守るミツバチにも<br>攻撃してきやがる。
#. de: Einige süßmäulige Imps klauen unseren Honig! Und nicht nur das: Um an ihre Beute zu kommen, töten sie eiskalt unsere Bienen!
#. fr: Des imps amateurs de miel en ont après notre rucher. Non seulement ils volent le précieux nectar, mais en plus ils tuent les abeilles qui essaient de protéger le fruit de leur labeur.
#. column 56: An adventurer! Oh, I never thought I'd be so happy to see one of your lot!
#. column 58: Please, you must lend us your blade!
#. column 59: Aid the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Think of all the unruly tosspots who'll venture out into the forest if they don't get their mead! Please reconsider!
msgctxt "FateEvent:31:0:57"
msgid "It's those damnable imps! Not only are they pinching the honey from all our hives, but they're killing the precious bees in the process."
msgstr "Это проклятые бесы! Мало того что воруют мёд из ульев, так ещё и убивают наших драгоценных пчёл!"

#. ja: ああ、そろそろ来るぞ……。<br>頼むよ、ウチの蜂蜜のために、にっくきインプどもを<br>メッタメタに返り討ちにしてやってくれ！
#. de: Sie werden sicher bald wiederkommen. Bitte, treib ihnen das Naschen aus und beschütze unsere Bienen!
#. fr: Si on ne les arrête pas, la production future risque d'être compromise. Ce serait une catastrophe pour les habitants d... Oh, purée<nbsp>! Les voilà<nbsp>! Aidez-moi, je vous en supplie<nbsp>!
#. column 56: An adventurer! Oh, I never thought I'd be so happy to see one of your lot!
#. column 57: It's those damnable imps! Not only are they pinching the honey from all our hives, but they're killing the precious bees in the process.
#. column 59: Aid the beekeepers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Think of all the unruly tosspots who'll venture out into the forest if they don't get their mead! Please reconsider!
msgctxt "FateEvent:31:0:58"
msgid "Please, you must lend us your blade!"
msgstr "Прошу, помоги нам!"

#. ja: 引き受けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Du hilfst doch, nicht wahr?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'apiculteur<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: An adventurer! Oh, I never thought I'd be so happy to see one of your lot!
#. column 57: It's those damnable imps! Not only are they pinching the honey from all our hives, but they're killing the precious bees in the process.
#. column 58: Please, you must lend us your blade!
#. column 62: Think of all the unruly tosspots who'll venture out into the forest if they don't get their mead! Please reconsider!
