msgctxt "FateEvent:32:0:59"
msgid "Aid the farmer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь фермеру?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そんな……<br>頼れるのは冒険者ぐらいなのに……
#. de: \<seufz> Eine weitere Ernte verloren ...
#. fr: Quel malheur<nbsp>! Sans votre aide, cette récolte risque d'être perdue...
#. column 56: The oranges are all picked and boxed. Now I need only wait for the caravan to come pick them up...
#. column 57: The problem is, the caravan is nowhere in sight, and I can already hear the rats clawing their way out from under the rocks. It won't be long before they've found their way into the crates.
#. column 58: I beg of you, <if $gn4>good lady<else>good sir</if>! Would you help me in keeping the rats clear of my oranges until the chocobos arrive?
#. column 59: Aid the farmer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:32:0:62"
msgid "Another harvest lost, then..."
msgstr "Вот и ещё один урожай пропал..."

#. ja: ねえ、私たちに力を貸して。<br>キキルンに攫われた市民を、助けに行きたいの。
#. de: Du siehst mutig und entschlossen aus, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>, und wir können jede Hilfe gebrauchen.
#. fr: Ah, <if $gn4>aventurière<else>aventurier</if><nbsp>! J'ai besoin de votre aide<nbsp>! Des bandits qiqirns ont enlevé plusieurs habitants du Viaduc. Je crois qu'ils cherchent à les vendre aux Amalj'aa<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Once a person has been tempered, the soul is lost and the body transformed into an empty husk which answers only to the commands of the primal Ifrit.
#. column 58: We must stop this foul dealing and rescue the villagers before they are taken back to the Bowl of Embers.
#. column 59: Will you help?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then the Brass Blades shall fight alone.
msgctxt "FateEvent:33:0:56"
msgid "Listen carefully, adventurer. Qiqirn bandits have kidnapped several Highbridge residents and are looking to sell them off to the Amalj'aa for tempering."
msgstr "Слушайте внимательно, искатель приключений. Бандиты кикирн похитили нескольких жителей Высокого моста и собираются продать их амалджа, чтобы те поработили пленников."

#. ja: やつらは、攫った市民をアマルジャ族に引き渡す気よ。<br>今、最後の交渉をしているみたい……。
#. de: Die Qiqirn halten einige Bewohner Hohenbrücks als Geiseln fest und wollen sie an die Amalj'aa verkaufen. Die Ver<shy>hand<shy>lungen sind in vollem Gange, aber noch können wir das Schlimmste verhindern!
#. fr: Si on les laisse faire, ces gens seront subjugués et perdront leur âme<nbsp>! Leurs corps deviendront des coquilles vides, ne répondant qu'aux ordres du Primordial Ifrit.
#. column 56: Listen carefully, adventurer. Qiqirn bandits have kidnapped several Highbridge residents and are looking to sell them off to the Amalj'aa for tempering.
#. column 58: We must stop this foul dealing and rescue the villagers before they are taken back to the Bowl of Embers.
#. column 59: Will you help?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then the Brass Blades shall fight alone.
msgctxt "FateEvent:33:0:57"
msgid "Once a person has been tempered, the soul is lost and the body transformed into an empty husk which answers only to the commands of the primal Ifrit."
msgstr "Порабощённые теряют душу, а их тела превращаются в пустые оболочки, которые подчиняются лишь приказам праймала Ифрита."

#. ja: みんなを奪還できる最後のチャンスよ。<br>お願い、少しでも多くの力を貸りたいの……！
#. de: Je mehr wir sind, desto größer sind unsere Chancen auf Erfolg! Wir dürfen diese armen Leute nicht im Stich lassen!
#. fr: Je vous en supplie, aidez-moi à libérer les villageois avant qu'on ne les mène au Cratère des tisons.
#. column 56: Listen carefully, adventurer. Qiqirn bandits have kidnapped several Highbridge residents and are looking to sell them off to the Amalj'aa for tempering.
#. column 57: Once a person has been tempered, the soul is lost and the body transformed into an empty husk which answers only to the commands of the primal Ifrit.
#. column 59: Will you help?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then the Brass Blades shall fight alone.
msgctxt "FateEvent:33:0:58"
msgid "We must stop this foul dealing and rescue the villagers before they are taken back to the Bowl of Embers."
msgstr "Надо сорвать эту гнусную сделку и спасти жителей, пока их не увели в Чашу Огня."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Messingklingen unterstützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Offrir votre aide<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Listen carefully, adventurer. Qiqirn bandits have kidnapped several Highbridge residents and are looking to sell them off to the Amalj'aa for tempering.
#. column 57: Once a person has been tempered, the soul is lost and the body transformed into an empty husk which answers only to the commands of the primal Ifrit.
#. column 58: We must stop this foul dealing and rescue the villagers before they are taken back to the Bowl of Embers.
#. column 62: Then the Brass Blades shall fight alone.
