msgctxt "FateEvent:33:0:59"
msgid "Will you help?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поможешь?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ……っ。わかった、私たちにも銅刃団の意地があるわ。
#. de: Wie du meinst. Wir Messingklingen werden vor unserer Verantwortung nicht davonlaufen.
#. fr: Les lames de cuivre ne peuvent donc compter que sur elles-mêmes, alors...
#. column 56: Listen carefully, adventurer. Qiqirn bandits have kidnapped several Highbridge residents and are looking to sell them off to the Amalj'aa for tempering.
#. column 57: Once a person has been tempered, the soul is lost and the body transformed into an empty husk which answers only to the commands of the primal Ifrit.
#. column 58: We must stop this foul dealing and rescue the villagers before they are taken back to the Bowl of Embers.
#. column 59: Will you help?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:33:0:62"
msgid "Then the Brass Blades shall fight alone."
msgstr "Тогда Медные Клинки будут сражаться в одиночку."

#. ja: 集合！！<br>これより、帝国兵襲撃に備え、<br>黒渦団新兵の実践訓練を実施するのである！
#. de: Stillgestanden, du Waschlappen! Um die neuen Rekruten des Mahlstroms auf den Ernstfall einer garleischen Invasion vorzubereiten, veranstalten wir heute einen Übungskampf unter erschwerten Bedingungen!
#. fr: Garde à vous...<nbsp>! Repos<nbsp>! Jeune <if $gn4>fe<else>ho</if>mme, sache qu'une manœuvre destinée à entraîner les nouveaux éléments du Maelstrom va bientôt commencer.
#. column 57: A batch of fresh recruits will more than likely be making a sorry attempt to defend the checkpoint here against a mock imperial assault.
#. column 58: If you wish, you are welcome to join the recruits. Hells, with you at the fore, the greenbacks just might learn something about teamwork.
#. column 59: Join the exercise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then I must ask you to stand clear. I won't have spectators distracting my men.
msgctxt "FateEvent:35:0:56"
msgid "Listen up! A series of live Maelstrom training exercises will begin in less than half a bell."
msgstr "Внимание! Меньше чем через полколокола начнётся серия полевых учений Мальстрёма."

#. ja: これは、攻め入る黒渦団の教導隊員を殲滅し、<br>デネベール関門の突破を食い止める防衛訓練である！
#. de: Einige unserer Ausbilder haben sich für drei Wochen an ein striktes Schikanier- und Schleifverbot gehalten und sind dem<shy>ent<shy>spre<shy>chend auf hundertachtzig!
#. fr: Son objectif est de défendre le point de contrôle contre un assaut de fausses forces impériales.
#. column 56: Listen up! A series of live Maelstrom training exercises will begin in less than half a bell.
#. column 58: If you wish, you are welcome to join the recruits. Hells, with you at the fore, the greenbacks just might learn something about teamwork.
#. column 59: Join the exercise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then I must ask you to stand clear. I won't have spectators distracting my men.
msgctxt "FateEvent:35:0:57"
msgid "A batch of fresh recruits will more than likely be making a sorry attempt to defend the checkpoint here against a mock imperial assault."
msgstr "Новобранцы наверняка будут изо всех сил пытаться отбить эту заставу от условного нападения имперцев."

#. ja: 危険な訓練ではあるが、君が希望するなら、<br>本訓練への参加を認めるのである。
#. de: Da können schon mal ein paar Ohren, Nasen und sonstige Gliedmaßen auf der Strecke bleiben. Hast du genug Mumm, mit unseren Frischlingen gegen die Ausbilder zu kämpfen?
#. fr: Si tu le désires, tu peux y participer, toi aussi. Nul doute que ta présence en première ligne devrait donner l'exemple et motiver nos bleus.
#. column 56: Listen up! A series of live Maelstrom training exercises will begin in less than half a bell.
#. column 57: A batch of fresh recruits will more than likely be making a sorry attempt to defend the checkpoint here against a mock imperial assault.
#. column 59: Join the exercise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then I must ask you to stand clear. I won't have spectators distracting my men.
msgctxt "FateEvent:35:0:58"
msgid "If you wish, you are welcome to join the recruits. Hells, with you at the fore, the greenbacks just might learn something about teamwork."
msgstr "Хочешь — присоединяйся к новобранцам. С тобой во главе эти зелёные ребята, может, хоть работать сообща научатся."

#. ja: 訓練に参加しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: An der Übung teilnehmen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Participer à l'exercice<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Listen up! A series of live Maelstrom training exercises will begin in less than half a bell.
#. column 57: A batch of fresh recruits will more than likely be making a sorry attempt to defend the checkpoint here against a mock imperial assault.
#. column 58: If you wish, you are welcome to join the recruits. Hells, with you at the fore, the greenbacks just might learn something about teamwork.
#. column 62: Then I must ask you to stand clear. I won't have spectators distracting my men.
