msgctxt "FateEvent:35:0:59"
msgid "Join the exercise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Присоединиться к учениям?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ならば、訓練に巻き込まれぬよう<br>急ぎ、この場から離れるが賢明である！
#. de: Pah, Memme! Dann halt dich mit deiner Mami mal schön abseits vom Geschehen.
#. fr: Dans ce cas, je te prie de t'écarter. Ce n'est pas un spectacle et je ne veux pas que mes hommes soient distraits pendant la manœuvre.
#. column 56: Listen up! A series of live Maelstrom training exercises will begin in less than half a bell.
#. column 57: A batch of fresh recruits will more than likely be making a sorry attempt to defend the checkpoint here against a mock imperial assault.
#. column 58: If you wish, you are welcome to join the recruits. Hells, with you at the fore, the greenbacks just might learn something about teamwork.
#. column 59: Join the exercise?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:35:0:62"
msgid "Then I must ask you to stand clear. I won't have spectators distracting my men."
msgstr "Тогда отойди подальше. Не хватало ещё, чтобы зрители отвлекали моих людей."

#. ja: これはこれは冒険者さん！<br>なんて運命的なタイミングでいらっしゃいました。
#. de: Ha, <if $gn4>eine Abenteurerin<else>ein Abenteurer</if> zur rechten Zeit vertreibt des Landwirts Kummer und Leid! Dich schicken die Zwölf!
#. fr: Par les douze<nbsp>! Un<if $gn4>e aventurière<else> aventurier</if><nbsp>! Vous tombez bien, mon ami<if $gn4>e</if>.
#. column 57: You see, I'm tasked with tillin' the orchards so that the roots of these here trees might breathe better, like. But it seems each an' ev'ry step I take is straight into a damned molehill.
#. column 58: I've already gone an' lamed me left leg, and cannae 'ford to lame me right, so I was thinkin' I could get meself a true 'venturer to whack the bloody moles one good. What do you say?
#. column 59: Whack away?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Me da was right! You can always trust a 'venturer to right the wrongs of this world. But enough of me yappin', now get to whackin'!
#. column 62: Me da was right... You can't trust a 'venturer farther than you can kick one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:36:0:56"
msgid "Twelve take me! If it ain't a real live 'venturer! I could use some help, if it's help you're profferin'?"
msgstr "Клянусь Двенадцатью! Да это же настоящий искатель приключений! Помощь нужна? Если ты, конечно, за ней пришёл."

#. ja: 最近、この辺りでモールが大量に繁殖して、<br>畑をボッコボコの穴だらけにされて困り果てています。
#. de: In letzter Zeit durchwühlen uns die Mulle hier die Felder nämlich derart, dass sie löchriger sind als die Socken meines Bruders ... was ich persönlich für ein ziemliches Kunststück halte.
#. fr: Vous voyez, j'm'occupe d'labourer les vergers pour que les racines respirent mieux. Mais, à chaque pas que j'fais, j'tombe sur un trou creusé par ces maudites taupes.
#. column 56: Twelve take me! If it ain't a real live 'venturer! I could use some help, if it's help you're profferin'?
#. column 58: I've already gone an' lamed me left leg, and cannae 'ford to lame me right, so I was thinkin' I could get meself a true 'venturer to whack the bloody moles one good. What do you say?
#. column 59: Whack away?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Me da was right! You can always trust a 'venturer to right the wrongs of this world. But enough of me yappin', now get to whackin'!
#. column 62: Me da was right... You can't trust a 'venturer farther than you can kick one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:36:0:57"
msgid "You see, I'm tasked with tillin' the orchards so that the roots of these here trees might breathe better, like. But it seems each an' ev'ry step I take is straight into a damned molehill."
msgstr "Понимаешь, мне поручили вспахать сады, чтобы корни деревьев могли дышать. Только вот куда ни шагну — везде проклятая кротовина!"

#. ja: 憎たらしいモールを叩きまくって<br>退治してもらえないでしょうか？
#. de: Jedenfalls ist an Bestellung der Felder unter diesen Umständen nicht zu denken, mal ganz abgesehen davon, dass sich schon zahlreiche Chocobos die Füße verstaucht haben. Du hast doch sicher ein Herz für Tiere?
#. fr: J'me suis d'jà blessé à la jambe gauche et j'tiens pas m'casser la droite, alors j'pensais qu'vous pourriez vous charger de ces sales bestioles pour moi. Vous en dites quoi<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Twelve take me! If it ain't a real live 'venturer! I could use some help, if it's help you're profferin'?
#. column 57: You see, I'm tasked with tillin' the orchards so that the roots of these here trees might breathe better, like. But it seems each an' ev'ry step I take is straight into a damned molehill.
#. column 59: Whack away?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Me da was right! You can always trust a 'venturer to right the wrongs of this world. But enough of me yappin', now get to whackin'!
#. column 62: Me da was right... You can't trust a 'venturer farther than you can kick one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:36:0:58"
msgid "I've already gone an' lamed me left leg, and cannae 'ford to lame me right, so I was thinkin' I could get meself a true 'venturer to whack the bloody moles one good. What do you say?"
msgstr "Я уже левую ногу повредил, правую тоже калечить не хочу. Вот и подумал: может, найдётся настоящий искатель приключений, чтобы хорошенько проучить этих кротов? Ну как?"

#. ja: 叩きまくってあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Bauern helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: S'occuper des taupes<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Twelve take me! If it ain't a real live 'venturer! I could use some help, if it's help you're profferin'?
#. column 57: You see, I'm tasked with tillin' the orchards so that the roots of these here trees might breathe better, like. But it seems each an' ev'ry step I take is straight into a damned molehill.
#. column 58: I've already gone an' lamed me left leg, and cannae 'ford to lame me right, so I was thinkin' I could get meself a true 'venturer to whack the bloody moles one good. What do you say?
#. column 60: Me da was right! You can always trust a 'venturer to right the wrongs of this world. But enough of me yappin', now get to whackin'!
#. column 62: Me da was right... You can't trust a 'venturer farther than you can kick one.
