msgctxt "FateEvent:36:0:59"
msgid "Whack away?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Проучить кротов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、それはありがたい！<br>……見てください、早速現れたようです！<br>よろしくお願いします！
#. de: Danke, das werd ich dir nicht vergessen! Und sieh nur, da ist auch gleich schon wieder ein Rudel von den Biestern! Schnapp sie dir!
#. fr: Mon père avait bien raison<nbsp>! On peut vraiment faire confiance aux aventuriers pour rétablir la justice en c'bas monde. Mais, assez parlé, à vous d'jouer<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Twelve take me! If it ain't a real live 'venturer! I could use some help, if it's help you're profferin'?
#. column 57: You see, I'm tasked with tillin' the orchards so that the roots of these here trees might breathe better, like. But it seems each an' ev'ry step I take is straight into a damned molehill.
#. column 58: I've already gone an' lamed me left leg, and cannae 'ford to lame me right, so I was thinkin' I could get meself a true 'venturer to whack the bloody moles one good. What do you say?
#. column 59: Whack away?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Me da was right... You can't trust a 'venturer farther than you can kick one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:36:0:60"
msgid "Me da was right! You can always trust a 'venturer to right the wrongs of this world. But enough of me yappin', now get to whackin'!"
msgstr "Отец был прав! На искателей приключений всегда можно положиться — они исправят любую несправедливость. Ладно, хватит болтать, за дело!"

#. ja: ですよね……チッ。
#. de: Ich hoffe, der nächste Chocobo, hinter dem du stehst, schlägt mal ordentlich aus.
#. fr: Mon père avait raison... On n'peut pas faire confiance aux aventuriers<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Twelve take me! If it ain't a real live 'venturer! I could use some help, if it's help you're profferin'?
#. column 57: You see, I'm tasked with tillin' the orchards so that the roots of these here trees might breathe better, like. But it seems each an' ev'ry step I take is straight into a damned molehill.
#. column 58: I've already gone an' lamed me left leg, and cannae 'ford to lame me right, so I was thinkin' I could get meself a true 'venturer to whack the bloody moles one good. What do you say?
#. column 59: Whack away?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Me da was right! You can always trust a 'venturer to right the wrongs of this world. But enough of me yappin', now get to whackin'!
msgctxt "FateEvent:36:0:62"
msgid "Me da was right... You can't trust a 'venturer farther than you can kick one."
msgstr "Отец был прав... Искателям приключений нельзя доверять."

#. ja: 憎たらしいモールを叩きまくって<br>退治してください、お願いします！！
#. de: Wer anderen eine Grube gräbt, sag ich immer ... Gib den Mullen ordentlich was auf die Mütze. Sie haben's nicht anders verdient!
#. fr: Mon père m'disait qu'le meilleur endroit où frapper une taupe, c'est en plein sur leur caboche<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:37:0:56"
msgid "Me da said the best place to whack a mole is straight upside his head."
msgstr "Отец всегда говорил: бить крота надо прямо по башке."

#. ja: お前、腕に自信は？　仕事を請負う余裕はあるか？<br>ならば、リトルアラミゴまで警護を依頼したい。
#. de: Hm, du machst 'nen zähen Eindruck, aber hast du's auch wirklich drauf? Falls ja, hätt ich da vielleicht 'nen Job für dich.
#. fr: Je vous en prie, vous devez m'aider<nbsp>! Les Amalj'aa sont à mes trousses<nbsp>! S'ils m'attrapent, je n'ai aucune chance<nbsp>!
#. column 57: You see, I was tasked with infiltrating Zanr'ak and stealing their battle plans, but I was caught and taken to the Bowl of Embers for tempering. However, I managed to escape when the carriage transporting me and the other slaves slipped off the road.
#. column 58: Though I have had somewhat of a head start, it took their battle drakes little time to pick up my scent, and now a party of pursuers is only a matter of malms away. I must get to the aetheryte at Little Ala Mhigo so I might relay my findings to the flame commander, but do not believe I can make it on my own.
#. column 59: Escort the scout to Little Ala Mhigo?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then you have sentenced me to death...or worse, tempering.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:38:0:56"
msgid "Please, you must help me. I am being hunted by the Amalj'aa, and if they catch me, they <i>will</i> kill me."
msgstr "Прошу, помогите мне. За мной охотятся амалджа, и если они меня поймают, то <i>убьют</i>."

#. ja: あちらの部隊に、アマルジャ族について報告がある。<br>戦況に関わる重大な情報だが、<br>それを知る際、うかつにもやつらに顔を見られたのだ。
#. de: Ich bin in den Besitz höchst brisanter Informationen gelangt, die die entscheidende Wende in unseren Aus<shy>einander<shy>set<shy>zungen mit den Amalj'aa bringen könnten und muss unbedingt den Kommandanten in Klein-Ala Mhigo davon in Kenntnis setzen!
#. fr: Vous voyez, je devais m'infiltrer à Zanr'ak pour y voler leurs plans de bataille, mais j'ai été découvert et mené au Cratère des tisons pour y être subjugué. Par chance, j'ai réussi à m'échapper lorsque la calèche qui nous trans<shy>por<shy>tait, les autres esclaves et moi, a fait une sortie de route.
#. column 56: Please, you must help me. I am being hunted by the Amalj'aa, and if they catch me, they <i>will</i> kill me.
#. column 58: Though I have had somewhat of a head start, it took their battle drakes little time to pick up my scent, and now a party of pursuers is only a matter of malms away. I must get to the aetheryte at Little Ala Mhigo so I might relay my findings to the flame commander, but do not believe I can make it on my own.
#. column 59: Escort the scout to Little Ala Mhigo?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then you have sentenced me to death...or worse, tempering.
msgctxt "FateEvent:38:0:57"
msgid "You see, I was tasked with infiltrating Zanr'ak and stealing their battle plans, but I was caught and taken to the Bowl of Embers for tempering. However, I managed to escape when the carriage transporting me and the other slaves slipped off the road."
msgstr "Мне поручили проникнуть в Занрак и украсть их боевые планы, но меня поймали и увезли в Чашу Огня для закалки. Однако мне удалось сбежать, когда повозка, в которой везли меня и других пленников, съехала с дороги."

#. ja: 襲撃に備えようにも、この部隊が集団で動けば<br>かえって標的になるだろう。<br>そこで、外から来たお前に警護を頼みたい。
#. de: Die Späher der Amalj'aa werden das ganz sicher verhindern wollen, daher muss ich unauffällig reisen. Am besten in Begleitung <if $gn4>einer<else>eines</if> Außenstehenden wie dir!
#. fr: J'avais beau avoir un peu d'avance sur eux, leurs draconides de combat n'ont pas mis longtemps à retrouver ma trace et mes poursuivants ne sont plus très loin désormais. Je dois atteindre l'éthérite de Petite Ala Mhigo pour faire part de mes découvertes au commandant des sables, mais je n'y arriverai pas sans aide.
#. column 56: Please, you must help me. I am being hunted by the Amalj'aa, and if they catch me, they <i>will</i> kill me.
#. column 57: You see, I was tasked with infiltrating Zanr'ak and stealing their battle plans, but I was caught and taken to the Bowl of Embers for tempering. However, I managed to escape when the carriage transporting me and the other slaves slipped off the road.
#. column 59: Escort the scout to Little Ala Mhigo?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then you have sentenced me to death...or worse, tempering.
msgctxt "FateEvent:38:0:58"
msgid "Though I have had somewhat of a head start, it took their battle drakes little time to pick up my scent, and now a party of pursuers is only a matter of malms away. I must get to the aetheryte at Little Ala Mhigo so I might relay my findings to the flame commander, but do not believe I can make it on my own."
msgstr "Мне удалось немного оторваться, но боевые драконы быстро взяли мой след. Погоня уже совсем близко. Я должен добраться до эфирита Малой Ала Миго и передать свои сведения командиру Пламени, но в одиночку мне не справиться."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Kundschafter begleiten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter l'éclaireur jusqu'à Petite Ala Mhigo<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Please, you must help me. I am being hunted by the Amalj'aa, and if they catch me, they <i>will</i> kill me.
#. column 57: You see, I was tasked with infiltrating Zanr'ak and stealing their battle plans, but I was caught and taken to the Bowl of Embers for tempering. However, I managed to escape when the carriage transporting me and the other slaves slipped off the road.
#. column 58: Though I have had somewhat of a head start, it took their battle drakes little time to pick up my scent, and now a party of pursuers is only a matter of malms away. I must get to the aetheryte at Little Ala Mhigo so I might relay my findings to the flame commander, but do not believe I can make it on my own.
#. column 62: Then you have sentenced me to death...or worse, tempering.
