msgctxt "FateEvent:38:0:59"
msgid "Escort the scout to Little Ala Mhigo?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить разведчика до Маленького Ала-Миго?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: では、今の話は忘れるように。一切の他言は無用だ。
#. de: Dann hast du von all dem hier nichts gehört, verstanden?
#. fr: Votre refus me condamne à mort... ou pire, à être subjugué...
#. column 56: Please, you must help me. I am being hunted by the Amalj'aa, and if they catch me, they <i>will</i> kill me.
#. column 57: You see, I was tasked with infiltrating Zanr'ak and stealing their battle plans, but I was caught and taken to the Bowl of Embers for tempering. However, I managed to escape when the carriage transporting me and the other slaves slipped off the road.
#. column 58: Though I have had somewhat of a head start, it took their battle drakes little time to pick up my scent, and now a party of pursuers is only a matter of malms away. I must get to the aetheryte at Little Ala Mhigo so I might relay my findings to the flame commander, but do not believe I can make it on my own.
#. column 59: Escort the scout to Little Ala Mhigo?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:38:0:62"
msgid "Then you have sentenced me to death...or worse, tempering."
msgstr "Тогда ты обрекаешь меня на смерть... или на что похуже — закалку."

#. ja: なぁ、あんた、冒険者だろ？<br>あんたの力を借りたいんだ。
#. de: He, du bist doch <if $gn4>'ne Abenteurerin<else>'n Abenteurer</if>, oder? Dann musst du mir helfen!
#. fr: Hé, vous êtes un<if $gn4>e aventurière<else> aventurier</if>, vous<nbsp>! Pourriez-vous m'accorder un instant<nbsp>?
#. column 57: The fields are crawling with ocean roselings─horrible creatures that choke out the crops and maim the tillers who tend to them. We hold our own against the seedkin, but it seems for every one we cut down, there are three more to take its place!
#. column 58: We'd be obliged if you could lend us your sword in clearing the fields.
#. column 59: Aid the tillers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: That's right kind of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. You see? Here they come now!
#. column 62: Apologies, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I reckon you have matters of greater import what need attendin'.
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:39:0:56"
msgid "A moment of your time, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>?"
msgstr "Не уделите мне минутку, <if $gn4>сударыня<else>сударь</if>?"

#. ja: このあたりにはオーシャン・ローズリングっていう<br>花の魔物が繁茂しててな……参っちまうよ。<br>完全に根付いてるのか、刈っても刈っても現れちまう。
#. de: Ich hab ja echt nichts gegen Wildblumen, aber bei diesen Ozean-Röslingen hört der Spaß auf. Die haben neulich die halbe Schafsherde meines Nachbarn verputzt, das muss man sich mal vorstellen!
#. fr: Les champs grouillent de callisias marines, d'horribles créatures végétales qui étouffent nos récoltes. Nous avons beau essayer de nous en débarrasser, pour chaque spécimen que nous éliminons, il y en a trois nouveaux qui ap<shy>pa<shy>rais<shy>sent<nbsp>!
#. column 56: A moment of your time, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>?
#. column 58: We'd be obliged if you could lend us your sword in clearing the fields.
#. column 59: Aid the tillers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: That's right kind of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. You see? Here they come now!
#. column 62: Apologies, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I reckon you have matters of greater import what need attendin'.
msgctxt "FateEvent:39:0:57"
msgid "The fields are crawling with ocean roselings─horrible creatures that choke out the crops and maim the tillers who tend to them. We hold our own against the seedkin, but it seems for every one we cut down, there are three more to take its place!"
msgstr "Поля кишат морскими розлингами — жуткими тварями, которые губят посевы и калечат тех, кто за ними ухаживает. Пока мы кое-как отбиваемся от этих семенных тварей, но стоит срубить одну — как на её место приходят три!"

#. ja: かといって、放置もできないんだが……<br>いい加減、俺たちもいっぱいいっぱいでなぁ。<br>よければ、奴らの駆除に手を貸してくれないか？
#. de: Mit unseren normalen Unkrautbekämpfungsmethoden ist den Biestern leider nicht beizukommen. Aber jemand wie du hat sicher noch andere Tricks im Ärmel, vermute ich mal.
#. fr: Nous vous serions re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sants si vous pouviez nous aider à exterminer ces mauvaises plantes.
#. column 56: A moment of your time, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>?
#. column 57: The fields are crawling with ocean roselings─horrible creatures that choke out the crops and maim the tillers who tend to them. We hold our own against the seedkin, but it seems for every one we cut down, there are three more to take its place!
#. column 59: Aid the tillers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: That's right kind of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. You see? Here they come now!
#. column 62: Apologies, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I reckon you have matters of greater import what need attendin'.
msgctxt "FateEvent:39:0:58"
msgid "We'd be obliged if you could lend us your sword in clearing the fields."
msgstr "Будем вам признательны, если поможете очистить поля."

#. ja: 駆除に手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Röslingen die Stengel stutzen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les laboureurs<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: A moment of your time, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>?
