msgctxt "FateEvent:39:0:59"
msgid "Aid the tillers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь земледельцам?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうかそうか、手伝ってくれるのか！<br>助かるよ……と、言ってるそばから姿を見せたな！<br>さあ冒険者さん、さっそくやっちゃってくれ！！
#. de: Das ist zu gütig von dir, vielen Dank! Sicher tauchen sie schon bald wieder au... Ah, da oben! Sieh nur!
#. fr: C'est vraiment gentil. Regardez<nbsp>! Les voilà<nbsp>!
#. column 56: A moment of your time, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>?
#. column 57: The fields are crawling with ocean roselings─horrible creatures that choke out the crops and maim the tillers who tend to them. We hold our own against the seedkin, but it seems for every one we cut down, there are three more to take its place!
#. column 58: We'd be obliged if you could lend us your sword in clearing the fields.
#. column 59: Aid the tillers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Apologies, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I reckon you have matters of greater import what need attendin'.
