msgctxt "FateEvent:45:0:58"
msgid "Gather cores for the hammer workers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Собрать ядра для рабочих?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 核は倒して奪ってもいいし、拾ってきてもいい……。<br>とにかく集めて、持ってきてくれ……。
#. de: Ausgezeichnet! Wenn du Glück hast, findest du am Boden Kerne von verschiedenen Erd-Exergonen. Die lebenden musst du auf andere Art überreden, sich von ihren Kernen zu trennen.
#. fr: Les noyaux, tu peux les obtenir en tuant des élémentaires... ou en les ramassant... Moi, du moment que tu m'en rapportes...
#. column 56: Cores... Cannot drive the piles without earth sprite cores...
#. column 57: Cores harden the land... Help the piles take hold... Have you any cores?
#. column 58: Gather cores for the hammer workers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Cores...
msgctxt "FateEvent:45:0:60"
msgid "Cores...lying about... Cores...flying about..."
msgstr "Ядра... валяются... Ядра... летают..."

#. ja: お前には、関係のないことだったな……。
#. de: Ist gut. Entschuldige, dass ich dich mit meinem Anliegen behelligt habe.
#. fr: Tu t'en contrefiches, en fait...
#. column 56: Cores... Cannot drive the piles without earth sprite cores...
#. column 57: Cores harden the land... Help the piles take hold... Have you any cores?
#. column 58: Gather cores for the hammer workers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Cores...lying about... Cores...flying about...
msgctxt "FateEvent:45:0:62"
msgid "Cores..."
msgstr "Ядра..."

#. ja: お、お助けくだせぇ冒険者様！<br>そこの廃屋を根城にしている盗賊団に、<br>大事な荷を奪われちまった……！
#. de: <if $gn4>Gütige Abenteurerin<else>Gütiger Abenteurer</if>! Du musst mir helfen! Die Diebe in jenem Anwesen dort oben haben mich um all meine Waren erleichtert!
#. fr: Vous, là. C'est le Consortium qui vous envoie<nbsp>? Non<nbsp>? Bon, ce n'est pas grave. Maintenant que vous êtes là, vous allez m'aider. D'accord<nbsp>?
#. column 57: The lawless thugs who squat there in that ramshackle manse have stolen my precious cargo and I require you to retrieve it. Not too daunting a task for someone of your obvious talents, I presume?
#. column 58: Aid the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Very good, very good. Now make haste. I have tea planned with a noble lady not long from now and it would not do well if I were late.
#. column 62: Perhaps you mistook my order for a choice?
msgctxt "FateEvent:46:0:56"
msgid "You there. Did the Consortium send you? No? Well, that is of no matter. You are here now, and now you shall help me. Agreed?"
msgstr "Эй, вы! Консорциум вас прислал? Нет? Ну да неважно. Раз уж вы здесь, поможете мне. Договорились?"

#. ja: あの荷がなけりゃ飢えて死ぬだけ、<br>根城に乗り込みゃ犬死にだ。<br>どうか、あっしの荷物を取り戻してくだせぇ！
#. de: Ohne den Erlös aus ihrem Verkauf bin ich dem Untergang geweiht. Meine Familie hat schon jetzt kaum zu essen.
#. fr: Des voleurs, qui ont pour repaire la maison en ruine là-bas, m'ont dérobé une cargaison de valeur. J'aimerais que vous la récupériez. Je suis sûr que c'est un jeu d'enfant pour quelqu'un de votre trempe.
#. column 56: You there. Did the Consortium send you? No? Well, that is of no matter. You are here now, and now you shall help me. Agreed?
#. column 58: Aid the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Very good, very good. Now make haste. I have tea planned with a noble lady not long from now and it would not do well if I were late.
#. column 62: Perhaps you mistook my order for a choice?
msgctxt "FateEvent:46:0:57"
msgid "The lawless thugs who squat there in that ramshackle manse have stolen my precious cargo and I require you to retrieve it. Not too daunting a task for someone of your obvious talents, I presume?"
msgstr "Без товара мне конец. Если не верну груз, моя семья голодать будет!"

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Händler helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le marchand<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You there. Did the Consortium send you? No? Well, that is of no matter. You are here now, and now you shall help me. Agreed?
#. column 57: The lawless thugs who squat there in that ramshackle manse have stolen my precious cargo and I require you to retrieve it. Not too daunting a task for someone of your obvious talents, I presume?
#. column 60: Very good, very good. Now make haste. I have tea planned with a noble lady not long from now and it would not do well if I were late.
#. column 62: Perhaps you mistook my order for a choice?
