msgctxt "FateEvent:46:0:58"
msgid "Aid the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь торговцу?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 神様！　あっしの命、冒険者様に託しましたぜ！
#. de: Oh Götter! Segnet <if $gn4>diese gütige Abenteurerin<else>diesen gütigen Abenteurer</if>, auf dass <if $gn4>ihr<else>ihm</if> Erfolg beschieden sein möge!
#. fr: Très bien, très bien. Faites vite. Je dois prendre le thé avec une noble dame dans peu de temps et je ne peux quand même pas arriver en retard.
#. column 56: You there. Did the Consortium send you? No? Well, that is of no matter. You are here now, and now you shall help me. Agreed?
#. column 57: The lawless thugs who squat there in that ramshackle manse have stolen my precious cargo and I require you to retrieve it. Not too daunting a task for someone of your obvious talents, I presume?
#. column 58: Aid the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Perhaps you mistook my order for a choice?
msgctxt "FateEvent:46:0:60"
msgid "Very good, very good. Now make haste. I have tea planned with a noble lady not long from now and it would not do well if I were late."
msgstr "Отлично, отлично. Поторопитесь. Скоро у меня чаепитие с одной знатной дамой, опаздывать никак нельзя."

#. ja: そんなぁ～！<br>このままアリの餌にでもなれってんですかい！？
#. de: Oh weh, elendig verenden werde ich und als Futter der Treiberameisen enden.
#. fr: Vous avez peut-être pris mon ordre pour une suggestion.
#. column 56: You there. Did the Consortium send you? No? Well, that is of no matter. You are here now, and now you shall help me. Agreed?
#. column 57: The lawless thugs who squat there in that ramshackle manse have stolen my precious cargo and I require you to retrieve it. Not too daunting a task for someone of your obvious talents, I presume?
#. column 58: Aid the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Very good, very good. Now make haste. I have tea planned with a noble lady not long from now and it would not do well if I were late.
msgctxt "FateEvent:46:0:62"
msgid "Perhaps you mistook my order for a choice?"
msgstr "Неужели вы приняли мой приказ за предложение?"

#. ja: 君、ちょうどいいところに！<br>ゴブリン族から、さっき届いた資材を守ってくれないか？
#. de: Ah, dich schicken die Götter! Bitte, du musst unsere Ersatzteile für die Dampframmen beschützen!
#. fr: Par Thal<nbsp>! Je ne sais pas si je dois égorger ces Gobelins ou ceux qui les ont chassés d'Ul'dah et les ont poussés à rejoindre Martelterre<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Now the thrice-damned runts are running about buggerin' up my supplies for the hammers, and I haven't the means to stop them. Now if I had me an adventurer...
#. column 58: Lend the worker a hand?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Give the little shites no quarter. That'll learn 'em.
#. column 62: Ah, I forgot. It's coin what does the talkin', eh? Well, I have more than enough for the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> what does in them gobbies.
msgctxt "FateEvent:47:0:56"
msgid "Thal's balls! I don't know whether to slit the throats of them goblins, or them what kicked the buggers out of Ul'dah and into Hammerlea!"
msgstr "Яйца Тала! Не знаю, кого зарезать — гоблинов или тех, кто выгнал их из Ульды на Молотковые луга!"

#. ja: やつらときたら、追い出された腹いせに<br>資材の箱を片っ端から壊していくんだ。<br>まったく大損だよ！
#. de: Eine Horde Goblins, die sauer über den Rausschmiss aus Ul'dah ist, sabotiert uns schon seit Wochen und greift jedes Mal an, wenn wir eine neue Lieferung erhalten haben. Sie können jede Sekunde hier auftauchen!
#. fr: Ils sont en train de retourner mes provisions pour trouver des marteaux, et je ne peux rien faire pour les en empêcher. Ah, si seulement j'avais un<if $gn4>e aventurière<else> aventurier</if> sous la main...
#. column 56: Thal's balls! I don't know whether to slit the throats of them goblins, or them what kicked the buggers out of Ul'dah and into Hammerlea!
#. column 58: Lend the worker a hand?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Give the little shites no quarter. That'll learn 'em.
#. column 62: Ah, I forgot. It's coin what does the talkin', eh? Well, I have more than enough for the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> what does in them gobbies.
msgctxt "FateEvent:47:0:57"
msgid "Now the thrice-damned runts are running about buggerin' up my supplies for the hammers, and I haven't the means to stop them. Now if I had me an adventurer..."
msgstr "Эти проклятые коротышки портят наши запасы для молотов, а мне их не остановить. Вот бы найти какого-нибудь приключенца..."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Gegen die Goblins kämpfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Prêter main-forte à l'ouvrier<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Thal's balls! I don't know whether to slit the throats of them goblins, or them what kicked the buggers out of Ul'dah and into Hammerlea!
#. column 57: Now the thrice-damned runts are running about buggerin' up my supplies for the hammers, and I haven't the means to stop them. Now if I had me an adventurer...
#. column 60: Give the little shites no quarter. That'll learn 'em.
#. column 62: Ah, I forgot. It's coin what does the talkin', eh? Well, I have more than enough for the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> what does in them gobbies.
