msgctxt "FateEvent:47:0:58"
msgid "Lend the worker a hand?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь рабочему?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがたい。資材の箱は、そこに……<br>って、さっそくゴブリン族が来たぞ！
#. de: Hab vielen Dank! Die Kisten stehen direkt dort vor... Ah, da sind die kleinen Teufel ja schon!
#. fr: Ne leur montrez aucune pitié. Ça leur apprendra.
#. column 56: Thal's balls! I don't know whether to slit the throats of them goblins, or them what kicked the buggers out of Ul'dah and into Hammerlea!
#. column 57: Now the thrice-damned runts are running about buggerin' up my supplies for the hammers, and I haven't the means to stop them. Now if I had me an adventurer...
#. column 58: Lend the worker a hand?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Ah, I forgot. It's coin what does the talkin', eh? Well, I have more than enough for the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> what does in them gobbies.
msgctxt "FateEvent:47:0:60"
msgid "Give the little shites no quarter. That'll learn 'em."
msgstr "Не давайте этим мелким гадам спуску. Вот и усвоят урок."

#. ja: いい働きをしてくれたら、礼は出すつもりだ。<br>今すぐ考え直してくれないか？
#. de: Ich würde dich reichlich entlohnen! Bist du dir wirklich sicher?
#. fr: Ah, j'oubliais. On n'a pas parlé argent, mais j'en bien assez pour <if $gn4>celle<else>celui</if> qui se chargera de ces Gobelins.
#. column 56: Thal's balls! I don't know whether to slit the throats of them goblins, or them what kicked the buggers out of Ul'dah and into Hammerlea!
#. column 57: Now the thrice-damned runts are running about buggerin' up my supplies for the hammers, and I haven't the means to stop them. Now if I had me an adventurer...
#. column 58: Lend the worker a hand?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Give the little shites no quarter. That'll learn 'em.
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:47:0:62"
msgid "Ah, I forgot. It's coin what does the talkin', eh? Well, I have more than enough for the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> what does in them gobbies."
msgstr "Ах да, забыл. За дело, конечно, платят. Золота у меня хватит, чтобы наградить <if $gn4>героиню<else>героя</if>, которая разделается с гоблинами."

#. ja: うちの父ちゃんは、この池で死んだんだ。<br>釣りをしてて、スポーニング・オロボンに食べられて……<br>めちゃくちゃさ。
#. de: M-Mein Vater wurde hier beim Angeln v-von Orobon gefressen! \<schnief>
#. fr: Mon père... Il est mort dévoré par un orobon.
#. column 57: Now I wants 'em all dead, like. Wiv crossy eyes like them as drawed in the picture shows. Da used to take me to the picture shows...before he was et. By a 'bon.
#. column 58: Kill some 'bons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Don't get et!
#. column 62: \<whimper><br>One day, I'll be big enough to kill me own 'bon! Jus' you wait!
msgctxt "FateEvent:48:0:56"
msgid "Me da... Et by a 'bon, he were."
msgstr "Мой папка... Его съел оробон..."

#. ja: オロボンなんて、いなくなればいいのに……！<br>あんたも冒険者なら、あいつらを倒してくれよ！
#. de: Sch-Schreckliche Monster sind das! I-Ich wünschte, sie würden alle aus Eorzea verschwinden ... Du bist doch <if $gn4>eine Abenteurerin<else>ein Abenteurer</if>, oder? K-Kannst du nicht gegen sie kämpfen?
#. fr: Maintenant, je veux qu'ils meurent tous. Avec leurs yeux globuleux... Je ne peux plus les voir... même en peinture<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Me da... Et by a 'bon, he were.
#. column 58: Kill some 'bons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Don't get et!
#. column 62: \<whimper><br>One day, I'll be big enough to kill me own 'bon! Jus' you wait!
msgctxt "FateEvent:48:0:57"
msgid "Now I wants 'em all dead, like. Wiv crossy eyes like them as drawed in the picture shows. Da used to take me to the picture shows...before he was et. By a 'bon."
msgstr "Теперь я хочу, чтоб они все сдохли. С глазами навыкате, как на картинках. Папка водил меня в кино... пока его не съел оробон."

#. ja: 引き受けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Vater des Kindes rächen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Tuer des orobons<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Me da... Et by a 'bon, he were.
#. column 57: Now I wants 'em all dead, like. Wiv crossy eyes like them as drawed in the picture shows. Da used to take me to the picture shows...before he was et. By a 'bon.
#. column 60: Don't get et!
#. column 62: \<whimper><br>One day, I'll be big enough to kill me own 'bon! Jus' you wait!
