msgctxt "FateEvent:48:0:58"
msgid "Kill some 'bons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Убить оробонов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: よっしゃ、父ちゃんの敵討ちだ！<br>いーーーーっぱい、やっつけてくれよな！
#. de: D-Danke! Vernichte so viele, wie du kannst! Bitte, bitte!
#. fr: Ne vous laissez pas dévorer<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Me da... Et by a 'bon, he were.
#. column 57: Now I wants 'em all dead, like. Wiv crossy eyes like them as drawed in the picture shows. Da used to take me to the picture shows...before he was et. By a 'bon.
#. column 58: Kill some 'bons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<whimper><br>One day, I'll be big enough to kill me own 'bon! Jus' you wait!
msgctxt "FateEvent:48:0:60"
msgid "Don't get et!"
msgstr "Только не дай себя съесть!"

#. ja: ケチ！　冒険者はユーカンだって聞いたのに！
#. de: Und ich dachte, ihr Abenteurer würdet für die gerechte Sache kämpfen ...
#. fr: Un jour, j'serai assez grand pour tuer moi-même un orobon<nbsp>! Vous verrez<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Me da... Et by a 'bon, he were.
#. column 57: Now I wants 'em all dead, like. Wiv crossy eyes like them as drawed in the picture shows. Da used to take me to the picture shows...before he was et. By a 'bon.
#. column 58: Kill some 'bons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Don't get et!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:48:0:62"
msgid "\\<whimper><br>One day, I'll be big enough to kill me own 'bon! Jus' you wait!"
msgstr "<i>Хнык...</i><br>Вот подрасту и сам завалю оробона! Ещё увидите!"

#. ja: おい、そこのあんた！<br>冒険者だろう、ちょっと手伝ってくれよ！
#. de: He, du da! Ja, dich mein ich! Ich könnte die Hilfe <if $gn4>einer kampferprobten Abenteurerin<else>eines kampferprobten Abenteurers</if> wie dir gerade gut gebrauchen!
#. fr: Hé, vous<nbsp>! Vous êtes un<if $gn4>e aventurière<else> aventurier</if>, pas vrai<nbsp>? Parfait<nbsp>! Vous êtes exactement ce qu'il me faut.
#. column 57: You see that man over there? The big one. The captain of a shipping vessel out of Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han found him stowed away belowdecks. When the captain moored here at the Quay, we brought the brute ashore for questioning...
#. column 58: ...when he up and started assailing my men! And for a man who's been holed up in a dark corner for the past fortnight, he has more energy than you'd believe. We could certainly use a hand in calming him down.
#. column 59: Aid the Quay guards?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Aye... I shan't judge you for your decision. No <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in their right mind would want to dance with that <i>thing</i>.
msgctxt "FateEvent:49:0:56"
msgid "An adventurer, are you? Well, you'll have to do."
msgstr "Вы приключенец? Ну, сгодитесь."

#. ja: あそこで暴れているあの男！<br>あいつは船に潜り込もうとしてた密航者でな。<br>なのに捕まえたら、シラを切りやがる。
#. de: Es geht um den Typen, der dort vorne gerade einen der Matrosen grün und blau schlägt! Ahctstymm heißt das Raubein! Ist 'n gesuchter Verbrecher und hatte sich als blinder Passagier an Bord geschlichen. Als ich ihn festnehmen wollte, ist er vollkommen ausgerastet.
#. fr: Vous voyez cet homme là-bas<nbsp>? Le grand, oui. Le capitaine d'un navire en provenance de Radz-at-Han l'a découvert caché dans sa cale. Une fois à quai, nous l'avons mené sur la terre ferme pour l'interroger.
#. column 56: An adventurer, are you? Well, you'll have to do.
#. column 58: ...when he up and started assailing my men! And for a man who's been holed up in a dark corner for the past fortnight, he has more energy than you'd believe. We could certainly use a hand in calming him down.
#. column 59: Aid the Quay guards?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Aye... I shan't judge you for your decision. No <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in their right mind would want to dance with that <i>thing</i>.
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:49:0:57"
msgid "You see that man over there? The big one. The captain of a shipping vessel out of Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han found him stowed away belowdecks. When the captain moored here at the Quay, we brought the brute ashore for questioning..."
msgstr "Видите того здоровяка? Капитан судна из Радз-ат-Хана нашёл его в трюме. Когда судно пришвартовалось здесь, мы вытащили этого громилу на берег, чтобы допросить..."

#. ja: それで問い詰めたら、暴れ出しやがったんだ！<br>怪我人が出る前にさっさと片付けたいから、<br>あんたの力を貸してくれ！
#. de: Wir müssen eingreifen, bevor die Sache eskaliert, aber alleine werde ich mit dem Psychopathen nicht fertig. Kannst du mir helfen?
#. fr: C'est là qu'il s'en est pris à mes hommes<nbsp>! Il a beau avoir passé presque deux semaines enfermé dans le noir, il a beaucoup d'énergie à revendre... Nous aurions besoin d'aide pour le contrôler.
#. column 56: An adventurer, are you? Well, you'll have to do.
#. column 57: You see that man over there? The big one. The captain of a shipping vessel out of Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han found him stowed away belowdecks. When the captain moored here at the Quay, we brought the brute ashore for questioning...
#. column 59: Aid the Quay guards?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Aye... I shan't judge you for your decision. No <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in their right mind would want to dance with that <i>thing</i>.
msgctxt "FateEvent:49:0:58"
msgid "...when he up and started assailing my men! And for a man who's been holed up in a dark corner for the past fortnight, he has more energy than you'd believe. We could certainly use a hand in calming him down."
msgstr "...а он ни с того ни с сего набросился на моих людей! И это после двух недель в тёмном углу — энергии у него хоть отбавляй. Помогли бы нам его усмирить."

#. ja: 手を貸してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Gelbjacke unterstützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les gardes du quai<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: An adventurer, are you? Well, you'll have to do.
#. column 57: You see that man over there? The big one. The captain of a shipping vessel out of Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han found him stowed away belowdecks. When the captain moored here at the Quay, we brought the brute ashore for questioning...
#. column 58: ...when he up and started assailing my men! And for a man who's been holed up in a dark corner for the past fortnight, he has more energy than you'd believe. We could certainly use a hand in calming him down.
#. column 62: Aye... I shan't judge you for your decision. No <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in their right mind would want to dance with that <i>thing</i>.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:49:0:59"
msgid "Aid the Quay guards?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь стражникам причала?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ……分かった、残念だが仕方がない。<br>無理を言ってすまなかったな。
#. de: In Ordnung, die Sache geht dich ja auch eigentlich nichts an. Entschuldige, dass ich dich da mit reinziehen wollte.
#. fr: Je comprends votre décision... Je ne vous juge pas. Qui aurait envie de se frotter à une pareille brute<nbsp>?
#. column 56: An adventurer, are you? Well, you'll have to do.
#. column 57: You see that man over there? The big one. The captain of a shipping vessel out of Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han found him stowed away belowdecks. When the captain moored here at the Quay, we brought the brute ashore for questioning...
#. column 58: ...when he up and started assailing my men! And for a man who's been holed up in a dark corner for the past fortnight, he has more energy than you'd believe. We could certainly use a hand in calming him down.
#. column 59: Aid the Quay guards?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:49:0:62"
msgid "Aye... I shan't judge you for your decision. No <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in their right mind would want to dance with that <i>thing</i>."
msgstr "Ну что ж... Не стану тебя осуждать. Ни одна <if $gn4>женщина<else>мужчина</if> в здравом уме не захочет связываться с этой <i>штукой</i>."

#. ja: アーススプライトの核は集まったか……？
#. de: Und, bist du fündig geworden?
#. fr: Tu me rapportes des noyaux d'élémentaire de terre...<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Cores...
#. column 62: You bring cores...I bring coin... Simple...
msgctxt "FateEvent:50:0:56"
msgid "Cores...?"
msgstr "Ядра?.."

#. ja: 悪くない。この調子で、もっと頼む……。
#. de: Ausgezeichnet! Mach weiter so!
#. fr: Oui, continue comme ça...
#. column 56: Cores...?
#. column 62: You bring cores...I bring coin... Simple...
msgctxt "FateEvent:50:0:60"
msgid "Cores..."
msgstr "Ядра..."

#. ja: そうか……。<br>報酬は歩合制だ……覚えておくんだな……。
#. de: Verstehe. Denk an die Belohnung. Es lohnt sich!
#. fr: Si tu m'apportes des noyaux d'élémentaire de terre... je te les achète... C'est simple comme bonjour...
#. column 56: Cores...?
#. column 60: Cores...
msgctxt "FateEvent:50:0:62"
msgid "You bring cores...I bring coin... Simple..."
msgstr "Ты приносишь ядра... я плачу... Всё просто..."

#. ja: あっしの荷物、取り戻してくれたんで！？
#. de: Wie sieht's aus? Hast du meine Waren wieder?
#. fr: Alors<nbsp>? Vous avez récupéré ma cargaison<nbsp>? J'ai un rendez-vous, vous savez. Avec une noble dame. Et une tasse de thé. Dépêchez-vous un peu<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Is this all? I could have sworn there were more. Countless more. Yes. Now back into the breach, my good <if $gn4>lady<else>fellow</if>.
#. column 62: What are you waiting for!? The tea! It grows ever colder!
msgctxt "FateEvent:51:0:56"
msgid "Have you retrieved my crates yet? I have an appointment, you know. One with a noble lady. There will be tea."
msgstr "Мои ящики уже нашли? У меня, между прочим, встреча. С одной знатной дамой. Будем пить чай."

#. ja: 間違いねぇ、あっしの荷物でさぁ！<br>さすが冒険者様、他のも頼みましたぜ！
#. de: Das ist zweifellos aus meinen Beständen! Vielen Dank! Wenn du auch den Rest finden würdest, wäre ich dir auf ewig dankbar!
#. fr: C'est tout<nbsp>? J'aurais juré qu'il y en avait plus. Oui, beaucoup plus. Allez chercher le reste<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you retrieved my crates yet? I have an appointment, you know. One with a noble lady. There will be tea.
#. column 62: What are you waiting for!? The tea! It grows ever colder!
#. macro: <if $gn4>lady<else>fellow</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:51:0:60"
msgid "Is this all? I could have sworn there were more. Countless more. Yes. Now back into the breach, my good <if $gn4>lady<else>fellow</if>."
msgstr "Это всё? А я думал, их куда больше. Несметно больше. Да, ступайте обратно, <if $gn4>миледи<else>сударь</if>."

#. ja: はて、そいじゃその手にお持ちの物は……？
#. de: Dann husch zurück mit dir zu den hinterhältigen Lalafell! Diese Diebe haben sich ihre Abreibung redlich verdient.
#. fr: Qu'est-ce que vous attendez<nbsp>!? La noble dame va s'ennuyer et mon thé va être froid<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you retrieved my crates yet? I have an appointment, you know. One with a noble lady. There will be tea.
#. column 60: Is this all? I could have sworn there were more. Countless more. Yes. Now back into the breach, my good <if $gn4>lady<else>fellow</if>.
msgctxt "FateEvent:51:0:62"
msgid "What are you waiting for!? The tea! It grows ever colder!"
msgstr "Чего ждёте?! Чай! Он уже остывает!"

#. ja: アーススプライトの核を集めている……。<br>持っていたら、譲ってくれ……。
#. de: Du hast nicht zufällig Erd-Exergon-Kerne bei dir? Ich könnte die nämlich gut gebrauchen ...
#. fr: Obtiens-moi des noyaux...
msgctxt "FateEvent:52:0:56"
msgid "Cores..."
msgstr "Ядра..."

#. ja: 盗賊団に奪われた、あっしの荷物を取り戻してくだせぇ！<br>奴らの根城はそこの廃屋、頼みますぜ！
#. de: Was machst du hier mit leeren Händen? Mein gesamter Warenbestand wurde mir von den dreisten Dieben da oben geklaut! Wenn ich die Kisten nicht wiederbekomme, bin ich ruiniert!
#. fr: Je n'ai pas de temps à perdre. La noble dame et mon thé m'attendent. Je ne vous l'ai pas déjà expliqué<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:53:0:56"
msgid "I do not have the time for this. Tea and noble ladies await! Didn't I mention this?"
msgstr "Мне некогда! Чай и знатные дамы ждут! Я разве не говорил?"

#. ja: 冒険者さん、お願いがあります。<br>ここで発掘された遺物をオアシスへ運ぶので、<br>護衛として同行してくれませんか？
#. de: He, du da! <if $gn4>Mutige Abenteurerin<else>Mutiger Abenteurer</if>! Ich hätte da eine Bitte an dich: Kannst du mir helfen, ein Fundstück von diesem Ausgrabungsort zur Vergessenen Oase zu bringen?
#. fr: Dites-moi, vous me semblez être un<if $gn4>e</if> aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> expérimenté<if $gn4>e</if>. Figurez-vous que je dois traverser le désert pour rejoindre les sources oubliées et y livrer ces reliques, mais je ne peux pas à la fois me défendre et les porter.
#. column 57: You see, the seemingly lifeless desert is actually teeming with creatures who wait under the sand for their victims to hap upon their traps. And then there are the Amalj'aa...
#. column 58: So, what say you? Guide me safely to Forgotten Springs and I shall see to it that you are handsomely rewarded.
#. column 59: Escort the Stone Torch?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well then. I suppose my clients will have to wait.
msgctxt "FateEvent:54:0:56"
msgid "You seem the able adventurer. I must cross the desert to Forgotten Springs with these relics unearthed here at the Strike, but cannot well defend myself with my hands full."
msgstr "Вы выглядите опытным приключенцем. Мне нужно доставить эти реликвии, найденные здесь, в Забытый оазис, но с занятыми руками я себя не защищу."

#. ja: この辺りは、アマルジャ族の勢力が強い……。<br>砂漠に入ったきり二度と戻らない者も多く、<br>荷運びは大変危険な任務なのです。
#. de: In der Sagolii-Wüste wimmelt's von Amalj'aa und ich hab schon von Kollegen gehört, die nie wieder aus ihr zurückgekehrt sind ... Be<shy>ziehungs<shy>weise: Ich hab nie wieder was von ihnen gehört!
#. fr: C'est que le désert grouille de créatures tapies dans le sable, prêtes à se jeter sur toute personne qui passe à proximité. Et puis, il y a les Amalj'aa...
#. column 56: You seem the able adventurer. I must cross the desert to Forgotten Springs with these relics unearthed here at the Strike, but cannot well defend myself with my hands full.
#. column 58: So, what say you? Guide me safely to Forgotten Springs and I shall see to it that you are handsomely rewarded.
#. column 59: Escort the Stone Torch?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well then. I suppose my clients will have to wait.
msgctxt "FateEvent:54:0:57"
msgid "You see, the seemingly lifeless desert is actually teeming with creatures who wait under the sand for their victims to hap upon their traps. And then there are the Amalj'aa..."
msgstr "На вид пустыня безжизненная, но под песком притаились твари, поджидающие добычу. А ещё там амалджа..."

#. ja: でも、先輩は僕に任せると言ってくれた。<br>何としてでも、無事にオアシスへ荷物を届けたいんです！
#. de: Mein Chef jedenfalls meinte, ich wär genau der Richtige für den Job ... W-Was er damit wohl gemeint hat?
#. fr: J'aimerais donc que vous m'escortiez jusqu'à l'Oasis oubliée. Je veillerai à ce que vous touchiez une belle récompense.
#. column 56: You seem the able adventurer. I must cross the desert to Forgotten Springs with these relics unearthed here at the Strike, but cannot well defend myself with my hands full.
#. column 57: You see, the seemingly lifeless desert is actually teeming with creatures who wait under the sand for their victims to hap upon their traps. And then there are the Amalj'aa...
#. column 59: Escort the Stone Torch?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well then. I suppose my clients will have to wait.
msgctxt "FateEvent:54:0:58"
msgid "So, what say you? Guide me safely to Forgotten Springs and I shall see to it that you are handsomely rewarded."
msgstr "Ну как, проводите меня до Забытых источников? Я вас щедро награжу."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem gemobbten Soldaten zur Seite stehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter ce soldat<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You seem the able adventurer. I must cross the desert to Forgotten Springs with these relics unearthed here at the Strike, but cannot well defend myself with my hands full.
#. column 57: You see, the seemingly lifeless desert is actually teeming with creatures who wait under the sand for their victims to hap upon their traps. And then there are the Amalj'aa...
#. column 58: So, what say you? Guide me safely to Forgotten Springs and I shall see to it that you are handsomely rewarded.
#. column 62: Well then. I suppose my clients will have to wait.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:54:0:59"
msgid "Escort the Stone Torch?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить Каменный факел?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: あ、そうか。せっかく先輩が任せてくれたんだから、<br>自分の力で完遂すべきですよね！
#. de: V-Verstehe ... \<schluck> ... Dann werd ich die Tour wohl alleine antreten müssen. War schön, dich kennengelernt zu haben.
#. fr: Comme vous voulez. J'imagine que mes clients devront attendre, dans ce cas.
#. column 56: You seem the able adventurer. I must cross the desert to Forgotten Springs with these relics unearthed here at the Strike, but cannot well defend myself with my hands full.
#. column 57: You see, the seemingly lifeless desert is actually teeming with creatures who wait under the sand for their victims to hap upon their traps. And then there are the Amalj'aa...
#. column 58: So, what say you? Guide me safely to Forgotten Springs and I shall see to it that you are handsomely rewarded.
#. column 59: Escort the Stone Torch?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:54:0:62"
msgid "Well then. I suppose my clients will have to wait."
msgstr "Что ж, значит, заказчикам придётся подождать."

#. ja: まったく、最近の若い陸兵ときたら、<br>ひ弱な奴らばかりで、かなわん！<br>これでは、いざというときにまともに戦えんぞ！！
#. de: Es ist zum Nasenhaareraufen mit diesen jungen Rekruten! Ihren Mund können sie gar nicht weit genug aufreißen, aber mit dem Schwert fuchteln sie rum wie Gaukler mit ihren Schleifchen und Ringen. Wenn es hart auf hart kommt, überleben die keine zwei Wimpernschläge!
#. fr: C'est incroyable<nbsp>! Chaque lot de nouvelles recrues que les Barracudas m'envoient est pire que le précédent. J'ai déjà dû en renvoyer trois qui n'arrêtaient pas de pleurer.
#. column 57: If only I had more <if $gn4>women<else>men</if> like you. Ones with sharp blades, and the wits to match.
#. column 58: I know. How about you show these yellow-bellied greenbacks how a true warrior fights? I'll make it worth your while.
#. column 59: Crack the whip?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hah hah hah! You hear that, scrags? Prepare to have your arses handed to you on a silver bleedin' platter. Now fall in!
#. column 62: \<sigh><br>I suppose they wouldn't have offered much of a challenge anywise.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:55:0:56"
msgid "I swear, each batch of recruits the Barracudas send me is worse than the last. I've already had to send three home because <i>they wouldn't stop crying</i>."
msgstr "Клянусь, каждая новая партия рекрутов от «Барракуд» хуже предыдущей. Троих уже пришлось отправить домой, потому что <i>они никак не могли перестать плакать</i>."

#. ja: ときに、お主。<br>ずいぶんと腕が立ちそうな冒険者だな？
#. de: Du siehst hingegen aus, als hättest du schon einige Schlachten geschlagen.
#. fr: Vous, au contraire, vous m'avez l'air d'être un<if $gn4>e</if> aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> compétent<if $gn4>e</if>. Capable de manier son arme habilement, et surtout le cerveau qui va avec.
#. column 56: I swear, each batch of recruits the Barracudas send me is worse than the last. I've already had to send three home because <i>they wouldn't stop crying</i>.
#. column 58: I know. How about you show these yellow-bellied greenbacks how a true warrior fights? I'll make it worth your while.
#. column 59: Crack the whip?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hah hah hah! You hear that, scrags? Prepare to have your arses handed to you on a silver bleedin' platter. Now fall in!
#. column 62: \<sigh><br>I suppose they wouldn't have offered much of a challenge anywise.
#. macro: <if $gn4>women<else>men</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:55:0:57"
msgid "If only I had more <if $gn4>women<else>men</if> like you. Ones with sharp blades, and the wits to match."
msgstr "Вот бы побольше таких, как ты, <if $gn4>женщин<else>мужчин</if>. С острым клинком и такой же острой головой."

#. ja: ここはひとつ、うちの新兵どもと一戦交えて<br>鍛えなおしてやってくれ！！
#. de: Ein Übungskampf gegen dich wäre den Bengeln und Gören sicher eine prima Lektion.
#. fr: Ah, je sais<nbsp>! Vous accepteriez de montrer aux mauviettes que j'ai ici comment se bat un véritable guerrier<nbsp>? Je m'arrangerai pour vous récompenser.
#. column 56: I swear, each batch of recruits the Barracudas send me is worse than the last. I've already had to send three home because <i>they wouldn't stop crying</i>.
#. column 57: If only I had more <if $gn4>women<else>men</if> like you. Ones with sharp blades, and the wits to match.
#. column 59: Crack the whip?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hah hah hah! You hear that, scrags? Prepare to have your arses handed to you on a silver bleedin' platter. Now fall in!
#. column 62: \<sigh><br>I suppose they wouldn't have offered much of a challenge anywise.
msgctxt "FateEvent:55:0:58"
msgid "I know. How about you show these yellow-bellied greenbacks how a true warrior fights? I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr "Вот что. Покажи этим трусам-новичкам, как сражается настоящий воин. Я тебя щедро награжу."

#. ja: 鍛えなおしてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Rekruten die Augen öffnen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Faire une dé<shy>mon<shy>stra<shy>tion aux nouvelles recrues<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I swear, each batch of recruits the Barracudas send me is worse than the last. I've already had to send three home because <i>they wouldn't stop crying</i>.
#. column 57: If only I had more <if $gn4>women<else>men</if> like you. Ones with sharp blades, and the wits to match.
#. column 58: I know. How about you show these yellow-bellied greenbacks how a true warrior fights? I'll make it worth your while.
#. column 60: Hah hah hah! You hear that, scrags? Prepare to have your arses handed to you on a silver bleedin' platter. Now fall in!
#. column 62: \<sigh><br>I suppose they wouldn't have offered much of a challenge anywise.
