#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:55:0:59"
msgid "Crack the whip?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Подстегнуть их?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 協力痛み入る！<br>連中に、遠慮も配慮も無用。<br>完膚なきまでに打ちのめしてくれ！！
#. de: Du bist wahrlich <if $gn4>eine ehrenvolle Frau<else>ein ehrenvoller Mann</if>! Zeige keine Zurückhaltung! Prügle den Übermut aus diesen Flegeln, dass ihnen Hören und Sehen vergeht!
#. fr: Hahaha<nbsp>! Vous avez entendu, bande de lopettes<nbsp>? Va falloir vous secouer. Formez les rangs<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I swear, each batch of recruits the Barracudas send me is worse than the last. I've already had to send three home because <i>they wouldn't stop crying</i>.
#. column 57: If only I had more <if $gn4>women<else>men</if> like you. Ones with sharp blades, and the wits to match.
#. column 58: I know. How about you show these yellow-bellied greenbacks how a true warrior fights? I'll make it worth your while.
#. column 59: Crack the whip?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sigh><br>I suppose they wouldn't have offered much of a challenge anywise.
msgctxt "FateEvent:55:0:60"
msgid "Hah hah hah! You hear that, scrags? Prepare to have your arses handed to you on a silver bleedin' platter. Now fall in!"
msgstr "Ха-ха-ха! Слышали, сопляки? Сейчас вам зададут жару! А ну, стройся!"

#. ja: そうか、仕方ない。<br>うちの新兵では、手ごたえがなさすぎるか……
#. de: Das ist sehr bedauerlich. Diesen Windbeuteln gehört einmal kräftig der Marsch geblasen ...
#. fr: Je suppose que ce n'est pas vraiment un défi pour vous.
#. column 56: I swear, each batch of recruits the Barracudas send me is worse than the last. I've already had to send three home because <i>they wouldn't stop crying</i>.
#. column 57: If only I had more <if $gn4>women<else>men</if> like you. Ones with sharp blades, and the wits to match.
#. column 58: I know. How about you show these yellow-bellied greenbacks how a true warrior fights? I'll make it worth your while.
#. column 59: Crack the whip?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hah hah hah! You hear that, scrags? Prepare to have your arses handed to you on a silver bleedin' platter. Now fall in!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:55:0:62"
msgid "\\<sigh><br>I suppose they wouldn't have offered much of a challenge anywise."
msgstr "<i>Эх...</i><br>Пожалуй, они и правда не составили бы особого вызова."

#. ja: おおっ、そこの冒険者！<br>いいところに来た、ひとつ頼まれてくれっ！！
#. de: He da, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>! Sieh dir diese beiden Streithähne an!
#. fr: Les dieux soient loués<nbsp>! Vous arrivez à point nommé, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>!
#. column 57: Anselm and Fiebras are at each other's throats again! It's that damned ale wench. Both fancy the lass, and neither is willing to stand aside so that the other may have her...though, truth be told, the wench despises both, and only humors them because it is her job to do so.
#. column 58: The two are good lads...when not in their cups, but I fear that their lust for this girl will end in one of them dead! I have already tried calming them with words, but to no avail. This leaves us with but one solution─steel.
#. column 59: Beat the violence out of the two?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: This will not end well... You have sentenced a man to death today. Let that sit well on your conscience.
msgctxt "FateEvent:56:0:56"
msgid "Thank the Twelve you came along when you did!"
msgstr "Двенадцать послали тебя как раз вовремя!"

#. ja: 喧嘩だよ、喧嘩の仲裁だ。<br>こいつらを大人しくさせたいんだが、さすがは海の男2人。<br>どうにも屈強で、オレの手を焼かせやがるのよ。
#. de: Eigentlich sollten sie's in ihrem Alter besser wissen, aber die meisten Piraten lassen ihren seelischen Reifeprozess anscheinend irgendwann in der Pubertät über die Planke gehen. Mit Vernunft ist denen jedenfalls nicht beizukommen.
#. fr: Anselm et Fiebras sont aux prises une fois de plus<nbsp>! C'est encore parti d'une stupide histoire de femmes. Ce sont de bons gars... enfin, quand ils n'ont pas trop bu. J'ai bien peur que cette rivalité ne finisse par faire un mort.
#. column 56: Thank the Twelve you came along when you did!
#. column 58: The two are good lads...when not in their cups, but I fear that their lust for this girl will end in one of them dead! I have already tried calming them with words, but to no avail. This leaves us with but one solution─steel.
#. column 59: Beat the violence out of the two?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: This will not end well... You have sentenced a man to death today. Let that sit well on your conscience.
msgctxt "FateEvent:56:0:57"
msgid "Anselm and Fiebras are at each other's throats again! It's that damned ale wench. Both fancy the lass, and neither is willing to stand aside so that the other may have her...though, truth be told, the wench despises both, and only humors them because it is her job to do so."
msgstr "Ансельм и Фиебра снова сцепились! Всё из-за этой проклятой разносчицы эля. Оба на неё запали, и ни один не уступит другому... Хотя, если честно, девица терпеть их не может и только подыгрывает, потому что такая у неё работа."

#. ja: いっちょ、手加減なしでガツンとやって、<br>バカどもの頭を冷やしてやってくれい！
#. de: Die Jungs verstehen nur die Sprache der Köpfnüsse! Doch wenn ich sie alleine stelle, reagieren die ihren Frust am Ende nur gemeinsam an mir ab. Bitte, du musst mir helfen!
#. fr: Il faut dire qu'ils sont têtus comme des pirates, ces deux idiots. J'ai déjà essayé de les raisonner par la parole, mais en vain. Il ne nous reste qu'une solution, la force.
#. column 56: Thank the Twelve you came along when you did!
#. column 57: Anselm and Fiebras are at each other's throats again! It's that damned ale wench. Both fancy the lass, and neither is willing to stand aside so that the other may have her...though, truth be told, the wench despises both, and only humors them because it is her job to do so.
#. column 59: Beat the violence out of the two?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: This will not end well... You have sentenced a man to death today. Let that sit well on your conscience.
msgctxt "FateEvent:56:0:58"
msgid "The two are good lads...when not in their cups, but I fear that their lust for this girl will end in one of them dead! I have already tried calming them with words, but to no avail. This leaves us with but one solution─steel."
msgstr "Парни они хорошие... когда трезвые. Но боюсь, из-за этой девицы один из них убьёт другого! Я уже пытался их унять словами, да без толку. Остаётся одно — сталь."

#. ja: 頭を冷やしてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Streit schlichten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Mater les deux bagarreurs<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Thank the Twelve you came along when you did!
#. column 57: Anselm and Fiebras are at each other's throats again! It's that damned ale wench. Both fancy the lass, and neither is willing to stand aside so that the other may have her...though, truth be told, the wench despises both, and only humors them because it is her job to do so.
#. column 58: The two are good lads...when not in their cups, but I fear that their lust for this girl will end in one of them dead! I have already tried calming them with words, but to no avail. This leaves us with but one solution─steel.
#. column 62: This will not end well... You have sentenced a man to death today. Let that sit well on your conscience.
