msgctxt "FateEvent:56:0:59"
msgid "Beat the violence out of the two?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Утихомирить драчунов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: うっ……そ、そうか。<br>無理なことを頼もうとして、悪かったな。
#. de: Jaja, du hast ja Recht. Ich sollte mich nicht vor meiner Verantwortung drücken. Aber sieh dir die beiden doch an!
#. fr: Tout cela va mal finir... Désolé de vous avoir demandé ça. Sachez que vous aurez peut-être une mort sur la conscience...
#. column 56: Thank the Twelve you came along when you did!
#. column 57: Anselm and Fiebras are at each other's throats again! It's that damned ale wench. Both fancy the lass, and neither is willing to stand aside so that the other may have her...though, truth be told, the wench despises both, and only humors them because it is her job to do so.
#. column 58: The two are good lads...when not in their cups, but I fear that their lust for this girl will end in one of them dead! I have already tried calming them with words, but to no avail. This leaves us with but one solution─steel.
#. column 59: Beat the violence out of the two?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:56:0:62"
msgid "This will not end well... You have sentenced a man to death today. Let that sit well on your conscience."
msgstr "Ничем хорошим это не кончится... Сегодня ты обрёк человека на смерть. Пусть совесть тебе об этом напомнит."

#. ja: ゲッ！？　お、俺は別に負けてないぞ。<br>これはちょっと……そう、油断しただけだ！
#. de: I-Ich? Ich bin gar nicht besiegt, das sieht nur so aus! \<keuch>
#. fr: Cette femme ne m'a pas vraiment battu, c'est juste que je n'avais pas fini de me préparer. Elle m'a attaqué par surprise<nbsp>!
#. column 57: I didn't think when I left my bed this morning that some slighted scold with a peiste-sized chip on her shoulder might challenge me to a bloody duel. But I wasn't about to refuse her...not with everyone watching and my reputation on the line. If I ain't one thing, it's craven.
#. column 58: But here I am. Bloodied and bruised while that hells-cat sits over there smirking. What she did ain't proper and I plan on learnin' her a lesson. Just, this time with a wee bit of help. What say you?
#. column 59: Challenge Grishild the Ungood?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You aren't craven, are you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:57:0:56"
msgid "That woman didn't best me. I merely came unprepared."
msgstr "Эта женщина меня не победила. Просто я был не готов."

#. ja: あそこの女が、力比べとか言うモンだからよぉ。<br>ノッてやったら、意外と強ぇでやんの！
#. de: Allerdings muss ich zugeben ... \<fiep> ... dass diese Frau da vorne ... \<schnauf> ... ganz schön was auf dem Kasten hat.
#. fr: C'est cette mégère qui m'a provoqué en duel, en plus<nbsp>! Je ne pouvais quand même pas refuser devant tout le monde<nbsp>! Ma réputation était en jeu<nbsp>! S'il y a bien une chose que je ne suis pas, c'est un lâche.
#. column 56: That woman didn't best me. I merely came unprepared.
#. column 58: But here I am. Bloodied and bruised while that hells-cat sits over there smirking. What she did ain't proper and I plan on learnin' her a lesson. Just, this time with a wee bit of help. What say you?
#. column 59: Challenge Grishild the Ungood?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You aren't craven, are you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:57:0:57"
msgid "I didn't think when I left my bed this morning that some slighted scold with a peiste-sized chip on her shoulder might challenge me to a bloody duel. But I wasn't about to refuse her...not with everyone watching and my reputation on the line. If I ain't one thing, it's craven."
msgstr "Та женщина предложила помериться силами. Ну я и согласился — а она, оказывается, крепкий орешек!"

#. ja: そうだ、あんたも手を貸してくれよ！<br>野良のケンカに、卑怯もへったくれもねぇだろ？
#. de: W-Warum ... \<röchel> ... versuchst du's nicht auch mal? Du wirst bestimmt ... \<hust> ... so spielend mit ihr fertig wie ich! (Alles, bloß nicht noch mal gegen die kämpfen!)
#. fr: Mais me voilà, couvert de sang et de bleus alors que cette furie ricane. Je n'ai pas apprécié ce qu'elle a fait et je compte bien lui donner une bonne leçon. Mais avec un peu d'aide, cette fois. Qu'en dites-vous<nbsp>?
#. column 56: That woman didn't best me. I merely came unprepared.
#. column 57: I didn't think when I left my bed this morning that some slighted scold with a peiste-sized chip on her shoulder might challenge me to a bloody duel. But I wasn't about to refuse her...not with everyone watching and my reputation on the line. If I ain't one thing, it's craven.
#. column 59: Challenge Grishild the Ungood?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You aren't craven, are you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:57:0:58"
msgid "But here I am. Bloodied and bruised while that hells-cat sits over there smirking. What she did ain't proper and I plan on learnin' her a lesson. Just, this time with a wee bit of help. What say you?"
msgstr "А теперь посмотри на меня: весь в синяках и крови, а эта ведьма вон ухмыляется. Нечестно она поступила, и я собираюсь её проучить. Только на этот раз мне понадобится помощь. Ну что скажешь?"

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Grishild herausfordern?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Défier Grishild la terreur<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: That woman didn't best me. I merely came unprepared.
#. column 57: I didn't think when I left my bed this morning that some slighted scold with a peiste-sized chip on her shoulder might challenge me to a bloody duel. But I wasn't about to refuse her...not with everyone watching and my reputation on the line. If I ain't one thing, it's craven.
#. column 58: But here I am. Bloodied and bruised while that hells-cat sits over there smirking. What she did ain't proper and I plan on learnin' her a lesson. Just, this time with a wee bit of help. What say you?
#. column 62: You aren't craven, are you?
