msgstr "Бросить вызов Гришильд Негодной?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: けっ。怖気づいてるんじゃねぇよ。
#. de: Ts, da hat wohl <if $gn4>eine<else>einer</if> gestrichen die Hosen voll, was?
#. fr: Vous n'êtes pas un<if $gn4>e peureuse<else> lâche</if>, tout de même<nbsp>?
#. column 56: That woman didn't best me. I merely came unprepared.
#. column 57: I didn't think when I left my bed this morning that some slighted scold with a peiste-sized chip on her shoulder might challenge me to a bloody duel. But I wasn't about to refuse her...not with everyone watching and my reputation on the line. If I ain't one thing, it's craven.
#. column 58: But here I am. Bloodied and bruised while that hells-cat sits over there smirking. What she did ain't proper and I plan on learnin' her a lesson. Just, this time with a wee bit of help. What say you?
#. column 59: Challenge Grishild the Ungood?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:57:0:62"
msgid "You aren't craven, are you?"
msgstr "Неужели струсил?"

#. ja: 現在、我ら黒渦団は、デネベール関門の防衛訓練中である！<br>攻め入る黒渦団の教導隊員を殲滅するのである！<br>希望ならば、お主の参加も認めるのである！
#. de: Das Manöver des Mahlstroms ist in vollem Gange, Milchgesicht! Wenn du Mumm genug in den Knochen hast, kannst du dich gerne beteiligen! Ansonsten: Wegtreten!
#. fr: Salut, jeune <if $gn4>fe<else>ho</if>mme<nbsp>! Le Maelstrom mène un exercice d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment au poste de Nevelle. Les aventuriers comme toi peuvent participer s'ils le désirent.
msgctxt "FateEvent:58:0:56"
msgid "Hear ye! The Maelstrom is conducting a live training exercise at the De Nevelle Checkpoint. All adventurers are welcome to join."
msgstr "Внимание! На Заставе Невеля Мальстрём проводит полевые учения. Всем искателям приключений добро пожаловать!"

#. ja: おお冒険者か、こりゃ、いいところに！<br>お主も、うちのひ弱な新兵たちを打ちのめし、<br>鍛えてやってくれ！！
#. de: Ah, du kommst gerade recht! Unsere hochnäsigen Rekruten brauchen jemanden, der sie auf den Boden der Tatsachen zurückholt! Nur keine Zurückhaltung, mein<if $gn4>e Liebe<else> Lieber</if>!
#. fr: Ah, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! Vous tombez bien<nbsp>! Vous voudriez bien apprendre à ces pleutres deux ou trois choses sur le combat<nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:59:0:56"
msgid "You look to be well-seasoned <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>. Would you care to show this batch of yellow-bellied greenbacks a thing or two about battlecraft?"
msgstr "Ты, похоже, бывалый <if $gn4>боец<else>боец</if>. Не покажешь этим трусливым салагам, как надо сражаться?"

#. ja: 冒険者よ、助けてほしい！<br>せっかく摘んだ「オレンジ入りの木箱」が襲われてるんだ！<br>箱にたかってるラットどもを根こそぎ倒してくれ！
#. de: Meine Orangen! Meine Orangen! Ist das zu fassen? Diese elenden Ratten haben einfach keinen Respekt vor einem hart schuftenden Bauern! Jemand muss sie vertreiben!
#. fr: Aidez-moi à repousser ces maudits rats jusqu'à ce que la caravane de chocobos vienne prendre mes oranges.
#. macro: <if $gn4>good lady<else>good sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:60:0:56"
msgid "I beg of you, <if $gn4>good lady<else>good sir</if>! Might you help me keep these damnable rats clear of my oranges until the chocobo caravan arrives?"
msgstr "Умоляю, <if $gn4>миледи<else>сударь</if>! Помогите отогнать проклятых крыс от моих апельсинов, пока не прибыл караван чокобо!"

#. ja: もう、うっとうしいガラゴなんだから！<br>これじゃあ小麦粉を出荷できないわよ……。
#. de: Diese verfluchten Galagos! Wie soll ich mein Mehl so jemals zum Markt bekommen?
#. fr: Ras le bol des galagos<nbsp>! À cause de ces vilains chapardeurs, je ne peux pas livrer ma farine<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:61:0:56"
msgid "Galagos! Galagos! How am I to deliver my wheat to market when the Grey Fleet is overrun with...with...galagos!?"
msgstr "Галакосы! Галакосы! Как мне доставить пшеницу на рынок, если весь Серый флот кишит... кишит... галакосами?!"

#. ja: ヤーゾンめ、ウジャウジャ集まりやがって……。<br>杭打ち機はくれてやるもんか！
#. de: Ist das zu fassen?! Wie dreist von diesen Yarzons, ihre Nester in unserer Dampframme zu errichen! Na warte, die können was erleben! Können sie doch, oder?
#. fr: Saletés de yarzons<nbsp>! Qu'est-ce qu'ils ont à venir traîner par ici<nbsp>!? Hors de question qu'on les laisse d'approcher de nos machines<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:62:0:56"
msgid "The yarzons won't have the Hammers! Not if I can help it!"
msgstr "Не бывать ярзонам у наших молотов! Пока я здесь, не бывать!"

#. ja: 資材を守るんだ。ほら、早く！<br>ゴブリン族を追い払ってくれっ！
#. de: Du musst unsere Zahnräder beschützen. Ohne die sind wir aufgeschmissen! Sieh doch, die Goblins sind schon voll im Gange.
#. fr: Si ces satanés Gobelins touchent à mes rouages, je... je... je vais leur en faire voir de toutes les couleurs<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:63:0:56"
msgid "If those cursed goblins lay a hand on me cogs I'll...I'll... Well, I'll think of somethin'!"
msgstr "Только эти проклятые гоблины тронут мои шестерёнки — я... я... Ну, что-нибудь придумаю!"

#. ja: あわわわ……！<br>オロボンが、よってたかって浅瀬の小魚を！<br>ウチの晩御飯なのにー！？
#. de: He, die elenden Orobon futtern uns die ganzen Fische weg! U-Unser Abendessen!
#. fr: Argh<nbsp>! Maudits orobons<nbsp>! Si on les laisse manger les jeunes poissons, il n'y aura rien à manger pour la prochaine saison<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:64:0:56"
msgid "The orobon are at it again! We cannot let them eat any more of the younger fish, or there'll be naught left for next season's catch!"
msgstr "Опять оробоны за своё! Нельзя позволить им сожрать всю молодь, а то в следующем сезоне ловить будет нечего!"

#. ja: 父ちゃんはオロボンに食べられた……。<br>あいつらを全部倒して、父ちゃんの恨みを晴らしてくれよ！
#. de: Die Orobon verdienen es nicht, auf dieser Welt zu sein. Die verdammten Viecher haben meinen Vater auf dem Gewissen!
#. fr: Mon père... Il est mort dévoré par un orobon. Maintenant, je veux qu'ils meurent tous. Aidez-moi à les exterminer, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:65:0:56"
msgid "Me da... Et by a 'bon, he were. Now I wants the fishes all dead, like. Can ye make 'em all dead, like?"
msgstr "Мой папка... Его съел оробон. Теперь хочу, чтобы все рыбы подохли. Можешь всех их убить?"

#. ja: ムムッ、貴殿から熱い闘魂を感じるぞ。<br>相当な猛者と見込んで、協力をお願いしたい！
#. de: Hm ja, mit dir könnte das was werden ... Mit dir könnte ich das Feldlager der Amalj'aa sicher ganz gut aufmischen.
#. fr: Héhé<nbsp>! Mais vous m'avez l'air d'un<if $gn4>e aventurière pleine<else> aventurier plein</if> d'ardeur<nbsp>! Tout à fait ce qu'il me faut<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Spurred by rumors of a new Amalj'aa commander, I arrived outside the beast tribe encampment to find not only that the commander had arrived, but that the foul lizards were preparing to march on Ul'dah!
#. column 58: A request for reinforcements has already been sent via linkshell, but it will be several bells before they arrive, and by then it will be too late. No, we must stop the enemy before they advance, and since we are sorely outnumbered, I believe the only path to victory is to lower morale by targeting both their supplies and their leader.
#. column 59: Aid the Immortal Flames?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then I suggest you leave this area immediately, for it will soon be engulfed in chaos.
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:66:0:56"
msgid "Ah, an adventurer. And one with fire in <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> eyes, no less. That fire is just what we need."
msgstr "О, приключенец. Да ещё и с огнём в глазах. Такой огонь нам как раз нужен."

#. ja: そこのアマルジャ軍陣屋に、新たな指揮官が着任したと聞き<br>こっそり偵察に来たのだが……<br>連中め、既に進軍準備をしているではないか！
#. de: Warum, fragst du? Weil da gerade ein neuer Kommandant eingesetzt worden ist, und der steckt voller Tatendrang. Plant, die Kämpfer an der Front zu beliefern, um bei seinen Untergebenen wie Vorgesetzten gleichsam zu punkten! Aber da hat er die Rechnung ohne mich gemacht!
#. fr: Figurez-vous qu'intrigué par les rumeurs d'un nouveau commandant chez les Amalj'aa, je suis allé voir ça de plus près. Non seulement je l'ai aperçu de mes propres yeux, mais j'ai également découvert que ces satanés hommes-lézards se préparaient à marcher vers Ul'dah<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ah, an adventurer. And one with fire in <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> eyes, no less. That fire is just what we need.
#. column 58: A request for reinforcements has already been sent via linkshell, but it will be several bells before they arrive, and by then it will be too late. No, we must stop the enemy before they advance, and since we are sorely outnumbered, I believe the only path to victory is to lower morale by targeting both their supplies and their leader.
#. column 59: Aid the Immortal Flames?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then I suggest you leave this area immediately, for it will soon be engulfed in chaos.
msgctxt "FateEvent:66:0:57"
msgid "Spurred by rumors of a new Amalj'aa commander, I arrived outside the beast tribe encampment to find not only that the commander had arrived, but that the foul lizards were preparing to march on Ul'dah!"
msgstr "Услышав слухи о новом командире амалджа, я отправился к их лагерю и обнаружил, что тот не только прибыл, но и собирается повести этих мерзких ящеров на Ульду!"

#. ja: 援軍を待っていては手遅れ。<br>我と共に軍陣屋へ乗り込み、物資の破壊と<br>新指揮官の討伐をもって、進軍を阻止してほしいのだ！
#. de: Glasmaul heißt der Typ, und ich werd ihm gehörig die Fresse polieren mit meinen Lalafell-Sprungkicks, du wirst schon sehen. Die Vorratskisten können wir dabei gleich mit zerdeppern. Klingt doch nach 'ner höllischen Portion Spaß, oder etwa nicht?
#. fr: J'ai envoyé une demande de renfort par linkshell, mais ils arriveront trop tard. Non, nous devons étouffer dans l'œuf l'assaut ennemi. Ceci dit, étant donné notre infériorité numérique, je propose de saper leur moral en ciblant leurs provisions et leur chef.
#. column 56: Ah, an adventurer. And one with fire in <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> eyes, no less. That fire is just what we need.
#. column 57: Spurred by rumors of a new Amalj'aa commander, I arrived outside the beast tribe encampment to find not only that the commander had arrived, but that the foul lizards were preparing to march on Ul'dah!
#. column 59: Aid the Immortal Flames?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then I suggest you leave this area immediately, for it will soon be engulfed in chaos.
msgctxt "FateEvent:66:0:58"
msgid "A request for reinforcements has already been sent via linkshell, but it will be several bells before they arrive, and by then it will be too late. No, we must stop the enemy before they advance, and since we are sorely outnumbered, I believe the only path to victory is to lower morale by targeting both their supplies and their leader."
msgstr "Мы уже запросили подкрепление по linkshell, но оно прибудет лишь через несколько часов — будет поздно. Надо остановить врага до наступления. Нас намного меньше, так что для победы придётся подорвать их боевой дух: уничтожить припасы и устранить командира."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Kundschafter auf seiner Selbstmordmission beistehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les Immortels<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Ah, an adventurer. And one with fire in <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> eyes, no less. That fire is just what we need.
#. column 57: Spurred by rumors of a new Amalj'aa commander, I arrived outside the beast tribe encampment to find not only that the commander had arrived, but that the foul lizards were preparing to march on Ul'dah!
#. column 58: A request for reinforcements has already been sent via linkshell, but it will be several bells before they arrive, and by then it will be too late. No, we must stop the enemy before they advance, and since we are sorely outnumbered, I believe the only path to victory is to lower morale by targeting both their supplies and their leader.
#. column 62: Then I suggest you leave this area immediately, for it will soon be engulfed in chaos.
