msgctxt "FateEvent:67:0:58"
msgid "Collect soulstones for the naturalist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Собрать камни душ для натуралистки?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ステキね。働き者は大好きよ。
#. de: Wunderbar! Fleißige Abenteurer<if $gn4>innen</if> wie du haben einen Seelenstein bei mir im Brett, hohohoho!
#. fr: Génial<nbsp>! Je savais que vous m'aideriez<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I was right! Stand in the desert long enough, and an adventurer is bound to come calling. So, can one assume you are looking for employment? I am a naturalist studying the magicked aura emitted from the Sunken Temple of Qarn, and I believe this aura is what powers those stone golems which guard the entrance.
#. column 57: If I can learn to disrupt that aura, I may be able to render all the guardians inactive, opening the ruins for further exploration by scholars such as myself. But to do so, I first require the hearts of those very guardians, so I may study how they operate.
#. column 58: Collect soulstones for the naturalist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You would forsake a woman in need? What would the good people of the Adventurers' Guild say to that!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:67:0:60"
msgid "Oh, I knew my plan would work!"
msgstr "О, я знала, что план сработает!"

#. ja: あら、思わせぶりな酷い人。<br>この細腕が、それ程したたかに見えて？
#. de: Wie bitte? Wie kannst du nur so herzlos sein? Da hat ja ein Golem mehr Mitgefühl als du!
#. fr: Vous laisseriez passer l'occasion de faire avancer la science<nbsp>? Je me demande ce qu'en dirait la guilde des aventuriers.
#. column 56: I was right! Stand in the desert long enough, and an adventurer is bound to come calling. So, can one assume you are looking for employment? I am a naturalist studying the magicked aura emitted from the Sunken Temple of Qarn, and I believe this aura is what powers those stone golems which guard the entrance.
#. column 57: If I can learn to disrupt that aura, I may be able to render all the guardians inactive, opening the ruins for further exploration by scholars such as myself. But to do so, I first require the hearts of those very guardians, so I may study how they operate.
#. column 58: Collect soulstones for the naturalist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, I knew my plan would work!
msgctxt "FateEvent:67:0:62"
msgid "You would forsake a woman in need? What would the good people of the Adventurers' Guild say to that!?"
msgstr "Вы бросите женщину в беде? И что же скажут добрые люди из Гильдии приключенцев?!"

#. ja: 石兵のソウルストーンが要るの。<br>私のために、ガーディアンを砕いてくださる？
#. de: Ich benötige Golem-Seelensteine. Kannst du ein paar der Wächter für mich in Stücke schlagen? Die merken auch gar nicht, dass das weh tut, glaub mir!
#. fr: À l'intérieur de chacun de ces gardiens se trouve une pierre d'âme qui les anime. J'ai besoin de ces objets pour comprendre comment les désactiver.
msgctxt "FateEvent:68:0:56"
msgid "Inside each stone guardian is a soulstone which animates the lifeless rock. I need these stones so I might learn how to extinguish the flames of life within."
msgstr "Внутри каждого каменного стража спрятан камень души, который оживляет безжизненную глыбу. Мне нужны эти камни, чтобы понять, как погасить заключённую в них искру жизни."

#. ja: 石兵のソウルストーンを手に入れたのね。<br>もったいぶっては嫌よ？
#. de: Oh, du bist fündig geworden! Soll ich dir deine schwere Last abnehmen?
#. fr: Vous m'apportez quelque chose, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>?
#. column 60: The... The light... It burns so brightly, yet emits no heat. What sort of fell magicks am I witnessing here...? Oh, my apologies. Yes, very good. This specimen will do just fine, but I would not turn away a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who brought me more.
#. column 62: But why!? You are a mere adventurer. You cannot expect to fathom the complex mysteries of the soulstones' inner workings! You must entrust them to me! To me!
msgctxt "FateEvent:69:0:56"
msgid "You have brought me something, have you not?"
msgstr "Вы ведь что-то принесли?"

#. ja: うふ、すごく良いわ……なんて冷たい心臓……。<br>じっくり調べたいから、もっと集めてくださる？
#. de: Oh, welch wunderbare Qualität! Das Herzen so kalt sein können! Ich kann den Beginn meiner Experi... äh, Unter<shy>such<shy>ungen kaum erwarten!
#. fr: La... la lumière... Elle est intense, mais n'émet aucune chaleur. Quelle sorte de magie étrange est-ce donc<nbsp>? Cette pierre d'âme est parfaite, mais il m'en faudra plus pour mieux comprendre leur mécanisme.
#. column 56: You have brought me something, have you not?
#. column 62: But why!? You are a mere adventurer. You cannot expect to fathom the complex mysteries of the soulstones' inner workings! You must entrust them to me! To me!
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:69:0:60"
msgid "The... The light... It burns so brightly, yet emits no heat. What sort of fell magicks am I witnessing here...? Oh, my apologies. Yes, very good. This specimen will do just fine, but I would not turn away a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who brought me more."
msgstr "Свет... Такой яркий, а тепла не даёт. Что за тёмная магия передо мной?.. Простите. Да, превосходно. Этот образец вполне подойдёт, но я не откажусь и от других камней — если их принесёт <if $gn4>женщина<else>мужчина</if>."

#. ja: 意地悪ね。それ、余計な荷物になるだけよ？
#. de: Dein Herz ist kälter als jeder Stein! Vermutlich macht es dir sogar Spaß, mich zu ärgern ... was dich ja fast schon wieder sympathisch macht, hohoho!
#. fr: Mais pourquoi<nbsp>!? Vous n'êtes qu'un<if $gn4>e simple aventurière<else>simple aventurier</if>. Vous n'avez aucune chance d'appréhender les mystères complexes du fonc<shy>tion<shy>ne<shy>ment des pierres d'âme. Vous devez me les confier<nbsp>! À moi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You have brought me something, have you not?
#. column 60: The... The light... It burns so brightly, yet emits no heat. What sort of fell magicks am I witnessing here...? Oh, my apologies. Yes, very good. This specimen will do just fine, but I would not turn away a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who brought me more.
msgctxt "FateEvent:69:0:62"
msgid "But why!? You are a mere adventurer. You cannot expect to fathom the complex mysteries of the soulstones' inner workings! You must entrust them to me! To me!"
msgstr "Но почему?! Вы всего лишь приключенец. Вам не постичь сложных тайн устройства камней душ! Отдайте их мне! Мне!"

#. ja: 助けてください、食べ物が必要なんです。<br>このままじゃ、働き通しのお母さんが倒れちゃう……！
#. de: Bitte, bitte, du musst uns unbedingt helfen. Meine Mami braucht ganz dringend was zu essen, sonst fällt sie bei der vielen, schweren Arbeit noch um!
#. fr: Je vous en prie. Mon petit frère a très faim, mais ma mère s'est surmenée au travail et est trop faible pour nous nourrir... alors, si vous aviez un petit quelque chose pour lui...
#. column 57: Even the leaves of a cactus would suffice...
#. column 58: Help the poor girl?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: May the Twelve bless you!
#. column 62: \<sob> Back to the pub again, then...
#. macro: <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:70:0:56"
msgid "Please, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>. My baby brother is hungry, but my mother is too weak to feed him. My father left before I reached my third nameday, and my grandfather died last week in Copperbell Mines. My sister moved away to a rich merchant's house and no longer visits us, and my older brother lies all day in the corner with his somnus pipe... If you could spare some food..."
msgstr "Прошу вас, <if $gn4>госпожа<else>сударь</if>. Младший брат голодает, а мама так ослабла от работы, что не может его накормить. Отец ушёл, когда мне не было и трёх лет, а дедушка на прошлой неделе умер в шахтах Коппербелла. Сестра перебралась в дом богатого торговца и больше нас не навещает, а старший брат целыми днями лежит в углу со своей трубкой сомнуса... Не найдётся ли у вас немного еды?.."

#. ja: 贅沢なんていいません。サボテンの果肉でいいから、<br>おなかいっぱい食べさせてあげたいの……！
#. de: Wir haben auch gar keine hohen Ansprüche. Ein paar Kaktusblätter, aus denen wir Salat machen können, würden uns schon genügen. Wenn man getrocknete Mistfliegen dazugibt, ist es sogar fast, als würde man Brotkrumen dazu essen! Brotkrumen!
#. fr: Même des morceaux de cactuar suffiraient...
#. column 56: Please, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>. My baby brother is hungry, but my mother is too weak to feed him. My father left before I reached my third nameday, and my grandfather died last week in Copperbell Mines. My sister moved away to a rich merchant's house and no longer visits us, and my older brother lies all day in the corner with his somnus pipe... If you could spare some food...
#. column 58: Help the poor girl?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: May the Twelve bless you!
#. column 62: \<sob> Back to the pub again, then...
msgctxt "FateEvent:70:0:57"
msgid "Even the leaves of a cactus would suffice..."
msgstr "Даже кактусовые листья сгодятся..."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Mädchen helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la pauvre fille<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Please, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>. My baby brother is hungry, but my mother is too weak to feed him. My father left before I reached my third nameday, and my grandfather died last week in Copperbell Mines. My sister moved away to a rich merchant's house and no longer visits us, and my older brother lies all day in the corner with his somnus pipe... If you could spare some food...
