msgid "Help the poor girl?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь бедной девочке?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: よかった……！<br>サボテンの針、痛いから注意してくださいね。
#. de: Danke! Und pass auf, dass du dich nicht an den Nadeln pikst!
#. fr: Que les Douze soient loués<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Please, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>. My baby brother is hungry, but my mother is too weak to feed him. My father left before I reached my third nameday, and my grandfather died last week in Copperbell Mines. My sister moved away to a rich merchant's house and no longer visits us, and my older brother lies all day in the corner with his somnus pipe... If you could spare some food...
#. column 57: Even the leaves of a cactus would suffice...
#. column 58: Help the poor girl?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sob> Back to the pub again, then...
msgctxt "FateEvent:70:0:60"
msgid "May the Twelve bless you!"
msgstr "Пусть Двенадцать благословят вас!"

#. ja: 駄目なんだ……。<br>やっぱり、私がもっと……頑張らないと……。
#. de: W-Wirklich nicht ...? Aber meine Mami ...
#. fr: Il va falloir que je commence à travailler à mon âge, dans ce cas...
#. column 56: Please, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>. My baby brother is hungry, but my mother is too weak to feed him. My father left before I reached my third nameday, and my grandfather died last week in Copperbell Mines. My sister moved away to a rich merchant's house and no longer visits us, and my older brother lies all day in the corner with his somnus pipe... If you could spare some food...
#. column 57: Even the leaves of a cactus would suffice...
#. column 58: Help the poor girl?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: May the Twelve bless you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:70:0:62"
msgid "\\<sob> Back to the pub again, then..."
msgstr "<i>Всхлип...</i> Опять в кабак, значит..."

#. ja: サボテンの果肉がほしいんです。<br>お母さんに、おなかいっぱい食べてもらいたいの！
#. de: Ich brauche ganz viele Katusblätter, damit meine Mami sich endlich mal wieder richtig satt essen kann!
#. fr: Je vous en prie, apportez-moi des morceaux de cactuar<nbsp>! C'est pour nourrir mon petit frère<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:71:0:56"
msgid "Please! My baby brother will starve without something to eat! Anything will do. Even the leaves of a cactus!"
msgstr "Пожалуйста! Мой младший братишка умрёт с голоду, если ему нечего будет есть! Подойдёт что угодно. Даже листья кактуса!"

#. ja: あっ、サボテンの果肉！<br>お願いします、わたしにわけてください……！
#. de: Oh, der Geruch frisch gepflückter Kaktusblätter! Bitte, bitte, kannst du mir welche geben?
#. fr: Avez-vous trouvé des morceaux de cactuar<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Thank you! But please, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>. Can I have some more?
#. column 62: But my baby brother!
msgctxt "FateEvent:72:0:56"
msgid "Did you find any leaves?"
msgstr "Нашли листья?"

#. ja: ありがとう！<br>もう少し量があるといいんですけど……。
#. de: Danke! Meinst du, du kannst noch etwas mehr davon pflücken?
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Mais, je vous en prie, apportez-m'en plus si vous pouvez<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Did you find any leaves?
#. column 62: But my baby brother!
#. macro: <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:72:0:60"
msgid "Thank you! But please, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>. Can I have some more?"
msgstr "Спасибо! Но, пожалуйста, <if $gn4>госпожа<else>господин</if>... Можно ещё немного?"

#. ja: そうですよね、赤の他人にわけるなんて……。
#. de: Warum solltest du auch? Wir kennen uns ja gar nicht ...
#. fr: Mon pauvre petit frère... il va mourir... (snif)...
#. column 56: Did you find any leaves?
#. column 60: Thank you! But please, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>. Can I have some more?
msgctxt "FateEvent:72:0:62"
msgid "But my baby brother!"
msgstr "Но ведь мой братишка!"

#. ja: はぁ～い、そこのア・ナ・タ♪<br>アタシ、常夏の踊り娘イ・ミレワ。<br>ミレワのお願い、聞いてほしいなっ。
#. de: Hallo <if $gn4>Süße<else>Süßer</if> ♪ Bist du die Eskorte, von der Meister Gegeruju gesprochen hat? Ich bin eine Tänzerin, und zwar die grazilste jenseits des Schwerblütigen Meeres! Meine Darbietungen bescheren jeder und jedem 'nen zweiten Frühling, wenn du verstehst, was ich meine.
#. fr: Vous, là<nbsp>! Serrriez-vous l'escorte que le seigneur Gegeruju m'a promise<nbsp>?
#. column 57: My...ah, client awaits me at Hidden Falls and I grow weary in this heat.
#. column 58: I also believe there might be someone following me─a common enough nuisance for one in my...ah, line of work.
#. column 59: Escort the lady?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You're <i>not</i> the escort? Then you're lucky I don't charge you for the time we've spent here chatting.
msgctxt "FateEvent:73:0:56"
msgid "You there. Might you be the escort Master Gegeruju promised?"
msgstr "Эй, ты! Не ты ли сопровождение, которое обещал хозяин Гегеруджу?"

#. ja: ミレワ、今から隠れ滝に行って<br>お金持ちのオジサマに特別な舞を<br>お届けしなくちゃなんだけど……
#. de: Heute hat mich so ein alter Knacker zum Verborgenen Wasserfall bestellt, wo ich ihm meinen <i>Frühlingstanz</i> vorführen soll. Na ja, solange die Kohle stimmt.
#. fr: Mon... euh, client m'attend à la Chute cachée et je perrrds patience avec cette chaleur accablante.
#. column 56: You there. Might you be the escort Master Gegeruju promised?
#. column 58: I also believe there might be someone following me─a common enough nuisance for one in my...ah, line of work.
#. column 59: Escort the lady?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You're <i>not</i> the escort? Then you're lucky I don't charge you for the time we've spent here chatting.
msgctxt "FateEvent:73:0:57"
msgid "My...ah, client awaits me at Hidden Falls and I grow weary in this heat."
msgstr "Мой... э-э... клиент ждёт меня у Скрытого водопада. В такую жару я уже совсем измучилась."

#. ja: ひとりぼっちの出勤じゃ、ちょっぴり心細いから<br>オジサマのところまで、<br>ミレワにつきあってほしい～なっ。
#. de: In meiner <i>Arbeitskleidung</i> errege ich allerdings leider immer eine Menge Aufsehen. Was meinst du, Schätzchen? Lust auf 'nen Strandspaziergang mit mir zum Wasserfall?
#. fr: Je crrrains aussi que quelqu'un me suive, ce qui est plutôt gênant dans... mon domaine d'expertise.
#. column 56: You there. Might you be the escort Master Gegeruju promised?
#. column 57: My...ah, client awaits me at Hidden Falls and I grow weary in this heat.
#. column 59: Escort the lady?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You're <i>not</i> the escort? Then you're lucky I don't charge you for the time we've spent here chatting.
msgctxt "FateEvent:73:0:58"
msgid "I also believe there might be someone following me─a common enough nuisance for one in my...ah, line of work."
msgstr "Кажется, за мной кто-то следит. Для моей... э-э... работы это обычное дело, но всё равно неприятно."

#. ja: つきあってあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Kurtisane begleiten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter la dame<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You there. Might you be the escort Master Gegeruju promised?
#. column 57: My...ah, client awaits me at Hidden Falls and I grow weary in this heat.
#. column 58: I also believe there might be someone following me─a common enough nuisance for one in my...ah, line of work.
#. column 62: You're <i>not</i> the escort? Then you're lucky I don't charge you for the time we've spent here chatting.
