#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:88:0:59"
msgid "Escort the courier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить посыльного?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうですか……。<br>私ひとりで行くしかないんでしょうか……。
#. de: Na, dann steht mir wohl ein ordentlicher Spießrutenlauf bevor ...
#. fr: Bon, je suppose qu'une piqûre de taon n'est rien comparée à la punition qui m'attend si l'hydromel n'arrive pas à temps...
#. column 56: Oh, what ever can I do!? This mead must be delivered to the Sanctum of the Twelve before the rite, or the monsignor will have my ar─ Ah, my head. He'll have my head!
#. column 57: But with all these gnats circling about, attracted to the sweet smell of the honey, I'll never make it to the sanctuary in one piece!
#. column 58: Would it be too much trouble to ask you to escort me? I could pay you with part of what the monsignor gave me.
#. column 59: Escort the courier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:88:0:62"
msgid "Well, I suppose the sting of a gnat is less excruciating than the punishment waiting me if this mead does not arrive on time..."
msgstr "Что ж, укус овода, пожалуй, не так мучителен, как наказание, которое меня ждёт, если мёд не доставят вовремя..."

#. ja: 海賊暮らしを捨てられなかった連中は、<br>皆、去っていった……。<br>残っているのは、ここで生きる覚悟を決めた者だ。
#. de: Nicht alle konnten sich mit dem Leben an Land anfreunden. Einige unserer Kameraden haben ihr Glück bei anderen Mannschaften versucht. Wozu mehr Mut gehört, kann ich dir nicht sagen ...
#. fr: Nous n'avons forcé personne. Tous ceux qui étaient incapables de résister à l'appel du large sont partis il y a bien longtemps et je ne leur souhaite que du bonheur.
msgctxt "FateEvent:89:0:56"
msgid "We dinnae force this life upon a single man. Those what could not resist the call o' the Deep left us lubbers long ago, and I wish 'em naught but the best."
msgstr "Никого мы не заставляли жить по-нашему. Те, кто не смог противиться зову морских глубин, давно ушли, и я желаю им всего наилучшего."

#. ja: 山での暮らしは正直苦しいが、<br>海賊を続けてお尋ね者として生きるよりは、<br>マシなのかもしれないね。
#. de: Nichts gibt dir so ein Gefühl von Freiheit wie ein Schiff mit frischem Wind in den Segeln. Aber das ruhige Leben hier in den Bergen hat auch was. Als Gesetzlose auf Seewaren wir nämlich ständig auf der Flucht.
#. fr: Vivre sur la terre ferme n'est pas une partie de plaisir, mais pour être honnête, ça vaut mieux que d'être un pirate par les temps qui courent.
msgctxt "FateEvent:90:0:56"
msgid "If the Admiral wants to believe that we Salthounds've righted the rudder and straightened the ship by reclaimin' the mill, let the fool."
msgstr "Хочет адмирал верить, будто мы, Морские псы, исправились и встали на путь истинный, отвоёвывая мельницу, — пусть. Дурак он и есть дурак."

#. ja: 金もねぇ、資材もねぇ……<br>キキルン族の店でも略奪するか……。
#. de: Wir haben weder Geld noch Materialien, um diese marode Mühle wieder auf Vordermann zu bringen. Vielleicht sollten wir 'n paar Qiqirn-Händler ausrauben, harhar.
#. fr: Pas d'argent, pas de butin. Juste un vieux moulin pourri et quelques limaces à me mettre sous la dent.
#. column 57: Might be as I should raid me that rat-run tradin' post on yonder.
msgctxt "FateEvent:91:0:56"
msgid "No coin, no loot. Just a rottin' mill and slugs to break me fast on."
msgstr "Ни монеты, ни добычи. Только гнилая мельница да слизни на завтрак."

#. ja: おっと、いけねぇ。<br>昔のクセが出ちまったよ。
#. de: Oh, 'tschuldigung. Macht der Gewohnheit ...
#. fr: Je devrais peut-être attaquer le repaire des Qiqirns, là-bas... Oups, j'ai rien dit<nbsp>!
#. column 56: No coin, no loot. Just a rottin' mill and slugs to break me fast on.
msgctxt "FateEvent:91:0:57"
msgid "Might be as I should raid me that rat-run tradin' post on yonder."
msgstr "Может, стоило бы ограбить вон тот торговый пост крыс..."

#. ja: うむ。<br>まずはこのボロボロの建物をなんとかせねば。
#. de: Will mal schauen, ob ich diesen Schuppen hier nicht wieder schüssig bekommen. Kann eigentlich nicht schwieriger sein, als 'n Beiboot zu flicken.
#. fr: Le cap'taine dit qu'on aura pas d'rhum tant qu'le moulin marchera pas cor<shy>rec<shy>te<shy>ment. Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment que je cache une bouteille près des chutes.
msgctxt "FateEvent:92:0:56"
msgid "The cap'n says no rum till the mill's runnin' proper, like. Good thing I still keeps me that bottle 'idden by the falls."
msgstr "Капитан сказал: никакого рома, пока мельница как следует не заработает. Хорошо ещё, что у меня припрятана бутылка у водопада."

#. ja: 終わんねぇよ！<br>どっから手ぇ付けりゃいいんだ！？
#. de: Hier sind doch Hopfen und Malz verloren! Man weiß gar nicht, wo man anfangen soll!
#. fr: Que le cap'taine aille pourrir dans les sept enfers<nbsp>! Ce maudit moulin est en trrrop mauvais état. Il faudrait l'détruire et construire un nouveau bateau avec.
msgctxt "FateEvent:93:0:56"
msgid "Damn the cap'n all the way to the Seventh Gate and back! This bloody mill is beyond mendin'. It should be torn down and used to build another ship!"
msgstr "Чтоб капитану провалиться в Седьмые врата и обратно! Эту проклятую мельницу уже не починить. Снести бы её да построить из брёвен корабль!"

#. ja: ウチら海賊団「猟犬同盟」は、<br>5年前の霊災でバラバラになった……<br>残った連中を集めて、ここに移住してきたのさ。
#. de: Uns Meeresköter hat es bei der Katastrophe vor fünf Jahren zerschlagen. Einige gingen mit unserem Schiff unter, andere wurden was weiß ich wohin gespült. Der Rest von uns hat sich berappelt und ist hier zur Witwenmühle gekommen, um ganz von vorne anzufangen. Nach all den Jahren auf See kein leichtes Unterfangen, das will ich dir sagen.
#. fr: Nous, les Dogues de mer, avons perdu notre navire et la moitié d'l'équipage quand l'ciel nous est tombé sur la tête, y a cinq ans. Sans l'cap'taine, on s'rait sûrement des mousses sur d'autres bateaux.
msgctxt "FateEvent:94:0:56"
msgid "We Salthounds lost our ship and 'alf the bloody crew when the sky fell five summers past. If it weren't fer the cap'n, I suppose most of us'd still be reavin', but as scrags with other crews."
msgstr "Мы, Солёные псы, потеряли корабль и половину проклятой команды, когда пять лет назад небо рухнуло на землю. Если бы не капитан, большинство из нас до сих пор скиталось бы по морям — жалкими оборванцами на чужих кораблях."

#. ja: 村のハズレにいるララフェル族を見たかい？
#. de: Hast du die Lalafell da am Waldrand gesehen? Das ist unser Käpten, jawohl. War ihr Befehl, dass wir die Mühle hier aufbauen sollen.
#. fr: Tu vois la Lalafelle assise là-bas<nbsp>? C'est notre fidèle cap'taine. C'est elle qui voulait qu'on r'mette c'moulin en état.
#. column 57: Why a mill? I's learned in me years as a pirate there be one thing ye ne'er do, and that be question the cap'n.
msgctxt "FateEvent:95:0:56"
msgid "Ye see the Lala off sittin' by 'er lonesome? That be our trusty cap'n. 'Twas 'er notion we should see this mill up an' runnin'."
msgstr "Видишь вон ту лалочку, сидит себе одна? То наш верный капитан. Это она задумала привести мельницу в порядок."

#. ja: あんなナリだが、腕の立つ海賊でね。<br>船上での白兵戦にかけちゃ、かなりのもんさ。<br>今じゃ魔物や蛮族相手に、その腕を振っているがね。
#. de: Warum eine Mühle? Hör zu, wenn ich in all den Jahren eins gelernt hab, dann das: Stell nie den Käpten in Frage.
#. fr: Pourquoi un moulin<nbsp>? Si j'ai appris quelque chose au cours d'mes années comme pirate, c'est qu'il faut jamais mettre en doute l'cap'taine.
#. column 56: Ye see the Lala off sittin' by 'er lonesome? That be our trusty cap'n. 'Twas 'er notion we should see this mill up an' runnin'.
msgctxt "FateEvent:95:0:57"
msgid "Why a mill? I's learned in me years as a pirate there be one thing ye ne'er do, and that be question the cap'n."
msgstr "Почему мельница? За годы пиратской жизни я усвоил одно: капитана лучше не спрашивать."

#. ja: この集落が、なんで「プアメイドミル」……<br>つまり「貧乏女の製材所」だなんて、<br>不吉な名で呼ばれてるのか解るか？
#. de: Weißte, warum se diesen Ort Witwenmühle nennen? Na?
#. fr: J'ai connu pas mal de femmes dans ma jeunesse, c'est pour cela que j'ai accepté de suivre le cap'taine dans ce trou perdu.
#. column 57: But lo, do ye sees yerself a single blushin' beauty amongst these 'ere roots an' vines? I's been cozened, I 'as.
msgctxt "FateEvent:96:0:56"
msgid "I's 'ad me my share o' maids back durin' me reavin' days, which is why I agreed to follow the cap'n up 'ere to this forsaken piss pit."
msgstr "В молодости у меня хватало девиц — вот я и согласился последовать за капитаном в эту богом забытую дыру."

#. ja: 魔物や蛮族が跋扈するここらで<br>働く木こりたちは、すぐに行方知れずになる。<br>そして残るは、貧乏な未亡人だけってことよ。
#. de: Dat is, weil die armen Holzfällers hier imma reihenweise von de Monster dahingerafft wurden. Und zurück blieben bloß die Witwen. Tja, dumm gelaufen, wa?
#. fr: Mais tu vois une beauté parmi ces racines et ces lianes<nbsp>? Je me suis fait avoir...
#. column 56: I's 'ad me my share o' maids back durin' me reavin' days, which is why I agreed to follow the cap'n up 'ere to this forsaken piss pit.
msgctxt "FateEvent:96:0:57"
msgid "But lo, do ye sees yerself a single blushin' beauty amongst these 'ere roots an' vines? I's been cozened, I 'as."
msgstr "Но погляди-ка: видишь тут хоть одну красотку среди корней да лиан? Меня провели, вот что."

#. ja: ここは元々、木こりたちの集落だったんだが、<br>第七霊災の時に、住人が逃げちまってね。<br>その廃村を提督から頂戴したってわけよ。
#. de: Hier an der Mühle haben früher Holzfäller gelebt, aber die haben nach der Geschichte mit Dalamud schlagartig das Weite gesucht. Der Admiral war so nett, uns die verlassene Siedlung als neue Bleibe zu überlassen.
#. fr: Nous n'avons pas versé une seule goutte de sang en prenant le contrôle du moulin. Quand nous sommes arrivés, il était déjà abandonné depuis belle lurette. Enfin, tout aurait été différent si ça n'avait pas été le cas.
msgctxt "FateEvent:97:0:56"
msgid "Not a single drop o' blood was shed in the takin' o' the mill. By the time we'd arrived, the place 'ad already been long abandoned. Though, if it 'adn't, I reckon the tale might've been different."
msgstr "Ни капли крови не пролили, когда захватили мельницу. К нашему приходу это место уже давно опустело. А вот если бы нет — история, думаю, вышла бы совсем другая."

#. ja: 昔の海賊暮らしを懐かしむ奴もいるが、<br>誰もがやりたくて、やってたわけでもないんだ。<br>誘拐されて、仕方なくやってた奴も多いのさ。
#. de: Ein paar von uns trauern den guten alten Zeiten nach, aber nicht jeder landete aus freiem Willen bei den Piraten. Manchen ließ das Schicksal keine andere Wahl, und manchen der vorgehaltene Degen nicht.
#. fr: Certains de ces hommes se délectent de leurs exploits sur les cinq mers. Moi<nbsp>? J'ai horreur du grand large. Une femme comme moi arrive à peine à dormir avec les craquements et le roulis.
msgctxt "FateEvent:98:0:56"
msgid "Some o' these men still revel in the tales o' their exploits on the five seas. Me? I loathed the Deep. A woman as me could get nary a night's rest, what with the constant croakin' an' rockin'."
msgstr "Некоторые до сих пор любят вспоминать свои подвиги в пяти морях. А я? Ненавидела морскую пучину. Такой женщине, как я, было не уснуть под вечный скрип и качку."

#. ja: クソだと思っていた海賊暮らしも、<br>今となれば、懐かしい……。<br>これが歳を重ねるってことなのかね？
#. de: Als Pirat hab ich mein Leben oft verflucht, aber jetzt sehn ich mich auf die hohe See zurück. Aus der Ferne betrachtet sieht eben alles viel rosiger aus ...
#. fr: Une fois, j'ai tranché la gorge du roi d'une île, j'ai enlevé ses filles et brûlé son village. Avec le butin gagné ce jour, j'ai pu boire du rhum pendant un mois. Et me voilà à valser dans les buissons. Alors, si tu crois que j'm'amuse, t'es encore plus bigleux qu'une taupe.
msgctxt "FateEvent:99:0:56"
msgid "I once slit the throat of an island king, took 'is daughters, and burned 'is village. The loot I plundered that day saw me belly filled with rum for a moon. And now, 'ere I am, dancin' in the shrubs. So, if ye thinks I look 'appy, yer blinder than a one-eyed crone."
msgstr "Однажды я перерезал горло островному королю, похитил его дочерей и сжёг его деревню. На добычу с того дня я целый месяц пил ром. А теперь вот танцую среди кустов. Так что если тебе кажется, будто я счастлив, ты слепее одноглазой старухи."

#. ja: ウチらは霊災で船を失って、ここへ流れ着いた。<br>ここにはウチらしかいないから、陸の上とはいえ、<br>船の上と変わらず自由に生きられる。
#. de: Wir haben während der Siebten Katastrophe unser Schiff verloren und sind hier gestrandet. Ist schon was anderes, über moosbedeckte Böden zu wandern als über die Planken an Deck, aber da wir dieses Fleckchen Erde zumindest für uns alleine haben, ist uns wenigstens die Freiheit geblieben.
#. fr: L'équipage est là depuis trois ans, mais y a pas de quoi être fiers. Chaque fois que nous avançons, de nouvelles créatures sortent de nulle part pour nous donner une bonne raclée.
msgctxt "FateEvent:100:0:56"
msgid "The crew's been 'ere nigh on three summers, but we've little to show for it. Every time we make e'en an ilm of 'eadway, some new creature crawls from the forest to come kick our arses back down."
msgstr "Команда здесь уже почти три года, а похвастаться нам нечем. Чуть продвинемся хоть на йоту — из леса выползает какая-нибудь тварь и снова нас откатывает назад."

#. ja: 頻繁に魔物や蛮族が襲ってくるが、<br>せっかく手に入れた住処だ。<br>そう簡単に、手放すつもりはないね。
#. de: Überfälle von Monsterhorden und Stoßtrupps der Wilden Stämme sind hier an der Tagesordung, aber beim Klabautermann, so einfach lassen wir uns unser neues Zuhause nicht nehmen!
#. fr: Le cap'taine nous dit qu'notre jour viendra. J'ai rien d'mieux à faire de toute manière.
msgctxt "FateEvent:101:0:56"
msgid "The cap'n keeps tellin' us our day, she'll come. I's naught better to do with me time, so wait, I shall."
msgstr "Капитан всё твердит, что наш день ещё настанет. А мне больше заняться нечем, так что буду ждать."

#. ja: 5年前、小汚い海賊だった俺らが、<br>今じゃ、小汚い木こりだ。<br>変わったような、変わってないような……。
#. de: Vor fünf Jahren war'n wir dreckige Piraten, jetzt sind wir dreckige Holzfäller ... Hat sich nicht viel geändert, was?
#. fr: Trancher la gorge de quelqu'un, rien de plus facile, mais s'approcher suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment pour ça, c'est autre chose. S'approcher d'un arbre est facile, c'est la partie découpe qui est plus dure.
msgctxt "FateEvent:102:0:56"
msgid "Cuttin' a throat is easy─it's the gettin' to it that be 'ard. Gettin' to a tree is easy. Now, the cuttin'..."
msgstr "Горло перерезать — проще простого. Сложно подобраться. К дереву подобраться легко. А вот рубить..."

#. ja: ここプアメイドミルは、うちら「猟犬同盟」のシマだ。<br>用がねぇなら、さっさと消えな。
#. de: Die Witwenmühle ist Meeresköter-Revier, ist das klar? Also lungre hier nicht einfach grundlos rum.
#. fr: T'es sur les terres des Dogues de mer, là<nbsp>! Disparrrais avant que j'te découpe en rondelles<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:103:0:56"
msgid "This 'ere be Salt'ound land. Scurry off afore we cut off yer limbs and use 'em to prop up our feet, like."
msgstr "Здесь земли Морских псов. Убирайся, пока мы не отрубили тебе конечности и не подложили их себе под ноги."

#. ja: ……うふふ。<br>魔物でも蛮族でもいいから、<br>はやく襲ってこないかしら……。
#. de: Mann, ist das öde hier. Die Enterei auf See, da war immer was los. Können hier nicht bald mal 'n paar Monster oder Kobolde auftauchen?
#. fr: J'imagine que tu te d'mandes pourquoi mes loups d'mer sont ici.
#. column 57: Well, keep wonderin', 'cause I ain't tellin' no meddlin' 'venturer.
msgctxt "FateEvent:104:0:56"
msgid "I suppose yer wonderin' why I brought me 'ounds 'ere."
msgstr "Наверное, ты гадаешь, зачем я привела сюда своих псов."

#. ja: 野良仕事なんて、もうたくさん。<br>はぁ、一暴れしたいわ……。
#. de: Ich kann das dreckige Holz hier nämlich nicht mehr sehen. 'n paar aufblitzenden Klingen brächten mich sicher auf andere Gedanken.
#. fr: Eh bien, continue de réfléchir parce que j'suis pas près de t'le dire.
#. column 56: I suppose yer wonderin' why I brought me 'ounds 'ere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:104:0:57"
msgid "Well, keep wonderin', 'cause I ain't tellin' no meddlin' 'venturer."
msgstr "Так и продолжай гадать, любопытный <if $gn4>авантюристка<else>авантюрист</if>. Я тебе не скажу."

#. ja: 常夏の踊り娘……<br>その舞は、香しい花びらが風に漂うように<br>わが身をめくるめく歓喜の渦へ誘う……
#. de: Frühling ...! Wenn duftende Blüten vom Wind getragen mich hinfortreißen in einen Strudel aus Wonne! Das ist Frühling!
#. fr: Pourquoi le seigneur Gegeruju doit-il toujours me faire attendre<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:105:0:56"
msgid "Why does Master Gegeruju insist on making me wait?"
msgstr "С чего хозяин Гегеруджу заставляет меня ждать?"

#. ja: おおお、ミレワちゃん……<br>来たれば、ワシのすべてを捧げよう……！！
#. de: Mein lieblicher Frühling, du bist mein ein und alles! Die ganze Welt will ich dir zu Füßen legen!
#. fr: Ce que nous appelons rose embaumerait peut-être autant sous un autre nom... mais ça ne me coûterait pas aussi cher.
msgctxt "FateEvent:106:0:56"
msgid "Perhaps a rose by any other name would smell just as sweet, but then again, it would not cost me as much coin."
msgstr "Может, под другим именем роза пахла бы так же сладко, но стоила бы куда дешевле."

#. ja: ただいま、ゴブリン族たちより<br>「海賊の略奪品」を押収する作戦中であります。<br>危ないので離れているほうがよいのであります！
#. de: Wir stecken hier gerade in einer höchst brisanten Operation. Die Goblins hehlen mit Piratenbeute, die wir sicherstellen. Komm uns also nicht in die Quere.
#. fr: Depuis que l'Amirale et la douane de Mealvaan ont mis en place des règles strictes concernant l'importation des mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses, des pirates se sont mis à utiliser des Gobelins pour faire passer leur contrebande en toute impunité.
#. column 57: One such pack of goblins has been discovered here in Skull Valley, and my men and I have been ordered to confiscate the goods and slay all those who fail to cooperate.
#. column 58: We could use the help of a skilled adventurer such as yourself. And do not worry. You <i>will</i> be rewarded for your efforts. Your safety, on the other hand, I cannot guarantee. But such is any job, no?
msgctxt "FateEvent:107:0:56"
msgid "Since the Admiral and Mealvaan's Gate began implementing stricter import laws, clever pirates have taken to using goblins to distribute their contraband to the people of La Noscea, so that they may escape the hand of justice."
msgstr "С тех пор как адмирал и таможня Меалваановых врат ужесточили правила ввоза товаров, хитроумные пираты стали использовать гоблинов, чтобы сбывать контрабанду жителям Ла-Носкии и уходить от правосудия."

#. ja: もし手伝ってくださるのなら、<br>「海賊の略奪品」を自分のところまで<br>お持ちいただきたいのであります。
#. de: Falls du uns helfen möchtest, schnapp dir ein paar der Beutekisten und bringe sie zu mir.
#. fr: Un de ces groupes de Gobelins a été découvert dans la vallée du Crâne, et mes hommes et moi avons reçu pour ordre de confisquer leur camelote et de tuer tous ceux qui refuseront de coopérer.
#. column 56: Since the Admiral and Mealvaan's Gate began implementing stricter import laws, clever pirates have taken to using goblins to distribute their contraband to the people of La Noscea, so that they may escape the hand of justice.
#. column 58: We could use the help of a skilled adventurer such as yourself. And do not worry. You <i>will</i> be rewarded for your efforts. Your safety, on the other hand, I cannot guarantee. But such is any job, no?
msgctxt "FateEvent:107:0:57"
msgid "One such pack of goblins has been discovered here in Skull Valley, and my men and I have been ordered to confiscate the goods and slay all those who fail to cooperate."
msgstr "Здесь, в долине Черепа, обнаружили одну такую шайку гоблинов. Мне и моим людям приказано изъять товары и перебить всех, кто откажется сотрудничать."

#. ja: 「海賊の略奪品」はキャンプ内に落ちていたり、<br>ゴブリン族をやっつければ手に入るはずであります！
#. de: Die Kisten sollten im Lager der Goblins rumliegen. Vermutlich tragen einige der Halunken auch welche bei sich.
#. fr: Nous avons besoin d'un<if $gn4>e aventurière<else> aventurier</if>. Ne vous inquiétez pas, vous toucherez une récompense. Je ne peux cependant pas garantir votre sécurité. Mais c'est toujours comme ça, pas vrai<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Since the Admiral and Mealvaan's Gate began implementing stricter import laws, clever pirates have taken to using goblins to distribute their contraband to the people of La Noscea, so that they may escape the hand of justice.
#. column 57: One such pack of goblins has been discovered here in Skull Valley, and my men and I have been ordered to confiscate the goods and slay all those who fail to cooperate.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:107:0:58"
msgid "We could use the help of a skilled adventurer such as yourself. And do not worry. You <i>will</i> be rewarded for your efforts. Your safety, on the other hand, I cannot guarantee. But such is any job, no?"
msgstr "Нам пригодилась бы помощь такого умелого авантюриста, как ты. Не волнуйся, за труды ты <i>точно</i> получишь награду. А вот за твою безопасность ручаться не могу. Такая уж работа, верно?"

#. ja: しーっ！<br>お静かに、現在隠密行動中であります。<br>ゴブリン族に気付かれるわけにはいきません。
#. de: Psst, jetzt trample hier doch nicht so rum! Du lässt ja noch unsere ganze Geheimoperation auffliegen! Die Goblins dürfen auf keinen Fall Wind von unseren Plänen bekommen.
#. fr: Silence<nbsp>! Vous risquez de mettre en péril notre mission<nbsp>! Nous devons à tout prix confisquer les mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses de contrebande que transportent ces Gobelins<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you wish to join.
#. column 58: In that case, you are free to infiltrate the goblin camp and retrieve as many crates as you can lift. The ones being carried by the goblins themselves may require a tad more...coercing.
#. column 59: Join the operation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have our thanks, adventurer. Bring any crates collected back to me, and I will see they are delivered back to the custom house.
#. column 62: In that case, I must ask that you leave this place at once.
msgctxt "FateEvent:108:0:56"
msgid "Silence! I would not have you disturb our mission to confiscate the contraband being hoarded by that band of goblins..."
msgstr "Тише! Не мешайте нашей операции по изъятию контрабанды, которую прячет шайка гоблинов..."

#. ja: 実は、この先のキャンプで<br>ゴブリン族が「海賊の略奪品」を<br>売買しているという情報がありまして……。
#. de: Wir nehmen sie nämlich hoch, und diesmal so richtig! Weißt du, die Gauner sollen hier mit Piratenbeute hehlen, haben unsere Informanten berichtet.
#. fr: Enfin, vous pouvez nous aider si vous le désirez.
#. column 56: Silence! I would not have you disturb our mission to confiscate the contraband being hoarded by that band of goblins...
#. column 58: In that case, you are free to infiltrate the goblin camp and retrieve as many crates as you can lift. The ones being carried by the goblins themselves may require a tad more...coercing.
#. column 59: Join the operation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have our thanks, adventurer. Bring any crates collected back to me, and I will see they are delivered back to the custom house.
#. column 62: In that case, I must ask that you leave this place at once.
msgctxt "FateEvent:108:0:57"
msgid "Unless, that is, you wish to join."
msgstr "Разве что ты сам хочешь присоединиться."

#. ja: 「海賊の略奪品」を押収する作戦を<br>準備しているところなのであります。
#. de: Unser Plan ist, die Beutekisten sicherzustellen und die Goblins dingfest zu machen!
#. fr: Si c'est le cas, infiltrez-vous dans le camp des Gobelins et récupérez autant de caisses que vous le pourrez. Si vous en croisez portant des caisses, essayez de les persuader de vous les remettre...
#. column 56: Silence! I would not have you disturb our mission to confiscate the contraband being hoarded by that band of goblins...
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you wish to join.
#. column 59: Join the operation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have our thanks, adventurer. Bring any crates collected back to me, and I will see they are delivered back to the custom house.
#. column 62: In that case, I must ask that you leave this place at once.
msgctxt "FateEvent:108:0:58"
msgid "In that case, you are free to infiltrate the goblin camp and retrieve as many crates as you can lift. The ones being carried by the goblins themselves may require a tad more...coercing."
msgstr "Тогда можешь пробраться в лагерь гоблинов и унести сколько сможешь ящиков. А у гоблинов, которые носят их с собой, ящики придётся... отбирать силой."

#. ja: 手伝いを申し出ますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Gelbjacken helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Participer à l'opération<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Silence! I would not have you disturb our mission to confiscate the contraband being hoarded by that band of goblins...
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you wish to join.
#. column 58: In that case, you are free to infiltrate the goblin camp and retrieve as many crates as you can lift. The ones being carried by the goblins themselves may require a tad more...coercing.
#. column 60: You have our thanks, adventurer. Bring any crates collected back to me, and I will see they are delivered back to the custom house.
#. column 62: In that case, I must ask that you leave this place at once.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:108:0:59"
msgid "Join the operation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Присоединиться к операции?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、それは助かるであります！<br>「海賊の略奪品」はキャンプ内に落ちていたり、<br>ゴブリン族をやっつければ手に入るはずであります！
#. de: Oh, du willst uns helfen? Das ist überaus freundlich von dir! Die Kisten sollten im Lager der Goblins rumliegen. Vermutlich tragen einige der Halunken auch welche bei sich.
#. fr: Je vous remercie. Rapportez-moi toutes les caisses que vous pourrez et je veillerai à ce qu'elles soient acheminées jusqu'à la douane.
#. column 56: Silence! I would not have you disturb our mission to confiscate the contraband being hoarded by that band of goblins...
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you wish to join.
#. column 58: In that case, you are free to infiltrate the goblin camp and retrieve as many crates as you can lift. The ones being carried by the goblins themselves may require a tad more...coercing.
#. column 59: Join the operation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: In that case, I must ask that you leave this place at once.
msgctxt "FateEvent:108:0:60"
msgid "You have our thanks, adventurer. Bring any crates collected back to me, and I will see they are delivered back to the custom house."
msgstr "Спасибо, авантюрист. Принеси мне все ящики, какие соберёшь, а я позабочусь, чтобы их доставили обратно на таможню."

#. ja: む、では作戦に巻き込まれないよう、<br>この付近から離れているほうがいいのであります。
#. de: Dann bring dich lieber in Sicherheit, gleich geht's hier nämlich rund.
#. fr: Dans ce cas, je vais vous demander de quitter ces lieux im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment.
#. column 56: Silence! I would not have you disturb our mission to confiscate the contraband being hoarded by that band of goblins...
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you wish to join.
#. column 58: In that case, you are free to infiltrate the goblin camp and retrieve as many crates as you can lift. The ones being carried by the goblins themselves may require a tad more...coercing.
#. column 59: Join the operation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have our thanks, adventurer. Bring any crates collected back to me, and I will see they are delivered back to the custom house.
msgctxt "FateEvent:108:0:62"
msgid "In that case, I must ask that you leave this place at once. "
msgstr "Тогда прошу тебя немедленно покинуть это место."

#. ja: 「海賊の略奪品」を持ってきてくださったのですか？
#. de: Bist du auf Beutegut gestoßen?
#. fr: Avez-vous pu subtiliser des caisses de contrebande<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Yes, these items are all prohibited under thalassocratic decree. The first assessor will be most pleased.
#. column 62: Then back into the fray with you! That contraband won't confiscate itself!
msgctxt "FateEvent:109:0:56"
msgid "Were you able to retrieve any crates?"
msgstr "Удалось добыть ящики?"

#. ja: おおっ、感謝であります！<br>他にも手に入れたら、自分までお願いするであります！
#. de: Ah, ausgezeichnet. Wenn du noch mehr davon in die Finger bekommst, weißt du ja, wo du mich findest.
#. fr: Oui, il s'agit bien de mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses interdites par décret de l'amirauté. Vous avez fait une belle prise, mon ami<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>! Dites-moi si vous en récupérez d'autres.
#. column 56: Were you able to retrieve any crates?
#. column 62: Then back into the fray with you! That contraband won't confiscate itself!
msgctxt "FateEvent:109:0:60"
msgid "Yes, these items are all prohibited under thalassocratic decree. The first assessor will be most pleased."
msgstr "Да, эти товары запрещены постановлением морской державы. Первый оценщик будет очень доволен."

#. ja: 「海賊の略奪品」はまだ押収できませんか？<br>キャンプ内に落ちているのを拾うか、<br>ゴブリン族から奪うのであります！
#. de: Was, noch nicht? Dann mach mal deine Augen auf! Das ganze Goblinlager sollte voll von dem Zeug sein. Notfalls musst du den Übeltätern halt in die Taschen gucken.
#. fr: Alors retournez-y<nbsp>! Ces mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses ne vont pas se confisquer toutes seules.
#. column 56: Were you able to retrieve any crates?
#. column 60: Yes, these items are all prohibited under thalassocratic decree. The first assessor will be most pleased.
msgctxt "FateEvent:109:0:62"
msgid "Then back into the fray with you! That contraband won't confiscate itself!"
msgstr "Ну же, возвращайся в бой! Контрабанда сама себя не конфискует!"

#. ja: ひとつ、お聞きしたい。<br>もしや、あなたは南防波壁へ向かうのですか？
#. de: Falls mir die Frage gestattet ist: Du bist nicht zufällig unterwegs zum Süddamm?
#. fr: J'ai une requête urgente, mais seulement si vous êtes en rrroute pour le barrage du sud.
#. column 57: I must deliver important orders from the Admiral herself to the Maelstrom commander stationed at South Tidegate, but the storm privates assigned to accompany me have yet to arrive. For all I know they could be lying drunk in a gutter somewhere. Or <i>dead</i> in a gutter somewhere.
#. column 58: You don't appear to be dead or drunk, so could I ask you to escort me through Quarterstone? I don't believe we will encounter much trouble, but I've been known to be wrong on countless occasions.
#. column 59: Escort the scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I see. Very well then.<br>Till sea swallows all.
msgctxt "FateEvent:110:0:56"
msgid "I have an urgent request, but only if you are bound for Tidegate."
msgstr "У меня срочная просьба. Но только если ты направляешься к Тайдгейту."

#. ja: 南防波壁に、至急届けなくてはならない<br>物資があるのですが、不審船が発見されたとかで、<br>兵が出払っており、護衛がいない状況なのです。
#. de: Dort muss dringend eine Nachschublieferung hingebracht werden, aber niemand ist da, der mir Geleitschutz geben kann. Alle Gelbjacken, die hier stationiert waren, sind aufgebrochen, um diese Sache mit dem unbekannten Schiff zu untersuchen.
#. fr: Je dois apporter des orrrdres de l'Amirale au commandant du Maelstrom stationné là-bas, mais les soldats qui devaient m'accompagner ne sont pas là. Je n'ai pas le temps de les attendre davantage.
#. column 56: I have an urgent request, but only if you are bound for Tidegate.
#. column 58: You don't appear to be dead or drunk, so could I ask you to escort me through Quarterstone? I don't believe we will encounter much trouble, but I've been known to be wrong on countless occasions.
#. column 59: Escort the scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I see. Very well then.<br>Till sea swallows all.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:110:0:57"
msgid "I must deliver important orders from the Admiral herself to the Maelstrom commander stationed at South Tidegate, but the storm privates assigned to accompany me have yet to arrive. For all I know they could be lying drunk in a gutter somewhere. Or <i>dead</i> in a gutter somewhere."
msgstr "Мне нужно срочно передать важные приказы самого адмирала командиру Мальстрёма на Южных приливных вратах, но приставленные ко мне рядовые до сих пор не явились. Поди знай, может, они где-нибудь валяются пьяные в канаве. Или уже <i>мёртвые</i>..."

#. ja: 自分に同行し、護衛をお願いできないでしょうか？<br>近頃、このあたりの街道も物騒なので。
#. de: Der Weg zum Süddamm ist in letzter Zeit nicht sicher, alleine würde ich die Reise vermutlich nicht überleben.
#. fr: Vous me semblez assez brrrave et <if $gn4>ex<shy>pé<shy>ri<shy>men<shy>tée<else>expérimenté</if> pour les remplacer. Voulez-vous bien m'escorter à Quartpierre<nbsp>? Je ne pense pas que nous aurons beaucoup de problèmes, mais je dois reconnaître m'être déjà trompée par le passé.
#. column 56: I have an urgent request, but only if you are bound for Tidegate.
#. column 57: I must deliver important orders from the Admiral herself to the Maelstrom commander stationed at South Tidegate, but the storm privates assigned to accompany me have yet to arrive. For all I know they could be lying drunk in a gutter somewhere. Or <i>dead</i> in a gutter somewhere.
#. column 59: Escort the scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I see. Very well then.<br>Till sea swallows all.
msgctxt "FateEvent:110:0:58"
msgid "You don't appear to be dead or drunk, so could I ask you to escort me through Quarterstone? I don't believe we will encounter much trouble, but I've been known to be wrong on countless occasions."
msgstr "На вид вы не мертвы и не пьяны. Не проводите меня через Четвертной камень? Вряд ли мы встретим серьёзные неприятности, но я уже не раз ошибалась."

#. ja: 同行してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Botin beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter l'éclaireuse<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I have an urgent request, but only if you are bound for Tidegate.
#. column 57: I must deliver important orders from the Admiral herself to the Maelstrom commander stationed at South Tidegate, but the storm privates assigned to accompany me have yet to arrive. For all I know they could be lying drunk in a gutter somewhere. Or <i>dead</i> in a gutter somewhere.
#. column 58: You don't appear to be dead or drunk, so could I ask you to escort me through Quarterstone? I don't believe we will encounter much trouble, but I've been known to be wrong on countless occasions.
#. column 62: I see. Very well then.<br>Till sea swallows all.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:110:0:59"
msgid "Escort the scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить разведчицу?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ならば、ほかをあたります。
#. de: Tja, dann hoffe ich mal, dass einer deiner Kollegen etwas mutiger ist.
#. fr: Je vois. Dans ce cas, il ne me reste plus qu'à espérrrer que les soldats du Maelstrom arriveront vite.
#. column 56: I have an urgent request, but only if you are bound for Tidegate.
#. column 57: I must deliver important orders from the Admiral herself to the Maelstrom commander stationed at South Tidegate, but the storm privates assigned to accompany me have yet to arrive. For all I know they could be lying drunk in a gutter somewhere. Or <i>dead</i> in a gutter somewhere.
#. column 58: You don't appear to be dead or drunk, so could I ask you to escort me through Quarterstone? I don't believe we will encounter much trouble, but I've been known to be wrong on countless occasions.
#. column 59: Escort the scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:110:0:62"
msgid "I see. Very well then.<br>Till sea swallows all."
msgstr "Понятно. Что ж, тогда ладно.<br>Пока море не поглотит всё."

#. ja: な、なんだよ……。俺の世話を焼いて、<br>謝礼をふんだくろうったって、そうはいかないぞ。
#. de: Was denn, was denn? Ich könnt mich mal ein bisschen lockerer machen, meinst du? Na, du hast gut reden! Mit meinem Hexenschuss würdest du sicher auch wie ein Waschbrett rumlaufen.
#. fr: Des citrons<nbsp>! J'ai horreur des citrons<nbsp>! Je déteste les citrons<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Look at this ankle! It has swollen to the size of an ogre pumpkin! All because I slipped on that blasted lemon rind!
#. column 58: And now, here I am, mere malms from my destination in Vesper Bay, stuck on this side of the Footfalls...because of a <i>LEMON</i>! You...wouldn't happen to be heading in that direction, now...would you? I could use a sturdy shoulder to lean upon.
#. column 59: Escort the merchant to Vesper Bay?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I suppose you think all this is amusing. A man attacked by a savage lemon rind. Go on. Laugh it up. Let us hear you now.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:111:0:56"
msgid "Lemons! I <i>hate</i> lemons! I <i>despise</i> lemons! I </i>loathe</i> lemons!"
msgstr "Лимоны! Я <i>ненавижу</i> лимоны! Я их <i>терпеть не могу</i>! Я их </i>просто видеть не могу</i>!"

#. ja: 俺は、すぐそこのベスパーベイへ<br>商品を仕入れに行くだけだ。ほら、楽勝だろ？
#. de: Mach dich lieber mal nützlich und eskortier mich zur Bucht des Abendsterns, damit ich meine Waren abliefern und mir ein paar Massagen verschreiben lassen kann.
#. fr: Regardez cette cheville<nbsp>! Elle fait la taille d'une citrouille des ogres<nbsp>! Et tout ça parce que j'ai glissé sur cette maudite peau de citron<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Lemons! I <i>hate</i> lemons! I <i>despise</i> lemons! I </i>loathe</i> lemons!
#. column 58: And now, here I am, mere malms from my destination in Vesper Bay, stuck on this side of the Footfalls...because of a <i>LEMON</i>! You...wouldn't happen to be heading in that direction, now...would you? I could use a sturdy shoulder to lean upon.
#. column 59: Escort the merchant to Vesper Bay?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I suppose you think all this is amusing. A man attacked by a savage lemon rind. Go on. Laugh it up. Let us hear you now.
msgctxt "FateEvent:111:0:57"
msgid "Look at this ankle! It has swollen to the size of an ogre pumpkin! All because I slipped on that blasted lemon rind!"
msgstr "Да посмотри на эту лодыжку! Раздулась с огренскую тыкву! И всё потому, что я поскользнулся на этой проклятой лимонной корке!"

#. ja: そりゃあ安全な道じゃないし、ちょっとヘマをして<br>膝に傷を受けてるが、静かに歩いていけば……。<br>護衛を雇う余裕なんてないし……。
#. de: Normalerweise hechte ich den Monstern hier ja mit Leichtigkeit davon, aber in meiner aktuellen Verfassung könnte ich höchstens noch Planke spielen. Und ich glaube nicht, dass die Biester da drauf reinfallen.
#. fr: Et me voici, à quelques mètres seulement de la baie des Vêpres, bloqué de ce côté de la voie du Soleil... Tout ça à cause d'un CITRON<nbsp>! Vous n'iriez pas dans cette direction, par hasard<nbsp>? J'aurais bien besoin de quelqu'un sur qui m'appuyer.
#. column 56: Lemons! I <i>hate</i> lemons! I <i>despise</i> lemons! I </i>loathe</i> lemons!
#. column 57: Look at this ankle! It has swollen to the size of an ogre pumpkin! All because I slipped on that blasted lemon rind!
#. column 59: Escort the merchant to Vesper Bay?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I suppose you think all this is amusing. A man attacked by a savage lemon rind. Go on. Laugh it up. Let us hear you now.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:111:0:58"
msgid "And now, here I am, mere malms from my destination in Vesper Bay, stuck on this side of the Footfalls...because of a <i>LEMON</i>! You...wouldn't happen to be heading in that direction, now...would you? I could use a sturdy shoulder to lean upon."
msgstr "И вот я здесь, всего в нескольких милях от Веспер-Бей, застрял по эту сторону перевала... из-за <i>ЛИМОНА</i>! Ты... случайно не туда направляешься? Мне бы не помешало на кого-нибудь опереться."

#. ja: ベスパーベイまで送りますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Händler eskortieren?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter le marchand jusqu'à la baie des Vêpres<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Lemons! I <i>hate</i> lemons! I <i>despise</i> lemons! I </i>loathe</i> lemons!
#. column 57: Look at this ankle! It has swollen to the size of an ogre pumpkin! All because I slipped on that blasted lemon rind!
#. column 58: And now, here I am, mere malms from my destination in Vesper Bay, stuck on this side of the Footfalls...because of a <i>LEMON</i>! You...wouldn't happen to be heading in that direction, now...would you? I could use a sturdy shoulder to lean upon.
#. column 62: I suppose you think all this is amusing. A man attacked by a savage lemon rind. Go on. Laugh it up. Let us hear you now.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:111:0:59"
msgid "Escort the merchant to Vesper Bay?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить торговца до Веспер-Бей?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 笑うだけなら、どっか行けよ。<br>敵がお前を追ってけば、俺は万々歳なんだ。
#. de: Jaja, wer den Schaden hat, braucht für den Spott nicht zu sorgen, was? Na, schönen Dank jedenfalls, du herzlose Abenteurerseele.
#. fr: Je suppose que vous trouvez ça drôle. Un homme attaqué par une peau de citron... Allez-y, riez.
#. column 56: Lemons! I <i>hate</i> lemons! I <i>despise</i> lemons! I </i>loathe</i> lemons!
#. column 57: Look at this ankle! It has swollen to the size of an ogre pumpkin! All because I slipped on that blasted lemon rind!
#. column 58: And now, here I am, mere malms from my destination in Vesper Bay, stuck on this side of the Footfalls...because of a <i>LEMON</i>! You...wouldn't happen to be heading in that direction, now...would you? I could use a sturdy shoulder to lean upon.
#. column 59: Escort the merchant to Vesper Bay?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:111:0:62"
msgid "I suppose you think all this is amusing. A man attacked by a savage lemon rind. Go on. Laugh it up. Let us hear you now."
msgstr "Думаешь, всё это смешно? Мужчину одолела лимонная корка. Ну, давай. Смейся. Чего замолчал?"

#. ja: アーススプライトの核は、十分に集まった……。<br>だが、もしまだ持っているのなら……くれ。
#. de: Ich habe mittlerweile genug Erd-Exergon-Kerne. Aber ein kleiner Extravorrat kann natürlich nicht schaden. Also, wenn du noch welche auftreiben kannst ...
#. fr: Des noyaux d'élémentaire de terre... on n'en a jamais assez...
msgctxt "FateEvent:112:0:56"
msgid "Enough cores... But can never have truly enough cores..."
msgstr "Ядер уже достаточно... Хотя ядер много не бывает..."

#. ja: アーススプライトの核はそろった。<br>もちろん……あればあるほど、助かるがな……。
#. de: Du hast nicht zufällig noch ein paar zusätzliche Erd-Exergon-Kerne gefunden? Ich kann immer einen kleinen Vorrat davon gebrauchen.
#. fr: Des noyaux d'élémentaire de terre<nbsp>? Je n'en ai jamais trop...
#. column 60: Core... This will...serve nicely...
#. column 62: Very well...
msgctxt "FateEvent:113:0:56"
msgid "Cores...? Can never have too many cores..."
msgstr "Ядра?.. Их никогда не бывает слишком много..."

#. ja: ありがたくもらっておこう……。<br>次の工事に、役立つ……。
#. de: Vielen Dank. Die werden uns auf der nächsten Baustelle von großem Nutzen sein.
#. fr: Un noyau pour moi... Merci, ça va m'être bien utile...
#. column 56: Cores...? Can never have too many cores...
#. column 62: Very well...
msgctxt "FateEvent:113:0:60"
msgid "Core... This will...serve nicely..."
msgstr "Ядро... сгодится... Спасибо..."

#. ja: 構わん……。数はそろっている。
#. de: Wie du meinst ... Für dieses Mal habe ich ja genug zusammen.
#. fr: Très bien...
#. column 56: Cores...? Can never have too many cores...
#. column 60: Core... This will...serve nicely...
msgctxt "FateEvent:113:0:62"
msgid "Very well..."
msgstr "Ладно..."

#. ja: サボテンの果肉、たくさん集まりました！<br>冒険者さんが親切にしてくれたこと、きっと忘れません。
#. de: Danke, dass du uns so viele Kaktusblätter gebracht hast. Das werden wir dir nie vergessen! Meiner Mami geht es bestimmt bald schon wieder besser!
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Grâce à vous je n'ai plus besoin d'aller à l'auberge voir cet homme à l'odeur rance au deuxième étage...
msgctxt "FateEvent:114:0:56"
msgid "Thank you! Now I won't have to go back to the pub and dance for that sour-smelling man. \\<shudder>"
msgstr "Спасибо! Теперь мне не придётся снова идти в кабак и танцевать для того вонючего типа. <i>Бр-р...</i>"

#. ja: サボテンの果肉……？<br>もっと貰っていいんですか……？
#. de: Du hast noch mehr Kaktusblätter gesammelt? Für mich?
#. fr: Vous... vous voulez m'en donner plus<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Oh thank you! My baby brother will be so happy...if my older brother doesn't take the leaves and sell them for more somnus...
#. column 62: Do you have a baby brother, too?
msgctxt "FateEvent:115:0:56"
msgid "You... You want to give me more?"
msgstr "Вы... вы хотите дать мне ещё?"

#. ja: わあっ、ありがとうございます！<br>こんなにあったら、わたしも少し食べられるかな……？
#. de: Oh, prima! Dann bleiben ja vielleicht sogar ein paar für mich übrig! Erst muss aber meine Mami wieder zu Kräften kommen.
#. fr: Oh merci<nbsp>! Mon petit frère va être si content...
#. column 56: You... You want to give me more?
#. column 62: Do you have a baby brother, too?
msgctxt "FateEvent:115:0:60"
msgid "Oh thank you! My baby brother will be so happy...if my older brother doesn't take the leaves and sell them for more somnus..."
msgstr "Ой, спасибо! Братишка будет так рад... если только старший брат не отберёт листья и не продаст их, чтобы купить ещё сомнуса..."

#. ja: 冒険者さんも、サボテンが好きなんですね。
#. de: Oh, du magst du Blätter auch? Wenn du willst, kann ich dir noch ein paar getrocknete Mistfliegen abgeben.
#. fr: Vous aussi, vous avez un petit frère<nbsp>?
#. column 56: You... You want to give me more?
#. column 60: Oh thank you! My baby brother will be so happy...if my older brother doesn't take the leaves and sell them for more somnus...
msgctxt "FateEvent:115:0:62"
msgid "Do you have a baby brother, too?"
msgstr "У вас тоже есть младший братишка?"

#. ja: 盗賊団に取られた荷物は、すっかり戻ってきやした。<br>冒険者サマサマでさぁ！
#. de: Welch Segen! Ich habe all meine Waren wieder. Der Erlös wird meine Familie einige Zeit über die Runden bringen, so viel steht fest. Gepriesen seist du, oh <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>!
#. fr: Oui, je crois que tout y est. Je vais enfin pouvoir prendre mon thé. Ah, quelle belle journée<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:116:0:56"
msgid "Yes, I believe everything is in order. It seems I will be having tea after all! Oh, what a glorious day!"
msgstr "Да, похоже, всё на месте. Значит, чай у меня всё-таки будет! О, какой чудесный день!"

#. ja: おや？　まだあっしの荷物がございやしたか？
#. de: Nanu? Du hast noch mehr Diebesgut gefunden? Dabei war ich mir sicher, schon all meine Waren wiedererhalten zu haben ...
#. fr: Vous voulez dire qu'il restait encore des caisses dans la maison<nbsp>?
#. column 60: By golly, you were right! My mind must have been somewhere else. In Ul'dah. Sipping on tea, I suppose.
#. column 62: Of course not! I have all my crates right here! Silly adventurer.
msgctxt "FateEvent:117:0:56"
msgid "You mean to tell me, there were still crates in the manse?"
msgstr "Постойте, так в поместье ещё оставались ящики?"

#. ja: ははぁ、こんなモンもありやしたね。<br>さっすが冒険者様、ぬかりねぇや！
#. de: Oh, die Kiste hatte ich ganz vergessen! Haha, nicht ohne Grund überlass ich die Buchhaltung ja meiner Frau!
#. fr: Vous aviez raison, j'avais la tête ailleurs. Je me voyais déjà à Ul'dah, en train de prendre le thé avec cette noble dame...
#. column 56: You mean to tell me, there were still crates in the manse?
#. column 62: Of course not! I have all my crates right here! Silly adventurer.
msgctxt "FateEvent:117:0:60"
msgid "By golly, you were right! My mind must have been somewhere else. In Ul'dah. Sipping on tea, I suppose."
msgstr "Вот ведь, вы были правы! Видно, мысли мои уже были далеко отсюда. В Ульде. За чашечкой чая, пожалуй."

#. ja: そりゃそうだ！<br>あっしの荷物は、すっかり戻ってきやしたからね。
#. de: Hätte mich auch gewundert, obwohl ich über einen kleinen Extragewinn natürlich nicht traurig gewesen wäre ...
#. fr: Bien sûr que non<nbsp>! Toutes mes caisses sont là.
#. column 56: You mean to tell me, there were still crates in the manse?
#. column 60: By golly, you were right! My mind must have been somewhere else. In Ul'dah. Sipping on tea, I suppose.
msgctxt "FateEvent:117:0:62"
msgid "Of course not! I have all my crates right here! Silly adventurer."
msgstr "Да нет, конечно! Все ящики при мне. Вот же растяпа."

#. ja: ソウルストーンが、こんなにいっぱい……。<br>うふ、濃密な研究になりそうだわ。
#. de: So viele Seelensteine! Ich werde wochenlang nicht aus dem Labor kommen, ohohohohoho!
#. fr: Je devrais avoir suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment de pierres d'âme, maintenant. Je pourrais éclairer ma chambre pendant des mois... euh, je veux dire découvrir un grand nombre de secrets<nbsp>! Oui, c'est ça<nbsp>!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:118:0:56"
msgid "This should be more than a sufficient amount of soulstones. Why, I could light my bedchamber for mon─ I mean, discover <i>myriad</i> secrets! Yes."
msgstr "Этого должно хватить с лихвой. Да я бы могла осветить ими спальню на мно─ То есть, открыть <i>несметное</i> количество тайн! Да."

#. ja: まだ石兵のソウルストーンを持っているの？<br>いいわ、引き取らせて。
#. de: Du hast noch mehr Seelensteine gesammelt? Na, nichts wie her damit!
#. fr: J'ai suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment de pierres d'âmes pour effectuer mes recherches, mais je ne vais pas refuser celles qu'on m'apporte en plus, bien sûr.
#. column 60: Excellent! My colleagues will never mock me again!
#. column 62: Well, you know where to find me! (Hopefully the guardians do not.)
msgctxt "FateEvent:119:0:56"
msgid "I have more than enough soulstones to conduct my research, but I won't turn away those who are willing to bring more."
msgstr "Камней души у меня и так хватает для исследований, но от тех, кто хочет принести ещё, я отказываться не стану."

#. ja: もう十分なんだけど、つい欲張ってしまうわね。<br>貴方、とっても献身的なんだもの。
#. de: Eigentlich hab ich ja genug, aber ich kann den Hals einfach nicht voll genug bekommen. Jetzt muss ich nur noch <if $gn4>eine starke Abenteurerin<else>einen starken Abenteurer</if> finden, die mir die ganzen Steine nach Hause schleppt, ohohohohoho!
#. fr: Excellent<nbsp>! Mes collègues ne se moqueront plus jamais de moi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I have more than enough soulstones to conduct my research, but I won't turn away those who are willing to bring more.
#. column 62: Well, you know where to find me! (Hopefully the guardians do not.)
msgctxt "FateEvent:119:0:60"
msgid "Excellent! My colleagues will never mock me again!"
msgstr "Вот это да! Теперь коллеги надо мной больше не посмеются!"

#. ja: あら、遊ばれてしまったかしら？
#. de: Einer Dame Hoffnungen zu machen, nur um sie dann zu enttäuschen. Das ist aber nicht die feine Art!
#. fr: Bon, vous savez où me trouver. (J'espère que ce n'est pas le cas pour les gardiens.)
#. column 56: I have more than enough soulstones to conduct my research, but I won't turn away those who are willing to bring more.
#. column 60: Excellent! My colleagues will never mock me again!
msgctxt "FateEvent:119:0:62"
msgid "Well, you know where to find me! (Hopefully the guardians do not.)"
msgstr "Что ж, ты знаешь, где меня найти! Надеюсь, стражи — нет."

#. ja: ああっ、そこの冒険者さんっ！<br>わたしのお願い、聞いてくれませんかっ！
#. de: Hallo, <if $gn4>freundliche Abenteurerin<else>freundlicher Abenteurer</if>! Du siehst jedenfalls freundlich aus! Sicher kannst du mir helfen!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Mademoiselle l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if>, j'ai besoin de votre aide<nbsp>! Je suis une humble pêcheuse de coquillage qui cherche à nourrir sa famille, mais...
#. column 57: But the rainbowlip oysters that I sell for a gil a dozen to the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol are all being eaten by the dreadful colibri.
#. column 58: The savvy little devils follow me and wait until I have found a shell, then swoop in from behind and snatch it from my basket! Try as I might to retrieve them, the birds are much too quick for me to catch. If someone were to help, I would be eternally in their debt!
#. column 59: Help collect shells?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Twelve! I shall wait here for you.
#. column 62: My sons... They won't last much longer on sandfleas and seawater.
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:120:0:56"
msgid "I beg of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I'm but a poor collector of shells, looking to feed her family."
msgstr "Умоляю вас, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if>! Я всего лишь бедная собирательница ракушек, хочу прокормить семью."

#. ja: わたし、細工物に使うため、「虹蝶貝」を集めてたんです。<br>なのに……突然、コリブリたちがあらわれて<br>貝がらをほとんど食べてしまって……！
#. de: Ich komme immer an diesen Strand, um Regenbogenaustern zu sammeln, aus deren Schalen ich Schmuck anfertige. Doch in letzter Zeit scheinen die Kolibris unter Kalkmangel zu leiden. Jedenfalls fressen sie die Austern samt Schalen! Heute haben sie mir auch alles vor der Nase weggefuttert!
#. fr: Figurez-vous que des colibris viennent dévorer les huîtres arc-en-ciel que je vends quelques gils la douzaine à des artisans qui s'en servent dans leur ouvrage.
#. column 56: I beg of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I'm but a poor collector of shells, looking to feed her family.
#. column 58: The savvy little devils follow me and wait until I have found a shell, then swoop in from behind and snatch it from my basket! Try as I might to retrieve them, the birds are much too quick for me to catch. If someone were to help, I would be eternally in their debt!
#. column 59: Help collect shells?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Twelve! I shall wait here for you.
#. column 62: My sons... They won't last much longer on sandfleas and seawater.
msgctxt "FateEvent:120:0:57"
msgid "But the rainbowlip oysters that I sell for a gil a dozen to the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol are all being eaten by the dreadful colibri."
msgstr "Но ужасные колибри пожирают все радужные устрицы, которые я продаю милому лалафеллу в Коста-дель-Соль по гилю за дюжину."

#. ja: でも、まだ消化するまでは時間があるはずです！<br>コリブリたちから「虹蝶貝」を取り返してくださいっ！<br>どんな手を使ったって、構いませんからっ！！
#. de: Aber sicher sind die Schalen noch nicht verdaut. Wenn du den Kolibris jetzt ein paar auf den Schnabel gibst, spucken sie ihre Mahlzeit vielleicht wieder aus!
#. fr: Ces vilains volatiles me suivent et attendent que j'aie trouvé un coquillage pour le chiper dans mon panier<nbsp>! Ils sont bien trop rapides pour que je les attrape. Si seulement quelqu'un voulait bien m'aider à les récupérer... Ils n'ont sans doute pas encore digéré ce qu'ils m'ont volé, je dois pouvoir récupérer mes précieuses coquilles<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I beg of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I'm but a poor collector of shells, looking to feed her family.
#. column 57: But the rainbowlip oysters that I sell for a gil a dozen to the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol are all being eaten by the dreadful colibri.
#. column 59: Help collect shells?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Twelve! I shall wait here for you.
#. column 62: My sons... They won't last much longer on sandfleas and seawater.
msgctxt "FateEvent:120:0:58"
msgid "The savvy little devils follow me and wait until I have found a shell, then swoop in from behind and snatch it from my basket! Try as I might to retrieve them, the birds are much too quick for me to catch. If someone were to help, I would be eternally in their debt!"
msgstr "Эти хитрые пташки следят за мной и ждут, пока я найду ракушку, а потом налетают сзади и утаскивают её из корзины! Я пыталась отбить добычу, но птицы слишком быстрые. Помогите мне, и я буду в вечном долгу!"

#. ja: 取り返してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Austern für die Frau sammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider à récupérer les huîtres avalées<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I beg of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I'm but a poor collector of shells, looking to feed her family.
#. column 57: But the rainbowlip oysters that I sell for a gil a dozen to the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol are all being eaten by the dreadful colibri.
#. column 58: The savvy little devils follow me and wait until I have found a shell, then swoop in from behind and snatch it from my basket! Try as I might to retrieve them, the birds are much too quick for me to catch. If someone were to help, I would be eternally in their debt!
#. column 60: Praise the Twelve! I shall wait here for you.
#. column 62: My sons... They won't last much longer on sandfleas and seawater.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:120:0:59"
msgid "Help collect shells?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать ракушки?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: やったぁっ！<br>ありがとうございます冒険者さんっ！
#. de: Danke! Das ist wirklich äußerst liebenswürdig von dir!
#. fr: Que les Douze vous bénissent<nbsp>! Je vous attends ici.
#. column 56: I beg of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I'm but a poor collector of shells, looking to feed her family.
#. column 57: But the rainbowlip oysters that I sell for a gil a dozen to the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol are all being eaten by the dreadful colibri.
#. column 58: The savvy little devils follow me and wait until I have found a shell, then swoop in from behind and snatch it from my basket! Try as I might to retrieve them, the birds are much too quick for me to catch. If someone were to help, I would be eternally in their debt!
#. column 59: Help collect shells?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: My sons... They won't last much longer on sandfleas and seawater.
msgctxt "FateEvent:120:0:60"
msgid "Praise the Twelve! I shall wait here for you."
msgstr "Хвала Двенадцати! Буду ждать вас здесь."

#. ja: そんなぁ……。<br>ああっ、急がないと貝がらが消化されちゃう……！
#. de: Wirklich nicht?! Wenn nicht schnell jemand was unternimmt, sind die schönen Muschelschalen bald nur noch Kalkbrei in den Mägen der Vögel.
#. fr: Si seulement quelqu'un pouvait m'aider...
#. column 56: I beg of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I'm but a poor collector of shells, looking to feed her family.
#. column 57: But the rainbowlip oysters that I sell for a gil a dozen to the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol are all being eaten by the dreadful colibri.
#. column 58: The savvy little devils follow me and wait until I have found a shell, then swoop in from behind and snatch it from my basket! Try as I might to retrieve them, the birds are much too quick for me to catch. If someone were to help, I would be eternally in their debt!
#. column 59: Help collect shells?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Twelve! I shall wait here for you.
msgctxt "FateEvent:120:0:62"
msgid "My sons... They won't last much longer on sandfleas and seawater."
msgstr "Мои сыновья... На одних песчаных блохах да морской воде долго не протянут."

#. ja: コリブリたちが消化する前に、<br>「虹蝶貝」の貝がらを手にいれてほしいんです！
#. de: Hol mir bitte die Regenbogenaustern von den Kolibris zurück, bevor sich die Vögel sattgefressen haben und wieder aus dem Staub machen!
#. fr: Les colibris ont dérobé tous mes coquillages<nbsp>! Si je ne les récupère pas au plus vite, mes fils n'auront rien à manger et mourront de faim<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:121:0:56"
msgid "The colibri have swallowed all my shells whole! If I cannot retrieve them, my sons will go hungry another night!"
msgstr "Колибри проглотили все мои ракушки целиком! Если я их не верну, мои сыновья снова останутся голодными!"

#. ja: 「虹蝶貝」を持ってきてくれたのですか？
#. de: Hattest du Erfolg bei der Austernsuche?
#. fr: Est-ce que vous m'apportez des huîtres arc-en-ciel<nbsp>!?
#. column 60: Oh, I cannot thank you enough! Unless you were to bring me more. Then I would thank you again!
#. column 62: If left in the colibri's bellies too long, the shells will lose all their luster and the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol will refuse to buy them.
msgctxt "FateEvent:122:0:56"
msgid "Might those be rainbowlip oysters you carry!?"
msgstr "Постойте, неужели у вас радужные устрицы?"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>まだ、貝がらを食べたコリブリはいるはずです。<br>もっといっぱい、取り返してくださいっ！
#. de: Danke! Aber da müssen noch viel mehr Austern sein. Hast du schon in allen Kolibrimägen nachgeschaut?
#. fr: Oh, merci infiniment<nbsp>! Mais si jamais vous pouviez m'en apporter d'autres, cela m'aiderait beaucoup.
#. column 56: Might those be rainbowlip oysters you carry!?
#. column 62: If left in the colibri's bellies too long, the shells will lose all their luster and the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol will refuse to buy them.
msgctxt "FateEvent:122:0:60"
msgid "Oh, I cannot thank you enough! Unless you were to bring me more. Then I would thank you again!"
msgstr "Ох, и не знаю, как вас благодарить! Хотя если принесёте ещё, поблагодарю снова!"

#. ja: 貝がらがコリブリに消化されないうちに、早くお願いします！
#. de: Wir haben keine Zeit zu verlieren, <if $gn4>meine Liebe<else>mein Lieber</if>! Die Magensäfte der Kolibris sind ziemlich aggressiv!
#. fr: S'ils passent trop de temps dans le jabot des colibris, mes coquillages perdront leur éclat et les gentils Lalafells refuseront de me les acheter.
#. column 56: Might those be rainbowlip oysters you carry!?
#. column 60: Oh, I cannot thank you enough! Unless you were to bring me more. Then I would thank you again!
msgctxt "FateEvent:122:0:62"
msgid "If left in the colibri's bellies too long, the shells will lose all their luster and the kind Lalafell in Costa del Sol will refuse to buy them."
msgstr "Если ракушки слишком долго пробудут в животах колибри, они потускнеют, и добрый лалафелл из Коста-дель-Соль откажется их покупать."

#. ja: 「虹蝶貝」は十分に集まりました。<br>ちょっとベトついてるようですが……<br>いい細工物に仕上げますよ。
#. de: Dank dir habe ich nun genug Regenbogenaustern! Sie sind zwar ein bisschen klebrig, aber mit etwas Kernseife werd ich den Magenschleim der Kolibris schon abscheuern können. Da werden bestimmt ganz wundervolle Schmuckstücke draus!
#. fr: Ce soir, mes fils et moi mangerons des becs de dodo et des pieds de pélicans<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:123:0:56"
msgid "Tonight my sons and I dine on the finest dodo beaks and pelican feet!"
msgstr "Сегодня мы с сыновьями отведаем лучшие клювы додо и пеликаньи лапки!"

#. ja: 「海賊の略奪品」を持ってきてくださったのですか？
#. de: Bist du auf Beutegut gestoßen?
#. fr: Avez-vous pu mettre la main sur des mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses de contrebande<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Remarkable. To think that there are respectable people in La Noscea who would purchase this filth... I will personally see the contents destroyed in the custom house furnaces.
#. column 62: We haven't much more time. If you find anything suspicious, deliver it to me posthaste.
msgctxt "FateEvent:124:0:56"
msgid "How goes the search for contraband?"
msgstr "Как идут поиски контрабанды?"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>ほかにも押収したら、また持ってきてください。
#. de: Besten Dank! Wenn du noch mehr findest, weißt du ja, wo du mich findest.
#. fr: Parfait<nbsp>! Dire que ce sont des gens respectables de la Noscea qui achètent ces saletés... Je vais veiller moi-même à ce que ces mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses soient brûlées.
#. column 56: How goes the search for contraband?
#. column 62: We haven't much more time. If you find anything suspicious, deliver it to me posthaste.
msgctxt "FateEvent:124:0:60"
msgid "Remarkable. To think that there are respectable people in La Noscea who would purchase this filth... I will personally see the contents destroyed in the custom house furnaces."
msgstr "Вот это да. Подумать только, в Ла-Носкее есть порядочные люди, готовые покупать такое... Я лично прослежу, чтобы всё содержимое сожгли в печах таможни."

#. ja: まもなく帰還しますので、<br>もし「海賊の略奪品」をお持ちでしたら<br>早めにお申し出ください。
#. de: Dann beeile dich, wir können die Durchsuchung nicht ewig fortführen. Bevor die Jungs Verstärkung rufen, ziehen wir uns zurück.
#. fr: Nous n'avons pas beaucoup de temps. Si vous voyez quelque chose de suspect, apportez-le-moi im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment.
#. column 56: How goes the search for contraband?
#. column 60: Remarkable. To think that there are respectable people in La Noscea who would purchase this filth... I will personally see the contents destroyed in the custom house furnaces.
msgctxt "FateEvent:124:0:62"
msgid "We haven't much more time. If you find anything suspicious, deliver it to me posthaste."
msgstr "У нас осталось совсем мало времени. Если найдёте что-нибудь подозрительное, немедленно отнесите мне."

#. ja: ゴブリン族の強制捜査は無事終了しました！<br>ご協力ありがとうございました！
#. de: Die Durchsuchung des Goblinlagers ist abgeschlossen. Vielen Dank für deine Unterstützung!
#. fr: L'opération est terminée.
#. column 57: There are still a few moments before we pack up these crates and deliver them to the custom house for inspection and incineration. If you happen upon any more contraband in that time, please let us know.
#. column 60: Very good. I shall add these items to the others. Your contribution has been duly noted.
msgctxt "FateEvent:125:0:56"
msgid "The operation is nearly complete."
msgstr "Операция почти завершена."

#. ja: まもなく帰還しますので、<br>もし「海賊の略奪品」をお持ちでしたら<br>早めにお申し出ください。
#. de: Ich werde hier bald das Feld räumen. Falls du mir also noch etwas aushändigen möchtest, tue es bitte schnell.
#. fr: Il va nous falloir un peu de temps pour préparer ces caisses et les acheminer jusqu'à la douane, où elles seront inspectées, puis détruites. Si vous trouvez d'autres mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses de contrebande pendant ce temps, n'hésitez pas à m'en informer.
#. column 56: The operation is nearly complete.
#. column 60: Very good. I shall add these items to the others. Your contribution has been duly noted.
msgctxt "FateEvent:125:0:57"
msgid "There are still a few moments before we pack up these crates and deliver them to the custom house for inspection and incineration. If you happen upon any more contraband in that time, please let us know."
msgstr "Мы скоро упакуем эти ящики и доставим их на таможню для проверки и сожжения. Если за это время найдёте ещё контрабанду, сообщите нам."

#. fr: Très bien. Je vais ajouter ces objets aux autres. Merci pour votre con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
#. column 56: The operation is nearly complete.
#. column 57: There are still a few moments before we pack up these crates and deliver them to the custom house for inspection and incineration. If you happen upon any more contraband in that time, please let us know.
msgctxt "FateEvent:125:0:60"
msgid "Very good. I shall add these items to the others. Your contribution has been duly noted."
msgstr "Отлично. Добавлю эти вещи к остальным. Ваш вклад не останется незамеченным."

#. ja: コッファー＆コフィンは、キキルン入店お断りだ。<br>お前、キキルンを連れていたりは……しねーか。
#. de: Qiqirn haben im Würfel & Becher Hausverbot! Du musst deinen also draußen anbind... Wie, du hast gar keinen bei dir? Aber warum riechst du dann so streng? Na ja, auch egal ...
#. fr: Interdit aux Qiqirns. Pas d'exception. Vous n'êtes pas un Qiqirn, hein<nbsp>?
#. column 57: No. If you were, I'd smell it.
#. column 58: Might be you could help me, though. A pack of the rats is fixin' to sneak its way in and steal our wine. How do I know? Because they try just about every godsdamned day.
#. column 59: Help the heavy?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Forget it, then.
msgctxt "FateEvent:126:0:56"
msgid "No Qiqirn allowed. No exceptions. You ain't a Qiqirn, are you?"
msgstr "Кикирнам вход воспрещён. Без исключений. Ты ведь не кикирн?"

#. ja: 獣人民族排斥令が出てるってのもあるが、<br>正直あいつら、くせーだろ！<br>だから入店を断ってるのに、食い下がるやつがいてな……。
#. de: So oder so haben wir schon genug Ärger mit den Jungs. Einige wollen sich nämlich partout nicht an das Hausverbot halten. Faseln was von „Freiheit den Ratten“ und „Tod den Unterdrückern“.
#. fr: Non. Si c'était le cas, je l'aurais senti.
#. column 56: No Qiqirn allowed. No exceptions. You ain't a Qiqirn, are you?
#. column 58: Might be you could help me, though. A pack of the rats is fixin' to sneak its way in and steal our wine. How do I know? Because they try just about every godsdamned day.
#. column 59: Help the heavy?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Forget it, then.
msgctxt "FateEvent:126:0:57"
msgid "No. If you were, I'd smell it."
msgstr "Нет. Будь ты кикирном, я бы почуял."

#. ja: 数匹なら俺ひとりでも楽勝だが、<br>最近は徒党を組んで乗り込んできやがる。<br>手が空いてるなら、追っ払うのを手伝ってくんねーか？
#. de: Mit ein paar von denen würde ich natürlich auch alleine fertig, aber in letzter Zeit tauchen die hier regelmäßig in ganzen Rudeln auf. Das wird mir dann doch ein bisschen zu viel.
#. fr: Vous pouvez peut-être m'aider, du coup. Un groupe de ces fichus hommes-rats essaie de s'infiltrer ici pour nous voler notre vin. Comment je le sais<nbsp>? Parce qu'ils essaient tous les jours, pardi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: No Qiqirn allowed. No exceptions. You ain't a Qiqirn, are you?
#. column 57: No. If you were, I'd smell it.
#. column 59: Help the heavy?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Forget it, then.
msgctxt "FateEvent:126:0:58"
msgid "Might be you could help me, though. A pack of the rats is fixin' to sneak its way in and steal our wine. How do I know? Because they try just about every godsdamned day."
msgstr "Может, поможешь мне? Стая этих крыс собирается пробраться внутрь и стащить наше вино. Откуда знаю? Они пытаются это сделать чуть ли не каждый проклятый день."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Wächter helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Offrir votre aide<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: No Qiqirn allowed. No exceptions. You ain't a Qiqirn, are you?
#. column 57: No. If you were, I'd smell it.
#. column 58: Might be you could help me, though. A pack of the rats is fixin' to sneak its way in and steal our wine. How do I know? Because they try just about every godsdamned day.
#. column 62: Forget it, then.
