msgctxt "FateEvent:126:0:59"
msgid "Help the heavy?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь громиле?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ま、客に頼むことじゃねーよな……。<br>悪かった、気にせず中で飲んでってくれよ。
#. de: Ja, ich weiß ... Ich sollte mir abgewöhnen, jeden Gast um Hilfe zu bitten. Genehmige dir da drinnen mal dein Mull-Ragout. Du hast es dir verdient.
#. fr: Oubliez ce que je vous ai dit. Je vais me débrouiller moi-même...
#. column 56: No Qiqirn allowed. No exceptions. You ain't a Qiqirn, are you?
#. column 57: No. If you were, I'd smell it.
#. column 58: Might be you could help me, though. A pack of the rats is fixin' to sneak its way in and steal our wine. How do I know? Because they try just about every godsdamned day.
#. column 59: Help the heavy?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:126:0:62"
msgid "Forget it, then."
msgstr "Ладно, забудь."

#. ja: 冒険者よ、いいところに現れてくれたな！<br>すまないが、「ジャイアント」の退治を手伝ってくれ。<br>奴ら、このあたりに根付こうと、最近よく現れるのだ。
#. de: Oh, <if $gn4>eine Abenteurerin<else>ein Abenteurer</if>! Du kommst genau zum richtigen Zeitpunkt. Ich habe gerade ein <i>riesiges</i> Problem. Kannst du mir dabei helfen, es auszurotten?
#. fr: Vous, là<nbsp>! Oui, vous<nbsp>! Vous semblez être la personne qu'il me faut. Pourrais-je vous convaincre de consacrer une partie de votre temps libre à l'élimination de petits nuisibles qui errent autour de la Tour de l'Œil<nbsp>?
#. column 57: I use the word “small” in a purely figurative sense, for the pests I refer to are actually quite <i>large</i>─“giant,” one might even say. So, then. Do you perhaps fancy yourself a slayer of giants?
#. column 58: Fancy yourself a giant slayer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Just the answer I was hoping to hear! Injuries be damned─your spirit has rekindled mine own! Let us charge into battle together!
#. column 62: Well, then would you at least be kind enough to tell those deadweights back at Camp Dragonhead to get off their leaden arses and send reinforcements to the tower? As you can clearly see, I am sorely undermanned.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:127:0:56"
msgid "You there! Yes, you there! My unit has abandoned me, and I sit here cold and bleeding. Might I convince you to spare a few moments of your time clearing the area of a few...ah, <i>small</i> pests up about Monument Tower?"
msgstr "Эй ты! Да, ты! Мой отряд бросил меня здесь, окоченевшего и истекающего кровью. Не уделишь ли ты пару минут, чтобы разогнать этих... э-э... <i>маленьких</i> вредителей возле Башни-памятника?"

#. ja: とくに最近では、「秘石の塔」がたびたび襲われるせいで、<br>警備が人手不足になってな……ぜひ、力を貸してくれ。
#. de: Das Mal wird in letzter Zeit so häufig von Riesen angegriffen, dass wir gar nicht mehr mit dem Rekrutieren neuer Wachen hinterherkommen. Besonders die Frischlinge verletzen sich meist schon beim ersten Kampf. Wir würden deine Hilfe daher sehr zu schätzen wissen!
#. fr: J'utilise le mot “petit”, mais il s'agit en réalité de géants. Ça vous dirait d'en tuer pour moi<nbsp>?
#. column 56: You there! Yes, you there! My unit has abandoned me, and I sit here cold and bleeding. Might I convince you to spare a few moments of your time clearing the area of a few...ah, <i>small</i> pests up about Monument Tower?
#. column 58: Fancy yourself a giant slayer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Just the answer I was hoping to hear! Injuries be damned─your spirit has rekindled mine own! Let us charge into battle together!
#. column 62: Well, then would you at least be kind enough to tell those deadweights back at Camp Dragonhead to get off their leaden arses and send reinforcements to the tower? As you can clearly see, I am sorely undermanned.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:127:0:57"
msgid "I use the word “small” in a purely figurative sense, for the pests I refer to are actually quite <i>large</i>─“giant,” one might even say. So, then. Do you perhaps fancy yourself a slayer of giants?"
msgstr "«Маленькие» — это, конечно, в переносном смысле. На деле вредители довольно <i>крупные</i> — можно даже сказать, гиганты. Ну так что? Не желаешь прослыть убийцей гигантов?"

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Tuer des géants<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You there! Yes, you there! My unit has abandoned me, and I sit here cold and bleeding. Might I convince you to spare a few moments of your time clearing the area of a few...ah, <i>small</i> pests up about Monument Tower?
#. column 57: I use the word “small” in a purely figurative sense, for the pests I refer to are actually quite <i>large</i>─“giant,” one might even say. So, then. Do you perhaps fancy yourself a slayer of giants?
#. column 60: Just the answer I was hoping to hear! Injuries be damned─your spirit has rekindled mine own! Let us charge into battle together!
#. column 62: Well, then would you at least be kind enough to tell those deadweights back at Camp Dragonhead to get off their leaden arses and send reinforcements to the tower? As you can clearly see, I am sorely undermanned.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
