msgctxt "FateEvent:127:0:58"
msgid "Fancy yourself a giant slayer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поборешься с гигантами?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 協力に感謝する、冒険者よ！<br>さあ、我らの手で勝利をもぎ取ろうではないか！
#. de: Das ist genau die Antwort, die ich hören wollte. Herzlichen Dank, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>! Mit dir an unserer Seite ist uns der Sieg so gut wie sicher!
#. fr: Voilà qui me réjouit<nbsp>! Venez, nous allons combattre ensemble<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You there! Yes, you there! My unit has abandoned me, and I sit here cold and bleeding. Might I convince you to spare a few moments of your time clearing the area of a few...ah, <i>small</i> pests up about Monument Tower?
#. column 57: I use the word “small” in a purely figurative sense, for the pests I refer to are actually quite <i>large</i>─“giant,” one might even say. So, then. Do you perhaps fancy yourself a slayer of giants?
#. column 58: Fancy yourself a giant slayer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, then would you at least be kind enough to tell those deadweights back at Camp Dragonhead to get off their leaden arses and send reinforcements to the tower? As you can clearly see, I am sorely undermanned.
msgctxt "FateEvent:127:0:60"
msgid "Just the answer I was hoping to hear! Injuries be damned─your spirit has rekindled mine own! Let us charge into battle together!"
msgstr "Именно это я и надеялся услышать! К чёрту раны — твой боевой дух снова зажёг во мне огонь! Вперёд, вместе в бой!"

#. ja: そうか……ならばせめて、「秘石の塔」へ寄ったら、<br>増援をよこすよう、誰かに伝えてくれないか？<br>我々は、ここで奴らの監視を続けるつもりなのでな。
#. de: Das ist sehr bedauerlich. Könntest du dann wenigstens so nett sein und jemandem Bescheid geben, wenn du zufällig am Mal vorbeikommen solltest? Sag dem Betreffenden, dass wir dringend Verstärkung brauchen. Wir halten hier solange weiter die Stellung.
#. fr: Très bien... Vous voudriez bien quand même dire à ces incapables du camp de la Tête du dragon d'envoyer des renforts<nbsp>? Comme vous le voyez, nous sommes en sous-effectif ici.
#. column 56: You there! Yes, you there! My unit has abandoned me, and I sit here cold and bleeding. Might I convince you to spare a few moments of your time clearing the area of a few...ah, <i>small</i> pests up about Monument Tower?
#. column 57: I use the word “small” in a purely figurative sense, for the pests I refer to are actually quite <i>large</i>─“giant,” one might even say. So, then. Do you perhaps fancy yourself a slayer of giants?
#. column 58: Fancy yourself a giant slayer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Just the answer I was hoping to hear! Injuries be damned─your spirit has rekindled mine own! Let us charge into battle together!
msgctxt "FateEvent:127:0:62"
msgid "Well, then would you at least be kind enough to tell those deadweights back at Camp Dragonhead to get off their leaden arses and send reinforcements to the tower? As you can clearly see, I am sorely undermanned."
msgstr "Тогда окажи хотя бы такую услугу: передай бездельникам в Лагере Драконьей Головы, чтобы прислали подкрепление к башне. Как видишь, людей у нас катастрофически мало."

#. ja: おお、これぞまさしく天の助け！<br>冒険者さん、唐突で申し訳ないのですが、<br>私の護衛を頼まれてはくれないでしょうか？
#. de: Du kommst gerade recht. Ich könnte jemanden zum Geleit gebrauchen.
#. fr: Par tous les saints<nbsp>! J'espérais justement qu'un<if $gn4>e aventurière<else> aventurier</if> de votre trempe m'adresserait la parole. Puis-je vous demander un service<nbsp>?
#. column 57: I am one of a cadre of researchers, scholars, and naturalists who go by the collective name “the Sons of Saint Coinach.” I am returning from a foray into the lowlands of Coerthas to collect supplies, but find the road back to our site of study overrun with terrible creatures who were not there on my way north.
#. column 58: If you would be so kind as to lend me your talents in clearing the path and keeping my head securely attached to my shoulders, I would see to it that you are suitably rewarded.
#. column 59: Escort the son of Saint Coinach?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I suppose it was too much to ask... Well, I shan't think any less of you for your decision. We all have our priorities.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:128:0:56"
msgid "Oh, thank the saints! You would <i>not</i> believe how long I have been standing here waiting for a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of your ilk to happen by. Might I ask of you a favor?"
msgstr "О святые! Вы даже не представляете, как долго я тут ждал, чтобы встретить <i>женщину</i> вроде вас. Не окажете ли мне услугу?"

#. ja: 実は「聖コイナク財団の調査地」まで<br>行きたかったのですが、その……<br>魔物が恐ろしくて、ここから進めずにいたのです。
#. de: Ich habe in den Grabungsstätten der Sankt Coinach-Stiftung zu tun, und ... nicht, dass ich Angst hätte, aber der Weg soll nicht so ganz sicher sein.
#. fr: Je fais partie du collectif d'archéologues de la Fondation de Saint-Coinach et je dois me rendre à la Trouvaille pour y récupérer des documents importants. Le problème, c'est que le chemin est parsemé de créatures dangereuses.
#. column 56: Oh, thank the saints! You would <i>not</i> believe how long I have been standing here waiting for a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of your ilk to happen by. Might I ask of you a favor?
#. column 58: If you would be so kind as to lend me your talents in clearing the path and keeping my head securely attached to my shoulders, I would see to it that you are suitably rewarded.
#. column 59: Escort the son of Saint Coinach?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I suppose it was too much to ask... Well, I shan't think any less of you for your decision. We all have our priorities.
msgctxt "FateEvent:128:0:57"
msgid "I am one of a cadre of researchers, scholars, and naturalists who go by the collective name “the Sons of Saint Coinach.” I am returning from a foray into the lowlands of Coerthas to collect supplies, but find the road back to our site of study overrun with terrible creatures who were not there on my way north."
msgstr "Я из группы исследователей, учёных и естествоиспытателей, известных под общим именем «Сыны святого Койнаха». Возвращаюсь из низин Коэртаса за припасами, но дорогу обратно к месту раскопок заполонили ужасные твари. Когда я шёл на север, их там не было."

#. ja: それで護衛を探していたのですが……<br>いかんせん、引き受けてくれるアテがなく、<br>途方に暮れていた次第です。
#. de: Was meinst du, kannst du mir Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft leisten und nebenbei ein bisschen aufpassen?
#. fr: Je vous payerais rubis sur l'ongle si vous vouliez bien dégager la route et veiller à ma sécurité.
#. column 56: Oh, thank the saints! You would <i>not</i> believe how long I have been standing here waiting for a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of your ilk to happen by. Might I ask of you a favor?
#. column 57: I am one of a cadre of researchers, scholars, and naturalists who go by the collective name “the Sons of Saint Coinach.” I am returning from a foray into the lowlands of Coerthas to collect supplies, but find the road back to our site of study overrun with terrible creatures who were not there on my way north.
#. column 59: Escort the son of Saint Coinach?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I suppose it was too much to ask... Well, I shan't think any less of you for your decision. We all have our priorities.
msgctxt "FateEvent:128:0:58"
msgid "If you would be so kind as to lend me your talents in clearing the path and keeping my head securely attached to my shoulders, I would see to it that you are suitably rewarded."
msgstr "Будьте так добры, помогите расчистить дорогу и сохранить мою голову на плечах. Я позабочусь, чтобы вас достойно вознаградили."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Ist wirklich nicht gefährlich. Na? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter l'archéologue<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, thank the saints! You would <i>not</i> believe how long I have been standing here waiting for a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of your ilk to happen by. Might I ask of you a favor?
#. column 57: I am one of a cadre of researchers, scholars, and naturalists who go by the collective name “the Sons of Saint Coinach.” I am returning from a foray into the lowlands of Coerthas to collect supplies, but find the road back to our site of study overrun with terrible creatures who were not there on my way north.
#. column 58: If you would be so kind as to lend me your talents in clearing the path and keeping my head securely attached to my shoulders, I would see to it that you are suitably rewarded.
#. column 62: I suppose it was too much to ask... Well, I shan't think any less of you for your decision. We all have our priorities.
