msgctxt "FateEvent:144:0:59"
msgid "Protect the engineer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Защитить инженера?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 実はギガースがこの地を狙ってましてね～。<br>何度か追い返したりしてたんですが、<br>今度はここへの物資を狙いだしたんですよ～。
#. de: Weißt du, wer es auf dieses Gebiet hier abgesehen hat, auf dem du stehst? Die Gigas. Mittlerweile versuchen sie gezielt, unsere Forschungsarbeiten zu sabotieren.
#. fr: Les gigas<nbsp>! Ils sont partout et ils détruisent tout sur leur passage<nbsp>!
#. column 57: We were on our way back to Ishgard to share this moon's findings with the Holy See when from out of nowhere a band of scantily clad muscle-bound thugs appeared waving their massive weapons, running hither and thither, crushing crates left and right.
#. column 58: It was all my companions and I could do to steal away to safety with whatever we could carry. We are too tuckered to attempt to garrote them by ourselves, and would be more than grateful to <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> who might assist us in driving off the gigas.
#. column 59: Garrote the gigas?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sigh> A whole moon's findings... Gone... The Sons will be devastated...
msgctxt "FateEvent:145:0:56"
msgid "The gigas! They're everywhere and they won't. Stop. Smashing. Our. Things!"
msgstr "Гиги! Они повсюду и всё крушат. Наши вещи. Вдребезги!"

#. ja: 運悪く、この物資を輸送中に我々も襲われまして～。<br>なんとかここまでたどり着きましたが<br>物資を狙ってまた襲ってくるんだろうな～と。
#. de: Sie greifen die Karawanen an, die archäologische Fundstücke für weitere Unter<shy>such<shy>ungen abtransportieren. Die letzte hätte es fast erwischt!
#. fr: Nous regagnions Ishgard pour transporter ces échan<shy>til<shy>lons lorsque ces brutes surgies de nulle part ont commencé à brandir leurs armes massives avant de tout détruire.
#. column 56: The gigas! They're everywhere and they won't. Stop. Smashing. Our. Things!
#. column 58: It was all my companions and I could do to steal away to safety with whatever we could carry. We are too tuckered to attempt to garrote them by ourselves, and would be more than grateful to <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> who might assist us in driving off the gigas.
#. column 59: Garrote the gigas?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sigh> A whole moon's findings... Gone... The Sons will be devastated...
msgctxt "FateEvent:145:0:57"
msgid "We were on our way back to Ishgard to share this moon's findings with the Holy See when from out of nowhere a band of scantily clad muscle-bound thugs appeared waving their massive weapons, running hither and thither, crushing crates left and right."
msgstr "Мы возвращались в Ишгард, чтобы представить Священному престолу результаты исследований за этот лунный месяц, как вдруг откуда ни возьмись появились полуголые бугаи с огромным оружием. Мечутся повсюду и крушат ящики направо и налево."

#. ja: 護衛の彼らも、道中の戦闘で疲労してましてね～。<br>誰かなんとかしてくれないかな～、なんて。
#. de: Die Wachen sind vollkommen erschöpft und werden eine zweite Angriffswelle nicht überleben! Irgendjemand muss diesem Treiben ein Ende setzen!
#. fr: Nous avons juste eu le temps de fuir en abandonnant derrière nous nos affaires, et nos escortes sont trop épuisées pour les récupérer sans aide. Accepteriez-vous de nous aider à repousser ces géants<nbsp>?
#. column 56: The gigas! They're everywhere and they won't. Stop. Smashing. Our. Things!
#. column 57: We were on our way back to Ishgard to share this moon's findings with the Holy See when from out of nowhere a band of scantily clad muscle-bound thugs appeared waving their massive weapons, running hither and thither, crushing crates left and right.
#. column 59: Garrote the gigas?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sigh> A whole moon's findings... Gone... The Sons will be devastated...
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:145:0:58"
msgid "It was all my companions and I could do to steal away to safety with whatever we could carry. We are too tuckered to attempt to garrote them by ourselves, and would be more than grateful to <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> who might assist us in driving off the gigas."
msgstr "Мы с товарищами едва успели унести ноги, прихватив всё, что смогли. Мы слишком вымотались, чтобы самим расправиться с гигами, и были бы очень признательны <if $gn4>той, кто<else>тому, кто</if> поможет их прогнать."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du, die Gigas abzuwehren?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Violenter les gigas<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: The gigas! They're everywhere and they won't. Stop. Smashing. Our. Things!
#. column 57: We were on our way back to Ishgard to share this moon's findings with the Holy See when from out of nowhere a band of scantily clad muscle-bound thugs appeared waving their massive weapons, running hither and thither, crushing crates left and right.
#. column 58: It was all my companions and I could do to steal away to safety with whatever we could carry. We are too tuckered to attempt to garrote them by ourselves, and would be more than grateful to <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> who might assist us in driving off the gigas.
#. column 62: \<sigh> A whole moon's findings... Gone... The Sons will be devastated...
