msgctxt "FateEvent:153:0:59"
msgid "Escort the astrologian to Camp Dragonhead?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить астролога в Лагерь Драконьей Головы?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 分かりました。<br>残念ですが仕方ありません。<br>どうしよう、早く伝えないと……。
#. de: Ich verstehe. Und du verstehst offensichtlich gar nichts! Wenn du wüsstest, was in ... Ach, vergiss, was ich gesagt habe.
#. fr: Je n'en attendais pas moins d'un<if $gn4>e incroyante<else> incroyant</if>. Ishgard a bien raison de fermer ses portes aux personnes de votre espèce.
#. column 56: Pardon me, but might you be headed north towards Camp Dragonhead? If you are, I have a proposition.
#. column 57: I am an astrologian employed at the Observatorium. I must hurry these readings to a courier in the camp so that he might deliver them to the archbishop.
#. column 58: Usually, a knight of House Durendaire would accompany me, but those stationed at the Observatorium had to make for the Nail to intercept a band of crazed giants come down from the mountain to raid our kitchens and steal our women. And therefore, I must ask you to accompany me.
#. column 59: Escort the astrologian to Camp Dragonhead?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:153:0:62"
msgid "I might have expected as much from an unbeliever. The Holy See is wise to keep its gates shut to the likes of you."
msgstr "Чего и следовало ожидать от неверующего. Священный престол мудро поступил, закрыв ворота для таких, как ты."

#. ja: おお、この運命の出会いに感謝します。<br>つり橋におびえて逃げ出したこの子を追いかけて、<br>そのまま道に迷ってしまいました。
#. de: Oh, welch glückliche Fügung des Schicksals! <if $gn4>Meine Retterin<else>Mein Retter</if>! Dieser kleine Feigling hier hat plötzlich gescheut und ich bin ihm nach, und schon hatte ich mich verirrt.
#. fr: Ah, quelle chance de vous trouver ici<nbsp>! Cette rencontre est cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment un signe des Douze, j'en suis sûr<nbsp>! Voyez-vous, mon chocobo a eu peur de traverser le pont de lianes au-dessus du ravin, et a pris la fuite.
#. column 57: Let us just say that a few too many sips from the wineskin have left me...displaced from my companions, and now I find myself stranded here at the crossroads of nowhere and no place.
#. column 58: And as if it couldn't get any better for a poor man with a pea-sized bladder, I am now being stalked by what appears to be a pack of raptors, of all things. Would it be too much to ask for an escort to someplace less hostile?
#. column 59: Escort the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your kindness will not go unrewarded, friend. I am a man of means, and I mean to reward you...once I am safe again with my caravan, I mean.
#. column 62: O fickle goddess of fate, Nymeia! Why must You always pull away that which Oschon has so generously pushed into my path?
msgctxt "FateEvent:154:0:56"
msgid "Out of all the places in this wide realm where you could be standing right now, praise the Wanderer for leading you here to me!"
msgstr "Из всех мест на свете именно сюда тебя привёл Странник! Хвала ему — ты как раз вовремя!"

#. ja: 商隊と合流したいのですが<br>この子が、魔物の気配にすっかり怖じ気付いて<br>動いてくれないのです。
#. de: Ich will versuchen, zur Karawane zurückzufinden. Kannst du hier kurz auf den Kleinen aufpassen?
#. fr: À cause de ça, j'ai perdu mes compagnons de caravane... Et maintenant, me voilà perdu au milieu de nulle part, avec ma bête qui ne veut pas se remettre en route.
#. column 56: Out of all the places in this wide realm where you could be standing right now, praise the Wanderer for leading you here to me!
#. column 58: And as if it couldn't get any better for a poor man with a pea-sized bladder, I am now being stalked by what appears to be a pack of raptors, of all things. Would it be too much to ask for an escort to someplace less hostile?
#. column 59: Escort the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your kindness will not go unrewarded, friend. I am a man of means, and I mean to reward you...once I am safe again with my caravan, I mean.
#. column 62: O fickle goddess of fate, Nymeia! Why must You always pull away that which Oschon has so generously pushed into my path?
msgctxt "FateEvent:154:0:57"
msgid "Let us just say that a few too many sips from the wineskin have left me...displaced from my companions, and now I find myself stranded here at the crossroads of nowhere and no place."
msgstr "Скажем так: я выпил из бурдюка чуть больше, чем следовало, и... отстал от спутников. Теперь застрял здесь, на перекрёстке нигде и никуда."

#. ja: この子が、動き出すまで、<br>しばらくそばにいてくれないか？
#. de: So verstört, wie er ist, rührt er sich eh eine Weile nicht vom Fleck.
#. fr: Est-ce que vous voudriez bien me protéger jusqu'à ce que mon chocobo soit calmé<nbsp>? Je sens qu'il y a des bêtes féroces qui rôdent par ici.
#. column 56: Out of all the places in this wide realm where you could be standing right now, praise the Wanderer for leading you here to me!
#. column 57: Let us just say that a few too many sips from the wineskin have left me...displaced from my companions, and now I find myself stranded here at the crossroads of nowhere and no place.
#. column 59: Escort the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your kindness will not go unrewarded, friend. I am a man of means, and I mean to reward you...once I am safe again with my caravan, I mean.
#. column 62: O fickle goddess of fate, Nymeia! Why must You always pull away that which Oschon has so generously pushed into my path?
msgctxt "FateEvent:154:0:58"
msgid "And as if it couldn't get any better for a poor man with a pea-sized bladder, I am now being stalked by what appears to be a pack of raptors, of all things. Would it be too much to ask for an escort to someplace less hostile?"
msgstr "И словно бедняге с крохотным мочевым пузырём мало неприятностей, за мной увязалась стая рапторов! Не мог бы ты проводить меня туда, где поспокойнее?"

#. ja: いてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du kurz aufpassen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Protéger le marchand<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Out of all the places in this wide realm where you could be standing right now, praise the Wanderer for leading you here to me!
#. column 57: Let us just say that a few too many sips from the wineskin have left me...displaced from my companions, and now I find myself stranded here at the crossroads of nowhere and no place.
#. column 58: And as if it couldn't get any better for a poor man with a pea-sized bladder, I am now being stalked by what appears to be a pack of raptors, of all things. Would it be too much to ask for an escort to someplace less hostile?
#. column 60: Your kindness will not go unrewarded, friend. I am a man of means, and I mean to reward you...once I am safe again with my caravan, I mean.
#. column 62: O fickle goddess of fate, Nymeia! Why must You always pull away that which Oschon has so generously pushed into my path?
