msgctxt "FateEvent:154:0:59"
msgid "Escort the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить купца?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、あなたをつかわされた運命の神に感謝を！
#. de: Ich danke dir! Wirklich ein Glück, dass du des Weges gekommen bist. Also dann, bin gleich wieder da!
#. fr: Votre bonté sera récompensée. J'ai des moyens et je compte bien vous remercier comme il se doit... une fois que j'aurai rejoint ma caravane, évidemment.
#. column 56: Out of all the places in this wide realm where you could be standing right now, praise the Wanderer for leading you here to me!
#. column 57: Let us just say that a few too many sips from the wineskin have left me...displaced from my companions, and now I find myself stranded here at the crossroads of nowhere and no place.
#. column 58: And as if it couldn't get any better for a poor man with a pea-sized bladder, I am now being stalked by what appears to be a pack of raptors, of all things. Would it be too much to ask for an escort to someplace less hostile?
#. column 59: Escort the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: O fickle goddess of fate, Nymeia! Why must You always pull away that which Oschon has so generously pushed into my path?
msgctxt "FateEvent:154:0:60"
msgid "Your kindness will not go unrewarded, friend. I am a man of means, and I mean to reward you...once I am safe again with my caravan, I mean."
msgstr "Доброе дело не останется без награды, друг. Я человек состоятельный и щедро тебя отблагодарю... когда доберусь до каравана, конечно."

#. ja: おお、運命の出会いではなかったのですね……。
#. de: Und ich dachte, jetzt wäre alles gut. \<seufz>
#. fr: Ô, Nymeia<nbsp>! Pourquoi m'enlèves-tu toujours ce qu'Oschon a si généreusement mis sur mon chemin<nbsp>? Et pourquoi mon chocobo est si peureux<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Out of all the places in this wide realm where you could be standing right now, praise the Wanderer for leading you here to me!
#. column 57: Let us just say that a few too many sips from the wineskin have left me...displaced from my companions, and now I find myself stranded here at the crossroads of nowhere and no place.
#. column 58: And as if it couldn't get any better for a poor man with a pea-sized bladder, I am now being stalked by what appears to be a pack of raptors, of all things. Would it be too much to ask for an escort to someplace less hostile?
#. column 59: Escort the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your kindness will not go unrewarded, friend. I am a man of means, and I mean to reward you...once I am safe again with my caravan, I mean.
msgctxt "FateEvent:154:0:62"
msgid "O fickle goddess of fate, Nymeia! Why must You always pull away that which Oschon has so generously pushed into my path?"
msgstr "О, непостоянная Нимея, богиня судьбы! Почему ты всегда отнимаешь то, что Ошон так щедро посылает мне на пути?"

#. ja: ジジルン、タマゴ、スキスキっちゃ！<br>キキルンみんな、タマゴ、スキスキっちゃ！
#. de: Jijiroon lieben Eier! Alle Qiqirn lieben Schalenschlüfen!
#. fr: Jijiroon aimer tous les œufs, les gros, les petits, les normaux. Jijiroon a jamais vu d'œufs carrés. Et vous<nbsp>?
#. column 57: No? Has adventurer seen a pelican egg? Pelican eggs are big eggs. Pelican eggs are round eggs. Big round tasty eggs are pelican eggs.
#. column 58: Jijiroon likes pelican eggs. Qiqirn like pelican eggs. Qiqirn trade sparklies for pelican eggs. Jijiroon trades sparklies for pelican eggs and then trades pelican eggs for more sparklies!
#. column 59: Trade pelican eggs with Jijiroon for sparklies?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Jijiroon's clever Qiqirn! Clever, clever Qiqirn!
#. column 62: No eggs, no sparklies... No sparklies, no eggs... No eggs, no supper...
msgctxt "FateEvent:155:0:56"
msgid "Jijiroon likes big eggs. Jijiroon likes small eggs. Jijiroon likes round eggs. Jijiroon likes square eggs. Jijiroon's not seen a square egg. Has adventurer seen a square egg?"
msgstr "Джиджирун любит большие яйца. И маленькие любит. Круглые тоже. Квадратные тоже любит. Но квадратных Джиджирун не видел. Искатель приключений видел квадратное яйцо?"

#. ja: ジジルン、タマゴ、ないないっちゃ！<br>ジジルン、タマゴ、あつめるっちゃ！
#. de: Aber keine Eier nirgends finden. Du haben Eier für Jijiroon? Du bringen schnell?
#. fr: Non<nbsp>? Et un œuf de pélican<nbsp>? Œufs de pélican être gros. Et ronds. Et avoir bon goût.
#. column 56: Jijiroon likes big eggs. Jijiroon likes small eggs. Jijiroon likes round eggs. Jijiroon likes square eggs. Jijiroon's not seen a square egg. Has adventurer seen a square egg?
#. column 58: Jijiroon likes pelican eggs. Qiqirn like pelican eggs. Qiqirn trade sparklies for pelican eggs. Jijiroon trades sparklies for pelican eggs and then trades pelican eggs for more sparklies!
#. column 59: Trade pelican eggs with Jijiroon for sparklies?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Jijiroon's clever Qiqirn! Clever, clever Qiqirn!
#. column 62: No eggs, no sparklies... No sparklies, no eggs... No eggs, no supper...
msgctxt "FateEvent:155:0:57"
msgid "No? Has adventurer seen a pelican egg? Pelican eggs are big eggs. Pelican eggs are round eggs. Big round tasty eggs are pelican eggs."
msgstr "Нет? А яйцо пеликана видел? Яйца пеликана большие. И круглые. Большие, круглые, вкусные яйца — это яйца пеликана."

#. ja: あっちに、ペリカン、いるいるっちゃ。<br>あなた、「ペリカンの卵」、とるとるっちゃ！
#. de: Pelikan haben gute Eier. Bringst du mir? Pelikan brauchen so viel nicht.
#. fr: Jijiroon aimer les œufs de pélican. Qiqirns échanger des clic clic contre des œufs de pélican. Jijiroon échanger des clic clic contre des œufs de pélican et puis des œufs de pélican contre plus de clic clic<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Jijiroon likes big eggs. Jijiroon likes small eggs. Jijiroon likes round eggs. Jijiroon likes square eggs. Jijiroon's not seen a square egg. Has adventurer seen a square egg?
#. column 57: No? Has adventurer seen a pelican egg? Pelican eggs are big eggs. Pelican eggs are round eggs. Big round tasty eggs are pelican eggs.
#. column 59: Trade pelican eggs with Jijiroon for sparklies?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Jijiroon's clever Qiqirn! Clever, clever Qiqirn!
#. column 62: No eggs, no sparklies... No sparklies, no eggs... No eggs, no supper...
msgctxt "FateEvent:155:0:58"
msgid "Jijiroon likes pelican eggs. Qiqirn like pelican eggs. Qiqirn trade sparklies for pelican eggs. Jijiroon trades sparklies for pelican eggs and then trades pelican eggs for more sparklies!"
msgstr "Джиджирун любит яйца пеликана. Кикирн любят яйца пеликана. Кикирн меняют блестяшки на яйца пеликана. Джиджирун меняет блестяшки на яйца пеликана, а потом яйца пеликана — на ещё больше блестяшек!"

#. ja: 「ペリカンの卵」をとってきてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Bringst du Jijiroon Pelikan-Eier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Échanger des œufs de pélican à Jijiroon contre des clic clic<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Jijiroon likes big eggs. Jijiroon likes small eggs. Jijiroon likes round eggs. Jijiroon likes square eggs. Jijiroon's not seen a square egg. Has adventurer seen a square egg?
#. column 57: No? Has adventurer seen a pelican egg? Pelican eggs are big eggs. Pelican eggs are round eggs. Big round tasty eggs are pelican eggs.
#. column 58: Jijiroon likes pelican eggs. Qiqirn like pelican eggs. Qiqirn trade sparklies for pelican eggs. Jijiroon trades sparklies for pelican eggs and then trades pelican eggs for more sparklies!
#. column 60: Jijiroon's clever Qiqirn! Clever, clever Qiqirn!
#. column 62: No eggs, no sparklies... No sparklies, no eggs... No eggs, no supper...
