#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:155:0:59"
msgid "Trade pelican eggs with Jijiroon for sparklies?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Обменять яйца пеликана у Джиджируна на блестяшки?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ジジルン、わくわくっちゃ……<br>タマゴ、わくわくっちゃ……
#. de: Juhui, juhu! Pelikan-Eier für Jijiroon!
#. fr: Jijiroon être un Qiqirn malin<nbsp>! Un Qiqirn très malin<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Jijiroon likes big eggs. Jijiroon likes small eggs. Jijiroon likes round eggs. Jijiroon likes square eggs. Jijiroon's not seen a square egg. Has adventurer seen a square egg?
#. column 57: No? Has adventurer seen a pelican egg? Pelican eggs are big eggs. Pelican eggs are round eggs. Big round tasty eggs are pelican eggs.
#. column 58: Jijiroon likes pelican eggs. Qiqirn like pelican eggs. Qiqirn trade sparklies for pelican eggs. Jijiroon trades sparklies for pelican eggs and then trades pelican eggs for more sparklies!
#. column 59: Trade pelican eggs with Jijiroon for sparklies?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: No eggs, no sparklies... No sparklies, no eggs... No eggs, no supper...
msgctxt "FateEvent:155:0:60"
msgid "Jijiroon's clever Qiqirn! Clever, clever Qiqirn!"
msgstr "Джиджирун — умный кикирн! Очень, очень умный!"

#. ja: ジジルン、しょんぼりっちゃ……<br>タマゴ、たべたいっちゃ……
#. de: Warum keine Eier für Jijiroon? Warum? Jijiroon doch hungrig! Qiqirn-Freunde alle viel hungrig.
#. fr: Pas d'œufs, pas de clic clic... Pas de clic clic, pas d'œufs... Et pas d'œufs, pas de miam miam...
#. column 56: Jijiroon likes big eggs. Jijiroon likes small eggs. Jijiroon likes round eggs. Jijiroon likes square eggs. Jijiroon's not seen a square egg. Has adventurer seen a square egg?
#. column 57: No? Has adventurer seen a pelican egg? Pelican eggs are big eggs. Pelican eggs are round eggs. Big round tasty eggs are pelican eggs.
#. column 58: Jijiroon likes pelican eggs. Qiqirn like pelican eggs. Qiqirn trade sparklies for pelican eggs. Jijiroon trades sparklies for pelican eggs and then trades pelican eggs for more sparklies!
#. column 59: Trade pelican eggs with Jijiroon for sparklies?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Jijiroon's clever Qiqirn! Clever, clever Qiqirn!
msgctxt "FateEvent:155:0:62"
msgid "No eggs, no sparklies... No sparklies, no eggs... No eggs, no supper..."
msgstr "Нет яиц — нет блестяшек... Нет блестяшек — нет яиц... Нет яиц — нет ужина..."

#. ja: 「ペリカンの卵」、あるあるっちゃ？
#. de: Du bringen schon Eier von Pelikan für Jijiroon?
#. fr: Aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> avoir des œufs pour Jijiroon<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Oh ho! Jijiroon must keep paws from oh, so tasty eggs. Tasty eggs mean sparkly sparklies. Jijiroon loves his sparklies!
#. column 62: Greedy adventurer hoards tasty eggs for greedy self! Might Jijiroon's sparklies have not enough sparkle?
msgctxt "FateEvent:156:0:56"
msgid "Adventurer has eggs for Jijiroon?"
msgstr "У искателя приключений есть яйца для Джиджируна?"

#. ja: ジジルン、うきうきっちゃ。<br>もっともっと、くれくれっちゃ！
#. de: Juhu, viel köstlich Eier du bringen! Viel! Noch mehr!
#. fr: Oh ho<nbsp>! Jijiroon devoir éviter de toucher les œufs délicieux. Œufs donner des clic clic. Jijiroon adorer les clic clic<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Adventurer has eggs for Jijiroon?
#. column 62: Greedy adventurer hoards tasty eggs for greedy self! Might Jijiroon's sparklies have not enough sparkle?
msgctxt "FateEvent:156:0:60"
msgid "Oh ho! Jijiroon must keep paws from oh, so tasty eggs. Tasty eggs mean sparkly sparklies. Jijiroon loves his sparklies!"
msgstr "О-хо! Джиджирун должен не трогать такие вкусные яйца. Вкусные яйца — это блестяшки. Джиджирун любит блестяшки!"

#. ja: 「ペリカンの卵」、もっともっと、くれくれっちゃ！
#. de: Juhu, viel köstlich Eier du bringen! Viel! Noch mehr!
#. fr: Aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>  vouloir garder les œufs pour <if $gn4>elle<else>lui</if><nbsp>! Clic clic de Jijiroon pas briller assez<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Adventurer has eggs for Jijiroon?
#. column 60: Oh ho! Jijiroon must keep paws from oh, so tasty eggs. Tasty eggs mean sparkly sparklies. Jijiroon loves his sparklies!
msgctxt "FateEvent:156:0:62"
msgid "Greedy adventurer hoards tasty eggs for greedy self! Might Jijiroon's sparklies have not enough sparkle?"
msgstr "Жадный искатель приключений прячет вкусные яйца у себя! Может, блестяшки Джиджируна недостаточно блестят?"

#. ja: 「ペリカンの卵」、くれくれっちゃ！
#. de: Du bringen Eier von Pelikan!
#. fr: Plus d'œufs, plus de clic clic... Pas d'œufs, pas de clic clic<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:157:0:56"
msgid "More eggs, more sparklies! No eggs, no sparklies!"
msgstr "Больше яиц — больше блестяшек! Нет яиц — нет блестяшек!"

#. ja: 「ペリカンの卵」、もりもりっちゃ！<br>これで、ちゃりちゃり、もりもりっちゃ！
#. de: Waa, viel Pelikan-Eier! Jijiroon können fast nicht tragen so viel!
#. fr: Plus d'œufs, plus de clic clic... Encore des œufs, encore des clic clic<nbsp>!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:158:0:56"
msgid "Enough eggs, enough sparklies... More eggs, <i>more</i> sparklies!"
msgstr "Яиц хватит, блестяшек тоже... Больше яиц — <i>больше</i> блестяшек!"

#. ja: 「ペリカンの卵」、もりもり、うれしいっちゃ！<br>もっともりもり、ほしいっちゃ！
#. de: Waa, viel Pelikan-Eier! Jijiroon können fast nicht tragen so viel!
#. fr: Aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> avoir des œufs pour Jijiroon<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Oh ho! Jijiroon cannot keep paws from oh, so tasty eggs. Tasty eggs are oh, so tasty. Jijiroon has enough sparklies. Jijiroon cannot eat sparklies! Jijiroon <i>can</i> eat tasty eggs!
#. column 62: Greedy adventurer hoards tasty eggs for greedy self! Might Jijiroon's sparklies have not enough sparkle?
msgctxt "FateEvent:159:0:56"
msgid "Adventurer has more eggs for Jijiroon? More eggs means more sparklies! Or maybe...Jijiroon eats more tasty eggs!"
msgstr "У искателя приключений ещё яйца для Джиджируна? Больше яиц — больше блестяшек! Или... Джиджирун съест ещё больше вкусных яиц!"

#. ja: ジジルン、ルンルンっちゃ。<br>もっともりもり、くれくれっちゃ！
#. de: Jijiroon glücklich! Jijiroon fröhlich! Du bringen noch mehr fröhliche Ei!
#. fr: Oh ho<nbsp>! Jijiroon devoir éviter de toucher les œufs délicieux. Œufs donner des clic clic. Jijiroon adorer les clic clic<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Adventurer has more eggs for Jijiroon? More eggs means more sparklies! Or maybe...Jijiroon eats more tasty eggs!
#. column 62: Greedy adventurer hoards tasty eggs for greedy self! Might Jijiroon's sparklies have not enough sparkle?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:159:0:60"
msgid "Oh ho! Jijiroon cannot keep paws from oh, so tasty eggs. Tasty eggs are oh, so tasty. Jijiroon has enough sparklies. Jijiroon cannot eat sparklies! Jijiroon <i>can</i> eat tasty eggs!"
msgstr "О-хо! Джиджирун не может удержаться от таких вкусных яиц. Вкусные яйца — такие вкусные! Блестяшек у Джиджируна уже достаточно. Блестяшки не съешь! А вкусные яйца <i>можно</i> съесть!"

#. ja: ジジルン、ワクワクっちゃ。<br>タマゴ、もりもり、ワクワクっちゃ！
#. de: Keine Ei? Du bringen schnell noch mehr fröhliche Ei für Jijiroon.
#. fr: Aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>  vouloir garder les œufs pour <if $gn4>elle<else>lui</if><nbsp>! Clic clic de Jijiroon pas briller assez<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Adventurer has more eggs for Jijiroon? More eggs means more sparklies! Or maybe...Jijiroon eats more tasty eggs!
#. column 60: Oh ho! Jijiroon cannot keep paws from oh, so tasty eggs. Tasty eggs are oh, so tasty. Jijiroon has enough sparklies. Jijiroon cannot eat sparklies! Jijiroon <i>can</i> eat tasty eggs!
msgctxt "FateEvent:159:0:62"
msgid "Greedy adventurer hoards tasty eggs for greedy self! Might Jijiroon's sparklies have not enough sparkle?"
msgstr "Жадный искатель приключений прячет вкусные яйца у себя! Может, блестяшки Джиджируна недостаточно блестят?"

#. ja: ああっ、助けて冒険者さんっ！<br>お願いします、他に頼れる人いないんですぅっ！
#. de: Zu Hilf, Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>! Niemand außer dir kann uns retten!
#. fr: Pourquoi suis-je si mal<shy>chan<shy>ceu<shy>se<nbsp>? J'avais enfin rencontré un homme bien<nbsp>: grand, séduisant, affectueux. Je l'invite à une après-midi romantique à la mare de l'Espoir pour pêcher et écouter le bruit du vent dans les feuilles.
#. column 57: But what happens on the path home? What <i>always</i> happens! We're attacked by a pack of lindwurms! And of course, the gentleman he is, my love sacrifices himself to the creatures that I might escape unscathed. And so here I sit, twenty summers gone since my first nameday, and still without husband.
#. column 58: Oh, and I almost forgot. The lindwurms have finished devouring my soulmate and now they are after me. Perhaps I should just sit here and allow them to ravage my flesh... Is there no one who will come to my rescue?
#. column 59: Help the damsel in distress?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I am coming, Gerard...or was it Gerald. No, Gerald was last week...though, I suppose he'll be there, too.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:160:0:56"
msgid "Why must I have such ill luck? I <i>finally</i> meet a good man─tall, handsome, caring─and invite him out for a romantic afternoon on Hopeseed Pond, just the two of us, casting our lines into the calm water as we listen to the forest whisper."
msgstr "Ну почему мне так не везёт? Я <i>наконец-то</i> встретила хорошего мужчину — высокого, красивого, заботливого — и пригласила его на романтическую прогулку к пруду Надежды. Только мы вдвоём, удочки в спокойной воде, а лес шепчет нам на ухо."

#. ja: 森で働いていたら、「リンドヴルム」に襲われたんです！<br>慌てて、何とかここまで逃げてきたんですけど……<br>しつこくて、まだ追うのを諦めてません！
#. de: Wir waren friedlich bei der Ernte, da hat uns ein Lindwurm angegriffen! Wir sind gerannt, was wir konnten! So was Schreckliches habe ich ja noch nie gesehen!
#. fr: Mais qu'est-ce qui se passe sur le chemin du retour<nbsp>? Ce qu'il se passe à chaque fois<nbsp>! Des lindwurms s'en sont pris à nous<nbsp>! Et mon amour a donné sa vie pour que je puisse m'échapper. Et me voilà vingt ans plus tard, toujours sans mari.
#. column 56: Why must I have such ill luck? I <i>finally</i> meet a good man─tall, handsome, caring─and invite him out for a romantic afternoon on Hopeseed Pond, just the two of us, casting our lines into the calm water as we listen to the forest whisper.
#. column 58: Oh, and I almost forgot. The lindwurms have finished devouring my soulmate and now they are after me. Perhaps I should just sit here and allow them to ravage my flesh... Is there no one who will come to my rescue?
#. column 59: Help the damsel in distress?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I am coming, Gerard...or was it Gerald. No, Gerald was last week...though, I suppose he'll be there, too.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:160:0:57"
msgid "But what happens on the path home? What <i>always</i> happens! We're attacked by a pack of lindwurms! And of course, the gentleman he is, my love sacrifices himself to the creatures that I might escape unscathed. And so here I sit, twenty summers gone since my first nameday, and still without husband."
msgstr "Но что случилось по дороге домой? То, что <i>всегда</i> случается! На нас напала стая линдвурмов! И, конечно, мой возлюбленный, истинный джентльмен, пожертвовал собой, чтобы я спаслась. И вот мне уже двадцать лет, а мужа всё нет."

#. ja: お願いします、冒険者さん！<br>あの恐ろしい「リンドヴルム」を退治してください！
#. de: Er lauert immer noch auf uns! Bitte, bitte vernichte das garstige Tier!
#. fr: Oh, j'ai failli oublier. Les lindwurms ont fini de dévorer mon âme sœur et en ont désormais après moi. Je devrais peut-être attendre qu'ils s'occupent de moi. Personne ne viendra donc à mon secours<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Why must I have such ill luck? I <i>finally</i> meet a good man─tall, handsome, caring─and invite him out for a romantic afternoon on Hopeseed Pond, just the two of us, casting our lines into the calm water as we listen to the forest whisper.
#. column 57: But what happens on the path home? What <i>always</i> happens! We're attacked by a pack of lindwurms! And of course, the gentleman he is, my love sacrifices himself to the creatures that I might escape unscathed. And so here I sit, twenty summers gone since my first nameday, and still without husband.
#. column 59: Help the damsel in distress?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I am coming, Gerard...or was it Gerald. No, Gerald was last week...though, I suppose he'll be there, too.
msgctxt "FateEvent:160:0:58"
msgid "Oh, and I almost forgot. The lindwurms have finished devouring my soulmate and now they are after me. Perhaps I should just sit here and allow them to ravage my flesh... Is there no one who will come to my rescue?"
msgstr "Ой, чуть не забыла. Линдвурмы уже доели мою родственную душу и теперь охотятся за мной. Может, мне просто сидеть и ждать, пока они растерзают меня?.. Неужели никто не придёт на помощь?"

#. ja: 退治しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du den Lindwurm beseitigen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Secourir la demoiselle en détresse<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Why must I have such ill luck? I <i>finally</i> meet a good man─tall, handsome, caring─and invite him out for a romantic afternoon on Hopeseed Pond, just the two of us, casting our lines into the calm water as we listen to the forest whisper.
#. column 57: But what happens on the path home? What <i>always</i> happens! We're attacked by a pack of lindwurms! And of course, the gentleman he is, my love sacrifices himself to the creatures that I might escape unscathed. And so here I sit, twenty summers gone since my first nameday, and still without husband.
#. column 58: Oh, and I almost forgot. The lindwurms have finished devouring my soulmate and now they are after me. Perhaps I should just sit here and allow them to ravage my flesh... Is there no one who will come to my rescue?
#. column 62: I am coming, Gerard...or was it Gerald. No, Gerald was last week...though, I suppose he'll be there, too.
