msgctxt "FateEvent:160:0:59"
msgid "Help the damsel in distress?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь попавшей в беду девушке?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そ、そんな……。<br>こんな残酷なことがあっていいの……！？
#. de: D-Du kannst uns doch nicht einfach unserem Schicksal überlassen!?
#. fr: J'arrive, Gerard... Gerald<nbsp>? Non, Gerald, c'était la semaine dernière... Enfin, je pense qu'il y sera également.
#. column 56: Why must I have such ill luck? I <i>finally</i> meet a good man─tall, handsome, caring─and invite him out for a romantic afternoon on Hopeseed Pond, just the two of us, casting our lines into the calm water as we listen to the forest whisper.
#. column 57: But what happens on the path home? What <i>always</i> happens! We're attacked by a pack of lindwurms! And of course, the gentleman he is, my love sacrifices himself to the creatures that I might escape unscathed. And so here I sit, twenty summers gone since my first nameday, and still without husband.
#. column 58: Oh, and I almost forgot. The lindwurms have finished devouring my soulmate and now they are after me. Perhaps I should just sit here and allow them to ravage my flesh... Is there no one who will come to my rescue?
#. column 59: Help the damsel in distress?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:160:0:62"
msgid "I am coming, Gerard...or was it Gerald. No, Gerald was last week...though, I suppose he'll be there, too."
msgstr "Я уже иду, Джеральд... Или всё-таки Джерард? Нет, Джеральд был на прошлой неделе... Хотя, думаю, и он там будет."

#. ja: あなた、誰でふっち？<br>もちかちて、手伝ってくれるのでふっち？
#. de: Oh, <if $gn4>eine Abenteurige<else>ein Abenteuriger</if>!
#. fr: Ah, un<if $gn4>e aventurière<else> aventurier</if><nbsp>! Je me nomme Phanaxio et j'ai besoin de vous.
#. column 57: This one stands in a sad, sad place, soaked with the blood of many friendly ones. This one's companions were slain by touched ones for refusing to bend to their dark design.
#. column 58: This one only wishes to gather fallen ones' belongings, so that fallen ones may be returned to a place more proper than this. Would spoken one who stands here now hear this one's humble entreaty?
#. column 59: Collect the effects of the fallen sylphs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: This one is gladdened at spoken one's response. This one shall wait here for the items.
#. column 62: This one is saddened by spoken one's response, but understands that it cannot be helped. This one will endure...
msgctxt "FateEvent:161:0:56"
msgid "Ah, visiting one! This one is Phanaxio of the New Leaf. This one seeks aid from one who seeks to give it."
msgstr "А, путник! Я Фанаксио из Нового Листа. Ищу того, кто готов прийти на помощь."

#. ja: ここでなかまがたくさん死んでた、悲ちい場所でふっち。<br>ここには、たいせつななかまのもちものが落ちてるふっち。<br>なかまのもちもの、集めてあげたいでふっち。
#. de: Hier sind Freundinnen der Meinigen gestorben. Die Finstrigen haben sie umgebracht. Die Meinige sucht nach Andenken an die Beklagenswertigen ...
#. fr: Nous sommes à un endroit bien triste où a été versée une énorme quantité de sang. Mes compagnons ont été tués par les dénaturés, car ils refusaient de participer à leur plan.
#. column 56: Ah, visiting one! This one is Phanaxio of the New Leaf. This one seeks aid from one who seeks to give it.
#. column 58: This one only wishes to gather fallen ones' belongings, so that fallen ones may be returned to a place more proper than this. Would spoken one who stands here now hear this one's humble entreaty?
#. column 59: Collect the effects of the fallen sylphs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: This one is gladdened at spoken one's response. This one shall wait here for the items.
#. column 62: This one is saddened by spoken one's response, but understands that it cannot be helped. This one will endure...
msgctxt "FateEvent:161:0:57"
msgid "This one stands in a sad, sad place, soaked with the blood of many friendly ones. This one's companions were slain by touched ones for refusing to bend to their dark design."
msgstr "Это место — печальное, печальное. Оно залито кровью многих наших. Моих спутников убили осквернённые за то, что те отказались участвовать в их тёмном замысле."

#. ja: お願いでふっち、<br>なかまの思いでの持ち物、あつめてほちいんでふっち！
#. de: Kann <if $gn4>die<else>der</if> Hilfsbereitige der Meinigen helfen?
#. fr: Je veux simplement récupérer leurs affaires. N'allez-vous pas répondre à ma prière<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Ah, visiting one! This one is Phanaxio of the New Leaf. This one seeks aid from one who seeks to give it.
#. column 57: This one stands in a sad, sad place, soaked with the blood of many friendly ones. This one's companions were slain by touched ones for refusing to bend to their dark design.
#. column 59: Collect the effects of the fallen sylphs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: This one is gladdened at spoken one's response. This one shall wait here for the items.
#. column 62: This one is saddened by spoken one's response, but understands that it cannot be helped. This one will endure...
msgctxt "FateEvent:161:0:58"
msgid "This one only wishes to gather fallen ones' belongings, so that fallen ones may be returned to a place more proper than this. Would spoken one who stands here now hear this one's humble entreaty?"
msgstr "Я хочу лишь собрать вещи павших, чтобы они вернулись туда, где им и место, а не остались здесь. Неужели путник, что стоит передо мной, не откликнется на мою смиренную просьбу?"

#. ja: シルフの遺品を集めますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der Sylphe beim Suchen helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Récupérer les effets des Sylphes disparus<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Ah, visiting one! This one is Phanaxio of the New Leaf. This one seeks aid from one who seeks to give it.
#. column 57: This one stands in a sad, sad place, soaked with the blood of many friendly ones. This one's companions were slain by touched ones for refusing to bend to their dark design.
#. column 58: This one only wishes to gather fallen ones' belongings, so that fallen ones may be returned to a place more proper than this. Would spoken one who stands here now hear this one's humble entreaty?
#. column 60: This one is gladdened at spoken one's response. This one shall wait here for the items.
#. column 62: This one is saddened by spoken one's response, but understands that it cannot be helped. This one will endure...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
