#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:161:0:59"
msgid "Collect the effects of the fallen sylphs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Собрать вещи павших сильфов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとふっち、助かるふっち。<br>でも、わるいシルフもきてるふっち。<br>気をつけるでふっち。
#. de: Vielen Dank <if $gn4>der<else>dem</if> Mitgefühligen! Doch <if $gn4>sie<else>er</if> muss sich vor den finstrigen Sylphen in Acht nehmen!
#. fr: Votre réponse me plaît. J'attendrai ici que vous rapportiez les objets.
#. column 56: Ah, visiting one! This one is Phanaxio of the New Leaf. This one seeks aid from one who seeks to give it.
#. column 57: This one stands in a sad, sad place, soaked with the blood of many friendly ones. This one's companions were slain by touched ones for refusing to bend to their dark design.
#. column 58: This one only wishes to gather fallen ones' belongings, so that fallen ones may be returned to a place more proper than this. Would spoken one who stands here now hear this one's humble entreaty?
#. column 59: Collect the effects of the fallen sylphs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: This one is saddened by spoken one's response, but understands that it cannot be helped. This one will endure...
msgctxt "FateEvent:161:0:60"
msgid "This one is gladdened at spoken one's response. This one shall wait here for the items."
msgstr "Я рад ответу путника. Буду ждать здесь, пока вы не принесёте вещи."

#. ja: ううっ、ちもなみだもないでふっち。<br>あなたなんかキライでふっち、かえれかえれでふっち！
#. de: Oh, <if $gn4>die<else>der</if> Herzlosige! <if $gn4>Sie<else>Er</if> soll fortgehen!
#. fr: Votre réponse me cloue le bec, mais je vais devoir faire avec...
#. column 56: Ah, visiting one! This one is Phanaxio of the New Leaf. This one seeks aid from one who seeks to give it.
#. column 57: This one stands in a sad, sad place, soaked with the blood of many friendly ones. This one's companions were slain by touched ones for refusing to bend to their dark design.
#. column 58: This one only wishes to gather fallen ones' belongings, so that fallen ones may be returned to a place more proper than this. Would spoken one who stands here now hear this one's humble entreaty?
#. column 59: Collect the effects of the fallen sylphs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: This one is gladdened at spoken one's response. This one shall wait here for the items.
msgctxt "FateEvent:161:0:62"
msgid "This one is saddened by spoken one's response, but understands that it cannot be helped. This one will endure..."
msgstr "Мне печален ответ путника, но ничего не поделаешь. Я потерплю..."

#. ja: なかまのもちもの、持ってきたでふっち？
#. de: Hat <if $gn4>die<else>der</if> Hilfsbereitige Andenken gefunden?
#. fr: Avez-vous réussi à réunir les effets de mes amis<nbsp>?
#. column 60: This one cannot express the feelings that well in this one's heart. Yet, the search is not over. There are still more items to be found.
#. column 62: Then this one shall wait.
msgctxt "FateEvent:162:0:56"
msgid "Has spoken one found the effects of fallen brave ones?"
msgstr "Путник нашёл вещи павших храбрецов?"

#. ja: ありがとふっち。<br>もっとお願いするでふっち。
#. de: Vielen Dank! Vielleicht findet <if $gn4>die<else>der</if> Deinige ja noch mehr Sachen der Getötigen!
#. fr: Jamais je ne pourrai vous remercier assez<nbsp>!<br>Mais il reste des objets à trouver.
#. column 56: Has spoken one found the effects of fallen brave ones?
#. column 62: Then this one shall wait.
msgctxt "FateEvent:162:0:60"
msgid "This one cannot express the feelings that well in this one's heart. Yet, the search is not over. There are still more items to be found."
msgstr "Я не в силах выразить, что у меня на сердце. Но поиски ещё не закончены. Осталось найти другие вещи."

#. ja: ものがないでふっち？
#. de: Keine Andenken an die Getötigen mehr?
#. fr: Si c'est comme cela, <br>Je pense que cela attendra.
#. column 56: Has spoken one found the effects of fallen brave ones?
#. column 60: This one cannot express the feelings that well in this one's heart. Yet, the search is not over. There are still more items to be found.
msgctxt "FateEvent:162:0:62"
msgid "Then this one shall wait."
msgstr "Тогда я буду ждать."

#. ja: なかまのもの、集めてるでふっち。<br>見つけたら持ってくるでふっち。
#. de: Die Meinige sucht Andenken an getötige Freundinnen. <if $gn4>Die<else>Der</if> Deinige soll helfen!
#. fr: Si nous voulons que leur mémoire perdure, nous devons rassembler les effets de mes compagnons.<br>J'attendrai votre retour dans les environs.
msgctxt "FateEvent:163:0:56"
msgid "The effects of this one's fallen companions must be gathered if fallen ones' memories are to endure. Here this one shall wait until all have been found."
msgstr "Надо собрать вещи павших спутников, чтобы память о них жила. Я буду ждать здесь, пока всё не найдётся."

#. ja: いっぱい集まって、うれちいでふっち。<br>でも、もっとあったら、ほしいでふっち。
#. de: Die Meinige ist glücklich! Aber noch mehr Andenken sind noch besser!
#. fr: Je suis si triste d'avoir perdu mes compagnons, mais en récupérant leurs effets,<br>Nous leur permettrons de vivre dans nos mémoires à tout jamais.
msgctxt "FateEvent:164:0:56"
msgid "This one is filled with sorrow for the loss of close companions, but the return of these keepsakes will ensure fallen ones' memories endure for all time."
msgstr "Я скорблю о близких спутниках, которых потерял, но эти памятные вещи помогут сохранить их память навеки."

#. ja: まだあるのでふっち？<br>あるなら、もらってあげたいでふっち。
#. de: <if $gn4>Die<else>Der</if> Hilfreichige hat so viele Andenken gefunden! Die Meinige nimmt gern noch mehr!
#. fr: Avez-vous trouvé d'autres effets de mes compagnons décédés<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Spoken one is more resourceful than this one could have ever imagined. Further thanks are in order.
#. column 62: Then this one shall make ready to take the items on one final journey.
msgctxt "FateEvent:165:0:56"
msgid "Has spoken one found further effects of fallen brave ones?"
msgstr "Путник нашёл ещё вещи павших храбрецов?"

#. ja: ありがとふっち。<br>たくさんたくさん、あるほうがいいふっち。
#. de: Vielen Dank. Jedes Andenken ist der Meinigen willkommen!
#. fr: Jamais je n'aurais imaginé que vous soyez à la hauteur.<br>Je vous remercie de tout cœur.
#. column 56: Has spoken one found further effects of fallen brave ones?
#. column 62: Then this one shall make ready to take the items on one final journey.
msgctxt "FateEvent:165:0:60"
msgid "Spoken one is more resourceful than this one could have ever imagined. Further thanks are in order."
msgstr "Путник оказался куда находчивее, чем я мог представить. Благодарности моей нет конца."

#. ja: そうでふっち？<br>ないなら、なくてもいいでふっち。
#. de: Aber wenn <if $gn4>die<else>der</if> Deinige noch Andenken findet, freut sich die Meinige sehr!
#. fr: Je vais me préparer à emporter tous ces objets.
#. column 56: Has spoken one found further effects of fallen brave ones?
#. column 60: Spoken one is more resourceful than this one could have ever imagined. Further thanks are in order.
msgctxt "FateEvent:165:0:62"
msgid "Then this one shall make ready to take the items on one final journey."
msgstr "Тогда я приготовлюсь отнести эти вещи в последнее путешествие."

#. ja: ん、何を揉めてるかって？<br>実は彼、ここを出禁になっててねぇ。<br>お引き取り願おうとしているのさ。
#. de: Was ist? Beobachte mich gefälligst nicht, während ich meinen Mut zusammenkratze. Ich muss den Typen da drüben rauswerfen, den Mamool Ja.
#. fr: Pourquoi toutes ces histoires<nbsp>? Eh bien, à cause de ce... type. Bien qu'on lui ait interdit l'accès aux sources, il continue de s'y rendre chaque jour et d'importuner nos autres clients, alors qu'il sait qu'il n'est plus le bienvenu ici.
#. column 57: Oh, but it is not what you think. We haven't banned him for what he <i>is</i>, but for what he has <i>done</i>─namely exposing himself to several of the other bathers.
#. column 58: It is my duty to escort him off the premises, but just look at the size of him! Without several extra helping hands, I fear that this will not end well for me or the springs. Might you lend me your blade?
#. column 59: Drive the debaucher from the springs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, then wish me the Spinner's luck, because I will most definitely need it... Ulp!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:166:0:56"
msgid "What is all the fuss, you ask? Why, it is this...this...<i>thing</i>, that is what. Though forbidden entry to the springs, he insists on returning each and every day to disturb our other customers."
msgstr "В чём тут шум? Да вот из-за этого... этого... <i>чудища</i>. Ему запретили входить в источники, но он упорно возвращается туда каждый день и мешает другим посетителям."

#. ja: マムージャ族の湯浴みの踊りが卑猥だと、<br>ほかの客から苦情が殺到してるもんで、<br>やめるよう頼んでるんだが、聞いてくれなくてね……。
#. de: Er hört einfach nicht auf, vor den anderen Badegästen zu tanzen, verstehst du? Das geht aber nicht! Keine Tänze im Bad!
#. fr: Oh, mais n'allez pas croire qu'il a été banni à cause de ce qu'il est, mais à cause de ce qu'il a fait, c'est-à-dire s'exhiber devant les autres baigneurs et exécuter une danse qui est, comment dire... obscène, c'est le mot, oui. Nous avons reçu de nombreuses plaintes, hélas.
#. column 56: What is all the fuss, you ask? Why, it is this...this...<i>thing</i>, that is what. Though forbidden entry to the springs, he insists on returning each and every day to disturb our other customers.
#. column 58: It is my duty to escort him off the premises, but just look at the size of him! Without several extra helping hands, I fear that this will not end well for me or the springs. Might you lend me your blade?
#. column 59: Drive the debaucher from the springs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, then wish me the Spinner's luck, because I will most definitely need it... Ulp!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:166:0:57"
msgid "Oh, but it is not what you think. We haven't banned him for what he <i>is</i>, but for what he has <i>done</i>─namely exposing himself to several of the other bathers."
msgstr "Но вы всё не так поняли. Мы запретили ему входить не за то, <i>кто</i> он, а за то, что он <i>сделал</i>, — а именно выставлял себя напоказ перед другими купальщиками."

#. ja: もはや、腕ずくで止めるしかない状況さ。<br>よければ、あんたも手を貸してくれないか？
#. de: Ich weiß nicht, welchen Teil von „Nein“ er nicht versteht, aber wir müssen ihn rausbefördern. Hilfst du mir?
#. fr: Je dois le faire sortir, mais regardez-moi ce colosse<nbsp>! Sans aide, je crains que les choses ne tournent pas à mon avantage. Accepteriez-vous de m'aider, avant que je perde tous mes clients<nbsp>?
#. column 56: What is all the fuss, you ask? Why, it is this...this...<i>thing</i>, that is what. Though forbidden entry to the springs, he insists on returning each and every day to disturb our other customers.
#. column 57: Oh, but it is not what you think. We haven't banned him for what he <i>is</i>, but for what he has <i>done</i>─namely exposing himself to several of the other bathers.
#. column 59: Drive the debaucher from the springs?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, then wish me the Spinner's luck, because I will most definitely need it... Ulp!
msgctxt "FateEvent:166:0:58"
msgid "It is my duty to escort him off the premises, but just look at the size of him! Without several extra helping hands, I fear that this will not end well for me or the springs. Might you lend me your blade?"
msgstr "Я должен вывести его отсюда, но только посмотрите, какой он огромный! Без помощи нескольких человек всё может плохо кончиться и для меня, и для источников. Не поможете мне?"

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du, den Mamool Ja zu bändigen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter le Mamool Ja obscène loin des sources<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: What is all the fuss, you ask? Why, it is this...this...<i>thing</i>, that is what. Though forbidden entry to the springs, he insists on returning each and every day to disturb our other customers.
#. column 57: Oh, but it is not what you think. We haven't banned him for what he <i>is</i>, but for what he has <i>done</i>─namely exposing himself to several of the other bathers.
#. column 58: It is my duty to escort him off the premises, but just look at the size of him! Without several extra helping hands, I fear that this will not end well for me or the springs. Might you lend me your blade?
#. column 62: Well, then wish me the Spinner's luck, because I will most definitely need it... Ulp!
