msgid "Accompany the merchant to the plant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить купца до завода?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: なんだ、冷やかしですか。<br>だったら……帰ってくれませんかね？
#. de: Hm! Du versäumst die Gelegenheit deines Lebens, alles über Seim und Schein zu erfahren, das sag ich dir.
#. fr: Mais je vous aurais donné l'argent que je leur avais promis<nbsp>! Cela ne vous suffit pas<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Tell me, did you happen to see a pair of double-crossing snakes on your way here? No, I suppose you did not. But that is no longer of any matter. What matters is the opportunity that sits here before each of us. That is, unless you are a double-crossing snake as well.
#. column 57: Look around. What do you see? Does this look like any place for an unarmed merchant? No it does not. Then what, you ask, am I doing here? I'd like to know the answer myself! One moment I was on my way to discuss business at the Ceruleum Processing Plant, flanked by a pair of burly Hellsguards, the next I'm all by my lonesome.
#. column 58: Yes, perhaps there was talk of me halving their pay on account of their not having slain a single beast since that ladybug outside Stonesthrow...but that is beside the point! They could have at least waited until we had arrived at the plant and I had paid them their half before leaving me. And now, here I am, short one escort...
#. column 59: Accompany the merchant to the plant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:167:0:62"
msgid "But I'll pay you with the money I promised the others! Is that not enough incentive!?"
msgstr "Но я же заплачу тебе обещанные им деньги! Разве этого мало?"

#. ja: 冒険者さん、力を貸してください！<br>この地で蛮神イフリートのテンパードたちが、<br>蛮神を崇め奉る儀式をしようとしているようなんです！
#. de: Geh nicht weiter, Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>! Die von Ifrit Besessenen wollen eine Zeremonie für ihren Feuergott abhalten!
#. fr: Un éclaireur vient de rentrer avec de tristes nouvelles. Un groupe d'Amalj'aa accompagné d'esclaves subjugués vient de commencer un rite d'invocation tout près d'ici. Vous savez ce que cela veut dire, bien sûr. Ifrit<nbsp>! Le Primordial de feu pourrait apparaître à tout moment<nbsp>!
#. column 57: While I do not doubt my unit would fight bravely if it came to battle with the Lord of the Inferno, I fear we would be overmatched and their deaths would be for naught. However, those Amalj'aa who conduct the rites, they we may be able to handle.
#. column 58: With some help...of course. If we can engage the lizards and the tempered and distract them long enough to destroy the glowing cresset used in the rites, we may be able to thwart their plans and drive them back to Zahar'ak. Will you join us?
#. column 59: Aid the recruit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then we shall do the deed without you. Such is our duty, such is our destiny.
msgctxt "FateEvent:168:0:56"
msgid "A scout has just returned bearing ill tidings. A party of Amalj'aa and their tempered slaves have begun a summoning rite nearby. Do you know what that means, fool? Ifrit! The hells-damned primal could be here breathing fire down our necks any moment!"
msgstr "Разведчик только что вернулся с дурными вестями. Неподалёку отряд амалджа вместе со своими порабощёнными рабами начал ритуал призыва. Знаете, что это значит, глупцы? Ифрит! Проклятый праймал может в любую минуту явиться и опалить нас своим дыханием!"

#. ja: これ以上、蛮神イフリートに力をつけられては、<br>我らが不滅隊にとってよい結果は生まれないでしょう……。
#. de: Wenn Ifrits Macht dadurch noch weiter wächst, ist nicht abzusehen, was noch passiert! Und die Legion der Unsterblichen muss dann als Erstes ausrücken.
#. fr: Je sais que mon unité se battrait avec courage contre le Primordial des flammes infernales, mais je crains qu'il n'ait le dessus et que mes hommes meurent pour rien. Cependant, nous pourrions peut-être maîtriser les Amalj'aa qui effectuent le rite.
#. column 56: A scout has just returned bearing ill tidings. A party of Amalj'aa and their tempered slaves have begun a summoning rite nearby. Do you know what that means, fool? Ifrit! The hells-damned primal could be here breathing fire down our necks any moment!
#. column 58: With some help...of course. If we can engage the lizards and the tempered and distract them long enough to destroy the glowing cresset used in the rites, we may be able to thwart their plans and drive them back to Zahar'ak. Will you join us?
#. column 59: Aid the recruit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then we shall do the deed without you. Such is our duty, such is our destiny.
msgctxt "FateEvent:168:0:57"
msgid "While I do not doubt my unit would fight bravely if it came to battle with the Lord of the Inferno, I fear we would be overmatched and their deaths would be for naught. However, those Amalj'aa who conduct the rites, they we may be able to handle."
msgstr "Мои бойцы будут сражаться храбро, если нам придётся столкнуться с Владыкой Пламени. Но боюсь, нам его не одолеть, и они погибнут напрасно. А вот с амалджаа, проводящими обряд, мы, возможно, справимся."

#. ja: 奴らが儀式に使っている祭器があるはずです。<br>儀式を仕切るアマルジャ族の祭司・警備兵ともども、<br>この地より排除してはもらえないでしょうか！？
#. de: Es gibt bestimmt ein zentrales Zeremonialobjekt. Das müssen wir vernichten, und die Priester und Wachen der Amalj'aa gleich mit!
#. fr: Il nous faudra juste un petit coup de main. Si nous attaquons les Amalj'aa et leurs esclaves, nous ferons diversion suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment longtemps pour détruire le crasset flamboyant utilisé pour le rite. Ainsi, nous pourrions contrecarrer leur plan et les repousser jusqu'à Zahar'ak. Voulez-vous vous joindre à nous<nbsp>?
#. column 56: A scout has just returned bearing ill tidings. A party of Amalj'aa and their tempered slaves have begun a summoning rite nearby. Do you know what that means, fool? Ifrit! The hells-damned primal could be here breathing fire down our necks any moment!
#. column 57: While I do not doubt my unit would fight bravely if it came to battle with the Lord of the Inferno, I fear we would be overmatched and their deaths would be for naught. However, those Amalj'aa who conduct the rites, they we may be able to handle.
#. column 59: Aid the recruit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then we shall do the deed without you. Such is our duty, such is our destiny.
msgctxt "FateEvent:168:0:58"
msgid "With some help...of course. If we can engage the lizards and the tempered and distract them long enough to destroy the glowing cresset used in the rites, we may be able to thwart their plans and drive them back to Zahar'ak. Will you join us?"
msgstr "С вашей помощью... разумеется. Если мы отвлечём ящеров и порабощённых достаточно надолго, чтобы уничтожить сияющий алтарь, который они используют в ритуале, то сможем сорвать их планы и прогнать обратно в Захар'ак. Вы с нами?"

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du, die Zeremonie zu verhindern?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Rejoindre les Immortels<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: A scout has just returned bearing ill tidings. A party of Amalj'aa and their tempered slaves have begun a summoning rite nearby. Do you know what that means, fool? Ifrit! The hells-damned primal could be here breathing fire down our necks any moment!
#. column 57: While I do not doubt my unit would fight bravely if it came to battle with the Lord of the Inferno, I fear we would be overmatched and their deaths would be for naught. However, those Amalj'aa who conduct the rites, they we may be able to handle.
#. column 58: With some help...of course. If we can engage the lizards and the tempered and distract them long enough to destroy the glowing cresset used in the rites, we may be able to thwart their plans and drive them back to Zahar'ak. Will you join us?
#. column 62: Then we shall do the deed without you. Such is our duty, such is our destiny.
