#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:170:0:59"
msgid "Protect the wine from the buccaneers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Защитить вино от пиратов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そ、そんな……。<br>こんなことなら、普段から鍛えておけばよかった……。
#. de: Das ist aber unangenehm. Wer soll jetzt den Transport begleiten? Ich etwa?
#. fr: Zut... J'aurais vraiment dû passer plus de temps à faire de la musculation.
#. column 56: An adventurer! And just in the nick of time! Can you lend a man a hand?
#. column 57: The cart with today's shipment of sour red was overturned just as she left from Wineport. If it were simply restacking crates, I wouldn't bother asking an outsider for help, but my boy who rode ahead to corral the bolted cart birds spotted a band of buccaneers headed this direction.
#. column 58: I haven't the means to defend meself or the crates, and the Wineport militia is too drunk to be of any help. So I must put the fate of my cargo in your hands.
#. column 59: Protect the wine from the buccaneers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:170:0:62"
msgid "Then I'll be forced to abandon my wine...and my livelihood... Forgive me, son..."
msgstr "Ну вот... Надо было мне самому тренироваться. Придётся оставить вино... и всё, чем я зарабатываю на жизнь... Прости, сынок..."

#. ja: いやぁ、助かるよ！<br>冒険者サンのおかげで、いっぱい集まったさ。
#. de: Du bist fabelhaft. Jetzt hab ich erst mal genug Kerne.
#. fr: La fortune est de nature changeante, mais aujourd'hui, elle a choisi de sourire à un pauvre ingénieur solitaire, et je l'en remercie. Mais je vous remercie également...
#. column 57: Now I must gather my things and ready myself for the short, but sweet journey back to the plant. Though, if you happen to find any more cores in the time before I depart, I will be more than happy to purchase those off you.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:171:0:56"
msgid "Fortune may be a fickle mistress, but today she chose to smile upon a lone draughtsman, and for that I thank her...and thank <i>you</i> as well."
msgstr "Фортуна переменчива, но сегодня она улыбнулась одинокому чертёжнику. За это я ей благодарен... и <i>тебе</i> тоже."

#. ja: だが、出し惜しみはやめといてくれるかな？<br>まだ持ってるなら受け取るから、自分によこしてくれよ。
#. de: Aber wenn du noch was bei dir hast, nehme ich es gerne. Je mehr, desto besser.
#. fr: Je dois rassembler mes affaires et me préparer pour le court trajet jusqu'à l'usine. Si jamais vous trouvez des noyaux avant mon départ, je vous les achèterai avec plaisir.
#. column 56: Fortune may be a fickle mistress, but today she chose to smile upon a lone draughtsman, and for that I thank her...and thank <i>you</i> as well.
msgctxt "FateEvent:171:0:57"
msgid "Now I must gather my things and ready myself for the short, but sweet journey back to the plant. Though, if you happen to find any more cores in the time before I depart, I will be more than happy to purchase those off you."
msgstr "Теперь мне надо собрать вещи и приготовиться к короткому, но приятному пути обратно на завод. Если до моего отъезда найдёшь ещё ядер, с радостью их куплю."

#. ja: おっと……もしかして冒険者サン、<br>「アーススプライトの核」を持ってきてくれたのかい？
#. de: Wie, hast du etwa noch mehr Exergon-Kerne beschafft?
#. fr: Qu'est-ce qu'il y a<nbsp>? Auriez-vous récupéré d'autres noyaux sur les cadavres encore fumants des gentils élémentaires de la région<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Huzzah, huzzah! I knew from the moment I saw you that you were not one to let a man down. A tip of my hat to you...had I a hat to tip.
#. column 62: Hoarding cores will do you little good. There are only a handful of people in the realm who seek them, and I guarantee you none are as kind...or rich as I.
msgctxt "FateEvent:172:0:56"
msgid "What is this? Has my knight wrenched more cores from the cold, dead corpses of our friendly neighborhood sprites?"
msgstr "Что это? Мой рыцарь добыл ещё ядер из холодных мёртвых тел наших соседских спрайтов?"

#. ja: そうだよ、これさ！　これが欲しかったのさ！<br>もっともっと、持ってきてくれよな！
#. de: Vielen Dank. Aber bring mir noch mehr!
#. fr: Bravo<nbsp>! Dès que j'ai fait votre rencontre, je savais que vous n'étiez pas du genre à laisser tomber les gens. C'est formidable.
#. column 56: What is this? Has my knight wrenched more cores from the cold, dead corpses of our friendly neighborhood sprites?
#. column 62: Hoarding cores will do you little good. There are only a handful of people in the realm who seek them, and I guarantee you none are as kind...or rich as I.
msgctxt "FateEvent:172:0:60"
msgid "Huzzah, huzzah! I knew from the moment I saw you that you were not one to let a man down. A tip of my hat to you...had I a hat to tip."
msgstr "Ура, ура! Я сразу понял, что ты меня не подведёшь. Снял бы перед тобой шляпу... будь она у меня."

#. ja: まだあるのかい？<br>あるなら、早めに持ってきてくれよ。<br>俺がこの場を去ってしまう前にさ。
#. de: Ja? Nein? Wenn du welche hast, gib sie mir schnell, ich bin nämlich nicht mehr lange hier.
#. fr: Vous ne ferez rien de ces noyaux d'élémentaires. Peu de personnes en ce bas monde en ont besoin, et je vous garantis que ces personnes vous paieront moins bien que moi.
#. column 56: What is this? Has my knight wrenched more cores from the cold, dead corpses of our friendly neighborhood sprites?
#. column 60: Huzzah, huzzah! I knew from the moment I saw you that you were not one to let a man down. A tip of my hat to you...had I a hat to tip.
msgctxt "FateEvent:172:0:62"
msgid "Hoarding cores will do you little good. There are only a handful of people in the realm who seek them, and I guarantee you none are as kind...or rich as I."
msgstr "Нет смысла копить ядра. В мире найдётся лишь горстка тех, кому они нужны, и уверяю тебя: никто из них не будет таким добрым... или богатым, как я."

#. ja: シーッ！<br>今は偵察任務中だ、大きな声を出すなよ冒険者……。<br>ここがバレたら、命はないぜ……？
#. de: Psssst! Nicht so laut! Ich versuche hier, mich zu <i>tarnen</i>!
#. fr: Chut<nbsp>! Pas un bruit<nbsp>! L'ennemi va nous repérer si vous continuez<nbsp>! Je suis en mission, moi<nbsp>! Regardez, vous voyez les troupes impériales là-bas<nbsp>? J'étais ici pour découvrir ce qu'elles font là et comment elles sont parvenues aussi loin dans la Sylve des Douze, mais des Sylphes subjugués ont fait leur apparition.
#. column 57: Now the two groups are fighting, and more sylphs gather as we speak. The tempered followers of Ramuh are not what one would call friends of Gridania, but we may be able to use this situation to our advantage.
#. column 58: Allow the beastmen and the imperials to weaken each other just enough, and then swoop in and put the Garlean invaders to the sword, frightening off any sylphs who remain.
#. column 59: See Mianne's far-fetched plan into motion?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Think about it! If this works, I'll be awarded the Emerald Leaf! Oh, and, uh...you might be awarded something, too.
#. column 62: Then begone with you. I won't be dragged off for tempering because you couldn't keep quiet.
msgctxt "FateEvent:173:0:56"
msgid "Shhh! Quiet down! Any louder and you will compromise my position to the enemy! Over there. Can you not see the small party of imperial troops? Their purpose, and how they made it this deep into the Twelveswood without being discovered─that is what I was here to find out...that is, until the tempered sylphs arrived."
msgstr "Тише! Не шумите! Ещё немного — и враги меня заметят! Вон там. Видите небольшой отряд имперцев? Я пыталась выяснить, что они здесь делают и как добрались так глубоко в Чёрную чащу незамеченными... Но тут явились порабощённые сильфы."

#. ja: いいか、ここには帝国の先遣部隊がいる。<br>奴らめ、どうやってここまで入ってきたかしらんが……<br>何を企んでるか、ここでこうして探っているのさ。
#. de: Also pass auf, da draußen ist ein Stoßtrupp der Garlear, nur ein paar Leute. Keine Ahnung, <i>wie</i> sie hierher gekommen sind, aber ich bin hier um rauszukriegen, <i>warum</i>.
#. fr: Les Sylphes ont commencé à s'en prendre aux éclaireurs impériaux. Ces Sylphes-là sont subjugués et ne sont pas ce que l'on pourrait nommer des alliés de Gridania, mais nous pourrions utiliser cette situation à notre avantage pour les laisser affaiblir les soldats.
#. column 56: Shhh! Quiet down! Any louder and you will compromise my position to the enemy! Over there. Can you not see the small party of imperial troops? Their purpose, and how they made it this deep into the Twelveswood without being discovered─that is what I was here to find out...that is, until the tempered sylphs arrived.
#. column 58: Allow the beastmen and the imperials to weaken each other just enough, and then swoop in and put the Garlean invaders to the sword, frightening off any sylphs who remain.
#. column 59: See Mianne's far-fetched plan into motion?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Think about it! If this works, I'll be awarded the Emerald Leaf! Oh, and, uh...you might be awarded something, too.
#. column 62: Then begone with you. I won't be dragged off for tempering because you couldn't keep quiet.
msgctxt "FateEvent:173:0:57"
msgid "Now the two groups are fighting, and more sylphs gather as we speak. The tempered followers of Ramuh are not what one would call friends of Gridania, but we may be able to use this situation to our advantage."
msgstr "Теперь эти две группы дерутся, а сильфов вокруг становится всё больше. Порабощённые последователи Раму нам не друзья Гридании, но мы можем обратить эту ситуацию себе на пользу."

#. ja: ……だが、ここに近々テンパードシルフがくるらしいんだ。<br>あいつらが、帝国兵とぶつかったら大騒ぎになる……。<br>先に帝国兵を撃破して、全面対決を避けるんだ！
#. de: Aber jetzt kommt der interessante Teil: Besessene Sylphen sind auch hierher unterwegs! Wenn die mit den Garlearn zu<shy>sammen<shy>treffen, geht's rund! Wir müssen die Garlear angreifen, bevor die Sylphen kommen und die Situation un<shy>be<shy>rechen<shy>bar wird.
#. fr: On pourrait les laisser s'affronter jusqu'au bout, mais mieux vaut éviter un pugilat généralisé. Essayez donc d'intervenir pour éliminer les Garlemaldais avant que l'escarmouche se transforme en carnage, mais faites attention aux Sylphes hostiles. Si ce plan fonctionne, on m'offrira l'insigne foliaire du serpent<nbsp>! Oh, et vous... euh... vous aurez une récompense.
#. column 56: Shhh! Quiet down! Any louder and you will compromise my position to the enemy! Over there. Can you not see the small party of imperial troops? Their purpose, and how they made it this deep into the Twelveswood without being discovered─that is what I was here to find out...that is, until the tempered sylphs arrived.
#. column 57: Now the two groups are fighting, and more sylphs gather as we speak. The tempered followers of Ramuh are not what one would call friends of Gridania, but we may be able to use this situation to our advantage.
#. column 59: See Mianne's far-fetched plan into motion?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Think about it! If this works, I'll be awarded the Emerald Leaf! Oh, and, uh...you might be awarded something, too.
#. column 62: Then begone with you. I won't be dragged off for tempering because you couldn't keep quiet.
msgctxt "FateEvent:173:0:58"
msgid "Allow the beastmen and the imperials to weaken each other just enough, and then swoop in and put the Garlean invaders to the sword, frightening off any sylphs who remain."
msgstr "Пусть зверолюди и имперцы немного ослабят друг друга, а потом нападём и перебьём гарлеанских захватчиков, попутно разогнав оставшихся сильфов."

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du beim Angriff auf die Garlear?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Mettre à exécution le plan de  Mianne<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Shhh! Quiet down! Any louder and you will compromise my position to the enemy! Over there. Can you not see the small party of imperial troops? Their purpose, and how they made it this deep into the Twelveswood without being discovered─that is what I was here to find out...that is, until the tempered sylphs arrived.
#. column 57: Now the two groups are fighting, and more sylphs gather as we speak. The tempered followers of Ramuh are not what one would call friends of Gridania, but we may be able to use this situation to our advantage.
#. column 58: Allow the beastmen and the imperials to weaken each other just enough, and then swoop in and put the Garlean invaders to the sword, frightening off any sylphs who remain.
#. column 60: Think about it! If this works, I'll be awarded the Emerald Leaf! Oh, and, uh...you might be awarded something, too.
#. column 62: Then begone with you. I won't be dragged off for tempering because you couldn't keep quiet.
