msgctxt "FateEvent:173:0:59"
msgid "See Mianne's far-fetched plan into motion?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Приступить к безумному плану Мианны?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: やってくれるか！<br>すまない、恩に着るぜ……。
#. de: Jawohl, das lob ich mir. Dann auf in den Kampf!
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Shhh! Quiet down! Any louder and you will compromise my position to the enemy! Over there. Can you not see the small party of imperial troops? Their purpose, and how they made it this deep into the Twelveswood without being discovered─that is what I was here to find out...that is, until the tempered sylphs arrived.
#. column 57: Now the two groups are fighting, and more sylphs gather as we speak. The tempered followers of Ramuh are not what one would call friends of Gridania, but we may be able to use this situation to our advantage.
#. column 58: Allow the beastmen and the imperials to weaken each other just enough, and then swoop in and put the Garlean invaders to the sword, frightening off any sylphs who remain.
#. column 59: See Mianne's far-fetched plan into motion?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then begone with you. I won't be dragged off for tempering because you couldn't keep quiet.
msgctxt "FateEvent:173:0:60"
msgid "Think about it! If this works, I'll be awarded the Emerald Leaf! Oh, and, uh...you might be awarded something, too."
msgstr "Подумай только! Если всё выгорит, мне вручат Изумрудный Лист! А, ну... тебе, может, тоже кое-что перепадёт."

#. ja: そうか……さすがに、ひとりで突撃はできねぇ。<br>もう少し両者の様子を探って、戦力を把握しておくか……。
#. de: Hm, dann muss ich wohl abwarten, wie die Begegnung verläuft. Alleine werde ich mit den Garlearn nämlich nicht fertig.
#. fr: Hors de ma vue. Je ne vais pas me faire repérer parce que vous ne savez pas vous taire.
#. column 56: Shhh! Quiet down! Any louder and you will compromise my position to the enemy! Over there. Can you not see the small party of imperial troops? Their purpose, and how they made it this deep into the Twelveswood without being discovered─that is what I was here to find out...that is, until the tempered sylphs arrived.
#. column 57: Now the two groups are fighting, and more sylphs gather as we speak. The tempered followers of Ramuh are not what one would call friends of Gridania, but we may be able to use this situation to our advantage.
#. column 58: Allow the beastmen and the imperials to weaken each other just enough, and then swoop in and put the Garlean invaders to the sword, frightening off any sylphs who remain.
#. column 59: See Mianne's far-fetched plan into motion?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Think about it! If this works, I'll be awarded the Emerald Leaf! Oh, and, uh...you might be awarded something, too.
msgctxt "FateEvent:173:0:62"
msgid "Then begone with you. I won't be dragged off for tempering because you couldn't keep quiet."
msgstr "Тогда проваливай. Не хватало ещё, чтобы меня объявили прималом из-за того, что ты не умеешь держать язык за зубами."

#. ja: おお、頼れそうな冒険者よ、いいところに。<br>このコボルド軍試掘地に動きアリとの<br>情報を得て、偵察に来たのですが……
#. de: Kenn ich dich? Egal, du siehst verlässlich aus. Wir haben Nachricht über Aktivitäten im Probegrabungslager der Kobolde.
#. fr: Vous arrivez au bon moment. Si vous cherchez du travail, vous avez de la chance, car nous avons besoin de main-d'œuvre.
#. column 57: My unit has been informed that the kobolds are preparing to start a new dig at a nearby location and have begun hauling their tools to the site.
#. column 58: They have yet to catch wind of me and my men, and so if we strike now, we will catch them unawares, giving us the upper hand. We may even succeed in destroying their equipment. What say you? There is a spot for you in our line, and you're entitled to any loot you find and can carry off this godsforsaken mountain. If you survive, that is!
#. column 59: Join the unit in their assault?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: And you would watch as an opportunity such as this one slips from your fingers like sand? You adventurers are as fickle as lady fortune herself.
msgctxt "FateEvent:174:0:56"
msgid "You have good timing, adventurer. If it is work you seek, you are in luck, for we are in need of several extra hands."
msgstr "Как вовремя ты пришёл, искатель приключений! Ищешь работу? Тебе повезло — нам как раз нужны помощники."

#. ja: 確かに試掘作業が開始されているようです。<br>奴らが、まだこちらに気づいていない今なら、<br>奇襲をしかけることで、試掘を妨害できるはず！
#. de: Die Kobolde graben herum! In <i>unserem</i> Gebiet! Denen werden wir aber einen dicken Strich durch die Rechnung machen.
#. fr: Mon unité a appris que les Kobolds ont entamé de nouvelles fouilles non loin d'ici et sont en train d'acheminer leurs outils jusqu'au site. Ils ne savent pas que mes hommes sont là et, si nous frappons im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment, nous les prendrons au dépourvu et nous aurons l'avantage.
#. column 56: You have good timing, adventurer. If it is work you seek, you are in luck, for we are in need of several extra hands.
#. column 58: They have yet to catch wind of me and my men, and so if we strike now, we will catch them unawares, giving us the upper hand. We may even succeed in destroying their equipment. What say you? There is a spot for you in our line, and you're entitled to any loot you find and can carry off this godsforsaken mountain. If you survive, that is!
#. column 59: Join the unit in their assault?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: And you would watch as an opportunity such as this one slips from your fingers like sand? You adventurers are as fickle as lady fortune herself.
msgctxt "FateEvent:174:0:57"
msgid "My unit has been informed that the kobolds are preparing to start a new dig at a nearby location and have begun hauling their tools to the site."
msgstr "До нас дошли вести: кобольды собираются начать раскопки неподалёку и уже тащат туда инструменты."

#. ja: よければ、<br>「コボルド族の採掘道具」の破壊にご協力ください。<br>黒渦団にあなたの名を売る、いい機会にもなりますよ。
#. de: Bist du dabei? Es ist ganz einfach: Du musst nur die Kobold-Werkzeuge zerstören. Damit kannst du dich beim Mahlstrom sehr beliebt machen. Na, wie sieht's aus?
#. fr: Nous parviendrons peut-être également à détruire leur équipement. C'est une bonne occasion de vous faire bien voir du Maelstrom. Qu'en pensez-vous<nbsp>? Nous avons de la place pour vous et tout ce que vous récupérerez dans cette maudite montagne sera à vous. Enfin, si vous survivez, bien sûr.
#. column 56: You have good timing, adventurer. If it is work you seek, you are in luck, for we are in need of several extra hands.
#. column 57: My unit has been informed that the kobolds are preparing to start a new dig at a nearby location and have begun hauling their tools to the site.
#. column 59: Join the unit in their assault?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: And you would watch as an opportunity such as this one slips from your fingers like sand? You adventurers are as fickle as lady fortune herself.
msgctxt "FateEvent:174:0:58"
msgid "They have yet to catch wind of me and my men, and so if we strike now, we will catch them unawares, giving us the upper hand. We may even succeed in destroying their equipment. What say you? There is a spot for you in our line, and you're entitled to any loot you find and can carry off this godsforsaken mountain. If you survive, that is!"
msgstr "Они ещё не заметили нас, так что, если ударим сейчас, застанем их врасплох и получим преимущество. Может, даже уничтожим их инструменты. Ну что скажешь? Место в строю найдётся. Всё, что сумеешь унести с этой проклятой горы, будет твоим. Если, конечно, выживешь!"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Machst du mit?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Participer à l'assaut<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You have good timing, adventurer. If it is work you seek, you are in luck, for we are in need of several extra hands.
#. column 57: My unit has been informed that the kobolds are preparing to start a new dig at a nearby location and have begun hauling their tools to the site.
#. column 58: They have yet to catch wind of me and my men, and so if we strike now, we will catch them unawares, giving us the upper hand. We may even succeed in destroying their equipment. What say you? There is a spot for you in our line, and you're entitled to any loot you find and can carry off this godsforsaken mountain. If you survive, that is!
