msgstr "Вступить в отряд и атаковать?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 手柄をあげる好機をみすみす逃すとは……。
#. de: Dabei wollte ich dir Gelegenheit zu Ruhm und wertvollen Erfahrungen verschaffen ...
#. fr: Et vous seriez prêt<if $gn4>e</if> à manquer une telle opportunité<nbsp>? Vous, les aventuriers, vous êtes de vraies girouettes<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You have good timing, adventurer. If it is work you seek, you are in luck, for we are in need of several extra hands.
#. column 57: My unit has been informed that the kobolds are preparing to start a new dig at a nearby location and have begun hauling their tools to the site.
#. column 58: They have yet to catch wind of me and my men, and so if we strike now, we will catch them unawares, giving us the upper hand. We may even succeed in destroying their equipment. What say you? There is a spot for you in our line, and you're entitled to any loot you find and can carry off this godsforsaken mountain. If you survive, that is!
#. column 59: Join the unit in their assault?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:174:0:62"
msgid "And you would watch as an opportunity such as this one slips from your fingers like sand? You adventurers are as fickle as lady fortune herself."
msgstr "И ты упустишь такой шанс? Авантюристы — сущие непостоянные создания, прямо как сама госпожа Фортуна."

#. ja: お願いします、助けてください！<br>娘とここを歩いていたら、「最後の群民」の信者が、<br>突然襲いかかってきて、娘を連れ去っていったのです！！
#. de: Es ist schrecklich, Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>! Die Jünger Dalamuds haben meine Tochter entführt!
#. fr: Ma fille<nbsp>! Ils ont enlevé ma fille<nbsp>!
#. column 57: There were four of them, all dressed in robes redder than a hunter's moon. They called themselves the Lambs of Dalamud and assured me she would not be harmed, but I've heard the rumors. I know about the blood sacrifices to their pagan god!
#. column 58: Please, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I beg of thee! I am but an old man, but you─you can rescue my daughter from the grim fate that awaits her.
#. column 59: Hunt down the kidnappers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I will be forever in debt to you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>!
#. column 62: First my wife...then my sons...and now my daughter... \<sob>
msgctxt "FateEvent:175:0:56"
msgid "My daughter! They've taken my daughter!"
msgstr "Моя дочь! Они забрали мою дочь!"

#. ja: 奴らは娘を抱え、この奥へ消えていきました。<br>ああ、このままでは娘が<br>「救世神ダラガブ」の生贄にされてしまう！！
#. de: Wir gingen gemütlich spazieren, und da standen sie plötzlich! Sie haben die Ärmste mit sich gerissen ... Oh, ihr Götter, wenn sie ihr nur nichts angetan haben!
#. fr: Ils étaient quatre et portaient des robes rouges. Ils m'ont assuré qu'ils ne lui feraient pas de mal, mais je sais que ces damnés Survivalistes font des sacrifices humains à leur dieu païen<nbsp>!
#. column 56: My daughter! They've taken my daughter!
#. column 58: Please, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I beg of thee! I am but an old man, but you─you can rescue my daughter from the grim fate that awaits her.
#. column 59: Hunt down the kidnappers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I will be forever in debt to you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>!
#. column 62: First my wife...then my sons...and now my daughter... \<sob>
msgctxt "FateEvent:175:0:57"
msgid "There were four of them, all dressed in robes redder than a hunter's moon. They called themselves the Lambs of Dalamud and assured me she would not be harmed, but I've heard the rumors. I know about the blood sacrifices to their pagan god!"
msgstr "Их было четверо, все в одеждах краснее охотничьей луны. Назвались Ягнятами Даламуда и уверяли, что не тронут её, но я слышал слухи. Знаю я про кровавые жертвоприношения их языческому богу!"

#. ja: 慈悲深く、勇気あふれる冒険者さん、お願いです！<br>どうか「最後の群民」から、娘を助け出してください！
#. de: <if $gn4>Liebe, gute Abenteurerin<else>Lieber, guter Abenteurer</if>, bitte rette meine Tochter, mein Ein und Alles!
#. fr: Je vous en prie<nbsp>! Je ne suis qu'un pauvre fermier, mais vous, vous avez le pouvoir de sauver ma fille du sombre destin qui l'attend. Par pitié<nbsp>!
#. column 56: My daughter! They've taken my daughter!
#. column 57: There were four of them, all dressed in robes redder than a hunter's moon. They called themselves the Lambs of Dalamud and assured me she would not be harmed, but I've heard the rumors. I know about the blood sacrifices to their pagan god!
#. column 59: Hunt down the kidnappers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I will be forever in debt to you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>!
#. column 62: First my wife...then my sons...and now my daughter... \<sob>
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:175:0:58"
msgid "Please, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I beg of thee! I am but an old man, but you─you can rescue my daughter from the grim fate that awaits her."
msgstr "Прошу, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if>! Умоляю! Я всего лишь старик, но вы... вы можете спасти мою дочь от страшной участи."

#. ja: 助けてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du die entführte Tochter retten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Traquer les ravisseurs<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: My daughter! They've taken my daughter!
#. column 57: There were four of them, all dressed in robes redder than a hunter's moon. They called themselves the Lambs of Dalamud and assured me she would not be harmed, but I've heard the rumors. I know about the blood sacrifices to their pagan god!
#. column 58: Please, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I beg of thee! I am but an old man, but you─you can rescue my daughter from the grim fate that awaits her.
#. column 60: I will be forever in debt to you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>!
#. column 62: First my wife...then my sons...and now my daughter... \<sob>
