msgctxt "FateEvent:175:0:59"
msgid "Hunt down the kidnappers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Преследовать похитителей?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>娘はこの奥にいるはずです！<br>
#. de: Hab tausend, millionenfach Dank! Sie muss da drin sein, bitte entreiß sie diesen ruchlosen Kultisten!
#. fr: Je vous suis ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sant<nbsp>!
#. column 56: My daughter! They've taken my daughter!
#. column 57: There were four of them, all dressed in robes redder than a hunter's moon. They called themselves the Lambs of Dalamud and assured me she would not be harmed, but I've heard the rumors. I know about the blood sacrifices to their pagan god!
#. column 58: Please, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I beg of thee! I am but an old man, but you─you can rescue my daughter from the grim fate that awaits her.
#. column 59: Hunt down the kidnappers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: First my wife...then my sons...and now my daughter... \<sob>
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:175:0:60"
msgid "I will be forever in debt to you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>!"
msgstr "Я век буду в долгу перед вами, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if>!"

#. ja: そんな……<br>どうしたら……。<br>
#. de: Wie ... Mir ... fehlen die Worte ob solcher Herzlosigkeit!
#. fr: Ma fille est tout ce qu'il me reste au monde...
#. column 56: My daughter! They've taken my daughter!
#. column 57: There were four of them, all dressed in robes redder than a hunter's moon. They called themselves the Lambs of Dalamud and assured me she would not be harmed, but I've heard the rumors. I know about the blood sacrifices to their pagan god!
#. column 58: Please, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>! I beg of thee! I am but an old man, but you─you can rescue my daughter from the grim fate that awaits her.
#. column 59: Hunt down the kidnappers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I will be forever in debt to you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:175:0:62"
msgid "First my wife...then my sons...and now my daughter... \\<sob>"
msgstr "Сначала жена... потом сыновья... а теперь и дочь... <i>Всхлип...</i>"

#. ja: 「最後の群民」から、娘を助け出してください！<br>娘はこの奥にいるはずです！
#. de: Hilf meiner Tochter! Sie ist dort drin, in der Gewalt der Jünger Dalamuds!
#. fr: Les Survivalistes ne peuvent pas être bien loin. Trouvez-les et sauvez ma pauvre fille. Elle est si jeune<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:176:0:56"
msgid "The Lambs of Dalamud cannot be far. Find them and save my poor daughter. She has only seen but sixteen summers!"
msgstr "Ягнята Даламуда где-то неподалёку. Найдите их и спасите мою бедную дочь. Ей всего шестнадцать лет!"

#. ja: お願いです、お助けください！<br>「最後の群民」にさらわれたんです。
#. de: So tu doch etwas! Ich wurde von den Kultisten entführt!
#. fr: Non<nbsp>! N'approchez pas<nbsp>!<br>... Pardon, je vous ai pris<if $gn4>e</if> pour l'un<if $gn4>e</if> d'entre eux. Aidez-moi à m'enfuir d'ici<nbsp>!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:177:0:56"
msgid "No! Stay away!<br>Oh... Are you not one of them? Then you must help me! Quickly, before they return!"
msgstr "Нет! Не подходите!<br>Ох... Вы не один из них? Тогда помогите мне! Скорее, пока они не вернулись!"

#. ja: ご親切にありがとうございます！<br>神様は、まだ私を見捨ててはいなかったのですね！
#. de: Den Göttern sei Dank! Die Vorsehung hat mir erneut ein<if $gn4>e Retterin<else>en Retter</if> gesandt!
#. fr: Je ne vous remercierai jamais assez<nbsp>! Les Dieux ne m'avaient pas abandonnée<nbsp>! Vous ne savez pas ce que votre geste représente pour mon père et moi<nbsp>! Il sera si soulagé de me retrouver<nbsp>!
#. column 57: But the Lambs of Dalamud... They will come again, as they have so many times in the past. They took my mother and brothers before me, and will not stop until my blood, too, has stained the desert floor, giving life to their all-powerful god.
#. column 58: Unless, that is, we can end it... <i>You</i> can end it. The Lambs lurk nearby. I believe they watch us even now. Put them to the sword and free the peoples of northern Thanalan from the grip of fear...or it will only be a matter of time before I am drained of my lifeblood as my poor father watches...
#. column 59: Hunt down and slay the Lambs of Dalamud?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Do our lives mean that little to you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:178:0:56"
msgid "I cannot thank you enough! You do not know what this means to me and my father. He will be overjoyed at my return."
msgstr "Я не знаю, как вас благодарить! Вы даже не представляете, как это важно для меня и отца. Он будет так рад, что я вернулась."

#. ja: 「最後の群民」は、私を生贄にささげるために<br>無理やりここへ連れてきました。<br>奴らを倒さないかぎり、同じことが繰り返されるでしょう。
#. de: Die Kultisten wollen mich Dalamud als Opfer darbringen! Wenn du sie nicht alle tötest, werden sie dasselbe immer und immer wieder versuchen!
#. fr: Mais les Survivalistes reviendront. C'est toujours comme ça. Ils ont enlevé ma mère et mes frères avant moi, et ils n'auront de cesse que lorsque mon sang aura souillé le sable du désert pour donner vie à leur dieu tout-puissant.
#. column 56: I cannot thank you enough! You do not know what this means to me and my father. He will be overjoyed at my return.
#. column 58: Unless, that is, we can end it... <i>You</i> can end it. The Lambs lurk nearby. I believe they watch us even now. Put them to the sword and free the peoples of northern Thanalan from the grip of fear...or it will only be a matter of time before I am drained of my lifeblood as my poor father watches...
#. column 59: Hunt down and slay the Lambs of Dalamud?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Do our lives mean that little to you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:178:0:57"
msgid "But the Lambs of Dalamud... They will come again, as they have so many times in the past. They took my mother and brothers before me, and will not stop until my blood, too, has stained the desert floor, giving life to their all-powerful god."
msgstr "Но Ягнята Даламуда... Они снова явятся, как уже бывало не раз. Сначала они похитили мою мать и братьев, а теперь не успокоятся, пока и моя кровь не обагрит пустыню, даруя жизнь их всемогущему богу."

#. ja: ですから、親切な冒険者さん、<br>奴らを倒してくださいませんか？<br>奴らは、また儀式をするためにやってくるはずなんです。
#. de: Du musst verhindern, dass noch mehr Unschuldige ihr Leben verlieren.
#. fr: Enfin, nous pourrions peut-être empêcher cela... Les Survivalistes ne sont pas loin. Je suis persuadée qu'ils nous observent en ce moment même. Éliminez-les et libérez les habitants du Thanalan septentrional ou mon père sera bientôt le témoin de mon exécution.
#. column 56: I cannot thank you enough! You do not know what this means to me and my father. He will be overjoyed at my return.
#. column 57: But the Lambs of Dalamud... They will come again, as they have so many times in the past. They took my mother and brothers before me, and will not stop until my blood, too, has stained the desert floor, giving life to their all-powerful god.
#. column 59: Hunt down and slay the Lambs of Dalamud?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Do our lives mean that little to you?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:178:0:58"
msgid "Unless, that is, we can end it... <i>You</i> can end it. The Lambs lurk nearby. I believe they watch us even now. Put them to the sword and free the peoples of northern Thanalan from the grip of fear...or it will only be a matter of time before I am drained of my lifeblood as my poor father watches..."
msgstr "Но мы можем положить этому конец... Вернее, <i>вы</i> можете. Ягнята где-то рядом. Думаю, они следят за нами даже сейчас. Убейте их и избавьте жителей северного Таналана от страха... Иначе пройдёт совсем немного времени, и из меня выкачают всю кровь, а мой бедный отец будет смотреть..."

#. ja: 「最後の群民」と戦いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Legst du dich mit den Jüngern Dalamuds an?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Traquer et éliminer les Survivalistes<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I cannot thank you enough! You do not know what this means to me and my father. He will be overjoyed at my return.
#. column 57: But the Lambs of Dalamud... They will come again, as they have so many times in the past. They took my mother and brothers before me, and will not stop until my blood, too, has stained the desert floor, giving life to their all-powerful god.
#. column 58: Unless, that is, we can end it... <i>You</i> can end it. The Lambs lurk nearby. I believe they watch us even now. Put them to the sword and free the peoples of northern Thanalan from the grip of fear...or it will only be a matter of time before I am drained of my lifeblood as my poor father watches...
#. column 62: Do our lives mean that little to you?
