msgctxt "FateEvent:178:0:59"
msgid "Hunt down and slay the Lambs of Dalamud?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Выслеживать и уничтожить Ягнят Даламуда?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうですか……残念です。
#. de: Du ... musst ein Herz aus Stein haben! <i>schluchz</i>
#. fr: Nos vies n'ont-elles aucune valeur à vos yeux<nbsp>?
#. column 56: I cannot thank you enough! You do not know what this means to me and my father. He will be overjoyed at my return.
#. column 57: But the Lambs of Dalamud... They will come again, as they have so many times in the past. They took my mother and brothers before me, and will not stop until my blood, too, has stained the desert floor, giving life to their all-powerful god.
#. column 58: Unless, that is, we can end it... <i>You</i> can end it. The Lambs lurk nearby. I believe they watch us even now. Put them to the sword and free the peoples of northern Thanalan from the grip of fear...or it will only be a matter of time before I am drained of my lifeblood as my poor father watches...
#. column 59: Hunt down and slay the Lambs of Dalamud?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:178:0:62"
msgid "Do our lives mean that little to you?"
msgstr "Неужели наши жизни для вас ничего не значат?"

#. ja: さあ、おとなしく生贄となるがいい！
#. de: <i>Du</i> sollst das Opfer Dalamuds sein!!!
#. fr: Votre sang nous rendra forts<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:179:0:56"
msgid "Your blood will give us strength!"
msgstr "Ваша кровь придаст нам сил!"

#. ja: ……。
#. de: ...
#. fr: ...
msgctxt "FateEvent:180:0:56"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ja: キャンプ・オーバールックへ物資を輸送中なのだが、<br>荷運びチョコボが怪我しちまってな……。<br>どうにも動けず、立ち往生しているのだ。
#. de: Ich wollte mit meinen Waren nach Camp Ausblick, aber ich stecke hier fest, wie du siehst. Mein Chocobo lahmt und kommt nicht mehr weiter.
#. fr: Je suis en route pour livrer des mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses au camp du Guet, mais mon chocobo s'est blessé. Je suis bloqué là sans pouvoir repartir dans un sens ou dans l'autre...
#. column 57: You see, earlier, there were four of us, but the three storm soldiers tasked with my protection were slain by kobolds. I managed to make it this far, but my chocobo's hobbled his leg.
#. column 58: Might you be so kind as to give me a hand leading my injured 'bo the rest of the way to Camp Overlook?
#. column 59: Assist the coachman?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I won't forget the face of the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who refused a stranger's plea for help, just you see.
msgctxt "FateEvent:181:0:56"
msgid "There aren't any kobolds following you, are there? I fear I can no longer outrun the beasts..."
msgstr "За вами ведь не гонятся кобольды? Боюсь, от этих тварей мне уже не убежать..."

#. ja: この辺りは、コボルド族が多いから、<br>チョコボから目を離せず、助けも呼びに行けなくてな。
#. de: Die Gegend ist Koboldgebiet. Nicht der beste Ort, um eine Pause einzulegen. Aber was bleibt mir übrig?
#. fr: Avec tous les Kobolds qui traînent par ici, je ne peux pas quitter mon chocobo des yeux pour chercher de l'aide.
#. column 56: There aren't any kobolds following you, are there? I fear I can no longer outrun the beasts...
#. column 58: Might you be so kind as to give me a hand leading my injured 'bo the rest of the way to Camp Overlook?
#. column 59: Assist the coachman?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I won't forget the face of the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who refused a stranger's plea for help, just you see.
msgctxt "FateEvent:181:0:57"
msgid "You see, earlier, there were four of us, but the three storm soldiers tasked with my protection were slain by kobolds. I managed to make it this far, but my chocobo's hobbled his leg."
msgstr "Нас было четверо, но кобольды перебили троих солдат Шторма, приставленных меня охранять. Я добрался сюда, но чокобо повредил ногу."

#. ja: ここは、荷車を押してくしかねえな……<br>よければ、あんた、手伝ってくれないか？
#. de: Kannst du vielleicht auf meinen Chocobo aufpassen, bis es ihm besser geht?
#. fr: Il va falloir que je pousse moi-même mon chargement. Vous ne voudriez pas m'aider<nbsp>?
#. column 56: There aren't any kobolds following you, are there? I fear I can no longer outrun the beasts...
#. column 57: You see, earlier, there were four of us, but the three storm soldiers tasked with my protection were slain by kobolds. I managed to make it this far, but my chocobo's hobbled his leg.
#. column 59: Assist the coachman?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I won't forget the face of the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who refused a stranger's plea for help, just you see.
msgctxt "FateEvent:181:0:58"
msgid "Might you be so kind as to give me a hand leading my injured 'bo the rest of the way to Camp Overlook?"
msgstr "Не поможете довести моего раненого чокобо до лагеря «Обзорный»?"

#. ja: 手伝ってあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du beim Aufpassen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le livreur<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: There aren't any kobolds following you, are there? I fear I can no longer outrun the beasts...
#. column 57: You see, earlier, there were four of us, but the three storm soldiers tasked with my protection were slain by kobolds. I managed to make it this far, but my chocobo's hobbled his leg.
#. column 58: Might you be so kind as to give me a hand leading my injured 'bo the rest of the way to Camp Overlook?
#. column 62: I won't forget the face of the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who refused a stranger's plea for help, just you see.
