msgctxt "FateEvent:181:0:59"
msgid "Assist the coachman?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь вознице?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: あんたの顔は、忘れないぜ……。
#. de: Na herzlichen Dank. Nicht sehr hilfsbereit von dir. Mach, dass du wegkommst.
#. fr: C'est sympa, bonjour la solidarité... Je le retiens.
#. column 56: There aren't any kobolds following you, are there? I fear I can no longer outrun the beasts...
#. column 57: You see, earlier, there were four of us, but the three storm soldiers tasked with my protection were slain by kobolds. I managed to make it this far, but my chocobo's hobbled his leg.
#. column 58: Might you be so kind as to give me a hand leading my injured 'bo the rest of the way to Camp Overlook?
#. column 59: Assist the coachman?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:181:0:62"
msgid "I won't forget the face of the <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who refused a stranger's plea for help, just you see."
msgstr "Я запомню лицо <if $gn4>женщины<else>мужчины</if>, которая отказала незнакомцу в помощи. Вот увидишь."

#. ja: おい……そこな道行く冒険者よ。<br>お前、腕っ節に自信はあるか？<br>もしもあるならその腕前、披露してみる気はないか？
#. de: Oh, <if $gn4>eine Abenteurerin<else>ein Abenteurer</if> mit stolzgeschwellter Brust. Kannst du was oder tust du nur so?
#. fr: Vite, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>. Les collines grouillent d'Amalj'aa qui n'hésiteront pas à s'en prendre à vous. Ou peut-être vous prenez-vous pour un<if $gn4>e guerrière<else> guerrier</if><nbsp>? Voulez-vous verser du sang<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Over yon in the Amalj'aa encampment of Zanr'ak sits a small band of the beasties. Normally, we wouldn't pay the place any mind. Gutting some low-ranking grunt roasting a marmot over a fire won't win us any wars; but my scouts report that today is different. Commander Diamondjaw Nezedd Gah, for whatever reason, has taken a place at that fire.
#. column 58: I could wait two lifetimes and not have another chance such as this, so I'm taking my men in. Throw the bones and see where they fall, I say. If you think you can keep up, you're welcome to join. When killing's the business, the more the merrier, no?
#. column 59: Join the raiding party?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, then stay out of our way. Wouldn't want one of my men tripping over your head, now.
msgctxt "FateEvent:182:0:56"
msgid "Look alive, adventurer. The hills are crawling with Amalj'aa looking to tear the head off of a soft piece of meat like yourself. Or maybe you fancy yourself a fighter? Is it blood you seek?"
msgstr "Живее, искатель приключений! Холмы кишат амалджа, которым не терпится оторвать голову такому мягкотелому куску мяса, как вы. Или считаете себя бойцом? Крови жаждете?"

#. ja: 実は今、ここザンラク脇本陣に<br>「金剛のネゼド・ガー」が来ているのだ。<br>奴は過去何度も、我が不滅隊の前に立ちはだかった強敵だ。
#. de: Entschuldige. Ich versuche deinen Kampfgeist zu schüren. Wir brauchen nämlich Hilfe im Kampf gegen einen diamantharten Gegner: Nezedd Gah, den Kommandanten von Zanr'ak.
#. fr: Dans le camp amalj'aa de Zanr'ak, il y a un petit groupe de ces bêtes sauvages. En temps normal, nous n'aurions que faire de cet endroit. Éventrer quelques fantassins qui font griller des marmottes ne nous apporterait rien de particulier... Mais mes éclaireurs ont repéré autre chose. Le commandant Nezedd Gah mâchoire-de-diamant, pour une raison inconnue, se trouve dans ce camp.
#. column 56: Look alive, adventurer. The hills are crawling with Amalj'aa looking to tear the head off of a soft piece of meat like yourself. Or maybe you fancy yourself a fighter? Is it blood you seek?
#. column 58: I could wait two lifetimes and not have another chance such as this, so I'm taking my men in. Throw the bones and see where they fall, I say. If you think you can keep up, you're welcome to join. When killing's the business, the more the merrier, no?
#. column 59: Join the raiding party?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, then stay out of our way. Wouldn't want one of my men tripping over your head, now.
msgctxt "FateEvent:182:0:57"
msgid "Over yon in the Amalj'aa encampment of Zanr'ak sits a small band of the beasties. Normally, we wouldn't pay the place any mind. Gutting some low-ranking grunt roasting a marmot over a fire won't win us any wars; but my scouts report that today is different. Commander Diamondjaw Nezedd Gah, for whatever reason, has taken a place at that fire."
msgstr "Вон в лагере амалджа в Занраке сидит небольшая шайка этих зверюг. Обычно мы бы и внимания на них не обратили. Зарезать какого-нибудь безымянного солдата, жарящего сурка у костра, — не победа. Но сегодня всё иначе: мои разведчики донесли, что командир Незедд Гах Алмазная Челюсть зачем-то уселся у того костра."

#. ja: 今なら奴と多少の雑魚が周りにいるのみよ。<br>誅殺するには千載一遇ともいえる、絶好の機会なのだ。<br>どうだ、刺客となる気はあるか？
#. de: Die Legion ist ihm schon ein paar mal schmählich unterlegen. Aber diesmal kriegen wir ihn. Er ist in der Nähe und hat nur ein paar Wachen um sich. Was ist, traust du dich?
#. fr: Jamais je n'aurai une autre occasion d'accéder à lui, alors je vais envoyer mes hommes. On ne peut pas rater cette chance de lui faire la peau. Si vous voulez vous joindre à nous, vous êtes l<if $gn4>a bienvenue<else>e bienvenu</if>. Quand il s'agit d'extermination, plus on est de fous et plus on rit, pas vrai<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Look alive, adventurer. The hills are crawling with Amalj'aa looking to tear the head off of a soft piece of meat like yourself. Or maybe you fancy yourself a fighter? Is it blood you seek?
#. column 57: Over yon in the Amalj'aa encampment of Zanr'ak sits a small band of the beasties. Normally, we wouldn't pay the place any mind. Gutting some low-ranking grunt roasting a marmot over a fire won't win us any wars; but my scouts report that today is different. Commander Diamondjaw Nezedd Gah, for whatever reason, has taken a place at that fire.
#. column 59: Join the raiding party?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, then stay out of our way. Wouldn't want one of my men tripping over your head, now.
msgctxt "FateEvent:182:0:58"
msgid "I could wait two lifetimes and not have another chance such as this, so I'm taking my men in. Throw the bones and see where they fall, I say. If you think you can keep up, you're welcome to join. When killing's the business, the more the merrier, no?"
msgstr "Я и за две жизни такой возможности не дождусь, так что веду туда своих людей. Бросим кости — там видно будет. Думаешь, не отстанешь — присоединяйся. Если дело доходит до убийства, чем больше народу, тем веселее, а?"

#. ja: 襲撃しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Wagst du das Attentat auf Nezedd Gah?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Rejoindre le groupe<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Look alive, adventurer. The hills are crawling with Amalj'aa looking to tear the head off of a soft piece of meat like yourself. Or maybe you fancy yourself a fighter? Is it blood you seek?
#. column 57: Over yon in the Amalj'aa encampment of Zanr'ak sits a small band of the beasties. Normally, we wouldn't pay the place any mind. Gutting some low-ranking grunt roasting a marmot over a fire won't win us any wars; but my scouts report that today is different. Commander Diamondjaw Nezedd Gah, for whatever reason, has taken a place at that fire.
#. column 58: I could wait two lifetimes and not have another chance such as this, so I'm taking my men in. Throw the bones and see where they fall, I say. If you think you can keep up, you're welcome to join. When killing's the business, the more the merrier, no?
#. column 62: Well, then stay out of our way. Wouldn't want one of my men tripping over your head, now.
