msgid "Collect raincatcher nectar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Собрать нектар дожделовов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 恩に着る！<br>いやあ、親切な冒険者さんと<br>出会えてよかったよ。
#. de: Gut, dass es noch hilfsbereite Abenteurer gibt. Danke! Das werde ich dir nicht vergessen.
#. fr: Mille mercis<nbsp>! Je vais attendre ici que vous me rapportiez le miel et que vous donniez une bonne leçon aux colibris<nbsp>!
#. column 56: If I may, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I's but a Wineport housebond, tasked with tendin' the vines.
#. column 57: However, truth be told, 'tis not I what does the bulk o' the work, but the wood's goodly bees. Still, I must find all manner of ways to lure the flyin' faeries up to the vines. O'er the seasons, I's found that raincatcher nectar does a right job.
#. column 58: If it weren't for them bloody pink devils, I'd already have the sweet stuff up on the vines, but a man of me age ain't built to weather a beak to the gut. Might I ask <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> to collect the nectar in me stead? Me master will pay handsomely.
#. column 59: Collect raincatcher nectar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Me master won't be pleased, and I know not how many more lashin's me back can take...
msgctxt "FateEvent:189:0:60"
msgid "A thousand thanks and a thousand more! I'll wait here for the nectar while you give them colibri what's comin' to 'em!"
msgstr "Тысячу раз спасибо! Буду ждать здесь, пока вы принесёте нектар и зададите калибри как следует!"

#. ja: それなら、自力でなんとかしてみる……。<br>ごきげんよう、冒険者さん。お気をつけて。
#. de: Dann muss ich es wohl selbst wagen ... Vielleicht wenn ich ganz langsam und vorsichtig schleiche?
#. fr: Mon maître va être furieux. Je vais devoir trouver une solution...
#. column 56: If I may, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I's but a Wineport housebond, tasked with tendin' the vines.
#. column 57: However, truth be told, 'tis not I what does the bulk o' the work, but the wood's goodly bees. Still, I must find all manner of ways to lure the flyin' faeries up to the vines. O'er the seasons, I's found that raincatcher nectar does a right job.
#. column 58: If it weren't for them bloody pink devils, I'd already have the sweet stuff up on the vines, but a man of me age ain't built to weather a beak to the gut. Might I ask <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> to collect the nectar in me stead? Me master will pay handsomely.
#. column 59: Collect raincatcher nectar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: A thousand thanks and a thousand more! I'll wait here for the nectar while you give them colibri what's comin' to 'em!
msgctxt "FateEvent:189:0:62"
msgid "Me master won't be pleased, and I know not how many more lashin's me back can take..."
msgstr "Хозяин будет недоволен... Не знаю, сколько ещё порок выдержит моя спина..."

#. ja: 「レインキャッチャーの蜜」を集めてきてくれ。<br>コリブリたちも蜜を狙っているから、<br>奴らをさっさと退治したほうが、蜜集めがはかどるよ。
#. de: Ich benötige Regenfänger-Nektar, Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>! Das ist eine ganz famose Pflanze, sag ich dir! Aber hüte dich vor den Kolibris.
#. fr: Vous trouverez le miel dans les pots de cueillepluie. C'est grâce à lui que les plantes attirent les mouches et les écureuils pour les noyer et aspirer tous leurs nutriments. <br>Seuls les Douze savent comment une fleur aussi horrible peut donner un miel aussi sucré. Débarrassez-vous des colibris rapidement pour vous faciliter la tâche.
msgctxt "FateEvent:190:0:56"
msgid "You'll find the nectar deep inside the raincatchers' pots. 'Tis what the plants use to lure flies and squirrels and whatnot inside, so that they might drown the vile things and suck the meager meat straight from the bones. Only the Twelve know how nectar from such a vile flower can be so sweet."
msgstr "Нектар найдёте глубоко внутри чашечек дожделовов. Растение заманивает туда мух, белок и прочую мелочь, чтобы утопить их и высосать жалкие остатки плоти прямо из костей. Одним Двенадцати известно, как у такого мерзкого цветка может быть такой сладкий нектар."

#. ja: 「レインキャッチャーの蜜」は、集まったかい？
#. de: Konntest du den Regenfänger-Nektar besorgen?
#. fr: Vous rapportez du miel, pas vrai<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Ah, the nectar! So sweet, I could smell you comin' from half a malm distant! Many thanks, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. Many thanks!
#. column 62: Pardon me, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I did not mean to offend.
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:191:0:56"
msgid "Bring us back some nectar, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>?"
msgstr "Принесли немного нектара, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if>?"

#. ja: そうそう、この蜜だ。ありがとう！<br>この香り……一発でレインキャッチャーとわかるよ。
#. de: Ah, dieser Duft! Köstlich! Kein Wunder, dass die Bienen darauf fliegen!
#. fr: Ah, ce miel<nbsp>! Il est si doux qu'on le sent à plus d'un malm à la ronde. Je vous remercie infiniment<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Bring us back some nectar, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>?
#. column 62: Pardon me, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I did not mean to offend.
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:191:0:60"
msgid "Ah, the nectar! So sweet, I could smell you comin' from half a malm distant! Many thanks, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. Many thanks!"
msgstr "А, вот он, нектар! Такой сладкий, что я учуял вас за полмальма! Спасибо, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if>. Огромное спасибо!"

#. ja: レインキャッチャーは背の高い赤い花だよ。
#. de: レインキャッチャーは背の高い赤い花だよ。
#. fr: Je vous demande pardon, je ne voulais pas vous offenser.
#. column 56: Bring us back some nectar, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>?
#. column 60: Ah, the nectar! So sweet, I could smell you comin' from half a malm distant! Many thanks, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. Many thanks!
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:191:0:62"
msgid "Pardon me, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I did not mean to offend."
msgstr "Простите, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if>. Я не хотел вас обидеть."

#. ja: 「レインキャッチャーの蜜」は十分集まったよ。<br>なんだかもう、蜜蜂の羽音が聞こえてくる気がするよ。
#. de: Damit habe ich genug Nektar für die Saison. Mir ist, als könnte ich das Summen der Bienen schon ganz deutlich hören!
#. fr: Bénis soient les Douze<nbsp>! Mon seau est presque plein. Je ferais mieux de retourner dans les vignes. Enfin, je parie que je pourrais finir de remplir mon seau si vous m'en apportiez au plus vite.
msgctxt "FateEvent:192:0:56"
msgid "Praise the Twelve! Me bucket's almost full, and there's still a bell to spare. Best be I pack up and make me way back to the vineyard. Though, I still reckon I can find room in the pail for a few more drops, if they was brought to me swift, like."
msgstr "Хвала Двенадцати! Ведро почти полное, а время ещё есть. Пора бы собираться и возвращаться на виноградник. Хотя, если принести побыстрее, в ведре ещё найдётся местечко для пары капель."

#. ja: 「レインキャッチャーの蜜」を集めてくれたのか？
#. de: Bringst du mir noch mehr Regenfänger-Nektar?
#. fr: Vous rapportez du miel, pas vrai<nbsp>?
#. column 60: That was right kindly of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. With this much, me master may just forget the cane tonight.
#. column 62: Pardon me, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I did not mean to offend.
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:193:0:56"
msgid "Might <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> have brought back even more nectar?"
msgstr "Не принесли ли <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if> ещё нектара?"

#. ja: うわー、ありがとう。<br>こんなに集めてくれるなんて、<br>頼もしい冒険者と出会えてよかったよ！
#. de: Vielen Dank! So viel Nektar! Auf dich ist wirklich Verlass.
#. fr: C'était vraiment très gentil. Avec tout cela, j'échapperai peut-être aux coups de canne ce soir.
#. column 56: Might <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> have brought back even more nectar?
#. column 62: Pardon me, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I did not mean to offend.
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:193:0:60"
msgid "That was right kindly of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. With this much, me master may just forget the cane tonight."
msgstr "Очень любезно с вашей стороны, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if>. С таким количеством хозяин, может, сегодня и не станет браться за трость."

#. ja: ちょうどよかった。<br>もう十分な量が集まったんだ。
#. de: Gut, ich habe nämlich schon mehr als genug Nektar! Danke für deine Hilfe!
#. fr: Je vous demande pardon, je ne voulais pas vous offenser.
#. column 56: Might <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> have brought back even more nectar?
#. column 60: That was right kindly of you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. With this much, me master may just forget the cane tonight.
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:193:0:62"
msgid "Pardon me, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>. I did not mean to offend."
msgstr "Простите, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорд</if>. Я не хотел вас обидеть."

#. ja: 冒険者か……<br>見てくれよ、街道に魔物があふれてる……
#. de: Sieh dir das mal an, Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>. Was ist das für ein Zustand? Links und rechts der Straße ist alles voller Monster!
#. fr: V-vous avez entendu<nbsp>? Et là<nbsp>? Cette jungle va me rendre fou.
#. column 57: I seek only to return home to my wife, my wine, and my warm p<hyphen>p<hyphen>pair of ph<hyphen>ph<hyphen>phurbleskin room slippers. But look. My legs are j<hyphen>j<hyphen>jelly and the sweat pours forth from my brow like there was a raging river inside my head.
#. column 58: I simply c-c-c-c-cannot make the journey! B<hyphen>B<hyphen>But if there were someone to clear the path for me...
#. column 59: Assist the off-duty porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have put my heart at ease, good friend. Now let us hurry before the fear takes me again.
#. column 62: Wh-Wh-What would you have me do then!?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:194:0:56"
msgid "D-D-Did you hear that? And that? And <i>that</i>!? This d<hyphen>d<hyphen>damnable jungle will have my sanity before the sun has turned."
msgstr "С-с-слышали? А это? И <i>это</i>!? Будь прокляты эти дж-дже-джунгли! До заката я тут точно рассудка лишусь."

#. ja: 行きは、こんな状態じゃなかったのに<br>これじゃ、いつになったら家に帰れることやら……<br>新婚なもんで、早く帰りたいのに……。
#. de: Vielleicht sieht man gerade nicht alle, aber ich sage dir, sie sind da und lauern! Klar passiert das am Rückweg, wenn man müde ist und nur mehr nach Hause will. \<seufz>
#. fr: Je veux juste  retrouver ma femme, mon bon vin et mes chaussons bien chauds. J'ai les jambes en coton et une fièvre carabinée.
#. column 56: D-D-Did you hear that? And that? And <i>that</i>!? This d<hyphen>d<hyphen>damnable jungle will have my sanity before the sun has turned.
#. column 58: I simply c-c-c-c-cannot make the journey! B<hyphen>B<hyphen>But if there were someone to clear the path for me...
#. column 59: Assist the off-duty porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have put my heart at ease, good friend. Now let us hurry before the fear takes me again.
#. column 62: Wh-Wh-What would you have me do then!?
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:194:0:57"
msgid "I seek only to return home to my wife, my wine, and my warm p<hyphen>p<hyphen>pair of ph<hyphen>ph<hyphen>phurbleskin room slippers. But look. My legs are j<hyphen>j<hyphen>jelly and the sweat pours forth from my brow like there was a raging river inside my head."
msgstr "Хочу только вернуться домой, к жене, вину и тёплым п-п-парным тапочкам из шкурки ф-ф-фурбола. Но посмотрите: ноги др-дрожат, а пот льётся со лба, будто у меня в голове река разлилась."

#. ja: なあ、もしあんたもここを通るなら、<br>ついでに、魔物を退治してくれないか？
#. de: Ich meine - falls du auch hier durchmusst, wie wär's, wenn du den Weg freiräumst?
#. fr: Je ne peux pas faire ce voyage seul. M-mais si jamais quelqu'un acceptait de m'accompagner...
#. column 56: D-D-Did you hear that? And that? And <i>that</i>!? This d<hyphen>d<hyphen>damnable jungle will have my sanity before the sun has turned.
#. column 57: I seek only to return home to my wife, my wine, and my warm p<hyphen>p<hyphen>pair of ph<hyphen>ph<hyphen>phurbleskin room slippers. But look. My legs are j<hyphen>j<hyphen>jelly and the sweat pours forth from my brow like there was a raging river inside my head.
#. column 59: Assist the off-duty porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have put my heart at ease, good friend. Now let us hurry before the fear takes me again.
#. column 62: Wh-Wh-What would you have me do then!?
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:194:0:58"
msgid "I simply c-c-c-c-cannot make the journey! B<hyphen>B<hyphen>But if there were someone to clear the path for me..."
msgstr "Я просто н-не м-могу пройти весь этот путь! Е-если бы кто-нибудь расчистил мне дорогу..."

#. ja: 退治してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du den Weg monsterfrei machen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter l'homme jusqu'à Port-aux-Vins<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: D-D-Did you hear that? And that? And <i>that</i>!? This d<hyphen>d<hyphen>damnable jungle will have my sanity before the sun has turned.
#. column 57: I seek only to return home to my wife, my wine, and my warm p<hyphen>p<hyphen>pair of ph<hyphen>ph<hyphen>phurbleskin room slippers. But look. My legs are j<hyphen>j<hyphen>jelly and the sweat pours forth from my brow like there was a raging river inside my head.
#. column 58: I simply c-c-c-c-cannot make the journey! B<hyphen>B<hyphen>But if there were someone to clear the path for me...
#. column 60: You have put my heart at ease, good friend. Now let us hurry before the fear takes me again.
#. column 62: Wh-Wh-What would you have me do then!?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:194:0:59"
msgid "Assist the off-duty porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь отставному носильщику?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、助かるぜ。<br>これで、早く妻に会えそうだ。
#. de: Danke! Ich bin frisch verheiratet, weißt du. Da wäre ich schon froh, wenn ich noch ein paar Jährchen meines Lebens genießen könnte.
#. fr: Je vous remercie de tout cœur. Partons vite avant que la peur ne me prenne à nouveau.
#. column 56: D-D-Did you hear that? And that? And <i>that</i>!? This d<hyphen>d<hyphen>damnable jungle will have my sanity before the sun has turned.
#. column 57: I seek only to return home to my wife, my wine, and my warm p<hyphen>p<hyphen>pair of ph<hyphen>ph<hyphen>phurbleskin room slippers. But look. My legs are j<hyphen>j<hyphen>jelly and the sweat pours forth from my brow like there was a raging river inside my head.
#. column 58: I simply c-c-c-c-cannot make the journey! B<hyphen>B<hyphen>But if there were someone to clear the path for me...
#. column 59: Assist the off-duty porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Wh-Wh-What would you have me do then!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:194:0:60"
msgid "You have put my heart at ease, good friend. Now let us hurry before the fear takes me again."
msgstr "Вы меня успокоили, друг! Поспешим, пока страх снова не вернулся."

#. ja: そ、そんな……。<br>さては、新婚の俺への嫉妬だな……？
#. de: Was? Aber ich bin doch  frisch verheiratet u-und ... außerdem ... Ich will hier nicht von Monstern zerfleischt werden!
#. fr: C-comment voulez-vous que je m'en sorte<nbsp>?
#. column 56: D-D-Did you hear that? And that? And <i>that</i>!? This d<hyphen>d<hyphen>damnable jungle will have my sanity before the sun has turned.
#. column 57: I seek only to return home to my wife, my wine, and my warm p<hyphen>p<hyphen>pair of ph<hyphen>ph<hyphen>phurbleskin room slippers. But look. My legs are j<hyphen>j<hyphen>jelly and the sweat pours forth from my brow like there was a raging river inside my head.
#. column 58: I simply c-c-c-c-cannot make the journey! B<hyphen>B<hyphen>But if there were someone to clear the path for me...
#. column 59: Assist the off-duty porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have put my heart at ease, good friend. Now let us hurry before the fear takes me again.
msgctxt "FateEvent:194:0:62"
msgid "Wh-Wh-What would you have me do then!?"
msgstr "И что же вы предлагаете мне делать!?"

#. ja: 街道の魔物を退治してくれよ！<br>このままじゃ家に帰れないんだ！
#. de: Nun vertreib schon die Bestie an der Straße! Du willst doch auch nach Hause, oder gefällt's dir hier draußen so gut?
#. fr: N-nous sommes encerclés<nbsp>! F-faites quelque chose<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:195:0:56"
msgid "Th-Th-Th-They surround us! D-D-Do something!"
msgstr "О-О-Они нас окружили! С-Сделайте что-нибудь!"

#. ja: たーいへん、たーいへん！<br>鉱山で　ほりだしーた石像<br>動きだしーて　あばれだしーた！
#. de: Furchtbar, furchtbar! Mann aus Stein lebt! Mann aus Stein läuft! Haben wir Furchtbares ausgegraben aus Berg!
#. fr: À l'aide<nbsp>! L'homme de pierre, c'est un tueur<nbsp>!
#. column 57: O benevolent Lord of Crags! Why have You forsaken Your children!? Are we not worthy of saving from this terrible man of stone!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:196:0:56"
msgid "Save us! Saaave us! The man of stone, he walks! The man of stone, he kills!"
msgstr "Спасите нас! Спасите! Каменный человек ходит! Каменный человек убивает!"

#. ja: あぶなくーて　鉱山　はいれなーい！<br>石像　鉱山　でてきたーら　もっとあぶなーい。<br>だれーか　石像　こわしーて　ほしーな！
#. de: Können nicht in Berg zurück, so gefährlich wegen Mann aus Stein! Wenn rauskommt, noch mehr Gefahr! Muss wer zerstören!
#. fr: Ô Primordial des tremblements dévastateurs<nbsp>! Pourquoi nous as-tu abandonnés<nbsp>? Ne sommes-nous pas dignes d'être sauvés<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Save us! Saaave us! The man of stone, he walks! The man of stone, he kills!
msgctxt "FateEvent:196:0:57"
msgid "O benevolent Lord of Crags! Why have You forsaken Your children!? Are we not worthy of saving from this terrible man of stone!? "
msgstr "О милосердный Владыка Утёсов! За что ты оставил своих детей!? Неужели мы недостойны спасения от этого ужасного каменного человека!?"

#. ja: 帝国兵とテンパードシルフとの戦いが激化すれば、<br>より大きな戦火が広がってしまう……！<br>いいか、今は帝国兵を優先的に攻撃するんだ。
#. de: Wer weiß, was passiert, wenn der Kampf zwischen den Garlearn und den Sylphen außer Kontrolle gerät. Los, wir greifen ein! Stürz dich auf die Garlear!
#. fr: Nous ne pouvons pas laisser les troupes impériales quitter ces bois. Nous devons utiliser les sylphes subjugués à notre avantage et ne les attaquer que s'ils le font en premier. Ce sont peut-être des ennemis, mais ils sont les enfants de la forêt. Ce sont les élémentaires qui devront décider de leur destin.
msgctxt "FateEvent:197:0:56"
msgid "The imperials cannot be allowed to leave this grove alive. We must use the tempered sylphs to our advantage and only engage them if they attack first. Enemies though they may be, they are still children of the forest. Their fates are to be decided by the elementals."
msgstr "Нельзя позволить имперцам живыми выбраться из этой рощи. Надо использовать порабощённых сильфов в своих целях и нападать на них, только если они атакуют первыми. Пусть они и враги, но всё же дети леса. Их судьбу решат элементали."

#. ja: 協力してくださる冒険者の方ですね？<br>ありがとうございます……実のところを申せば、<br>ジャイアント族と戦うことに、不安を覚えていましたから。
#. de: Du willst uns helfen, ja? Ich danke dir. Um ganz ehrlich zu sein, wir haben unheimliche Angst vor den Riesen ...
#. fr: J'aimerais participer au combat, mais je ne peux plus bouger. Mon... armure semble... euh... rouillée et je... euh... ne ferais que vous ralentir. Oui, vous ralentir. Je vous en prie, allez-y.
msgctxt "FateEvent:198:0:56"
msgid "I would join you in battle if I could, but my wounds... I fear they would only burden you."
msgstr "Я бы сражался с вами, если бы мог, но мои раны... боюсь, я буду вам только обузой."

#. ja: 奴らに、資材を狙う知恵があったとはな……。
#. de: Dass sie es auf die Kisten mit Fundstücken abgesehen hatten! Diese Riesen haben mehr Verstand als gedacht!
#. fr: Nous pensions depuis longtemps que les géants avaient des capacités cognitives limitées. On n'aurait pas cru qu'ils sauraient s'en prendre aux caisses contenant nos recherches...
msgctxt "FateEvent:199:0:56"
msgid "It has been long believed that giants only possess the cognitive ability of a common field mouse, but if they are selectively destroying the research, while leaving the other crates undamaged..."
msgstr "Давно считалось, что гиганты умом не превосходят обычную полевую мышь. Но если они целенаправленно уничтожают наши исследования, не трогая остальные ящики..."

#. ja: ひぃ～、クタクタだ。<br>さっさと荷物片付けて、休憩しようぜ、なあ。
#. de: Puh! Los, prüfen wir die Ladung! Und dann brauch ich eine Pause, das sag ich dir.
#. fr: Je commence à avoir mal aux jambes et au dos. Ramassons ce que nous pouvons et filons.
msgctxt "FateEvent:200:0:56"
msgid "My legs and back grow tired. Let us gather what we can and be off."
msgstr "Ноги и спина уже ноют. Соберём, что сможем, и уйдём."

#. ja: 早いとこ搬入したほうがいいわね。<br>また来るかもしれないし。
#. de: Wir müssen die Sachen schnell in Sicherheit bringen. Wer weiß, wann sie wieder angreifen!
#. fr: Nous devons faire vite. J'ai l'impression que ce n'est pas la dernière fois que nous voyons nos amis les géants.
msgctxt "FateEvent:201:0:56"
msgid "We must make haste. I have this sinking feeling that we have not seen the last of our giant friends."
msgstr "Нужно поторопиться. Что-то подсказывает мне, что это не последняя наша встреча с гигантами."

#. ja: おわっ！？<br>安全だと思ってたのに……ここまで追ってきたなんて！
#. de: Oh nein! Da sind sie! Und wir dachten, wir seien in Sicherheit!
#. fr: Ils nous ont poursuivis jusqu'ici<nbsp>! Qu'est-ce qui peut bien motiver ces créatures<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:202:0:56"
msgid "For them to pursue us this far! Whatever is it that drives these creatures!?"
msgstr "Зачем они гнались за нами так далеко? Что ими движет?!"

#. ja: くそっ、邪魔くさいジャイアント族だぜっ！<br>けど……今の俺たちの装備じゃどうにもなんねぇ。
#. de: Die vermaledeiten Riesen sind schon wieder da! Aber mit unserer Ausrüstung haben wir nicht die geringste Chance ...
#. fr: Les voilà. Je pensais que nous pourrions discuter une dernière fois comme des gens civilisés, mais ces sourires démoniaques me font penser le contraire.
msgctxt "FateEvent:203:0:56"
msgid "There they are. I thought we may have one last chance to discuss this like civilized men, but those devilish grins speak otherwise."
msgstr "Вот они. Я думал, у нас будет ещё шанс решить всё по-хорошему, как цивилизованные люди, но эти дьявольские ухмылки говорят об обратном."

#. ja: たいちょー！<br>なんだか寒くなってきたし、今日は諦めて戻りませんか？
#. de: Kommandant! Es wird immer kälter und den Männern friert! Sollen wir uns zurückziehen?
#. fr: Encore une heure par ce froid et je vais geler sur place. Pourquoi n'avons-nous pas reçu pour mission d'étudier les bernaches de Costa del Sol<nbsp>?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:204:0:56"
msgid "One more bell in this cold and my arse will <i>literally</i> freeze off: fall right from my backside and shatter into a thousand pieces upon the tundra. Why couldn't we have been assigned to studying the mysteries of the barnacles of Costa del Sol?"
msgstr "Ещё один час на таком холоде — и моя задница <i>буквально</i> отвалится, упадёт и разлетится на тысячу кусочков по всей тундре. Почему нас не отправили изучать загадки ракушек Коста-дель-Соль?"

#. ja: 頼むぞ、冒険者！<br>今は君だけが頼りなのだ！
#. de: Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>, hilf uns!
#. fr: Plus je vois ces géants et plus je pense que j'ai été stupide de croire que je pouvais raisonner de telles brutes.
msgctxt "FateEvent:205:0:56"
msgid "The more I see of these giants, the more convinced I am of how foolish I was for ever believing that I might reason with the lumbering lummoxes."
msgstr "Чем больше я вижу этих гигантов, тем яснее понимаю, каким же глупцом был, когда думал, что смогу с ними договориться."

#. ja: ホントに頼むぜ、おい。<br>あんたらみたいなのがやってくれねぇと、<br>こっちが困っちまうんでな。
#. de: Nun mach schon, verdammt! Wofür hast du denn nun deine Waffe?!
#. fr: Combien sont-ils, au juste<nbsp>? Je tremble rien que d'y penser<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:206:0:56"
msgid "Just how many of these things can there be!? I shudder at the thought!"
msgstr "Да сколько же их ещё!? У меня аж дрожь берёт!"

#. ja: こういう時にこそ頼れるのが冒険者。<br>バッチリ決めてくれちゃってよね！
#. de: Ich sag doch, die Abenteurer sind ein nützliches Volk! Immer drauf, <if $gn4>tapferes Mädchen<else>mein Freund</if>!
#. fr: Les aventuriers sont-ils tous aussi braves que vous<nbsp>? On raconte pourtant que vous n'êtes que des bandits sans foi ni loi qui tueraient père et mère. Vous n'allez pas me tuer, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:207:0:56"
msgid "I say, are all adventurers as brave and noble as you? Because rumor has it that you are all merciless bandits who'll cut an old woman's throat if there's gil to be had for doing it. You wouldn't cut my throat, would you?"
msgstr "Скажите, все авантюристы такие храбрые и благородные, как вы? А то слухи ходят, будто вы безжалостные бандиты, готовые перерезать старухе горло за гил. Вы ведь не перережете мне горло?"

#. ja: 一旦、休憩だ。<br>遅れている者が追いつき次第、出発する。
#. de: Wir rasten hier. Sobald die Nachzügler aufgeholt haben, geht's weiter.
#. fr: Je pense avoir vu certains de mes compagnons au loin. Attendons qu'ils nous rejoignent.
msgctxt "FateEvent:208:0:56"
msgid "I believe I saw some of my companions in the distance. Let us wait here for them to join us."
msgstr "Кажется, я видел вдали своих спутников. Подождём, пока они нас догонят."

#. ja: 参りましたなぁ……これは。<br>一体どうしたんでしょう、もう追いついてもいいのに。<br>まさか、何かトラブルにでも巻き込まれて……?
#. de: Verflixt, wo steckt er nur? Er wird sich doch nicht verlaufen haben. Dabei sollte er die Route langsam kennen ...
#. fr: Regardez<nbsp>! C'est le reste de ma caravane<nbsp>! Mais quelque chose ne tourne pas rond... Quelqu'un les attaque<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:209:0:56"
msgid "There! I see the rest of my caravan...but something's wrong... Could it be they are under attack?"
msgstr "Вон они! Вижу остаток каравана... Но что-то не так... Неужели на них напали?"

#. ja: た、助けてくれぇぇぇっ！<br>私は、私は死にたくなぃぃぃっ！
#. de: H-Hilfe! Zu Hüüülf!
#. fr: Je vous en prie<nbsp>! Ne me laissez pas mourir ici<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:210:0:56"
msgid "Please! I cannot be left to die like this!"
msgstr "Прошу! Нельзя же бросить меня умирать вот так!"

#. ja: いやぁ！<br>どうして、どうしてこんなことに！<br>誰か助けてよぉ……！
#. de: Wie konnte es nur so weit kommen? Jemand muss uns helfen! Irgendwer!
#. fr: Pourquoi moi<nbsp>? Pourquoi<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:211:0:56"
msgid "Why me!? Why meee!?"
msgstr "Почему я!? Почему яяя!?"

#. ja: ああもうっ、じれったい！<br>あんなの、さっさと片付けちまえっ！
#. de: Kurzen Prozess muss man da machen, jawohl!
#. fr: Si seulement j'avais une épée...
msgctxt "FateEvent:212:0:56"
msgid "If I only had a blade..."
msgstr "Вот бы у меня был клинок..."

#. ja: ……このまま共倒れして、<br>俺が捕まったこと、ウヤムヤにできねーかな……？
#. de: Ich! Gefangen! Wie soll ich mich da rausreden? Jeder wird wissen, dass ich jämmerlich versagt habe ...
#. fr: Que ces imbéciles s'entre-tuent. Nous aurons moins à faire, comme cela.
msgctxt "FateEvent:213:0:56"
msgid "Let the fools kill each other. It will save the rest of us the trouble."
msgstr "Пусть эти дураки перебьют друг друга. Нам меньше возни останется."

#. ja: これから始まる「コンチネンタル・パレード」は、<br>みんなが驚く姿に「変身」して、回廊を練り歩く催し……。
#. de: Gleich beginnt die Parade der Gaukler! Mach mit und feier ein schaurig-schönes Allerschutzheiligen-Fest!
#. fr: Vous voulez participer à notre grande parade<nbsp>? Nous parcourons les rues déguisés pour surprendre les citadins<nbsp>!
#. column 57: When the parade begins, speak with the unusual illusionist yonder. He will grant a form at once festive and frightening. While in this form, pray cast the Festal Cant charm upon those spectators who have come to watch.
#. column 58: So, what say you? Will you join our petrifying procession, and bring happiness and fortune to the people?
#. column 59: Participate in the parade?
#. column 62: Oh? Does my description of our creepy cavalcade fill you with terror? Unfortunate, that. Should you manage to muster your courage, you will find me here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:214:0:56"
msgid "Greetings, adventurer. Are you perchance here to join our splendidly spooky parade? There is nothing to it, I assure you."
msgstr "Приветствую, авантюрист. Не хотите ли присоединиться к нашей жутко-прекрасной параде? Не бойтесь, ничего сложного."

#. ja: パレードが始まったら「妖しい奇術師」に変身させてもらって……<br>そして、見物客の「ウルダハの市民」たちに、<br>幸運の「おまじない」をかけてあげるのよ……クスクス……。
#. de: Lass dich nach Beginn der Parade von dem halbseidenen Gaukler verwandeln und belege die Bürger Ul'dahs mit einem Glückszauber!
#. fr: Demandez à un illusionniste qu'il vous transforme<nbsp>! Puis jetez une incantation aux citadins. Ce sera très amusant<nbsp>! Hi hi hi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Greetings, adventurer. Are you perchance here to join our splendidly spooky parade? There is nothing to it, I assure you.
#. column 58: So, what say you? Will you join our petrifying procession, and bring happiness and fortune to the people?
#. column 59: Participate in the parade?
#. column 62: Oh? Does my description of our creepy cavalcade fill you with terror? Unfortunate, that. Should you manage to muster your courage, you will find me here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:214:0:57"
msgid "When the parade begins, speak with the unusual illusionist yonder. He will grant a form at once festive and frightening. While in this form, pray cast the Festal Cant charm upon those spectators who have come to watch."
msgstr "Когда начнётся парад, поговорите с тем странным иллюзионистом вон там. Он придаст вам облик одновременно праздничный и жуткий. А потом в этом облике произнесите заклинание «Праздничный напев» для зрителей, пришедших на нас посмотреть."

#. ja: このパンプキンヘッドとともに、<br>楽しい楽しいパレードをしましょう……クスクス……。<br>どう？　あなたも参加してくださらない？
#. de: Feier mit dem Großen Kürbiskopf! Es soll eine glückselige Nacht für alle werden!
#. fr: Une joyeuse parade en compagnie d'une femme à tête de citrouille, vous vous en souviendrez toute votre vie<nbsp>!<br>Alors<nbsp>? Ça vous tente<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Greetings, adventurer. Are you perchance here to join our splendidly spooky parade? There is nothing to it, I assure you.
#. column 57: When the parade begins, speak with the unusual illusionist yonder. He will grant a form at once festive and frightening. While in this form, pray cast the Festal Cant charm upon those spectators who have come to watch.
#. column 59: Participate in the parade?
#. column 62: Oh? Does my description of our creepy cavalcade fill you with terror? Unfortunate, that. Should you manage to muster your courage, you will find me here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:214:0:58"
msgid "So, what say you? Will you join our petrifying procession, and bring happiness and fortune to the people?"
msgstr "Ну что скажете? Присоединитесь к нашей леденящей кровь процессии и подарите людям счастье и удачу?"

#. ja: パレードを始めますか？
#. de: Möchtest du die Parade starten?
#. fr: Participer à la parade<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Greetings, adventurer. Are you perchance here to join our splendidly spooky parade? There is nothing to it, I assure you.
#. column 57: When the parade begins, speak with the unusual illusionist yonder. He will grant a form at once festive and frightening. While in this form, pray cast the Festal Cant charm upon those spectators who have come to watch.
#. column 58: So, what say you? Will you join our petrifying procession, and bring happiness and fortune to the people?
#. column 62: Oh? Does my description of our creepy cavalcade fill you with terror? Unfortunate, that. Should you manage to muster your courage, you will find me here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:214:0:59"
msgid "Participate in the parade?"
msgstr "Участвовать в параде?"

#. ja: そう、残念だわ……。<br>始めたくなったら声をかけて……クスクス……。
#. de: Wie schade ... Lass es mich wissen, wenn du es dir anders überlegst!
#. fr: Dommage... Revenez me parler si vous changez d'avis<nbsp>! Hi hi hi.
#. column 56: Greetings, adventurer. Are you perchance here to join our splendidly spooky parade? There is nothing to it, I assure you.
#. column 57: When the parade begins, speak with the unusual illusionist yonder. He will grant a form at once festive and frightening. While in this form, pray cast the Festal Cant charm upon those spectators who have come to watch.
#. column 58: So, what say you? Will you join our petrifying procession, and bring happiness and fortune to the people?
#. column 59: Participate in the parade?
msgctxt "FateEvent:214:0:62"
msgid "Oh? Does my description of our creepy cavalcade fill you with terror? Unfortunate, that. Should you manage to muster your courage, you will find me here."
msgstr "Ох? Неужели мой рассказ о жутком шествии вас напугал? Как жаль. Если наберётесь храбрости, найдёте меня здесь."

#. ja: アルケオダイノスに追われてるくぽ。<br>ぷぷぷ……ちょっと挑発してやったら、<br>すぐに顔真っ赤っかくぽ～！
#. de: Dass diese Archaeosaurier aber auch immer so nachtragend sein müssen, kupo! Ich meine, ein paar Nüsse in den Nüstern: Wer wird denn da gleich aus den Schuppen fahren?
#. fr: Au secours<nbsp>! Au secours, kuppo<nbsp>! De méchants archéosaures veulent me manger<nbsp>! Je leur ai fait une petite farce, mais ils se sont énervés tout rouge, kuppo<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Yes, I might have misplaced them <i>in</i> the nose of a sleeping scaly-crawly...but is that truly cause to condemn a poor, defenseless moogle, kupo?
#. column 58: Save Mogoosh from his own undoing?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: But I did nothing wrong, kupo!
msgctxt "FateEvent:221:0:56"
msgid "What!? I simply misplaced a few kupo nuts, and now the whole world is after me, kupo!"
msgstr "Что!? Я всего-то потерял пару орешков купо, а теперь весь мир за мной гонится, купо!"

#. ja: やつら、鼻だけは利くから、そろそろここも危ないくぽ。<br>キミ、ひまそうだから、モグのかわりに、<br>相手してやってくれないくぽ？
#. de: Du hast doch sicher Lust auf einen Trainingskampf, oder? Dein Glück, den hab ich dir nämlich besorgt, kupo!
#. fr: Comme ils ont un bon nez, ils ne tarderont pas à arriver jusqu'ici, kuppo<nbsp>! Vous voulez bien vous occuper d'eux pour moi<nbsp>?
#. column 56: What!? I simply misplaced a few kupo nuts, and now the whole world is after me, kupo!
#. column 58: Save Mogoosh from his own undoing?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: But I did nothing wrong, kupo!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:221:0:57"
msgid "Yes, I might have misplaced them <i>in</i> the nose of a sleeping scaly-crawly...but is that truly cause to condemn a poor, defenseless moogle, kupo?"
msgstr "Да, я мог потерять их <i>в</i> носу у спящего чешуйчатого ползуна... Но разве это повод осуждать бедного беззащитного мугла, купо?"

#. ja: 相手してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Mogosh vor den wütenden Archaeosauriern retten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Vous occuper des archéosaures<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: What!? I simply misplaced a few kupo nuts, and now the whole world is after me, kupo!
#. column 57: Yes, I might have misplaced them <i>in</i> the nose of a sleeping scaly-crawly...but is that truly cause to condemn a poor, defenseless moogle, kupo?
#. column 62: But I did nothing wrong, kupo!
