msgid "Save Mogoosh from his own undoing?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Спасти Могуша от него самого?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: チッ……頼りない冒険者くぽ……！<br>ここは危ないから、さっさと逃げるがいいくぽ！
#. de: Pah, <if $gn4>feige Abenteurerin<else>feiger Abenteurer</if>, kupo! Ehre ist dir wohl fremd, was?
#. fr: Oh là là<nbsp>! Vous n'êtes pas très aimable, vous, kuppo<nbsp>! En tout cas, ça va être très dangereux par ici<nbsp>! Sauve kuppo<nbsp>!
#. column 56: What!? I simply misplaced a few kupo nuts, and now the whole world is after me, kupo!
#. column 57: Yes, I might have misplaced them <i>in</i> the nose of a sleeping scaly-crawly...but is that truly cause to condemn a poor, defenseless moogle, kupo?
#. column 58: Save Mogoosh from his own undoing?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:221:0:62"
msgid "But I did nothing wrong, kupo!"
msgstr "Но я ничего плохого не сделал, купо!"

#. ja: 冒険者さん、いいところに来たくぽ～。<br>身勝手なあいつのせいで、仲間が迷惑してるくぽ。<br>根性を叩きなおしてほしいくぽ～！
#. de: Gut, dass du da bist, Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>! Mogosh hat schon wieder nichts als Unsinn im Kopf und bringt uns alle in Gefahr, kupo. Kannst du ihm seine Flausen austreiben?
#. fr: Oh, vous tombez bien, kuppo<nbsp>! À cause de ce vilain chenapan, mes camarades sont bien gênés<nbsp>! Dites, vous voulez bien lui donner une bonne leçon, kuppo<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Lend your adequately bony fist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: No fist? I suppose, then, an ordinary rock will have to suffice, kupo.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:222:0:56"
msgid "That misbehaving Mogoosh has plucked one too many poms, nicked one too many nuts, and drubbed one too many dragons. What he <i>needs</i> is a good cuff on his tuft...but not with some soft moogle mitt. No, it should be a hard bony fist......like the one <i>you</i> just so happen to have, kupo!"
msgstr "Этот негодник Могуш уже сорвал слишком много помпонов, стащил слишком много орехов и отделал слишком много драконов. Ему <i>нужно</i> хорошенько отвесить по помпону... только не мягкой лапкой мугла. Нет, нужен крепкий костлявый кулак... такой, как у вас, купо!"

#. ja: 叩きなおしてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Mogosh eine Lektion erteilen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Donner une bonne leçon au chenapan<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: That misbehaving Mogoosh has plucked one too many poms, nicked one too many nuts, and drubbed one too many dragons. What he <i>needs</i> is a good cuff on his tuft...but not with some soft moogle mitt. No, it should be a hard bony fist......like the one <i>you</i> just so happen to have, kupo!
#. column 62: No fist? I suppose, then, an ordinary rock will have to suffice, kupo.
