msgid "Lend your adequately bony fist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Одолжить свой крепкий костлявый кулак?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: がーん！　それは残念くぽ……。<br>でもでも、もしも気が変わって、手伝う気になったら、<br>いつでも戻ってくるくぽ！
#. de: Ach menno, kupo! Hast du viel zu tun? Wenn du's dir anders überlegst, ich warte hier!
#. fr: Kuppoooooo<nbsp>!?<nbsp>... D'accord... Mais si vous changez d'avis, revenez me voir, d'accord, kuppo<nbsp>?
#. column 56: That misbehaving Mogoosh has plucked one too many poms, nicked one too many nuts, and drubbed one too many dragons. What he <i>needs</i> is a good cuff on his tuft...but not with some soft moogle mitt. No, it should be a hard bony fist......like the one <i>you</i> just so happen to have, kupo!
#. column 57: Lend your adequately bony fist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:222:0:62"
msgid "No fist? I suppose, then, an ordinary rock will have to suffice, kupo."
msgstr "Нет кулака? Тогда придётся обойтись обычным камнем, купо."

#. ja: うしし……おたから、いっぱいくぽ！<br>でもでも、まだまだ欲しいくぽ！<br>もっと集めてほしいくぽ！
#. de: Ui, wie das glitzert und glänzt, kupo! Bring noch mehr davon, mehr!
#. fr: Kuppopo<nbsp>! À moi tous les trésors<nbsp>! Mais il m'en faut plus, kuppo<nbsp>! Dites, vous allez m'aider à obtenir plus de trésors<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:223:0:56"
msgid "The hills are still ali～ve. Alive, I tell you! You can trust me on this, kupo!"
msgstr "Холмы всё ещё живы-ы-ы. Живы, говорю тебе! Можешь мне верить, купо!"

#. ja: おたから、いっぱい集まったくぽ！<br>もっともっと、欲しいくぽ！
#. de: In glitzernde Münzen will ich mich kleiden, kupo! Bring mehr, meeehr!
#. fr: Kuppopo<nbsp>! J'ai encore plus de trésors<nbsp>! Mais je n'en ai jamais assez<nbsp>! Apportez-m'en davantage, kuppo<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Mwah hah! No more will they laugh at me, kupo! They will only hide their eyes from the twinkling!
#. column 62: My neck... Oh, how it twinkles! Oh, how it aches... Maybe it is time to call it a day, kupo...
msgctxt "FateEvent:224:0:56"
msgid "More! I must have more! I cannot be out-twinkled! I must not be out-sparkled! Did you bring me more twinkling, kupo?"
msgstr "Ещё! Мне нужно ещё! Нельзя, чтобы меня переплюнули по блеску! Нельзя, чтобы затмили! Принёс мне ещё блестяшек, купо?"

#. ja: うしし……ありがとくぽ～！<br>もっとおたから、欲しいくぽ！
#. de: Danke, kupo! Bring mir mehr davon, meeehr!
#. fr: Hihihi<nbsp>! Merci, kuppo<nbsp>! Allez, encore plus<nbsp>!
#. column 56: More! I must have more! I cannot be out-twinkled! I must not be out-sparkled! Did you bring me more twinkling, kupo?
#. column 62: My neck... Oh, how it twinkles! Oh, how it aches... Maybe it is time to call it a day, kupo...
msgctxt "FateEvent:224:0:60"
msgid "Mwah hah! No more will they laugh at me, kupo! They will only hide their eyes from the twinkling!"
msgstr "Муа-ха-ха! Теперь надо мной больше не будут смеяться, купо! Будут только прятать глаза от блеска!"

#. ja: おたから、もういいくぽ。<br>いっぱいありすぎて、持てないくぽ。
#. de: Danke, kupo, das reicht! Mehr kann ich nicht tragen.
#. fr: Je crois que j'ai assez de trésors comme ça, kuppo<nbsp>! Si j'en ai plus, je ne pourrai pas tout transporter, kuppo...
#. column 56: More! I must have more! I cannot be out-twinkled! I must not be out-sparkled! Did you bring me more twinkling, kupo?
#. column 60: Mwah hah! No more will they laugh at me, kupo! They will only hide their eyes from the twinkling!
msgctxt "FateEvent:224:0:62"
msgid "My neck... Oh, how it twinkles! Oh, how it aches... Maybe it is time to call it a day, kupo..."
msgstr "Шея... Ох, как блестит! И как же болит... Пожалуй, на сегодня хватит, купо..."

#. ja: ここには、おたからがいっぱいくぽ。<br>丸いピカピカ、いっぱい拾ってきてほしいくぽ！
#. de: Münzen, so viele Münzen, kupo! Heb sie alle auf. Alle!
#. fr: Kuppopo<nbsp>! Il y a plein de petits trésors brillants et ronds ici<nbsp>! Ramassez-les pour moi, kuppo<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:225:0:56"
msgid "The hills are alive with the sound of twinkling, kupo.♪"
msgstr "Холмы звенят от блеска, купо.♪"

#. ja: うしし……ここは、おたからがいっぱいくぽ！<br>丸いピカピカ、見つけたら、集めてきてほしいくぽ～！
#. de: Hier liegen so viele schicke Münzen rum, kupo! Mit einer Kette daraus werden mich in Moglingen alle beneiden!
#. fr: Hihihi<nbsp>! Il y a plein de petits trésors brillants et ronds ici<nbsp>! Trouvez-les et apportez-les-moi, kuppo<nbsp>!
#. column 57: You cannot hear twinkling, kupo? Of course you cannot! You are not a moogle! But you can see twinkling, no? You have eyes, no? Then help me find the twinkling, kupo!
#. column 58: Help the modish moogle?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Huzzah! Hooray! Hurrah! My necklace will soon be complete, kupo!
#. column 62: But my necklace, kupo...
msgctxt "FateEvent:226:0:56"
msgid "Hehehe! The hills are alive with the sound of twinkling, kupo!♪"
msgstr "Хи-хи-хи! Холмы звенят от блеска, купо!♪"

#. ja: ぴかぴか、きらきら、大好きくぽ！<br>おたから集めは、モグのロマン。<br>だから、手伝ってほしいくぽ！
#. de: Hilfst du mir, die Schätze einzusammeln, kupo?
#. fr: Oui, oui, oui<nbsp>! J'aime les trésors brillants, kuppo<nbsp>! J'en veux tout plein<nbsp>! Alors, vous allez m'aider, kuppo<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Hehehe! The hills are alive with the sound of twinkling, kupo!♪
#. column 58: Help the modish moogle?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Huzzah! Hooray! Hurrah! My necklace will soon be complete, kupo!
#. column 62: But my necklace, kupo...
msgctxt "FateEvent:226:0:57"
msgid "You cannot hear twinkling, kupo? Of course you cannot! You are not a moogle! But you can see twinkling, no? You have eyes, no? Then help me find the twinkling, kupo!"
msgstr "Ты не слышишь, как блестит, купо? Ну конечно! Ты же не мугл! Зато видишь блеск, да? Глаза-то у тебя есть? Тогда помоги мне его найти, купо!"

#. ja: 手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem modischen Mogry helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le Mog<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Hehehe! The hills are alive with the sound of twinkling, kupo!♪
#. column 57: You cannot hear twinkling, kupo? Of course you cannot! You are not a moogle! But you can see twinkling, no? You have eyes, no? Then help me find the twinkling, kupo!
#. column 60: Huzzah! Hooray! Hurrah! My necklace will soon be complete, kupo!
#. column 62: But my necklace, kupo...
