msgctxt "FateEvent:226:0:58"
msgid "Help the modish moogle?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь модному муглу?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おたから、いっぱいひろって、<br>持ってきてほしいくぽ～。
#. de: Bring mir so viele Münzen, wie du findest, kupo!
#. fr: Apportez-moi tout plein de trésors, kuppo<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Hehehe! The hills are alive with the sound of twinkling, kupo!♪
#. column 57: You cannot hear twinkling, kupo? Of course you cannot! You are not a moogle! But you can see twinkling, no? You have eyes, no? Then help me find the twinkling, kupo!
#. column 58: Help the modish moogle?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: But my necklace, kupo...
msgctxt "FateEvent:226:0:60"
msgid "Huzzah! Hooray! Hurrah! My necklace will soon be complete, kupo!"
msgstr "Ура! Вот-вот закончу ожерелье, купо!"

#. ja: えっ……手伝ってくれないくぽ……？
#. de: Wirklich nicht, kupo? Schade ...
#. fr: Quoi, kuppo<nbsp>!?<nbsp>... Vous ne voulez pas m'aider<nbsp>?<nbsp>...
#. column 56: Hehehe! The hills are alive with the sound of twinkling, kupo!♪
#. column 57: You cannot hear twinkling, kupo? Of course you cannot! You are not a moogle! But you can see twinkling, no? You have eyes, no? Then help me find the twinkling, kupo!
#. column 58: Help the modish moogle?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Huzzah! Hooray! Hurrah! My necklace will soon be complete, kupo!
msgctxt "FateEvent:226:0:62"
msgid "But my necklace, kupo..."
msgstr "Но моё ожерелье, купо..."

#. ja: おたから、いっぱい拾えたくぽ？
#. de: Hast du glitzernde Münzen gefunden, kupo?
#. fr: Vous avez ramassé plein de trésors, kuppo<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Hah hah! I shall be the twinkliest moogle in all Moghome! More, I must have more, kupo!
#. column 62: You scratch my pom, I scratch your...er...what is it you landlords scratch when you need something, kupo?
msgctxt "FateEvent:227:0:56"
msgid "Did you hear the twinkling, kupo?"
msgstr "Слышишь, как блестит, купо?"

#. ja: ありがとくぽ！<br>もっともっと欲しいくぽ！
#. de: Danke, kupo! Aber ich brauche noch mehr, meeehr!
#. fr: Merci, kuppo<nbsp>! Mais c'est pas fini<nbsp>! Apportez-m'en plus<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Did you hear the twinkling, kupo?
#. column 62: You scratch my pom, I scratch your...er...what is it you landlords scratch when you need something, kupo?
msgctxt "FateEvent:227:0:60"
msgid "Hah hah! I shall be the twinkliest moogle in all Moghome! More, I must have more, kupo!"
msgstr "Ха-ха! Я буду самым сверкающим муглом во всём Могдоме! Ещё! Мне нужно ещё больше, купо!"

#. ja: たくさん持ってきてくれたら、<br>お礼するくぽ。
#. de: Wenn du mir viele Münzen bringst, bekommst du eine ganz tolle Belohnung, kupo!
#. fr: Si vous me donnez plein de trésors, je vous remercierai, kuppo<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Did you hear the twinkling, kupo?
#. column 60: Hah hah! I shall be the twinkliest moogle in all Moghome! More, I must have more, kupo!
msgctxt "FateEvent:227:0:62"
msgid "You scratch my pom, I scratch your...er...what is it you landlords scratch when you need something, kupo?"
msgstr "Почешешь мне помпон, а я тебе... э-э... что там вы, хозяева, чешете, когда вам что-то нужно, купо?"

#. ja: ちょっと、そこの冒険者さん！<br>私のお願いを聞いてほしいケロ。
#. de: He daaaa, quaaak! Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>! Ich könnte deine Hilfe gut gebrauchen!
#. fr: Oh, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>, écoute-moâ<nbsp>! J'ai besoin de ton aide, coâ.
#. column 57: I am Maro Roggo, one of Mistress Matoya's loyal, but easily replaceable servants.
#. column 58: And if I am not back at her cave with these ingredients before the cauldron boils, she'll toss me in the brew, ribbit! Might I humbly request an escort to see me back quickly?
#. column 59: Escort Maro to Matoya's Cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Have you no heart, ribbit!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:228:0:56"
msgid "Oh, woe betide the poor poroggo whose skin shall make the mistress a fine pair of shoes, ribbit."
msgstr "О горе мне, бедному порогго! Хозяйка сошьёт себе из моей шкуры пару чудесных туфель, ква!"

#. ja: 私、マトーヤ様にお使いを頼まれて、<br>帰る途中ケロ。
#. de: Matoya hat mich ausgeschickt, um Besorgungen für sie zu machen. Die habe ich auch erledigt, quaaak.
#. fr: Je suis au service de madame Matoya, et je retourne auprès d'elle en ce moment même...
#. column 56: Oh, woe betide the poor poroggo whose skin shall make the mistress a fine pair of shoes, ribbit.
#. column 58: And if I am not back at her cave with these ingredients before the cauldron boils, she'll toss me in the brew, ribbit! Might I humbly request an escort to see me back quickly?
#. column 59: Escort Maro to Matoya's Cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Have you no heart, ribbit!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:228:0:57"
msgid "I am Maro Roggo, one of Mistress Matoya's loyal, but easily replaceable servants."
msgstr "Я Маро Рогго, один из верных, но легко заменимых слуг госпожи Матойи."

#. ja: だけど最近、魔物が増えてるから、<br>ひとりで帰るのが不安ケロ。<br>洞窟まで一緒に、来てもらえないケロ？
#. de: Aber jetzt wimmelt der ganze Weg von Monstern. Wenn ich nicht aufpasse, fressen die mich auf!
#. fr: Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, il y a beaucoup de monstres dans les environs, et je ne suis pas sûr d'arriver jusqu'à la caverne de ma maîtresse sain et sauf, coâ. Tu veux bien m'accompagner<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Oh, woe betide the poor poroggo whose skin shall make the mistress a fine pair of shoes, ribbit.
#. column 57: I am Maro Roggo, one of Mistress Matoya's loyal, but easily replaceable servants.
#. column 59: Escort Maro to Matoya's Cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Have you no heart, ribbit!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:228:0:58"
msgid "And if I am not back at her cave with these ingredients before the cauldron boils, she'll toss me in the brew, ribbit! Might I humbly request an escort to see me back quickly?"
msgstr "И если я не вернусь к её пещере с припасами до того, как закипит котёл, она бросит меня в варево, ква! Не проводишь меня поскорее домой?"

#. ja: 助けてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Matoyas Helferlein helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Accompagner ce poroggo<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, woe betide the poor poroggo whose skin shall make the mistress a fine pair of shoes, ribbit.
#. column 57: I am Maro Roggo, one of Mistress Matoya's loyal, but easily replaceable servants.
#. column 58: And if I am not back at her cave with these ingredients before the cauldron boils, she'll toss me in the brew, ribbit! Might I humbly request an escort to see me back quickly?
#. column 62: Have you no heart, ribbit!?
