msgctxt "FateEvent:228:0:59"
msgid "Escort Maro to Matoya's Cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Проводить Маро до пещеры Матойи?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ……助けてくれないケロ？<br>冷たい人ケロ！
#. de: Wie gemein, quaaak! Du kannst mich doch nicht einfach als Froschschenkel enden lassen!
#. fr: Coâ<nbsp>!? Ça ne te dérange donc pas si je me fais dévorer par des monstres en chemin<nbsp>?<nbsp>...
#. column 56: Oh, woe betide the poor poroggo whose skin shall make the mistress a fine pair of shoes, ribbit.
#. column 57: I am Maro Roggo, one of Mistress Matoya's loyal, but easily replaceable servants.
#. column 58: And if I am not back at her cave with these ingredients before the cauldron boils, she'll toss me in the brew, ribbit! Might I humbly request an escort to see me back quickly?
#. column 59: Escort Maro to Matoya's Cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:228:0:62"
msgid "Have you no heart, ribbit!?"
msgstr "Да у тебя совсем сердца нет, ква?!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>「青の手」　新兵器カイハツ中　間違いない！<br>そろった証拠　ミンナに　知らせる～よ！
#. de: Psshh ... Indigohand bastelt fährliche neue Tötenwerkzeug. Gobbi hat ganz mulmige Fühl in Bauch.
#. fr: Psshhh... Psshhh... Les méchants pas beaux de la Main indigo préparent une nouvelle arme<nbsp>! L'humain<if $gn4>e</if> doit récupérer des preuves et les montrer aux gentils Gobelins<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:229:0:56"
msgid "Slicktrix has many shivershakes, for most clear is it whizzlepops will bring much firedoom and bangyboom. Must make swiftheels and trade tongueflaps with goodly gobbieflock."
msgstr "Сликстрикс весь дрожит от страха: ясно же, что эти бах-бумки принесут огонь и взрывы. Надо поспешить и поговорить с хорошими гоблинами."

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>そこのヒト　ちょっと　聞いて！
#. de: Psssh, Großwachsene<if $gn4><else>r</if>, spannzu Ohren auf wie Segel für streng heime Auftrag!
#. fr: Psshhh... L'humain<if $gn4>e</if> doit aider les gentils Gobelins<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Matters of most graveness have skyfallen upon our goodshire! The Illuminati and their besullied bluehands are deep-plotting madschemes!
#. column 58: Whizzlepops, they make! Whizzlepops they wield! What whizzles? What pops? No goodgobbies know, but goodgobbies must! Need whizzlepops to see!
#. column 59: Bring Slicktrix whizzlepops?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be overmore thanksgiving when whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
#. column 62: Then no more tongueflaps shall Slicktrix trade with uplander. Tongueflaps for busydealers alone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:230:0:56"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Halt your swiftheels and lend openears to Slicktrix!"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Стой, путник, послушай Сликстрикса!"

#. ja: 科学者集団「青の手」　新兵器カイハツ中！<br>たぶん　絶対　間違いな～い！<br>だけど　証拠が　揃わな～い！
#. de: Indigohand hat neue Tötenwerkzeug basteln! Glaubzzu nicht? Psh! Muzzu gleich schauen eigenselbst und bringzzu Beweis!
#. fr: Les savants fous de la Main indigo préparent une nouvelle arme<nbsp>! C'est absolument presque certain<nbsp>! Mais Slicktrix a besoin de preuves pour convaincre ses copains<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Halt your swiftheels and lend openears to Slicktrix!
#. column 58: Whizzlepops, they make! Whizzlepops they wield! What whizzles? What pops? No goodgobbies know, but goodgobbies must! Need whizzlepops to see!
#. column 59: Bring Slicktrix whizzlepops?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be overmore thanksgiving when whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
#. column 62: Then no more tongueflaps shall Slicktrix trade with uplander. Tongueflaps for busydealers alone.
msgctxt "FateEvent:230:0:57"
msgid "Matters of most graveness have skyfallen upon our goodshire! The Illuminati and their besullied bluehands are deep-plotting madschemes!"
msgstr "На нашу добрую деревню обрушилась беда! Иллюминаты и их грязные синеручки замышляют что-то страшное!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>だから　証拠集め　手伝って！<br>仲間は　ミンナ　やられた～よ！
#. de: Kannzu spionschleichen und Maschine bringen für untersuchen? Sonst ist große Fahr!
#. fr: Pssshhh... L'humain<if $gn4>e</if> doit lui prêter main-forte<nbsp>! C'est une question de vie ou de mort<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Halt your swiftheels and lend openears to Slicktrix!
#. column 57: Matters of most graveness have skyfallen upon our goodshire! The Illuminati and their besullied bluehands are deep-plotting madschemes!
#. column 59: Bring Slicktrix whizzlepops?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be overmore thanksgiving when whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
#. column 62: Then no more tongueflaps shall Slicktrix trade with uplander. Tongueflaps for busydealers alone.
msgctxt "FateEvent:230:0:58"
msgid "Whizzlepops, they make! Whizzlepops they wield! What whizzles? What pops? No goodgobbies know, but goodgobbies must! Need whizzlepops to see!"
msgstr "Бах-бумки делают! Бах-бумки носят! Что бахает? Что бумкает? Добрые гоблины не знают, но должны узнать! Надо увидеть эти бах-бумки!"

#. ja: 協力してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Goblin bei der Beweissuche helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Slicktrix<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Halt your swiftheels and lend openears to Slicktrix!
#. column 57: Matters of most graveness have skyfallen upon our goodshire! The Illuminati and their besullied bluehands are deep-plotting madschemes!
#. column 58: Whizzlepops, they make! Whizzlepops they wield! What whizzles? What pops? No goodgobbies know, but goodgobbies must! Need whizzlepops to see!
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be overmore thanksgiving when whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
#. column 62: Then no more tongueflaps shall Slicktrix trade with uplander. Tongueflaps for busydealers alone.
