msgctxt "FateEvent:230:0:59"
msgid "Bring Slicktrix whizzlepops?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Принести Сликстриксу бах-бумки?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>ありがとう　頼んだ～よ！
#. de: Khoo! Vieledank!
#. fr: Psshh... Pssshh... Slicktrix savait qu'il pouvait compter sur l'humain<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>!
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Halt your swiftheels and lend openears to Slicktrix!
#. column 57: Matters of most graveness have skyfallen upon our goodshire! The Illuminati and their besullied bluehands are deep-plotting madschemes!
#. column 58: Whizzlepops, they make! Whizzlepops they wield! What whizzles? What pops? No goodgobbies know, but goodgobbies must! Need whizzlepops to see!
#. column 59: Bring Slicktrix whizzlepops?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then no more tongueflaps shall Slicktrix trade with uplander. Tongueflaps for busydealers alone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:230:0:60"
msgid "Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be overmore thanksgiving when whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!"
msgstr "Шкоххх!<br>Сликстрикс благодарен верховнику! А когда бах-бумки наполнят гоблинский мешок, будет благодарен ещё больше!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>そう　残念……。<br>さて　どうするか　困った～よ。
#. de: Psssh? ... Jetzt ist Teurerat ...
#. fr: Slicktrix est très déçu... Pssshhh... Pssshh... Il ne sait pas comment il va faire...
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Halt your swiftheels and lend openears to Slicktrix!
#. column 57: Matters of most graveness have skyfallen upon our goodshire! The Illuminati and their besullied bluehands are deep-plotting madschemes!
#. column 58: Whizzlepops, they make! Whizzlepops they wield! What whizzles? What pops? No goodgobbies know, but goodgobbies must! Need whizzlepops to see!
#. column 59: Bring Slicktrix whizzlepops?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be overmore thanksgiving when whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
msgctxt "FateEvent:230:0:62"
msgid "Then no more tongueflaps shall Slicktrix trade with uplander. Tongueflaps for busydealers alone."
msgstr "Больше Сликстрикс не станет болтать с верховником. Болтать будет только с торговцами!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>新兵器カイハツの証拠　探してほしい！
#. de: Psssh, Großwachsene<if $gn4><else>r</if>, bringzzu schon Knallmaschine für untersuchen?
#. fr: Pssshh... L'humain<if $gn4>e</if> doit trouver des preuves<nbsp>!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:231:0:56"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Popbringer brings no whizzlepops! Slicktrix finds heart brimfilled with worrythoughts!"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Найди доказательства разработки нового оружия!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>新兵器カイハツの証拠　見つかった？
#. de: Hazzu schon Knallmaschine sammeln?
#. fr: Pssshh... L'humain<if $gn4>e</if> a trouvé quelque chose<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be many more thanksgiving when many more whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
#. column 62: Uplander uphold busydeal, but gobbiebag is still airylight. Slicktrix everseeks many more whizzlepops!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:232:0:56"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Did popbringer find bluehand whizzlepops? Then busydeal we can make!"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Нашёл бах-бумки синеручек? Тогда заключим выгодную сделку!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>なるほど　怪し～い　部品！<br>ほかにも　ないか　探してほしい！
#. de: Psssh! Ganz Verdächtigeding und sicher ganz fährlich. Los, sammelzzu noch mehr!
#. fr: Pssshhhoh<nbsp>! Des mécanismes étranges<nbsp>!<nbsp>... L'humain<if $gn4>e</if> doit continuer de chercher<nbsp>! Il y en a peut-être d'autres<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Did popbringer find bluehand whizzlepops? Then busydeal we can make!
#. column 62: Uplander uphold busydeal, but gobbiebag is still airylight. Slicktrix everseeks many more whizzlepops!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:232:0:60"
msgid "Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be many more thanksgiving when many more whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!"
msgstr "Шкоххх!<br>Сликстрикс благодарен верховнику! А когда в гоблинском мешке будет ещё больше бах-бумок, будет благодарен куда больше!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>怪し～い　部品　あったら持ってき～て！
#. de: Kho ... Gobbi versteht schon Funktionierenweise ... Großwachsene<if $gn4><else>r</if>, suchzzu noch mehr mit Gründlicheblick!
#. fr: Pssshhh... Si l'humain<if $gn4>e</if> trouve des mécanismes étranges, <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> doit les apporter à Slicktrix<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Did popbringer find bluehand whizzlepops? Then busydeal we can make!
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be many more thanksgiving when many more whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
msgctxt "FateEvent:232:0:62"
msgid "Uplander uphold busydeal, but gobbiebag is still airylight. Slicktrix everseeks many more whizzlepops!"
msgstr "Верховник соблюдает уговор, а гоблинский мешок всё ещё пуст. Сликстриксу нужно ещё много бах-бумок!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>新兵器カイハツの証拠　見つけてきた？
#. de: Psssh ... Hazzu Knallmaschine bringen?
#. fr: Pssshh... L'humain<if $gn4>e</if> a trouvé des preuves<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be evermore thanksgiving when overmore whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
#. column 62: Uplander uphold busydeal most highly!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:233:0:56"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Did popbringer find overmore whizzlepops? Then overmore busydeals we can make!"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Нашёл ещё больше бах-бумок? Тогда заключим ещё более выгодную сделку!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>証拠の品　いっぱい欲しい<br>ほかにも　ないか　集めた～い！
#. de: Kannzu schnappen noch mehr Knallmaschine für untersuchen? Vielleicht hat alle andere Funktionierenweise ...
#. fr: Pssshhh<nbsp>! Slictrix veut plus de mécanismes<nbsp>! L'humain<if $gn4>e</if> doit continuer d'en chercher<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Did popbringer find overmore whizzlepops? Then overmore busydeals we can make!
#. column 62: Uplander uphold busydeal most highly!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:233:0:60"
msgid "Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be evermore thanksgiving when overmore whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!"
msgstr "Шкоххх!<br>Сликстрикс благодарен верховнику! А когда в гоблинском мешке будет ещё больше бах-бумок, будет благодарен куда больше!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>証拠の品　あるだけ　集めた～い！
#. de: Wennzu mehr Knallmaschine bringst, ist besser!
#. fr: Pssshh... Psshhh... Slicktrix veut autant de preuves que possible<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Did popbringer find overmore whizzlepops? Then overmore busydeals we can make!
#. column 60: Shkohhh!<br>Slicktrix is thanksgiving to uplander! Slicktrix will be evermore thanksgiving when overmore whizzlepops fill gobbiebag!
msgctxt "FateEvent:233:0:62"
msgid "Uplander uphold busydeal most highly!"
msgstr "Верховник соблюдает уговор как нельзя лучше!"

#. ja: 念願のハルドラス像巡礼を、ついに成し遂げたぞ！
#. de: Redwald hat mir die Sieben Höllen heiß gemacht. Die Schneeböcke müssen dran glauben!
#. fr: Enfin<nbsp>! Après toutes ces années, j'ai enfin pu voir la statue de Haldrath de mes propres yeux<nbsp>!
#. column 57: I didn't tell that entitled crone to come kneel and pray in a pile of buckshite.
#. column 58: \<sigh> You wouldn't want to slay a herd of harmless steinbocks with the unluckiest knight in Falcon's Nest, would you?
#. column 59: Lock horns with the bucks?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sigh> I didn't think so...
msgctxt "FateEvent:234:0:56"
msgid "\\<sigh> What did I do to deserve this...?"
msgstr "<i>Эх...</i> За что мне всё это...?"

#. ja: だが、これはいかんな……。<br>かなりの数の魔物が寄りついて、聖像を汚しておるようだ。
#. de: Sonst ist es nur eine Frage der Zeit, bis die nächste adelige Besucherin der Pike in einen ihrer Haufen tritt und wir alle unseres Amtes enthoben werden!
#. fr: Mais dans quel état est-elle<nbsp>? Tous ces monstres qui rôdent autour et la salissent...
#. column 56: \<sigh> What did I do to deserve this...?
#. column 58: \<sigh> You wouldn't want to slay a herd of harmless steinbocks with the unluckiest knight in Falcon's Nest, would you?
#. column 59: Lock horns with the bucks?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sigh> I didn't think so...
msgctxt "FateEvent:234:0:57"
msgid "I didn't tell that entitled crone to come kneel and pray in a pile of buckshite."
msgstr "Я не говорил этой зазнавшейся старухе приходить молиться на кучу козьего дерьма."

#. ja: 冒険者よ、どうだ？<br>一緒に戦ってはくれぬものか？
#. de: Hilf mir, das zu verhindern!
#. fr: Dites-moi, brave jeune <if $gn4>fe<else>ho</if>mme, accepteriez-vous de m'aider à occire ces abo<shy>mi<shy>na<shy>tions<nbsp>?
#. column 56: \<sigh> What did I do to deserve this...?
#. column 57: I didn't tell that entitled crone to come kneel and pray in a pile of buckshite.
#. column 59: Lock horns with the bucks?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sigh> I didn't think so...
msgctxt "FateEvent:234:0:58"
msgid "\\<sigh> You wouldn't want to slay a herd of harmless steinbocks with the unluckiest knight in Falcon's Nest, would you?"
msgstr "<i>Эх...</i> Не хотите ли вы вместе с самым невезучим рыцарем Соколиного гнезда перебить стадо безобидных горных козлов?"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Ritter helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider ce templier<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: \<sigh> What did I do to deserve this...?
#. column 57: I didn't tell that entitled crone to come kneel and pray in a pile of buckshite.
#. column 58: \<sigh> You wouldn't want to slay a herd of harmless steinbocks with the unluckiest knight in Falcon's Nest, would you?
#. column 62: \<sigh> I didn't think so...
