msgctxt "FateEvent:234:0:59"
msgid "Lock horns with the bucks?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сразиться с козлами?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 助力はしかねると……！？<br>フン、かような不届き者には、神罰が下ろう！
#. de: Du verweigerst einem Tempelritter deine Hilfe? Na warte, dafür wird dich die Furie strafen.
#. fr: Vraiment<nbsp>!?<nbsp>... Hmpf<nbsp>! Le jour du jugement, la Conquérante saura reconnaître les siens<nbsp>!
#. column 56: \<sigh> What did I do to deserve this...?
#. column 57: I didn't tell that entitled crone to come kneel and pray in a pile of buckshite.
#. column 58: \<sigh> You wouldn't want to slay a herd of harmless steinbocks with the unluckiest knight in Falcon's Nest, would you?
#. column 59: Lock horns with the bucks?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:234:0:62"
msgid "\\<sigh> I didn't think so..."
msgstr "<i>Эх...</i> Я так и думал..."

#. ja: この男が、手合わせの相手を求めている。<br>私も挑戦してみたが……桁外れの強さだった。<br>すがすがしいほどにあっさり負けたよ。
#. de: Das da vorne ist der neue Dragoon. Schon seinen Namen gehört? Pfffft ...
#. fr: Ce type, là, il cherche des gens à sa hauteur pour l'affronter. J'ai bien tenté ma chance, mais j'ai méchamment dérouillé. C'est qu'il est sacrément costaud, le bougre...
#. column 57: Why so grim, you ask? No reason I can fathom. \<snigger>
#. column 58: But now, the moon-touched lad has taken to challenging all who pass by to duels. You're free to test your mettle, if you wish. But ware the boy's \<snigger> <i>butt</i>.
#. column 59: Challenge Ser Alaimbert?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A wise decision. It is not as if we'd reconsider his “title” should he prove victorious anyway. \<snigger>
msgctxt "FateEvent:235:0:56"
msgid "The grim-looking fellow there in full regalia is our company's newest Knight Dragoon."
msgstr "Вон тот мрачный тип в полном облачении — новобранец нашей роты, рыцарь-драгун."

#. ja: こいつの名は、「鋭槍のアランベール」。<br>イシュガルドでも屈指の精鋭「竜騎士団」に所属する、<br>若き竜騎士だそうだ。
#. de: Alle machen sich deshalb über ihn lustig. Nur: Er denkt, das läge an seiner mangelnden Kampf<shy>erfahrung und will sich jetzt in einem Duell beweisen. Dabei ist er ehrlich gesagt ein ziemlich passabler Kämpfer.
#. fr: Il se fait surnommer Alaimbert le transperceur. D'après ce qu'on m'a expliqué, ce serait un jeune aspirant chevalier dragon.
#. column 56: The grim-looking fellow there in full regalia is our company's newest Knight Dragoon.
#. column 58: But now, the moon-touched lad has taken to challenging all who pass by to duels. You're free to test your mettle, if you wish. But ware the boy's \<snigger> <i>butt</i>.
#. column 59: Challenge Ser Alaimbert?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A wise decision. It is not as if we'd reconsider his “title” should he prove victorious anyway. \<snigger>
msgctxt "FateEvent:235:0:57"
msgid "Why so grim, you ask? No reason I can fathom. \\<snigger>"
msgstr "Чего такой хмурый? Да без понятия. <i>Хи-хи!</i>"

#. ja: 私がこれまで会った中で、間違いなく最強の男だ。<br>どうだ、挑戦してみないか？
#. de: Vielleicht sogar der stärkste, der mir je begegnet ist. Aber der Name ... Pfffffft!
#. fr: Je crois bien que je n'ai jamais rencontré quelqu'un d'aussi balèze de toute ma vie. Mais dis, tu voudrais pas l'affronter, toi aussi<nbsp>?
#. column 56: The grim-looking fellow there in full regalia is our company's newest Knight Dragoon.
#. column 57: Why so grim, you ask? No reason I can fathom. \<snigger>
#. column 59: Challenge Ser Alaimbert?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A wise decision. It is not as if we'd reconsider his “title” should he prove victorious anyway. \<snigger>
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:235:0:58"
msgid "But now, the moon-touched lad has taken to challenging all who pass by to duels. You're free to test your mettle, if you wish. But ware the boy's \\<snigger> <i>butt</i>."
msgstr "Но теперь этот лунатик повадился вызывать на дуэль всех прохожих. Хотите испытать себя — пожалуйста. Только берегитесь его... <i>зада</i>. <i>Хи-хи!</i>"

#. ja: 勝負をしますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Alaimbert herausfordern?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Relever le défi<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: The grim-looking fellow there in full regalia is our company's newest Knight Dragoon.
#. column 57: Why so grim, you ask? No reason I can fathom. \<snigger>
#. column 58: But now, the moon-touched lad has taken to challenging all who pass by to duels. You're free to test your mettle, if you wish. But ware the boy's \<snigger> <i>butt</i>.
#. column 62: A wise decision. It is not as if we'd reconsider his “title” should he prove victorious anyway. \<snigger>
