msgctxt "FateEvent:235:0:59"
msgid "Challenge Ser Alaimbert?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Бросить вызов сэру Алеймберу?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうだな、やめておけ……賢明な判断だ。<br>私はそれができず、身のほどというものを思い知らされた。
#. de: Ja, ist wahrscheinlich die weisere Entscheidung.
#. fr: Ah, t'en fais pas, je te comprends très bien. Moi aussi, si j'avais su, je ne l'aurais pas affronté, ce gars.
#. column 56: The grim-looking fellow there in full regalia is our company's newest Knight Dragoon.
#. column 57: Why so grim, you ask? No reason I can fathom. \<snigger>
#. column 58: But now, the moon-touched lad has taken to challenging all who pass by to duels. You're free to test your mettle, if you wish. But ware the boy's \<snigger> <i>butt</i>.
#. column 59: Challenge Ser Alaimbert?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:235:0:62"
msgid "A wise decision. It is not as if we'd reconsider his “title” should he prove victorious anyway. \\<snigger>"
msgstr "Мудрое решение. Даже если он победит, его «титул» всё равно не пересмотрят. <i>Хи-хи!</i>"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>研究資料　だいぶ　そろった～！<br>これで　はかどる　研究調査！
#. de: Braufix hat schon viele alte Forschenpapier sammeln. Jetzt kann bald kopierschreiben eigene Werk! Kho kho kho!
#. fr: Pssshhh... Avec tous ces documents, Browfix va pouvoir créer une machine ré<shy>vo<shy>lu<shy>tion<shy>nai<shy>re<nbsp>!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:236:0:56"
msgid "Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>Browfix remembers not how many wordleaves were wrongtaken, but backtaken have been more than few. Maybe less than few remain now."
msgstr "Шкох... Шкох... Шкох...<br>Брауфикс уже не помнит, сколько листов стащил, но вернул немало. Может, теперь их осталось совсем мало."

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>研究資料　集めてくれて～！<br>ありがとう～！
#. de: Bringzzu Forschenschrift für Braufix? Großedank!
#. fr: Pssshhh... Browfix a besoin de documents<nbsp>! L'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> doit lui en rapporter tout plein<nbsp>!
#. column 57: The scent of lofty knowledge in wrongtaken wordleaves tickles Browfix's noseholes!
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Fewthanks remain for uplander who claims manythanks of Browfix, but morethanks I will find!
#. column 62: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Has the goodly uplander found many and more of wrongtaken wordleaves?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:237:0:56"
msgid "Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>More! More! There must be more!"
msgstr "Шкох... Шкох... Шкох...<br>Ещё! Ещё! Должно быть больше!"

#. ja: もっともっと　欲しいかも～！<br>欠けてる資料　もっとある～！
#. de: Kannzu noch mehr finden?
#. fr: Browfix veut plus de feuillets<nbsp>! Il en manque<nbsp>! Il en manque<nbsp>! Pssshhh<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>More! More! There must be more!
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Fewthanks remain for uplander who claims manythanks of Browfix, but morethanks I will find!
#. column 62: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Has the goodly uplander found many and more of wrongtaken wordleaves?
msgctxt "FateEvent:237:0:57"
msgid "The scent of lofty knowledge in wrongtaken wordleaves tickles Browfix's noseholes!"
msgstr "Запах возвышенных знаний в украденных листах щекочет ноздри Брауфикса!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>こいつは　新しい　資料？<br>我々　とても助か～る！
#. de: Kho kho kho ... Papier mit Neuewissen! Braufix wird kopierstehlen für eigenselbst!
#. fr: Pssshhhm<nbsp>?<nbsp>... De nouveaux feuillets<nbsp>? Cela va faire grandement avancer les recherches de Browfix<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>More! More! There must be more!
#. column 57: The scent of lofty knowledge in wrongtaken wordleaves tickles Browfix's noseholes!
#. column 62: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Has the goodly uplander found many and more of wrongtaken wordleaves?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:237:0:60"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Fewthanks remain for uplander who claims manythanks of Browfix, but morethanks I will find!"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Брауфикс благодарен верховнику. А когда листы вернутся, благодарен будет ещё больше!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>研究資料　見つからない？
#. de: Psssh? Gibt keine Forschenzettel? Bizzu kurzsehen mit Auge oder warum? Suchzzu weiter!
#. fr: Psshhh<nbsp>?<nbsp>... L'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> ne trouve pas les documents de Browfix<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>More! More! There must be more!
#. column 57: The scent of lofty knowledge in wrongtaken wordleaves tickles Browfix's noseholes!
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Fewthanks remain for uplander who claims manythanks of Browfix, but morethanks I will find!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:237:0:62"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Has the goodly uplander found many and more of wrongtaken wordleaves?"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Добрый верховник нашёл ещё много украденных листов?"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>あたりにちらばった資料　持ってきて！
#. de: Großwachsene<if $gn4><else>r</if> bringt Forschenwerk von andere! Braufix braucht nicht kümmern ♪
#. fr: Pssshhh... L'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> doit récupérer les feuillets éparpillés partout et les apporter à Browfix<nbsp>!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:238:0:56"
msgid "Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>The fishmen are the slipperiest of sorts. They seek not wordleaves for their lofty knowledge, but for their deliciousness!"
msgstr "Шкох... Шкох... Шкох...<br>Рыболюды — скользкие типы. Листы им нужны не для возвышенных знаний, а чтобы съесть!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>ここには　研究資料　たっくさん！<br>残したのは　図書館　作ったヒトたち！
#. de: Schauzzu mal, hier gibt ganz viele Forschenpapier von weglaufene Großwachsene!
#. fr: Psshhh... Il y a tout plein de documents ici<nbsp>! Les humains qui ont construit la bibliothèque ont laissé un grand trésor<nbsp>!
#. column 57: My halflegs cannot carry me with swiftness of slippery scales. I seek busydeal with uplander who has embiggened strongarms atop enswifted heels!
#. column 58: Might you be uplander Browfix seeks?
#. column 59: Help Browfix retrieve his lost folios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I have for the giving! Manythanks for giving when wordleaves return!
#. column 62: Pshhhhhh...<br>My braincase mourns uplander's unkindness...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:239:0:56"
msgid "Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>The fishmen have wrongtaken wordleaves meant for Browfix's braincase and fled!"
msgstr "Шкох... Шкох... Шкох...<br>Рыболюды украли листы, которые должны были попасть в голову Брауфикса, и сбежали!"

#. ja: このあたりで　資料の一部　見つかった！<br>だけど「青の手」攻めてきて　資料バッラバラ！
#. de: Braufix sammelt mit Fleißigehand, aber Indigohand kommt zu stören. Jetzt ist verstreuen in Richtung von Allehimmel.
#. fr: Browfix a trouvé des feuillets pour fabriquer une machine ré<shy>vo<shy>lu<shy>tion<shy>nai<shy>re<nbsp>!<nbsp>... Mais les méchants de la Main indigo sont venus le gêner, et les papiers sont tout éparpillés<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>The fishmen have wrongtaken wordleaves meant for Browfix's braincase and fled!
#. column 58: Might you be uplander Browfix seeks?
#. column 59: Help Browfix retrieve his lost folios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I have for the giving! Manythanks for giving when wordleaves return!
#. column 62: Pshhhhhh...<br>My braincase mourns uplander's unkindness...
msgctxt "FateEvent:239:0:57"
msgid "My halflegs cannot carry me with swiftness of slippery scales. I seek busydeal with uplander who has embiggened strongarms atop enswifted heels!"
msgstr "Мои короткие ножки не поспевают за скользкими чешуями. Ищу выгодную сделку с верховником: нужны сильные руки и быстрые ноги!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>資料　拾ったら　持ってきて！<br>もしかすると　魔物が　持ってるかも！
#. de: Kannzu vielleicht suchen und Braufix bringen, kho?
#. fr: Psshhh... L'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> doit aider Browfix et ramasser les feuillets<nbsp>! Mais attention aux monstres<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>The fishmen have wrongtaken wordleaves meant for Browfix's braincase and fled!
#. column 57: My halflegs cannot carry me with swiftness of slippery scales. I seek busydeal with uplander who has embiggened strongarms atop enswifted heels!
#. column 59: Help Browfix retrieve his lost folios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I have for the giving! Manythanks for giving when wordleaves return!
#. column 62: Pshhhhhh...<br>My braincase mourns uplander's unkindness...
msgctxt "FateEvent:239:0:58"
msgid "Might you be uplander Browfix seeks?"
msgstr "Ты тот самый верховник, которого ищет Брауфикс?"

#. ja: 協力してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Goblin bei der Suche nach alten Sharlayaner Forschungsunterlagen helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Browfix<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>The fishmen have wrongtaken wordleaves meant for Browfix's braincase and fled!
#. column 57: My halflegs cannot carry me with swiftness of slippery scales. I seek busydeal with uplander who has embiggened strongarms atop enswifted heels!
#. column 58: Might you be uplander Browfix seeks?
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I have for the giving! Manythanks for giving when wordleaves return!
#. column 62: Pshhhhhh...<br>My braincase mourns uplander's unkindness...
