msgctxt "FateEvent:239:0:59"
msgid "Help Browfix retrieve his lost folios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь Брауфиксу вернуть украденные листы?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>助かった！<br>これで調査も　はかど～る！
#. de: Psssh! Herz von Braufix ist voll mit Warmefühl! Jetzt kann kopierschreiben Forschenarbeit.
#. fr: Psshhh... Grâce à l'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>, les recherches de Browfix vont beaucoup avancer<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>The fishmen have wrongtaken wordleaves meant for Browfix's braincase and fled!
#. column 57: My halflegs cannot carry me with swiftness of slippery scales. I seek busydeal with uplander who has embiggened strongarms atop enswifted heels!
#. column 58: Might you be uplander Browfix seeks?
#. column 59: Help Browfix retrieve his lost folios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Pshhhhhh...<br>My braincase mourns uplander's unkindness...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:239:0:60"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I have for the giving! Manythanks for giving when wordleaves return!"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Брауфикс очень благодарен! Будет благодарен ещё больше, когда листы вернутся!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>それは残念　ハァ　どうする……。
#. de: Kannzu nicht finden? Khoo ...  Jetzt muss Braufix alle selbst forschen! Lästigesache ...
#. fr: Pssshhh<nbsp>! Browfix espérait vraiment que l'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> l'aiderait...
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>The fishmen have wrongtaken wordleaves meant for Browfix's braincase and fled!
#. column 57: My halflegs cannot carry me with swiftness of slippery scales. I seek busydeal with uplander who has embiggened strongarms atop enswifted heels!
#. column 58: Might you be uplander Browfix seeks?
#. column 59: Help Browfix retrieve his lost folios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I have for the giving! Manythanks for giving when wordleaves return!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:239:0:62"
msgid "Pshhhhhh...<br>My braincase mourns uplander's unkindness..."
msgstr "Пшшшшш...<br>Сердце Брауфикса скорбит из-за недоброты верховника..."

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>図書館作ったヒトたち　貴重な研究　いっぱいしてた<br>だから　貴重な資料も　いっぱ～い！
#. de: Psssh ... Weglaufene Großwachsene sind ganz hell in Denkschale. Nützliche Forschen für nützliche Maschinen! Und Bauenweise steht alle auf verstreute Forschenzettel hier!
#. fr: Pssshhh... Les humains qui ont construit la bibliothèque faisaient des recherches in<shy>té<shy>res<shy>santes<nbsp>! Il y a plein de documents pour les Gobelins dedans<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I am giving to uplander! Many morethanks to be given upon backhand of wordleaves!
#. column 62: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>More and many of wrongtaken wordleaves remain unfound. Will goodly uplander see them back to Browfix?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:240:0:56"
msgid "Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>Browfix remembers not how many wordleaves were wrongtaken, but backtaken have been less than few. More! More! There must be more!"
msgstr "Шкох... Шкох... Шкох...<br>Брауфикс не помнит, сколько листов стащили, но вернули пока совсем немного. Ещё! Ещё! Должно быть больше!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>貴重な資料　ありがと～！<br>きっともっと　あるはず～！
#. de: Großedank! Vielleicht kannzu noch mehr bringen?
#. fr: Pssshh... Merci pour ces feuillets, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! Mais Browfix est sûr qu'il y en a plus<nbsp>! Beaucoup plus<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>Browfix remembers not how many wordleaves were wrongtaken, but backtaken have been less than few. More! More! There must be more!
#. column 62: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>More and many of wrongtaken wordleaves remain unfound. Will goodly uplander see them back to Browfix?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:240:0:60"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I am giving to uplander! Many morethanks to be given upon backhand of wordleaves!"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Брауфикс благодарит верховника! А когда листы вернутся, будет благодарен ещё больше!"

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>研究資料　きっともっと　いっぱいあるはず！<br>もっとたくさん　集めた～い！
#. de: Psssh ... Gibt sicher noch viel mehr Forschenpapier. Muzzu weitersuchen!
#. fr: Psshhh... Browfix sait qu'il reste encore tout plein de feuillets à récupérer<nbsp>! L'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> doit les trouver<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Shkoh... Shkoh... Shkoh...<br>Browfix remembers not how many wordleaves were wrongtaken, but backtaken have been less than few. More! More! There must be more!
#. column 60: Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Manythanks I am giving to uplander! Many morethanks to be given upon backhand of wordleaves!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:240:0:62"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>More and many of wrongtaken wordleaves remain unfound. Will goodly uplander see them back to Browfix?"
msgstr "Пшшш... Шкоххх...<br>Ещё много украденных листов так и не нашли. Добрый верховник поможет вернуть их Брауфиксу?"

#. ja: 聞いてくれ。<br>こいつは、栄えある「聖フィネア連隊」にふさわしくない男だ。<br>仲間の手柄を横取りする、悪癖があるんだ！
#. de: Es war eindeutig ich, der dem garstigen Biest den Todesstoß versetzte. Doch Werner beansprucht die Ehre für sich!
#. fr: Laisse-moi te dire quelque chose, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>. L'homme que tu vois là n'a rien à faire au Convictoire. Il n'hésite pas à s'approprier les exploits des autres<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Honor binds me from crossing blades with my sworn brother, but it does not bind me from <i>aiding</i> one who might have been <i>wrongly assaulted</i> by a conniving lout of a brother. What say you, adventurer?
#. column 58: Uphold Ser Beaudonet's honor by disciplining Ser Werner?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You, too would see the name of the Convictors' sullied? Then you are no better than Ser Werner... Nay, worse.
msgctxt "FateEvent:241:0:56"
msgid "Ser Werner has sullied the Convictors' name one too many times, and I shall not stand idly by as he has the effrontery to snatch glory from the hands of the deserving."
msgstr "Сэр Вернер уже не раз позорил имя Поборников, и я не стану смотреть сложа руки, пока он нагло присваивает чужие заслуги."

#. ja: 何としても、懲らしめてやりたいんだが……<br>タチの悪いことに、こいつ、腕はそこそこ立つ。<br>ひとつ、手伝ってはくれないか？
#. de: Er ist eine Schande für Finneas Vollstrecker und hat eine Lektion verdient, die ich ihm erteilen werde. Mit, äh, deiner Hilfe, denn ich bin ja noch <i>so</i> verausgabt vom Kampf gegen den <i>riesigen</i> Drachen!
#. fr: J'aimerais lui donner une leçon qu'il n'oubliera pas de sitôt... mais, je ne suis malheureusement pas de taille. Dis, accepterais-tu de m'aider<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Ser Werner has sullied the Convictors' name one too many times, and I shall not stand idly by as he has the effrontery to snatch glory from the hands of the deserving.
#. column 58: Uphold Ser Beaudonet's honor by disciplining Ser Werner?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You, too would see the name of the Convictors' sullied? Then you are no better than Ser Werner... Nay, worse.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:241:0:57"
msgid "Honor binds me from crossing blades with my sworn brother, but it does not bind me from <i>aiding</i> one who might have been <i>wrongly assaulted</i> by a conniving lout of a brother. What say you, adventurer?"
msgstr "Честь не позволяет мне скрестить клинки с побратимом. Но она не мешает <i>помочь</i> тому, кого этот подлый мерзавец <i>несправедливо обидел</i>. Что скажешь, искатель приключений?"

#. ja: 手伝ってあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Beaudonet im Kampf beistehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Accepter la demande<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Ser Werner has sullied the Convictors' name one too many times, and I shall not stand idly by as he has the effrontery to snatch glory from the hands of the deserving.
#. column 57: Honor binds me from crossing blades with my sworn brother, but it does not bind me from <i>aiding</i> one who might have been <i>wrongly assaulted</i> by a conniving lout of a brother. What say you, adventurer?
#. column 62: You, too would see the name of the Convictors' sullied? Then you are no better than Ser Werner... Nay, worse.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
