#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:241:0:58"
msgid "Uphold Ser Beaudonet's honor by disciplining Ser Werner?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Заступиться за честь сэра Бодоне и проучить сэра Вернера?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか……。<br>見ず知らずの相手に頼まれても、困るよな。<br>すまない、忘れてくれ。
#. de: Ist nicht deine Sache, hm? Na ja, ich will's dir nicht verübeln ...
#. fr: D'accord... Je comprends tout à fait. Moi-même, j'hésiterais, si quelqu'un que je ne connais pas me demandait ça.
#. column 56: Ser Werner has sullied the Convictors' name one too many times, and I shall not stand idly by as he has the effrontery to snatch glory from the hands of the deserving.
#. column 57: Honor binds me from crossing blades with my sworn brother, but it does not bind me from <i>aiding</i> one who might have been <i>wrongly assaulted</i> by a conniving lout of a brother. What say you, adventurer?
#. column 58: Uphold Ser Beaudonet's honor by disciplining Ser Werner?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:241:0:62"
msgid "You, too would see the name of the Convictors' sullied? Then you are no better than Ser Werner... Nay, worse."
msgstr "Ты тоже хочешь опозорить имя Поборников? Тогда ты ничем не лучше сэра Вернера... Нет, даже хуже."

#. ja: もっと！<br>もっと、私の心を滾らせてくれる者はいないものか！
#. de: Ich werde der ganzen Welt beweisen, dass mit einem à la Wertesta nicht zu spaßen ist!
#. fr: N'y a-t-il personne pour aviver les flammes de mon cœur<nbsp>!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:242:0:56"
msgid "Come! I shall prove to any and all the might of the Knights Dragoon!"
msgstr "Вперёд! Я докажу всем и каждому, на что способны рыцари-драгуны!"

#. ja: こんにちはくぽ。<br>もしかして、「白亜の宮殿」まで、<br>向かう途中だったりするくぽ？
#. de: Hallo Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>! Du bist nicht zufällig unterwegs zum Kreidetempel, kupo?
#. fr: Salut, kuppo<nbsp>! Dites, vous n'iriez pas vers Zénith, par hasard<nbsp>?
#. column 57: If the ancient covenant says <i>all</i> moogles of Moghome must tend to the holy tower, why is it always yours-kupo-truly who finds himself stuck wiping down the walls by his lonesome?
#. column 58: \<sigh> You wouldn't happen to be on your way to Zenith, would you? I've drawn the small nut and now must take one in the pom to see my ungrateful brothers remain in Hraesvelgr's good graces. Problem is, I don't think I can make it there on my own, kupo.
#. column 59: Escort the moogle to Zenith?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Mog it! If Hraesvelgr wants to come down from the lofty heavens and raze Moghome, let him! At least I'll never have to wipe a wall again.
msgctxt "FateEvent:243:0:56"
msgid "Those good-for-naught pom-clods! They said they'd be here by now, kupo!"
msgstr "Эти лентяи с помпонами! Обещали быть здесь к этому времени, купо!"

#. ja: モグは、「白亜の宮殿」に行くとこくぽ。<br>お掃除が大好きで、いつもきれいにしてあげてるくぽ。
#. de: Ich putze für mein Leben gern und mache deshalb oft bei den Drachen sauber.
#. fr: C'est là que je dois aller, kuppo, pour faire le ménage. Même que c'est mon occupation préférée<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Those good-for-naught pom-clods! They said they'd be here by now, kupo!
#. column 58: \<sigh> You wouldn't happen to be on your way to Zenith, would you? I've drawn the small nut and now must take one in the pom to see my ungrateful brothers remain in Hraesvelgr's good graces. Problem is, I don't think I can make it there on my own, kupo.
#. column 59: Escort the moogle to Zenith?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Mog it! If Hraesvelgr wants to come down from the lofty heavens and raze Moghome, let him! At least I'll never have to wipe a wall again.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:243:0:57"
msgid "If the ancient covenant says <i>all</i> moogles of Moghome must tend to the holy tower, why is it always yours-kupo-truly who finds himself stuck wiping down the walls by his lonesome?"
msgstr "В древнем договоре сказано, что <i>все</i> муглы из Могдома должны заботиться о священной башне. Так почему же мне, бедному муглу, вечно приходится в одиночку оттирать стены?"

#. ja: 今日は、いつも一緒に行くおともだちがいないくぽ。<br>心細いから、一緒に行ってほしいくぽ！
#. de: Normalerweise zusammen mit meinen Freunden, kupo, aber die haben heute keine Zeit. Alleine ist mir der Weg zum Tempel aber viel zu gefährlich, kupo!
#. fr: Mais aujourd'hui, mes camarades ne sont pas avec moi... et j'ai un peu peur d'y aller tout seul, kuppo<nbsp>! Vous ne voudriez pas m'accompagner<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Those good-for-naught pom-clods! They said they'd be here by now, kupo!
#. column 57: If the ancient covenant says <i>all</i> moogles of Moghome must tend to the holy tower, why is it always yours-kupo-truly who finds himself stuck wiping down the walls by his lonesome?
#. column 59: Escort the moogle to Zenith?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Mog it! If Hraesvelgr wants to come down from the lofty heavens and raze Moghome, let him! At least I'll never have to wipe a wall again.
msgctxt "FateEvent:243:0:58"
msgid "\\<sigh> You wouldn't happen to be on your way to Zenith, would you? I've drawn the small nut and now must take one in the pom to see my ungrateful brothers remain in Hraesvelgr's good graces. Problem is, I don't think I can make it there on my own, kupo."
msgstr "<i>Эх...</i> Ты случайно не направляешься в Зенит? Мне достался самый маленький орешек, и теперь надо получить по помпону, чтобы мои неблагодарные братья не лишились расположения Хресвельгра. Только вот одному мне туда не добраться, купо."

#. ja: 護衛してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Geleitest du den Mogry zum Kreidetempel?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Escorter ce Mog<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Those good-for-naught pom-clods! They said they'd be here by now, kupo!
#. column 57: If the ancient covenant says <i>all</i> moogles of Moghome must tend to the holy tower, why is it always yours-kupo-truly who finds himself stuck wiping down the walls by his lonesome?
#. column 58: \<sigh> You wouldn't happen to be on your way to Zenith, would you? I've drawn the small nut and now must take one in the pom to see my ungrateful brothers remain in Hraesvelgr's good graces. Problem is, I don't think I can make it there on my own, kupo.
#. column 62: Mog it! If Hraesvelgr wants to come down from the lofty heavens and raze Moghome, let him! At least I'll never have to wipe a wall again.
