msgctxt "FateEvent:244:0:59"
msgid "Save Galar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Спасти Галара?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そんな……。<br>どうしよう。
#. de: Wie herzlos ...
#. fr: Oh, non<nbsp>!<nbsp>... Pourvu que mon oncle s'en sorte...
#. column 56: <if $gn4>Daughter<else>Son</if> of the Land, you are here in our realm at the blessing of Vidofnir, which means there is good within you.
#. column 57: Mine uncle, known by your people as Galar of the Second Sun, ever loyal servant of Hraesvelgr, is beset by minions of Nidhogg.
#. column 58: I ask with humble heart that you lend him your strength, for without aid, I do not believe he will survive much longer, and I am too young and weak to alter the tide of battle.
#. column 59: Save Galar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:244:0:62"
msgid "Then you have condemned him to death... Perhaps Vidofnir was mistaken..."
msgstr "Значит, ты обрёк его на смерть... Может, Видофнир ошибалась..."

#. ja: 冒険者よ、好いところに来た。<br>先の咆哮が聞こえたか？<br>あれは、ドラゴン族の襲撃前の合図。
#. de: Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if> ... Hast du das Brüllen gerade vernommen? Nidhoggs Horde bläst zum Angriff.
#. fr: Humain<if $gn4>e</if>, tu tombes bien. As-tu entendu le rugissement, tout à l'heure<nbsp>? C'était un appel à l'attaque.
#. column 57: The followers of Nidhogg approach, seeking that which they can never have.
#. column 58: Would you watch as I clip their wings and watch them fall to Hydaelyn's bosom, or would you stand with me, weapons drawn like a true hero of Her choosing?
#. column 59: Join Fjalar in his battle against the Horde?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then you may wish to watch from afar, lest the dragons smell your fear.
#. macro: <if $gn4>Daughter<else>Son</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:245:0:56"
msgid "<if $gn4>Daughter<else>Son</if> of the Land, did the battle cry of my black-hearted kin reach your ears?"
msgstr "<if $gn4>Дочь<else>Сын</if> Земли, ты слышал боевой клич моих черносердечных сородичей?"

#. ja: 邪竜の眷属どもが、すぐ近くに集結しているようだ。<br>すでに、かなりの数が集まっている気配がある……。
#. de: Sie sind ganz in der Nähe ... Und es sind viele ...
#. fr: Les sbires de Nidhogg ne devraient pas tarder à arriver en nombre par ici. Il y en a déjà dans les environs, je le sens...
#. column 56: <if $gn4>Daughter<else>Son</if> of the Land, did the battle cry of my black-hearted kin reach your ears?
#. column 58: Would you watch as I clip their wings and watch them fall to Hydaelyn's bosom, or would you stand with me, weapons drawn like a true hero of Her choosing?
#. column 59: Join Fjalar in his battle against the Horde?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then you may wish to watch from afar, lest the dragons smell your fear.
msgctxt "FateEvent:245:0:57"
msgid "The followers of Nidhogg approach, seeking that which they can never have."
msgstr "Приспешники Нидхёгга приближаются. Они жаждут заполучить то, чего им никогда не видать."

#. ja: だがこの我がいるかぎり、心配は無用……。<br>徒党を組まねば何もできぬ連中など、恐るるに足らん！<br>ともに戦うというならば、拒みはせぬがな！
#. de: Doch sei unbesorgt: Solange ich über den Kreidetempel wache, wird die Horde hier niemandem ein Haar krümmen. Oder wärst du gar gewillt, mit mir in den Krieg zu ziehen? Ich würde dich nicht daran hindern.
#. fr: Mais tant que je suis avec toi, tu n'as rien à craindre. Nos ennemis sont incapables d'agir de leur propre chef<nbsp>! Acceptes-tu de m'aider à les chasser d'ici<nbsp>?
#. column 56: <if $gn4>Daughter<else>Son</if> of the Land, did the battle cry of my black-hearted kin reach your ears?
#. column 57: The followers of Nidhogg approach, seeking that which they can never have.
#. column 59: Join Fjalar in his battle against the Horde?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then you may wish to watch from afar, lest the dragons smell your fear.
msgctxt "FateEvent:245:0:58"
msgid "Would you watch as I clip their wings and watch them fall to Hydaelyn's bosom, or would you stand with me, weapons drawn like a true hero of Her choosing?"
msgstr "Станешь смотреть, как я обломаю им крылья и отправлю к Хайделин? Или встанешь рядом со мной с оружием в руках, как истинный герой, избранный Ею?"

#. ja: ともに戦いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Zusammen mit Fjalar gegen die Horde kämpfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Fjalar<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: <if $gn4>Daughter<else>Son</if> of the Land, did the battle cry of my black-hearted kin reach your ears?
#. column 57: The followers of Nidhogg approach, seeking that which they can never have.
#. column 58: Would you watch as I clip their wings and watch them fall to Hydaelyn's bosom, or would you stand with me, weapons drawn like a true hero of Her choosing?
#. column 62: Then you may wish to watch from afar, lest the dragons smell your fear.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
