msgctxt "FateEvent:245:0:59"
msgid "Join Fjalar in his battle against the Horde?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сражаться с ордой вместе с Фьяларом?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ならば、早くここから離れろ。<br>巻き込まれでもしたら、ただでは済まんぞ！
#. de: Dann solltest du dich schleunigst in Sicherheit bringen. Die Horde macht vor Unbeteiligten keinen Halt.
#. fr: Vraiment<nbsp>? Dans ce cas, je te conseille de partir d'ici avant que ça ne soit trop dangereux.
#. column 56: <if $gn4>Daughter<else>Son</if> of the Land, did the battle cry of my black-hearted kin reach your ears?
#. column 57: The followers of Nidhogg approach, seeking that which they can never have.
#. column 58: Would you watch as I clip their wings and watch them fall to Hydaelyn's bosom, or would you stand with me, weapons drawn like a true hero of Her choosing?
#. column 59: Join Fjalar in his battle against the Horde?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:245:0:62"
msgid "Then you may wish to watch from afar, lest the dragons smell your fear."
msgstr "Тогда лучше смотри издалека, а то драконы учуют твой страх."

#. ja: くぽぽ……モグのおともだちが見当たらないくぽ。<br>でも、アイツのお腹から、くぽくぽ聞こえる、<br>気がするくぽ……どういうことくぽ？
#. de: Mein Freund ist zu spät zu unserer Verabredung, kupo! Er hat sie doch wohl nicht vergessen? Und warum tönt es ständig kupo, kupo aus dem Bauch dieses Drachen? Will der eine Karriere als Bauchredner starten?
#. fr: Kuppoppo<nbsp>! Mais où est mon camarade<nbsp>!?<nbsp>... C'est étrange, j'entends des “kuppo<nbsp>! kuppo<nbsp>!” qui vienne du ventre de ce monstre. Qu'est-ce que ça veut dire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:246:0:56"
msgid "Do you hear something coming from that creature's belly? I could swear I heard something, kupo..."
msgstr "Слышишь, что-то доносится из брюха этой твари? Клянусь, там кто-то пищал: «купо»..."

#. ja: オレの頼みを聞いてくれ。<br>ここらに棲む虫どもに、やたらと寄りつかれて困っている。<br>何とか、撃退してほしいんだ！
#. de: Ich bitte dich, du musst mir helfen! Diese dämlichen Viecher lassen mir keine Ruhe!
#. fr: Hé, toi<nbsp>! J'ai besoin de ton aide pour régler un fichu problème<nbsp>! Figure-toi que les insectes du coin n'arrêtent pas de venir m'emmerder. J'ai besoin que quelqu'un les chasse de là<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Here, ye can even have the coin I was paid for that last chocobo. Just keep the bloody buggers off me!
#. column 58: Fight off the fleas?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I cannot blame ye. I wouldn't wish such a fate on me worst enemy...or me best enemy, for that matter.
msgctxt "FateEvent:247:0:56"
msgid "Fleas! They're everywhere! In me hair, in me buskins, in me godsdamned codpiece!"
msgstr "Блохи! Они повсюду! В волосах, в сапогах, в проклятых штанах!"

#. ja: 何故か、オレばかり虫に好かれるんだ……。<br>寄りつかれてからじゃ、手後れだ。<br>悪いが、探し出してやっつけてくれよ！
#. de: Surren um mich rum, als hätte ich drei Monde nicht gebadet, dabei hab ich noch nie gebadet!
#. fr: Je ne sais pas pourquoi ils me collent comme ça, mais je préfère qu'ils ne s'approchent pas de moi<nbsp>! S'il te plaît, file-moi un coup de main<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Fleas! They're everywhere! In me hair, in me buskins, in me godsdamned codpiece!
#. column 58: Fight off the fleas?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I cannot blame ye. I wouldn't wish such a fate on me worst enemy...or me best enemy, for that matter.
msgctxt "FateEvent:247:0:57"
msgid "Here, ye can even have the coin I was paid for that last chocobo. Just keep the bloody buggers off me!"
msgstr "Вот, забирай деньги, что мне заплатили за того чокобо. Только избавь меня от этих проклятых тварей!"

#. ja: 助けてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Moosiger Gipfel von der Flohplage befreien?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Mossy Peak<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Fleas! They're everywhere! In me hair, in me buskins, in me godsdamned codpiece!
#. column 57: Here, ye can even have the coin I was paid for that last chocobo. Just keep the bloody buggers off me!
#. column 62: I cannot blame ye. I wouldn't wish such a fate on me worst enemy...or me best enemy, for that matter.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
