#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:247:0:58"
msgid "Fight off the fleas?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Прогнать блох?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 手伝う気になったらいつでも言ってくれ。<br>よろしく頼む！
#. de: Schlägt da wirklich ein Herz in deiner Brust?
#. fr: D'accord... Si jamais tu changes d'avis, tu n'auras qu'à suivre les puces pour me retrouver...
#. column 56: Fleas! They're everywhere! In me hair, in me buskins, in me godsdamned codpiece!
#. column 57: Here, ye can even have the coin I was paid for that last chocobo. Just keep the bloody buggers off me!
#. column 58: Fight off the fleas?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:247:0:62"
msgid "I cannot blame ye. I wouldn't wish such a fate on me worst enemy...or me best enemy, for that matter."
msgstr "Не виню тебя. Такой участи и врагу не пожелаешь... Даже самому заклятому."

#. ja: グンド族に追われている。<br>あいつらを撃退してもらえばありがたい。
#. de: Diesen unverschämten Gundo muss mal jemand Manieren beibringen! Verstehst du dich auf Etikette?
#. fr: Au secours<nbsp>! Les Gundu sont à ma poursuite<nbsp>! Il faut les empêcher de m'attraper<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:248:0:56"
msgid "The Gundu are mostly bark, and little bite...but that bark can be quite annoying, especially when trying to catch a few moments slumber after a sixteen-bell training regimen. Luckily, a quick slap on the wrist should send them fluttering back to their huts. Would you consider joining the effort? You will be compensated."
msgstr "Гунду больше лают, чем кусают... Но как же они раздражают, особенно когда пытаешься вздремнуть после шестнадцатичасовой тренировки. Достаточно хорошенько их отшлёпать — и сами побегут обратно в свои хижины. Поможешь? За помощь заплачу."

#. ja: そこの、そこの、旅のヒト！<br>そこらにたくさんおる「クラウド・スプライト」から、<br>「湧水の核」を集めてはくれぬか？
#. de: Na-Vanu-eeh sieht die vielen Exergone? Vanu-ooh braucht Kerne von Exergonen.
#. fr: Humain<if $gn4>e</if>, écoute ma demande<nbsp>! J'ai besoin des noyaux de source que possèdent les élémentaires de nuage que tu vois par ici<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Zundu would fetch water, but thirst makes our limbs heavy as tree trunks. Kind netherling comes to poor Zundu's aid, yes?
#. column 58: Fetch water for the Zundu?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hunt sprites for their cores, or find those lying about. Bring them to us, and Zundu throats will feel the gentle caress of pure water.
#. column 62: Forgive us, netherling. Zundu seek not the aid of strangers.
msgctxt "FateEvent:249:0:56"
msgid "Kind netherling, with heart as warm as shining sun! Throats of the Zundu are parched, like dried grass after moons without rain..."
msgstr "Добрый верховник, чьё сердце сияет, как солнце! Зундусам не хватает воды, горло пересохло, словно трава после долгих месяцев без дождя..."

#. ja: 実は、実は、我らの郷で、綺麗な水が不足しておってな。<br>「湧水の核」は、水のもと。<br>溶かせば、雨の水より、清らかな水になるのだ。
#. de: In Heimat von Vanu-ooh kaum Wasser, daher Vanu-ooh Kerne schmelzen für Nass wie nach Regennacht.
#. fr: Notre village manque cruellement d'eau, et ces noyaux en sont une source inestimable<nbsp>! Ils contiennent l'eau pure de la pluie<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Kind netherling, with heart as warm as shining sun! Throats of the Zundu are parched, like dried grass after moons without rain...
#. column 58: Fetch water for the Zundu?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hunt sprites for their cores, or find those lying about. Bring them to us, and Zundu throats will feel the gentle caress of pure water.
#. column 62: Forgive us, netherling. Zundu seek not the aid of strangers.
msgctxt "FateEvent:249:0:57"
msgid "Zundu would fetch water, but thirst makes our limbs heavy as tree trunks. Kind netherling comes to poor Zundu's aid, yes?"
msgstr "Зундусы бы сами сходили за водой, да от жажды ноги стали тяжёлыми, как стволы деревьев. Добрый верховник поможет несчастным зундусам, да?"

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Zundo die Kerne besorgen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le jeune Zundu<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Kind netherling, with heart as warm as shining sun! Throats of the Zundu are parched, like dried grass after moons without rain...
#. column 57: Zundu would fetch water, but thirst makes our limbs heavy as tree trunks. Kind netherling comes to poor Zundu's aid, yes?
#. column 60: Hunt sprites for their cores, or find those lying about. Bring them to us, and Zundu throats will feel the gentle caress of pure water.
#. column 62: Forgive us, netherling. Zundu seek not the aid of strangers.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:249:0:58"
msgid "Fetch water for the Zundu?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Принести воду для зундусов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうだ、そうだ、「湧水の核」は、<br>クラウド・スプライトを狩るか、<br>落ちているものを、拾って集めてほしい。
#. de: Vielen Dank, Na-Vanu-eeh! Kerne aus Exergonen klopfen oder von Boden aufheben wie reife Königskastanie!
#. fr: Oui, tu dois récupérer les noyaux de source sur des élémentaires de nuage ou ceux qui sont tombés par terre.
#. column 56: Kind netherling, with heart as warm as shining sun! Throats of the Zundu are parched, like dried grass after moons without rain...
#. column 57: Zundu would fetch water, but thirst makes our limbs heavy as tree trunks. Kind netherling comes to poor Zundu's aid, yes?
#. column 58: Fetch water for the Zundu?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Forgive us, netherling. Zundu seek not the aid of strangers.
msgctxt "FateEvent:249:0:60"
msgid "Hunt sprites for their cores, or find those lying about. Bring them to us, and Zundu throats will feel the gentle caress of pure water."
msgstr "Добудь ядра из облачных спрайтов или подбери те, что валяются на земле. Принеси их нам, и чистая вода нежно смочит горло зундусов."

#. ja: すまぬ、すまぬ、<br>我らと関係のない者まで、巻き込もうとしておった……。
#. de: Vanu-ooh bittet Na-Vanu-eeh um Verzeihung für Bitte lästig wie Dungmückenschwarm.
#. fr: Je te prie de m'excuser... J'oubliais que les problèmes des Zundu ne concernent pas les gens d'en bas...
#. column 56: Kind netherling, with heart as warm as shining sun! Throats of the Zundu are parched, like dried grass after moons without rain...
#. column 57: Zundu would fetch water, but thirst makes our limbs heavy as tree trunks. Kind netherling comes to poor Zundu's aid, yes?
#. column 58: Fetch water for the Zundu?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hunt sprites for their cores, or find those lying about. Bring them to us, and Zundu throats will feel the gentle caress of pure water.
msgctxt "FateEvent:249:0:62"
msgid "Forgive us, netherling. Zundu seek not the aid of strangers."
msgstr "Прости нас, верховник. Зундусы не должны просить помощи у чужаков."

#. ja: どうだ、どうだ？<br>「湧水の核」は集まったか……？
#. de: Hat Na-Vanu-eeh Kerne gefunden?
#. fr: As-tu récupéré des noyaux de source, humain<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>?<nbsp>...
#. column 60: Ahhh... I can feel the pure waters trickling down my throat like a gentle brook!
#. column 62: This is unfortunate, but I suppose there is nothing to be done.
msgctxt "FateEvent:250:0:56"
msgid "Netherling! Do you return with the watery succor Zundu seek?"
msgstr "Верховник! Вернулся с водой, которая так нужна зундусам?"

#. ja: 好いぞ、好いぞ。<br>もっと、もっと、持ってきてほしい。
#. de: Danke, danke! Ausgezeichnet! Wenn Na-Vanu-eeh noch mehr findet, Vanu-ooh bringen!
#. fr: Oui, c'est ça<nbsp>! C'est ça<nbsp>! Rapporte-m'en autant que tu le peux<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Netherling! Do you return with the watery succor Zundu seek?
#. column 62: This is unfortunate, but I suppose there is nothing to be done.
msgctxt "FateEvent:250:0:60"
msgid "Ahhh... I can feel the pure waters trickling down my throat like a gentle brook!"
msgstr "А-а... Чистая вода струится по горлу, словно ручей!"

#. ja: そうか、そうか。<br>残念ではあるが、仕方あるまい。
#. de: Oh, das bedauerlich ist ...
#. fr: Ah, je vois... C'est bien dommage, mais tout comme le vent ne peut être saisi, nous n'y pouvons rien.
#. column 56: Netherling! Do you return with the watery succor Zundu seek?
#. column 60: Ahhh... I can feel the pure waters trickling down my throat like a gentle brook!
msgctxt "FateEvent:250:0:62"
msgid "This is unfortunate, but I suppose there is nothing to be done."
msgstr "Жаль, но ничего не поделаешь."

#. ja: 我は、我は、「湧水の核」を集めている……。<br>持っているなら、譲ってくれぬか？
#. de: Vanu-ooh sammelt Exergon-Kerne. Na-Vanu-eeh ist freundlich und hilft?
#. fr: Je dois rassembler des noyaux de source<nbsp>! S'il te plaît, gentil<if $gn4>le</if> humain<if $gn4>e</if>, donne-m'en, si tu en as<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:251:0:56"
msgid "I collect spring cores to bring succor to my brothers. Does netherling bring some to us?"
msgstr "Я собираю ядра источника, чтобы помочь своим сородичам. Верхоник принёс нам немного?"

#. ja: だいぶ、だいぶ、集まった。<br>「湧水の核」は、集まった。<br>だが、もしもまだあるなら、譲ってほしい。
#. de: Vanu-ooh hat schon viele Kerne. Aber Vanu-ooh kann nie genug davon haben.
#. fr: Grâce à toi, j'ai plein de noyaux de source, mais si tu en trouves plus, je les veux bien.
msgctxt "FateEvent:252:0:56"
msgid "Stock of spring cores swells like a burgeoning river. But Zundu must have more to sate our thirst."
msgstr "Запас ядер источника растёт, словно полноводная река. Но зундусам нужно ещё больше, чтобы утолить жажду."

#. ja: よし、よし。<br>なんとか「湧水の核」が集まった。<br>もっとあれば、もっと助かる。
#. de: Vanu-ooh schon genug Kerne hat. Für heute. Aber morgen kommt auch. Wenn Na-Vanu-eeh noch welche findet, soll Na-Vanu-eeh ruhig bringen.
#. fr: Je crois que j'ai assez de noyaux de source, mais bien sûr, je ne les refuserai pas si tu en trouves d'autres, gentil<if $gn4>le</if> humain<if $gn4>e</if>.
#. column 60: Thank you, netherling. Your kindness tickles our hearts like a gentle rain.
#. column 62: That is fine, netherling. You have brought the Zundu enough succor for today.
msgctxt "FateEvent:253:0:56"
msgid "Yes, yes, this will do. But Zundu can never have enough water. Any more netherling brings will be welcome."
msgstr "Да, да, этого хватит. Но воды зундусам всегда мало. Если верховник принесёт ещё, мы будем рады."

#. ja: ありがたい、ありがたい。<br>恵みの時雨のごとき、優しいお方だ。
#. de: Vielen Dank! Na-Vanu-eeh ist gütig wie sanfter Sommerregen.
#. fr: Merci, merci, humain<if $gn4>e</if>. Tu es aussi gentil<if $gn4>le</if> que la pluie qui caresse nos îles<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Yes, yes, this will do. But Zundu can never have enough water. Any more netherling brings will be welcome.
#. column 62: That is fine, netherling. You have brought the Zundu enough succor for today.
msgctxt "FateEvent:253:0:60"
msgid "Thank you, netherling. Your kindness tickles our hearts like a gentle rain."
msgstr "Спасибо, верховник. Твоя доброта ласкает сердца, словно нежный дождь."

#. ja: そうか、そうか、かまわない。<br>必要な量は、集まった。
#. de: Verstanden. Na-Vanu-eeh hat fleißig genug gesammelt.
#. fr: Ce n'est pas grave. Grâce à toi, j'en ai assez.
#. column 56: Yes, yes, this will do. But Zundu can never have enough water. Any more netherling brings will be welcome.
#. column 60: Thank you, netherling. Your kindness tickles our hearts like a gentle rain.
msgctxt "FateEvent:253:0:62"
msgid "That is fine, netherling. You have brought the Zundu enough succor for today."
msgstr "Всё хорошо, верховник. Ты принёс зундусам достаточно воды на сегодня."

#. ja: 我を、我を、助けてほしい。<br>雪嵐のように横暴な、ブンド族の奴らに、<br>追われておる。
#. de: Vanu-ooh braucht Hilfe, Na-Vanu-eeh! Vundo-eeh grausam wie bitterer Eiswind verfolgen Vanu-ooh!
#. fr: Humain<if $gn4>e</if>, je t'en supplie, tu dois m'aider<nbsp>! Les méchants Vundu me poursuivent comme une tempête destructrice<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Zundu escapes, flies here with the speed of gusting winds. But my weary legs can carry me no further...
#. column 58: Oh, how I long to feel the gentle breeze of Ok' Zundu once more! Netherling will guide me home, yes?
#. column 59: Guide the harried Zundu home?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Netherling's heart is as cold and callous as the Vundu!
msgctxt "FateEvent:254:0:56"
msgid "Netherling, hear my plea! Zundu suffers long as prisoner of the Vundu. Vundu chief uses my poor back as stool for his stinky feet─an unending storm of pain and indignity!"
msgstr "Верховник, выслушай мою мольбу! Зундусы долго были пленниками вунду. Вождь вунду использовал мою спину как подставку для своих вонючих ног — бесконечная буря боли и унижений!"

#. ja: あれは、あれは、いつだったか。<br>奴らに囚われ、過酷な仕事を強要された。<br>やっとの思いで、逃げ出したのだ。
#. de: Vanu-ooh soll wieder Fußstütze sein für Vundo-Ältesten. Aber Füße von Vundo-Ältesten riechen wie Gnu-Fell in Regenzeit.
#. fr: Ils m'avaient fait prisonnier... pour que je serve de repose-pieds à leur ancien<nbsp>! Mais j'ai réussi à m'enfuir<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Netherling, hear my plea! Zundu suffers long as prisoner of the Vundu. Vundu chief uses my poor back as stool for his stinky feet─an unending storm of pain and indignity!
#. column 58: Oh, how I long to feel the gentle breeze of Ok' Zundu once more! Netherling will guide me home, yes?
#. column 59: Guide the harried Zundu home?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Netherling's heart is as cold and callous as the Vundu!
msgctxt "FateEvent:254:0:57"
msgid "Zundu escapes, flies here with the speed of gusting winds. But my weary legs can carry me no further..."
msgstr "Зундус бежал сюда со скоростью порывистого ветра. Но усталые ноги больше не держат..."

#. ja: しかし、しかし、足を怪我して、<br>思うように、歩けない。<br>我が郷に着くまで、護ってはもらえぬか？
#. de: Vanu-ooh konnte fliehen, aber jetzt hat Fuß verletzt und ist langsam wie Schnecke auf glitschigem Blatt.
#. fr: Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, je me suis blessé à la jambe, et je sais qu'ils vont me rattraper<nbsp>! Je t'en supplie, protège-moi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Netherling, hear my plea! Zundu suffers long as prisoner of the Vundu. Vundu chief uses my poor back as stool for his stinky feet─an unending storm of pain and indignity!
#. column 57: Zundu escapes, flies here with the speed of gusting winds. But my weary legs can carry me no further...
#. column 59: Guide the harried Zundu home?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Netherling's heart is as cold and callous as the Vundu!
msgctxt "FateEvent:254:0:58"
msgid "Oh, how I long to feel the gentle breeze of Ok' Zundu once more! Netherling will guide me home, yes?"
msgstr "Как же хочется снова почувствовать ласковый ветерок Ок'Зунду! Верховник проводит меня домой, да?"

#. ja: 護衛してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Zundo eskortieren?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le Zundu en fuite<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Netherling, hear my plea! Zundu suffers long as prisoner of the Vundu. Vundu chief uses my poor back as stool for his stinky feet─an unending storm of pain and indignity!
#. column 57: Zundu escapes, flies here with the speed of gusting winds. But my weary legs can carry me no further...
#. column 58: Oh, how I long to feel the gentle breeze of Ok' Zundu once more! Netherling will guide me home, yes?
#. column 62: Netherling's heart is as cold and callous as the Vundu!
