msgstr "Проводить измученного зундуса домой?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: なんと、なんと、酷いヒトか……！
#. de: Na-Vanu-eeh hat Herz so kalt wie Wind in Winternacht ...
#. fr: Comment<nbsp>!? N'as-tu donc aucune pitié pour un pauvre Zundu<nbsp>!?<nbsp>...
#. column 56: Netherling, hear my plea! Zundu suffers long as prisoner of the Vundu. Vundu chief uses my poor back as stool for his stinky feet─an unending storm of pain and indignity!
#. column 57: Zundu escapes, flies here with the speed of gusting winds. But my weary legs can carry me no further...
#. column 58: Oh, how I long to feel the gentle breeze of Ok' Zundu once more! Netherling will guide me home, yes?
#. column 59: Guide the harried Zundu home?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:254:0:62"
msgid "Netherling's heart is as cold and callous as the Vundu!"
msgstr "У верховника сердце такое же холодное и чёрствое, как у вунду!"

#. ja: ザザ……ザ……こちらは「検査システム」。<br>センサーが工作機械の異常動作を検知しました。<br>強制停止を要請します。
#. de: \<biep> ... Fehlfunktion im Wartungssystem ... Sofortige Abschaltung der defekten Techniker empfohlen ...
#. fr: Bzzzz... Bzz... Ici la sphère d'examen. Une anomalie a été détectée dans le fonc<shy>tion<shy>ne<shy>ment des machines-outils... Demande arrêt immédiat...
#. column 57: Answer request?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<buzzzzzz>
msgctxt "FateEvent:255:0:56"
msgid "\\<buzzzzzz> ...sors detect critical malfunction in engineering units T76 through T9... \\<buzzzzzz> Requesting emergency shutd... \\<buzzzzzz>"
msgstr "<i>Бзззз...</i> ...нсоры обнаружили критическую неисправность инженерных блоков T76–T9... <i>Бзззз...</i> Запрос аварийного отключ... <i>Бзззз...</i>"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Anweisung der Inspektionsdrohne befolgen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la sphère d'examen<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: \<buzzzzzz> ...sors detect critical malfunction in engineering units T76 through T9... \<buzzzzzz> Requesting emergency shutd... \<buzzzzzz>
#. column 62: \<buzzzzzz>
