msgid "\\<buzzzzzz>"
msgstr "<i>Бзззз...</i>"

#. ja: 友だちが出かけたまま、帰ってこないんだ。<br>僕と同じくらいの、若いドラゴン族を見なかった？
#. de: Mein Freund ist immer noch nicht zurück. Dabei wollte er nur kurz die Gegend erkunden, hat er gesagt.
#. fr: Dis-moi, humain<if $gn4>e</if>, n'as-tu pas vu un dragon comme moi<nbsp>? C'est mon ami. Il ne revient pas...
#. column 57: Nidhogg cares little and less for the blood bonds he has with those who do not follow him to the darkness. If Rhei End is discovered by the dread wyrm's minions, no mercy will be shown...
#. column 58: Assist the dragonling in locating Rhei End?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I thought, perhaps, children of the land would place similar value on kith and kin as do we dragons. I see I still have much to learn of your kind.
msgctxt "FateEvent:256:0:56"
msgid "My brother, Rhei End has yet to return from his maunderings. I fear he may be in danger."
msgstr "Братец мой, Рэй Энд всё ещё не вернулся из своих странствий. Боюсь, с ним могла случиться беда."

#. ja: 邪竜の眷属に襲われたんじゃないかって、心配なんだ。<br>お願い、友だちを探してくれないかな……？
#. de: Bestimmt haben die bösen Drachen ihn angegriffen. Hilf mir bitte, ihn zu suchen!
#. fr: Je crains qu'il n'ait été attaqué par ceux qui sont aux ordres de Nidhogg. Tu veux bien aller voir s'il ne lui est rien arrivé<nbsp>?
#. column 56: My brother, Rhei End has yet to return from his maunderings. I fear he may be in danger.
#. column 58: Assist the dragonling in locating Rhei End?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I thought, perhaps, children of the land would place similar value on kith and kin as do we dragons. I see I still have much to learn of your kind.
msgctxt "FateEvent:256:0:57"
msgid "Nidhogg cares little and less for the blood bonds he has with those who do not follow him to the darkness. If Rhei End is discovered by the dread wyrm's minions, no mercy will be shown..."
msgstr "Нидхоггу нет дела до кровных уз с теми, кто не последовал за ним во тьму. Если приспешники ужасного змея найдут Рэй Энда, пощады не будет..."

#. ja: 探してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Das Drachenkind suchen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Chercher l'ami de ce dragon<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: My brother, Rhei End has yet to return from his maunderings. I fear he may be in danger.
#. column 57: Nidhogg cares little and less for the blood bonds he has with those who do not follow him to the darkness. If Rhei End is discovered by the dread wyrm's minions, no mercy will be shown...
#. column 62: I thought, perhaps, children of the land would place similar value on kith and kin as do we dragons. I see I still have much to learn of your kind.
