msgid "Assist the dragonling in locating Rhei End?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь дракончику отыскать Рэй Энда?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: いきなり頼んじゃって、ごめんね。<br>僕はここで、友だちを待ってることにするよ……。
#. de: Schade ... Ich werde hier weiter nach ihm suchen ...
#. fr: Pardon, j'aurais dû me douter qu'un<if $gn4>e</if> humain<if $gn4>e</if> n'aurait que faire de ma demande...
#. column 56: My brother, Rhei End has yet to return from his maunderings. I fear he may be in danger.
#. column 57: Nidhogg cares little and less for the blood bonds he has with those who do not follow him to the darkness. If Rhei End is discovered by the dread wyrm's minions, no mercy will be shown...
#. column 58: Assist the dragonling in locating Rhei End?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:256:0:62"
msgid "I thought, perhaps, children of the land would place similar value on kith and kin as do we dragons. I see I still have much to learn of your kind."
msgstr "Думал, дети земли так же дорожат родными и близкими, как мы, драконы. Похоже, мне ещё многое предстоит узнать о вашем народе."

#. ja: 「ゲイラキャット」という魔物に再三の襲撃を受けている。<br>糧食の中に、何やら好物が混じっているらしくてな。<br>貴重な食いモノを守るため、協力してはくれまいか？
#. de: Die Geira-Katzen stürzen sich wie von Sinnen auf unsere Vorratskisten. Irgendwas da drin muss sie anlocken. Die Versorgung der ganzen Rosenkavallerie ist gefährdet.
#. fr: Maudits gaélichats<nbsp>! Mais qu'est-ce qu'ils ont à s'en prendre à nos provisions<nbsp>!? Dites, vous voulez bien nous aider à chasser ces sales bêtes<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Cast off the clowder?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well...I suppose the cats will leave once the mint is gone. Though, we'll still have that vilekin problem to deal with...
msgctxt "FateEvent:257:0:56"
msgid "Who would have thought gaelicats would be attracted to catmint? Everyone? You're probably right... But that does not mean we can stand here and watch as the beasts tear through our camp! Lend us your talents, adventurer, and the Rosehouse will reward you nicely."
msgstr "Кто бы мог подумать, что кошачья мята привлечёт гаэльских котов? Да все, говоришь? Наверное, ты прав... Но это не значит, что мы будем стоять и смотреть, как эти твари разносят наш лагерь! Покажи, на что способен, искатель приключений, а Розовый дом щедро тебя наградит."

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du, die Geira-Katzen zu vertreiben?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le chevalier de la Rose<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Who would have thought gaelicats would be attracted to catmint? Everyone? You're probably right... But that does not mean we can stand here and watch as the beasts tear through our camp! Lend us your talents, adventurer, and the Rosehouse will reward you nicely.
#. column 62: Well...I suppose the cats will leave once the mint is gone. Though, we'll still have that vilekin problem to deal with...
