msgid "Cast off the clowder?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Отогнать стаю?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 無理を言って悪かった。<br>ここは補給も潤沢ではない、辺境の基地。<br>食いモノの話は、死活問題なのでな……。
#. de: Verdammt. Wenn wir diese lästigen Biester nicht loswerden, dann gibt's hier bald 'ne Meuterei ...
#. fr: Hmpf, j'imagine que vous avez d'autres gaélichats à fouetter... En tout cas, si nous mourons de faim, ça sera peut-être de votre faute<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Who would have thought gaelicats would be attracted to catmint? Everyone? You're probably right... But that does not mean we can stand here and watch as the beasts tear through our camp! Lend us your talents, adventurer, and the Rosehouse will reward you nicely.
#. column 57: Cast off the clowder?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:257:0:62"
msgid "Well...I suppose the cats will leave once the mint is gone. Though, we'll still have that vilekin problem to deal with..."
msgstr "Что ж... Полагаю, коты уйдут, когда мята закончится. Хотя с этими мерзкими насекомыми всё равно придётся разбираться..."

#. ja: ワイルドチョコボの羽根が必要なんだ。<br>矢羽根の材料に、ぴったりなんでな……。<br>このあたりに落ちているから、拾ってきてくれないか。
#. de: Ein Pfeil mit 'ner Befiederung aus Chocobofedern fliegt wie am Schnürchen gezogen. Willst du dir ein paar Gil dazuverdienen und mir welche besorgen?
#. fr: Hé, toi, l'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>, tu veux pas m'aider à ramasser des plumes de chocobo sauvage<nbsp>? Mes camarades et moi, nous en avons besoin pour l'empennage de nos flèches. On en trouve un peu partout dans le coin.
#. column 57: There are molted feathers lying about the forest here, but you may find that some end up stuck to the backsides of the hairy beasts who lurk about the trees.
msgctxt "FateEvent:258:0:56"
msgid "A well-crafted arrow is worth its weight in gold, and master fletchers swear by wild chocobo feathers, claiming them the best in the realm if you would see your arrow fly straight and true."
msgstr "Хорошо сделанная стрела на вес золота, а лучшие мастера клянутся, что перья диких чокобо — лучшие во всём мире. С ними стрела полетит точно в цель."

#. ja: 抜けた羽根が、魔物にくっついていることも結構ある。<br>腕に自信があるなら、魔物を倒して拾うのもアリだ！
#. de: Wenn du Glück hast, findest du welche auf dem Boden. Manchmal kleben sie auch am Fell von Monstern.
#. fr: Cela dit, il peut aussi arriver que les monstres du coin en aient sur eux. Donc si tu n'en as pas peur, tu peux essayer de leur prendre.
#. column 56: A well-crafted arrow is worth its weight in gold, and master fletchers swear by wild chocobo feathers, claiming them the best in the realm if you would see your arrow fly straight and true.
msgctxt "FateEvent:258:0:57"
msgid "There are molted feathers lying about the forest here, but you may find that some end up stuck to the backsides of the hairy beasts who lurk about the trees."
msgstr "В лесу полно выпавших перьев, но некоторые могут застрять на спинах мохнатых тварей, что прячутся среди деревьев."

#. ja: このあたりで、チョコボが魔物に襲われていた。<br>抜けたばかりのワイルドチョコボの羽根が、<br>あちこちにちらばってるはずだ。
#. de: Eine Herde Wild-Chocobos wurde hier gerade von Bandersnatch angegriffen. Dabei haben sie ordentlich Federn gelassen, die noch hier rumliegen müssten.
#. fr: Je ne sais pas si tu as vu, mais un chocobo sauvage s'est fait attaquer par des monstres tout à l'heure. Du coup, il a laissé des plumes un peu partout.
#. column 57: I'll be out here searching for fallen feathers myself for another bell or so, but if you'd like to join me, I will pay good coin for any feather you bring me. You have my word.
#. column 58: Find feathers for the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Suit yourself, then.
msgctxt "FateEvent:259:0:56"
msgid "A hunter can never have too many arrows. The materials to make those arrows, however, can oft prove difficult to come by, especially if what you seek is firm, unbent, unfrayed feathers for the fletchings."
msgstr "Охотнику стрел много не бывает. А вот материалы для них порой трудно достать — особенно если нужны крепкие, ровные и целые перья для оперения."

#. ja: 頼む、ワイルドチョコボの羽根を集めてきてくれないか？<br>オレたちゃそれを、矢羽根の材料にして、<br>その矢でチョコボを狩る……って寸法さ！
#. de: Kannst dir ein paar Gil dazuverdienen, wenn du mir welche bringst. Wir können sie gut für die Befiederung unserer Pfeile gebrauchen.
#. fr: C'est une vraie aubaine pour nous autres chasseurs, car elles nous servent pour l'empennage de nos flèches. Dis, tu voudrais pas m'aider à en ramasser autant que possible<nbsp>?
#. column 56: A hunter can never have too many arrows. The materials to make those arrows, however, can oft prove difficult to come by, especially if what you seek is firm, unbent, unfrayed feathers for the fletchings.
#. column 58: Find feathers for the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Suit yourself, then.
msgctxt "FateEvent:259:0:57"
msgid "I'll be out here searching for fallen feathers myself for another bell or so, but if you'd like to join me, I will pay good coin for any feather you bring me. You have my word."
msgstr "Я ещё с колокол буду искать перья, но можешь присоединиться. За каждое перо заплачу звонкой монетой, обещаю."

#. ja: 手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du dem Jäger?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le chasseur de La Penne<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: A hunter can never have too many arrows. The materials to make those arrows, however, can oft prove difficult to come by, especially if what you seek is firm, unbent, unfrayed feathers for the fletchings.
#. column 57: I'll be out here searching for fallen feathers myself for another bell or so, but if you'd like to join me, I will pay good coin for any feather you bring me. You have my word.
#. column 62: Suit yourself, then.
