msgid "Find feathers for the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Найти перья для охотника?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか、残念だ……。<br>たくさん使うんだが、まだまだ足りなくてな……。
#. de: Ach, schade ... Alleine kann ich kaum so viel aufklauben, wie wir brauchen.
#. fr: Ah, bon<nbsp>?<nbsp>... Ben, tant pis, alors...
#. column 56: A hunter can never have too many arrows. The materials to make those arrows, however, can oft prove difficult to come by, especially if what you seek is firm, unbent, unfrayed feathers for the fletchings.
#. column 57: I'll be out here searching for fallen feathers myself for another bell or so, but if you'd like to join me, I will pay good coin for any feather you bring me. You have my word.
#. column 58: Find feathers for the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:259:0:62"
msgid "Suit yourself, then."
msgstr "Как знаешь."

#. ja: ワイルドチョコボの羽根を、<br>持ってきてくれたのか？
#. de: Hast du Federn von Wild-Chocobos gefunden?
#. fr: Tu m'apportes des plumes de chocobo sauvage<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Beautiful. Feathers as these will see mine arrows will fly true.
#. column 62: Well, the offer still stands, should you come across any.
msgctxt "FateEvent:260:0:56"
msgid "Have you any feathers for trade?"
msgstr "Нашёл перья на обмен?"

#. ja: ありがとう、助かる！<br>もっと集めてくれるとうれしい！
#. de: Ah ja, wunderbar! Könnte immer noch welche davon gebrauchen!
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Si tu en trouves davantage, n'hésite pas à me les donner.
#. column 56: Have you any feathers for trade?
#. column 62: Well, the offer still stands, should you come across any.
msgctxt "FateEvent:260:0:60"
msgid "Beautiful. Feathers as these will see mine arrows will fly true."
msgstr "Красота! С такими перьями мои стрелы точно не промахнутся."

#. ja: そうか、残念だ。<br>ワイルドチョコボの羽根がたくさん必要なんだ。
#. de: Oh, schade ... Wir brauchen Unmengen von dem Zeug in Fiederhag.
#. fr: Ah, bon<nbsp>? Il nous en faut beaucoup, vois-tu, donc si tu en trouves, apporte-les-moi, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Have you any feathers for trade?
#. column 60: Beautiful. Feathers as these will see mine arrows will fly true.
msgctxt "FateEvent:260:0:62"
msgid "Well, the offer still stands, should you come across any."
msgstr "Что ж, если найдёшь ещё, предложение в силе."

#. ja: おかげで、ワイルドチョコボの羽根がかなり集まった。<br>とはいえ、あればあるほど助かる……。<br>もっと持ってきてくれるのは歓迎だ！
#. de: Du hast fleißig gesammelt, aber wie gesagt: Wir können gar nicht genug haben von den Federn. Falls du noch welche findest, bring sie mir.
#. fr: Grâce à toi, j'ai beaucoup de plumes de chocobo. Mais à vrai dire, je n'en ai jamais assez. Donc, si t'en trouves encore, viens me les apporter, d'accord<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:261:0:56"
msgid "I have more than enough feathers to fill my quiver for a sennight at least...but like I said, a hunter can never have too many arrows. I welcome for trade any more you may find."
msgstr "Мне этих перьев хватит набить колчан на целую неделю... но, как я уже говорил, стрел много не бывает. Найдёшь ещё — с радостью обменяю."

#. ja: ワイルドチョコボの羽根、<br>ずいぶん持ってきてくれたな！<br>いくら感謝しても、しきれないほどだよ！
#. de: Ich weiß deine Hilfe wirklich sehr zu schätzen!
#. fr: Tu as vraiment fait du bon travail, mon ami<if $gn4>e</if>. Je ne te remercierai jamais assez<nbsp>!
#. column 60: You have my thanks, adventurer. I did not think this day would see my pack so full.
#. column 62: There must not be a single feather left in this neck of the forest!
msgctxt "FateEvent:262:0:56"
msgid "If you have more feathers, I will not be the fool who turns you away."
msgstr "Если у тебя есть ещё перья, я не стану отказываться."

#. ja: 本当に助かるよ。<br>オレたち猟師は、矢をたくさん使うからな。いくらあっても足りないぐらいだ。
#. de: Danke! Für uns sind diese Federn überlebenswichtig.
#. fr: Grâce à toi, nous autres chasseurs allons pouvoir nous con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner plein de flèches. Avec ça, la chasse devrait être bonne, cette saison. Merci beaucoup, mon ami<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>!
#. column 56: If you have more feathers, I will not be the fool who turns you away.
#. column 62: There must not be a single feather left in this neck of the forest!
msgctxt "FateEvent:262:0:60"
msgid "You have my thanks, adventurer. I did not think this day would see my pack so full."
msgstr "Спасибо тебе, искатель приключений. Не думал, что мой мешок сегодня будет таким полным."

#. ja: さすがに、もう……なかったか？
#. de: Gibt wohl keine mehr, hm? Na, wen wundert's, so fleißig wie du warst.
#. fr: Tu n'en as pas trouvé d'autres<nbsp>? Bah, tu en as fait assez de toute façon...
#. column 56: If you have more feathers, I will not be the fool who turns you away.
#. column 60: You have my thanks, adventurer. I did not think this day would see my pack so full.
msgctxt "FateEvent:262:0:62"
msgid "There must not be a single feather left in this neck of the forest!"
msgstr "Неужели в этих краях не осталось ни одного пера?"

#. ja: もう、やんなっちゃう。<br>せっかくの休暇が台無しだわ。<br>アタシだって、たまにはゆっくりしたいのに～。
#. de: Bitte lasst mich in Frieden. Ich habe heute doch meinen freien Tag!
#. fr: Je suis épuisée<nbsp>! Pourquoi ne veulent-ils pas comprendrrre que moi aussi j'ai besoin de vacances de temps en temps<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:263:0:56"
msgid "I thought I could escape my admirers, but I didn't expect there'd be pirates! This is always happening..."
msgstr "Думала, скроюсь от поклонников, а тут ещё и пираты! Вечно со мной такое..."

#. ja: ん、何を揉めてるかって？<br>実は彼、ここを出禁になっててねぇ。<br>お引き取り願おうとしているのさ。
#. de: <i>Der</i> darf hier nicht mehr auftreten! Nicht mit diesem lasziven Hüftkreisen!
#. fr: On a interdit l'accès à la plage à ce... type, et il essaie quand même de passer. Il ne veut pas comprendre qu'il n'est pas le bienvenu ici.
#. column 57: Seems his “traditional bathing dance” has the other faire-goers in a furor─think of the children, they say! And no matter how many times we ask, he won't stop his sickening gyration.
#. column 58: He's left us no choice─we'll have to drive him from the beaches. Lend us your strength, friend, as it isn't easy to control such...passion.
#. column 59: Drive away the passionate Mamool Ja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I understand... If this weren't my job, I'd just want to laze about on the beach too. Suppose I've no choice but to drive him off myself... For the children!
msgctxt "FateEvent:264:0:56"
msgid "Seven hells, this blasted Mamool Ja won't leave. He's been banned from the festivities, but nothin' I say'll make him go away."
msgstr "Семь адских кругов, да этот проклятый мамул-джа никак не уймётся! Его выгнали с праздника, а он и слушать не хочет."

#. ja: マムージャ族の水浴みの踊りが卑猥だと、<br>ほかの客から苦情が殺到してるもんで、<br>やめるよう頼んでるんだが、聞いてくれなくてね……。
#. de: Wir sind ja tolerante Leute, aber der Fruchtbarkeitstanz der Mamool Ja ist einfach nichts für den Feuermond-Reigen. Es sind schließlich auch Kinder zugegen.
#. fr: Il dit que ses danses sont tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>les, mais elles importunent nos visiteurs.
#. column 56: Seven hells, this blasted Mamool Ja won't leave. He's been banned from the festivities, but nothin' I say'll make him go away.
#. column 58: He's left us no choice─we'll have to drive him from the beaches. Lend us your strength, friend, as it isn't easy to control such...passion.
#. column 59: Drive away the passionate Mamool Ja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I understand... If this weren't my job, I'd just want to laze about on the beach too. Suppose I've no choice but to drive him off myself... For the children!
msgctxt "FateEvent:264:0:57"
msgid "Seems his “traditional bathing dance” has the other faire-goers in a furor─think of the children, they say! And no matter how many times we ask, he won't stop his sickening gyration."
msgstr "Похоже, его «традиционный танец купальщиков» взбесил всех гостей праздника — говорят, о детях подумать надо! Сколько ни просим, он всё равно продолжает свои отвратительные ужимки."

#. ja: もはや、腕ずくで止めるしかない状況さ。<br>よければ、あんたも手を貸してくれないか？
#. de: Der hier will das einfach nicht einsehen. Kannst du mir nicht helfen, ihn zu verjagen?
#. fr: S'il continue de m'énerver, je vais le fumer derrière un cyprès... Un peu d'aide ne serait pas de refus<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Seven hells, this blasted Mamool Ja won't leave. He's been banned from the festivities, but nothin' I say'll make him go away.
#. column 57: Seems his “traditional bathing dance” has the other faire-goers in a furor─think of the children, they say! And no matter how many times we ask, he won't stop his sickening gyration.
#. column 59: Drive away the passionate Mamool Ja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I understand... If this weren't my job, I'd just want to laze about on the beach too. Suppose I've no choice but to drive him off myself... For the children!
msgctxt "FateEvent:264:0:58"
msgid "He's left us no choice─we'll have to drive him from the beaches. Lend us your strength, friend, as it isn't easy to control such...passion."
msgstr "Другого выхода не осталось — придётся прогнать его с пляжа. Помоги нам, дружище: с такой... страстью нелегко совладать."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Wirst du den obszönen Mamool Ja stoppen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'organisateur<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Seven hells, this blasted Mamool Ja won't leave. He's been banned from the festivities, but nothin' I say'll make him go away.
#. column 57: Seems his “traditional bathing dance” has the other faire-goers in a furor─think of the children, they say! And no matter how many times we ask, he won't stop his sickening gyration.
#. column 58: He's left us no choice─we'll have to drive him from the beaches. Lend us your strength, friend, as it isn't easy to control such...passion.
#. column 62: I understand... If this weren't my job, I'd just want to laze about on the beach too. Suppose I've no choice but to drive him off myself... For the children!
