msgid "Drive away the passionate Mamool Ja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Прогнать страстного мамул-джа?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか……<br>マムージャ族は、うでっぷしが強いから不安だが、<br>自分でやるしかないか……。
#. de: Verstehe, du hast Angst vor dem stämmigen Krieger. Oder stehst du etwa auf seine lasziven Bewegungen?
#. fr: Je vois... On ne peut compter que sur soi-même.
#. column 56: Seven hells, this blasted Mamool Ja won't leave. He's been banned from the festivities, but nothin' I say'll make him go away.
#. column 57: Seems his “traditional bathing dance” has the other faire-goers in a furor─think of the children, they say! And no matter how many times we ask, he won't stop his sickening gyration.
#. column 58: He's left us no choice─we'll have to drive him from the beaches. Lend us your strength, friend, as it isn't easy to control such...passion.
#. column 59: Drive away the passionate Mamool Ja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:264:0:62"
msgid "I understand... If this weren't my job, I'd just want to laze about on the beach too. Suppose I've no choice but to drive him off myself... For the children!"
msgstr "Понимаю... Не будь это моей работой, я бы тоже валялся на пляже. Похоже, придётся самому его прогнать... Ради детей!"

#. ja: そこの海賊たちが、お手製花火を打ち上げようとしているんだ！<br>危ないからやめろって説得しても、聞く耳持たないんだよ。<br>もう、力ずくで止めるしかないみたいだ。
#. de: Siehst du die Piraten da? Sie haben selbstgemachtes Feuerwerk mitgebracht und zündeln damit herum.
#. fr: Ces sales pirates veulent allumer des feux d'artifice faits maison... J'ai bien tenté de leur expliquer que c'était dangereux, mais ils refusent de m'écouter. Aidez-moi à les arrêter<nbsp>!
#. column 57: You look like you can take on even the most black-hearted pirate. Please, get them off the beach before anyone comes to harm!
#. column 58: Stop the pirates from setting off the fireworks?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Can't say I blame you. Those pirates seem set on blowing us all up. I suppose I'll wait till someone else comes along.
msgctxt "FateEvent:265:0:56"
msgid "These pirates are thinking to set off their shoddy fireworks right on the beach! We can't let them put our guests in danger, and the only thing they'll listen to is force. "
msgstr "Пираты собрались запускать свои дрянные фейерверки прямо на пляже! Нельзя подвергать опасности наших гостей, а понимают они только силу."

#. ja: ねえ君、もし腕に自信があるなら、<br>海賊たちを止めてもらえないかな？<br>正直、僕には自信がないんだ……。
#. de: Wenn ein Besucher des Feuermond-Reigens zu Schaden kommt, war das vielleicht unser letztes Sommerfest ...
#. fr: C'est vraiment pas la mer à boire pour <if $gn4>une aventurière<else>un aventurier</if> digne de ce nom... Et autant vous le dire tout de suite, je ne me suis jamais vanté d'en être un<nbsp>!
#. column 56: These pirates are thinking to set off their shoddy fireworks right on the beach! We can't let them put our guests in danger, and the only thing they'll listen to is force.
#. column 58: Stop the pirates from setting off the fireworks?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Can't say I blame you. Those pirates seem set on blowing us all up. I suppose I'll wait till someone else comes along.
msgctxt "FateEvent:265:0:57"
msgid "You look like you can take on even the most black-hearted pirate. Please, get them off the beach before anyone comes to harm!"
msgstr "Ты похож на того, кому по плечу даже самый отъявленный пират. Пожалуйста, прогони их с пляжа, пока никто не пострадал!"

#. ja: 止めてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Bringst du die Piraten zur Vernunft?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider ce Lalafell<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: These pirates are thinking to set off their shoddy fireworks right on the beach! We can't let them put our guests in danger, and the only thing they'll listen to is force.
#. column 57: You look like you can take on even the most black-hearted pirate. Please, get them off the beach before anyone comes to harm!
#. column 62: Can't say I blame you. Those pirates seem set on blowing us all up. I suppose I'll wait till someone else comes along.
