msgstr "Помешать пиратам запустить фейерверки?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか……残念だよ。<br>無理を言ってごめん、ほかの人に頼むよ。
#. de: Nein? Dann kann ich nur hoffen, dass nichts Ernsthaftes passiert ...
#. fr: Désolé, j'étais persuadé d'avoir enfin trouvé plus courageux que moi...
#. column 56: These pirates are thinking to set off their shoddy fireworks right on the beach! We can't let them put our guests in danger, and the only thing they'll listen to is force.
#. column 57: You look like you can take on even the most black-hearted pirate. Please, get them off the beach before anyone comes to harm!
#. column 58: Stop the pirates from setting off the fireworks?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:265:0:62"
msgid "Can't say I blame you. Those pirates seem set on blowing us all up. I suppose I'll wait till someone else comes along."
msgstr "Не могу тебя винить. Эти пираты, похоже, готовы взорвать нас всех. Придётся подождать, пока кто-нибудь ещё не появится."

#. ja: この辺の砂浜にある、<br>「海賊の密造酒」を回収してきてほしいんだ。
#. de: Vergnügungssüchtige Piraten haben ihren Fusel mitgebracht und am Strand liegenlassen. Nicht auszudenken, was passiert, wenn die Flaschen in die Hände von Minderjährigen fallen!
#. fr: Vous avez vu<nbsp>? Les pirates laissent leurs bouteilles traîner partout sur la plage. C'est dangereux en plus d'être dégoûtant<nbsp>!
#. column 57: I don't care if you need to pry them from their drunken fingers, just bring me as many as you can carry!
msgctxt "FateEvent:266:0:56"
msgid "The pirates've thrown bottles of their grog all over the beaches. They'll be boozing until sunrise if we just let them be. "
msgstr "Пираты раскидали по пляжу бутылки с пойлом. Если ничего не делать, они будут бухать до самого рассвета."

#. ja: 海賊が持っているものを、力ずくで奪ってきても構わないよ。<br>どちらでもいい、君次第だ。
#. de: Kannst du bitte die Flaschen aufsammeln, die hier verstreut herumliegen?
#. fr: Rapportez-moi les bouteilles vides que vous trouverez. Peu m'importe si vous devez leur arracher des mains, mais n'hésitez pas à leur donner une bonne leçon<nbsp>!
#. column 56: The pirates've thrown bottles of their grog all over the beaches. They'll be boozing until sunrise if we just let them be.
msgctxt "FateEvent:266:0:57"
msgid "I don't care if you need to pry them from their drunken fingers, just bring me as many as you can carry!"
msgstr "Неважно, придётся ли вырывать бутылки из их пьяных рук. Просто принеси сколько сможешь!"

#. ja: まったく、海賊たちにはほとほと困ったもんだ。<br>あろうことか、勝手に大量の密造酒を持ち込んで、<br>酒盛りをしようとしているんだ。
#. de: Immer diese trinksüchtigen Piraten! Können die sich nicht an einem kühlen Eistee berauschen?
#. fr: Les pirates ne sont que des gros dégoûtants. Ils ont débarqué ici avec tout leur alcool et ils se soûlent à longueur de journée.
#. column 57: We can't have them disturbing our guests and dirtying the beach any longer. Get as many bottles of that nasty stuff as you can. I don't care if you need to take it straight out of their fumbling hands, either.
#. column 58: Help the chaperone bring peace and cleanliness to the beach?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, as long as you don't have a mind to join the pirates in their boozing. They won't be leaving any time soon, so speak to me again if you feel like lending a hand.
msgctxt "FateEvent:267:0:56"
msgid "The pirates here have been bad enough, but with some drink in them it's even worse! They've brought barrels of their black market grog: enough to keep them going for a while."
msgstr "Эти пираты и без того доставляют хлопоты, а уж под выпивкой совсем распоясались! Привезли бочки контрабандной браги — им хватит надолго."

#. ja: これ以上、会場を荒らされるわけにはいかないから、<br>砂浜にある「海賊の密造酒」を回収してきてほしい。<br>なんなら、海賊から力ずくで奪ってきても構わないよ。
#. de: Sie haben selbstgebrannten Fusel mitgebracht und nun liegen überall ihre leeren Flaschen herum. Kannst du sie bitte einsammeln?
#. fr: Ils mettent la pagaille sur la plage en plus de la salir<nbsp>! Ça vous dérangerait de ramasser les bouteilles vides que vous trouvez et de leur filer une bonne raclée au passage<nbsp>?
#. column 56: The pirates here have been bad enough, but with some drink in them it's even worse! They've brought barrels of their black market grog: enough to keep them going for a while.
#. column 58: Help the chaperone bring peace and cleanliness to the beach?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, as long as you don't have a mind to join the pirates in their boozing. They won't be leaving any time soon, so speak to me again if you feel like lending a hand.
msgctxt "FateEvent:267:0:57"
msgid "We can't have them disturbing our guests and dirtying the beach any longer. Get as many bottles of that nasty stuff as you can. I don't care if you need to take it straight out of their fumbling hands, either."
msgstr "Нельзя больше позволять им тревожить гостей и гадить на пляже. Собери побольше бутылок этой дряни. Можешь даже отобрать их у пиратов прямо из рук."

#. ja: 手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Säuberst du den Strand?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'organisateur des Feux de la Mort<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: The pirates here have been bad enough, but with some drink in them it's even worse! They've brought barrels of their black market grog: enough to keep them going for a while.
#. column 57: We can't have them disturbing our guests and dirtying the beach any longer. Get as many bottles of that nasty stuff as you can. I don't care if you need to take it straight out of their fumbling hands, either.
#. column 62: Well, as long as you don't have a mind to join the pirates in their boozing. They won't be leaving any time soon, so speak to me again if you feel like lending a hand.
