msgctxt "FateEvent:267:0:58"
msgid "Help the chaperone bring peace and cleanliness to the beach?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь смотрителю навести порядок на пляже?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 楽しんでるところ悪かった。<br>手伝う気になったら、また声をかけてくれ。
#. de: Tut mir leid, dass ich dir das aufhalsen musste. Aber ich befürchte, diese Piraten tauchen bald wieder auf ...
#. fr: Je comprends que vous ayez mieux à faire, mais il faudra bien que quelqu'un nettoie tout ça... Revenez me voir si vous changez d'avis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: The pirates here have been bad enough, but with some drink in them it's even worse! They've brought barrels of their black market grog: enough to keep them going for a while.
#. column 57: We can't have them disturbing our guests and dirtying the beach any longer. Get as many bottles of that nasty stuff as you can. I don't care if you need to take it straight out of their fumbling hands, either.
#. column 58: Help the chaperone bring peace and cleanliness to the beach?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:267:0:62"
msgid "Well, as long as you don't have a mind to join the pirates in their boozing. They won't be leaving any time soon, so speak to me again if you feel like lending a hand."
msgstr "Ладно, главное — не вздумай присоединиться к пиратской попойке. Они ещё нескоро уйдут. Передумаешь помочь — приходи ко мне."

#. ja: 「海賊の密造酒」を回収してきてくれたのか？
#. de: Hast du den Piratenfusel eingesammelt?
#. fr: Vous avez des bouteilles pour moi<nbsp>?
#. column 60: You have my thanks. Looks like the pirates still have plenty left, so bring them to me once you've collected them.
#. column 62: Hmmm...I don't think that's all of it. If you see any, make sure to bring them straight here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:268:0:56"
msgid "Were you able to collect any bottles of that nasty grog?"
msgstr "Удалось собрать бутылки с этой мерзкой брагой?"

#. ja: 助かる！<br>まだまだあるようだ、どんどん回収してきてくれ。
#. de: Danke! Es liegen aber noch mehr Flaschen am Strand rum ...
#. fr: Merveilleux<nbsp>! Vous pouvez continuer ceci dit, j'en vois encore plein<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Were you able to collect any bottles of that nasty grog?
#. column 62: Hmmm...I don't think that's all of it. If you see any, make sure to bring them straight here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:268:0:60"
msgid "You have my thanks. Looks like the pirates still have plenty left, so bring them to me once you've collected them."
msgstr "Спасибо! Похоже, у пиратов ещё много осталось. Соберёшь — приноси сюда."

#. ja: もう無くなったかな……？<br>悪いがまだあったら、回収してきてほしい。
#. de: Das waren alle? Na, lange wird es nicht dauern, bis diese Saufpiraten wieder auftauchen ...
#. fr: Vous avez tout ramassé<nbsp>? Merci<nbsp>! Enfin, comptez sur les pirates pour revenir mettre le bazar. Si vous en voyez d'autres, n'hésitez pas à faire le ménage, hein<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Were you able to collect any bottles of that nasty grog?
#. column 60: You have my thanks. Looks like the pirates still have plenty left, so bring them to me once you've collected them.
msgctxt "FateEvent:268:0:62"
msgid "Hmmm...I don't think that's all of it. If you see any, make sure to bring them straight here."
msgstr "Хм... Не думаю, что это всё. Увидишь ещё бутылки — сразу неси сюда."

#. ja: たくさん回収してくれたおかげで、ずいぶん減ったようだ。<br>だが、砂浜をキレイにするためにも、<br>さらに回収してきてほしい。
#. de: Danke, der Strand sieht schon viel besser aus. Aber es liegen immer noch Flaschen herum ...
#. fr: Vous m'avez apporté une aide précieuse. La plage est presque propre... “presque”<nbsp>! Il y a encore du travail...
msgctxt "FateEvent:269:0:56"
msgid "Hopefully this keeps the pirates from getting out of hand. The beach is a mite cleaner too, but there's still grog lying about. Bring me any more bottles you find."
msgstr "Надеюсь, теперь пираты не так разгуляются. И пляж стал немного чище, но брага ещё валяется. Найдёшь бутылки — приноси."

#. ja: さらに回収してきてくれたのかい？
#. de: Hast du noch mehr von den Flaschen gefunden?
#. fr: Vous en avez trouvé d'autres<nbsp>?
#. column 60: What a haul! Nothing left for the pirates to do now but sleep it off.
#. column 62: But they did bring barrels of the stuff. If you see any more, bring them here before the pirates think to start drinking again.
msgctxt "FateEvent:270:0:56"
msgid "I knew there'd be more─how much grog did the pirates bring?"
msgstr "Я так и знал, что ещё найдутся. Сколько же браги пираты привезли?"

#. ja: 本当にありがとう！<br>これで海賊たちも、しばらくは大人しくなるだろう。
#. de: Vielen Dank! Hoffen wir, dass sich die trinksüchtigen Piraten jetzt etwas zusammenreißen ...
#. fr: Merci beaucoup, j'espère que les pirates vont en prendre de la graine<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I knew there'd be more─how much grog did the pirates bring?
#. column 62: But they did bring barrels of the stuff. If you see any more, bring them here before the pirates think to start drinking again.
msgctxt "FateEvent:270:0:60"
msgid "What a haul! Nothing left for the pirates to do now but sleep it off."
msgstr "Вот это улов! Теперь пиратам остаётся только проспаться."

#. ja: 回収し尽くしてしまったか？<br>もし、まだあったら、回収してくれるとありがたい。
#. de: Das war's fürs Erste. Hilfst du mir, wenn wieder Flaschen auftauchen?
#. fr: Vous avez tout ramassé<nbsp>? Si vous en voyez d'autres, n'hésitez pas à vous y remettre<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I knew there'd be more─how much grog did the pirates bring?
#. column 60: What a haul! Nothing left for the pirates to do now but sleep it off.
msgctxt "FateEvent:270:0:62"
msgid "But they did bring barrels of the stuff. If you see any more, bring them here before the pirates think to start drinking again."
msgstr "Но они же привезли целые бочки. Увидишь ещё бутылки — неси сюда, пока пираты не надумали снова пить."

#. ja: この人たち、さっきからしつこいんです！<br>助けてくれませんか！？
#. de: Hilfe! Wir werden belästigt! Wir wollen doch nur in Frieden unsere ver<shy>füh<shy>re<shy>ri<shy>schen Körper räkeln!
#. fr: Pitié, aidez-moi à me débarrasser de ces personnes<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Help the distressed faire-goers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then what good are you!? Can't you see we're in trouble!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:271:0:56"
msgid "These pirates have been following us up and down the beach. Please, make them go away!"
msgstr "Эти пираты ходят за нами по всему пляжу. Пожалуйста, прогоните их!"

#. ja: 助けてあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du den Badenixen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider cette femme<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: These pirates have been following us up and down the beach. Please, make them go away!
#. column 62: Then what good are you!? Can't you see we're in trouble!?
