#. column 58: Assist with retrieving the mochi?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Is that so... I'll not hide my disappointment, but nor can I blame you. The sight of those slavering beasts is enough to send even hardened mochi-retrievers fleeing with their tails between their legs.
msgctxt "FateEvent:295:0:56"
msgid "All was proceeding well until the accursed Rabid Wives came and unleashed their deckhounds. Battle-trained as they are, the cyclops's mighty pounding does naught to deter them."
msgstr "Всё шло хорошо, пока проклятые «Бешеные жёны» не явились и не спустили своих палубных гончих. Эти боевые псы не боятся даже могучих ударов циклопа."

#. ja: どうにかして「降神祭の臼」まで近づいて、<br>つきたての「降神餅」を回収してくれねぇか！？<br>持ってきた餅は「タロ」に渡してくれ！
#. de: Du musst einen Weg finden, an den Mörser und die Mochi darin zu gelangen, ohne dem Hammer oder diesen Bestien zum Opfer zu fallen. Wenn du einige Mochi-Klumpen besorgen kannst, lass sie am besten in der Obhut von Taro.
#. fr: Tu nous rendrais un grand service en t'approchant du mortier pour ramasser des mochi... Plus tu en récupèreras, mieux ce sera, mais fais attention à ne pas te faire aplatir comme une crêpe<nbsp>! Il te suffira d'apporter les mochi ainsi obtenus à Taro.
#. column 56: All was proceeding well until the accursed Rabid Wives came and unleashed their deckhounds. Battle-trained as they are, the cyclops's mighty pounding does naught to deter them.
#. column 58: Assist with retrieving the mochi?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Is that so... I'll not hide my disappointment, but nor can I blame you. The sight of those slavering beasts is enough to send even hardened mochi-retrievers fleeing with their tails between their legs.
msgctxt "FateEvent:295:0:57"
msgid "You must find a way to reach the mortar and retrieve the mochi, taking care to avoid maw and mallet both. What you are able to procure, you may leave in Taro's safekeeping."
msgstr "Найди способ добраться до ступы и забрать моти, увернувшись и от клыков, и от молота. Всё, что достанешь, оставь на хранение Таро."

#. ja: 手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Beim Sicherstellen der Mochi helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider cet homme ?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: All was proceeding well until the accursed Rabid Wives came and unleashed their deckhounds. Battle-trained as they are, the cyclops's mighty pounding does naught to deter them.
#. column 57: You must find a way to reach the mortar and retrieve the mochi, taking care to avoid maw and mallet both. What you are able to procure, you may leave in Taro's safekeeping.
#. column 62: Is that so... I'll not hide my disappointment, but nor can I blame you. The sight of those slavering beasts is enough to send even hardened mochi-retrievers fleeing with their tails between their legs.
