msgctxt "FateEvent:295:0:58"
msgid "Assist with retrieving the mochi?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать моти?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そ、そうか……。<br>確かにあの「軍用犬」の大群を見たら、<br>尻込みするのも無理はねぇよな……。
#. de: Wirklich nicht ...? Ich muss sagen, ich bin ein wenig enttäuscht, aber ich kann es dir auch nicht verübeln. Der Anblick dieser Bestien lässt selbst gestählte Abenteurer den Schwanz einziehen.
#. fr: Pas de problème, je te comprends... Moi-même, quand je vois ces molosses assoifés de sang, j'ai bien envie de prendre mes jambes à mon cou<nbsp>!
#. column 56: All was proceeding well until the accursed Rabid Wives came and unleashed their deckhounds. Battle-trained as they are, the cyclops's mighty pounding does naught to deter them.
#. column 57: You must find a way to reach the mortar and retrieve the mochi, taking care to avoid maw and mallet both. What you are able to procure, you may leave in Taro's safekeeping.
#. column 58: Assist with retrieving the mochi?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:295:0:62"
msgid "Is that so... I'll not hide my disappointment, but nor can I blame you. The sight of those slavering beasts is enough to send even hardened mochi-retrievers fleeing with their tails between their legs."
msgstr "Вот как... Не стану скрывать разочарования, но и винить тебя не могу. От вида этих слюнявых зверюг даже бывалые собиратели моти пустятся наутёк, поджав хвост."

#. ja: わん、わん……。
#. de: Wuff, wuff ...
#. fr: Ouaf, ouaf...
#. column 60: Ruff! Arruff!
#. column 62: \<whimper>
msgctxt "FateEvent:296:0:56"
msgid "Arf, arf..."
msgstr "Гав, гав..."

#. ja: ワン！ワォーン！
#. de: Wau, wau!
#. fr: Ouaf<nbsp>! Ouaaaf<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Arf, arf...
#. column 62: \<whimper>
msgctxt "FateEvent:296:0:60"
msgid "Ruff! Arruff!"
msgstr "Р-р-ав! Гав!"

#. ja: キュゥゥゥゥン……。
#. de: \<winsel>
#. fr: Ouuuu... Ouuuu...
#. column 56: Arf, arf...
#. column 60: Ruff! Arruff!
msgctxt "FateEvent:296:0:62"
msgid "\\<whimper>"
msgstr "<i>У-у-у...</i>"

#. ja: 多くの「降神餅」が集まったぜ！<br>けど、振る舞う餅は、多ければ多いほど良いもんだ！<br>よかったら、もっと回収してきてくれよな！？
#. de: Dank dir konnten wir eine beachtliche Menge an Mochi-Klumpen retten, aber wir benötigen noch mehr, um den Erfolg der Feierlichkeiten zur Himmelswende zu sichern. Mach ruhig noch ein wenig weiter so!
#. fr: Parfait, ça en fait un bon paquet<nbsp>! Mais rien ne t'empêche d'aller en chercher plus, hein<nbsp>? Pour le bien de la fête de la transition<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:297:0:56"
msgid "We've managed to retrieve a fair amount of mochi, but more is needed if we are to ensure the celebration's success. Keep at it awhile longer, I beg you!"
msgstr "Мы уже собрали немало моти, но для успешного праздника нужно ещё больше. Поработай ещё немного, прошу тебя!"

#. ja: きゃん、きゃん♪
#. de: Wuff, wuff! ♪
#. fr: Haa haa... Ouaf<nbsp>!♪
#. column 60: Woof, woof!
#. column 62: Arf, arf!
msgctxt "FateEvent:298:0:56"
msgid "Arf, arf!♪"
msgstr "Гав-гав!♪"

#. ja: ゥワンッ! ゥワンッ!
#. de: Wau, wau!
#. fr: Ou... Ouaf ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Arf, arf!♪
#. column 62: Arf, arf!
msgctxt "FateEvent:298:0:60"
msgid "Woof, woof!"
msgstr "Гав-гав!"

#. ja: きゃん、きゃん！
#. de: Wuff, wuff!
#. fr: Ouaf<nbsp>! Ouaf<nbsp>! Ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Arf, arf!♪
#. column 60: Woof, woof!
msgctxt "FateEvent:298:0:62"
msgid "Arf, arf!"
msgstr "Гав, гав!"

#. ja: くーん、くーん……。
#. de: \<winsel>
#. fr: Ouuuu... Ouuuu...
msgctxt "FateEvent:299:0:56"
msgid "\\<sniff> \\<sniff>"
msgstr "<i>Шмыг...</i> <i>Шмыг...</i>"

#. ja: アンアンッ!
#. de: Wuff, wuff!
#. fr: Ouaf<nbsp>! Ouaf ouaf<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:300:0:56"
msgid "Arf, arf!"
msgstr "Гав-гав!"

#. ja: 私は、アインハルト家に仕える工兵です。<br>放属性ファイアシャードの収集に、<br>協力願えませんか？
#. de: Ich bin ein Techniker des Hauses Haillenarte. Wollt Ihr mir beim Sammeln von instabilen Feuerscherben behilflich sein?
#. fr: Je suis un ingénieur au service de la maison Haillenarte. Que diriez-vous de m'aider à récupérer des éclats de feu irradiants<nbsp>?
#. column 57: The High Count would be most appreciative of any and all assistance. Might you be interested? Such deeds would not go unnoticed by our house.
#. column 62: Ah, I see that you are occupied with your own tasks. Forgive me the intrusion. Though, if your mind should change, I shall be here waiting.
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Good evening<else>Twelve give you good morrow</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Good day to you<else>Good evening</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 4)>Good evening<else>Twelve give you good morrow</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 4 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 17)>Good day to you<else>Good evening</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 17 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:301:0:56"
msgid "<if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Good evening<else>Twelve give you good morrow</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Good day to you<else>Good evening</if></if>, adventurer. I am an engineer of the noble House Haillenarte, here at the behest of His Illustriousness to collect unstable shards that we might learn how to tap their energies."
msgstr "<if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Добрый вечер<else>Двенадцать благословений тебе</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Доброго дня<else>Добрый вечер</if></if>, искатель приключений. Я инженер из благородного дома Эйнхардт. По поручению Его Сиятельства собираю нестабильные осколки, чтобы узнать, как использовать их энергию."

#. ja: 手伝いますか？
#. de: Hilfst du ihm?
#. fr: Aider l'ingénieur des Haillenarte<nbsp>?
#. column 56: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Good evening<else>Twelve give you good morrow</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Good day to you<else>Good evening</if></if>, adventurer. I am an engineer of the noble House Haillenarte, here at the behest of His Illustriousness to collect unstable shards that we might learn how to tap their energies.
#. column 62: Ah, I see that you are occupied with your own tasks. Forgive me the intrusion. Though, if your mind should change, I shall be here waiting.
msgctxt "FateEvent:301:0:57"
msgid "The High Count would be most appreciative of any and all assistance. Might you be interested? Such deeds would not go unnoticed by our house."
msgstr "Высокий граф будет весьма признателен за любую помощь. Вас это заинтересовало? Наш дом не забудет оказанную услугу."

#. ja: ……そうですか。<br>ご自身の探索計画もあるでしょうから、仕方ありません。<br>気が変わりましたら、お声がけ願います。
#. de: Das ist bedauerlich, doch ich verstehe, dass Ihr zur Zeit andere Prioritäten habt. Solltet Ihr Eure Meinung ändern, könnt Ihr mich jederzeit ansprechen.
#. fr: C'est bien dommage, mais je suppose que vous avez d'autres priorités. N'hésitez pas à revenir me voir si vous changez d'avis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Good evening<else>Twelve give you good morrow</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Good day to you<else>Good evening</if></if>, adventurer. I am an engineer of the noble House Haillenarte, here at the behest of His Illustriousness to collect unstable shards that we might learn how to tap their energies.
#. column 57: The High Count would be most appreciative of any and all assistance. Might you be interested? Such deeds would not go unnoticed by our house.
msgctxt "FateEvent:301:0:62"
msgid "Ah, I see that you are occupied with your own tasks. Forgive me the intrusion. Though, if your mind should change, I shall be here waiting."
msgstr "А, вижу, вы заняты своими делами. Прошу простить за беспокойство. Если передумаете, я буду здесь."

#. ja: 地表に凝固した放属性ファイアシャードを採取するか、<br>ファイアスプライトを倒すことで、集めてください。
#. de: Die Scherben könnt ihr direkt einsammeln oder durch das Erlegen von Feuer-Exergonen erhalten.
#. fr: Pour obtenir des éclats, vous pouvez les ramasser directement ou vaincre les élémentaires de feu qui rôdent aux alentours.
msgctxt "FateEvent:302:0:56"
msgid "This particular area exhibits a high concentration of fire shards, whether they be sprouting from the very ground we walk upon, or animated in the form of sprites."
msgstr "В этом месте особенно много огненных осколков: они растут прямо из земли или оживают, превращаясь в спрайтов."

#. ja: 放属性ファイアシャードを集められましたか？<br>よろしければ、回収させていただきます。
#. de: Wie ich sehe, konntet Ihr einige instabile Feuerscherben einsammeln. Bitte lasst sie mich Euch abnehmen.
#. fr: Je vois que vous avez réussi à récupérer des éclats de feu irradiants. Laissez-moi donc vous en débarrasser<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Ah, this will do nicely! On behalf of House Haillenarte, you have our thanks.
#. column 62: The High Count's generosity knows no bounds when it comes to rewarding service in his name. Have you more shards, further riches await.
msgctxt "FateEvent:303:0:56"
msgid "How have you fared in your search? Allow me to relieve you of your burden."
msgstr "Как успехи в поисках? Позвольте забрать у вас найденное."

#. ja: ご協力に感謝します！<br>アインハルト家を代表してお礼申し上げます！
#. de: Im Namen des Hauses Haillenarte möchte ich Euch meinen tiefsten Dank aussprechen.
#. fr: Excellent<nbsp>! La maison Haillenarte vous remercie pour votre con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
#. column 56: How have you fared in your search? Allow me to relieve you of your burden.
#. column 62: The High Count's generosity knows no bounds when it comes to rewarding service in his name. Have you more shards, further riches await.
msgctxt "FateEvent:303:0:60"
msgid "Ah, this will do nicely! On behalf of House Haillenarte, you have our thanks."
msgstr "Вот, отлично! От имени дома Хайленарт благодарю вас."

#. ja: この資源は、いくらあっても困りません。<br>また収集されましたら、お届けくださいね！
#. de: Wenn Ihr mir noch mehr Scherben bringen wollt, sage ich nicht nein. Je mehr, desto besser!
#. fr: Revenez me voir quand vous aurez accumulé davantage d'éclats. Plus il y en a, mieux c'est<nbsp>!
#. column 56: How have you fared in your search? Allow me to relieve you of your burden.
#. column 60: Ah, this will do nicely! On behalf of House Haillenarte, you have our thanks.
msgctxt "FateEvent:303:0:62"
msgid "The High Count's generosity knows no bounds when it comes to rewarding service in his name. Have you more shards, further riches await."
msgstr "Граф щедро награждает тех, кто служит ему. Нашли ещё осколки? За новые находки получите ещё больше."

#. ja: 放属性ファイアシャードは、<br>その名のとおり、属性の力を放つ作用があります。<br>ディアデム諸島の貴重な資源と言えるでしょう。
#. de: Wie aus dem Namen hervorgeht, versprühen diese Scherben feuerelementare Energie. Sie zählen zu den wertvollsten Ressourcen des Diadems.
#. fr: Comme leur nom l'indique, ces éclats diffusent l'énergie de l'élément dont ils sont issus dans l'environnement. Les explorateurs du Diadème se les arrachent<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:304:0:56"
msgid "Unlike the elemental crystals found in the lands below, the unstable shards of the Diadem perpetually radiate aetherial energy. This energy is believed to be what contributes to the size...and ferocity of the creatures on these remote isles."
msgstr "В отличие от элементальных кристаллов в землях внизу, нестабильные осколки Диадема постоянно излучают эфирную энергию. Считается, что именно она делает здешних тварей такими крупными... и свирепыми."

#. ja: 放属性ファイアシャードをお持ちでしたら、<br>回収させていただきます。
#. de: Ihr bringt mir noch mehr instabile Feuerscherben? Lasst sehen!
#. fr: Vous avez obtenu d'autres éclats de feu irradiants<nbsp>? Faites-moi voir ça<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Why, you have outdone yourself, good adventurer! House Haillenarte is in your debt!
#. column 62: Still, the High Count's generosity knows no bounds when it comes to rewarding service in his name. Have you more shards, further riches await.
msgctxt "FateEvent:305:0:56"
msgid "Every shard will bring House Haillenarte closer to solving the mystery surrounding these remarkable items. Your contribution is much appreciated."
msgstr "Каждый осколок приближает дом Хайленарт к разгадке тайны этих удивительных предметов. Мы очень ценим ваш вклад."

#. ja: さらなるご協力に感謝します！
#. de: Vielen Dank für Euren unermüdlichen Einsatz!
#. fr: Merci pour votre dévouement, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>!
#. column 56: Every shard will bring House Haillenarte closer to solving the mystery surrounding these remarkable items. Your contribution is much appreciated.
#. column 62: Still, the High Count's generosity knows no bounds when it comes to rewarding service in his name. Have you more shards, further riches await.
msgctxt "FateEvent:305:0:60"
msgid "Why, you have outdone yourself, good adventurer! House Haillenarte is in your debt!"
msgstr "Вот это вы постарались, добрый искатель приключений! Дом Хайленарт у вас в долгу!"

#. ja: この資源は、いくらあっても困りません。<br>また収集されましたら、お届けくださいね！
#. de: Wenn Ihr mir noch mehr Scherben bringen wollt, sage ich nicht nein. Je mehr, desto besser!
#. fr: Revenez me voir quand vous aurez accumulé davantage d'éclats. Plus il y en a, mieux c'est<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Every shard will bring House Haillenarte closer to solving the mystery surrounding these remarkable items. Your contribution is much appreciated.
#. column 60: Why, you have outdone yourself, good adventurer! House Haillenarte is in your debt!
msgctxt "FateEvent:305:0:62"
msgid "Still, the High Count's generosity knows no bounds when it comes to rewarding service in his name. Have you more shards, further riches await."
msgstr "Граф щедро награждает тех, кто служит ему. Нашли ещё осколки? За новые находки получите ещё больше."

#. ja: 私は、アインハルト家に仕える工兵です。<br>放属性ライトニングシャードの収集に、<br>協力願えませんか？
#. de: Ich bin ein Techniker des Hauses Haillenarte. Wollt Ihr mir beim Sammeln von instabilen Blitzscherben behilflich sein?
#. fr: Je suis un ingénieur au service de la maison Haillenarte. Que diriez-vous de m'aider à récupérer des éclats de foudre irradiants<nbsp>?
#. column 57: The High Count would be most appreciative of any and all assistance. Might you be interested? Such deeds would not go unnoticed by our house.
#. column 62: Ah, I see that you are occupied with your own tasks. Forgive me the intrusion. Though, if your mind should change, I shall be here waiting.
