msgctxt "FateEvent:343:0:58"
msgid "Aid the Vira beadmaid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь вире, мастерице бус?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: シュー……なんという慈悲深さ！<br>「奪われた装飾具」は、カリヤナ派の拠点に、<br>保管されているはず……見張りに注意してくれよ。
#. de: Mein Dank kennt keine Grenzen. Mögen die Götter dich zu den Orten leiten, an denen mein Ssschmuck verborgen liegt.
#. fr: Quelle générosité<nbsp>! Les Qalyanas ont sûrement emporté les colliers dans leur base, donc soyez <if $gn4>prudente<else>prudent</if>... Ssss...
#. column 56: Cravens, they are. Each and every lassst one of them! I toil day and night carving humble necklaces for my sisters, only to have them stolen by loathsssome Qalyana as I sleep!
#. column 57: Would that I could retrieve them myssself, yet I am but a carver of beads. You, however, have the look of a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of great merit. Might you win back the items in my stead?
#. column 58: Aid the Vira beadmaid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: This is a matter for the Vira. I cannot fault you for being unwilling or unable to lend your blade. Please, forgive my presumptuousssnesss.
msgctxt "FateEvent:343:0:60"
msgid "Unworthy am I of your boundlesss charity. May the Lady of the Blisss guide you true through the Qalyana settlement to where the wicked ones keep my things."
msgstr "Недостоин я такой безмерной щедрости. Пусть Госпожа Блаженства укажет тебе путь к поселению кальяна и к месту, где злодеи спрятали мои вещи."

#. ja: シュー……確かにこれは、アナンタ族の問題だ。<br>ヒトの子の友には関係のないことだったな。<br>強欲な申し出、忘れてくれ。
#. de: Ich akzeptiere deine Entscheidung. Diesss ist eine Angelegenheit der Vira. Wir werden sie alleine regeln.
#. fr: Vous vous dites sûrement que ce problème ne concerne que les Anantas, et vous avez raison. Je vais essayer de récupérer ces colliers moi-même... Ssss...
#. column 56: Cravens, they are. Each and every lassst one of them! I toil day and night carving humble necklaces for my sisters, only to have them stolen by loathsssome Qalyana as I sleep!
#. column 57: Would that I could retrieve them myssself, yet I am but a carver of beads. You, however, have the look of a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of great merit. Might you win back the items in my stead?
#. column 58: Aid the Vira beadmaid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Unworthy am I of your boundlesss charity. May the Lady of the Blisss guide you true through the Qalyana settlement to where the wicked ones keep my things.
msgctxt "FateEvent:343:0:62"
msgid "This is a matter for the Vira. I cannot fault you for being unwilling or unable to lend your blade. Please, forgive my presumptuousssnesss."
msgstr "Это дело вира. Не могу винить тебя, если ты не хочешь или не можешь обнажить клинок. Прости за мою дерзость."

#. ja: シュー……その輝き！<br>まさしく私が姉妹のために作った品に違いない！
#. de: Ja! Diesssen Schmuck habe ich gefertigt!
#. fr: Oui, ce sont bien les colliers que j'ai fabriqués pour mes sœurs<nbsp>! Ssss...
#. column 60: Rejoice, my sisters, for this one who treads the land with feet not tail has ressstored unto me that which our foul cousins have stolen! Rejoice!
#. column 62: Those beads were not carved for you and your ilk. They will bring you no fortune. They will bring you no strength.
msgctxt "FateEvent:344:0:56"
msgid "Yessssss! Those very beads you carry were carved by mine own hand!"
msgstr "Да-а-а! Это именно те бусы, что я вырезал собственными руками!"

#. ja: シュー……これで我が姉妹を、<br>美しく飾ってやることができるというもの……。<br>慈悲深きヒトの子の友に、感謝の念を捧げよう。
#. de: Frohlocket, meine Schwessstern! <if $gn4>Diese freundliche Abenteurerin<else>Dieser freundliche Abenteurer</if> hat uns einen Teil der gessstohlenen Beute wiedergebracht!
#. fr: Grâce à votre aide, je pourrai leur en faire cadeau comme je le voulais. Merci d'avoir donné une leçon aux Qalyanas au passage<nbsp>! Ssss...
#. column 56: Yessssss! Those very beads you carry were carved by mine own hand!
#. column 62: Those beads were not carved for you and your ilk. They will bring you no fortune. They will bring you no strength.
msgctxt "FateEvent:344:0:60"
msgid "Rejoice, my sisters, for this one who treads the land with feet not tail has ressstored unto me that which our foul cousins have stolen! Rejoice!"
msgstr "Ликуйте, сёстры! Этот путник, ступающий по земле ногами, а не хвостом, вернул мне то, что украли наши гнусные сородичи! Ликуйте!"

#. ja: シュー……疑いたくはないが、<br>その品を持ち逃げする気ではあるまいな？
#. de: Dieser Schmuck wurde nicht für deinesssgleichen gefertigt. Er wird dich nicht reich machen. Und auch nicht ssstärker.
#. fr: Ne me dites pas que vous avez l'intention de vous enfuir avec mes colliers<nbsp>? Ssss...
#. column 56: Yessssss! Those very beads you carry were carved by mine own hand!
#. column 60: Rejoice, my sisters, for this one who treads the land with feet not tail has ressstored unto me that which our foul cousins have stolen! Rejoice!
msgctxt "FateEvent:344:0:62"
msgid "Those beads were not carved for you and your ilk. They will bring you no fortune. They will bring you no strength."
msgstr "Эти бусы вырезаны не для тебя и тебе подобных. Ни богатства, ни силы они тебе не принесут."

#. ja: て、偵察任務中にグリズリーに出くわしたんだが、<br>目を離したが最後……襲われそうなんだ……。<br>た、助けてくれないか……？
#. de: I-Ich glaube, dieser Grizzly will was von mir. I-Ich aber nicht von ihm. Kannst du mal mit ihm reden? Schwertisch versteht er vielleicht.
#. fr: Je suis tombé sur un grizzli énorme, mais j'ai réussi à le semer... pour l'instant. S'il me retrouve, je vais me faire manger tout cru<nbsp>! Aidez-moi, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Help the flame scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Twelve and whoever's listening! Now, I'm going to be waiting right over here behind these bushes...
#. column 62: You'd l-l-l-l-l-leave me here to be eaten!? You wouldn't! You can't! Mother!!!
msgctxt "FateEvent:345:0:56"
msgid "Sh-Sh-She came out of n-n-nowhere... Tore privates F-F-Fafapi and Mimipu's limbs right off before s-s-swallowing them whole... Y-Y-You've got to help me... I think it's still out there!"
msgstr "О-о-она возникла из ни-никуда... Разорвала на части рядовых Фафафи и Мимипу, а потом проглотила целиком... П-помоги мне... Кажется, она всё ещё где-то рядом!"

#. ja: 不滅隊の斥候を助ける？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Kundschafter der Legion beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le soldat des Immortels<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Sh-Sh-She came out of n-n-nowhere... Tore privates F-F-Fafapi and Mimipu's limbs right off before s-s-swallowing them whole... Y-Y-You've got to help me... I think it's still out there!
#. column 60: Praise the Twelve and whoever's listening! Now, I'm going to be waiting right over here behind these bushes...
#. column 62: You'd l-l-l-l-l-leave me here to be eaten!? You wouldn't! You can't! Mother!!!
