msgctxt "FateEvent:345:0:57"
msgid "Help the flame scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь разведчику из Бессмертного Воинства?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: あ、ありがとう……。<br>見るからに手強そうなグリズリーだ……。<br>き、気を付けてくれよな！
#. de: V-Vielen Dank. Du scheust nicht vor <i>großen</i> Aufgaben, was? H-Hals und Beinbruch!
#. fr: M-merci... Il n'avait vraiment pas l'air commode, donc soyez <if $gn4>prudente<else>prudent</if><nbsp>!
#. column 56: Sh-Sh-She came out of n-n-nowhere... Tore privates F-F-Fafapi and Mimipu's limbs right off before s-s-swallowing them whole... Y-Y-You've got to help me... I think it's still out there!
#. column 57: Help the flame scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You'd l-l-l-l-l-leave me here to be eaten!? You wouldn't! You can't! Mother!!!
msgctxt "FateEvent:345:0:60"
msgid "Praise the Twelve and whoever's listening! Now, I'm going to be waiting right over here behind these bushes..."
msgstr "Хвала Двенадцати и всем, кто там нас слышит! А я пока подожду вон там, за кустами..."

#. ja: えっ……そんな……俺はどうしたら……？
#. de: W-Willst du mich diesem Monster zum Frass vorwerfen?
#. fr: Oh non, qu'est-ce que je vais faire...
#. column 56: Sh-Sh-She came out of n-n-nowhere... Tore privates F-F-Fafapi and Mimipu's limbs right off before s-s-swallowing them whole... Y-Y-You've got to help me... I think it's still out there!
#. column 57: Help the flame scout?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Twelve and whoever's listening! Now, I'm going to be waiting right over here behind these bushes...
msgctxt "FateEvent:345:0:62"
msgid "You'd l-l-l-l-l-leave me here to be eaten!? You wouldn't! You can't! Mother!!!"
msgstr "Т-ты бросишь меня здесь на съедение!? Не бросишь же! Не можешь! Мама-а-а!!!"

#. ja: 君はアラミゴ解放軍の協力者か？<br>ならば、周辺地域の安全確保のために、<br>巡回に同行してほしいのだが……。
#. de: Du stehst auf Seiten der Be<shy>freiungs<shy>armee? Warum hilfst du dann nicht mit, hier nach dem Rechten zu sehen?
#. fr: Vous êtes <if $gn4>une sympathisante<else>un sympathisant</if> de la résistance mhigoise<nbsp>? Dans ce cas, que diriez-vous de m'accompagner pour ma patrouille de routine<nbsp>?
#. column 57: So, are you with us, or against us?
#. column 58: Are you with them, or against them?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then might I suggest you get your pampered arse out of my homeland afore I gut you with an imperial blade and make you a martyr.
msgctxt "FateEvent:346:0:56"
msgid "You here to aid the Resistance? I know it's not as glamorous as trading blows with an imperial centurion, but the hills need patrolling and I'm short a sentry."
msgstr "Поможешь Сопротивлению? Знаю, патрулировать холмы не так занятно, как скрестить клинки с имперским центурионом, но дозорных не хватает."

#. ja: 実は、同行するはずの仲間が遅れていてね。<br>予定どおりに任務を終えるためにも、そろそろ出発したいのだ。<br>どうだ、やってくれるか？
#. de: Ich wurde anscheinend versetzt, jedenfalls lässt sich die Verstärkung partout nicht blicken. Aber langsam muss ich los. Was sagst du?
#. fr: Je devais être accompagné par un de mes camarades, mais je n'ai pas de nouvelles de lui. Je ne peux pas l'attendre indéfiniment, donc ça m'arrangerait que vous veniez avec moi.
#. column 56: You here to aid the Resistance? I know it's not as glamorous as trading blows with an imperial centurion, but the hills need patrolling and I'm short a sentry.
#. column 58: Are you with them, or against them?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then might I suggest you get your pampered arse out of my homeland afore I gut you with an imperial blade and make you a martyr.
msgctxt "FateEvent:346:0:57"
msgid "So, are you with us, or against us?"
msgstr "Так ты с нами или против нас?"

#. ja: 巡回に同行する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Auf Patrouille gehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le résistant mhigois<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You here to aid the Resistance? I know it's not as glamorous as trading blows with an imperial centurion, but the hills need patrolling and I'm short a sentry.
#. column 57: So, are you with us, or against us?
#. column 62: Then might I suggest you get your pampered arse out of my homeland afore I gut you with an imperial blade and make you a martyr.
