msgctxt "FateEvent:346:0:58"
msgid "Are you with them, or against them?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Вы с ними или против них?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか……残念だが、仕方ない。<br>もう少しだけ、仲間の到着をここで待ってみよう……。
#. de: Schade ... Dann werde ich wohl oder übel noch auf die Verstärkung warten müssen.
#. fr: C'est vous qui voyez. Pour ma part, je vais patienter encore un peu...
#. column 56: You here to aid the Resistance? I know it's not as glamorous as trading blows with an imperial centurion, but the hills need patrolling and I'm short a sentry.
#. column 57: So, are you with us, or against us?
#. column 58: Are you with them, or against them?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:346:0:62"
msgid "Then might I suggest you get your pampered arse out of my homeland afore I gut you with an imperial blade and make you a martyr."
msgstr "Тогда советую убраться с моей родины, пока я не выпустил тебе кишки имперским клинком и не сделал из тебя мученика."

#. ja: あ、あんた、腕が立ちそうだな！<br>キキルン族の山賊が、作物を狙ってやって来るんだ。<br>追い払うのに、協力してくれないか？
#. de: Verfluchte Ratten! Glauben, sie können mir ungestraft die Felder verwüsten! Aber nicht mit mir! Ich werde einen Abenteurer anheuern, der dem Treiben ein Ende setzt!
#. fr: Oh<nbsp>! S'il te plaît<nbsp>! Tu m'as l'air de savoir te battre, toi. Tu veux bien m'aider à me débarrasser de ces saletés de Qiqirns qui sont venus pour s'en prendre à mes récoltes<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Might you fit the bill?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I thought as much. You've more the look of one of those <if $gn4>courtesans<else>consortiers</if> what follow the Resistance camps. I suppose I'll have to keep waiting, then.
msgctxt "FateEvent:348:0:56"
msgid "Damnable rats think they can raid my fields... Well, I'll have no more of it! This harvest I'm hiring myself an adventurer to show those thieves what for! Now, if I could only find an adventurer..."
msgstr "Чтоб их, этих крыс! Думают, могут безнаказанно разорять мои поля... Хватит с меня! В этот сезон найму искателя приключений, чтоб проучил воришек! Вот только где бы его найти..."

#. ja: 協力する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Bauern helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le fermier<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Damnable rats think they can raid my fields... Well, I'll have no more of it! This harvest I'm hiring myself an adventurer to show those thieves what for! Now, if I could only find an adventurer...
#. column 62: I thought as much. You've more the look of one of those <if $gn4>courtesans<else>consortiers</if> what follow the Resistance camps. I suppose I'll have to keep waiting, then.
