msgctxt "FateEvent:349:0:57"
msgid "Agree to slay the bloodgliders?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Согласиться истребить кровокрылов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうですか……。<br>確かに、あなたには関係のない問題でしたね。<br>どうにか子どもだけでも、守る方法を探さないと……。
#. de: \<hust> \<hust> \<pfeif> Oh ... \<keuch> ... weh ...
#. fr: Vraiment<nbsp>? C'est vrai que ça ne vous concerne aucunement. Que vais-je faire<nbsp>? J'aimerais au moins éviter à mon enfant de respirer ce poison...
#. column 56: \<cough> \<cough> Bloodgliders \<cough> and their \<hack> bloody \<cough> scales... Must drive \<wheeze> the curs from \<hack> the cliffs afore \<cough> we \<gurgle> all cough up our \<chortle> lungs...
#. column 57: Agree to slay the bloodgliders?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:349:0:62"
msgid "\\<cough> \\<cough> \\<hack> Oh...\\<rasp> dear..."
msgstr "<i>Кхе-кхе!</i> <i>Кх!</i> Ох... <i>Хр-р...</i>"

#. ja: 帆別銭の収入がいまひとつなもんで、<br>「綺麗な珊瑚」でも集めて、商売しようと思うんだよね～。<br>なあ、アンタも手伝っておくれよ～。
#. de: Die Einnahmen aus dem Rubinzoll reichen nicht mehr zum Leben, deshalb will ich mit Korallen handeln. Kannst du mir bei der Suche helfen? Ich beteilige dich auch am Gewinn!
#. fr: La piraterie, ça gagne pas tant que ça en ce moment... Il paraît qu'on peut se faire pas mal d'argent en vendant des coraux à Kugane, tu veux pas m'aider à en récupérer<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Comb the beach for coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: O' course ye will! Ne'er met me a 'venturer what weren't lookin' to line <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> purse with a coin or two, and line it I will, iffin ye scrounge me some right comely coral.
#. column 62: Then ye'd best remove yerself from me beach afore I decide I's had enough o' yer bloody front.
msgctxt "FateEvent:350:0:56"
msgid "You there, pissin' 'bout my beach. Ye look as if ye've time enough to spare. Lend me a hand, like? I'd make it worth yer while. All's ye need to do is keep an eye out fer coral─the redder the better."
msgstr "Эй, ты чего тут на моём пляже слоняешься? Вроде времени у тебя полно. Поможешь мне? Не бесплатно, конечно. Ищи кораллы, чем краснее, тем лучше."

#. ja: 珊瑚集めを手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du Korallen suchen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la pirate<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You there, pissin' 'bout my beach. Ye look as if ye've time enough to spare. Lend me a hand, like? I'd make it worth yer while. All's ye need to do is keep an eye out fer coral─the redder the better.
#. column 60: O' course ye will! Ne'er met me a 'venturer what weren't lookin' to line <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> purse with a coin or two, and line it I will, iffin ye scrounge me some right comely coral.
#. column 62: Then ye'd best remove yerself from me beach afore I decide I's had enough o' yer bloody front.
