msgctxt "FateEvent:350:0:57"
msgid "Comb the beach for coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поискать на пляже кораллы?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: やってくれるのかい、嬉しいね～。<br>「綺麗な珊瑚」は、そこらで拾い集めるか、<br>サンゴセオイを倒せば、手に入るはずだよ～。
#. de: Danke! Du kannst die Korallen entweder aus dem Wasser aufsammeln oder von den Korallenschalen erbeuten.
#. fr: Hé, t'es <if $gn4>une chic fille<else>un chic type</if><nbsp>! On peut trouver des morceaux de corail intacts sur les récifs des environs ou en chassant des coquoraux.
#. column 56: You there, pissin' 'bout my beach. Ye look as if ye've time enough to spare. Lend me a hand, like? I'd make it worth yer while. All's ye need to do is keep an eye out fer coral─the redder the better.
#. column 57: Comb the beach for coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then ye'd best remove yerself from me beach afore I decide I's had enough o' yer bloody front.
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:350:0:60"
msgid "O' course ye will! Ne'er met me a 'venturer what weren't lookin' to line <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> purse with a coin or two, and line it I will, iffin ye scrounge me some right comely coral."
msgstr "Ну конечно поможешь! Ещё не встречал я искателя приключений, которому лишняя монетка в кошельке не помешает. Добывай мне кораллы покрасивее — и кошелёк <if $gn4>у тебя<else>у тебя</if> потяжелеет."

#. ja: それならそれで、構わないんだけどね～。<br>引き留めて悪かったよ～。
#. de: Na, wenn du mir nicht helfen willst, dann steh mir wenigstens nicht im Weg rum!
#. fr: Tant pis, j'ai l'habitude de me débrouiller.
#. column 56: You there, pissin' 'bout my beach. Ye look as if ye've time enough to spare. Lend me a hand, like? I'd make it worth yer while. All's ye need to do is keep an eye out fer coral─the redder the better.
#. column 57: Comb the beach for coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: O' course ye will! Ne'er met me a 'venturer what weren't lookin' to line <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> purse with a coin or two, and line it I will, iffin ye scrounge me some right comely coral.
msgctxt "FateEvent:350:0:62"
msgid "Then ye'd best remove yerself from me beach afore I decide I's had enough o' yer bloody front."
msgstr "Тогда убирайся с моего пляжа, пока я не решил, что с меня хватит твоей наглости."

#. ja: おや、「綺麗な珊瑚」が集まったのかい？<br>だったら、アタシに手渡しておくれ～。
#. de: Hast du ein paar schöne Korallen gefunden? Dann gib sie mir bitte!
#. fr: Oh, tu as trouvé des morceaux de corail intacts<nbsp>? Fais-moi voir ça, vite<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Quite a find, this is. Ye've an eye fer things most beauteous. This piece here'll fetch a pretty zeni o'er in Kugane.
#. column 62: Hand 'em o'er one at a time or all at once. Makes no bloody difference to me.
msgctxt "FateEvent:351:0:56"
msgid "That there be coral in yer purse? I can smell it, I can."
msgstr "Кораллы при тебе? Я чую их, чую."

#. ja: いやぁ、綺麗なもんだね～。<br>これなら、飾り物として売れそうだ。<br>もう少し欲しいから、また見つけたら渡しておくれ～。
#. de: Die sind aber hübsch! Die lassen sich bestimmt gut an Juweliere und Schmuckhändler verkaufen. Falls du noch mehr von der Sorte findest, nehm ich sie dir gerne ab.
#. fr: Ouah, ils sont super beaux<nbsp>! Avec ça, je vais pouvoir me remplir les poches à coup sûr. Si tu en trouves d'autres, apporte-les-moi, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. column 56: That there be coral in yer purse? I can smell it, I can.
#. column 62: Hand 'em o'er one at a time or all at once. Makes no bloody difference to me.
msgctxt "FateEvent:351:0:60"
msgid "Quite a find, this is. Ye've an eye fer things most beauteous. This piece here'll fetch a pretty zeni o'er in Kugane."
msgstr "Вот это находка! У тебя глаз на красоту. За такой кусок в Куганэ дадут хорошую цену."

#. ja: もう少し集めてから、渡してくれるのかい？<br>なら、頑張っておくれ～。
#. de: Kannst du noch mehr Korallen sammeln? Ich warte hier auf dich.
#. fr: Si tu veux m'apporter d'autres morceaux de corail intacts, n'hésite pas<nbsp>!
#. column 56: That there be coral in yer purse? I can smell it, I can.
#. column 60: Quite a find, this is. Ye've an eye fer things most beauteous. This piece here'll fetch a pretty zeni o'er in Kugane.
msgctxt "FateEvent:351:0:62"
msgid "Hand 'em o'er one at a time or all at once. Makes no bloody difference to me."
msgstr "Отдавай по одному или сразу все. Мне без разницы."

#. ja: 「綺麗な珊瑚」は、そこらで拾い集めるか、<br>サンゴセオイを倒せば、手に入るはずだよ～。
#. de: Schöne Korallen kannst du entweder aus dem Wasser aufsammeln oder von den Korallenschalen erbeuten.
#. fr: On peut trouver des morceaux de corail intacts sur les récifs des environs ou en chassant des coquoraux.
msgctxt "FateEvent:352:0:56"
msgid "Feelin' 'venturous, good 'venturer? Well then might be I'll let ye in on a trade secret. See them crawly coralshells off yonder? The coral on their backs is just as fine, if not finer than the stuff ye'll find lyin' bout the sand. Only ye'll have to toil a trifle to tear it from the beasties' backs!"
msgstr "Ну что, охота приключений, искатель? Тогда открою тебе торговую тайну. Видишь вон тех ползающих коралловых панцирников? Кораллы у них на спине ничуть не хуже, а то и лучше тех, что валяются на песке. Правда, придётся немного потрудиться, чтобы содрать их со зверюг!"

#. ja: おや、「綺麗な珊瑚」が集まったのかい？<br>だったら、アタシに手渡しておくれ～。
#. de: Hast du ein paar schöne Korallen gefunden? Dann lass mal sehen!
#. fr: Oh, tu as trouvé des morceaux de corail intacts<nbsp>? Fais-moi voir ça, vite<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Heh heh heh! This'll tar the ship, and leave me enough for some sake and a swive in the Rakuza. Thank ye kindly!
#. column 62: Might ye be thinkin' that ye can sell that coral in Kugane yerself? You can sure as hells try, but chances are ye'd find yerself in the clink. The bakufu don't take kindly to ijin sullyin' their seas.
msgctxt "FateEvent:353:0:56"
msgid "Ye bring this poor lass another piece?"
msgstr "Ещё кусочек для этой бедной девицы?"

#. ja: これだけあれば、もう十分そうだ。<br>手伝ってくれて、アタシ嬉しいよ～。
#. de: Wunderbar! Das reicht für heute. Vielen Dank für deine Hilfe!
#. fr: Ouah, je ne pensais pas que tu en trouverais autant<nbsp>! J'ai de quoi me reconvertir en négociante en corail, ha ha<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ye bring this poor lass another piece?
#. column 62: Might ye be thinkin' that ye can sell that coral in Kugane yerself? You can sure as hells try, but chances are ye'd find yerself in the clink. The bakufu don't take kindly to ijin sullyin' their seas.
msgctxt "FateEvent:353:0:60"
msgid "Heh heh heh! This'll tar the ship, and leave me enough for some sake and a swive in the Rakuza. Thank ye kindly!"
msgstr "Хе-хе-хе! Вот теперь корабль будет как новенький, да и на сакэ с развлечениями в Ракудза хватит. Премного благодарна!"

#. ja: おや、渡すのはやめにするのかい？<br>アタシもう少ししたら帰るつもりだから、<br>渡していくなら、早くしておくれな～。
#. de: Du willst sie mir nicht geben? Worauf wartest du? Ich bin nicht den ganzen Tag hier.
#. fr: Hein, tu as changé d'avis<nbsp>? Mais qu'est-ce que tu vas faire de tout ce corail<nbsp>? Allez, donne-moi tout ça...
#. column 56: Ye bring this poor lass another piece?
#. column 60: Heh heh heh! This'll tar the ship, and leave me enough for some sake and a swive in the Rakuza. Thank ye kindly!
msgctxt "FateEvent:353:0:62"
msgid "Might ye be thinkin' that ye can sell that coral in Kugane yerself? You can sure as hells try, but chances are ye'd find yerself in the clink. The bakufu don't take kindly to ijin sullyin' their seas."
msgstr "Думаешь, сможешь сам продать эти кораллы в Куганэ? Попробуй, конечно, но велика вероятность, что загремишь за решётку. Бакуфу не любят, когда чужеземцы портят их моря."

#. ja: もう少しで帰るつもりだから、<br>「綺麗な珊瑚」があったら、早めに渡しておくれ～。
#. de: Ich bleibe nicht mehr lange hier. Falls du noch mehr Korallen gefunden hast, gib sie mir bitte bald.
#. fr: J'ai pas l'intention de faire de vieux os ici, donc si tu as encore des morceaux de corail, donne-les-moi maintenant<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:354:0:56"
msgid "The throat's dry, and I could use a good swive. If ye've any more coral, ye'd best scamper, like."
msgstr "В горле пересохло, да и хорошенько бы повеселиться. Если есть ещё кораллы, поспеши-ка."

#. ja: 「ベニツノの卵」だが、産み落とされたものはもちろん、<br>親のムニ・ベニツノを倒しても、手に入るはずだぞ！
#. de: Du kannst die Eier auf dem Boden suchen oder, wenn du gemein bist, direkt den Eltern entwenden. Letzteres erfordert allerdings den Einsatz einer nicht unbeträchtlichen Menge von Gewalt.
#. fr: Tu peux me rapporter les œufs que tu trouveras par terre, mais aussi ceux que feraient tomber les bucorves. Bonne chasse aux œufs<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:355:0:56"
msgid "As I said before, you'll find hornbill eggs strewn about the paddies, as well as on the birds themselves. The females are known to warm their eggs 'neath their wings when hunting."
msgstr "Я уже говорил: ищи яйца птиц-носорогов на рисовых полях, а также у самих птиц. Известно, что самки греют яйца под крыльями, пока охотятся."

#. ja: 「稲の苗」は取り戻せたかい？<br>そうだと嬉しいんだけど……。
#. de: Konntest du ein paar Setzlinge zurückerobern? Ich wäre dir unendlich dankbar.
#. fr: Dis-moi que tu as récupéré quelques-uns de mes sacs de graines de riz...
#. column 60: Oh, my precious little sprouts... To think, had not this kindly traveler wandered hither, you'd be in the belly of a foul-smelling fiend.
#. column 62: You're not considering keeping those seedlings for yourself now, are you? I mean...there's no one in the village who could stop you, but you'd head home tonight with a thousand curses of rot upon your crotch...only one of which needs to take hold to make your life an itchy, burning hell with no honorable escape but a wakizashi to the gut. Are you truly willing to take that chance...?
msgctxt "FateEvent:358:0:56"
msgid "Had you any luck? Are the seedlings safe? Are the fish filleted?"
msgstr "Ну как, повезло? Саженцы в целости? Рыба уже выпотрошена?"

#. ja: ありがたや、ありがたや……。<br>旅人さんが通りがかってくれて、<br>本当によかったよ。
#. de: Ich danke den Kami, dass sie dich zu mir geschickt haben.
#. fr: Oh<nbsp>! Merci<nbsp>! Merci<nbsp>! J'ai eu de la chance que tu passes par là<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Had you any luck? Are the seedlings safe? Are the fish filleted?
#. column 62: You're not considering keeping those seedlings for yourself now, are you? I mean...there's no one in the village who could stop you, but you'd head home tonight with a thousand curses of rot upon your crotch...only one of which needs to take hold to make your life an itchy, burning hell with no honorable escape but a wakizashi to the gut. Are you truly willing to take that chance...?
msgctxt "FateEvent:358:0:60"
msgid "Oh, my precious little sprouts... To think, had not this kindly traveler wandered hither, you'd be in the belly of a foul-smelling fiend."
msgstr "Ах, мои драгоценные росточки... Подумать только, не окажись рядом этот добрый путник — быть бы вам в брюхе у вонючего чудовища."

#. ja: えっ……その「稲の苗」を、どうするつもりだい？<br>田植えまで手伝ってくれるつもりじゃあ、ないんだろう？
#. de: Ich seh doch, dass du welche in den Taschen hast! Was hast du damit vor? Willst du mir etwa persönlich beim Einpflanzen helfen?
#. fr: Tu ne veux pas me les donner<nbsp>? Tu n'as quand même pas l'intention de m'aider à les planter après, si<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Had you any luck? Are the seedlings safe? Are the fish filleted?
#. column 60: Oh, my precious little sprouts... To think, had not this kindly traveler wandered hither, you'd be in the belly of a foul-smelling fiend.
msgctxt "FateEvent:358:0:62"
msgid "You're not considering keeping those seedlings for yourself now, are you? I mean...there's no one in the village who could stop you, but you'd head home tonight with a thousand curses of rot upon your crotch...only one of which needs to take hold to make your life an itchy, burning hell with no honorable escape but a wakizashi to the gut. Are you truly willing to take that chance...?"
msgstr "Ты ведь не собираешься оставить саженцы себе? То есть... в деревне некому тебя остановить, но домой ты отправишься под проклятиями — тысяча пожеланий гнили твоему... Ну, достаточно одному сбыться, и жизнь станет зудящим, жгучим адом. А достойный выход останется лишь один — вспороть себе живот вакидзаси. Ты и правда готов рискнуть?.."

#. ja: 「ベニツノの卵」を持って来てくれたんだな？<br>そうだと言ってくれ！
#. de: Bitte sag mir, dass du Eier gefunden hast!
#. fr: Tu m'apportes des œufs de bucorve<nbsp>? Parfait<nbsp>! Fais-moi voir ça<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Hornbill eggs! For a moment there I truly thought you were a raccoon dog. These here will fry up nicely come the morrow! What, you didn't think I would simply dash them across the rocks, did you?
#. column 62: You can keep those eggs if you like... Not sure what good they'll serve, 'cepting clutter your bag there.
msgctxt "FateEvent:359:0:56"
msgid "I'm hoping those bulges in your pocket are hornbill eggs, and not on account of the fact you're just glad to see me...or that you're a glamoured raccoon dog with intentions of tricking me into giving you my firstborn."
msgstr "Надеюсь, эти выпуклости у тебя в кармане — яйца птиц-носорогов, а не просто ты рад меня видеть... И ты ведь не заколдованная енотовидная собака, которая хочет обманом заставить меня отдать ей первенца?"

#. ja: これだ、これだ！<br>回収することで、増殖を防ぎながら、<br>もらった卵は、晩飯の足しにでもさせてもらうよ！
#. de: Ah, wunderbar! Das hilft uns, die Bestände unter Kontrolle zu halten. Und in der Pfanne machen sich die Eier auch ganz gut!
#. fr: Génial<nbsp>! Plus tu m'en rapportes et moins on aura de soucis au moment où ils écloront<nbsp>! Et je te parle même pas de l'omelette que je compte en faire<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I'm hoping those bulges in your pocket are hornbill eggs, and not on account of the fact you're just glad to see me...or that you're a glamoured raccoon dog with intentions of tricking me into giving you my firstborn.
#. column 62: You can keep those eggs if you like... Not sure what good they'll serve, 'cepting clutter your bag there.
msgctxt "FateEvent:359:0:60"
msgid "Hornbill eggs! For a moment there I truly thought you were a raccoon dog. These here will fry up nicely come the morrow! What, you didn't think I would simply dash them across the rocks, did you?"
msgstr "Яйца птиц-носорогов! На миг я и правда решил, что ты енотовидная собака. Завтра как раз поджарю их на завтрак! Что, думал, я просто побросаю их о камни?"

#. ja: おや、回収した「ベニツノの卵」を、どうするつもりだい？<br>もしかして食べるつもりじゃ……？
#. de: Du kannst mir nicht erzählen, dass du keine gefunden hast! Man tritt gegen eins, bevor man bis drei zählen kann! Gib's zu, du willst die selber essen!
#. fr: Tu veux garder tes œufs de bucorve pour te faire une omelette<nbsp>? Les grands esprits se rencontrent...
#. column 56: I'm hoping those bulges in your pocket are hornbill eggs, and not on account of the fact you're just glad to see me...or that you're a glamoured raccoon dog with intentions of tricking me into giving you my firstborn.
#. column 60: Hornbill eggs! For a moment there I truly thought you were a raccoon dog. These here will fry up nicely come the morrow! What, you didn't think I would simply dash them across the rocks, did you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:359:0:62"
msgid "You can keep those eggs if you like... Not sure what good they'll serve, 'cepting clutter your bag there."
msgstr "Можешь оставить яйца себе, если хочешь... Не знаю только, зачем они тебе, кроме как место в сумке занимать."

#. ja: 「稲の苗」は取り戻せたかい？<br>まだあるなら、渡してくれると助かるよ。
#. de: Deine restlichen Setzlinge nehme ich dir gerne ab.
#. fr: Avec ce que tu m'as rapporté, je ne devrais pas mourir de faim<nbsp>! Cependant, si tu peux m'en ramener quelques-uns de plus, je ne dis pas non.
#. column 60: I've enough seedlings now that I'll be able to finish the planting, and I reckon you've learned those dirty fish a lesson they won't soon forget. Unless, that is, unless you wouldn't mind clubbing a few more, just for fun. Heh heh heh.
#. column 62: You're not considering keeping those seedlings for yourself now, are you? I mean...there's no one in the village who could stop you, but you'd head home tonight with a thousand curses of rot upon your crotch...only one of which needs to take hold to make your life an itchy, burning hell with no honorable escape but a wakizashi to the gut. Are you truly willing to take that chance...?
msgctxt "FateEvent:360:0:56"
msgid "Had you any more luck? I know there are more Namazu out there... I can smell them!"
msgstr "Как там дела? Я знаю, там ещё намадзу полно... Чую их!"

#. ja: これだけ取り戻せたら上出来さ。<br>さっそく田植えの準備をするとしようかね！<br>ありがたや、ありがたや……。
#. de: Danke, das sollte für die Bestellung der Felder reichen. Ich werde sofort die nötigen Vor<shy>bereitungen treffen.
#. fr: Magnifique<nbsp>! Avec tout ça, je pourrai même partager ma récolte avec ceux qui auront eu moins de chance que moi<nbsp>! Merci infiniment<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Had you any more luck? I know there are more Namazu out there... I can smell them!
#. column 62: You're not considering keeping those seedlings for yourself now, are you? I mean...there's no one in the village who could stop you, but you'd head home tonight with a thousand curses of rot upon your crotch...only one of which needs to take hold to make your life an itchy, burning hell with no honorable escape but a wakizashi to the gut. Are you truly willing to take that chance...?
msgctxt "FateEvent:360:0:60"
msgid "I've enough seedlings now that I'll be able to finish the planting, and I reckon you've learned those dirty fish a lesson they won't soon forget. Unless, that is, unless you wouldn't mind clubbing a few more, just for fun. Heh heh heh."
msgstr "Саженцев теперь хватит, чтобы закончить посадку. И, похоже, ты проучил этих мерзких рыб так, что надолго запомнят. Хотя... если не трудно, можешь дубинкой ещё парочку для забавы приложить. Хе-хе-хе."

#. ja: えっ……その「稲の苗」を、どうするつもりだい？<br>田植えまで手伝ってくれるつもりじゃあ、ないんだろう？
#. de: Ich seh doch, dass du welche in den Taschen hast! Was hast du damit vor? Willst du mir etwa persönlich beim Einpflanzen helfen?
#. fr: Tu ne veux pas me les donner<nbsp>? Tu n'as quand même pas l'intention de m'aider à les planter après, si<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Had you any more luck? I know there are more Namazu out there... I can smell them!
#. column 60: I've enough seedlings now that I'll be able to finish the planting, and I reckon you've learned those dirty fish a lesson they won't soon forget. Unless, that is, unless you wouldn't mind clubbing a few more, just for fun. Heh heh heh.
msgctxt "FateEvent:360:0:62"
msgid "You're not considering keeping those seedlings for yourself now, are you? I mean...there's no one in the village who could stop you, but you'd head home tonight with a thousand curses of rot upon your crotch...only one of which needs to take hold to make your life an itchy, burning hell with no honorable escape but a wakizashi to the gut. Are you truly willing to take that chance...?"
msgstr "Ты ведь не собираешься оставить саженцы себе? То есть... в деревне некому тебя остановить, но домой ты отправишься под проклятиями — тысяча пожеланий гнили твоему... Ну, достаточно одному сбыться, и жизнь станет зудящим, жгучим адом. А достойный выход останется лишь один — вспороть себе живот вакидзаси. Ты и правда готов рискнуть?.."

#. ja: おや、「ベニツノの卵」が残っているのかい？<br>だったら、手渡してくれ！
#. de: Du hast noch Eier? Dann nichts wie her damit!
#. fr: Il te reste encore des œufs<nbsp>? Je prends, je prends<nbsp>!
#. column 60: There are enough here for breakfast, lunch, dinner, and that meal that comes after dinner... What was it called again? Right. Breakfast. Now, if you're willing to find more, I'm sure I can find another meal.
#. column 62: You can keep those eggs if you like... Not sure what good they'll serve, 'cepting clutter your bag there.
msgctxt "FateEvent:361:0:56"
msgid "One less egg in the fields is one more night of silence. I'll eat...er, take as many as you can carry."
msgstr "Одно яйцо прочь с поля — ещё одна тихая ночь. Я съем... э-э, возьму столько, сколько унесёшь."

#. ja: 「ベニツノの卵」なら、いくらでも受け取るさ。<br>回収することで、増殖を防ぎながら、<br>もらった卵は、晩飯の足しにでもさせてもらうよ！
#. de: Ah, wunderbar! Das hilft uns, die Bestände unter Kontrolle zu halten. Und in der Pfanne machen sich die Eier auch ganz gut!
#. fr: Si tu en récupères d'autres, hésite pas à me les rapporter<nbsp>! Les bucorves devraient plus nous poser de problèmes, mais il y a pas de limite à la taille de mon omelette<nbsp>!
#. column 56: One less egg in the fields is one more night of silence. I'll eat...er, take as many as you can carry.
#. column 62: You can keep those eggs if you like... Not sure what good they'll serve, 'cepting clutter your bag there.
msgctxt "FateEvent:361:0:60"
msgid "There are enough here for breakfast, lunch, dinner, and that meal that comes after dinner... What was it called again? Right. Breakfast. Now, if you're willing to find more, I'm sure I can find another meal."
msgstr "Этого хватит на завтрак, обед, ужин и ещё один приём пищи после ужина... Как он там называется? Точно, завтрак. Если найдёшь ещё, уверен, я придумаю, что с ними съесть."

#. ja: おや、回収した「ベニツノの卵」を、どうするつもりだい？<br>もしかして食べるつもりじゃ……？
#. de: Du kannst mir nicht erzählen, dass du keine gefunden hast! Man tritt gegen eins, bevor man bis drei zählen kann! Gib's zu, du willst die selber essen!
#. fr: Tu veux garder tes œufs de bucorve pour te faire une omelette<nbsp>? Les grands esprits se rencontrent...
#. column 56: One less egg in the fields is one more night of silence. I'll eat...er, take as many as you can carry.
#. column 60: There are enough here for breakfast, lunch, dinner, and that meal that comes after dinner... What was it called again? Right. Breakfast. Now, if you're willing to find more, I'm sure I can find another meal.
msgctxt "FateEvent:361:0:62"
msgid "You can keep those eggs if you like... Not sure what good they'll serve, 'cepting clutter your bag there."
msgstr "Можешь оставить яйца себе, если хочешь... Не знаю только, зачем они тебе, кроме как место в сумке занимать."

#. ja: アンタ、冒険者だね？<br>オレは流れの酒保商人なんだが、<br>商材集めを手伝っちゃくれないか？
#. de: Wenn es etwas gibt, das ich lieber mag als Gil ... dann sind das noch mehr Gil! Buwahaha! Manchmal könnt ich mich echt totlachen über mich. Natürlich im übertragenen Sinne, buwaha!
#. fr: Salut, toi. Oh, mais t'es <if $gn4>aventurière<else>aventurier</if><nbsp>! Tu vas pouvoir m'aider<nbsp>! J'suis marchand itinérant, mais mes stocks sont quasiment vides<nbsp>!
#. column 57: But serious-like, I reckon I'm not the only one here who likes himself a fistful of gil. I saw how your brow did twitch when I mentioned the shiny. Which is why I've a right dandy proposition for you and yours.
#. column 58: Agree to do...something?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Gahahaha! And I ain't even told <if $gn4>the lass what she'll<else>the lad what he'll</if> be bloody doing! Not that what I need doing is all that taxing a task─I simply require a sack or two of griffin feathers. Easy peasy!
#. column 62: I see not even realm-saving, evil-slaying harbingers of light are cut out for the daunting task of...collecting feathers.
msgctxt "FateEvent:362:0:56"
msgid "If there's one thing I like better than coin...it's coin! Gahahahahaha! Oh, sometimes I kill myself. Not literally, mind you. That would be blasphemous, Rhalgr bless my bum."
msgstr "Если я что и люблю больше монет... так это монеты! Га-ха-ха-ха! Ох, иногда я сам себя до смерти смешу. Не буквально, разумеется. Это было бы богохульством. Ралгр, благослови мою задницу."

#. ja: 必要なのは矢羽根にする「グリフィンの羽根」さ。<br>アラミゴ解放軍から大量の注文を受けたんだが、<br>どうにも数が足りなくてね。
#. de: Aber mal im Ernst ... Ich glaub, ich bin nicht der Einzige, der nichts gegen klingende Münzen in der Tasche einzuwenden hat. Hab das Leuchten in deinen Augen gesehen, als ich das Zauberwort sagte. Deshalb hab ich ein Angebot für dich.
#. fr: Il me faut des plumes de griffon. L'armée de libération d'Ala Mhigo m'en a commandé énormément, ils en utilisent des quantités incroyables pour faire leurs flèches. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, j'en ai pas autant sous la main.
#. column 56: If there's one thing I like better than coin...it's coin! Gahahahahaha! Oh, sometimes I kill myself. Not literally, mind you. That would be blasphemous, Rhalgr bless my bum.
#. column 58: Agree to do...something?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Gahahaha! And I ain't even told <if $gn4>the lass what she'll<else>the lad what he'll</if> be bloody doing! Not that what I need doing is all that taxing a task─I simply require a sack or two of griffin feathers. Easy peasy!
#. column 62: I see not even realm-saving, evil-slaying harbingers of light are cut out for the daunting task of...collecting feathers.
msgctxt "FateEvent:362:0:57"
msgid "But serious-like, I reckon I'm not the only one here who likes himself a fistful of gil. I saw how your brow did twitch when I mentioned the shiny. Which is why I've a right dandy proposition for you and yours."
msgstr "А если серьёзно, не я один тут не прочь набить карман гилом. Видел, как у тебя бровь дёрнулась, когда я сказал про монеты. Вот у меня и есть для тебя отличное предложение."

#. ja: 矢羽根集めを手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Das Angebot annehmen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le marchand<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: If there's one thing I like better than coin...it's coin! Gahahahahaha! Oh, sometimes I kill myself. Not literally, mind you. That would be blasphemous, Rhalgr bless my bum.
#. column 57: But serious-like, I reckon I'm not the only one here who likes himself a fistful of gil. I saw how your brow did twitch when I mentioned the shiny. Which is why I've a right dandy proposition for you and yours.
#. column 60: You will? Gahahaha! And I ain't even told <if $gn4>the lass what she'll<else>the lad what he'll</if> be bloody doing! Not that what I need doing is all that taxing a task─I simply require a sack or two of griffin feathers. Easy peasy!
#. column 62: I see not even realm-saving, evil-slaying harbingers of light are cut out for the daunting task of...collecting feathers.
