msgid "Agree to do...something?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Взяться... за кое-что?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そいつはよかった、手伝ってくれるか！<br>「グリフィンの羽根」は、そこらで拾い集めるか、<br>トゥルーグリフィンを狩れば、手に入るはずさ。
#. de: Wirklich? Und ich hab dir noch nicht mal gesagt, worum es geht, buwaha! Aber keine Angst, ist gar nicht schwierig. Ich brauch lediglich ein paar Greifenfedern. Kinderleicht!
#. fr: Ah<nbsp>! Parfait<nbsp>! Tu m'retires une belle épine du pied<nbsp>! Pour en obtenir, tu peux récupérer celles qui traînent par terre, ou alors aller chasser des vrais griffons. À toi de voir si t'es assez téméraire<nbsp>!
#. column 56: If there's one thing I like better than coin...it's coin! Gahahahahaha! Oh, sometimes I kill myself. Not literally, mind you. That would be blasphemous, Rhalgr bless my bum.
#. column 57: But serious-like, I reckon I'm not the only one here who likes himself a fistful of gil. I saw how your brow did twitch when I mentioned the shiny. Which is why I've a right dandy proposition for you and yours.
#. column 58: Agree to do...something?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I see not even realm-saving, evil-slaying harbingers of light are cut out for the daunting task of...collecting feathers.
#. macro: <if $gn4>the lass what she'll<else>the lad what he'll</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:362:0:60"
msgid "You will? Gahahaha! And I ain't even told <if $gn4>the lass what she'll<else>the lad what he'll</if> be bloody doing! Not that what I need doing is all that taxing a task─I simply require a sack or two of griffin feathers. Easy peasy!"
msgstr "Правда? Га-ха-ха! Да я ещё даже не сказал <if $gn4>девушке, что ей предстоит<else>парню, что ему предстоит</if> делать! Да ничего сложного: всего-то нужна пара мешков грифоньих перьев. Проще простого!"

#. ja: まぁ、無理にとは言わないさ。<br>好きにしてくれや。
#. de: Verstehe. Das Sammeln von Federn ist wohl zu schwer für euch weltenrettende, lichtbringende Bezwinger des Bösen, hm?
#. fr: Bah, j'vais pas te forcer non plus. Fais comme tu veux.
#. column 56: If there's one thing I like better than coin...it's coin! Gahahahahaha! Oh, sometimes I kill myself. Not literally, mind you. That would be blasphemous, Rhalgr bless my bum.
#. column 57: But serious-like, I reckon I'm not the only one here who likes himself a fistful of gil. I saw how your brow did twitch when I mentioned the shiny. Which is why I've a right dandy proposition for you and yours.
#. column 58: Agree to do...something?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Gahahaha! And I ain't even told <if $gn4>the lass what she'll<else>the lad what he'll</if> be bloody doing! Not that what I need doing is all that taxing a task─I simply require a sack or two of griffin feathers. Easy peasy!
msgctxt "FateEvent:362:0:62"
msgid "I see not even realm-saving, evil-slaying harbingers of light are cut out for the daunting task of...collecting feathers."
msgstr "Вижу, даже спасителям мира и истребителям зла не по силам труднейшее задание... собрать перья."

#. ja: どうだい、「グリフィンの羽根」は集まったか？<br>そこらで拾い集めるか、<br>トゥルーグリフィンを狩れば、手に入るはずさ。
#. de: Mich interessieren genau zwei Dinge: Meine Gilbörse und mein Wohlbefinden. Wo du die Federn herzauberst, ist mir egal. Klaub sie vom Boden auf oder zupf sie aus toten Greifen.
#. fr: Alors ces plumes de griffon, c'en est où<nbsp>? Tu peux récupérer celles qui traînent par terre, ou alors aller chasser des vrais griffons. À toi de voir si t'es assez téméraire<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:363:0:56"
msgid "I have two cares in the world, my purse and my arse, and I've no room for a third concerning where you find me those feathers. Pluck them from the ground or from the twitching corpse of true griffins slain by your own hand, it's all the same to me."
msgstr "Меня волнуют всего две вещи: кошелёк и задница. Третьей, вроде того, где ты раздобудешь перья, нет. Подбирай с земли или выдирай из ещё подёргивающихся туш настоящих грифонов — мне всё равно."

#. ja: どうだい、「グリフィンの羽根」は集まったか？<br>あるならオレに渡してくれや。
#. de: Ah, du bist zurück. Hast hoffentlich Federn dabei?
#. fr: Allez, file-moi les plumes de griffon que t'as réussi à récupérer.
#. column 60: Ah! I knew I could trust you!
#. column 62: There's no need to wait till your sack is full. I'm offering the same price per, whether you bring me two or twenty.
msgctxt "FateEvent:364:0:56"
msgid "Back, are we? With feathers in hand, I pray."
msgstr "Вернулся? Надеюсь, с перьями."

#. ja: よし、品質もいいしバッチリだ。<br>ありがとうよ！
#. de: Ausgezeichnet! Weiter so!
#. fr: Voilà, c'est ça que je veux<nbsp>! De la plume de griffon de qualité<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Back, are we? With feathers in hand, I pray.
#. column 62: There's no need to wait till your sack is full. I'm offering the same price per, whether you bring me two or twenty.
msgctxt "FateEvent:364:0:60"
msgid "Ah! I knew I could trust you!"
msgstr "А! Я знал, что на тебя можно положиться!"

#. ja: おや？<br>もっと集めてから、まとめて渡すつもりかい？
#. de: Brauchst nicht zu warten, bis deine Taschen voll sind. Ich nehm auch gern vorher schon was.
#. fr: Tu veux pas<nbsp>? T'as l'intention de tout me donner d'un coup<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Back, are we? With feathers in hand, I pray.
#. column 60: Ah! I knew I could trust you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:364:0:62"
msgid "There's no need to wait till your sack is full. I'm offering the same price per, whether you bring me two or twenty."
msgstr "Не надо ждать, пока набьёшь полный мешок. За каждое перо плачу одинаково, принесёшь два или двадцать."

#. ja: 商材は、いくらでもほしい。<br>「グリフィンの羽根」は、そこらで拾い集めるか、<br>トゥルーグリフィンを狩れば、手に入るはずさ。
#. de: Hattest du jemals zu viel Gil? Nein, nicht wahr? Niemand kann jemals zu viel Gil haben. Und die Federn da draußen sind bare Münze. Ich wage also, die These aufzustellen, dass man gar nicht genug Federn besitzen kann. Ganz schön clever, was?
#. fr: N'aie pas peur d'en ramasser un bon paquet, j'en aurai jamais de trop<nbsp>! Si t'en trouves plus par terre, chasse des vrais griffons<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:365:0:56"
msgid "You ever had too much coin? Of course not, no one's ever had too much coin. Now, them feathers out there, they's coin. So from my postulations, I reckon just as no one can have too much coin, no one can have too many feathers. Look at me, all scholarly, like!"
msgstr "Бывало у тебя слишком много гила? Конечно нет, ни у кого не бывает слишком много гила. А перья там — это гил. Значит, как я рассудил, перьев, как и гила, много не бывает. Ну как, учёный из меня вышел?"

#. ja: まだ「グリフィンの羽根」を持っているなら、<br>急いでオレに渡してくれ。
#. de: Meine Beine werden schwerer und mein Magen leerer. Ich glaub, ich mach hier bald Feierabend.
#. fr: J'vais pas tarder à y aller. Si y t'reste encore des plumes, c'est le moment de me les donner.
#. column 60: This here'll make me a good ten score arrows, and the Resistance will pay a pretty penny for the lot. You have my thanks, adventurer. My thanks and my coin, and we both know which'll buy you more ale. Gahahaha!
#. column 62: Right then. I've more than enough to pull a profit for the day.
msgctxt "FateEvent:366:0:56"
msgid "The legs are getting a mite weary, and the belly's beginning to rumble. Think I may call it a day here afore long."
msgstr "Ноги уже устали, да и живот урчит. Пожалуй, скоро на сегодня хватит."

#. ja: よし、品質もいいしバッチリだ。<br>おかげで、かなりの在庫が集まった。<br>ありがとうよ！
#. de: Ha! Das reicht für ordentlich Pfeile und die Be<shy>freiungs<shy>armee wird ordentlich dafür latzen. Mein Dank und mein Geld. Und wir wissen ja beide, wofür du mehr Bier bekommst. Buwahahaha!
#. fr: Voilà, c'est ça que je veux<nbsp>! De la plume de qualité<nbsp>!
#. column 56: The legs are getting a mite weary, and the belly's beginning to rumble. Think I may call it a day here afore long.
#. column 62: Right then. I've more than enough to pull a profit for the day.
msgctxt "FateEvent:366:0:60"
msgid "This here'll make me a good ten score arrows, and the Resistance will pay a pretty penny for the lot. You have my thanks, adventurer. My thanks and my coin, and we both know which'll buy you more ale. Gahahaha!"
msgstr "Из этого получится целых двести стрел, а Сопротивление заплатит за них кругленькую сумму. Спасибо тебе, искатель приключений. И спасибо, и деньги — а мы оба знаем, что из этого принесёт тебе больше пива. Га-ха-ха!"

#. ja: もう少ししたら、取引先のところに向かうつもりだ。<br>渡し忘れがないようにしてくれよ？
#. de: Auch gut. Ich hab genug, um meinen Gilbeutel fürs Erste zu füllen.
#. fr: J'vais bientôt livrer l'armée de libération, alors oublie pas de me donner les plumes de griffon qui te reste.
#. column 56: The legs are getting a mite weary, and the belly's beginning to rumble. Think I may call it a day here afore long.
#. column 60: This here'll make me a good ten score arrows, and the Resistance will pay a pretty penny for the lot. You have my thanks, adventurer. My thanks and my coin, and we both know which'll buy you more ale. Gahahaha!
msgctxt "FateEvent:366:0:62"
msgid "Right then. I've more than enough to pull a profit for the day."
msgstr "Ладно. На сегодня товара у меня уже достаточно, чтобы получить прибыль."

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><if ($gn52 > 0)><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if> ！<br>これより、同盟軍の各隊が合同で演習を行うのですが、<br>貴官も参加されてはいかがですかな？
#. de: <if ($gn52 > 0)><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Wir führen hier ein Manöver der Allianz durch. Warum machst du nicht mit?
#. fr: <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><nbsp>! Voulez-vous participer avec nous à l'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment commun des troupes de l'Alliance<nbsp>?
#. column 57: <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> has requested your participation in a forthcoming training exercise for a unit of new recruits.
#. column 58: Allow your name to be added to the lists?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Very well. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> will be informed of this act of insubordination.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUlda… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankLimsaMaleText, row = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankGridaniaMaleText, row = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankUldahMaleText, row = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "FateEvent:367:0:56"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! Your timing, as always, is impeccable."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! Как всегда, вы пришли как нельзя вовремя."

#. ja: ちょうど、どの部隊に敵役を務めてもらおうかと、<br>思案していたところなのです。<br>貴官の腕前なら、仮想敵として十分だ。
#. de: Ich war gerade dabei, die Rollen zu verteilen. Jemanden wie dich könnten wir als Gegner gut gebrauchen!
#. fr: Nous étions justement en train de nous demander quel bataillon allait servir d'ennemi, mais vous remplirez ce rôle mieux que quiconque<nbsp>!
#. column 56: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Your timing, as always, is impeccable.
#. column 58: Allow your name to be added to the lists?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Very well. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> will be informed of this act of insubordination.
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:367:0:57"
msgid "<if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> has requested your participation in a forthcoming training exercise for a unit of new recruits."
msgstr "<if ($gn52 > 0)>Командование Мальстрёма</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Гнездо гадюк</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Зал Пламени</if> приглашает вас принять участие в предстоящих учениях для новобранцев."

#. ja: 演習に参加する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: An der Übung teilnehmen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Participer à l'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Your timing, as always, is impeccable.
#. column 57: <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> has requested your participation in a forthcoming training exercise for a unit of new recruits.
