msgctxt "FateEvent:367:0:58"
msgid "Allow your name to be added to the lists?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Разрешить внести вас в списки?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: うむ……貴官も忙しい身でしょうからな。<br>致し方ありません、またの機会に胸を貸してください。
#. de: Du hast sicher viel zu tun. Vielleicht ja ein anderes Mal.
#. fr: Nous savons tous que vous êtes <if $gn4>une femme très occupée<else>un homme très occupé</if>. Venez vous entraîner avec nous quand vous le voulez<nbsp>!
#. column 56: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Your timing, as always, is impeccable.
#. column 57: <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> has requested your participation in a forthcoming training exercise for a unit of new recruits.
#. column 58: Allow your name to be added to the lists?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:367:0:62"
msgid "Very well. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Maelstrom Command</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>The Adders' Nest</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>The Hall of Flames</if> will be informed of this act of insubordination."
msgstr "Что ж. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Командование Мальстрёма</if><if ($gn53 > 0)>Гнездо гадюк</if><if ($gn54 > 0)>Зал Пламени</if> узнает о вашем неповиновении."

#. ja: エオルゼア同盟軍の合同演習である！<br>冒険者諸君も、敵役として参加されたし！
#. de: Dies ist eine Gemeinschaftsübung von Truppen der eorzäischen Allianz. Abenteurer sind uns als Übungspartner stets willkommen!
#. fr: Nous sommes en pleine séance d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment. Les aventuriers qui souhaitent se joindre à nous sont les bienvenus<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:368:0:56"
msgid "Men and women of the Alliance gather near! Eorzea requires your blades!"
msgstr "Собирайтесь, воины Альянса! Эорзее нужны ваши клинки!"

#. ja: おぉ、こんなところで冒険者に出会うとは！<br>妖精綱の魔物、ダラの群れに囲まれてしまってね……。<br>切り抜けるために手を貸してくれないか？
#. de: <if $gn4>Eine Abenteurerin<else>Ein Abenteurer</if>!<br>Dich schickt der Himmel! Mir sind ein paar Dharas auf den Fersen und ich werd sie einfach nicht los!
#. fr: Quelle chance de vous rencontrer ici<nbsp>! Je suis encerclé par ces sales bêtes, et j'aurais bien besoin d'un petit coup de main...
#. column 57: Help save the fighter's eternal soul from consumption?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then if I die today, I will die with my sword in hand and my soul intact!
msgctxt "FateEvent:369:0:56"
msgid "An adventurer!? Then perhaps this day will not be my last! Spirits of the land seek to sup on my very soul. I fear I can no longer fend them off alone, but with you at my side..."
msgstr "Искатель приключений!? Значит, сегодня я, возможно, не погибну! Духи земли хотят пожрать мою душу. Одному мне их уже не сдержать, но с тобой рядом..."

#. ja: 闘士に手を貸す？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Befreiungskämpfer helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le résistant mhigois<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: An adventurer!? Then perhaps this day will not be my last! Spirits of the land seek to sup on my very soul. I fear I can no longer fend them off alone, but with you at my side...
#. column 62: Then if I die today, I will die with my sword in hand and my soul intact!
