msgctxt "FateEvent:369:0:57"
msgid "Help save the fighter's eternal soul from consumption?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь уберечь вечную душу бойца от пожирания?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか、戦う意志がないなら、すぐに逃げ出すといい。<br>ここは俺が、どうにかしてみせる！
#. de: Dann hau lieber ab, wenn du nicht kämpfen willst. Hier geht's nämlich gleich rund!
#. fr: Si vous n'avez pas envie de vous battre, je vous conseille de vous éloigner. Même seul, j'ai bien l'intention de me défendre<nbsp>!
#. column 56: An adventurer!? Then perhaps this day will not be my last! Spirits of the land seek to sup on my very soul. I fear I can no longer fend them off alone, but with you at my side...
#. column 57: Help save the fighter's eternal soul from consumption?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:369:0:62"
msgid "Then if I die today, I will die with my sword in hand and my soul intact!"
msgstr "Тогда, если мне суждено сегодня погибнуть, то погибну я с мечом в руке и душой нетронутой!"

#. ja: 狩りの最中に、大物のアントリオンに襲われたの。<br>どうにか逃げてきたんだけど……。
#. de: Ich wurde während der Jagd von einem riesigen Ameisenlöwen angegriffen und konnte nur mit Mühe und Not entkommen!
#. fr: Je me suis fait attaquer par un fourrrmilion alors que j'étais en train de chasser. Heurrreusement, on dirait que j'ai réussi à lui échapper pour l'instant...
#. column 57: I've been fighting wave after wave of the nasty creatures for bells now but there's no end to them. My arms are sore and my pack's light. I could use a strong adventurer like you. My tribe would even be willing to pay you for your services.
#. column 58: Fight by the ranger's side?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Why did it have to be an adventurer...? Of all the people that could have wandered by in my time of need... A Coliseum champion? No. A hero of legend? No. A savior of the realm and protector of the people? No. Just another damned adventurer...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:370:0:56"
msgid "Why did it have to be antlions...?<br>Ants? Nothing a few good stomps of the feet couldn't solve. Lions? A sultry glance and their legs are jelly. But antlions?"
msgstr "Ну почему именно муравьиные львы?.. Муравьёв-то раздавить парой хороших ударов ногой — проще простого. Львы? Одного томного взгляда хватит, и ноги у них подкосятся. Но муравьиные львы?"

#. ja: あんなのを放置していたら、<br>きっと私たちの仲間が、いつか大きな被害に遭うはず……。<br>冒険者さん、討伐に協力してくれませんか？
#. de: Das Tier ist eine Bedrohung für meinen Stamm! Könntest du mir helfen, es aus dem Weg zu räumen?
#. fr: Si on laisse cette horreur s'installer sur notrrre territoire, on ne pourra bientôt plus chasser tranquille... Dites, vous ne voudrrriez pas m'aider à le repousser<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Why did it have to be antlions...?<br>Ants? Nothing a few good stomps of the feet couldn't solve. Lions? A sultry glance and their legs are jelly. But antlions?
#. column 58: Fight by the ranger's side?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Why did it have to be an adventurer...? Of all the people that could have wandered by in my time of need... A Coliseum champion? No. A hero of legend? No. A savior of the realm and protector of the people? No. Just another damned adventurer...
msgctxt "FateEvent:370:0:57"
msgid "I've been fighting wave after wave of the nasty creatures for bells now but there's no end to them. My arms are sore and my pack's light. I could use a strong adventurer like you. My tribe would even be willing to pay you for your services."
msgstr "Я уже несколько часов отбиваюсь от одной волны этих тварей за другой, а им конца и края нет. Руки ноют, припасы на исходе. Мне бы пригодился такой сильный искатель приключений, как ты. Моё племя даже заплатит за помощь."

#. ja: 大物アントリオンに挑む？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Ameisenlöwen jagen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la chasseuse des M<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Why did it have to be antlions...?<br>Ants? Nothing a few good stomps of the feet couldn't solve. Lions? A sultry glance and their legs are jelly. But antlions?
#. column 57: I've been fighting wave after wave of the nasty creatures for bells now but there's no end to them. My arms are sore and my pack's light. I could use a strong adventurer like you. My tribe would even be willing to pay you for your services.
#. column 62: Why did it have to be an adventurer...? Of all the people that could have wandered by in my time of need... A Coliseum champion? No. A hero of legend? No. A savior of the realm and protector of the people? No. Just another damned adventurer...
