msgctxt "FateEvent:370:0:58"
msgid "Fight by the ranger's side?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сражаться бок о бок с охотницей?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうですか……。<br>誰でも怖いですよね、あんなのと戦うのは……。
#. de: Ich kann's dir nicht verdenken. Ich hab ja auch Angst vor dem Biest.
#. fr: Je vous comprrrends, n'importe qui ferait dans son pantalon devant un monstre aussi énorrrme...
#. column 56: Why did it have to be antlions...?<br>Ants? Nothing a few good stomps of the feet couldn't solve. Lions? A sultry glance and their legs are jelly. But antlions?
#. column 57: I've been fighting wave after wave of the nasty creatures for bells now but there's no end to them. My arms are sore and my pack's light. I could use a strong adventurer like you. My tribe would even be willing to pay you for your services.
#. column 58: Fight by the ranger's side?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:370:0:62"
msgid "Why did it have to be an adventurer...? Of all the people that could have wandered by in my time of need... A Coliseum champion? No. A hero of legend? No. A savior of the realm and protector of the people? No. Just another damned adventurer..."
msgstr "Ну почему именно искатель приключений?.. Кого только не могло занести сюда, когда мне нужна помощь... Чемпион Колизея? Нет. Легендарный герой? Нет. Спаситель мира и защитник людей? Нет. Всего лишь очередной проклятый искатель приключений..."

#. ja: アラミゴ解放軍に密書を届けるため、<br>川を渡りたいのですが、怪魚の群れが行く手を阻んでいるのです。<br>かといって、ひとりで相手できる数では……。
#. de: Ich muss ein wichtiges Dokument zur Be<shy>freiungs<shy>armee bringen, aber diese Monsterfische lassen mich nicht rüber. Alleine bin ich denen nicht gewachsen.
#. fr: J'ai un message important à faire parvenir à mes supérieurs, mais avec tous ces monstres, je ne sais pas si je vais réussir à traverser cette rivière...
#. column 57: But look at all those...those...<i>fish</i>! There is absolutely NO WAY I am crossing that river with all those disgusting creatures sloshing about. You! You have the look of a killer about you. In the name of the Eorzean Alliance, I command you to rid the waters of wavekin!
#. column 58: Take orders from a herald?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: What!? This is an outrage! I will have you court-martialed for this! I court-martial you this very instant! Guards, throw <if $gn4>her<else>him</if> into the dungeons. The lowest level!
msgctxt "FateEvent:371:0:56"
msgid "I carry with me an extremely urgent message, one that may (or may not) determine the fate of the entire realm!"
msgstr "Я несу крайне срочное послание. От него может зависеть судьба всего мира! А может и не зависеть."

#. ja: すみませんが、援護してくださいませんか？<br>重要な密書だけに、確実に届けたいのです。<br>どうか、よろしくお願いします。
#. de: Könntest du mir vielleicht Beistand gewähren? Die Sache ist wirklich dringend!
#. fr: Je ne sais pas si vous avez le temps mais ça serait vraiment chic de votre part de me donner un coup de main<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I carry with me an extremely urgent message, one that may (or may not) determine the fate of the entire realm!
#. column 58: Take orders from a herald?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: What!? This is an outrage! I will have you court-martialed for this! I court-martial you this very instant! Guards, throw <if $gn4>her<else>him</if> into the dungeons. The lowest level!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:371:0:57"
msgid "But look at all those...those...<i>fish</i>! There is absolutely NO WAY I am crossing that river with all those disgusting creatures sloshing about. You! You have the look of a killer about you. In the name of the Eorzean Alliance, I command you to rid the waters of wavekin!"
msgstr "Да вы только посмотрите на этих... этих... <i>рыб</i>! Ни за что на свете я не полезу в реку, кишащую этими мерзкими тварями. Эй, ты! По тебе видно, что ты умеешь убивать. Именем Альянса Эорзеи приказываю очистить воды от морских чудовищ!"

#. ja: 黒渦団の伝令に協力する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Boten des Mahlstroms helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le messager du Maelstrom<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I carry with me an extremely urgent message, one that may (or may not) determine the fate of the entire realm!
#. column 57: But look at all those...those...<i>fish</i>! There is absolutely NO WAY I am crossing that river with all those disgusting creatures sloshing about. You! You have the look of a killer about you. In the name of the Eorzean Alliance, I command you to rid the waters of wavekin!
#. column 62: What!? This is an outrage! I will have you court-martialed for this! I court-martial you this very instant! Guards, throw <if $gn4>her<else>him</if> into the dungeons. The lowest level!
