msgctxt "FateEvent:371:0:62"
msgid "What!? This is an outrage! I will have you court-martialed for this! I court-martial you this very instant! Guards, throw <if $gn4>her<else>him</if> into the dungeons. The lowest level!"
msgstr "Что!? Да это возмутительно! Я отдам вас под трибунал! Прямо сейчас! Стража, бросить <if $gn4>её<else>его</if> в темницу. В самую нижнюю камеру!"

#. ja: グッ……ハァ、ハァ……。<br>紅甲羅の亀どもが、シマエイをけしかけてきてな……。<br>ご、後生だから、助けちゃくれねぇか？
#. de: \<keuch> ... Gestreifte Rochen sind über mich hergefallen und haben mich verwundet. Ich glaube, die Rotpanzer haben sie uns auf den Hals gehetzt. Bitte, hilf mir!
#. fr: Ces sales Kojin se sont ramenés avec des raies rayées pour s'approprier nos provisions<nbsp>! Tu veux pas nous filer un coup de main pour les envoyer paître<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Help the dying Confederate?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Tell my wife that I...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:372:0:56"
msgid "The Red... They came with their rays... Rays, whose wings...blocked out the sun... We cannot let them advance on the village... We must...stop them... <i>You</i> must stop them... Why is it so cold...?"
msgstr "Краснопанцирные... Они пришли с лучами... Их крылья... закрыли солнце... Нельзя дать им добраться до деревни... Мы должны... остановить их... <i>Ты</i> должен их остановить... Почему так холодно?.."

#. ja: 助太刀する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Piraten vor den Rochen retten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le pirate blessé<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: The Red... They came with their rays... Rays, whose wings...blocked out the sun... We cannot let them advance on the village... We must...stop them... <i>You</i> must stop them... Why is it so cold...?
#. column 62: Tell my wife that I...
