msgctxt "FateEvent:372:0:57"
msgid "Help the dying Confederate?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь умирающему конфедерату?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ハァ……ハァ……<br>オレも年貢の納め時ってことかよ……。
#. de: Oje ... Dann ist meine Zeit wohl abgelaufen ...
#. fr: Sympa, dis donc<nbsp>! Tu pourrais au moins avoir pitié de moi...
#. column 56: The Red... They came with their rays... Rays, whose wings...blocked out the sun... We cannot let them advance on the village... We must...stop them... <i>You</i> must stop them... Why is it so cold...?
#. column 57: Help the dying Confederate?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:372:0:62"
msgid "Tell my wife that I..."
msgstr "Скажи моей жене, что я..."

#. ja: だ、誰かの視線を感じるんだ……。<br>ここらは、キキルン族の山賊が出るからね……。<br>腕に覚えがあるなら、見て来てくれないか？
#. de: Mein Vater meinte, es wäre verrückt, das Getreide selbst abzuliefern, aber hab ich auf ihn gehört? Jetzt hab ich den Salat. Und wenn ich nicht aufpasse, bin ich's auch bald: Fleischsalat auf den Tellern der Qiqirn!
#. fr: J'ai l'impression qu'on nous observe... Je suis sûr que c'est ces satanés Qiqirns, la montagne en pullule. Tu veux bien garder un œil ouvert sur le trajet, s'ils ne te font pas peur<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Save the villager from his fate?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I am doomed, I tell you. Doomed! I hope the rats choke on my coccyx.
msgctxt "FateEvent:373:0:56"
msgid "My father told me it was foolish to deliver that sack of grain myself, but did I listen to him? And now look at me, stuck between a proverbial rock and a hard place, the latter crawling with Qiqirn bandits who are more interested in picking my bones than they are my pockets."
msgstr "Отец говорил, что глупо самому везти мешок зерна, но разве я его послушал? И вот я здесь, между молотом и наковальней. А наковальня кишит бандитами-кикиринами, которым больше хочется обглодать мои кости, чем обчистить карманы."

#. ja: 協力する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Mann sein grausames Schicksal ersparen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider cet homme<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: My father told me it was foolish to deliver that sack of grain myself, but did I listen to him? And now look at me, stuck between a proverbial rock and a hard place, the latter crawling with Qiqirn bandits who are more interested in picking my bones than they are my pockets.
#. column 62: I am doomed, I tell you. Doomed! I hope the rats choke on my coccyx.
