msgctxt "FateEvent:373:0:57"
msgid "Save the villager from his fate?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Спасти крестьянина от гибели?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 仕方ない……。<br>気のせいかもしれないが、念のため、<br>少しここで待っておくとするよ。
#. de: Wehe mir, ich bin verloren! Ich hoffe, die Ratten verschlucken sich an meinem Steißbein!
#. fr: Ils t'effraient toi aussi<nbsp>? Pas grave. C'est sûrement mon imagination qui me joue des tours, mais je vais rester un moment ici, on ne sait jamais.
#. column 56: My father told me it was foolish to deliver that sack of grain myself, but did I listen to him? And now look at me, stuck between a proverbial rock and a hard place, the latter crawling with Qiqirn bandits who are more interested in picking my bones than they are my pockets.
#. column 57: Save the villager from his fate?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:373:0:62"
msgid "I am doomed, I tell you. Doomed! I hope the rats choke on my coccyx."
msgstr "Всё, пропал я, говорю тебе. Пропал! Надеюсь, крысы подавятся моим копчиком."

#. ja: い、祈りが通じたのか……！<br>見つけてくれる人が、現れるなんて……！<br>待ってたんだ！
#. de: Den Göttern sei Dank, meine Gebete wurden erhört! Ich bin ein Krieger aus Kaltherd, der, äh, unglück<shy>licher<shy>weise seine, äh, Waffe verlegt hat. Das müssen diese Kongamato gerochen haben, als sie sich mir in den Weg stellten!
#. fr: Quelqu'un m'a trouvé<nbsp>! Rhalgr a exaucé ma prière<nbsp>! J'ai attendu si longtemps<nbsp>!
#. column 57: I know what you are thinking. Any good warrior who forgets his steel is no good warrior. And you would be right. Just not this time! I beg of you, escort me back to my village that I may redeem myself!
#. column 58: Escort the hapless hamleter home?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Y-You can't just leave me here...can you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:374:0:56"
msgid "By the comet, my prayers─they've been answered! Please, goodly adventurer, I am a warrior of Coldhearth and happen to have...er...misplaced my blade, and now a plague of kongamato bar my path home."
msgstr "О боги, мои молитвы... услышаны! Прошу, добрый искатель приключений, я воин из Холодного очага и, как бы это сказать... потерял свой клинок. Теперь стая конгамато преградила мне путь домой."

#. ja: コンガマトーの群れに襲われて、<br>怪我を負って、身動きがとれなくなっていたんだ……。<br>た、頼む……俺を助けてくれっ……！
#. de: Ich weiß, was du jetzt denkst: Ein Krieger, der seine Waffe vergisst, ist ein schlechter Krieger. Und ich würde dir ja auch zustimmen, aber nicht in meinem Fall! Also, kannst du mir bitte den Weg nach Hause freikämpfen?
#. fr: Une volée de kongamato a fondu sur moi<nbsp>! Ils m'ont blessé et je n'arrive plus du tout à bouger. Aide-moi<nbsp>! Je t'en supplie<nbsp>!
#. column 56: By the comet, my prayers─they've been answered! Please, goodly adventurer, I am a warrior of Coldhearth and happen to have...er...misplaced my blade, and now a plague of kongamato bar my path home.
#. column 58: Escort the hapless hamleter home?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Y-You can't just leave me here...can you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:374:0:57"
msgid "I know what you are thinking. Any good warrior who forgets his steel is no good warrior. And you would be right. Just not this time! I beg of you, escort me back to my village that I may redeem myself!"
msgstr "Знаю, о чём ты думаешь. Воин, забывший оружие, — никудышный воин. И ты прав. Только не в этот раз! Умоляю, проводи меня в деревню, чтобы я мог искупить вину!"

#. ja: 助けてあげる？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Mann beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider cet homme<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: By the comet, my prayers─they've been answered! Please, goodly adventurer, I am a warrior of Coldhearth and happen to have...er...misplaced my blade, and now a plague of kongamato bar my path home.
#. column 57: I know what you are thinking. Any good warrior who forgets his steel is no good warrior. And you would be right. Just not this time! I beg of you, escort me back to my village that I may redeem myself!
#. column 62: Y-You can't just leave me here...can you?
