msgctxt "FateEvent:374:0:58"
msgid "Escort the hapless hamleter home?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Проводить незадачливого селянина домой?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: み、見捨てるっていうのか……！？
#. de: Du willst mich nicht wirklich hier zurücklassen ... oder?
#. fr: T-tu vas me laisser là sans rien faire<nbsp>!? Non... non... non...
#. column 56: By the comet, my prayers─they've been answered! Please, goodly adventurer, I am a warrior of Coldhearth and happen to have...er...misplaced my blade, and now a plague of kongamato bar my path home.
#. column 57: I know what you are thinking. Any good warrior who forgets his steel is no good warrior. And you would be right. Just not this time! I beg of you, escort me back to my village that I may redeem myself!
#. column 58: Escort the hapless hamleter home?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:374:0:62"
msgid "Y-You can't just leave me here...can you?"
msgstr "Т-ты ведь не бросишь меня здесь... правда?"

#. ja: 我が名は、センバン！<br>ひんがしの国より、強敵を求めてやってきた修行人だ。<br>この廟に潜むという、魔を払いにやってきた。
#. de: Sei gegrüßt, mein Name ist Senban. Ich bin aus Hingashi hergereist, um mein Kampfgeschick in Duellen mit mächtigen Gegnern zu üben.
#. fr: Mon nom est Senban<nbsp>! Je suis un samouraï de Hingashi, parcourant le monde à la recherche d'adversaires toujours plus puissants pour parfaire mon ap<shy>pren<shy>tis<shy>sage. Au cours de mon voyage, j'ai appris qu'un démon se cacherait ici, près du Compas de l'Hirondelle. J'ai donc l'intention de l'anéantir.
#. column 57: And it appears the land's greatest threats are <i>my</i> land's greatest threats, as well. I have heard rumor that a wicked onmyoji from the island of Koshu has inspirited a scarecrow to ravage the quiet fields of Namai and beyond.
#. column 58: Such an affront to the very kami we worship and revere is not to be forgiven, and I shall see this ne'er-do-well and his foul creation vanquished by myself if necessary. However...I would not turn away one who sought to test their own mettle, as well.
#. column 59: Join Senban in his hunt for a scarecrow?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then as I said, I shall slay this abomination myself. You are free to bear witness, and perhaps learn of courage and honor.
msgctxt "FateEvent:375:0:56"
msgid "I am Senban Oneblade, come to the mountains of Yanxia to test my mettle against the land's greatest threats."
msgstr "Я Сэнбан Однолезвийный. Я прибыл в горы Янся, чтобы испытать себя в битве с величайшими угрозами этих земель."

#. ja: なんでも、悪しき陰陽師が、案山子（かかし）に細工し、<br>仮初めの命を与えて、化け物に仕立てたそうでな。<br>人々は、そやつに畑を荒らされ困っているとか。
#. de: Ein Onmyoshi soll an diesem Ort eine Vogelscheuche mit einem Shikigami beseelt haben. Nun verwüstet sie die Felder und bereitet den Bauern nichts als Ärger.
#. fr: On m'a raconté qu'un prêtre onmyo malfaisant aurait offert un souffle de vie à un épouvantail. Cette existence, bien qu'éphémère, serait un vrai fléau pour les fermiers dont les champs se sont vu saccager par cette monstruosité.
#. column 56: I am Senban Oneblade, come to the mountains of Yanxia to test my mettle against the land's greatest threats.
#. column 58: Such an affront to the very kami we worship and revere is not to be forgiven, and I shall see this ne'er-do-well and his foul creation vanquished by myself if necessary. However...I would not turn away one who sought to test their own mettle, as well.
#. column 59: Join Senban in his hunt for a scarecrow?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then as I said, I shall slay this abomination myself. You are free to bear witness, and perhaps learn of courage and honor.
