msgctxt "FateEvent:375:0:57"
msgid "And it appears the land's greatest threats are <i>my</i> land's greatest threats, as well. I have heard rumor that a wicked onmyoji from the island of Koshu has inspirited a scarecrow to ravage the quiet fields of Namai and beyond."
msgstr "Похоже, величайшие угрозы здешних земель угрожают и <i>моим</i> владениям. Слышал, злой онмёдзи с острова Косю оживил пугало, и теперь оно разоряет тихие поля Намая и окрестностей."

#. ja: どうだ、拙者とともに、<br>化け物退治に挑むつもりはないか？
#. de: Ich würde natürlich auch allein mit ihr fertig, aber wenn du an meiner Seite in den Kampf ziehen und von mir lernen möchtest, werde ich dich nicht daran hindern.
#. fr:  Accepterais-tu de m'épauler afin de pourfendre cette vile créature<nbsp>?
#. column 56: I am Senban Oneblade, come to the mountains of Yanxia to test my mettle against the land's greatest threats.
#. column 57: And it appears the land's greatest threats are <i>my</i> land's greatest threats, as well. I have heard rumor that a wicked onmyoji from the island of Koshu has inspirited a scarecrow to ravage the quiet fields of Namai and beyond.
#. column 59: Join Senban in his hunt for a scarecrow?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then as I said, I shall slay this abomination myself. You are free to bear witness, and perhaps learn of courage and honor.
msgctxt "FateEvent:375:0:58"
msgid "Such an affront to the very kami we worship and revere is not to be forgiven, and I shall see this ne'er-do-well and his foul creation vanquished by myself if necessary. However...I would not turn away one who sought to test their own mettle, as well."
msgstr "Такое оскорбление самим ками, которым мы поклоняемся и чтим их, нельзя простить. Я сам одолею этого негодяя и его мерзкое создание, если понадобится. Но... не стану отказывать тому, кто тоже хочет испытать свою силу."

#. ja: 化け物退治に挑む？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Zusammen mit Senban die Vogelscheuche bekämpfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Senban<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
