msgid "Join Senban in his hunt for a scarecrow?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Охотиться на пугало вместе с Сэнбаном?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ただならぬ気配、一角の武人かと思ったが、<br>どうやら見込み違いであったようだな。
#. de: Ich dachte, du wärst so unerschrocken wie ich, aber da habe ich mich wohl getäuscht.
#. fr: Je pensais avoir vu en toi l'aura d'<if $gn4>une guerrière<else>un guerrier</if>. Il semblerait que j'ai fait erreur.
#. column 56: I am Senban Oneblade, come to the mountains of Yanxia to test my mettle against the land's greatest threats.
#. column 57: And it appears the land's greatest threats are <i>my</i> land's greatest threats, as well. I have heard rumor that a wicked onmyoji from the island of Koshu has inspirited a scarecrow to ravage the quiet fields of Namai and beyond.
#. column 58: Such an affront to the very kami we worship and revere is not to be forgiven, and I shall see this ne'er-do-well and his foul creation vanquished by myself if necessary. However...I would not turn away one who sought to test their own mettle, as well.
#. column 59: Join Senban in his hunt for a scarecrow?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:375:0:62"
msgid "Then as I said, I shall slay this abomination myself. You are free to bear witness, and perhaps learn of courage and honor."
msgstr "Как я и сказал, с этой тварью я справлюсь сам. Можешь посмотреть и, быть может, поучиться храбрости и чести."

#. ja: 同志よ、援護してくれ！<br>偵察中にチャプリの群れに襲われて、<br>命からがら逃げてきたんだ……。
#. de: <if $gn4>Schwester<else>Bruder</if> an den Waffen! Du musst mir helfen! Ich wurde während meiner Patrouille von Chapulis angegriffen. Ich konnte entkommen. Aber die Biester haben mich am Bein erwischt.
#. fr: Camarade<nbsp>! Aide-moi<nbsp>! J'étais en mission de recon<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ce... quand une nuée de chapulis a bondi sur moi. Je m'en suis à peine sorti...
#. column 57: Now the chapulis have my scent, and I am unfit to stand without effort, let alone swing a blade with any capacity. I must inform my captain of what I saw, but fear I will not be able to reach our camp alone. Would you...
#. column 58: Answer his unasked, yet strongly implied plea?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then hand me that stick over there, so at least I will die fighting!
#. macro: <if $gn4>Sister<else>Brother</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:376:0:56"
msgid "<if $gn4>Sister<else>Brother</if>-in-arms! I beg your assistance! I was ambushed by chapuli curs while scouting for my company. I managed to flee the creatures, but not without first taking a cut to the leg."
msgstr "<if $gn4>Сестра<else>Брат</if> по оружию! Прошу, помоги мне! Во время разведки на меня напали чапули. Я сумел от них сбежать, но они успели ранить меня в ногу."

#. ja: 途中で武器も落としてしまって……<br>だが、拠点にチャプリを引き連れて戻るわけには……。<br>すまないが、君だけが頼りなんだ！
#. de: Die Chapulis dürften keine Probleme haben, meiner Fährte zu folgen. Wenn sie mich aufspüren, bin ich geliefert. Meine Klinge vermag ich jedenfalls nicht mehr zu führen. Würdest du vielleicht ...?
#. fr: Comble de malchance, j'ai égaré mon arme en essayant de fuir... Il faut les abattre<nbsp>! Sinon ils me suivront jusqu'au campement et le dévasteront<nbsp>! Aide-moi, je t'en prie<nbsp>!
#. column 56: <if $gn4>Sister<else>Brother</if>-in-arms! I beg your assistance! I was ambushed by chapuli curs while scouting for my company. I managed to flee the creatures, but not without first taking a cut to the leg.
#. column 58: Answer his unasked, yet strongly implied plea?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then hand me that stick over there, so at least I will die fighting!
msgctxt "FateEvent:376:0:57"
msgid "Now the chapulis have my scent, and I am unfit to stand without effort, let alone swing a blade with any capacity. I must inform my captain of what I saw, but fear I will not be able to reach our camp alone. Would you..."
msgstr "Чапули идут по моему следу, а мне и стоять-то тяжело, не то что мечом махать. Надо сообщить капитану, что я увидел, но одному до лагеря мне не добраться. Не мог бы ты..."

#. ja: 闘士を助ける？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der unausgesprochenen, aber unüberhörbaren Bitte des Mannes entsprechen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider ce soldat<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: <if $gn4>Sister<else>Brother</if>-in-arms! I beg your assistance! I was ambushed by chapuli curs while scouting for my company. I managed to flee the creatures, but not without first taking a cut to the leg.
#. column 57: Now the chapulis have my scent, and I am unfit to stand without effort, let alone swing a blade with any capacity. I must inform my captain of what I saw, but fear I will not be able to reach our camp alone. Would you...
#. column 62: Then hand me that stick over there, so at least I will die fighting!
