msgid "Answer his unasked, yet strongly implied plea?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Откликнуться на его невысказанную, но явную просьбу?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そ、そうか……。<br>万事休す……だな……。
#. de: Dann gib mir wenigstens den Stock da vorne, damit ich mich etwas verteidigen kann!
#. fr: Non...<nbsp>? Alors... Alors c'est la fin...
#. column 56: <if $gn4>Sister<else>Brother</if>-in-arms! I beg your assistance! I was ambushed by chapuli curs while scouting for my company. I managed to flee the creatures, but not without first taking a cut to the leg.
#. column 57: Now the chapulis have my scent, and I am unfit to stand without effort, let alone swing a blade with any capacity. I must inform my captain of what I saw, but fear I will not be able to reach our camp alone. Would you...
#. column 58: Answer his unasked, yet strongly implied plea?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:376:0:62"
msgid "Then hand me that stick over there, so at least I will die fighting!"
msgstr "Тогда подай мне вон ту палку. Хоть умру в бою!"

#. ja: 最近、ウチの可愛いケナガウシが、<br>ガーダンの群れに襲われて困ってるの。<br>さっきも、恐ろしいガーダンの姿を見かけたんです！
#. de: Die Gedane haben beinahe meine ganze Herde gefressen. Nur noch ein Dzo ist mir geblieben und gerade eben habe ich schon wieder eine dieser Bestien herumschleichen sehen.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Étrangère<else>Étranger</if>, tu dois m'aider<nbsp>! Il y a une meute de gedans qui rôde dans les environs... J'ai peur qu'ils en aient après mon hainag...
#. column 57: Hm? An adventurer? Is this <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> an answer to my prayers?
#. column 58: Did Azim send you?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the sun and his light of mercy!
#. column 62: Damn you, Azim! Damn you and your deafened ears. I forsake you and embrace the Dusk Mother!
msgctxt "FateEvent:378:0:56"
msgid "O, Dawn Father! Why must my herd be harried night and day!? Have I not said the right words? Have I not made the correct offerings?"
msgstr "О, Отец Рассвета! Почему моё стадо донимают и днём и ночью!? Разве я не произносил правильных молитв? Разве не приносил нужных даров?"

#. ja: ウチってば、図体は大きいのに戦うのが苦手で……<br>強そうな旅人さん、お願いです！<br>ウチの子を、ガーダンから守ってくれませんか！？
#. de: Mein Dzo sieht zwar groß und stark aus, ist aber lammfromm und kann sich kaum zur Wehr setzen. Bitte, Fremde<if $gn4><else>r</if>, beschütze mein armes Tier vor den Gedanen!
#. fr: Il a l'air fort et costaud comme ça, mais il ne sait pas se défendre... Si les gedans attaquent, est-ce que tu pourrais le protéger<nbsp>?
#. column 56: O, Dawn Father! Why must my herd be harried night and day!? Have I not said the right words? Have I not made the correct offerings?
#. column 58: Did Azim send you?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the sun and his light of mercy!
#. column 62: Damn you, Azim! Damn you and your deafened ears. I forsake you and embrace the Dusk Mother!
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:378:0:57"
msgid "Hm? An adventurer? Is this <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> an answer to my prayers?"
msgstr "А? Искатель приключений? Неужели этот <if $gn4>человек<else>человек</if> — ответ на мои молитвы?"

#. ja: ケナガウシを守る？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den zahmen Dzo beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Défendre le hainag<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
