msgctxt "FateEvent:378:0:58"
msgid "Did Azim send you?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Тебя послал Азим?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: きゃあっ！<br>きました！　恐ろしいガーダンが！
#. de: Oje, da kommen schon die wilden Raubtiere!
#. fr: Aaah, ils arrivent<nbsp>! Les gedans<nbsp>!
#. column 56: O, Dawn Father! Why must my herd be harried night and day!? Have I not said the right words? Have I not made the correct offerings?
#. column 57: Hm? An adventurer? Is this <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> an answer to my prayers?
#. column 58: Did Azim send you?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Damn you, Azim! Damn you and your deafened ears. I forsake you and embrace the Dusk Mother!
msgctxt "FateEvent:378:0:60"
msgid "Praise the sun and his light of mercy! "
msgstr "Слава солнцу и его милосердному свету! "

#. ja: そんな……。<br>ウチの可愛いケナガウシ……<br>大切に育てたのに、食べられちゃうんですね……。
#. de: Wie herzlos von dir. Willst du wirklich mitansehen, wie mein Tier von den Raubtieren zerfleischt wird?
#. fr: M-mais s'il n'y a personne pour le défendre, mon hainag chéri va se faire... Lui que j'ai élevé avec amour...
#. column 56: O, Dawn Father! Why must my herd be harried night and day!? Have I not said the right words? Have I not made the correct offerings?
#. column 57: Hm? An adventurer? Is this <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> an answer to my prayers?
#. column 58: Did Azim send you?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the sun and his light of mercy!
msgctxt "FateEvent:378:0:62"
msgid "Damn you, Azim! Damn you and your deafened ears. I forsake you and embrace the Dusk Mother!"
msgstr "Будь ты проклят, Азим! Прокляты и ты, и твои глухие уши. Отрекаюсь от тебя и примыкаю к Матери Сумерек!"

#. ja: 助けてほしいっちゃ！<br>仲間が悪いキキルンに連れて行かれたっちゃ！<br>このままじゃ、食べられちゃうっちゃ！
#. de: Mimiroon Hilfe brauchen. Böse Qiqirn haben Freunde von Mimiroon entführt!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Aventuuurière<else>Aventuuurier</if><nbsp>! Les méchants Qiqirns vouloir croc croc ami de Mimiroon touuut cruuu<nbsp>! Toi devoir aider<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Poorest Mimiroon is too lacking of thew to rescue them, but you, most wondrous of wanderers have thew and more! Assist Mimiroon, can you? Many sparklies shall I add to your purses.
#. column 58: Assist poorest Mimiroon?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh woest of woes! Will no wanderers save my woeful companions!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:379:0:56"
msgid "Oh wanderling wanderer, poorest Mimiroon is in most dire need of helping. My friends, they have been nipped up and napped away."
msgstr "О путник, о дивный путник, несчастному Мимируну срочно нужна помощь. Моих друзей схватили и утащили."

#. ja: 案内するから、助けてほしいっちゃ！<br>仲間が心配すぎて、ミミルン腹ぺこっちゃ！
#. de: Mimiroon Weg zeigen. Du Mimiroon helfen! Dann viel Glitzer geben!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Aventuuurière<else>Aventuuurier</if> suivre Mimiroon. Mimiroon guider jusqu'à méchants Qiqirns. Tant d'inquiétuuude... donner envie de miam miam à Mimiroon<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh wanderling wanderer, poorest Mimiroon is in most dire need of helping. My friends, they have been nipped up and napped away.
#. column 58: Assist poorest Mimiroon?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh woest of woes! Will no wanderers save my woeful companions!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:379:0:57"
msgid "Poorest Mimiroon is too lacking of thew to rescue them, but you, most wondrous of wanderers have thew and more! Assist Mimiroon, can you? Many sparklies shall I add to your purses."
msgstr "Мимирун слаб, друзей не спасти. Но ты, о чудесный путник, силой не обделён! Поможешь Мимируну? Я щедро награжу тебя блестяшками."

#. ja: 助けるっちゃ？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Freunde des Qiqirn befreien?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Mimiroon à sauver son ami<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh wanderling wanderer, poorest Mimiroon is in most dire need of helping. My friends, they have been nipped up and napped away.
#. column 57: Poorest Mimiroon is too lacking of thew to rescue them, but you, most wondrous of wanderers have thew and more! Assist Mimiroon, can you? Many sparklies shall I add to your purses.
#. column 62: Oh woest of woes! Will no wanderers save my woeful companions!?
