msgctxt "FateEvent:380:0:58"
msgid "You know what he is going to ask...<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Догадаться нетрудно, о чём он попросит...<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 仕方あるまい。<br>事の発端は、俺がだまされたのが悪いのだ。<br>どうにか、己独りで対処してみよう。
#. de: Das ist sehr bedauerlich. Zählt Gerechtigkeit denn so wenig in dieser Welt? Dann muss ich wohl allein für sie kämpfen.
#. fr: Je vois... Après tout, c'est ma faute, j'aurais dû être plus vigilant. Il va quand même falloir que je règle cette affaire, seul s'il le faut...
#. column 56: My tribe frowns upon those who lack the strength to solve their own dilemmas. However, I believe they will frown more so upon those who have lost an entire moon's worth of meat to treachery.
#. column 57: The Ura are rarely seen on the steppe, choosing to spend their days among the mountains of the north, mining for precious metals. They only come to Reunion to trade for food─something I was bid by my brothers to do, for we were in dire need of their stones. Yet the stones I was traded are nothing but ordinary rocks...and I am too weak to take back what is rightfully my tribe's. Unless...
#. column 58: You know what he is going to ask...<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:380:0:62"
msgid "Then I shall be banished for certain... Perhaps the Buduga will take me into their ranks..."
msgstr "Что ж, теперь меня точно изгонят... Может, будуга примут меня в свои ряды..."

#. ja: ねぇ、見て、あのオジちゃん。<br>ひんがしの国のコウシュウから、<br>武者修行のために、渡ってきたんだって。
#. de: Siehst du den Samurai? Er ist aus Koshu, der Hauptinsel von Hingashi, hierher gekommen. Er will zum besten Schwertkämpfer von Hingashi werden und sucht jemanden, mit dem er sich duellieren kann.
#. fr: Hé, regarde un peu le vieux samouraï, là-bas. Paraît qu'il est venu de Koshu exprès pour trouver des partenaires d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Pirates too busy chasin' Reds hither thither, they won't give even give the poor man a glance. I reckon I could help him test his medals, but Da forbids it. Hey...! You haven't the look of a pirate. Would you help the Hingan?
#. column 58: Test them medals?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Truly!? I can watch, can't I?
#. column 62: You're just like all the others...
msgctxt "FateEvent:381:0:56"
msgid "Ye see that old bladesman? Me da says he's a Hingan from Koshu. Says he's here to “test his medals.”"
msgstr "Видишь того старого мечника? Отец говорит, он из Косю, что в Хингаси. Приехал сюда «проверить свои медали»."

#. ja: でも、海賊衆の人たちは相手にしないから、<br>なんだか可哀想で……。<br>ねぇ、強そうな<if $gn4>お姉さん<else>お兄さん</if>、挑戦してあげて？
#. de: Aber die Piraten interessieren sich nicht für ehrenvolle Kämpfe mit einem Samurai. Die machen lieber Jagd auf die Kojin. Sag mal, willst du nicht mit ihm kämpfen?
#. fr: Tous les pirates l'ignorent, donc il me fait un peu de peine... Dis, tu as l'air de savoir te défendre, non<nbsp>? Et si tu l'affrontais<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Ye see that old bladesman? Me da says he's a Hingan from Koshu. Says he's here to “test his medals.”
#. column 58: Test them medals?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Truly!? I can watch, can't I?
#. column 62: You're just like all the others...
msgctxt "FateEvent:381:0:57"
msgid "Pirates too busy chasin' Reds hither thither, they won't give even give the poor man a glance. I reckon I could help him test his medals, but Da forbids it. Hey...! You haven't the look of a pirate. Would you help the Hingan? "
msgstr "Пираты сейчас только за красными гончарами и гоняются, на беднягу и не взглянут. Я бы и сам помог ему испытать медали, да отец не велит. Эй... Ты ведь не пират! Поможешь хингасцу?"

#. ja: 挑戦する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Mit dem Samurai duellieren?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Affronter le samouraï<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Ye see that old bladesman? Me da says he's a Hingan from Koshu. Says he's here to “test his medals.”
#. column 57: Pirates too busy chasin' Reds hither thither, they won't give even give the poor man a glance. I reckon I could help him test his medals, but Da forbids it. Hey...! You haven't the look of a pirate. Would you help the Hingan?
#. column 60: Truly!? I can watch, can't I?
#. column 62: You're just like all the others...
