#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:381:0:58"
msgid "Test them medals?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Испытать его медали?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: やった～！<br>オジちゃんと、<if $gn4>お姉さん<else>お兄さん</if>が戦うところ、<br>アタシ見て、応援するね！
#. de: Hurra! Das wird bestimmt ein spannender Kampf! Und ich kann zugucken!
#. fr: Ce vieil homme ne paye pas de mine, mais mon petit doigt me dit que ça va être intéressant...
#. column 56: Ye see that old bladesman? Me da says he's a Hingan from Koshu. Says he's here to “test his medals.”
#. column 57: Pirates too busy chasin' Reds hither thither, they won't give even give the poor man a glance. I reckon I could help him test his medals, but Da forbids it. Hey...! You haven't the look of a pirate. Would you help the Hingan?
#. column 58: Test them medals?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You're just like all the others...
msgctxt "FateEvent:381:0:60"
msgid "Truly!? I can watch, can't I?"
msgstr "Правда?! А я могу посмотреть?"

#. ja: そっか……。<br>オジちゃん、いつも相手にされなくて可哀想……。
#. de: Ach ja? Schade. Er kann einem richtig leidtun. Niemand will mit ihm kämpfen, dabei übt er immer so verbissen.
#. fr: Toi aussi<nbsp>? Décidément, ce vieil homme n'a vraiment pas de chance...
#. column 56: Ye see that old bladesman? Me da says he's a Hingan from Koshu. Says he's here to “test his medals.”
#. column 57: Pirates too busy chasin' Reds hither thither, they won't give even give the poor man a glance. I reckon I could help him test his medals, but Da forbids it. Hey...! You haven't the look of a pirate. Would you help the Hingan?
#. column 58: Test them medals?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Truly!? I can watch, can't I?
msgctxt "FateEvent:381:0:62"
msgid "You're just like all the others..."
msgstr "И ты такой же, как все..."

#. ja: 今日も、お魚いっぱい獲れたっぺよ！<br>でもでも、この辺りにいるコジャに、<br>いつもお魚、盗み食いされちゃうっぺな……。
#. de: Das war ein vortrefflicher Fffang heute! Wenn mich nur die Koja nicht immer bestehlen würden ...
#. fr: J'ai encore fait le plein de poissons aujourd'hui<nbsp>! Mais les méchants koja m'embêtent... Ils m'en chapardent toujours sur le chemin du retour...
#. column 57: But lo, what does seek to filch my fished fish but a giant head! A. Giant. Head! Look at poor Gyogun? Does this look like someone who might emerge triumphant in a clash with a giant head? No! But you do...
#. column 58: (Literally) butt heads with the hungry koja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Grrr!<br>...What! A Namazu needs not teeth to growl! These lips do just fine!
msgctxt "FateEvent:382:0:56"
msgid "A basket of fish I have here, a basket! One filled with fish fished not fish filched. No, no. Never filched!"
msgstr "Есть у меня целая корзина рыбы! Поймал сам, ничего не крал! Нет-нет, ни одной рыбки не крал!"

#. ja: オイラ、戦うのは苦手っぺよ。<br>旅のお方、ものすんごい褒めてあげるから、<br>悪さをするコジャを追い払ってほしいっぺな！
#. de: Kämpfffen liegt mir nicht so, aber dir vielleicht?
#. fr: Je ne suis pas très doué pour me battre. Voudrais-tu bien m'aider <if $gn4>voyageuse<else>voyageur</if><nbsp>? Je te couvrirai de louanges si tu empêches les koja de voler mon poisson<nbsp>!
#. column 56: A basket of fish I have here, a basket! One filled with fish fished not fish filched. No, no. Never filched!
#. column 58: (Literally) butt heads with the hungry koja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Grrr!<br>...What! A Namazu needs not teeth to growl! These lips do just fine!
msgctxt "FateEvent:382:0:57"
msgid "But lo, what does seek to filch my fished fish but a giant head! A. Giant. Head! Look at poor Gyogun? Does this look like someone who might emerge triumphant in a clash with a giant head? No! But you do..."
msgstr "Но гляньте, кто пришёл мою рыбу красть! Огромная голова! Огро-о-омная! Ну посмотрите на беднягу Гёгуна! Разве я похож на того, кто одолеет эту здоровенную башку? Нет! А вот ты — другое дело..."

#. ja: ナマズオを助ける？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Fang des Namazuo beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le Namazu<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: A basket of fish I have here, a basket! One filled with fish fished not fish filched. No, no. Never filched!
#. column 57: But lo, what does seek to filch my fished fish but a giant head! A. Giant. Head! Look at poor Gyogun? Does this look like someone who might emerge triumphant in a clash with a giant head? No! But you do...
#. column 62: Grrr!<br>...What! A Namazu needs not teeth to growl! These lips do just fine!
