msgid "(Literally) butt heads with the hungry koja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь голодным кояджа и буквально столкнуться с ними лбами?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ぺぺぺぺぺっ！<br>薄情な旅のお方っぺな……！<br>そんなヒトは、これっぽっちも褒めてあげないっぺよ！
#. de: \<spotz>! Und du willst <if $gn4>eine Abenteurerin<else>ein Abenteurer</if> sein?
#. fr: Q-q-quoi<nbsp>!? Quel cœur de pierre<nbsp>! Puisque c'est comme ça, je garde mes louanges pour moi<nbsp>! Na<nbsp>!
#. column 56: A basket of fish I have here, a basket! One filled with fish fished not fish filched. No, no. Never filched!
#. column 57: But lo, what does seek to filch my fished fish but a giant head! A. Giant. Head! Look at poor Gyogun? Does this look like someone who might emerge triumphant in a clash with a giant head? No! But you do...
#. column 58: (Literally) butt heads with the hungry koja?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
