#. macro: <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:385:0:56"
msgid "Ack! The hells-damned bastard's gone and gut me like a spring pig. If I move, I'm afraid me life'll spill right from me. If I <i>don't</i> move, that devil-spawn'll be back soon to sup on me lights and liver. Me only hope is <if $gn4>an angel<else>a savior</if> from distant shores... (That'd be you, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.)"
msgstr "Ай! Чёртов ублюдок распорол мне брюхо, как молодому поросёнку. Шевельнусь — и душа вон. А если <i>не</i> шевельнусь, эта тварь скоро вернётся полакомиться моей печенью и потрохами. Надежда у меня одна — <if $gn4>ангел<else>спаситель</if> из дальних краёв... (То есть ты, <if $gn4>красавица<else>красавчик</if>.)"

#. ja: 化け物退治に挑む？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Piraten vor dem riesigen Gyuki beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le pirate<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Ack! The hells-damned bastard's gone and gut me like a spring pig. If I move, I'm afraid me life'll spill right from me. If I <i>don't</i> move, that devil-spawn'll be back soon to sup on me lights and liver. Me only hope is <if $gn4>an angel<else>a savior</if> from distant shores... (That'd be you, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.)
#. column 60: Praise the moon, the son, and the other ones! Get me through this, and I'll see you're richly rewarded, I will.
#. column 62: Leave me to die here, will you? Well then be there a curse on you and yours! A pox on your mother and the rot on your father! And pox on your father's rot, to boot!
