msgctxt "FateEvent:385:0:57"
msgid "Play the <if $gn4>angel<else>savior</if>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поиграешь в <if $gn4>ангела<else>спасителя</if>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: いよっ、さすがだね、<if $gn4>姐さん<else>兄さん</if>！<br>化け物退治は、強者の証し、誉れなり！<br>頼んだぜぇ！
#. de: Danke, <if $gn4>Fremde<else>Fremder</if>! Ich hoffe, du bist dem Riesenvieh gewachsen!
#. fr: Ha ha, je savais que je m'adressais à la bonne personne<nbsp>! Merci, <if $gn4>aventurière<else>aventurier</if>, et à toi de jouer<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ack! The hells-damned bastard's gone and gut me like a spring pig. If I move, I'm afraid me life'll spill right from me. If I <i>don't</i> move, that devil-spawn'll be back soon to sup on me lights and liver. Me only hope is <if $gn4>an angel<else>a savior</if> from distant shores... (That'd be you, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.)
#. column 57: Play the <if $gn4>angel<else>savior</if>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Leave me to die here, will you? Well then be there a curse on you and yours! A pox on your mother and the rot on your father! And pox on your father's rot, to boot!
msgctxt "FateEvent:385:0:60"
msgid "Praise the moon, the son, and the other ones! Get me through this, and I'll see you're richly rewarded, I will."
msgstr "Да благословят тебя луна, солнце и все остальные светила! Выручишь меня — и я щедро тебя отблагодарю, вот увидишь."

#. ja: そうかい、そうかい……。<br><if $gn4>姐さん<else>兄さん</if>なら、引き受けてくれると思ったが、<br>俺に見る目がなかったってことだな……。
#. de: Du kannst mich doch nicht dieser Bestie ausliefern! Bitte, ich flehe dich an!
#. fr: Euh... Et qu'est-ce qu'on va faire avec ce truc dégueulasse, nous<nbsp>? Si ce monstre s'énerve et tue tout le monde, ça sera sur ta conscience<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ack! The hells-damned bastard's gone and gut me like a spring pig. If I move, I'm afraid me life'll spill right from me. If I <i>don't</i> move, that devil-spawn'll be back soon to sup on me lights and liver. Me only hope is <if $gn4>an angel<else>a savior</if> from distant shores... (That'd be you, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.)
#. column 57: Play the <if $gn4>angel<else>savior</if>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the moon, the son, and the other ones! Get me through this, and I'll see you're richly rewarded, I will.
msgctxt "FateEvent:385:0:62"
msgid "Leave me to die here, will you? Well then be there a curse on you and yours! A pox on your mother and the rot on your father! And pox on your father's rot, to boot!"
msgstr "Оставишь меня тут умирать, да? Будь ты проклят, и весь твой род! Чтоб твою мать чума побрала, а отца — гниль! И чтоб гниль эта ещё и чумой покрылась!"

#. ja: ハァ……ハァ……ハァ……助けてくれ……。<br>人狼族の野武士に、襲われて逃げてきたんだ。<br>アイツらときたら、同族だろうがお構いなしでな……。
#. de: \<keuch> ... \<schnauf> ... Bitte hilf mir! Ich werde von wilden Wolfsleuten verfolgt. Alleine werd ich mit denen nicht fertig.
#. fr: (souffle)... (souffle)... A-aide-moi... Des brigands m'ont attaqué. J'ai réussi à fuir, mais ils sont sur mes traces... Ahh... Ils ont pas hésité à s'en prendre à l'un des leurs, les moins-que-rien...
#. column 57: They, too, are of the Lupin, but they are not my brothers. They let their hunger control them, drive them to deeds most dark. I tried to set them right, but my words only fanned their flames of wrath. Might I ask your aid in slowing them? I fear I can run no longer...
#. column 58: Help Gaei Straightheart?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You see before you a man in need and instead of offering him your hand, you instead give him your back? You are no better than my fallen brothers. Begone! I shall fight my own battles and die proud.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:386:0:56"
msgid "Please... \\<pant> \\<pant><br>Do not be frightened. My name is Gaei Straightheart. I...\\<pant> \\<pant>...mean you no harm... I am pursued and seek succor."
msgstr "Прошу... <i>Тяжело дышит...</i><br>Не пугайтесь. Меня зовут Гаэй Честное Сердце. Я... <i>тяжело дышит</i>... не причиню вам вреда... За мной гонятся, прошу о помощи."

#. ja: ヤツらに追われたまま、村に逃げ帰るわけにもいかない。<br>ここでケリを付けたいんだが、助勢を頼めないか？<br>むろん、拙者も応戦する！
#. de: Und in mein Dorf darf ich sie auch nicht führen. Die Sache muss hier beendet werden.
#. fr: Je peux pas les laisser me suivre jusqu'au village. Ils le mettraient à sac. Tu veux bien m'aider à les vaincre<nbsp>? Bien sûr, je serai à tes côtés<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Please... \<pant> \<pant><br>Do not be frightened. My name is Gaei Straightheart. I...\<pant> \<pant>...mean you no harm... I am pursued and seek succor.
#. column 58: Help Gaei Straightheart?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You see before you a man in need and instead of offering him your hand, you instead give him your back? You are no better than my fallen brothers. Begone! I shall fight my own battles and die proud.
msgctxt "FateEvent:386:0:57"
msgid "They, too, are of the Lupin, but they are not my brothers. They let their hunger control them, drive them to deeds most dark. I tried to set them right, but my words only fanned their flames of wrath. Might I ask your aid in slowing them? I fear I can run no longer..."
msgstr "Они тоже люпины, но братьями я их не считаю. Они не владеют своим голодом и творят из-за него страшные вещи. Я пытался их образумить, но лишь разжёг их ярость. Поможете их остановить? Боюсь, дальше я уже не убегу..."

#. ja: 手助けする？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Wolfsmann beistehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le Lupin<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Please... \<pant> \<pant><br>Do not be frightened. My name is Gaei Straightheart. I...\<pant> \<pant>...mean you no harm... I am pursued and seek succor.
#. column 57: They, too, are of the Lupin, but they are not my brothers. They let their hunger control them, drive them to deeds most dark. I tried to set them right, but my words only fanned their flames of wrath. Might I ask your aid in slowing them? I fear I can run no longer...
#. column 62: You see before you a man in need and instead of offering him your hand, you instead give him your back? You are no better than my fallen brothers. Begone! I shall fight my own battles and die proud.
