msgctxt "FateEvent:386:0:58"
msgid "Help Gaei Straightheart?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь Гаэю Честное Сердце?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: それほどの力がありながら、<br>義のために、助勢を拒むというのか！？<br>野武士と同じく、心が荒んでいるということか……。
#. de: Du bist stark, und doch verweigerst du mir deine Hilfe? Aus Bequemlichkeit? Pah! Du bist nicht besser als diese wilden Wölfe ...
#. fr: Tu sais te battre, non<nbsp>!? Tu ne veux pas apporter un peu de justice dans ce monde de brutes<nbsp>!? Tu ne vaux pas mieux qu'eux...
#. column 56: Please... \<pant> \<pant><br>Do not be frightened. My name is Gaei Straightheart. I...\<pant> \<pant>...mean you no harm... I am pursued and seek succor.
#. column 57: They, too, are of the Lupin, but they are not my brothers. They let their hunger control them, drive them to deeds most dark. I tried to set them right, but my words only fanned their flames of wrath. Might I ask your aid in slowing them? I fear I can run no longer...
#. column 58: Help Gaei Straightheart?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:386:0:62"
msgid "You see before you a man in need and instead of offering him your hand, you instead give him your back? You are no better than my fallen brothers. Begone! I shall fight my own battles and die proud."
msgstr "Перед тобой человек, которому нужна помощь, а ты вместо руки подаёшь ему спину? Ты ничем не лучше моих павших братьев. Убирайся! Я сам буду сражаться в своих битвах и умру с гордо поднятой головой."

#. ja: …………。
#. de: ...
#. fr: ...
#. column 57: Help the Qestir?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: .........
msgctxt "FateEvent:387:0:56"
msgid "........."
msgstr "........."

#. ja: 詐欺師をたたき出して欲しいようだ。協力する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du den Betrüger bestrafen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Il a besoin d'un coup de main pour expulser un arnaqueur... Aider le marchand qestir<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: .........
#. column 62: .........
