msgid "Help the Qestir?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь кестиру?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: …………。
#. de: ...
#. fr: ...
#. column 56: .........
#. column 57: Help the Qestir?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:387:0:62"
msgid "........."
msgstr "........."

#. ja: 騙すより、騙される方が悪いんだよ！<br>ゴチャゴチャ因縁つけるつもりなら、<br>お前もブチのめしてやる！
#. de: Wer so blöd ist, sich betrügen zu lassen, ist doch selbst schuld! Und wenn du dich einmischst, hau ich dich zusammen!
#. fr: Dans ce monde, c'est duper ou être dupé<nbsp>! Pourquoi personne ne veut comprendre ça<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:388:0:56"
msgid "I took nothing from that tight-lipped lout that he wasn't already prepared to lose. And if he wasn't, then he shouldn't have been in the gambling tents to begin with!"
msgstr "Я ничего не отнял у этого молчуна — он сам был готов проиграть. А если нет, нечего было и соваться в шатры для азартных игр!"

#. ja: 紅甲羅の連中に、お宝を奪われちまってなぁ～。<br>取り返しにきたんだが、数が多くて手出しできないんだぁ～。<br>腕に覚えがあるなら、奪還してはくれんかねぇ～。
#. de: Unsere Altäre wurden wieder von den Rotpanzern geschändet! Hilf mir, die Schätze ...... zurückzuholen!
#. fr: Les Rouges nous ont volé notre butiiiin<nbsp>! Je suis venu pour essayer de reprendre ce qui nous appartient, mais je n'y arriverai jamais tout seuuuul<nbsp>! Pourrais-tu m'aider à ramasser tous ces cooooffres<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Might you fit the description of “brave warrior”?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your answer is not unexpected, but welcome nonetheless. The Red will have taken the relics they stole to their makeshift camps. We must retrieve the items before the Red return to their stronghold.
#. column 62: Your answer is...unexpected, yet I will not pass judgment.
msgctxt "FateEvent:389:0:56"
msgid "Our altars, they have once again been defiled at the hands of the Red. Would that a brave warrior accompany me in my righteous quest to retrieve them."
msgstr "Красные снова осквернили наши алтари. Не найдётся ли храброго воина, который поможет мне вернуть их?"

#. ja: 奪還に協力する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Blaupanzer helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le Kojin<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Our altars, they have once again been defiled at the hands of the Red. Would that a brave warrior accompany me in my righteous quest to retrieve them.
#. column 60: Your answer is not unexpected, but welcome nonetheless. The Red will have taken the relics they stole to their makeshift camps. We must retrieve the items before the Red return to their stronghold.
#. column 62: Your answer is...unexpected, yet I will not pass judgment.
