msgctxt "FateEvent:398:0:57"
msgid "Aid the well-spoken maiden?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь благородной девице?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: あ、ありがとうございます！
#. de: V-Vielen Dank!
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>!
#. column 56: \<pant> \<pant><br>Several men of ill intent harry mine every step. I would be in your debt if you were to scatter them to the four winds.
#. column 57: Aid the well-spoken maiden?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Your answer to my plea is...unexpected. The nature of your kind has changed much since I last walked these lands.
msgctxt "FateEvent:398:0:60"
msgid "My thanks, fellow traveler!"
msgstr "Благодарю тебя, странник!"

#. ja: なんと、もはやこれまで……<br>しかし無理強いはできません……。<br>どうか、あなただけでも、お逃げください。
#. de: D-Dann war's das wohl für mich. Mögest wenigstens du ihnen entkommen.
#. fr: Oh non, qu'est-ce que je vais faire...<nbsp>?
#. column 56: \<pant> \<pant><br>Several men of ill intent harry mine every step. I would be in your debt if you were to scatter them to the four winds.
#. column 57: Aid the well-spoken maiden?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: My thanks, fellow traveler!
msgctxt "FateEvent:398:0:62"
msgid "Your answer to my plea is...unexpected. The nature of your kind has changed much since I last walked these lands."
msgstr "Твой ответ... неожиданный. С тех пор как я в последний раз ходила по этим землям, твой народ сильно переменился."

#. ja: おお、旅のお方！<br>よい時にお声掛けくださった！
#. de: Ah, <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>! Dich müssen die Kami geschickt haben!
#. fr: Vous ne pouviez pas mieux tomber, <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if><nbsp>!
#. column 57: Not moments after placing the morning's offerings, were they snatched up by a school of naughty Namazu. I did my best to retrieve them, but the thieves were far too slippery for me to catch. Might I ask your assistance?
#. column 58: Aid the young maid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Fortune favors both the bold and the patient! I shall wait for you here while you try and find as many of the stolen offerings as you can.
#. column 62: Oh, how I have fallen... Too weak to flay a fish. Too pathetic to warrant succor from a stranger.
msgctxt "FateEvent:399:0:56"
msgid "An adventurer, you say?"
msgstr "Ты, говоришь, искатель приключений?"

#. ja: あの食いしん坊のナマズオたちを、懲らしめてくれ！<br>わしの大切な供物を、荒らしておるのだ！
#. de: Diese frechen Namazuo dort vorne haben mir meine Opfergaben gestohlen! Du musst sie zurückbeschaffen.
#. fr: J'avais cuisiné quelques plats pour les offrir aux kami, mais des Namazu affamés ont tout gâché<nbsp>! Je vous en prie, aidez-moi à récupérer ces offrandes<nbsp>!
#. column 56: An adventurer, you say?
#. column 58: Aid the young maid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Fortune favors both the bold and the patient! I shall wait for you here while you try and find as many of the stolen offerings as you can.
#. column 62: Oh, how I have fallen... Too weak to flay a fish. Too pathetic to warrant succor from a stranger.
msgctxt "FateEvent:399:0:57"
msgid "Not moments after placing the morning's offerings, were they snatched up by a school of naughty Namazu. I did my best to retrieve them, but the thieves were far too slippery for me to catch. Might I ask your assistance?"
msgstr "Едва я разложила утренние подношения, как их утащила целая стайка проказливых намазу. Я пыталась вернуть их, но воры оказались слишком проворными. Не поможешь ли мне?"

#. ja: 少女を助けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du dem Mädchen helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la fillette<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: An adventurer, you say?
#. column 57: Not moments after placing the morning's offerings, were they snatched up by a school of naughty Namazu. I did my best to retrieve them, but the thieves were far too slippery for me to catch. Might I ask your assistance?
#. column 60: Fortune favors both the bold and the patient! I shall wait for you here while you try and find as many of the stolen offerings as you can.
#. column 62: Oh, how I have fallen... Too weak to flay a fish. Too pathetic to warrant succor from a stranger.
