#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:399:0:58"
msgid "Aid the young maid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь юной деве?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、なんと頼もしいことか！<br>それではナマズオたちから、奪われた供物を取り返し、<br>わしのところまで、届けてくだされ！
#. de: Wie nett von dir! Luchs diesen Namazuo die Opfergaben wieder ab und bring sie mir!
#. fr: Merci de votre générosité<nbsp>! Vous pouvez ramasser mes offrandes par terre ou les arracher à ces vauriens de Namazu. Faites attention à vous<nbsp>!
#. column 56: An adventurer, you say?
#. column 57: Not moments after placing the morning's offerings, were they snatched up by a school of naughty Namazu. I did my best to retrieve them, but the thieves were far too slippery for me to catch. Might I ask your assistance?
#. column 58: Aid the young maid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, how I have fallen... Too weak to flay a fish. Too pathetic to warrant succor from a stranger.
msgctxt "FateEvent:399:0:60"
msgid "Fortune favors both the bold and the patient! I shall wait for you here while you try and find as many of the stolen offerings as you can."
msgstr "Удача благоволит смелым и терпеливым! Я подожду здесь, а ты постарайся отыскать как можно больше украденных подношений."

#. ja: ご無体な……いや、そもそも供物を奪われるがまま、<br>反撃すらできぬ、おのれの弱さが悪いのか……。
#. de: Unerhörter Frevel! Die Kami mögen dich ...! Obwohl, eigentlich ist es ja meine Schuld. Ich hätte mir die Opfergaben nicht stehlen lassen dürfen.
#. fr: Vous avez mieux à faire, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>? Ce n'est pas grave, je demanderai à quelqu'un d'autre de m'aider...
#. column 56: An adventurer, you say?
#. column 57: Not moments after placing the morning's offerings, were they snatched up by a school of naughty Namazu. I did my best to retrieve them, but the thieves were far too slippery for me to catch. Might I ask your assistance?
#. column 58: Aid the young maid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Fortune favors both the bold and the patient! I shall wait for you here while you try and find as many of the stolen offerings as you can.
msgctxt "FateEvent:399:0:62"
msgid "Oh, how I have fallen... Too weak to flay a fish. Too pathetic to warrant succor from a stranger."
msgstr "Ох, до чего я пала... Не могу даже рыбу освежевать. И настолько жалка, что даже чужак не захочет мне помочь."

#. ja: 奪われた供物は取り戻せましたかな？<br>あの食いしん坊のナマズオたちが持っているハズ……。<br>どうか、よろしくお頼み申す！
#. de: Du musst mir die Opfergaben von diesen frechen Namazuo zurückbesorgen! Sonst krieg ich den Zorn der Kami zu spüren!
#. fr: Vous pouvez ramasser mes offrandes par terre ou les arracher à ces vauriens de Namazu. Faites attention à vous<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:400:0:56"
msgid "It was the Namazu. I saw them hiding in the brush while I was tending to the altars, their eyes near to popping from their sockets in anticipation. I do not believe their actions were wrought from malice, but to steal from my mistress is to incur her wrath. The offerings must be retrieved...at any cost."
msgstr "Это были намазу. Пока я ухаживал за алтарями, видел, как они прятались в кустах, чуть не лопаясь от нетерпения. Не думаю, что ими двигала злоба, но воровство у моей госпожи навлечёт на них её гнев. Подношения нужно вернуть... любой ценой."

#. ja: おお、奪われた供物を取り戻してくださったか！<br>ではでは、さっそくわしに渡してくだされ！
#. de: Oh, du warst erfolgreich! Dann rück die Opfergaben mal raus!
#. fr: Avez-vous réussi à mettre la main sur mes offrandes<nbsp>? Montrez-moi ce que vous avez trouvé, s'il vous plaît.
#. column 60: Yes. These are the selfsame items I placed upon the altars but a bell past...though I fear many more still rest in the hands of thieves.
#. column 62: Then what is this sweet aroma of rice I detect? My imagination, perhaps.
msgctxt "FateEvent:401:0:56"
msgid "Were your efforts met with success, good adventurer?"
msgstr "Ну как, удалось что-нибудь найти, добрый искатель приключений?"

#. ja: ありがたい！<br>しかし、まだ供物は残っているはず……。<br>また取り返したら、わしのところまで届けてくだされ！
#. de: Danke, aber das sind noch nicht alle! Ich warte auf den Rest!
#. fr: Super<nbsp>! Ce sont bien les plats que j'avais préparés pour les kami. Il me semble qu'il y en avait d'autres, donc si jamais vous avez encore un peu de temps pour m'aider...
#. column 56: Were your efforts met with success, good adventurer?
#. column 62: Then what is this sweet aroma of rice I detect? My imagination, perhaps.
msgctxt "FateEvent:401:0:60"
msgid "Yes. These are the selfsame items I placed upon the altars but a bell past...though I fear many more still rest in the hands of thieves."
msgstr "Да. Это те самые вещи, что я положил на алтари всего колокола назад... Боюсь только, ещё много подношений осталось у воров."

#. ja: なにやら芳しい香りがした気がしたが、<br>気のせいであったか……。
#. de: Ich dachte, ich hätte was Süßes gerochen. Muss ich mir wohl eingebildet haben.
#. fr: Il m'avait pourtant semblé reconnaître l'odeur des plats que j'ai cuisinés... Tant pis, j'ai dû me tromper.
#. column 56: Were your efforts met with success, good adventurer?
#. column 60: Yes. These are the selfsame items I placed upon the altars but a bell past...though I fear many more still rest in the hands of thieves.
msgctxt "FateEvent:401:0:62"
msgid "Then what is this sweet aroma of rice I detect? My imagination, perhaps."
msgstr "Что-то мне почудился сладкий запах риса. Наверное, показалось."

#. ja: かなりの量を取り戻すことができたが、<br>もしも、供物を見つけた時には、わしに届けてくだされ！
#. de: Du warst schon sehr fleißig, aber wenn du noch mehr finden solltest, nehm ich sie dir natürlich ab!
#. fr: Vous avez déjà récupéré une bonne partie de mes offrandes, mais il en reste encore<nbsp>! Si jamais vous en trouvez d'autres, merci de me les amener.
msgctxt "FateEvent:402:0:56"
msgid "A good many of the offerings have been retrieved. I foresee no anger from my mistress. Still...I foresee no joy, for many of the items still remain in the hands of those damnable Namazu."
msgstr "Многие подношения уже удалось вернуть. Думаю, госпожа не разгневается. Но и радости не будет: немало вещей всё ещё у этих проклятых намазу."

#. ja: おお、奪われた供物を取り戻してくださったか！<br>ではでは、さっそくわしに渡してくだされ！
#. de: Oh, hast du Opfergaben gefunden? Ich nehm sie dir gerne ab!
#. fr: Oh, vous avez retrouvé d'autres offrandes<nbsp>? Merci de me les donner<nbsp>!
#. column 60: My humble thanks, adventurer. My mistress will find no fault with your noble effort this day.
#. column 62: Or not... I expected more from you, <i><string $gs1></i>.
msgctxt "FateEvent:403:0:56"
msgid "I sense you come bearing gifts!"
msgstr "Чую, ты пришёл не с пустыми руками!"

#. ja: ありがたい！<br>これだけ取り戻すことができれば充分だろう！<br>おぬしの尽力に感謝するぞ！
#. de: Danke! Das sind zwar nicht alle, aber mehr als genug! Mögen die Kami dich schützen!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if>, vous êtes vraiment <if $gn4>géniale<else>génial</if><nbsp>! Je ne sais pas comment vous remercier.
#. column 56: I sense you come bearing gifts!
#. column 62: Or not... I expected more from you, <i><string $gs1></i>.
msgctxt "FateEvent:403:0:60"
msgid "My humble thanks, adventurer. My mistress will find no fault with your noble effort this day."
msgstr "Смиренно благодарю тебя, искатель приключений. Сегодня госпоже не в чем будет упрекнуть тебя за твой благородный труд."

#. ja: しかし、あのナマズオたちめ……<br>あれだけの供物を、一気に運び去るとは、<br>おそるべき貪欲さよな……。
#. de: Diese verfluchten Namazuo. Sind etwa mit dem Rest schon über alle Berge?
#. fr: Quand je pense à ces vauriens de Namazu... Qu'est-ce qu'ils comptaient faire avec tout ça<nbsp>? Ils ont vraiment les yeux plus gros que le ventre<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I sense you come bearing gifts!
#. column 60: My humble thanks, adventurer. My mistress will find no fault with your noble effort this day.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:403:0:62"
msgid "Or not... I expected more from you, <i><string $gs1></i>."
msgstr "Или нет... Я ожидал от тебя большего, <i><string $gs1></i>."

#. ja: それ以上近づくな……<br>妾は……妾は……！
#. de: Keinen Schritt näher, sonst ... Sonst ...!
#. fr: Attention<nbsp>!!! Ne vous approchez surtout pas<nbsp>!!!
#. column 57: Make it your concern?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Begone then! Before the fox...takes control...!
msgctxt "FateEvent:404:0:56"
msgid "Stop! Do not come any further. This matter does not concern you."
msgstr "Стой! Дальше не подходи. Тебя это не касается."

#. ja: 仲裁に入りますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Einschreiten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Intervenir<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Stop! Do not come any further. This matter does not concern you.
#. column 62: Begone then! Before the fox...takes control...!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
