msgctxt "FateEvent:436:0:58"
msgid "Join forces with J'najaq?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь Дж'наджак?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか……。<br>ならば、このまま死ぬ覚悟で、<br>ひとり挑むしかあるまいな……！
#. de: Dann werde ich meine Fehler alleine ausbügeln müssen.
#. fr: Puisqu'il en est ainsi,  je vais tenter d'assouvirrr ma vengeance seule. Rhalgr sera témoin de mes derniers instants<nbsp>!
#. column 56: My unarmed sister was assailed while she gathered water for the village. It was my duty to protect her, but my training has failed me, and now I have failed my tribe.
#. column 57: When I was younger, my pride would have prevented me from asking the aid of stranger; however, a lifetime of war has taught me pride does not bring victory, companions do. Adventurer, would you stand with me against those that dared harm my kin?
#. column 58: Join forces with J'najaq?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:436:0:62"
msgid "Thank you, traveler. You have reminded me that this mistake is mine and I must face its consequences alone."
msgstr "Спасибо, путник. Ты напомнил мне: виновата я, и одна должна понести за это наказание."

#. ja: 調理するために、大量の魚を運んで来たんだけど、<br>その匂いをスニッパーどもが、嗅ぎつけたようなんだ……。
#. de: Für unsere Feuermond-Grillparty habe ich fünf Kisten Fisch organisiert, doch der wohlige Geruch hat leider ein paar ungebetene Gäste auf den Plan gerufen.
#. fr: J'ai transporté du poisson en grande quantité jusqu'ici pour qu'il soit cuisiné, mais les odeurs attirent les cisailleurs...
#. column 57: If they get their claws on my fish, my merchant days are over! Please, for me and for the faire, kill every last one of those foul scavengers!
#. column 58: Help slay the snippers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, thank you so very much. I'm relying on you, and so is the Moonfire Faire!
#. column 62: No... No, it can't be! Do you have any idea how much gil I spent on all those fish!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:437:0:56"
msgid "I'm delivering all these fish to the faire kitchens, but some snippers have caught the scent."
msgstr "Я везу всю эту рыбу на кухню праздника, но снитперы учуяли её запах."

#. ja: もしも魚を食べられちまったら、商売あがったりだよ。<br>お願いだ、魔物退治を請け負ってくれないかい？
#. de: Wenn die Schnippler uns den Fisch auffuttern, wird nichts aus der Feier für all die Kaskadeure, die so fleißig beim Fest mithelfen.
#. fr: Nos ventes auront bonne mine s'ils devorent toute la marchandise...<nbsp>! Tu ne voudrais pas nous débarrasser de ces sales bêtes<nbsp>?
#. column 56: I'm delivering all these fish to the faire kitchens, but some snippers have caught the scent.
#. column 58: Help slay the snippers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, thank you so very much. I'm relying on you, and so is the Moonfire Faire!
#. column 62: No... No, it can't be! Do you have any idea how much gil I spent on all those fish!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:437:0:57"
msgid "If they get their claws on my fish, my merchant days are over! Please, for me and for the faire, kill every last one of those foul scavengers!"
msgstr "Если они доберутся до моей рыбы, мне конец как торговцу! Прошу, ради меня и ради праздника, перебей всех этих мерзких падальщиков!"

#. ja: 魔物退治を請け負う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Schwingst du dich <if $gn4>zur Retterin<else>zum Retter</if> des Freiluftgrillens auf?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Chasser les monstres<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I'm delivering all these fish to the faire kitchens, but some snippers have caught the scent.
#. column 57: If they get their claws on my fish, my merchant days are over! Please, for me and for the faire, kill every last one of those foul scavengers!
#. column 60: Thank you, thank you so very much. I'm relying on you, and so is the Moonfire Faire!
#. column 62: No... No, it can't be! Do you have any idea how much gil I spent on all those fish!?
