msgctxt "FateEvent:437:0:58"
msgid "Help slay the snippers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь расправиться со снитперами?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとう……！<br>頼りにしているよ、冒険者さん！
#. de: Danke! Wir zählen auf dich, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>!
#. fr: Merci bien<nbsp>! Je compte sur toi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I'm delivering all these fish to the faire kitchens, but some snippers have caught the scent.
#. column 57: If they get their claws on my fish, my merchant days are over! Please, for me and for the faire, kill every last one of those foul scavengers!
#. column 58: Help slay the snippers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: No... No, it can't be! Do you have any idea how much gil I spent on all those fish!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:437:0:60"
msgid "Thank you, thank you so very much. I'm relying on you, and so is the Moonfire Faire!"
msgstr "Спасибо, тысячу раз спасибо! Я на тебя рассчитываю, и весь Праздник Огненной Луны тоже!"

#. ja: そ、そんな……！<br>この魚を仕入れるのに、大金を使ったんだよ！？
#. de: Wie herzlos ...
#. fr: T-tu n'as pas idée de ce que ça nous a coûté pour faire venir tout ce poisson<nbsp>! Nos finances ne s'en remettront jamais<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I'm delivering all these fish to the faire kitchens, but some snippers have caught the scent.
#. column 57: If they get their claws on my fish, my merchant days are over! Please, for me and for the faire, kill every last one of those foul scavengers!
#. column 58: Help slay the snippers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, thank you so very much. I'm relying on you, and so is the Moonfire Faire!
msgctxt "FateEvent:437:0:62"
msgid "No... No, it can't be! Do you have any idea how much gil I spent on all those fish!?"
msgstr "Нет... Не может быть! Ты хоть представляешь, сколько гил я потратил на всю эту рыбу?!"

#. ja: やれやれ、客が多いのはいいことだが、<br>こうも汚されてしまうと、せっかくの景観が台無しだ。<br>ゲゲルジュ氏も、悲しむことだろう。
#. de: Viele Gäste sind ja schön und gut, aber der ganze Müll? Gegeruju wird es das Herz brechen, wenn er diese Sauerei sieht.
#. fr: On accueille pas mal de touristes pendant les festivités, et c'est plutôt une bonne chose, mais certains jettent leurs ordures n'importe où. Je suis sûr que Gegeruju ragerait de voir ça... On ne peut pas laisser les détritus gâcher le paysage<nbsp>!
#. column 57: I wonder, will you help us set things right? We mean to gather all this rubbish and return the beach to its true beauty.
#. column 58: Help gather rubbish?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have a good heart, adventurer. But be warned─there are wild colibri feeding amongst the rubbish and they don't take kindly to having a meal interrupted. If you come across any, you'll have to put them down.
#. column 62: A noble effort, but a pity nonetheless. Now then, what to do with all this rubbish...
msgctxt "FateEvent:438:0:56"
msgid "I'm all for a bustling faire, but we can't abide this litter to ruin the isle beaches. Gegeruju would be in tears if he saw this sight."
msgstr "Я только рад, что на праздник пришло столько гостей, но нельзя же позволять мусору портить пляжи острова. Гегеруджу бы расплакался, увидев такое."

#. ja: すまないが君……美しさを取り戻すためにも、<br>ゴミ集めに協力してもらえないか？
#. de: Und dir doch sicher auch, oder? Hilfst du uns, den Strand zu säubern?
#. fr: Tu ne voudrais pas nous donner un petit coup de main et rendre à cette plage sa beauté d'origine<nbsp>?
#. column 56: I'm all for a bustling faire, but we can't abide this litter to ruin the isle beaches. Gegeruju would be in tears if he saw this sight.
#. column 58: Help gather rubbish?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have a good heart, adventurer. But be warned─there are wild colibri feeding amongst the rubbish and they don't take kindly to having a meal interrupted. If you come across any, you'll have to put them down.
#. column 62: A noble effort, but a pity nonetheless. Now then, what to do with all this rubbish...
msgctxt "FateEvent:438:0:57"
msgid "I wonder, will you help us set things right? We mean to gather all this rubbish and return the beach to its true beauty."
msgstr "Поможешь нам всё исправить? Соберём весь мусор и вернём пляжу его первозданную красоту."

#. ja: ゴミ集めを手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Quasi umsonst für einen stinkreichen Pascha arbeiten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Ramasser les détritus<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I'm all for a bustling faire, but we can't abide this litter to ruin the isle beaches. Gegeruju would be in tears if he saw this sight.
#. column 57: I wonder, will you help us set things right? We mean to gather all this rubbish and return the beach to its true beauty.
#. column 60: You have a good heart, adventurer. But be warned─there are wild colibri feeding amongst the rubbish and they don't take kindly to having a meal interrupted. If you come across any, you'll have to put them down.
#. column 62: A noble effort, but a pity nonetheless. Now then, what to do with all this rubbish...
