msgctxt "FateEvent:438:0:58"
msgid "Help gather rubbish?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать мусор?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか、やってくれるか！<br>ゴミを食い荒らそうとする、コリブリもいるようでな。<br>見つけたら、力尽くで追い払ってくれよ。
#. de: Danke, wie überaus freundlich! Sammle den Müll auf und bring ihn zu mir. Und lass dir nicht von den Kolibris auf den Kopf koten!
#. fr: Merveilleux<nbsp>! Fais attention en ramassant les ordures parce que leur odeur a attiré des colibris. Si tu en aperçois, n'hésite pas à les chasser d'ici.
#. column 56: I'm all for a bustling faire, but we can't abide this litter to ruin the isle beaches. Gegeruju would be in tears if he saw this sight.
#. column 57: I wonder, will you help us set things right? We mean to gather all this rubbish and return the beach to its true beauty.
#. column 58: Help gather rubbish?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A noble effort, but a pity nonetheless. Now then, what to do with all this rubbish...
msgctxt "FateEvent:438:0:60"
msgid "You have a good heart, adventurer. But be warned─there are wild colibri feeding amongst the rubbish and they don't take kindly to having a meal interrupted. If you come across any, you'll have to put them down."
msgstr "У тебя доброе сердце, искатель приключений. Но берегись: среди мусора кормятся дикие колибри, и они не любят, когда им мешают. Если встретишь их, придётся их прикончить."

#. ja: そうか、残念だよ……。<br>さて、これだけの量のゴミをどうしたものか……。
#. de: Und was mach ich jetzt? Auf die nächste Flut warten?
#. fr: C'est bien dommage... Enfin bon, avec ou sans toi, il faudra bien que je trouve un moyen de nettoyer toutes ces ordures !
#. column 56: I'm all for a bustling faire, but we can't abide this litter to ruin the isle beaches. Gegeruju would be in tears if he saw this sight.
#. column 57: I wonder, will you help us set things right? We mean to gather all this rubbish and return the beach to its true beauty.
#. column 58: Help gather rubbish?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have a good heart, adventurer. But be warned─there are wild colibri feeding amongst the rubbish and they don't take kindly to having a meal interrupted. If you come across any, you'll have to put them down.
msgctxt "FateEvent:438:0:62"
msgid "A noble effort, but a pity nonetheless. Now then, what to do with all this rubbish..."
msgstr "Жаль, конечно... Ну и что теперь делать со всей этой кучей мусора..."

#. ja: 「紅蓮祭のゴミ」は、集めて来てくれたか？
#. de: Hast du etwas von dem Müll aufgesammelt?
#. fr: Alors ces détritus, tu en as ramassé<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Thank you! There is still a great deal left out there, though. Bring back some more and let us make this beach beautiful again.
#. column 62: Are you planning to take that rubbish home with you? I suppose I have no objections, but...
msgctxt "FateEvent:439:0:56"
msgid "Have you brought some of the rubbish you've gathered for collection?"
msgstr "Принёс что-нибудь из собранного мусора?"

#. ja: ありがとう！<br>まだゴミが残っているようなら、持って来てくれ。
#. de: Danke! Ich glaube, da liegt noch mehr!
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Si tu en vois d'autres, n'hésite pas à les ramasser et à me les apporter<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you brought some of the rubbish you've gathered for collection?
#. column 62: Are you planning to take that rubbish home with you? I suppose I have no objections, but...
msgctxt "FateEvent:439:0:60"
msgid "Thank you! There is still a great deal left out there, though. Bring back some more and let us make this beach beautiful again."
msgstr "Спасибо! Вон там ещё, похоже, много осталось. Приноси ещё, вместе сделаем этот пляж красивым!"

#. ja: ふむ、そのゴミを持ち帰ろうと？<br>それなら構わないが……。
#. de: Du willst ihn für dich behalten? Auch gut, aber lad ihn nicht hinter dem nächsten Busch ab!
#. fr: Si tu en as ramassé il vaut mieux me les donner, tu sais. Enfin tu peux aussi les jeter chez toi si tu préfères, mais je ne vois pas l'intérêt puisque tu peux le faire ici...
#. column 56: Have you brought some of the rubbish you've gathered for collection?
#. column 60: Thank you! There is still a great deal left out there, though. Bring back some more and let us make this beach beautiful again.
msgctxt "FateEvent:439:0:62"
msgid "Are you planning to take that rubbish home with you? I suppose I have no objections, but..."
msgstr "Хочешь забрать мусор домой? Что ж, я не против, но..."

#. ja: せっかくの景観なのだから、<br>美しく保ちたいのが人情というものだろう？
#. de: Ein solch schöner Strand! Den können wir doch nicht einfach so vor die Hunde gehen lassen!
#. fr: On a la chance de pouvoir profiter d'un endroit avec une vue sublime. Ce serait bien si nos semblables pouvaient garder une attitude acceptable...
msgctxt "FateEvent:440:0:56"
msgid "It is such a breath-taking beach. What living soul would not wish to preserve such natural beauty?"
msgstr "Пляж-то загляденье. Разве найдётся хоть одна живая душа, что не пожелает сохранить такую красоту?"

#. ja: おお、またゴミを集めて来てくれたのか！
#. de: Oh, du hast noch mehr Müll?
#. fr: Ne me dis pas que tu as rempli d'autres sacs de détritus<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Splendid! Thanks to you, this beach will be beautiful once again!
#. column 62: Are you planning to take that rubbish home with you? I suppose I have no objections, but...
msgctxt "FateEvent:441:0:56"
msgid "Well done! You are tireless in your efforts."
msgstr "Отличная работа! Ты прямо неутомим."

#. ja: ありがとう！<br>おかげで美しい景観が戻ってきたよ。
#. de: Danke! Jetzt ist der Strand wieder vorzeigbar!
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! C'est grâce à toi si cette plage reste aussi belle qu'à notre arrivée.
#. column 56: Well done! You are tireless in your efforts.
#. column 62: Are you planning to take that rubbish home with you? I suppose I have no objections, but...
msgctxt "FateEvent:441:0:60"
msgid "Splendid! Thanks to you, this beach will be beautiful once again!"
msgstr "Прекрасно! Благодаря тебе пляж снова станет красивым!"

#. ja: ふむ、そのゴミを持ち帰ろうと？<br>それなら構わないが……。
#. de: Wenn du willst, behalte ihn ruhig. Aber schön entsorgen, hörst du?
#. fr: Si tu as ramassé des ordures il vaut mieux me les donner, tu sais. Enfin tu peux aussi les jeter chez toi si tu préfères, mais je ne vois pas l'intérêt puisque tu peux le faire ici...
#. column 56: Well done! You are tireless in your efforts.
#. column 60: Splendid! Thanks to you, this beach will be beautiful once again!
msgctxt "FateEvent:441:0:62"
msgid "Are you planning to take that rubbish home with you? I suppose I have no objections, but..."
msgstr "Хочешь забрать мусор домой? Что ж, я не против, но..."

#. ja: うむ、ずいぶんと美しさが戻ってきたようだ。<br>しかし、まだゴミが残っているかもしれない……。<br>もしもまた見かけたら、持って来てくれたまえ。
#. de: Ja, der Strand sieht schon wieder ganz ordentlich aus. Aber es könnte noch etwas Müll rumliegen. Hast du auch jedes Sandkorn umgedreht?
#. fr: J'ai bien l'impression que la plage est par<shy>fai<shy>te<shy>ment propre maintenant, mais on ne sait jamais. Il reste peut-être des ordures, et certaines personnes se permettront peut-être d'en abandonner à nouveau. Si tu en vois, tu sais quoi faire...
msgctxt "FateEvent:442:0:56"
msgid "Already the beauty of this place is much restored. But there is still rubbish to be collected, which means there is still work to be done. Bring me whatever refuse you can find."
msgstr "Это место уже почти вернуло свою красоту. Но мусор ещё остался, а значит, работы не закончены. Приноси всё, что ещё найдёшь."

#. ja: サイクロプスに餅をつかせるまでは良かったんだが……。<br>空飛ぶ猫どもが押し寄せてきて、<br>えれぇ騒ぎなんだ！
#. de: Alles lief nach Plan, bis diese fliegenden Pelzknäuel hier aufgekreuzt sind. Selbst der Donnerschlag des Hammers des Zyklopen konnte sie nicht vertreiben!
#. fr: Tout aurait pu se passer à merveille... si seulement ces empêcheurs de faire du mochi en rond de chats n'avaient pas débarqué pour tout mettre sens dessus dessous<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Please, you must reach the mortar and save what mochi you can for the festival.
#. column 58: Assist with retrieving the mochi?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Of course, I understand. To risk life and limb avoiding the cyclops's earth-shattering hammer is one thing, but to do so while avoiding those winged hellcats may well be impossible.
msgctxt "FateEvent:443:0:56"
msgid "All was proceeding according to plan until these flying furballs came. Even the thunderous blows of the cyclops's hammer have failed to drive them off. "
msgstr "Всё шло по плану, пока не налетели эти летающие меховые комки. Даже громовые удары молота циклопа их не прогнали."

#. ja: どうにかして「降神祭の臼」まで近づいて、<br>つきたての「降神餅」を回収してくれねぇか！？
#. de: Bitte, du musst zum Mörser gelangen und für das Fest so viel Mochi wie möglich retten.
#. fr: Tu nous rendrais un grand service en t'approchant du mortier pour ramasser des mochi... Plus tu en récupèreras, mieux ce sera, mais fais attention à ne pas te faire aplatir comme une crêpe<nbsp>!
#. column 56: All was proceeding according to plan until these flying furballs came. Even the thunderous blows of the cyclops's hammer have failed to drive them off.
#. column 58: Assist with retrieving the mochi?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Of course, I understand. To risk life and limb avoiding the cyclops's earth-shattering hammer is one thing, but to do so while avoiding those winged hellcats may well be impossible.
msgctxt "FateEvent:443:0:57"
msgid "Please, you must reach the mortar and save what mochi you can for the festival."
msgstr "Прошу, проберись к ступе и спаси сколько сможешь праздничного моти."

#. ja: 手伝いますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Bereitest du dem Katzenjammer ein Ende?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider cet homme ?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: All was proceeding according to plan until these flying furballs came. Even the thunderous blows of the cyclops's hammer have failed to drive them off.
#. column 57: Please, you must reach the mortar and save what mochi you can for the festival.
#. column 62: Of course, I understand. To risk life and limb avoiding the cyclops's earth-shattering hammer is one thing, but to do so while avoiding those winged hellcats may well be impossible.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:443:0:58"
msgid "Assist with retrieving the mochi?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать моти?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そ、そうか……。<br>確かにあの飛猫と戦うのは大変そうだし、<br>尻込みするのも無理はねぇよな……。
#. de: Keine Sorge, ich verstehe dich. Sein Leben riskieren und dem knochenbrechenden Hammer des Zyklopen auszuweichen ist eine Sache. Dazu noch diesen geflügelten Tatzen zu entrinnen mag ein Ding der Unmöglichkeit sein.
#. fr: Pas de problème, je te comprends... Moi-même, quand je vois ces félins assoifés de sang, j'ai bien envie de prendre mes jambes à mon cou<nbsp>!
#. column 56: All was proceeding according to plan until these flying furballs came. Even the thunderous blows of the cyclops's hammer have failed to drive them off.
#. column 57: Please, you must reach the mortar and save what mochi you can for the festival.
#. column 58: Assist with retrieving the mochi?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:443:0:62"
msgid "Of course, I understand. To risk life and limb avoiding the cyclops's earth-shattering hammer is one thing, but to do so while avoiding those winged hellcats may well be impossible."
msgstr "Конечно, понимаю. Увернуться от сокрушительного молота циклопа — уже нелегко, а если ещё и от этих крылатых демонов спасаться, так вообще невыполнимая задача."

#. ja: 「降神餅」を回収できたみてえだな。<br>よし、俺に渡してくれ！
#. de: Ist das etwa eines der geheiligten Mochi in deinen Händen?
#. fr: Montre-moi tous ces bons mochi que tu as réussi à récupérer<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Well done. We've collected a considerable amount thus far, but one can never have too much mochi. Pray retrieve as much as you can.
#. column 62: Do you mean to hold it for safekeeping until later? Then I pray you have more when you return.
msgctxt "FateEvent:444:0:56"
msgid "Ah, is that mochi I see in your hands?"
msgstr "А, это у тебя моти?"

#. ja: 確かに受け取ったぜ、ありがとよ！<br>けど、振る舞う餅は、多ければ多いほどいいもんだ。<br>よかったら、もっと回収してきてくれよな！
#. de: Saubere Arbeit! Wir haben bereits jede Menge Mochi vor diesen Katzentatzen gerettet, aber man kann nie genug haben. Mach weiter und dieses Fest wird ein Erfolg!
#. fr: Excellent, merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Évidemment, plus il y en aura, plus les gens seront contents... Tu veux bien aller en chercher un peu plus<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Ah, is that mochi I see in your hands?
#. column 62: Do you mean to hold it for safekeeping until later? Then I pray you have more when you return.
msgctxt "FateEvent:444:0:60"
msgid "Well done. We've collected a considerable amount thus far, but one can never have too much mochi. Pray retrieve as much as you can."
msgstr "Отлично. Мы уже собрали немало, но моти много не бывает. Постарайся добыть как можно больше."

#. ja: ……「降神餅」を渡さないたぁ、何か考えがあるのか？<br>それならいいが、あとでちゃんと渡してくれよ！
#. de: Möchtest du dir etwa eine Portion Mochi als Wegzehrung aufbewahren? Ich hoffe, du bringst uns später noch mehr.
#. fr: Qu'est-ce qu'il y a<nbsp>? Tu veux tout garder pour toi tout<if $gn4>e</if> seul<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>? Ta mère ne t'a donc jamais dit que la gourmandise était un vilain défaut<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Ah, is that mochi I see in your hands?
#. column 60: Well done. We've collected a considerable amount thus far, but one can never have too much mochi. Pray retrieve as much as you can.
msgctxt "FateEvent:444:0:62"
msgid "Do you mean to hold it for safekeeping until later? Then I pray you have more when you return."
msgstr "Ты решил пока оставить лепёшки себе? Что ж, надеюсь, когда вернёшься, у тебя будет ещё."

#. ja: どうにかして「降神祭の臼」まで近づいて、<br>つきたての「降神餅」を回収してくれ！<br>よろしく頼んだぜ！
#. de: Bitte, du musst zum Mörser gelangen und für das Fest so viel Mochi wie möglich retten.
#. fr: Tu nous rendrais un grand service en t'approchant du mortier pour ramasser des mochi... Plus tu en récupèreras, mieux ce sera, mais fais attention à ne pas te faire aplatir comme une crêpe<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:445:0:56"
msgid "Please, you must reach the mortar and save what mochi you can for the festival."
msgstr "Прошу, проберись к ступе и спаси сколько сможешь праздничного моти."

#. ja: 結構な量を回収できたが、<br>振る舞う餅は、多ければ多いほどいいもんだ。<br>まだ「降神餅」を持ってるようなら、俺が受け取るぜ。
#. de: Saubere Arbeit! Wir haben bereits jede Menge Mochi vor diesen Katzentatzen gerettet, aber man kann nie genug haben. Mach weiter und dieses Fest wird ein Erfolg!
#. fr: Tu as déjà récupéré un sacré paquet de mochi, mais plus il y en aura, plus les gens seront contents... N'hésite pas à en ramener davantage si le cœur t'en dit.
#. column 60: Thank you, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. You have met and exceeded all expectations.
#. column 62: You don't mean to eat that yourself, do you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:446:0:56"
msgid "Well done. We've secured a sufficient store thus far, but one can never have too much mochi. Pray retrieve as much as you can."
msgstr "Отлично. Мы уже запасли достаточно моти, но его много не бывает. Постарайся добыть как можно больше."

#. ja: 「降神餅」、確かに受け取ったぜ！<br>回収してくれて、ありがとよ！
#. de: Vielen Dank, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Du hast all unsere Erwartungen übertroffen!
#. fr: Merci, merci et encore merci<nbsp>! Cette fête de la transition s'annonce des plus gluantes, hé hé<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Well done. We've secured a sufficient store thus far, but one can never have too much mochi. Pray retrieve as much as you can.
#. column 62: You don't mean to eat that yourself, do you?
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "FateEvent:446:0:60"
msgid "Thank you, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. You have met and exceeded all expectations."
msgstr "Спасибо, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. Ты оправдал все ожидания и даже превзошёл их."

#. ja: ……どうした、「降神餅」を渡してくれねぇのかい？
#. de: Du willst jetzt nicht all diese Mochi für dich behalten, oder?
#. fr: Qu'est-ce qu'il y a<nbsp>? Tu veux tout garder pour toi tout<if $gn4>e</if> seul<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>? Ta mère ne t'a donc jamais dit que la gourmandise était un vilain défaut<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Well done. We've secured a sufficient store thus far, but one can never have too much mochi. Pray retrieve as much as you can.
#. column 60: Thank you, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. You have met and exceeded all expectations.
msgctxt "FateEvent:446:0:62"
msgid "You don't mean to eat that yourself, do you?"
msgstr "Ты же не собираешься съесть всё это сам?"

#. ja: 結構な量の「降神餅」が回収できた。<br>これで「降神祭」も上手くいくってものさ！
#. de: Mit all dem geretteten Mochi in unserem Lager wird das Fest bestimmt ein voller Erfolg!
#. fr: Grâce à toi, nous avons assez de mochi pour un régiment<nbsp>! Il va falloir préparer suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment d'eau pour tous ceux qui s'étoufferont avec<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:447:0:56"
msgid "With our present stores of mochi, the festival is certain to be a success!"
msgstr "Теперь моти у нас достаточно, чтобы праздник наверняка удался!"

#. ja: このあたりで、「機械仕掛けの兵士」が目撃されたって噂、<br>あんたも、気になるのか？
#. de: Oh, du bist wohl auch hier, um dir die MI anzusehen, was?
#. fr: Oh, c'est toi. Les rumeurs t'intéressent aussi<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Lie in wait with Noctis?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Huh, then what're you doin' here?
msgctxt "FateEvent:448:0:56"
msgid "Oh, hey. Curious about the MTs too, are you?"
msgstr "О, привет. Тебя тоже боевые машины заинтересовали?"

#. ja: 「機械仕掛けの兵士」が気になる？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Mit Noctis auf die Lauer legen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Enquêter sur les soldats de fer avec Noctis<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, hey. Curious about the MTs too, are you?
#. column 62: Huh, then what're you doin' here?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:448:0:57"
msgid "Lie in wait with Noctis?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Подкараулить их вместе с Ноктисом?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: なんだよ、ちげーのかよ……。
#. de: Dann hast du hier nichts zu suchen.
#. fr: Ah bon, je croyais... Tant pis.
#. column 56: Oh, hey. Curious about the MTs too, are you?
#. column 57: Lie in wait with Noctis?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:448:0:62"
msgid "Huh, then what're you doin' here?"
msgstr "А, тогда чего ты здесь торчишь?"

#. ja: 見てくれ、この大量の陶器片を！<br>これは「常闇の愛し子」の連中が毒作りに使い、<br>そのまま投棄していった「毒壺の欠片」なんだ。
#. de: Sieh dir nur diese ganzen Scherben an! Das waren einst Tongefäße, in denen die Kinder der Ewigen Dunkelheit ihr Gift aufbewahrten<nbsp>... Und dann warfen sie sie einfach hier im Wald ab! Es ist nicht zu fassen.
#. fr: Regarde-moi tous ces fragments de poterie<nbsp>! Ce sont des morceaux de flacons que les enfants des Ténèbres éternelles utilisaient pour fabriquer le poison...
#. column 57: Now they are all smashed, and the flamingos have taken to swallowing the fragments! Now, I do not know a lot about poison or disease, but we cannot afford for these birds to spread any sort of foulness throughout the Greatwood. Will you help me gather the pieces?
#. column 58: Gather poison urn fragments?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh dear... How am I going to do this alone?
msgctxt "FateEvent:449:0:56"
msgid "Would you look at this mess! This is the work of the Children of the Everlasting Dark, no doubt about it. What's worse, these old urns were once full of poison for whatever nefarious deeds they have been carrying out."
msgstr "Ну и беспорядок! Это, без сомнения, дело рук Детей Вечной Тьмы. А эти старые урны когда-то были полны яда — знать бы ещё, для каких злодеяний они его готовили."

#. ja: しかも、餌だと誤認したのか、<br>フラミンゴが欠片を飲み込んでしまったようでな。<br>森全体に汚染が広がる前に、回収を手伝ってくれないか？
#. de: Und jetzt picken die Flamingos daran herum, weil sie die kleinen braunen Tonscherben für Käfer halten. Würdest du mir wohl dabei helfen, die Scherben einzusammeln, bevor die Vögel das Gift durch den ganzen Wald tragen?
#. fr: Ces derniers temps, il y a de plus en plus d'animaux qui tombent malades après avoir confondu ces fragments avec de la nourriture... Il faut les récupérer le plus vite possible, avant qu'ils ne fassent plus de victimes<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Would you look at this mess! This is the work of the Children of the Everlasting Dark, no doubt about it. What's worse, these old urns were once full of poison for whatever nefarious deeds they have been carrying out.
#. column 58: Gather poison urn fragments?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh dear... How am I going to do this alone?
msgctxt "FateEvent:449:0:57"
msgid "Now they are all smashed, and the flamingos have taken to swallowing the fragments! Now, I do not know a lot about poison or disease, but we cannot afford for these birds to spread any sort of foulness throughout the Greatwood. Will you help me gather the pieces?"
msgstr "Теперь урны разбиты, а фламинго глотают осколки! Я не слишком разбираюсь в ядах и болезнях, но нельзя допустить, чтобы птицы разнесли заразу по всему Великому Лесу. Поможешь собрать осколки?"

#. ja: 「毒壺の欠片」を回収する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die gefährlichen Gefäßscherben auflesen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'Elfe<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Would you look at this mess! This is the work of the Children of the Everlasting Dark, no doubt about it. What's worse, these old urns were once full of poison for whatever nefarious deeds they have been carrying out.
#. column 57: Now they are all smashed, and the flamingos have taken to swallowing the fragments! Now, I do not know a lot about poison or disease, but we cannot afford for these birds to spread any sort of foulness throughout the Greatwood. Will you help me gather the pieces?
#. column 62: Oh dear... How am I going to do this alone?
