#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:454:0:58"
msgid "Face the wrath of Kelaino?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Принять ярость Келайно?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうだ、やめておけ……。<br>迂闊に手を出せば、私のように……痛い目にあうぞ……。
#. de: Du handelst richtig<nbsp>... Ihr ist niemand gewachsen.
#. fr: Je vois... Tu as raison... Tu risquerais de finir dans le même état que moi...
#. column 56: I did not even see her until it was too late... Kelaino, that abomination... How I managed to escape her I know not.
#. column 57: Wait... Surely, you do not mean to face her?
#. column 58: Face the wrath of Kelaino?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:454:0:62"
msgid "A wise choice. At a glance, I would say you stand little chance against that demon."
msgstr "Мудрое решение. С первого взгляда видно: тебе с этим демоном не справиться."

#. ja: ぐっ……血を流しすぎた……。<br>痛み止めが効いてくれれば、立ち上がれるんだが……。
#. de: Argh<nbsp>... ich kann kaum stehen. Mit einem schmerzstillenden Mittel vielleicht, aber<nbsp>...
#. fr: J-j'ai perdu trop de sang... Si seulement la potion anesthésiante pouvait commencer à faire effet, je pourrais au moins me relever...
#. column 57: If Kelaino finds me, I am done for.
msgctxt "FateEvent:455:0:56"
msgid "I have lost too much blood... Though I have staunched the bleeding, I can barely stand."
msgstr "Я потеряла слишком много крови... Кровотечение удалось остановить, но я едва держусь на ногах."

#. ja: この足では、ケライノーに見つかったら最期……<br>いよいよ、私もここまでということか……。
#. de: Wenn mich Celeno in diesem Zustand erspäht, werde ich nicht mehr fliehen können. Keine Sorge<nbsp>... Ich werde meinem Ende tapfer ins Auge blicken.
#. fr: Si Céléno me trouve alors que je suis dans cet état, c'est la fin pour moi... Je n'ai aucune chance...
#. column 56: I have lost too much blood... Though I have staunched the bleeding, I can barely stand.
msgctxt "FateEvent:455:0:57"
msgid "If Kelaino finds me, I am done for."
msgstr "Если Келайно меня найдёт, мне конец."

#. ja: マンドリルの群れが、<br>ロンカの遺跡に侵入するところに居合わせたのです。<br>どうやら彼らは、貴重な遺物で遊んでいる様子……。
#. de: Siehst du die Mandrills dort? Sie haben sich in die Ronka-Ruinen gewagt und besudeln die alten Relikte jetzt mit ihren dreckigen Pfoten.
#. fr: J'ai vu un groupe de mandrills en train de jouer à l'entrée des ruines de Ronka avec des reliques très précieuses...
#. column 57: Unfortunately, by the time I call for assistance from my fellow warders, these beasts will have escaped me. Can you help me retrieve the treasures?
#. column 58: Help retrieve the Ronkan curios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I cannot expect an outsider to share my devotion to protecting these relics, but I thought you might be willing to lend a hand.
msgctxt "FateEvent:456:0:56"
msgid "Several wood raiders have entered the ruins and made off with countless artifacts. Judging by the way that they have been treating them as mere playthings, I think we can rule out the possibility of them having been trained for this purpose by enterprising thieves or the like."
msgstr "Несколько лесных налётчиков пробрались в руины и утащили оттуда несметное количество артефактов. Судя по тому, как они обращаются с ними, словно с игрушками, их вряд ли натаскали на это ушлые воры."

#. ja: 今から、仲間を呼んでいたのでは、間に合いません。<br>どうかマンドリルたちから「ロンカの遺物」を、<br>取り戻していただけませんか？
#. de: Wenn ich loslaufe, um meine Schwestern zu holen, ist bis zu unserer Rückkehr alles zerstört. Das garantiere ich. Wärst du gewillt, einzugreifen und die Relikte in Sicherheit zu bringen?
#. fr: Même si je cours prévenir les autres tout de suite, il sera trop tard pour sauver les trésors quand tout le monde arrivera...
#. column 56: Several wood raiders have entered the ruins and made off with countless artifacts. Judging by the way that they have been treating them as mere playthings, I think we can rule out the possibility of them having been trained for this purpose by enterprising thieves or the like.
#. column 58: Help retrieve the Ronkan curios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I cannot expect an outsider to share my devotion to protecting these relics, but I thought you might be willing to lend a hand.
msgctxt "FateEvent:456:0:57"
msgid "Unfortunately, by the time I call for assistance from my fellow warders, these beasts will have escaped me. Can you help me retrieve the treasures?"
msgstr "Пока я буду звать на помощь других стражниц, звери успеют скрыться. Поможешь вернуть сокровища?"

#. ja: 「ロンカの遺物」集めを手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Ronka-Relikte retten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Récupérer les reliques<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Several wood raiders have entered the ruins and made off with countless artifacts. Judging by the way that they have been treating them as mere playthings, I think we can rule out the possibility of them having been trained for this purpose by enterprising thieves or the like.
#. column 57: Unfortunately, by the time I call for assistance from my fellow warders, these beasts will have escaped me. Can you help me retrieve the treasures?
#. column 62: I cannot expect an outsider to share my devotion to protecting these relics, but I thought you might be willing to lend a hand.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:456:0:58"
msgid "Help retrieve the Ronkan curios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь вернуть ронканские древности?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: あなたにとっては「ロンカの遺物」は、<br>護るべきものではない、ということですか……。<br>残念です……。
#. de: Natürlich. Für dich haben die Relikte keine Bedeutung. Warum solltest du mir also helfen wollen?
#. fr: Je vois que tu te fiches bien des reliques ronka... D'accord... C'est dommage...
#. column 56: Several wood raiders have entered the ruins and made off with countless artifacts. Judging by the way that they have been treating them as mere playthings, I think we can rule out the possibility of them having been trained for this purpose by enterprising thieves or the like.
#. column 57: Unfortunately, by the time I call for assistance from my fellow warders, these beasts will have escaped me. Can you help me retrieve the treasures?
#. column 58: Help retrieve the Ronkan curios?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:456:0:62"
msgid "I cannot expect an outsider to share my devotion to protecting these relics, but I thought you might be willing to lend a hand."
msgstr "Не жду, что чужак разделит мою преданность этим реликвиям, но надеялась, что ты всё же поможешь."

#. ja: 「ロンカの遺物」を取り戻していただけたようですね。<br>それは、私が遺跡に戻しておきましょう。<br>一度、預けてくださいますか？
#. de: Du kämpfst mit erstaunlichem Eifer, ich bin beeindruckt. Überreiche die Relikte bitte mir, damit ich sie wieder an Ort und Stelle bringen kann.
#. fr: Je vois que tu as pu récupérer les reliques avant qu'elles ne soient com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment détruites<nbsp>! Je vais aller les reposer moi-même dans les ruines, peux-tu me les donner<nbsp>?
#. column 60: I am glad to see that they are intact. Once they have been properly cleansed, I shall return them to the ruins.
#. column 62: I would advise against keeping those artifacts for yourself. The huntresses of Fanow do not take kindly to thieves.
msgctxt "FateEvent:457:0:56"
msgid "Were you able to recover any artifacts?"
msgstr "Удалось вернуть какие-нибудь артефакты?"

#. ja: ご協力に感謝いたします。<br>お預かりした「ロンカの遺物」は、<br>綺麗に磨き上げてから、遺跡に戻しておきますね。
#. de: Ich danke dir. Überlasse es bitte mir, die Relikte wieder an ihren angemessenen Platz in den Ruinen zu bringen.
#. fr: Merci pour ton aide<nbsp>! Je vais de ce pas remettre les reliques à leur place, après leur avoir donné un bon coup de chiffon<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Were you able to recover any artifacts?
#. column 62: I would advise against keeping those artifacts for yourself. The huntresses of Fanow do not take kindly to thieves.
msgctxt "FateEvent:457:0:60"
msgid "I am glad to see that they are intact. Once they have been properly cleansed, I shall return them to the ruins."
msgstr "Рада видеть, что они целы. Я как следует их очищу и верну в руины."

#. ja: おや、どうしたのですか？<br>その「ロンカの遺物」は、あなたにとっては、<br>役立つ品ではないはずですが……。
#. de: Was ist los? Für dich haben diese alten Relikte doch keinerlei Wert, nicht wahr?
#. fr: Je vois que tu te fiches bien des reliques ronka... D'accord... C'est dommage...
#. column 56: Were you able to recover any artifacts?
#. column 60: I am glad to see that they are intact. Once they have been properly cleansed, I shall return them to the ruins.
msgctxt "FateEvent:457:0:62"
msgid "I would advise against keeping those artifacts for yourself. The huntresses of Fanow do not take kindly to thieves."
msgstr "Не советую оставлять эти артефакты себе. Охотницы Фанова ворам не спускают."

#. ja: 一匹、二匹であれば、私に追い払えても、<br>これだけの数となると、仲間たちの支援が不可欠でしょう。<br>ああ、「ロンカの遺物」がどうなるか……心配です……。
#. de: Wenn es sich nur um ein oder zwei vereinzelte Tiere handeln würde, käme ich mit diesem Problem alleine zurecht. Aber einer ganzen Horde bin ich nicht gewachsen. Sind diese Relikte also wirklich für immer verloren?
#. fr: J'aurais pu m'en occuper toute seule si les mandrills n'avaient été que deux ou trois...
msgctxt "FateEvent:458:0:56"
msgid "Although scaring off the wood raiders will prevent them from causing any further mischief, recovering the stolen treasures is far more important."
msgstr "Если прогнать лесных налётчиков, они больше не натворят бед, но куда важнее вернуть украденные сокровища."

#. ja: かなりの数の遺物を取り戻せましたし、<br>私は、あと少ししたら里に帰ろうかと思います。<br>まだ「ロンカの遺物」があるようなら、お預かりしますよ？
#. de: Du hast ganze Arbeit geleistet und ich schulde dir meinen Dank. Ich gehe nur noch sicher, dass kein Affe zurückkommt und kehre dann ins Dorf zurück. Solltest du noch Relikte gefunden haben, gib sie getrost mir.
#. fr: Tu as pu recouvrer la plupart des reliques, merci<nbsp>! Si tu en as d'autres, je les récupère<nbsp>!
#. column 60: So, that was not the last of the relics after all? You have a sharp eye indeed.
#. column 62: I would advise against keeping those artifacts for yourself. The huntresses of Fanow do not take kindly to thieves.
msgctxt "FateEvent:459:0:56"
msgid "I think I now have all of the stolen treasures, but we should probably look around for any we may have missed."
msgstr "Кажется, теперь я собрала все украденные сокровища. Но стоит проверить, не пропустили ли мы чего-нибудь."

#. ja: ご協力に感謝いたします。<br>お預かりした「ロンカの遺物」は、<br>綺麗に磨き上げてから、遺跡に戻しておきますね。
#. de: Ich danke dir zutiefst für ein beherztes Eingreifen. Nun erlaube mir, die von dir geborgenen Relikte wieder in die Ruinen zu bringen.
#. fr: Merci pour ton aide<nbsp>! Je vais de ce pas remettre les reliques à leur place, après leur avoir donné un bon coup de chiffon<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I think I now have all of the stolen treasures, but we should probably look around for any we may have missed.
#. column 62: I would advise against keeping those artifacts for yourself. The huntresses of Fanow do not take kindly to thieves.
msgctxt "FateEvent:459:0:60"
msgid "So, that was not the last of the relics after all? You have a sharp eye indeed."
msgstr "Значит, это были не последние реликвии? Глаз у тебя острый."

#. ja: おや、どうしたのですか？<br>その「ロンカの遺物」は、あなたにとっては、<br>役立つ品ではないはずですが……。
#. de: Was ist los? Für dich haben diese alten Relikte doch keinerlei Wert, nicht wahr?
#. fr: Eh bien, qu'est-ce qu'il se passe<nbsp>? Je croyais que vous vous fichiez de ces reliques<nbsp>?
#. column 56: I think I now have all of the stolen treasures, but we should probably look around for any we may have missed.
#. column 60: So, that was not the last of the relics after all? You have a sharp eye indeed.
msgctxt "FateEvent:459:0:62"
msgid "I would advise against keeping those artifacts for yourself. The huntresses of Fanow do not take kindly to thieves."
msgstr "Не советую оставлять эти артефакты себе. Охотницы Фанова ворам не спускают."

#. ja: それにしても、マンドリルたちは、<br>なぜ「ロンカの遺物」に興味を持ったのでしょうか？
#. de: Ich frage mich, weshalb die Mandrills überhaupt so zielstrebig auf die Relikte gehen. Ob sie schlicht und einfach neugierig sind?
#. fr: Je me demande vraiment pourquoi les mandrills s'intéressent à ces reliques...
msgctxt "FateEvent:460:0:56"
msgid "What could the wood raiders possibly want with the artifacts? Is this all some game to them?"
msgstr "Что лесным налётчикам вообще понадобилось в этих артефактах? Для них это просто игра?"

#. ja: ほう、その眼光……かなりの腕とお見受けする。<br>ちょうど新米の訓練がてら、狩りをするのだが……<br>手本を見せてやってはくれまいか？
#. de: Hm, du siehst mir aus wie <if $gn4>eine fähige Jägerin<else>ein fähiger Jäger</if>. Meine ungestüme Schülerin hat mich dazu gebracht, sie trotz ihrer Unerfahrenheit mit auf die Jagd zu nehmen, aber ob das wirklich eine gute Entscheidung war? Darf ich dich bitten, ein Auge auf sie zu haben?
#. fr: Oh<nbsp>! Je peux voir dans tes yeux que tu es très fort<if $gn4>e</if>, toi<nbsp>! J'étais justement sur le point d'emmener la nouvelle recrue chasser, tu crois que tu pourrais lui montrer ce que tu sais faire<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Accompany Salmet on the hunt for deer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Not to worry. She is my responsibility, after all.
msgctxt "FateEvent:461:0:56"
msgid "For an outsider, you seem quite at home in this neck of the woods. Would you mind accompanying my apprentice as she hunts a few deer? Just in case she should find herself overwhelmed."
msgstr "Для чужака ты здесь держишься на удивление уверенно. Не поможешь моей ученице поохотиться на оленей? На случай, если ей станет не справиться."

#. ja: 狩りに参加する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der jungen Jägerin zur Seite stehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Montrer à la nouvelle recrue vos aptitudes à la chasse<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: For an outsider, you seem quite at home in this neck of the woods. Would you mind accompanying my apprentice as she hunts a few deer? Just in case she should find herself overwhelmed.
#. column 62: Not to worry. She is my responsibility, after all.
