msgctxt "FateEvent:461:0:57"
msgid "Accompany Salmet on the hunt for deer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить Салмет на охоте за оленями?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ふむ、致し方あるまい。<br>無理を言ったようで、すまなかったな……。
#. de: Natürlich, du hast sicherlich Besseres zu tun. Zumal es vor allem meine Pflicht ist, über sie zu wachen.
#. fr: Hum, je vois... Désolée, tu as sûrement d'autres chats à fouetter...
#. column 56: For an outsider, you seem quite at home in this neck of the woods. Would you mind accompanying my apprentice as she hunts a few deer? Just in case she should find herself overwhelmed.
#. column 57: Accompany Salmet on the hunt for deer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:461:0:62"
msgid "Not to worry. She is my responsibility, after all."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. В конце концов, она моя забота."

#. ja: 偉大なる、オンドの母王、産卵祝う品、必要。<br>卵の子らの健康、願う真珠……<br>大きく、傷なく、つややかなの、ほしい。
#. de: Fsssh, wir Ondo ehren unsere Königin und ihre Eier mit den Tempest-Perlen. Sie sind wunderssschön. Wir beten für die Gesundheit und das Wohlergehen der Ondo-Kinder.
#. fr: Fssshh... La reine maternelle a donné naissance à nombre d'entre nous, et pour la remercccier, nous voulons lui offrir des perles tempétueuses. Beaucoup de perles tempétueuses<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Why we call them this, I do not know, though they have become increasssingly rare of late. Luckily, this cave seems to have a few ssscattered about. Will you help me gather them?
#. column 58: Help gather alonso pearls?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oysters sometimes ssspit out their pearls, so there may be a few lying in the sand.
#. column 61: Amphisbaenae hunt alonso oysters, ssswallowing them whole. If you cut them open and rummage through their innards, you might be able to find a few more pearls!
#. column 62: That is a shame... I was planning to give quite a handsssome reward, but I sssuppose you will not be needing it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:462:0:56"
msgid "The clutchmother has given birth, and to celebrate, we wish to present her with the most beautiful pearls in the Tempest. Alonso pearls, to be precissse."
msgstr "Мать-наседка принесла потомство, и в честь этого мы хотим подарить ей самые прекрасные жемчужины Бури. Жемчужины алонсо, если быть точнее."

#. ja: でも、海の水消えてから、<br>オンドの漁師、思うように漁できない。<br>「テンペストパール」、集めるの、助けてくれるか？
#. de: Aber seitdem das Wasser verschwunden ist, fällt es uns nicht mehr so leicht, die Perlen zu sammeln. Bitte hilf uns, <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>.
#. fr: Mais maintenant que l'eau a disssparu, nous avons vraiment besoin d'aide afin d'en récupérer un maximum. Ça vous dirait de nous donner un coup de main<nbsp>?
#. column 56: The clutchmother has given birth, and to celebrate, we wish to present her with the most beautiful pearls in the Tempest. Alonso pearls, to be precissse.
#. column 58: Help gather alonso pearls?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oysters sometimes ssspit out their pearls, so there may be a few lying in the sand.
#. column 61: Amphisbaenae hunt alonso oysters, ssswallowing them whole. If you cut them open and rummage through their innards, you might be able to find a few more pearls!
#. column 62: That is a shame... I was planning to give quite a handsssome reward, but I sssuppose you will not be needing it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:462:0:57"
msgid "Why we call them this, I do not know, though they have become increasssingly rare of late. Luckily, this cave seems to have a few ssscattered about. Will you help me gather them?"
msgstr "Почему их так называют, не знаю, но в последнее время они встречаются всё реже и реже. К счастью, в этой пещере, похоже, кое-где они ещё попадаются. Поможешь собрать их?"

#. ja: 「テンペストパール」集めを手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dabei helfen, die Tempest-Perlen zu sammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le pêcheur ondo<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: The clutchmother has given birth, and to celebrate, we wish to present her with the most beautiful pearls in the Tempest. Alonso pearls, to be precissse.
#. column 57: Why we call them this, I do not know, though they have become increasssingly rare of late. Luckily, this cave seems to have a few ssscattered about. Will you help me gather them?
#. column 60: Oysters sometimes ssspit out their pearls, so there may be a few lying in the sand.
#. column 61: Amphisbaenae hunt alonso oysters, ssswallowing them whole. If you cut them open and rummage through their innards, you might be able to find a few more pearls!
#. column 62: That is a shame... I was planning to give quite a handsssome reward, but I sssuppose you will not be needing it.
