msgctxt "FateEvent:462:0:58"
msgid "Help gather alonso pearls?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать жемчужины алонсо?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого FATE: <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、助けてくれるか、ありがたい。<br>「テンペストパール」、二枚貝、吐き出すことある。<br>だから、落ちてるもの、探すといい。
#. de: Deine Hilfe ist sehr willkommen. Muscheln hinterlassen die Tempest-Perlen. Du musst sie nur auflesen. Fsssh.
#. fr: Merccci beaucoup<nbsp>! Les mollusssques bivalves en laissent échapper ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment, alors il devrait y en avoir quelques-unes dans le sssable.
#. column 56: The clutchmother has given birth, and to celebrate, we wish to present her with the most beautiful pearls in the Tempest. Alonso pearls, to be precissse.
#. column 57: Why we call them this, I do not know, though they have become increasssingly rare of late. Luckily, this cave seems to have a few ssscattered about. Will you help me gather them?
#. column 58: Help gather alonso pearls?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 61: Amphisbaenae hunt alonso oysters, ssswallowing them whole. If you cut them open and rummage through their innards, you might be able to find a few more pearls!
#. column 62: That is a shame... I was planning to give quite a handsssome reward, but I sssuppose you will not be needing it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:462:0:60"
msgid "Oysters sometimes ssspit out their pearls, so there may be a few lying in the sand."
msgstr "Иногда устрицы выплёвывают жемчужины, так что они могут валяться прямо в песке."

#. ja: それから、「パール・アンフィスバエナ」、<br>二枚貝、よく食べるから、真珠も、よく呑み込む。<br>倒してみると、いい思う。
#. de: Auch alte Amphisbaenas fressen die Perlen gerne. Wenn du eine erlegst, findest du vielleicht auch welche ...
#. fr: D'autre part, ccces perles sssont également le plat préféré des amphisssbènes perlés. Vous devriez donc en trouver aussi dans leurs entrailles<nbsp>!
#. column 56: The clutchmother has given birth, and to celebrate, we wish to present her with the most beautiful pearls in the Tempest. Alonso pearls, to be precissse.
#. column 57: Why we call them this, I do not know, though they have become increasssingly rare of late. Luckily, this cave seems to have a few ssscattered about. Will you help me gather them?
#. column 58: Help gather alonso pearls?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oysters sometimes ssspit out their pearls, so there may be a few lying in the sand.
#. column 62: That is a shame... I was planning to give quite a handsssome reward, but I sssuppose you will not be needing it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:462:0:61"
msgid "Amphisbaenae hunt alonso oysters, ssswallowing them whole. If you cut them open and rummage through their innards, you might be able to find a few more pearls!"
msgstr "Амфисбены охотятся на устриц алонсо и заглатывают их целиком. Вскрой одну и поройся внутри — может, найдёшь ещё жемчужин!"

#. ja: そうか、残念だ。<br>オンドの漁師、海の水ないと、思うように漁できない。<br>どうしよう、どうしよう……。
#. de: Fsssh. Das ist bedauerlich. Ich hielt die Flossenlosen für hilfsbereiter ...
#. fr: Oh, ccc'est dommage<nbsp>! Revenez me voir sssi vous changez d'avis, sssurtout<nbsp>! Nous avons vraiment besoin d'aide...
#. column 56: The clutchmother has given birth, and to celebrate, we wish to present her with the most beautiful pearls in the Tempest. Alonso pearls, to be precissse.
#. column 57: Why we call them this, I do not know, though they have become increasssingly rare of late. Luckily, this cave seems to have a few ssscattered about. Will you help me gather them?
#. column 58: Help gather alonso pearls?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oysters sometimes ssspit out their pearls, so there may be a few lying in the sand.
#. column 61: Amphisbaenae hunt alonso oysters, ssswallowing them whole. If you cut them open and rummage through their innards, you might be able to find a few more pearls!
msgctxt "FateEvent:462:0:62"
msgid "That is a shame... I was planning to give quite a handsssome reward, but I sssuppose you will not be needing it."
msgstr "Жаль... Я собирался щедро тебя наградить, но, похоже, тебе это уже ни к чему."

#. ja: おお、「テンペストパール」、集めてくれたか！<br>ありがたく、受け取るぞ。
#. de: Psssh. Wie ich sehe, hast du Tempest-Perlen gesammelt. Danke. Bitte reiche sie mir.
#. fr: Ah, ccc'est vous<nbsp>! Avez-vous réussi à récupérer des perles tempétueuses<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Excellent! The clutchmother will be mossst pleased!
#. column 62: Should you find any more pearls, please bring them to me!
msgctxt "FateEvent:463:0:56"
msgid "Have you any alonso pearls?"
msgstr "Нашёл жемчужины алонсо?"

#. ja: 大きく、傷なく、つややかだ！<br>これなら卵の子ら、すくすく健康に育つ！<br>ありがとう、ありがとう！
#. de: Ja, sssehr gut. Diese Perlen sind groß und ohne Kratzer. Sie werden eine gute Dekoration abgeben. Danke!
#. fr: Ooooh, quelle belle lumière<nbsp>! La reine maternelle sssera enchantée<nbsp>! Merccci beaucoup<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you any alonso pearls?
#. column 62: Should you find any more pearls, please bring them to me!
msgctxt "FateEvent:463:0:60"
msgid "Excellent! The clutchmother will be mossst pleased!"
msgstr "Отлично! Мать-наседка будет очень довольна!"

#. ja: おお、もっと集めてきて、くれるのか？<br>それならば、待っているぞ。
#. de: Wirst du mir noch mehr Perlen bringen? Sehr gut. Ich erwarte dich hier.
#. fr: N'hésitez pas à m'en ramener d'autres, ccce ssserait très gentil de votre part<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you any alonso pearls?
#. column 60: Excellent! The clutchmother will be mossst pleased!
msgctxt "FateEvent:463:0:62"
msgid "Should you find any more pearls, please bring them to me!"
msgstr "Если найдёшь ещё жемчужин, приноси их мне!"

#. ja: 「テンペストパール」、落ちているもの、探すといい。<br>それから、二枚貝よく食べる「パール・アンフィスバエナ」、<br>倒してみると、いい思う。
#. de: Du kannst die Tempest-Perlen entweder auflesen, oder sie von alten Amphisbaenas erbeuten. Du hast die Wahl, fsssh.
#. fr: Que vous ramassiez les perles tempétueuses dans le sssable ou dans les ventres des amphisssbènes perlés, la reine maternelle vous sssera tout autant re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sante<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:464:0:56"
msgid "Whether you find the pearls in the sssand or inside an amphisbaena matters not!"
msgstr "Неважно, найдёшь ты жемчужины в песке или внутри амфисбены!"

#. ja: おお、「テンペストパール」、集めてくれたか！<br>十分集まっているが、いくらでも、受け取るぞ？
#. de: Oh, noch mehr Tempest-Perlen. Ondo können nie genug davon haben. Bitte reiche sie mir.
#. fr: Nous devrions avoir assez de perles, mais sssi vous en avez d'autres à me donner, ce sssera avec grand plaisir<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Excellent! The clutchmother will be mossst pleased!
#. column 62: Oh? You wish to keep them for yourssself? They are very pretty, it is true.
msgctxt "FateEvent:465:0:56"
msgid "I think we have enough pearls for now, but if you have any more, I would be happy to take those, too!"
msgstr "Думаю, пока жемчужин достаточно, но если у тебя есть ещё, с радостью их приму!"

#. ja: 大きく、傷なく、つややかだ！<br>これなら卵の子ら、すくすく健康に育つ！<br>ありがとう、ありがとう！
#. de: Ja, sssehr gut. Diese Perlen sind groß und ohne Kratzer. Sie werden eine gute Dekoration abgeben. Danke!
#. fr: Ooooh, quelle belle lumière<nbsp>! La reine maternelle sssera enchantée<nbsp>! Merccci beaucoup<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I think we have enough pearls for now, but if you have any more, I would be happy to take those, too!
#. column 62: Oh? You wish to keep them for yourssself? They are very pretty, it is true.
msgctxt "FateEvent:465:0:60"
msgid "Excellent! The clutchmother will be mossst pleased!"
msgstr "Превосходно! Матушка-наседка будет в восторге!"

#. ja: おお、真珠、自分のものにするか？<br>もう少しで、オンドの潮溜まり、帰るから、<br>それまでに、決めてくれ。
#. de: Hm. Du willst die Perlen wohl für dich behalten, was? Das ist Ssschade. Falls du sie mit uns teilen möchtest, warte ich hier auf dich.
#. fr: Vous voulez les garder pour vous<nbsp>? Je comprends, elles sssont tellement magnifiques...
#. column 56: I think we have enough pearls for now, but if you have any more, I would be happy to take those, too!
#. column 60: Excellent! The clutchmother will be mossst pleased!
msgctxt "FateEvent:465:0:62"
msgid "Oh? You wish to keep them for yourssself? They are very pretty, it is true."
msgstr "О? Хочешь оставить жемчуг себе? Они и правда очень красивые."

#. ja: もう少しで、オンドの潮溜まり、帰るから、<br>「テンペストパール」、見つけたら、渡してほしい。
#. de: Ich muss bald zurück in die Ondo-Becken, <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>. Falls du noch Tempest-Perlen hast, beeil dich und überreiche sie mir. Fsssh.
#. fr: Sssi vous avez d'autres perles tempétueuses, donnez-les-moi avant que je retourne à Baïne, sss'il vous plaît.
msgctxt "FateEvent:466:0:56"
msgid "If you have any more pearls for the clutchmother, please give them to me before I return to the Cups."
msgstr "Если найдёшь ещё жемчужин, отдай их мне до того, как я вернусь в Чаши."

#. ja: 災いを呼ぶ伝説の獣、「アルケオタニア」倒すには、<br>好物の紅血珊瑚使って、罠仕掛けるしかない……！
#. de: Fsssh. Um Archaeotania zu besiegen, müssen wir sie zunächst mit einem Köder anlocken. Der Schrecken der Tiefsee liebt Blutkorallen. Wir werden sie sammeln und einen Köder herstellen.
#. fr: Nos légendes parlent d'Archaeotania, l'annonccciatrice du chaos... Elles disent que le ssseul moyen d'en venir à bout est de lui tendre un piège, en l'attirant avec le mets qu'elle préfère, les coraux sssanguins<nbsp>!
#. column 57: This cave is known for being full of the ssstuff, although we may have to compete with those clionids...
#. column 58: Help Teushs Ooan collect sanguine coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: The clionids feed on coral, amongst other things, so if we give them enough of a beating, they might ssspit some out!
#. column 62: You have every right to refuse, of course, though I fear I will ssstruggle to gather coral and fight off the clionids by myself.
msgctxt "FateEvent:467:0:56"
msgid "If Archaeotania is attracted to sanguine coral as the ssstories sssay, we should try gathering as much as we can."
msgstr "Если легенды не врут и Археотания клюёт на кровавый коралл, надо собрать его как можно больше."

#. ja: でも、アルケオタニア、とても大口、とても大食い！<br>「紅血珊瑚」、いっぱい、いっぱい必要……！<br>集める、手伝ってくれるか？
#. de: Die Bestie hat einen unbändigen Appetit. Wir brauchen viele Blutkorallen, um den Köder herzustellen. Wirst du mir helfen, sie zu sammeln?
#. fr: À en juger par la taille de cccette mâchoire, il nous en faudra une montagne<nbsp>! Pourrais-tu m'aider à en ramasser, sssans-branchies<nbsp>?
#. column 56: If Archaeotania is attracted to sanguine coral as the ssstories sssay, we should try gathering as much as we can.
#. column 58: Help Teushs Ooan collect sanguine coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: The clionids feed on coral, amongst other things, so if we give them enough of a beating, they might ssspit some out!
#. column 62: You have every right to refuse, of course, though I fear I will ssstruggle to gather coral and fight off the clionids by myself.
msgctxt "FateEvent:467:0:57"
msgid "This cave is known for being full of the ssstuff, although we may have to compete with those clionids..."
msgstr "В этой пещере коралла полно, хотя, похоже, придётся потеснить этих клионидов..."

#. ja: 「紅血珊瑚」集めを手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dabei helfen, die Blutkorallen zu sammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Teushs Ooan en ramassant des coraux sanguins<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: If Archaeotania is attracted to sanguine coral as the ssstories sssay, we should try gathering as much as we can.
#. column 57: This cave is known for being full of the ssstuff, although we may have to compete with those clionids...
#. column 60: The clionids feed on coral, amongst other things, so if we give them enough of a beating, they might ssspit some out!
#. column 62: You have every right to refuse, of course, though I fear I will ssstruggle to gather coral and fight off the clionids by myself.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:467:0:58"
msgid "Help Teushs Ooan collect sanguine coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поможешь Теушсу Ооану собрать кровавый коралл?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、ありがたい！<br>「紅血珊瑚」、生えてるの採る、とてもいい！<br>珊瑚食べる「ロス・クリオニッド」、倒して採るもいい！
#. de: Ich danke dir! Du kannst die Blutkorallen auflesen oder von den erzürnten Clioniden erbeuten. Psssh.
#. fr: Je te sssuis redevable<nbsp>! Tu pourras en trouver par terre, ou même en abattant les clionides qui viennent iccci sss'en nourrir.
#. column 56: If Archaeotania is attracted to sanguine coral as the ssstories sssay, we should try gathering as much as we can.
#. column 57: This cave is known for being full of the ssstuff, although we may have to compete with those clionids...
#. column 58: Help Teushs Ooan collect sanguine coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You have every right to refuse, of course, though I fear I will ssstruggle to gather coral and fight off the clionids by myself.
msgctxt "FateEvent:467:0:60"
msgid "The clionids feed on coral, amongst other things, so if we give them enough of a beating, they might ssspit some out!"
msgstr "Клиониды едят коралл и ещё многое другое. Если хорошенько их отделать, может, выплюнут немного!"

#. ja: おお、悲しい……！<br>だが、導きのヒト、忙しい、知ってる……！<br>テウスィー、がんばって、どうにかする！
#. de: Das ist sehr ssschade. Wie soll ich nun diese Bestie erlegen? Wir Ondo sind verdammt!
#. fr: Tu ne veux pas m'aider<nbsp>? Fsshhh... J'y arriverai peut-être ssseul<nbsp>! Il ne sss'agit que de récolter des coraux, après tout<nbsp>!
#. column 56: If Archaeotania is attracted to sanguine coral as the ssstories sssay, we should try gathering as much as we can.
#. column 57: This cave is known for being full of the ssstuff, although we may have to compete with those clionids...
#. column 58: Help Teushs Ooan collect sanguine coral?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: The clionids feed on coral, amongst other things, so if we give them enough of a beating, they might ssspit some out!
msgctxt "FateEvent:467:0:62"
msgid "You have every right to refuse, of course, though I fear I will ssstruggle to gather coral and fight off the clionids by myself."
msgstr "Конечно, ты вправе отказаться. Только одному мне будет нелегко и коралл собрать, и от клионидов отбиться."

#. ja: それ、「紅血珊瑚」……！<br>導きのヒト、集めてくれたか？
#. de: Oh, hast du etwa Blutkorallen gesammelt? Sssehr gut. Gib sie mir. Ich werde den Köder daraus herstellen.
#. fr: As-tu ramassé quelques coraux sssanguins<nbsp>?
#. column 60: The color of finless ones' blood... Not that I would know, of course! Ha ha...
#. column 62: I have a feeling thisss might not be enough. Do you think you could gather sssome more?
msgctxt "FateEvent:468:0:56"
msgid "Did you manage to find any sssanguine coral?"
msgstr "Удалось найти кровавый коралл?"

#. ja: おお、とてもいい「紅血珊瑚」……！<br>陸人流す血のよう、だから紅血という……！<br>オンドの血と違う、ちょっと奇妙……？
#. de: Das sind hervorragende Blutkorallen. Sie vergießen rote Algen, wenn man sie auspresst. Sieht aus wie das Blut der Flossenlosen. Rot. Anders, als Ondo-Blut, fsssh.
#. fr: Excellent<nbsp>! Regarde cccette couleur, elle rappelle cccelle du sssang des sssans-branchies, tu ne trouves pas<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Did you manage to find any sssanguine coral?
#. column 62: I have a feeling thisss might not be enough. Do you think you could gather sssome more?
msgctxt "FateEvent:468:0:60"
msgid "The color of finless ones' blood... Not that I would know, of course! Ha ha..."
msgstr "Цветом прямо как кровь бесчешуйных... Хотя откуда мне знать! Ха-ха..."

#. ja: おお、もっとたくさん集めてくれるか？<br>それなら、テウスィー、待っている……。
#. de: Oh, du möchtest noch mehr sammeln? Gut, gut! Ich warte.
#. fr: Hum... Je ne penssse pas que nous aurons assez de coraux. Pourrais-tu m'en rapporter plusss<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Did you manage to find any sssanguine coral?
#. column 60: The color of finless ones' blood... Not that I would know, of course! Ha ha...
msgctxt "FateEvent:468:0:62"
msgid "I have a feeling thisss might not be enough. Do you think you could gather sssome more?"
msgstr "Кажется, этого маловато. Не принесёшь ещё немного?"

#. ja: 「紅血珊瑚」、生えてるの採る、とてもいい！<br>珊瑚食べる「ロス・クリオニッド」、倒して採るもいい！
#. de: Die Blutkorallen direkt von der Korallenbank sammeln, ist am einfachsten. Aber man kann sie auch von den Clioniden hier erbeuten.
#. fr: Fsshhh... Les coraux sssanguins poussent sssur le sssol, mais tu peux aussi abattre les clionides qui sss'en nourrissent et les extraire de leurs cadavres.
msgctxt "FateEvent:469:0:56"
msgid "The coral will only be used as bait, so it does not matter where you find it!"
msgstr "Кораллы всё равно пойдут на приманку, так что неважно, где ты их найдёшь!"

#. ja: それ、「紅血珊瑚」……！<br>テウスィー、そろそろ戻る、渡してくれるか？
#. de: Fsssh. Du möchtest noch mehr sammeln? Ich bleibe aber nicht mehr lange hier ...
#. fr: Je vais bientôt pouvoir passer à la sssuite de mon plan avec tous ccces coraux<nbsp>! Mais donne-moi ccceux que tu as. Plus nous en aurons, plus vite Archaeotania tombera dans nos filets<nbsp>!
#. column 60: I think we have a sssufficient amount to lure Archaeotania, but one can never have too much bait!
#. column 62: Perhaps we can afford to collect a few more pieces?
msgctxt "FateEvent:470:0:56"
msgid "Have you any more coral?"
msgstr "Есть ещё коралл?"

#. ja: おお、とてもいい「紅血珊瑚」……！<br>たくさん集まった、アルケオタニア、おびき寄せる罠、<br>これなら作れる、テウスィー、嬉しい……！
#. de: Das sind alles großartige Blutkorallen. Genug, dass ich daraus einen Köder für die Bestie herstellen kann. Die Tage Archaeotanias sind gezählt!
#. fr: Sssplendide<nbsp>! Archaeotania ne pourra pas résissster à l'appel de tous ccces délicccieux coraux sssanguins<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you any more coral?
#. column 62: Perhaps we can afford to collect a few more pieces?
msgctxt "FateEvent:470:0:60"
msgid "I think we have a sssufficient amount to lure Archaeotania, but one can never have too much bait!"
msgstr "Думаю, коралла уже достаточно, чтобы приманить Археотанию. Хотя приманки много не бывает!"

#. ja: おお、もっとたくさん集めてくれるか？<br>でも、テウスィー、そろそろ戻る……急いでくれるか？
#. de: Fsssh. Du möchtest noch mehr sammeln? Ich bleibe aber nicht mehr lange hier ...
#. fr: Tu retournes à la chasse aux coraux<nbsp>? Dépêche-toi, je vais bientôt partir.
#. column 56: Have you any more coral?
#. column 60: I think we have a sssufficient amount to lure Archaeotania, but one can never have too much bait!
msgctxt "FateEvent:470:0:62"
msgid "Perhaps we can afford to collect a few more pieces?"
msgstr "Может, соберём ещё немного?"

#. ja: 「紅血珊瑚」、たくさん集まった……。<br>テウスィー、そろそろ戻る。<br>珊瑚持っていたら、渡してくれるか？
#. de: Psssh. Ich habe bereits viele Blutkorallen in meinem Netz. Wenn du noch welche hast, überreiche sie mir. Ich werde bald in die Becken zurückkehren.
#. fr: Je vais bientôt pouvoir passer à la sssuite de mon plan avec tous ccces coraux<nbsp>! Mais donne-moi ccceux que tu as. Plus nous en aurons, plus vite Archaeotania tombera dans nos filets<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:471:0:56"
msgid "It is high time we left, though if you ssstill have any coral, I would be glad to add it to our haul."
msgstr "Пора уходить, но если у тебя ещё есть коралл, я с радостью добавлю его к нашим запасам."

#. ja: おお、導きのヒト……聞いてほしい！<br>ついに「アルケオタニア」、好物判明した……！<br>それは、紅血珊瑚……！
#. de: Oh, <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>! Du kommst zur rechten Zeit. Ich habe einen Weg gefunden, Archaeotania zu erlegen! Ich habe die Ssspuren gelesen und erkannt, dass das Ungeheuer eine Schwäche für Blutkorallen hat! Fsssh.
#. fr: Sssans-branchies<nbsp>! J'ai fait une découverte qui va nous permettre de débusssquer Archaeotania<nbsp>! Les indiccces que j'ai regroupés me font penssser qu'elle raffole des coraux sssanguins<nbsp>!
#. column 57: I am on my way to collect sssome now, though I could perhaps benefit from your company.
#. column 58: These caves are inhabited by all sssorts of horrid beasts, you know!
#. column 59: Protect Teushs Ooan on his way to the inner reaches of the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I ssstand a much higher chance of being eaten if I go alone, though I sssuppose that is a risk I shall have to take...
msgctxt "FateEvent:472:0:56"
msgid "According to the ssstories, Archaeotania is drawn to sanguine coral. For what reason, I do not know, but if this is true, we can use it to lure the beast!"
msgstr "По легендам, Археотанию манит кровавый коралл. Почему — не знаю, но если это правда, мы сможем приманить чудовище!"

#. ja: 紅血珊瑚、この洞窟、陸人の墓標、奥にある！<br>たくさん採取できれば、罠仕掛けて、<br>退治すること、不可能じゃない！
#. de: Mit dem Wissen kann ich einen Köder herstellen und Archaeotania in eine Falle locken. Ein alter Ondo hat mir verraten, dass in dieser Höhle hier viele Blutkorallen wachsen. Wir müssen nur hineingehen und sie ernten.
#. fr: Il y en a à foison dans la crypte du Sssans-branchies. Si nous en accumulons assez, nous pourrions tendre un piège à la bête<nbsp>! Et qui sssait<nbsp>? Peut-être la vaincre<nbsp>!
#. column 56: According to the ssstories, Archaeotania is drawn to sanguine coral. For what reason, I do not know, but if this is true, we can use it to lure the beast!
#. column 58: These caves are inhabited by all sssorts of horrid beasts, you know!
#. column 59: Protect Teushs Ooan on his way to the inner reaches of the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I ssstand a much higher chance of being eaten if I go alone, though I sssuppose that is a risk I shall have to take...
msgctxt "FateEvent:472:0:57"
msgid "I am on my way to collect sssome now, though I could perhaps benefit from your company."
msgstr "Я уже иду за кораллом. Вдвоём, пожалуй, будет сподручнее."

#. ja: テウスィー、がんばって戦う！<br>だから、導きのヒト……いっしょに魔物多い洞窟、<br>奥まで探索、協力してくれないか？
#. de: Psssh. Aber hier hausen auch viele gefährliche Lebewesen. <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>, wirst du mir beistehen und mich in die Höhle begleiten?
#. fr: Des prédateurs rôdent dans la caverne, et je me battrai sss'il le faut<nbsp>! Néanmoins, pourrais-tu m'accompagner<nbsp>? Avec ton aide, je n'en ssserais que plus rassuré.
#. column 56: According to the ssstories, Archaeotania is drawn to sanguine coral. For what reason, I do not know, but if this is true, we can use it to lure the beast!
#. column 57: I am on my way to collect sssome now, though I could perhaps benefit from your company.
#. column 59: Protect Teushs Ooan on his way to the inner reaches of the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I ssstand a much higher chance of being eaten if I go alone, though I sssuppose that is a risk I shall have to take...
msgctxt "FateEvent:472:0:58"
msgid "These caves are inhabited by all sssorts of horrid beasts, you know!"
msgstr "В этих пещерах полным-полно жутких тварей, знаешь ли!"

#. ja: テウスィー・オーンに協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Teushs Ooan in die Grotte begleiten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Teushs Ooan<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: According to the ssstories, Archaeotania is drawn to sanguine coral. For what reason, I do not know, but if this is true, we can use it to lure the beast!
#. column 57: I am on my way to collect sssome now, though I could perhaps benefit from your company.
#. column 58: These caves are inhabited by all sssorts of horrid beasts, you know!
#. column 62: I ssstand a much higher chance of being eaten if I go alone, though I sssuppose that is a risk I shall have to take...
