#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:472:0:59"
msgid "Protect Teushs Ooan on his way to the inner reaches of the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Защитишь Теушса Ооана, пока он пробирается вглубь пещеры?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、悲しい……！<br>だが、導きのヒト、忙しい、知ってる……！<br>テウスィー、がんばって、どうにかする！
#. de: Eine Enttäuschung! Ich dachte, <if $gn4>die Flossenlose<else>der Flossenlose</if> sei <if $gn4>eine große Kriegerin<else>ein großer Krieger</if>!
#. fr: Je t'en ai demandé trop. Je le réalise maintenant. Sssouhaite-moi bonne chanccce, sssans-branchies.
#. column 56: According to the ssstories, Archaeotania is drawn to sanguine coral. For what reason, I do not know, but if this is true, we can use it to lure the beast!
#. column 57: I am on my way to collect sssome now, though I could perhaps benefit from your company.
#. column 58: These caves are inhabited by all sssorts of horrid beasts, you know!
#. column 59: Protect Teushs Ooan on his way to the inner reaches of the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:472:0:62"
msgid "I ssstand a much higher chance of being eaten if I go alone, though I sssuppose that is a risk I shall have to take..."
msgstr "В одиночку меня с куда большей вероятностью съедят... Но, видимо, рискну."

#. ja: こんなところ、陸人いるとは、珍しい……！<br>そうか、やはり、陸人は「プルプラ貝」好きなのだな！
#. de: Gütige Flut, <if $gn4>eine Flossenlose<else>ein Flossenloser</if>! Ein seltener Anblick. Aber auch großes Glück!
#. fr: Ççça alors, un<if $gn4>e</if> sssans-branchies iccci<nbsp>!? Dites, vous aimez les pourpres, pas vrai<nbsp>?
#. column 57: No? Well, maybe you shhhould consider it. The purple ones here are ground to make dye. Very valuable, they are!
#. column 58: Unfortunately, the area is also home to deadly nauplii. I would not ssstand much of a chance against them by myself, but if you accompany me, I will give you a fair reward. What sssay you?
#. column 59: Escort Mewshs Laan into the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Ssscared, are you? I do not blame you, but I wish you would reconsssider.
msgctxt "FateEvent:473:0:56"
msgid "Never did I expect to sssee a finless one in these parts! Tell me, are you here to gather shells, too?"
msgstr "Не думал, что увижу здесь кого-то без плавников! Скажи, ты тоже пришёл собирать ракушки?"

#. ja: ムッ……プルプラ貝、取りに来たのでない？<br>あの貝殻、とてもいい紫色、染料になるぞ！<br>オレ、貝殻集めて、陸で交易するつもり！
#. de: Ich sammele Muscheln mit schöner Farbe, die sehr beliebt bei jungen Ondo und den Fremden sind.
#. fr: Non<nbsp>!? Vous devriez, parccce que leurs coquilles font des merveilles quand il sss'agit de teindre des vêtements<nbsp>! Il y a de l'argent à ssse faire, ccc'est moi qui vous le dis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Never did I expect to sssee a finless one in these parts! Tell me, are you here to gather shells, too?
#. column 58: Unfortunately, the area is also home to deadly nauplii. I would not ssstand much of a chance against them by myself, but if you accompany me, I will give you a fair reward. What sssay you?
#. column 59: Escort Mewshs Laan into the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Ssscared, are you? I do not blame you, but I wish you would reconsssider.
msgctxt "FateEvent:473:0:57"
msgid "No? Well, maybe you shhhould consider it. The purple ones here are ground to make dye. Very valuable, they are!"
msgstr "Нет? А зря. Фиолетовые раковины здесь перемалывают в краску. Очень ценная штука!"

#. ja: そうだ、貝殻集め、ついてきてくれないか？<br>洞窟の中、とても魔物多く、とても危険多い！<br>陸人、護衛してくれるなら、お礼するぞ！
#. de: Aber in der Höhle lauern viele Gefahren. Ohne das Wasser bin ich nicht schnell genug, um den Räubern zu entkommen, fsssh! Aber vielleicht kannst du mich begleiten und beschützen?
#. fr: Eh, ççça vous dirait de m'accompagner pendant que j'en ramasse<nbsp>? J'irais bien tout ssseul, mais je ne fais pas le poids faccce à toutes ccces créatures hossstiles... Je vous récompenssserai comme il ssse doit, ccc'est promis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Never did I expect to sssee a finless one in these parts! Tell me, are you here to gather shells, too?
#. column 57: No? Well, maybe you shhhould consider it. The purple ones here are ground to make dye. Very valuable, they are!
#. column 59: Escort Mewshs Laan into the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Ssscared, are you? I do not blame you, but I wish you would reconsssider.
msgctxt "FateEvent:473:0:58"
msgid "Unfortunately, the area is also home to deadly nauplii. I would not ssstand much of a chance against them by myself, but if you accompany me, I will give you a fair reward. What sssay you?"
msgstr "Беда в том, что здесь водятся опасные науплии. Одному мне с ними не справиться, но если пойдёшь со мной, щедро отблагодарю. Ну что скажешь?"

#. ja: メウスィー・ラーンを護衛する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Mewshs Laan in die Höhle begleiten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Mewshs Laan<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Never did I expect to sssee a finless one in these parts! Tell me, are you here to gather shells, too?
#. column 57: No? Well, maybe you shhhould consider it. The purple ones here are ground to make dye. Very valuable, they are!
#. column 58: Unfortunately, the area is also home to deadly nauplii. I would not ssstand much of a chance against them by myself, but if you accompany me, I will give you a fair reward. What sssay you?
#. column 62: Ssscared, are you? I do not blame you, but I wish you would reconsssider.
