msgctxt "FateEvent:473:0:59"
msgid "Escort Mewshs Laan into the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Сопроводить Мьюшса Лаана в пещеру?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: もしかして、陸人も洞窟の魔物、怖いのか？
#. de: Ich versssstehe. Ich fürchte mich auch vor diesen Ungeheuern ...
#. fr: Oh, ne me dites pas que vous avez peur<nbsp>! Vous pourriez faire preuve d'un peu plusss de courage, quand même<nbsp>! Enfin, puisssque ccc'est votre décccision... Mais vous ne sssavez pas ccce que vous ratez<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Never did I expect to sssee a finless one in these parts! Tell me, are you here to gather shells, too?
#. column 57: No? Well, maybe you shhhould consider it. The purple ones here are ground to make dye. Very valuable, they are!
#. column 58: Unfortunately, the area is also home to deadly nauplii. I would not ssstand much of a chance against them by myself, but if you accompany me, I will give you a fair reward. What sssay you?
#. column 59: Escort Mewshs Laan into the cave?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:473:0:62"
msgid "Ssscared, are you? I do not blame you, but I wish you would reconsssider."
msgstr "Испугался, что ли? Не осуждаю, но всё же подумай ещё раз."

#. ja: 漁を終えて帰ろうとしたんだが、<br>悪臭放つアネモネの群れが襲ってきたんだ。<br>このままじゃ、せっかくの釣果が汚染されちまう！
#. de: Ich hab mich so über den guten Fang gefreut, und jetzt das! Wenn die Anemonen die Fische verpesten, kann ich sie nur noch wegwerfen!
#. fr: J'allais rentrer après avoir terminé ma pêche, mais des anémones pestilentielles m'ont attaqué. Mes prises risquent d'être souillées par leur horrible odeur si on ne fait rien<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:474:0:56"
msgid "At this rate, my fish are going to smell dreadful by the time I get back to the Crystarium. More dreadful than usual!"
msgstr "Так я до Кристариума довезу рыбу — от неё же за милю не продохнуть. И это ещё цветочки!"

#. ja: おお、導きのヒト！<br>どうか、力貸してもらいたい！<br>恐ろしい、「大口の巨大獣」、現れたのだ！
#. de: <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>! Eine Spur! Der Schrecken der Ondo hat sich gezeigt! Archaeotania ist hier! Fsssh.
#. fr: Sssans-branchies<nbsp>! Viens-moi en aide, je t'en sssupplie<nbsp>! Un monssstre à la mâchoire géante est apparu dans les environs<nbsp>!
#. column 57: A horrifying creature appeared in the ancient ruins before disssappearing into the darknesss. I only caught a glimpse of it, but I sssuspect it is the dreaded Archaeotania.
#. column 58: I have found what appear to be tracksss left by the beast, but those wretched dagons are in my way! Will you get rid of them for me?
#. column 59: Slay the foul dagons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Forgive me if I sssave my thanks until the job is done. I am counting on you!
#. column 62: Very well, but do not blame me when Archaeotania decides to make you its next meal.
msgctxt "FateEvent:475:0:56"
msgid "Finlesss one, will you help me? It is a matter of great importance!"
msgstr "Бесчешуйный, поможешь мне? Дело очень важное!"

#. ja: その獣、いにしえの者の街から、<br>突如として現れ、大暴れしていずこか、去った！<br>一族に伝わる「アルケオタニア」、違いない！
#. de: Wir haben nur eine Chance, diese Kreatur zu erlegen. Seit Generationen erzählen sich die Ondo vom dunklen Omen. Von der Strafe der Alten!
#. fr: Il sss'est échappé d'une des bâtisses des anccciens et sssème le chaos depuis partout où il passe<nbsp>! Ccce ne peut être que la terrible créature de nos vieilles fables, Archaeotania<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Finlesss one, will you help me? It is a matter of great importance!
#. column 58: I have found what appear to be tracksss left by the beast, but those wretched dagons are in my way! Will you get rid of them for me?
#. column 59: Slay the foul dagons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Forgive me if I sssave my thanks until the job is done. I am counting on you!
#. column 62: Very well, but do not blame me when Archaeotania decides to make you its next meal.
msgctxt "FateEvent:475:0:57"
msgid "A horrifying creature appeared in the ancient ruins before disssappearing into the darknesss. I only caught a glimpse of it, but I sssuspect it is the dreaded Archaeotania."
msgstr "Ужасное чудовище явилось среди древних руин и скрылось во тьме. Я видел его лишь мельком, но подозреваю, что это та самая жуткая Археотания."

#. ja: 放置しておけば、必ず災い、起きる！<br>痕跡探して追跡したい、でも、ダゴンたち邪魔する！<br>どうか、どうか、力貸して、倒す、手伝ってほしい！
#. de: Ich bin bereit für diese Jagd, doch eine Schar Dagon hat sich mir in den Weg gestellt! Bitte hilf mir sie zu vertreiben, damit ich die Fährte untersuchen kann! Uns bleibt keine Zeit!
#. fr: Nous ne pouvons pas la laisser agir à sssa guise, elle détruira tout sssur ssson passage...  J'aimerais étudier les indiccces qu'elle a laissés, mais ccces dagons me bloquent le passage. Pourrais-tu m'aider<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Finlesss one, will you help me? It is a matter of great importance!
#. column 57: A horrifying creature appeared in the ancient ruins before disssappearing into the darknesss. I only caught a glimpse of it, but I sssuspect it is the dreaded Archaeotania.
#. column 59: Slay the foul dagons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Forgive me if I sssave my thanks until the job is done. I am counting on you!
#. column 62: Very well, but do not blame me when Archaeotania decides to make you its next meal.
msgctxt "FateEvent:475:0:58"
msgid "I have found what appear to be tracksss left by the beast, but those wretched dagons are in my way! Will you get rid of them for me?"
msgstr "Похоже, я нашёл следы чудовища, но эти проклятые дагоны мешают! Поможешь от них избавиться?"

#. ja: テウスィー・オーンに協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Teushs Ooan helfen, die Dagon zu vertreiben?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Teushs Ooan<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Finlesss one, will you help me? It is a matter of great importance!
#. column 57: A horrifying creature appeared in the ancient ruins before disssappearing into the darknesss. I only caught a glimpse of it, but I sssuspect it is the dreaded Archaeotania.
#. column 58: I have found what appear to be tracksss left by the beast, but those wretched dagons are in my way! Will you get rid of them for me?
#. column 60: Forgive me if I sssave my thanks until the job is done. I am counting on you!
#. column 62: Very well, but do not blame me when Archaeotania decides to make you its next meal.
