msgctxt "FateEvent:475:0:59"
msgid "Slay the foul dagons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Убить отвратительных дагонов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、ありがたい！<br>テウスィー、導きのヒト、感謝する！<br>邪魔なダゴン、倒す、お願いしたい！
#. de: Ich danke dir! Die Dagon waren schon immer ein Dorn im Auge der Ondo!
#. fr: Merccci, sssans-branchies<nbsp>! Les dagons sssont à toi<nbsp>! Bonne chanccce<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Finlesss one, will you help me? It is a matter of great importance!
#. column 57: A horrifying creature appeared in the ancient ruins before disssappearing into the darknesss. I only caught a glimpse of it, but I sssuspect it is the dreaded Archaeotania.
#. column 58: I have found what appear to be tracksss left by the beast, but those wretched dagons are in my way! Will you get rid of them for me?
#. column 59: Slay the foul dagons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Very well, but do not blame me when Archaeotania decides to make you its next meal.
msgctxt "FateEvent:475:0:60"
msgid "Forgive me if I sssave my thanks until the job is done. I am counting on you!"
msgstr "Спасибо скажу, когда дело будет сделано. Рассчитываю на тебя!"

#. ja: おお、悲しい……！<br>だが、導きのヒト、忙しい、知ってる……！<br>テウスィー、がんばって、どうにかする！
#. de: Du lässt Teushs Ooan im Stich? Psssh. Welch Enttäuschung! Warum hat dich nur der Mut verlassen?
#. fr: Quel dommage... Mais je ne t'en veux pas. Je sssais que les sssans-branchies ont aussi leurs propres problèmes.
#. column 56: Finlesss one, will you help me? It is a matter of great importance!
#. column 57: A horrifying creature appeared in the ancient ruins before disssappearing into the darknesss. I only caught a glimpse of it, but I sssuspect it is the dreaded Archaeotania.
#. column 58: I have found what appear to be tracksss left by the beast, but those wretched dagons are in my way! Will you get rid of them for me?
#. column 59: Slay the foul dagons?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Forgive me if I sssave my thanks until the job is done. I am counting on you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:475:0:62"
msgid "Very well, but do not blame me when Archaeotania decides to make you its next meal."
msgstr "Ладно, но не вини меня, когда Археотания решит сделать тебя своей следующей добычей."

#. ja: 乱暴者で有名、「沈殿のズムスィー・アース」、<br>アルケオタニア痕跡、調べてるみたい！<br>きっと、強い獣、手に入れて、悪いこと使う、違いない！
#. de: Psssh. Ein bekannter und hasserfüllter Aufwiegler der Flundern, Zumshs Aath, ist offenbar ebenfalls Archaeotania auf der Spur! Was auch immer er vorhat, er kann nichts Gutes im Sinn haben!
#. fr: Zumshs Aath, la terreur des abysses... Il inssspecte ccce qu'Archaeotania a laissé sur ssson passage<nbsp>! Il compte cccer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment ssse ssservir de la bête pour nourrir ssses terribles desseins<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:476:0:56"
msgid "That is Zumshs Aath Deepdread! It ssseems he too is following Archaeotania's trail. I do not know what he is plotting, but I guarantee he is up to no good. We must get him away from those tracks!"
msgstr "Это же Зумшс Аат Глубокий Ужас! Похоже, он тоже идёт по следу Археотании. Не знаю, что он задумал, но добром это не кончится. Надо увести его от следов!"

#. ja: 痕跡探して追跡したい、でも、ダゴンたち邪魔する！<br>どうか、どうか、力貸して、倒す、手伝ってほしい！
#. de: Ich bin Archaeotania auf der Spur, aber die Dagon haben sich mir in den Weg gestellt! Psssh! Hillf mir, sie zu vertreiben!
#. fr: Je dois absssolument inssspecter ccce qu'a laissé Archaeotania derrière elle<nbsp>! Ouvre-moi le passage en abattant ccces dagons, je t'en prie<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:477:0:56"
msgid "I cannot do anything until those dagons have been dealt with. Will you lend me your aid, finlesss one?"
msgstr "Я не могу ничего сделать, пока не разберусь с дагонами. Поможешь мне, бесчешуйный?"

#. ja: 木材を切り出していたのですが、<br>突然、猛ったトリフィドが現れまして……。<br>伐採した木材が集められずに、困っているのです。
#. de: Gerade als ich mich auf den Heimweg machen wollte, wurde ich von Triffiden angegriffen. Jetzt stehe ich hier ohne das ganze Holz, das ich geschlagen habe.
#. fr: J'étais en train de couper du bois quand je me suis retrouvé encerclé par ces triffides qui ont surgi de nulle part... Je ne sais pas comment je vais faire pour récupérer mon bois<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Gather lumber in the hope that it will quiet the man?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You shall gather the timber for me, you decree? Ah, such noble charity! The fruits of my labor can be collected from the forest floor, you see─though hacking up a triffid would be just as effective, probably.
#. column 62: Alas and woe, woe is me! If only someone would prune these infernal triffids, these vexatious trees!
msgctxt "FateEvent:478:0:56"
msgid "O stranger, hear my plea! The trees have turned, and logger becomes logee! The poets were right─my hubris has undone me!"
msgstr "О незнакомец, услышь мою мольбу! Деревья восстали, и дровосек вот-вот станет дровами! Поэты были правы: гордыня меня погубила!"

#. ja: 「伐採された木材」を回収する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Das Holz einsammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le bûcheron à récupérer le bois coupé<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: O stranger, hear my plea! The trees have turned, and logger becomes logee! The poets were right─my hubris has undone me!
#. column 60: You shall gather the timber for me, you decree? Ah, such noble charity! The fruits of my labor can be collected from the forest floor, you see─though hacking up a triffid would be just as effective, probably.
#. column 62: Alas and woe, woe is me! If only someone would prune these infernal triffids, these vexatious trees!
