msgctxt "FateEvent:478:0:57"
msgid "Gather lumber in the hope that it will quiet the man?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Собрать древесину, чтобы унять его?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ご協力いただけるなんて、感激です！<br>「伐採された木材」は、その辺りに散らばっています。<br>エルダー・トリフィドを倒すことでも、回収できるでしょう。
#. de: Vielen Dank! Das Holz, das ich geschlagen habe, liegt da vorne herum. Und vielleicht kannst du es auch von den Triffiden erbeuten.
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Le bois que j'ai coupé est éparpillé en tas dans les environs. Vous pouvez également en récupérer en éliminant les triffides gêneurs, si besoin.
#. column 56: O stranger, hear my plea! The trees have turned, and logger becomes logee! The poets were right─my hubris has undone me!
#. column 57: Gather lumber in the hope that it will quiet the man?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Alas and woe, woe is me! If only someone would prune these infernal triffids, these vexatious trees!
msgctxt "FateEvent:478:0:60"
msgid "You shall gather the timber for me, you decree? Ah, such noble charity! The fruits of my labor can be collected from the forest floor, you see─though hacking up a triffid would be just as effective, probably."
msgstr "Ты соберёшь для меня древесину? Какая благородная щедрость! Мои заготовки лежат прямо на лесной подстилке. Хотя можно просто порубить триффидов — должно сработать."

#. ja: 嗚呼、誰か力ある人が助けてくれればいいのですが……。
#. de: Oje, ich kann doch nicht mit leeren Händen zurück.
#. fr: Ah, si seulement quelqu'un de fort pouvait m'aider<nbsp>!
#. column 56: O stranger, hear my plea! The trees have turned, and logger becomes logee! The poets were right─my hubris has undone me!
#. column 57: Gather lumber in the hope that it will quiet the man?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You shall gather the timber for me, you decree? Ah, such noble charity! The fruits of my labor can be collected from the forest floor, you see─though hacking up a triffid would be just as effective, probably.
msgctxt "FateEvent:478:0:62"
msgid "Alas and woe, woe is me! If only someone would prune these infernal triffids, these vexatious trees!"
msgstr "Горе мне, горе! Вот бы кто-нибудь подрезал этих проклятых триффидов, этих несносных деревьев!"

#. ja: 「伐採された木材」は、その辺りに散らばっています。<br>エルダー・トリフィドを倒すことでも、回収できるでしょう。
#. de: Das Holz, das ich geschlagen habe, liegt da vorne herum. Und vielleicht kannst du es auch von den Triffiden erbeuten.
#. fr: Le bois que j'ai coupé est éparpillé en tas dans les environs. Vous pouvez également en récupérer en éliminant les triffides gêneurs, si besoin.
msgctxt "FateEvent:479:0:56"
msgid "The fruits of my labor can be collected from the forest floor, you see─though hacking up a triffid would be just as effective, probably."
msgstr "Мои заготовки лежат прямо на лесной подстилке. Хотя можно просто порубить триффидов — должно сработать."

#. ja: おや、「伐採された木材」をお持ちのようですね？<br>私に引き渡してくださいますか？
#. de: Konntest du mein Holz einsammeln?
#. fr: Ah, vous avez ramassé du bois coupé<nbsp>! Vous pouvez me le remettre<nbsp>?
#. column 60: I don't suppose I might trouble you for a few more lengths of the stuff, while you're here? I could ask in verse, if that helps...
#. column 62: One moment, please─though my creativity may be as a bottomless well, it does take time to plumb the depths, you know.
msgctxt "FateEvent:480:0:56"
msgid "Alas and woe, woe is me, I─ Oh, timber! That will do nicely, thank you."
msgstr "О, похоже, у тебя древесина! Отдашь её мне?"

#. ja: ありがとうございます。<br>もう少し、本数を回収しておきたいので、<br>「伐採された木材」を見つけたら、持ってきてくださいね。
#. de: Vielen Dank! Aber das reicht noch nicht. Kannst du mir bitte noch mehr von dem Holz bringen?
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! J'aimerais en récupérer encore un peu. Si vous en ramassez, donnez-le-moi, vous voulez bien<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Alas and woe, woe is me, I─ Oh, timber! That will do nicely, thank you.
#. column 62: One moment, please─though my creativity may be as a bottomless well, it does take time to plumb the depths, you know.
msgctxt "FateEvent:480:0:60"
msgid "I don't suppose I might trouble you for a few more lengths of the stuff, while you're here? I could ask in verse, if that helps..."
msgstr "Спасибо! Но мне нужно собрать ещё немного. Если найдёшь древесину, принеси её мне, ладно?"

#. ja: もう少し、数をまとめてから、<br>引き渡してくれるということでしょうか？
#. de: Willst du erst noch mehr Holz einsammeln, ehe du es mir gibst?
#. fr: Vous pourriez en ramasser un peu plus et me les remettre<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Alas and woe, woe is me, I─ Oh, timber! That will do nicely, thank you.
#. column 60: I don't suppose I might trouble you for a few more lengths of the stuff, while you're here? I could ask in verse, if that helps...
msgctxt "FateEvent:480:0:62"
msgid "One moment, please─though my creativity may be as a bottomless well, it does take time to plumb the depths, you know."
msgstr "Ты хочешь сначала собрать ещё древесины, а потом отдать её мне?"

#. ja: そろそろ、引き上げようと思います。<br>それなりの本数の木材を回収できましたからね。
#. de: Danke, das reicht für heute. Mit der Menge an Holz komme ich eine Weile über die Runden.
#. fr: Je ne vais pas tarder à rentrer, je pense que j'ai récupéré assez de bois.
msgctxt "FateEvent:481:0:56"
msgid "At last does the harvest to my humble hands return! Methinks anon I shall adjourn. ...Hm, that one's a bit much, isn't it?"
msgstr "Наконец-то добыча вернулась в мои скромные руки! Пожалуй, пора откланяться... Хм, переборщил с рифмой, да?"

#. ja: おや、「伐採された木材」をお持ちのようですね？<br>私に引き渡してくださいますか？
#. de: Konntest du mein Holz einsammeln?
#. fr: Ah, vous avez ramassé du bois coupé<nbsp>! Vous pouvez me le remettre<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Yes, this amount of wood should more than suffice. You are as a hero in one of the epics of eld! An epic involving an abundance of splinters.
#. column 62: If you come upon more lumber ere I depart, I shall gladly trade it for a verse or two.
msgctxt "FateEvent:482:0:56"
msgid "Boughs tremble, but speak not of the gentle breeze─ Aha, more timber! Thank you, fair stranger."
msgstr "Ветви дрожат, но не от нежного ветерка... Ага, ещё древесина! Спасибо, добрый путник."

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>これだけ回収できれば、十分でしょう。<br>後は、無事に木材を輸送するだけですね。
#. de: Vielen Dank, das reicht für's Erste! Hoffentlich komme ich damit heil nach Hause.
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Vous en avez ramassé assez. Maintenant, il faut juste les transporter sans encombre...
#. column 56: Boughs tremble, but speak not of the gentle breeze─ Aha, more timber! Thank you, fair stranger.
#. column 62: If you come upon more lumber ere I depart, I shall gladly trade it for a verse or two.
msgctxt "FateEvent:482:0:60"
msgid "Yes, this amount of wood should more than suffice. You are as a hero in one of the epics of eld! An epic involving an abundance of splinters."
msgstr "Да, этого дерева с лихвой хватит. Ты прямо герой древнего эпоса! Эпоса о щепках, которых было в избытке."

#. ja: そろそろ、引き上げようと思います。<br>もし気が変わりましたら、お声がけくださいね。
#. de: Gut, melde dich, wenn du es dir anders überlegst. Aber ich bleib hier nicht mehr lange.
#. fr: Je ne vais pas tarder à rentrer, mais dites-moi si vous changez d'avis.
#. column 56: Boughs tremble, but speak not of the gentle breeze─ Aha, more timber! Thank you, fair stranger.
#. column 60: Yes, this amount of wood should more than suffice. You are as a hero in one of the epics of eld! An epic involving an abundance of splinters.
msgctxt "FateEvent:482:0:62"
msgid "If you come upon more lumber ere I depart, I shall gladly trade it for a verse or two."
msgstr "Если до моего ухода найдёшь ещё древесины, с радостью обменяю её на пару стихов."

#. ja: おお、導きのヒト……あれ、見てほしい！<br>陸人に敵対的、とても過激な一派、フラウンダーいる！<br>乱暴者で有名、「沈殿のズムスィー・アース」、違いない！
#. de: Sieh nur, <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>! Dort drüben haben sich die hasserfüllten Flundern versammelt!
#. fr: Regarde, sssans-branchies<nbsp>! Le Flet, là-bas... Je penssse que ccc'est Zumshs Aath la terreur des abysses. Non, je n'ai aucun doute, en fait<nbsp>!
#. column 57: It ssseems that he too is searching for Archaeotania. If my guesss is correct, he wishes to use the beast in his own nefarious schemes. He may even try to lure it to the Cups!
#. column 58: We must ssstop him! Will you fight alongssside me?
#. column 59: Help Teushs Ooan fight Zumshs Aath Deepdread and his underlings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You ssseem to know a lot more about combat than I do, ssso I shall follow your lead!
#. column 62: Oh. That is not quite the answer I was hoping for... I had best devise another ssstrategy.
msgctxt "FateEvent:483:0:56"
msgid "Do you see that especially tall Ondo over there? That is Zumshs Aath Deepdread, a notorious villain!"
msgstr "Видишь вон того особенно рослого ондо? Это Зумшс Аат Глубокий Ужас, известный злодей!"

#. ja: しかも、「アルケオタニア」痕跡、調べているみたい！<br>きっと、強い獣、手に入れて、悪いこと使う、違いない！
#. de: Und sie scheinen ebenfalls auf der Suche nach Archaeotania zu sein. Das kann nichts Gutes bedeuten! Fsssh!
#. fr: Il inssspecte ccce qu'Archaeotania a laissé sssur ssson passage... Nous devons l'arrêter<nbsp>! Il veut pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment ssse ssservir de la bête pour mener à bien ssses terribles desseins<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Do you see that especially tall Ondo over there? That is Zumshs Aath Deepdread, a notorious villain!
#. column 58: We must ssstop him! Will you fight alongssside me?
#. column 59: Help Teushs Ooan fight Zumshs Aath Deepdread and his underlings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You ssseem to know a lot more about combat than I do, ssso I shall follow your lead!
#. column 62: Oh. That is not quite the answer I was hoping for... I had best devise another ssstrategy.
msgctxt "FateEvent:483:0:57"
msgid "It ssseems that he too is searching for Archaeotania. If my guesss is correct, he wishes to use the beast in his own nefarious schemes. He may even try to lure it to the Cups!"
msgstr "Похоже, он тоже ищет Археотанию. Если я не ошибаюсь, он хочет использовать чудовище в своих гнусных целях. Может, даже заманить его к Чашам!"

#. ja: でも、ズムスィー、乱暴者で有名、とても強い！<br>導きのヒト……戦って、勝てるか？<br>そうなら、ぜひ退治して、もらいたい……！
#. de: Siehst du ihren Anführer, Zumshs Aath? Er ist ein Fanatiker. Sssehr gefährlich. Aber wenn ich Archaeotania bezwingen möchte, muss ich ihn unschädlich machen. Wirst du mir helfen?
#. fr: Zumshs est d'une brutalité sssans pareille, même parmi les Flets. J'ai besoin de ton aide sssans-branchies. Mets-le en fuite, sss'il te plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Do you see that especially tall Ondo over there? That is Zumshs Aath Deepdread, a notorious villain!
#. column 57: It ssseems that he too is searching for Archaeotania. If my guesss is correct, he wishes to use the beast in his own nefarious schemes. He may even try to lure it to the Cups!
#. column 59: Help Teushs Ooan fight Zumshs Aath Deepdread and his underlings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You ssseem to know a lot more about combat than I do, ssso I shall follow your lead!
#. column 62: Oh. That is not quite the answer I was hoping for... I had best devise another ssstrategy.
msgctxt "FateEvent:483:0:58"
msgid "We must ssstop him! Will you fight alongssside me?"
msgstr "Надо его остановить! Сразишься со мной бок о бок?"

#. ja: テウスィー・オーンに協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Teushs Ooan helfen, die Flundern zu vertreiben?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Teushs Ooan<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Do you see that especially tall Ondo over there? That is Zumshs Aath Deepdread, a notorious villain!
#. column 57: It ssseems that he too is searching for Archaeotania. If my guesss is correct, he wishes to use the beast in his own nefarious schemes. He may even try to lure it to the Cups!
#. column 58: We must ssstop him! Will you fight alongssside me?
#. column 60: You ssseem to know a lot more about combat than I do, ssso I shall follow your lead!
#. column 62: Oh. That is not quite the answer I was hoping for... I had best devise another ssstrategy.
