msgid "Help Teushs Ooan fight Zumshs Aath Deepdread and his underlings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поможешь Теушсу Ооану одолеть Зумшса Аата Глубокий Ужас и его приспешников?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、ありがたい！<br>テウスィー、導きのヒト、感謝する！<br>テウスィー、戦い見守って、戦い学ぶ……！
#. de: Ich danke dir, <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>! Die Ondo stehen in deiner Schuld!
#. fr: Je compte sssur toi, sssans-branchies<nbsp>! Je vais en profiter pour obssserver comment les tiens ssse battent<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Do you see that especially tall Ondo over there? That is Zumshs Aath Deepdread, a notorious villain!
#. column 57: It ssseems that he too is searching for Archaeotania. If my guesss is correct, he wishes to use the beast in his own nefarious schemes. He may even try to lure it to the Cups!
#. column 58: We must ssstop him! Will you fight alongssside me?
#. column 59: Help Teushs Ooan fight Zumshs Aath Deepdread and his underlings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh. That is not quite the answer I was hoping for... I had best devise another ssstrategy.
msgctxt "FateEvent:483:0:60"
msgid "You ssseem to know a lot more about combat than I do, ssso I shall follow your lead!"
msgstr "Ты, похоже, разбираешься в бою куда лучше меня. Буду следовать твоему примеру!"

#. ja: おお、悲しい……！<br>だが、導きのヒト、忙しい、知ってる……！<br>テウスィー、がんばって、どうにかする！
#. de: Ohne deine Hilfe bin ich verloren! Ich habe keine Chance die Flundern zu bezwingen.
#. fr: Fsshhh... Tu ne peux pas<nbsp>? Je comprends... Je ferai de mon mieux ssseul<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Do you see that especially tall Ondo over there? That is Zumshs Aath Deepdread, a notorious villain!
#. column 57: It ssseems that he too is searching for Archaeotania. If my guesss is correct, he wishes to use the beast in his own nefarious schemes. He may even try to lure it to the Cups!
#. column 58: We must ssstop him! Will you fight alongssside me?
#. column 59: Help Teushs Ooan fight Zumshs Aath Deepdread and his underlings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You ssseem to know a lot more about combat than I do, ssso I shall follow your lead!
msgctxt "FateEvent:483:0:62"
msgid "Oh. That is not quite the answer I was hoping for... I had best devise another ssstrategy."
msgstr "Вот и нет. Придётся придумать другую стратегию..."

#. ja: おお、導きのヒト……聞いてほしい！<br>これまで調査、「アルケオタニア」、少しわかってきた……！<br>あの獣、とても大きい、とても強い、でも、警戒心強い！
#. de: Hallo <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>! Eine Gruppe Fischer hat die Spur Archaeotanias entdeckt.
#. fr: Sssans-branchies<nbsp>! J'en ai appris un peu plusss sssur Archaeotania<nbsp>! Malgré sssa taille gigantesssque et ssson incroyable puissanccce, elle ressste toujours sssur ssses gardes et passe ssson temps à ssse cacher<nbsp>!
#. column 57: It ssseems to be treating the area sssouth of the Cups as its territory, so I will concentrate my efforts here.
#. column 58: Will you watch my back while I look for hintsss as to its location?
#. column 59: Protect Teushs Ooan?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: It is all right, I quite understand. I shhhall just have to brave the roving predators and whatnot while I go about my work...
msgctxt "FateEvent:484:0:56"
msgid "For sssuch a large and powerful creature, Archaeotania certainly is cautiousss."
msgstr "Для такого огромного и сильного создания Археотания на удивление осторожна."

#. ja: オンドの潮溜まりの南、海溝を縄張りしているらしい……！<br>だから、テウスィーたち、張り込みしだけど、<br>決して姿、見せなかった……！
#. de: Ich bin ihnen bis hier in die Tiefe, zum Rand des Abhangs gefolgt.
#. fr: D'après mes in<shy>for<shy>ma<shy>tions, elle a établi ssson territoire dans les fosses au sssud de Baïne. Moi et les miens l'y avons attendue pour la débusssquer, mais elle n'est jamais sssortie de ssson trou<nbsp>!
#. column 56: For sssuch a large and powerful creature, Archaeotania certainly is cautiousss.
#. column 58: Will you watch my back while I look for hintsss as to its location?
#. column 59: Protect Teushs Ooan?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: It is all right, I quite understand. I shhhall just have to brave the roving predators and whatnot while I go about my work...
msgctxt "FateEvent:484:0:57"
msgid "It ssseems to be treating the area sssouth of the Cups as its territory, so I will concentrate my efforts here."
msgstr "Похоже, она облюбовала местность к югу от Чаш. Значит, буду искать здесь."

#. ja: テウスィー、もっとアルケオタニア、痕跡調べたい……！<br>でも、このあたり、ディープシー・カブスの縄張り……<br>調査中、テウスィーのこと、護ってくれるか？
#. de: Siehst du die Spuren dort drüben? Ich muss sie untersuchen, doch das hier ist das Revier der Tiefsee-Lunten. Ich brauche jemanden, der mir den Rücken freihält.
#. fr: Pourrais-tu empêcher ccces oléofurors de sss'en prendre à moi pendant que j'inssspecte cccet endroit à la recherche d'indiccces<nbsp>?
#. column 56: For sssuch a large and powerful creature, Archaeotania certainly is cautiousss.
#. column 57: It ssseems to be treating the area sssouth of the Cups as its territory, so I will concentrate my efforts here.
#. column 59: Protect Teushs Ooan?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: It is all right, I quite understand. I shhhall just have to brave the roving predators and whatnot while I go about my work...
msgctxt "FateEvent:484:0:58"
msgid "Will you watch my back while I look for hintsss as to its location?"
msgstr "Присмотришь за мной, пока я ищу подсказки, где она может быть?"

#. ja: テウスィー・オーンに協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Teushs Ooan vor den Tiefsee-Lunten beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Teushs Ooan<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: For sssuch a large and powerful creature, Archaeotania certainly is cautiousss.
#. column 57: It ssseems to be treating the area sssouth of the Cups as its territory, so I will concentrate my efforts here.
#. column 58: Will you watch my back while I look for hintsss as to its location?
#. column 62: It is all right, I quite understand. I shhhall just have to brave the roving predators and whatnot while I go about my work...
