msgstr "Защитить Теушса Ооана?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお、悲しい……！<br>だが、導きのヒト、忙しい、知ってる……！<br>テウスィー、がんばって、どうにかする！
#. de: Ohne deine Hilfe bin ich verloren! Ich habe keine Chance die Lunten zu bezwingen.
#. fr: Fsshhh... Ccc'est normal. Les Ondos ne sssont pas les ssseuls à requérir ton aide, j'en sssuis sssûr.
#. column 56: For sssuch a large and powerful creature, Archaeotania certainly is cautiousss.
#. column 57: It ssseems to be treating the area sssouth of the Cups as its territory, so I will concentrate my efforts here.
#. column 58: Will you watch my back while I look for hintsss as to its location?
#. column 59: Protect Teushs Ooan?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:484:0:62"
msgid "It is all right, I quite understand. I shhhall just have to brave the roving predators and whatnot while I go about my work..."
msgstr "Ничего, понимаю. Придётся самому пробираться среди бродячих хищников и прочих тварей..."

#. ja: ラリホー！<br>そこの道行く旅人よ、力を貸してくれんかの？
#. de: Holladrio, auf ein Wort, <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>! Hättest du vielleicht Lust, einem genialen Zwerg zur Hand zu gehen?
#. fr: Lali-ho<nbsp>! Dites, <if $gn4>voyageuse<else>voyageur</if>, vous pourriez me donner un coup de main<nbsp>?
#. column 57: The one thing we Tholls love more than tinkering with our toys is pitting those creations against our mortal enemies, the Goggs, in a battle to the death!
#. column 58: Alas, I am unable to complete my mechanical masterpiece and show the Gogg bastards what for... Oh, not for a lack of trying, mind you, but a simple lack of materials─prismatic ore, to be precise.
#. column 59: Assist the engineer in collecting prismatic ore?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A pity... You could have shared in the glory that is watching a Gogg turn tail and run home to his mother.
msgctxt "FateEvent:485:0:56"
msgid "Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. Might you spare a moment from your most wayward wanderings?"
msgstr "Лали-хо, путник, сбившийся с пути! Не уделишь ли минутку своим блужданиям?"

#. ja: 憎たらしいコグー一家の連中と、<br>自作オートマトンで勝負することになったのじゃ！<br>ワシは、この一戦に勝負をかけておる！
#. de: Ich habe die lausbärtigen Goggs zu einem Eisenbart-Bauwettbewerb herausgefordert! Sie bilden sich tatsächlich ein, dass sie es mit meiner Ingenieurskunst aufnehmen können!
#. fr: Ces abjects Gogg m'ont proposé une bataille d'automates, et bien sûr, j'ai décidé de relever le défi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. Might you spare a moment from your most wayward wanderings?
#. column 58: Alas, I am unable to complete my mechanical masterpiece and show the Gogg bastards what for... Oh, not for a lack of trying, mind you, but a simple lack of materials─prismatic ore, to be precise.
#. column 59: Assist the engineer in collecting prismatic ore?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A pity... You could have shared in the glory that is watching a Gogg turn tail and run home to his mother.
msgctxt "FateEvent:485:0:57"
msgid "The one thing we Tholls love more than tinkering with our toys is pitting those creations against our mortal enemies, the Goggs, in a battle to the death!"
msgstr "Больше всего на свете мы, троллы, любим возиться с игрушками. Ну и натравливать их друг на друга в смертельной схватке с нашими заклятыми врагами — гоггами!"

#. ja: じゃが、材料の「グルグプリズム」がなければ、<br>ワシの可愛いオートマトンは完成させることは不可能！<br>どうか材料集めに力を貸してくれい！
#. de: Aber ohne ausreichend Gulg-Prismen werde ich niemals die Prototypen für meine neueste Konstruktion fertigstellen können! Und ohne Prototypen kein „Dampfhammer“. Die Schmach wäre unerträglich! Bitte hilf mir, die Prismen zu sammeln!
#. fr: Le problème, c'est que mon automate n'est pas encore prêt<nbsp>! J'ai besoin de prismes volcaniques, vous pourriez m'aider à en trouver<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. Might you spare a moment from your most wayward wanderings?
#. column 57: The one thing we Tholls love more than tinkering with our toys is pitting those creations against our mortal enemies, the Goggs, in a battle to the death!
#. column 59: Assist the engineer in collecting prismatic ore?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A pity... You could have shared in the glory that is watching a Gogg turn tail and run home to his mother.
msgctxt "FateEvent:485:0:58"
msgid "Alas, I am unable to complete my mechanical masterpiece and show the Gogg bastards what for... Oh, not for a lack of trying, mind you, but a simple lack of materials─prismatic ore, to be precise."
msgstr "Увы, я не могу закончить свой механический шедевр и показать этим мерзким гоггам, где раки зимуют... И дело не в отсутствии стараний, а в нехватке материалов. А именно — призматической руды."

#. ja: トルー一家の技師に協力する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Baumeister zur Hand gehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'ingénieur des Tholl<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. Might you spare a moment from your most wayward wanderings?
#. column 57: The one thing we Tholls love more than tinkering with our toys is pitting those creations against our mortal enemies, the Goggs, in a battle to the death!
#. column 58: Alas, I am unable to complete my mechanical masterpiece and show the Gogg bastards what for... Oh, not for a lack of trying, mind you, but a simple lack of materials─prismatic ore, to be precise.
#. column 62: A pity... You could have shared in the glory that is watching a Gogg turn tail and run home to his mother.
