msgctxt "FateEvent:485:0:59"
msgid "Assist the engineer in collecting prismatic ore?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поможешь инженеру собрать призматическую руду?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 残念じゃぞい……。<br>さて、どうやって完成させるべきかの……。
#. de: Ohne Hilfe bin ich aufgeschmissen! Die Häme der Goggs wird unerträglich sein!
#. fr: Oh, très bien... Bon, comment je vais finir mon automate, maintenant<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. Might you spare a moment from your most wayward wanderings?
#. column 57: The one thing we Tholls love more than tinkering with our toys is pitting those creations against our mortal enemies, the Goggs, in a battle to the death!
#. column 58: Alas, I am unable to complete my mechanical masterpiece and show the Gogg bastards what for... Oh, not for a lack of trying, mind you, but a simple lack of materials─prismatic ore, to be precise.
#. column 59: Assist the engineer in collecting prismatic ore?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:485:0:62"
msgid "A pity... You could have shared in the glory that is watching a Gogg turn tail and run home to his mother."
msgstr "Вот досада... И как теперь закончить работу?"

#. ja: ラリホー！<br>その手に持っておる「グルグプリズム」……<br>ワシに譲ってくれい！
#. de: Holladrio! Sind das etwa Gulg-Prismen in deiner Hand? Reich sie mir!
#. fr: Lali-ho<nbsp>! Dites, c'est bien des prismes volcaniques que vous avez là<nbsp>? Donnez-les moi, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Yes, yes. This will do nicely! I can almost hear the screams of those damnable Goggs as they die slowly under the fist of my iron friend. Almost. I'll need more ore to hear it better.
#. column 62: Keep the ore if you must, just don't think of giving it to the Goggs. Unless you want to see me upset...and you don't want to see me upset.
msgctxt "FateEvent:486:0:56"
msgid "Lali-ho! Would you believe me if I said I could smell the prismatic ore in your bag? No? Well, I can."
msgstr "Лали-хо! Поверишь, если скажу, что чую призматическую руду в твоей сумке? Нет? А зря, правда чую."

#. ja: 感謝するぞい！<br>じゃが、まだまだ数が足りておらん！<br>また見つけたら持ってきてくれい！
#. de: Vielen Dank. Allerdings habe ich noch lange nicht genug von den Gulg-Prismen, um meine Prototypen herzustellen. Falls du noch mehr finden solltest ...
#. fr: Oh, merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Mais ça ne suffit pas, apportez-m'en plus<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Lali-ho! Would you believe me if I said I could smell the prismatic ore in your bag? No? Well, I can.
#. column 62: Keep the ore if you must, just don't think of giving it to the Goggs. Unless you want to see me upset...and you don't want to see me upset.
msgctxt "FateEvent:486:0:60"
msgid "Yes, yes. This will do nicely! I can almost hear the screams of those damnable Goggs as they die slowly under the fist of my iron friend. Almost. I'll need more ore to hear it better."
msgstr "Да, да. Отлично! Уже слышу, как эти проклятые гогги вопят, медленно умирая под кулаком моего железного друга. Почти слышу. Нужно ещё руды, чтобы расслышать получше."

#. ja: 残念じゃぞい……。<br>譲ってくれる気になったら、声をかけてほしいのじゃ。
#. de: Das ist wirklich bedauerlich. Falls du es dir noch anders überlegen solltest, ich bin hier.
#. fr: Comme vous voulez... Revenez me voir si vous changez d'avis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Lali-ho! Would you believe me if I said I could smell the prismatic ore in your bag? No? Well, I can.
#. column 60: Yes, yes. This will do nicely! I can almost hear the screams of those damnable Goggs as they die slowly under the fist of my iron friend. Almost. I'll need more ore to hear it better.
msgctxt "FateEvent:486:0:62"
msgid "Keep the ore if you must, just don't think of giving it to the Goggs. Unless you want to see me upset...and you don't want to see me upset."
msgstr "Оставь руду себе, если хочешь. Только не вздумай отдавать её гоггам. Не то я рассержусь... А тебе этого не надо."

#. ja: 地表に露出した「グルグプリズム」を拾うか、<br>それを餌とするディコタイタスを狩るか……。<br>入手手段はふたつに、ひとつじゃ！
#. de: Hm, entweder musst du die Gulg-Prismen von der Erde auflesen oder die Dicotiten jagen, die sich mit den Prismen schmücken. Am besten beides. Doppelt hält besser!
#. fr: Vous pourrez trouver des prismes volcaniques par terre, ou chasser les dicholitus qui s'en nourrissent<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:487:0:56"
msgid "Ore? The whole mountain there is filled with it. Why, a keen-eyed sort might even find lumps lying hither and yon about the scree. Though, if treasure hunts aren't your mug of ale, I suppose you could always just whack about the local lizards that lunch on the stuff. Decotitus I think they're called."
msgstr "Руда? Да вся гора вон там ею набита. Иной кусок можно и так найти среди камней — только глаза держи открытыми. А если искать сокровища не по душе, всегда можно поколотить местных ящеров. Как их там... децотиты, кажется."

#. ja: ラリホー！<br>「グルグプリズム」は、かなり集まったぞい！<br>さて、帰る準備でもするかの……。
#. de: Holladrio! Jetzt haben wir alle Gulg-Prismen zusammen! Zeit, die Prototypen zusammenzubauen ...
#. fr: Lali-ho<nbsp>! Je n'en espérais pas tant<nbsp>! Avec tout ça, je vais pouvoir m'atteler aux derniers préparatifs...
msgctxt "FateEvent:489:0:56"
msgid "Lali-ho! My pockets are full to bursting with prismatic pretties! Their luster will be my guiding light to victory! (Did you like that line? I'm thinking of using it after I've crushed the life from those Goggs.)"
msgstr "Лали-хо! Карманы ломятся от призматических блёсток! Их сияние приведёт меня к победе! Как вам строчка? Может, скажу её после того, как размозжу этих гоггов."

#. ja: ラリホー！<br>その手に持っておる「グルグプリズム」……<br>ワシに譲ってくれい！
#. de: Holladrio! Sind das etwa Gulg-Prismen in deiner Hand? Reich sie mir!
#. fr: Lali-ho<nbsp>! Dites, c'est bien des prismes volcaniques que vous avez là<nbsp>? Donnez-les moi, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Yes, yes. This is more than enough! Why, I might even have enough to build two automata! But no, that would go against our noble dwarven code. One-on-one! Mano-a-mano! Vis-à-vis! That is how we've settled our conflicts for centuries!
#. column 62: Keep the ore if you must. I have more than enough to complete my project!
msgctxt "FateEvent:490:0:56"
msgid "Lali-ho! More ore for yours truly? You shouldn't have...but I'll take it nonetheless!"
msgstr "Лали-хо! Ещё руды для меня? Ну надо же... Ладно, беру!"

#. ja: 感謝するぞい！<br>これだけ「グルグプリズム」があれば満足じゃ！<br>さて、帰る準備でもするかの……。
#. de: Dem Erbauer sei Dank! Jetzt habe ich genug Gulg-Prismen! Zeit, zurückzukehren ...
#. fr: Lali-ho<nbsp>! Merci, c'est plus que suffisant. Avec tout ça, je vais pouvoir m'atteler aux derniers préparatifs...
#. column 56: Lali-ho! More ore for yours truly? You shouldn't have...but I'll take it nonetheless!
#. column 62: Keep the ore if you must. I have more than enough to complete my project!
msgctxt "FateEvent:490:0:60"
msgid "Yes, yes. This is more than enough! Why, I might even have enough to build two automata! But no, that would go against our noble dwarven code. One-on-one! Mano-a-mano! Vis-à-vis! That is how we've settled our conflicts for centuries!"
msgstr "Да, да. Этого больше чем достаточно! Хватит, пожалуй, даже на два автомата. Но нет, это противоречит нашему благородному кодексу гномов. Один на один! Лицом к лицу! Так мы решаем споры уже не одно столетие!"

#. ja: 残念じゃぞい……。<br>譲ってくれる気になったら、声をかけてほしいのじゃ。
#. de: Das ist wirklich bedauerlich. Ich brauche die Gulg-Prismen unbedingt, oder ich mache mich lächerlich!
#. fr: Comme vous voulez... Revenez me voir si vous changez d'avis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Lali-ho! More ore for yours truly? You shouldn't have...but I'll take it nonetheless!
#. column 60: Yes, yes. This is more than enough! Why, I might even have enough to build two automata! But no, that would go against our noble dwarven code. One-on-one! Mano-a-mano! Vis-à-vis! That is how we've settled our conflicts for centuries!
msgctxt "FateEvent:490:0:62"
msgid "Keep the ore if you must. I have more than enough to complete my project!"
msgstr "Оставь руду себе, если хочешь. Мне и так хватит, чтобы закончить работу!"

#. ja: ラリホー！<br>おヌシ、なかなか腕が立ちそうじゃの！
#. de: Holladrio! Ich habe es vollbracht! Mein Meisterwerk ist bereit, den Gogg die Schmalzbärte zu versengen!
#. fr: Lali-ho<nbsp>! Vous savez vous battre, non<nbsp>? Sûrement mieux que moi, en tout cas.
#. column 57: Might you be willing to help me test the durability of my latest creation? It is for a most noble cause, I promise you. What cause, you ask? Why, crushing my enemies, of course! What cause could be more nobler? Especially when those enemies are of the detestable Gogg clan.
#. column 58: Assist the engineer in testing his creation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: There will be others. There always are!
msgctxt "FateEvent:491:0:56"
msgid "Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. I couldn't help but notice those bulging knots of thew 'neath your well-kept raiment."
msgstr "Лали-хо, путник, сбившийся с пути! Не могу не заметить, как под твоей ладной одеждой бугрятся мышцы."

#. ja: 最高のオートマトンを開発するために、<br>試作機と戦ってくれる者を探しておるのじゃ！<br>どうじゃ、頼まれてくれんかの？
#. de: Aber um die Effektivität meines genialen Konstrukts zu testen, brauche ich noch jemanden, der einen Testkampf gegen meine Prototypen absolviert! Ich brauche die Telemetriedaten, um meinen Dampfhammer für das Duell vorzubereiten.
#. fr: Pour les derniers réglages de mon automate, j'ai besoin d'un volontaire pour affronter deux prototypes. Je peux compter sur vous<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. I couldn't help but notice those bulging knots of thew 'neath your well-kept raiment.
#. column 58: Assist the engineer in testing his creation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: There will be others. There always are!
msgctxt "FateEvent:491:0:57"
msgid "Might you be willing to help me test the durability of my latest creation? It is for a most noble cause, I promise you. What cause, you ask? Why, crushing my enemies, of course! What cause could be more nobler? Especially when those enemies are of the detestable Gogg clan."
msgstr "Не поможешь испытать прочность моего последнего творения? Ради благородного дела, обещаю. Какого? Да сокрушения моих врагов, конечно! Что может быть благороднее? Особенно когда враги — мерзкий клан гоггов."

#. ja: トルー一家の技師に協力する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Mit den Prototypen des Baumeisters messen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'ingénieur des Tholl<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. I couldn't help but notice those bulging knots of thew 'neath your well-kept raiment.
#. column 57: Might you be willing to help me test the durability of my latest creation? It is for a most noble cause, I promise you. What cause, you ask? Why, crushing my enemies, of course! What cause could be more nobler? Especially when those enemies are of the detestable Gogg clan.
#. column 62: There will be others. There always are!
