msgctxt "FateEvent:491:0:58"
msgid "Assist the engineer in testing his creation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поможешь инженеру испытать его творение?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 残念じゃぞい……。<br>さて、誰に実戦テストを頼むかのう……。
#. de: Wie, du kneifst? Ich verstehe, du fürchtest dich vor meinen Prototypen. Kann ich dir nicht verübeln ...
#. fr: C'est dommage... Bon, où est-ce que je vais trouver un cobaye moi...<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Lali-ho, O wayward wanderer. I couldn't help but notice those bulging knots of thew 'neath your well-kept raiment.
#. column 57: Might you be willing to help me test the durability of my latest creation? It is for a most noble cause, I promise you. What cause, you ask? Why, crushing my enemies, of course! What cause could be more nobler? Especially when those enemies are of the detestable Gogg clan.
#. column 58: Assist the engineer in testing his creation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:491:0:62"
msgid "There will be others. There always are!"
msgstr "Ничего, найдутся другие. Они всегда находятся!"

#. ja: おお、旅人よ！<br>巡回中に、魔物に襲われた行商人を見つけたのだ。<br>部隊の仲間に救援も要請しているのだが……
#. de: He da! <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>! Uns hat die Nachricht von einem Händler erreicht, der Opfer eines Überfalls geworden ist. Wir haben bereits einen Trupp ausgesandt, um zu helfen, doch ...
#. fr: Oh, voyageu<if $gn4>se<else>r</if><nbsp>! J'ai trouvé un marchand sauvagement attaqué par un monstre pendant ma ronde. J'ai appelé des renforts, mais...
#. column 57: I'm looking after him while we wait for the rest of the guard to arrive─which I expect will be some time after every savage beast in the area has been drawn by the scent of blood, given how long they're taking.
#. column 58: Assist the guard in defending the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, yes, <i>do</i> be on your way. Don't worry about us─we'll be having ever so much fun being mauled.
msgctxt "FateEvent:492:0:56"
msgid "What's with all the blood, you ask? Well, our friend here's had a wee bite taken out of him by a draco. This sort of thing happens from time to time. Usually during my shift."
msgstr "Что за кровь, спрашиваешь? Нашего приятеля тут драко покусал. Такое время от времени случается. Обычно в мою смену."

#. ja: この辺りは、ドラコの縄張りでな。<br>血の匂いに敏感な奴らが、いつ襲ってくるとも限らない。<br>しばし、負傷した行商人の護衛に、協力してくれないか？
#. de: ... die Gegend liegt im Jagdrevier der Dracos. Wenn sie erst einmal die Witterung von Blut aufgenommen haben, ist es nur noch eine Frage der Zeit, bis sie auftauchen, um leichte Beute zu machen. Vielleicht könntest du helfen, den Händler in Not zu beschützen?
#. fr: Nous sommes sur le territoire des dracos. Ils sont sensibles à l'odeur du sang et pourraient attaquer à tout moment. Est-ce que je peux vous demander de protéger le marchand blessé quelque temps<nbsp>?
#. column 56: What's with all the blood, you ask? Well, our friend here's had a wee bite taken out of him by a draco. This sort of thing happens from time to time. Usually during my shift.
#. column 58: Assist the guard in defending the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, yes, <i>do</i> be on your way. Don't worry about us─we'll be having ever so much fun being mauled.
msgctxt "FateEvent:492:0:57"
msgid "I'm looking after him while we wait for the rest of the guard to arrive─which I expect will be some time after every savage beast in the area has been drawn by the scent of blood, given how long they're taking."
msgstr "Я присматриваю за ним, пока не подоспеет остальная стража. Судя по тому, как долго они едут, звери успеют слететься на запах крови раньше них."

#. ja: 護衛に協力してあげますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Händler beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider à protéger le marchand blessé<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: What's with all the blood, you ask? Well, our friend here's had a wee bite taken out of him by a draco. This sort of thing happens from time to time. Usually during my shift.
#. column 57: I'm looking after him while we wait for the rest of the guard to arrive─which I expect will be some time after every savage beast in the area has been drawn by the scent of blood, given how long they're taking.
#. column 62: Oh, yes, <i>do</i> be on your way. Don't worry about us─we'll be having ever so much fun being mauled.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:492:0:58"
msgid "Assist the guard in defending the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Поможешь стражнику защитить торговца?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 命が惜しいなら、早急に立ち去ったほうがいい。<br>いつ、ドラコの群れが現れるかもわからんからな。
#. de: Ich fürchte, der Händler ist in größter Gefahr und mit Dracos ist nicht zu spaßen. <if $gn4>Eine erfahrene Kriegerin<else>Ein erfahrener Krieger</if> an unserer Seite, wäre Gold wert.
#. fr: Si vous tenez à la vie, ne restez pas là. Qui sait quand les dracos peuvent attaquer...
#. column 56: What's with all the blood, you ask? Well, our friend here's had a wee bite taken out of him by a draco. This sort of thing happens from time to time. Usually during my shift.
#. column 57: I'm looking after him while we wait for the rest of the guard to arrive─which I expect will be some time after every savage beast in the area has been drawn by the scent of blood, given how long they're taking.
#. column 58: Assist the guard in defending the merchant?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:492:0:62"
msgid "Oh, yes, <i>do</i> be on your way. Don't worry about us─we'll be having ever so much fun being mauled."
msgstr "Ну да, ступай уж. За нас не волнуйся — мы тут просто <i>в восторге</i> от того, как нас рвут на части."

#. ja: うう、忌々しいドラコの奴らめ……<br>好き放題、噛みつきやがって……いたたたた……。
#. de: Diese verfluchten Dracos ... Argh ...
#. fr: Maudits dracos... Ils m'ont mordu... J'ai mal...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:493:0:56"
msgid "No, this is fine. Who needs intact flesh? Really, I'm having a <i>fabulous</i> time right now."
msgstr "Нет, всё отлично. Кому нужна целая шкура? Я просто в <i>восторге</i>."

#. ja: 何かを食い散らかした痕跡がある……。<br>これを食した生物は、かなり巨大な口を持っているようだ。
#. de: Das sind die Überreste der Mahlzeit einer Bestie mit einem gewaltigen Schlund. Archaeotania scheint einen großen Appetit auf Blutkorallen zu haben<nbsp>...
#. fr: Cet amas de chair ressemble aux restes d'un animal. Le prédateur responsable de ce carnage doit posséder une gigantesque mâchoire...
msgctxt "FateEvent:494:0:56"
msgid "Whatever left these remains has an enormous mouth."
msgstr "У того, кто оставил эти останки, огромная пасть."

#. ja: むっ、旅人か……？<br>実は困ったことが起きていてな。<br>こちらの行商人らしき方が、負傷して倒れていたのだ。
#. de: Hallo <if $gn4>Sünderin<else>Sünder</if>! Ein Wort der Warnung: Es scheint, irgendjemand oder irgendetwas macht die Gegend hier unsicher. Dieser Händler ist ganz klar Opfer eines Überfalls geworden.
#. fr: Oh, vous êtes un<if $gn4>e</if> voyageu<if $gn4>se<else>r</if><nbsp>? J'ai un problème<nbsp>: ce marchand semble blessé...
#. column 57: I've been pressing him for details, but truth be told, he isn't making much sense. Perhaps his words will have more meaning to a well-traveled person such as yourself?
msgctxt "FateEvent:495:0:56"
msgid "Hail, sinner! A word of caution─it seems as if some fell creature or lawless villain is about. This merchant has clearly been attacked by one or the other."
msgstr "Приветствую, грешник! Осторожнее: похоже, тут орудует какое-то чудовище или беззаконный злодей. На торговца явно кто-то напал."

#. ja: ところが、よほど恐ろしい目にでも遭ったのか、<br>我々が声をかけても、まともな応えが返ってこない。<br>キミからも、事情を聞いてみてはくれないか？
#. de: Ich habe versucht, von ihm zu erfahren, was vorgefallen ist. Ich muss jedoch gestehen, dass ich aus seiner Geschichte nicht schlau geworden bin. Aber vielleicht hast du mehr Glück als ich?
#. fr: Mais il ne répond pas quand on lui parle. Peut-être un traumatisme<nbsp>? Est-ce que vous pourriez essayer de lui parler pour savoir ce qui se passe, vous aussi<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Hail, sinner! A word of caution─it seems as if some fell creature or lawless villain is about. This merchant has clearly been attacked by one or the other.
msgctxt "FateEvent:495:0:57"
msgid "I've been pressing him for details, but truth be told, he isn't making much sense. Perhaps his words will have more meaning to a well-traveled person such as yourself?"
msgstr "Я пытался расспросить его, но, признаться, ничего толком не понял. Может, тебе, бывалому путешественнику, удастся разобраться в его словах?"

#. ja: う、うぅ……。
#. de: Oh diese Schrecken, diese haarsträubenden Schrecken! Halt dich fern von mir <if $gn4>Sünderin<else>Sünder</if>, oder kein Wort wird mir über die Lippen kommen!
#. fr: Ah... argh...
#. column 57: Listen despite your better judgment?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:496:0:56"
msgid "Oh, the horrors! The most assuredly real horrors! Stand right there while I tell you about them!"
msgstr "О, ужасы! Самые что ни на есть настоящие ужасы! Стой вот здесь, сейчас всё расскажу!"

#. ja: 事情を聞いてみますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dir die Geschichte des Händlers anhören?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Interroger le marchand<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, the horrors! The most assuredly real horrors! Stand right there while I tell you about them!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:496:0:57"
msgid "Listen despite your better judgment?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Выслушать его, хоть разум и подсказывает обратное?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 何かを食い散らかした痕跡がある……。<br>一部に正体不明の赤い物質が付着しているようだ。
#. de: Archaeotania scheint einen großen Appetit auf Blutkorallen zu haben ...
#. fr: Les restes de cet animal sont maculés d'une substance rouge, mais qui ne ressemble pas à du sang...
msgctxt "FateEvent:497:0:56"
msgid "Remnants of the fiend's last meal, covered in red flakes of some sort..."
msgstr "Остатки последней трапезы чудовища, покрытые какими-то красными хлопьями..."

#. ja: 森を護るは、ファノヴの民の務め……<br>いかなる悪しき変化も見逃すわけにはいかん。
#. de: Es ist unsere Bestimmung, den Großen Wald vor allen Gefahren zu beschützen. Mögen sie groß oder klein sein.
#. fr: Protéger la forêt est la mission des habitantes de Fanow... Nous devons être vigilantes en toutes cir<shy>cons<shy>tan<shy>ces<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:498:0:56"
msgid "We live to defend the Greatwood from threats great and small."
msgstr "Мы живём, чтобы защищать Великий Лес от любых угроз."

#. ja: 「外」の者が……何用ですか？
#. de: Was ist dein Begehr, <if $gn4>Fremde<else>Fremder</if>?
#. fr: Je peux vous aider<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:499:0:56"
msgid "What would an outsider like you want with us?"
msgstr "Что тебе нужно от нас, чужак?"

#. ja: ヤクルスは、私たちの翼です。<br>この子らの力なくして、森は護れはしません。
#. de: Ohne unsere Jaculus könnten wir unsere Pflicht nicht erfüllen. Dank ihnen erreichen wir jeden Winkel des Großen Waldes in Windeseile.
#. fr: Sans nos griffons nous ne pourrions pas protéger la forêt, vous savez.
msgctxt "FateEvent:500:0:56"
msgid "We would struggle to perform our duties without the jaculus. They allow us to reach even the farthest reaches of the Greatwood with remarkable speed."
msgstr "Без наших якулусов нам было бы трудно исполнять свой долг. Благодаря им мы быстро добираемся даже до самых дальних уголков Великого Леса."

#. ja: 森の木々に獣たち、そしてロンカの遺産……<br>そのすべてが微妙なバランスによって、<br>維持されているのです。
#. de: Wir beschützen nicht nur die Ruinen der Ronka vor Eindringlingen, wir bewahren auch die natürliche Balance aller Geschöpfe des Waldes.
#. fr: L'équilibre délicat entre les animaux de la forêt et l'héritage de Ronka est unique.
msgctxt "FateEvent:501:0:56"
msgid "Not only do we defend the Ronkan ruins from intruders, but we work to maintain the delicate natural balance of the Greatwood."
msgstr "Мы не только защищаем руины Ронки от незваных гостей, но и сохраняем хрупкое равновесие природы Великого Леса."

#. ja: タリチャックの羽根は、矢羽に最適だ。<br>部下にも集めさせているが、我々は残りの矢が、<br>心許ないのでな……。
#. de: Die Federn der Tarichuks sind ideal für unsere Pfeile geeignet. Sie geben ihnen genau den richtigen Drall über die ganze Distanz. Diese kleine Schar sollte uns für eine Weile mit ausreichend Federn versorgen.
#. fr: Les plumes de tarichuk sont parfaites pour fabriquer les flèches. J'ai laissé le soin à mes camarades d'aller en récupérer, mais j'ai bien peur qu'on soit quand même rapidement à court...
#. column 57: There may be a few lying on the ground, but the quickest way is to put down the tarichuks and pluck them from their corses.
#. column 58: Help the Singing Bows collect feathers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: If you have no interest in helping, please stay out of the way.
msgctxt "FateEvent:502:0:56"
msgid "Tarichuk feathers are the ideal choice for arrow flights. This flock should provide us with enough to last for a while."
msgstr "Перья таричуков идеально подходят для оперения стрел. Этой стаи нам должно надолго хватить."

#. ja: 君が協力してくれるなら、ありがたい。<br>「タリチャックの羽根」は拾い集めるも良し、<br>狩りをして集めるも良しだ。
#. de: Ein paar der Federn liegen auf dem Boden verstreut, aber am schnellsten geht es, wenn man die Vögel selbst erlegt und rupft.
#. fr: Ça serait vraiment nous rendre un grand service si tu acceptais de nous aider<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Tarichuk feathers are the ideal choice for arrow flights. This flock should provide us with enough to last for a while.
#. column 58: Help the Singing Bows collect feathers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: If you have no interest in helping, please stay out of the way.
msgctxt "FateEvent:502:0:57"
msgid "There may be a few lying on the ground, but the quickest way is to put down the tarichuks and pluck them from their corses."
msgstr "На земле иногда попадаются перья, но быстрее всего будет убить таричуков и ощипать их."

#. ja: 「タリチャックの羽根」を回収する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der Patrouille helfen, Federn zu erbeuten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aller récupérer des plumes de tarichuk<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Tarichuk feathers are the ideal choice for arrow flights. This flock should provide us with enough to last for a while.
#. column 57: There may be a few lying on the ground, but the quickest way is to put down the tarichuks and pluck them from their corses.
#. column 62: If you have no interest in helping, please stay out of the way.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:502:0:58"
msgid "Help the Singing Bows collect feathers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь Стреляющим Ливнем собрать перья?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 無理にとは言わんさ。
#. de: Wenn du nicht helfen möchtest, steh uns nicht im Weg.
#. fr: D'accord, je ne vais pas te forcer.
#. column 56: Tarichuk feathers are the ideal choice for arrow flights. This flock should provide us with enough to last for a while.
#. column 57: There may be a few lying on the ground, but the quickest way is to put down the tarichuks and pluck them from their corses.
#. column 58: Help the Singing Bows collect feathers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:502:0:62"
msgid "If you have no interest in helping, please stay out of the way."
msgstr "Не хочешь помогать — не настаиваю. Только не мешай."

#. ja: 「タリチャックの羽根」を持っているようだな。<br>それを提供してくれると、助かるのだが……？
#. de: Und, konntest du ein paar Federn für unsere Pfeilschafte sammeln?
#. fr: On dirait que tu es en possession de plumes de tarichuk, je me trompe<nbsp>? C'est pour moi<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Good work, though I would still like to collect more feathers before calling it a day.
#. column 62: Tell me, have you any skill as a fletcher?
msgctxt "FateEvent:503:0:56"
msgid "So, you have something for me?"
msgstr "Так, у тебя что-то для меня есть?"

#. ja: 感謝するぞ。<br>だが、まだ「タリチャックの羽根」が不足している。<br>また見つけたら、提供してくれるとありがたい。
#. de: Gute Arbeit. Aber wir benötigen noch mehr, bevor wir unsere Köcher wieder füllen können.
#. fr: Je te remercie<nbsp>! Bon, il en manque quand même toujours... Tu as encore un peu de temps pour m'aider<nbsp>?
#. column 56: So, you have something for me?
#. column 62: Tell me, have you any skill as a fletcher?
msgctxt "FateEvent:503:0:60"
msgid "Good work, though I would still like to collect more feathers before calling it a day."
msgstr "Хорошая работа. Но перьев всё ещё мало. Принесёшь ещё, если найдёшь?"

#. ja: ふむ、君も矢を作るのか？
#. de: Sprich, verstehst du dich auf das Handwerk des Pfeilmachers?
#. fr: Hum... Toi aussi tu veux t'en servir pour fabriquer des flèches<nbsp>?
#. column 56: So, you have something for me?
#. column 60: Good work, though I would still like to collect more feathers before calling it a day.
msgctxt "FateEvent:503:0:62"
msgid "Tell me, have you any skill as a fletcher?"
msgstr "Скажи, ты тоже умеешь делать стрелы?"

#. ja: タリチャックの羽根を矢羽にすると、<br>ブレが少なくなり、格段に命中率が上がるのだ。
#. de: Es ist kein Geheimnis hier im Wald: Pfeile mit diesen Federn fliegen weiter und sind treffsicherer als alle anderen Pfeile.
#. fr: Depuis qu'on utilise des plumes de tarichuk pour nos flèches, elles sont beaucoup plus précises.
msgctxt "FateEvent:504:0:56"
msgid "Arrows with tarichuk feather flights will never let you down, even at very long distances."
msgstr "Стрелы с оперением из перьев таричука не подведут даже на большом расстоянии."

#. ja: かなりの量を集めることができたが……<br>君は「タリチャックの羽根」を持っているようだな。<br>それも提供してくれるのか？
#. de: Wir haben schon ein paar Säcke voller Federn, aber man kann nie genug haben.
#. fr: On commence à avoir pas mal de plumes<nbsp>! Tu m'en as ramené aussi<nbsp>?
#. column 60: With this, we should be able to replenish our dwindling stock of arrows in no time.
#. column 62: Tell me, have you any skill as a fletcher?
msgctxt "FateEvent:505:0:56"
msgid "We already have a decent haul, but we can never have too many of these feathers."
msgstr "Мы уже неплохо набрали, но перьев много не бывает."

#. ja: 感謝するぞ。<br>これで、しばらくの間は矢羽に困ることはなさそうだ。
#. de: Damit sollten wir bald schon wieder genug Pfeile in den Köchern haben, um diese Patrouille zu Ende zu führen.
#. fr: Ah, merci, vraiment<nbsp>! Avec ça on devrait être tranquille pour un moment<nbsp>!
#. column 56: We already have a decent haul, but we can never have too many of these feathers.
#. column 62: Tell me, have you any skill as a fletcher?
msgctxt "FateEvent:505:0:60"
msgid "With this, we should be able to replenish our dwindling stock of arrows in no time."
msgstr "С этим запасом мы быстро пополним наши поредевшие запасы стрел."

#. ja: ふむ、君も矢を作るのか？
#. de: Sag, verstehst du dich auf das Handwerk des Pfeilmachers?
#. fr: Hum... Toi aussi tu veux t'en servir pour fabriquer des flèches<nbsp>?
#. column 56: We already have a decent haul, but we can never have too many of these feathers.
#. column 60: With this, we should be able to replenish our dwindling stock of arrows in no time.
msgctxt "FateEvent:505:0:62"
msgid "Tell me, have you any skill as a fletcher?"
msgstr "Скажи, ты умеешь делать стрелы?"

#. ja: タリチャックの羽根を矢羽にすると、<br>ブレが少なくなり、格段に命中率が上がるのだ。
#. de: Es ist kein Geheimnis hier im Wald: Pfeile mit diesen Federn fliegen weiter und sind treffsicherer als alle anderen Pfeile.
#. fr: Depuis qu'on utilise des plumes de tarichuk pour nos flèches, elles sont beaucoup plus précises.
msgctxt "FateEvent:506:0:56"
msgid "Arrows with tarichuk feather flights will never let you down, even at very long distances."
msgstr "Стрелы с оперением из перьев таричуков не подведут даже на большом расстоянии."

#. ja: 「光の氾濫」によって、ヴィースの数は減った。<br>森の護り手としての使命を果たしているのは、<br>我らファノヴの民くらいのものだ。
#. de: Der Niedergang der Viis seit der Lichtflut bedeutet, dass wir Jägerinnen aus Fanow nun die letzten sind, die den Großen Wald noch beschützen können. Eine große Verantwortung.
#. fr: Nous avons perdu beaucoup de nos camarades viis à cause du déluge de Lumière. Seules les habitantes de Fanow continuent de protéger la forêt de nos jours.
msgctxt "FateEvent:507:0:56"
msgid "The decline in the number of Viis since the Flood of Light means that we of Fanow are the only ones left to defend the Greatwood."
msgstr "После Потопа Света виес стало меньше. Теперь только мы, жители Фанова, защищаем Великий лес."

#. ja: 「外」の者が、どれほど戦えるのかと思っていましたが、<br>正直、驚いていますよ……。
#. de: Wir Jägerinnen haben unsere eigenen Taktiken und Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten entwickelt. Myalna ist eine gute Lehrmeisterin.
#. fr: Je n'aurais jamais pensé rencontrer un<if $gn4>e</if> étrang<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> qui sache se battre aussi bien que vous<nbsp>!
#. column 57: But after seeing the way you outsiders handle yourselves, I think we may stand to learn something from you, too.
msgctxt "FateEvent:508:0:56"
msgid "We Singing Bows have developed our own way of fighting, based on Myalna's teachings."
msgstr "Мы, Лучники Поющих Луков, выработали собственный стиль боя, следуя урокам Мьялны."

#. ja: 戦い方は、私たちと違っていますが、<br>きっと良い師と出会うことができたのでしょうね。<br>私たちにとってのミャルナ様のような……。
#. de: Aber nachdem wir dich und deinesgleichen im Kampf erlebt haben, müssen wir neidlos anerkennen, dass wir vielleicht auch noch das eine oder andere von den Fremden lernen können.
#. fr: Vos techniques de combat sont différentes, mais je dois reconnaître que vous devez avoir eu un excellent professeur.
#. column 56: We Singing Bows have developed our own way of fighting, based on Myalna's teachings.
msgctxt "FateEvent:508:0:57"
msgid "But after seeing the way you outsiders handle yourselves, I think we may stand to learn something from you, too."
msgstr "Но, увидев, как сражаетесь вы, чужаки, думаю, и нам есть чему у вас поучиться."

#. ja: 巡回の任務が続くと、<br>どうしてもお腹が減ってしまいます。<br>「外」では、どんな料理を食べるのですか？
#. de: Nicht selten sind wir wochenlang im Großen Wald unterwegs ohne lange Pausen. Da ist es wichtig, dass wir jede Gelegenheit zur Rast nutzen. Dabei essen wir oft getrocknete Feldrationen, die leicht und zugleich nahrhaft sind.
#. fr: Patrouiller, ça me donne toujours tellement faim... Dites, quel genre de nourriture vous mangez d'habitude à l'extérieur<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:509:0:56"
msgid "As we are constantly moving from one location to the next, we must eat whenever the opportunity affords itself. As such, we tend to rely on dried foods that are easy to carry."
msgstr "Мы всё время переходим с места на место и едим при первой возможности. Обычно это сушёная еда — её удобно брать с собой."

#. ja: はるか昔、「光の氾濫」が起こる前には、<br>もっと多くの渡り鳥が、飛来したと聞きます。
#. de: Es heißt, dass der Große Wald einst Heimat von zahllosen Vogelarten war. Das war vor der Lichtflut.
#. fr: Il y avait énormément d'oiseaux migrateurs dans la région avant le déluge de Lumière, vous savez...
#. column 57: They would feed on creatures such as crawlers, which upset the natural balance of the forest by spreading diseases and eating saplings. With those birds now gone, it falls to us to control the numbers of such pests.
msgctxt "FateEvent:510:0:56"
msgid "It is said that before the Flood, there were many more birds in the Greatwood."
msgstr "Говорят, до Потопа Света в Великом лесу было куда больше птиц."

#. ja: 本来なら、そうした鳥たちがクロウラーを食べ、<br>病の拡大を防いでいたはずなのですが……。<br>私たちは、渡り鳥の代役ということになりますね。
#. de: Einige hatten sich dabei auf die Jagd von Kriechern spezialisiert, die unkontrolliert das natürliche Gleichgewicht des Waldes durch Krankheiten und ihren Kahlfraß stören. Ohne die Vögel liegt es nun an uns, das Ungeziefer zu dezimieren.
#. fr: Comme ces oiseaux mangeaient les chenilles et autres insectes, ils empêchaient la prolifération des maladies. Maintenant qu'ils ne migrent plus par ici, c'est à nous d'assurer ce rôle.
#. column 56: It is said that before the Flood, there were many more birds in the Greatwood.
msgctxt "FateEvent:510:0:57"
msgid "They would feed on creatures such as crawlers, which upset the natural balance of the forest by spreading diseases and eating saplings. With those birds now gone, it falls to us to control the numbers of such pests."
msgstr "Птицы питались, например, гусеницами — те распространяют болезни и объедают молодые побеги, нарушая природный баланс. Теперь птиц нет, и нам приходится самим сокращать численность таких вредителей."

#. ja: まあ、こんなところにヒトがいるわ！<br>まだ草人にされていないだなんて、<br>珍しいこともあるのね！
#. de: Schau mal einer, guck! Hat sich da jemand in unser Land verirrt? Und keiner hat <if $gn4>sie<else>ihn</if> zum Grasgrummel gemacht!
#. fr: Oh bah, ça alors<nbsp>! <if $gn4>Une humaine<else>Un humain</if><nbsp>! Et pas enfeuillé<if $gn4>e</if>, en plus<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Aha! I see. You're someone's <i>favorite</i>. You lucky thing, you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:511:0:56"
msgid "Why, if it isn't a mortal! Oh, you would make the most darling little shrub! I'm shocked that no one's enchanted you already. Hmm..."
msgstr "Ой, да это же смертный! Ах, из тебя вышел бы такой славный кустик! Удивительно, что тебя до сих пор никто не заколдовал. Хм..."

#. ja: わかったわ！<br>アナタ、誰かのお気に入りなのね？<br>そうじゃないなら、草人になっているはずだもの！
#. de: Sprich fein, wer soll dein Herzblatt sein? Mit wem willst du bandeln? Sag's, sonst werd ich dich in einen Grasgrummel verwandeln! Hihihi!
#. fr: Ah, mais je sais. Tu es <if $gn4>la petite humaine préférée<else>le petit humain préféré</if> de quelqu'un de chez nous. T'aurais déjà pris racine sinon<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Why, if it isn't a mortal! Oh, you would make the most darling little shrub! I'm shocked that no one's enchanted you already. Hmm...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:511:0:57"
msgid "Aha! I see. You're someone's <i>favorite</i>. You lucky thing, you!"
msgstr "А, понятно! Ты чей-то <i>любимчик</i>. Везёт же тебе!"

#. ja: アナタ、フーアって知ってる？<br>あの子たち誰彼構わず、おもしろくないイタズラを、<br>してくるから嫌なのよね……。
#. de: Kennst du die Fuath? Langweilige Teichhüpfer. Ihre Späße machen kein Spaß und sie wollen doch nur immer unterhalten werden! Was für ein Theater!
#. fr: Tiens, d'ailleurs, tu connais les Fuath<nbsp>? Vaut mieux t'en méfier, parce que eux, y a que les mauvaises blagues qui les amusent.
#. column 57: The Fuath, for instance─no manners at all! And their tricks are cruel, mirthless things. Oh, yes. I'd keep my distance from the water if I were you, little mortal.
msgctxt "FateEvent:512:0:56"
msgid "You'll want to be careful, though. We pixies have rules. Manners, you see? But the other fae─they'll eat you right up."
msgstr "Только будь осторожен. У нас, пикси, свои правила. Мы-то воспитанные, понимаешь? А вот другие феи тебя мигом слопают."

#. ja: 水辺が彼らの領域だから……<br>悪趣味なイタズラをされたくないのなら、<br>湖には近づかないことね。
#. de: Sie hausen tief im See in einem nassen Schlosse und nehmen Fremde gerne auf die Flosse. Willst du ihrem Spiel entgehen, solltest du nicht zu nah am Ufer steh'n!
#. fr: Fais surtout attention à là où y a de l'eau. Que ce soit un lac ou une petite flaque de rien du tout, ça fait partie de leur territoire<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You'll want to be careful, though. We pixies have rules. Manners, you see? But the other fae─they'll eat you right up.
msgctxt "FateEvent:512:0:57"
msgid "The Fuath, for instance─no manners at all! And their tricks are cruel, mirthless things. Oh, yes. I'd keep my distance from the water if I were you, little mortal."
msgstr "Фуаты, например. Ни капли манер! Их проделки злые и совсем не смешные. Так что держись подальше от воды, смертный."

#. ja: ん……！？<br>フーアの気配がしたような……<br>気の所為よね？
#. de: Hm? War das etwa ein flapsiger Fuath? Oder hab ich mir das nur eingebildet?
#. fr: Rien que d'en parler, j'en ai le bout des ailes qui tremblote. À moins que... y en ait un pas loin<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:513:0:56"
msgid "In fact, I almost─no, surely not! They wouldn't dare..."
msgstr "Я уж подумала... Нет, не может быть! Они бы не посмели..."

#. ja: さっきのグリーングライダー……<br>幻惑の術で、けしかけられてたみたいだねぇ～。<br>あのフーアの兄弟、なんだってこんなことを……。
#. de: Das waren wieder diese beiden Plagegeister von den Fuath. Daen Wyd und Daen Lor. Sie haben diese Bestie beschworen und auf mich gehetzt!
#. fr: Ces Fuath avaient envouté ce planeur vert avec un de leur sort... (soupire)... Pourquoi sont-ils aussi méchants<nbsp>?
#. column 57: The Fuath are <i>made</i> that way, you understand. Drowned souls, doing what they must to feel alive.
msgctxt "FateEvent:514:0:56"
msgid "\\<sigh> They're malicious, distasteful creatures, I know, but would you laugh if I asked you not to hold the Daens' mischief against them?"
msgstr "<i>Эх...</i> Да, они злобные и отвратительные создания, но не могли бы вы не винить даэнов за их проказы?"

#. ja: フーアは、水死したヒトの魂から生まれた、<br>なんてことを言う古いアマロもいるけど……<br>なんだか気味が悪いよねぇ～。
#. de: Man sagt, die Fuath seien von den Geistern Ertrunkener beseelt. Aber vielleicht ist das auch nur eine Schauergeschichte, die sich alte Amaros erzählen ...
#. fr: Est-ce parce qu'ils naissent des âmes des noyés<nbsp>? J'ai déjà entendu mes plus vieux aînés parler de ça...
#. column 56: \<sigh> They're malicious, distasteful creatures, I know, but would you laugh if I asked you not to hold the Daens' mischief against them?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:514:0:57"
msgid "The Fuath are <i>made</i> that way, you understand. Drowned souls, doing what they must to feel alive."
msgstr "Фуаты <i>такие</i> по своей природе, понимаешь? Души утопленников — они делают всё, чтобы снова почувствовать себя живыми."

#. ja: 悪童ダエン兄弟のことは、<br>ン・モゥの間でも問題になっているのです～。
#. de: Die Daen-Brüder sind selbst unter den freundlich-friedlichen Nu Mou bekannt für ihre schrecklichen Scherereien!
#. fr: Tous les Nu Mou connaissent les terribles frères Daen<nbsp>! C'est dire si leur réputation est exécrable<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:515:0:56"
msgid "The Daens are known as wanton troublemakers throughout Il Mheg. I certainly hope you shan't judge all fae by their example."
msgstr "По всему Ил-Мегу знают, что братья Даэн — те ещё проказники. Надеюсь, ты не станешь судить обо всех феях по ним."

#. ja: ここのところ、悪童ダエン兄弟を見かけないけど、<br>どうしているのかしら……。<br>アナタ、ちょっと探してみる気はなぁい？
#. de: Die Daen-Zwillinge sind wahre Plagegeister! Wird Zeit, dass ihnen auch mal jemand einen Streich spielt!
#. fr: Ça fait un moment qu'on n'a pas croisé les frères Daen... J'ai une idée<nbsp>! Et si c'était nous qui allions les embêter pour une fois<nbsp>!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:516:0:56"
msgid "It's rare that those two stay above water long enough for someone to knock a bit of sense into them─don't squander this opportunity, darling mortal!"
msgstr "Редко эти двое так долго остаются над водой, чтобы их можно было хорошенько отлупить. Не упусти шанс, милый смертный!"

#. ja: 花蜜を探しに行こうと思ったんだけど、<br>アネモネたちが邪魔して進めないの……<br>助けてくれないかしら？
#. de: Ich bin hier, um den süßen Nektar der Feenblüte zu ernten, doch die doofen Anemonen verderben mir den ganzen Spaß! Hilfst du mir, die Spielverderber zu vertreiben?
#. fr: Dis, je voulais aller récolter un peu de nectar, mais y a cette bande d'anémones qui me bloque la route. Tu pourrais t'en occuper pour moi<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Help the pixie?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You... You're just going to leave me here? With all of these anemones?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:517:0:56"
msgid "Help, I'm trapped! Why, why, <i>why</i> are there anemones everywhere? I should never have agreed to this..."
msgstr "Помогите, я в ловушке! Ну почему, почему, <i>почему</i> здесь повсюду анемоны? И зачем я только согласилась..."

#. ja: ピクシーを助ける？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der Pixie helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la Pixie<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Help, I'm trapped! Why, why, <i>why</i> are there anemones everywhere? I should never have agreed to this...
#. column 62: You... You're just going to leave me here? With all of these anemones?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:517:0:57"
msgid "Help the pixie?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь пикси?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: うわーん！<br>助けてくれないなんて、ひどいわ！
#. de: Waaas?!<br>Du lässt mich arme Pixie einfach so im Stich? Das ist gemein!
#. fr: T-tu veux pas m'aider<nbsp>!? C'est pas gentil<nbsp>! Pas gentil du tout<nbsp>! Comment je vais faire, moi<nbsp>!?
#. column 56: Help, I'm trapped! Why, why, <i>why</i> are there anemones everywhere? I should never have agreed to this...
#. column 57: Help the pixie?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:517:0:62"
msgid "You... You're just going to leave me here? With all of these anemones?"
msgstr "Ты... Ты что, бросишь меня здесь? Среди этих анемонов?"

#. ja: 花蜜を集めに来たのだけれど、<br>怖い蜂がいっぱいで採りに行けないの！
#. de: Ich war gerade dabei, arglos meinen Nektar zu sammeln, als sich die blöden Biester in mein schönes Spiel eingemischt haben!
#. fr: Salut<nbsp>! Je suis là pour récupérer du nectar, mais ces sales abeilles me laissent pas approcher<nbsp>!
#. column 57: I very much do not want to go over there. But I need the nectar. But...bees...
#. column 58: Volunteer to collect nectar in the pixie's stead?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Please... Not the bees...
msgctxt "FateEvent:518:0:56"
msgid "First anemones, and now I have to deal with bees! This is why I detest nectar duty! "
msgstr "Сначала анемоны, теперь ещё и пчёлы! Вот почему я ненавижу собирать нектар! "

#. ja: ねえ、貴方って強いんでしょう？<br>キラー・ハニービーを追い払って花を探して、<br>「黄金色の花蜜」を集めてくれないかしら？
#. de: Du bist doch groß und stark? Würdest du den Killerbienchen eins auswischen und uns dabei helfen, den güldenen Nektar zu sammeln?
#. fr: T'as pas l'air d'avoir peur des piqûres, toi<nbsp>! Tu veux bien récupérer un peu de nectar doré à ma place<nbsp>?
#. column 56: First anemones, and now I have to deal with bees! This is why I detest nectar duty!
#. column 58: Volunteer to collect nectar in the pixie's stead?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Please... Not the bees...
msgctxt "FateEvent:518:0:57"
msgid "I very much do not want to go over there. But I need the nectar. But...bees..."
msgstr "Я туда ни за что не пойду. Но нектар мне нужен. Но... пчёлы..."

#. ja: 「黄金色の花蜜」集めを手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Beim Sammeln des güldenen Nektars helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la Pixie à récolter du nectar doré<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: First anemones, and now I have to deal with bees! This is why I detest nectar duty!
#. column 57: I very much do not want to go over there. But I need the nectar. But...bees...
#. column 62: Please... Not the bees...
