msgctxt "FateEvent:531:0:57"
msgid "Help Darmal slay the armadillos?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь Дармалу прогнать броненосцев?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ま、そうだよな……。<br>さて、雇い主にどう説明したもんか……。
#. de: Natürlich kannst du auch einen Anteil vom ... Ruhm ... abhaben!
#. fr: Je vois... Bon<nbsp>! Comment je vais pouvoir expliquer ça à mon employeur<nbsp>?...
#. column 56: We probably would've found the treasure by now if these armadillos weren't in our way. Fancy helping shoo them off?
#. column 57: Help Darmal slay the armadillos?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:531:0:62"
msgid "We're not expecting you to do it out of the kindness of your heart. You'll be rewarded, you know."
msgstr "Не думай, что мы просим помочь просто так. Награду получишь, само собой."

#. ja: おや、降神餅の餅つきを、見物に来たってか？<br>ちょうど準備が整ったところよぉ……！
#. de: Willst du beim Mochi-Stampfen zusehen? Es geht gleich los.
#. fr: Tu es ici pour voir comment on prépare le mochi de la transition<nbsp>? Tu arrives au bon moment, on était sur le point de commencer<nbsp>!
#. column 57: We finished preparations but moments ago, and our Gozu is fit to give the mochi rice a most thorough pounding.
#. column 58: Spectate the mochi pounding?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Very well. If you should change your mind, you know where to find us.
msgctxt "FateEvent:536:0:56"
msgid "Well met, adventurer. If you are come to observe the mochi pounding, look no further."
msgstr "Рад встрече, искатель приключений. Пришёл посмотреть, как толкут моти? Тогда ты по адресу."

#. ja: わざわざ東方から連れてきた、<br>力自慢のゴズも、やる気満々ってなもんよ！<br>さあさあ、おっぱじめるとするかな！
#. de: Dem fernöstlichen Gozu zuckt es bereits in den kräftigen Armen.
#. fr: Cette année, c'est ce gozu venu tout droit de la plaine de Yanxia qui joue du maillet. Prépare-toi, ça va être un spectacle à décorner les bœufs<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Well met, adventurer. If you are come to observe the mochi pounding, look no further.
#. column 58: Spectate the mochi pounding?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Very well. If you should change your mind, you know where to find us.
msgctxt "FateEvent:536:0:57"
msgid "We finished preparations but moments ago, and our Gozu is fit to give the mochi rice a most thorough pounding."
msgstr "Мы только что закончили приготовления, и наш Годзу уже готов как следует отбить моти."

#. ja: 餅つきを見学する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du beim Mochi-Stampfen zusehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Assister à la préparation du mochi<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Well met, adventurer. If you are come to observe the mochi pounding, look no further.
#. column 57: We finished preparations but moments ago, and our Gozu is fit to give the mochi rice a most thorough pounding.
#. column 62: Very well. If you should change your mind, you know where to find us.
