msgctxt "FateEvent:536:0:58"
msgid "Spectate the mochi pounding?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Посмотреть, как толкут моти?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おう、そうかい。<br>ま、気が変わったら、また声をかけてくんな！
#. de: Schade. Vielleicht überlegst du es dir ja noch mal.
#. fr: Dommage, tu rates quelque chose<nbsp>! Hésite pas à me faire signe si tu changes d'avis.
#. column 56: Well met, adventurer. If you are come to observe the mochi pounding, look no further.
#. column 57: We finished preparations but moments ago, and our Gozu is fit to give the mochi rice a most thorough pounding.
#. column 58: Spectate the mochi pounding?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:536:0:62"
msgid "Very well. If you should change your mind, you know where to find us."
msgstr "Ну что ж. Передумаешь — ты знаешь, где нас найти."

#. ja: やあ！<br>キミもエッグハントのパレードに参加してくれるのかい？<br>私たちと一緒に「森都の子ども」たちを笑顔にしよう！
#. de: Hallo! Willst du bei der Wundereiersuche mitmachen und uns helfen, die Kinder Gridanias glücklich zu machen?
#. fr: Salut<nbsp>! La parade de la chasse aux Prœufs va débuter, ça te dirait d'y participer<nbsp>? Il te suffit de suivre le cortège, et de distribuer des œufs à tous les enfants que tu croiseras<nbsp>!
#. column 57: It's easy to do your part. Simply don your rabbit costume and start walking, and the rest will take care of itself, trust me!
#. column 58: Take part in the procession?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A shame, that. Oh, well...I'm sure not <i>all</i> of the children will be crushingly disappointed.
msgctxt "FateEvent:538:0:56"
msgid "Greetings, friend! Have you come to take part in the procession? Pray join us, that we might bring smiles to the faces of every boy and girl in Gridania!"
msgstr "Привет, друг! Пришёл участвовать в шествии? Присоединяйся, вместе мы подарим улыбки всем девочкам и мальчикам Гридании!"

#. ja: パレードの正装は、ウサギの着ぐるみと決まっているんだ！<br>よかったら、キミも着用して参加してくれ！
#. de: Wie du siehst, tragen wir alle ein Hasenkostüm. Jeder der bei der Hasenparade mithoppeln will, muss sich verkleiden.
#. fr: Ah, et comme tu peux le voir, on a tous revêtu nos déguisements de lapin. Ce n'est pas une obligation, mais je t'invite à en faire autant pour la forme<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Greetings, friend! Have you come to take part in the procession? Pray join us, that we might bring smiles to the faces of every boy and girl in Gridania!
#. column 58: Take part in the procession?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A shame, that. Oh, well...I'm sure not <i>all</i> of the children will be crushingly disappointed.
msgctxt "FateEvent:538:0:57"
msgid "It's easy to do your part. Simply don your rabbit costume and start walking, and the rest will take care of itself, trust me!"
msgstr "Всё просто: надевай костюм кролика и отправляйся в путь. Дальше всё само пойдёт как надо, вот увидишь!"

#. ja: パレードに参加する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du bei der Hasenparade mitmachen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Participer à la parade<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Greetings, friend! Have you come to take part in the procession? Pray join us, that we might bring smiles to the faces of every boy and girl in Gridania!
#. column 57: It's easy to do your part. Simply don your rabbit costume and start walking, and the rest will take care of itself, trust me!
#. column 62: A shame, that. Oh, well...I'm sure not <i>all</i> of the children will be crushingly disappointed.
