msgctxt "FateEvent:538:0:58"
msgid "Take part in the procession?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Принять участие в шествии?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 残念だ。<br>私たちは、いつでもキミの参加を待っているよ！
#. de: Schade! Wenn du es dir anders überlegst, melde dich einfach!
#. fr: Tu as encore un peu de temps pour changer d'avis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Greetings, friend! Have you come to take part in the procession? Pray join us, that we might bring smiles to the faces of every boy and girl in Gridania!
#. column 57: It's easy to do your part. Simply don your rabbit costume and start walking, and the rest will take care of itself, trust me!
#. column 58: Take part in the procession?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:538:0:62"
msgid "A shame, that. Oh, well...I'm sure not <i>all</i> of the children will be crushingly disappointed."
msgstr "Жаль. Ну да ладно... Уверен, не <i>все</i> дети будут ужасно разочарованы."

#. ja: ニワトリの捕獲を手伝ってくれるのかい？<br>助かるよ、我々だけでは人手が足りなくてね……。
#. de: Hilfst du uns, die ausgerissenen Hühner wieder einzufangen? Es sind so viele und meine Kollegen vom Eiersuchkomitee sind bereits außer Atem.
#. fr: S-salut. Tu veux bien nous aider à attraper les poules<nbsp>? Elles sont vraiment nombreuses, et mes collègues lapins sont à bout de souffle...
#. column 57: The helpmeet will be herding the birds in this direction any moment now. All you need to do is snag as many of the slippery little things as you can.
#. column 58: Help catch the chickens?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Too busy, you say? Well, if you ever have a change of heart, you know where to find me. And remember: it's not for us─it's for the children.
msgctxt "FateEvent:540:0:56"
msgid "Oh, there you are. You're here to help us round up our chickens, right? We really could use another pair of hands right now..."
msgstr "А, вот и ты. Пришёл помочь нам собрать кур? Нам сейчас лишняя пара рук ой как пригодится..."

#. ja: 他の実行委員に追い込まれたニワトリたちが、<br>もうすぐ、この場所へとやってくるはずだ。<br>1羽でも多くのニワトリを捕まえてくれ！
#. de: Sie werden die Hühner in unsere Richtung treiben. Du brauchst nur zu warten, bis die aufgescheuchten Hühner auftauchen, dann schnappst du sie dir. Jedes eingefangene Huhn zählt!
#. fr: D'autres s'occupent de les rabattre vers ici. Elles devraient pas tarder à débarquer en nombre, c'est le moment ou jamais de leur mettre le grappin dessus<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh, there you are. You're here to help us round up our chickens, right? We really could use another pair of hands right now...
#. column 58: Help catch the chickens?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Too busy, you say? Well, if you ever have a change of heart, you know where to find me. And remember: it's not for us─it's for the children.
msgctxt "FateEvent:540:0:57"
msgid "The helpmeet will be herding the birds in this direction any moment now. All you need to do is snag as many of the slippery little things as you can."
msgstr "Помощник вот-вот пригонит сюда кур. Тебе остаётся только поймать как можно больше этих юрких птиц."

#. ja: ニワトリの捕獲を手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du helfen, die Hühner einzufangen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les organisateurs de la chasse aux Prœufs à attraper les poules<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, there you are. You're here to help us round up our chickens, right? We really could use another pair of hands right now...
#. column 57: The helpmeet will be herding the birds in this direction any moment now. All you need to do is snag as many of the slippery little things as you can.
#. column 62: Too busy, you say? Well, if you ever have a change of heart, you know where to find me. And remember: it's not for us─it's for the children.
