msgctxt "FateEvent:540:0:58"
msgid "Help catch the chickens?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь поймать кур?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか……。<br>では、気が変わったら声をかけてくれ。
#. de: Verstehe ... Wenn du es dir anders überlegst, melde dich einfach!
#. fr: T'as pas envie de te fatiguer<nbsp>? Je comprends... Fais-moi signe si tu changes d'avis.
#. column 56: Oh, there you are. You're here to help us round up our chickens, right? We really could use another pair of hands right now...
#. column 57: The helpmeet will be herding the birds in this direction any moment now. All you need to do is snag as many of the slippery little things as you can.
#. column 58: Help catch the chickens?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:540:0:62"
msgid "Too busy, you say? Well, if you ever have a change of heart, you know where to find me. And remember: it's not for us─it's for the children."
msgstr "Занят, говоришь? Ну что ж, передумаешь — знаешь, где меня найти. И помни: мы это делаем не для себя, а для детей."

#. ja: なンでオレが、こんなパレードに……<br>ヤカンを売りに来ただけだってのによォ……。
#. de: Was mache ich hier nur? Ich wollte doch bloß Teekessel verkaufen ...
#. fr: Qu'est-ce que j'fous là, sérieux... J'étais juste venu vendre des bouilloires, à la base...
msgctxt "FateEvent:541:0:56"
msgid "Bloody hells, can ye believe this!? I just came to sell a bleedin' kettle or two, and look at me now!"
msgstr "Да чтоб вас! Веришь ли, я всего-то пришёл продать пару проклятых чайников, а теперь посмотри на меня!"

#. ja: 酒代のツケが支払えないなら、<br>パレードに協力しろと、マーケットの連中に脅されたンだ。<br>しかも、暑苦しい着ぐるみまで……チクショウめぇ！
#. de: Ich hatte die Wahl, entweder meine Wirtshausschulden zu bezahlen oder an der Parade teilzunehmen. Hätte ich gewusst, dass man wie ein Schwein in diesem Kostüm schwitzt, hätte ich mich vermutlich anders entschieden. Uff!
#. fr: Si j'suis là, c'est à cause de mes créanciers. Ils m'ont dit<nbsp>: “Écoute, mon gars, si tu peux pas régler ton ardoise, alors tu dois participer à la parade de la chasse aux Prœufs.” Je sais, y a aucun rapport avec la choucroute... À croire qu'ils voulaient juste m'humilier, ces bâtards<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:542:0:56"
msgid "“If ye can't pay yer debt, I've got another deal for ye!” he said. Next thing I know, I'm wearin' this godsdamned rabbit's pate under the blisterin' sun!"
msgstr "«Не можешь расплатиться с долгами — есть для тебя другое дельце!» Так он сказал. А теперь я тут, в этой проклятой кроличьей шкуре, под палящим солнцем!"

#. ja: クソッ……いまいましい、スプリガンどもめ……。<br>ちょいとばかり、休ンでただけだってのに、<br>追い立てやがってよォ……。
#. de: Verfluchte Hühnerkacke! Diese verflixten Spriggans! Nicht einmal für fünf Minuten darf man sich ausruhen ...
#. fr: Saletés de boules de suie... Alors quoi, on a même plus le droit de souffler cinq minutes<nbsp>!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:543:0:56"
msgid "Those godsdamned spriggans. Can a man even take one bleedin' moment's rest without them buggerin' everythin' up!?"
msgstr "Проклятые спрригганы! Человек уже и передохнуть минутку не может, чтобы они всё не испортили!"

#. ja: あら、冒険者も来ていたのね。<br>だったら、なおのことパレードに協力して正解だったわ。<br>慈善事業を通じて、商会をアピールする好機だもの。
#. de: Oh, du nimmst auch an der Parade teil? Es gibt ja keine bessere Gelegenheit, um Handel zu treiben, als eine solche wohltätige Veranstaltung, welche die Herzen rührt und die Brieftaschen öffnet!
#. fr: Oh, <if $gn4>ma cliente préférée<else>mon client préféré</if><nbsp>! Décidément, j'ai bien fait de venir. Cette parade, c'est pour moi l'occasion d'accomplir une bonne action... et aussi, on ne va pas se le cacher, de promouvoir mon commerce à moindres frais<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:544:0:56"
msgid "Well, well. Fancy meetin' you here. Surprised to see me? Mind you, I ain't doin' this for charity."
msgstr "Ну надо же, кого я встречаю! Удивлён? Только не думай, что я здесь ради благотворительности."

#. ja: 飾りタマゴには、プレゼントといっしょに、<br>ウチの商会の広告も入れさせてもらっているわ。<br>例の石やスクリップの交換レートも、しっかり記入済みよ。
#. de: Ich habe mir erlaubt, in jedes gefüllte Wunderei einen Werbekatalog unseres Handelshauses beizulegen. Da stehen dann auch die aktuellsten Tauschraten drin, dafür habe ich gesorgt!
#. fr: En plus du cadeau, je me suis permis de glisser une petite brochure commerciale dans chacun de mes œufs-surprises. Elle mentionne notamment le prix de rachat de certains articles que je recherche depuis longtemps, à toutes fins utiles...
msgctxt "FateEvent:545:0:56"
msgid "Inside each of those eggs─along with a present for the children, o' course─is a piece o' parchment advertisin' the latest wares available at the House o' Splendors."
msgstr "В каждое яйцо, помимо подарка для детей, я вложила листовку с новинками Торгового дома «Роскошь». И, конечно, указала самые свежие курсы обмена камней и скриптов."

#. ja: もしかして、あのウサギ……<br>いいえ、やっぱり、気のせいよね。<br>あの人に限っては、こんなボランティアするわけないもの。
#. de: Der Hase mit dem nackten Oberkörper ... den kenn ich doch! ... Nein, ich muss mich täuschen. Er ist nicht die Person, die bei einer solchen Veranstaltung mitmacht ...
#. fr: Le lapin torse nu... j'ai l'impression de le connaître. Mais le type auquel je pense est pas du genre charitable, alors j'ai un doute...
msgctxt "FateEvent:546:0:56"
msgid "Can't pass up an opportunity to expand my business, after all. Speakin' o' which, does that other rabbit remind you of─no, that just ain't possible."
msgstr "Нельзя упускать возможность расширить своё дело. Кстати, тот кролик тебе никого не напоминает? Нет, не может быть."

#. ja: 解放者殿、あなたの腕を見込んで頼みたい……！<br>実は、この先で敵軍が新型魔導兵器の実働テストを、<br>行おうとしているようなんだ！
#. de: <if $gn4>Befreierin<else>Befreier</if>, wir brauchen deine Hilfe! Der Feind hat soeben einen neuen Typ Kampfmaschine im Feld getestet.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Grande libératrice<else>Grand libérateur</if>, j'ai une mission taillée pour quelqu'un de votre trempe<nbsp>! Nous avons découvert que les Impériaux testaient ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment de nouveaux modèles d'armes magitek dans les environs.
#. column 57: If we can gather up as many examples of their technology as possible, the Ironworks'll be able to uncover its secrets.
#. column 58: What do you say? Can you spare the time to help me?
#. column 59: Assist in collecting magitek parts?
#. column 60: That's the spirit! Now, if you grab as many parts as you can and bring them to me, I'll take care of the rest.
#. column 62: No doubt you're needed elsewhere, yes? Well, I'll be here for a little while longer, so let me know when you're free.
msgctxt "FateEvent:547:0:56"
msgid "The imperials are using this battle as an opportunity to test their latest magitek. Of course, this gives us a chance to do a little research of our own!"
msgstr "Имперцы используют это сражение, чтобы испытать новейшее магитехническое оружие. А значит, и мы можем кое-что изучить!"

#. ja: その「新兵器部材」を手に入れられれば、<br>調査することで対策を立てることもできるだろう。
#. de: Wenn wir die zurückgebliebenen Waffenteile einsammeln und analysieren, könnte uns das einen Hinweis auf eine Schwachstelle der Kampf<shy>maschinen geben.
#. fr: Si nous parvenions à récupérer quelques-uns de leurs composants, nos équipes pourraient en tirer parti pour élaborer des contremesures.
#. column 56: The imperials are using this battle as an opportunity to test their latest magitek. Of course, this gives us a chance to do a little research of our own!
#. column 58: What do you say? Can you spare the time to help me?
#. column 59: Assist in collecting magitek parts?
#. column 60: That's the spirit! Now, if you grab as many parts as you can and bring them to me, I'll take care of the rest.
#. column 62: No doubt you're needed elsewhere, yes? Well, I'll be here for a little while longer, so let me know when you're free.
msgctxt "FateEvent:547:0:57"
msgid "If we can gather up as many examples of their technology as possible, the Ironworks'll be able to uncover its secrets."
msgstr "Если собрать побольше образцов их технологий, Гарлондские мастерские смогут раскрыть их секреты."

#. ja: これは味方の命を守るチャンスなんだ！<br>どうか「新兵器部材」を集めてきてくれないか！？
#. de: Hilf unserer Sache und sammle die Waffenteile ein!
#. fr: En un sens, c'est la survie de nos troupes qui est en jeu<nbsp>! Alors, vous voulez bien vous joindre à l'opération<nbsp>?
#. column 56: The imperials are using this battle as an opportunity to test their latest magitek. Of course, this gives us a chance to do a little research of our own!
#. column 57: If we can gather up as many examples of their technology as possible, the Ironworks'll be able to uncover its secrets.
#. column 59: Assist in collecting magitek parts?
#. column 60: That's the spirit! Now, if you grab as many parts as you can and bring them to me, I'll take care of the rest.
#. column 62: No doubt you're needed elsewhere, yes? Well, I'll be here for a little while longer, so let me know when you're free.
msgctxt "FateEvent:547:0:58"
msgid "What do you say? Can you spare the time to help me?"
msgstr "Как думаешь, найдётся минутка мне помочь?"

#. ja: 回収に協力しますか？
#. de: Bei dem Einsammeln der Waffenteile helfen?
#. fr: Livrer des pièces d'arme magitek aux résistants<nbsp>?
#. column 56: The imperials are using this battle as an opportunity to test their latest magitek. Of course, this gives us a chance to do a little research of our own!
#. column 57: If we can gather up as many examples of their technology as possible, the Ironworks'll be able to uncover its secrets.
#. column 58: What do you say? Can you spare the time to help me?
#. column 60: That's the spirit! Now, if you grab as many parts as you can and bring them to me, I'll take care of the rest.
#. column 62: No doubt you're needed elsewhere, yes? Well, I'll be here for a little while longer, so let me know when you're free.
msgctxt "FateEvent:547:0:59"
msgid "Assist in collecting magitek parts?"
msgstr "Помочь собрать детали магитека?"

#. ja: やってくれるか、感謝するぞ！<br>いくつか「新兵器部材」が集まったら、<br>わたしのところに持ってきてくれ！
#. de: Danke. Bringe alle Waffenteile, die du findest, zu mir.
#. fr: Vous en êtes<nbsp>? Parfait<nbsp>! Essayez de m'apporter plusieurs pièces en une fois, ça ira plus vite.
#. column 56: The imperials are using this battle as an opportunity to test their latest magitek. Of course, this gives us a chance to do a little research of our own!
#. column 57: If we can gather up as many examples of their technology as possible, the Ironworks'll be able to uncover its secrets.
#. column 58: What do you say? Can you spare the time to help me?
#. column 59: Assist in collecting magitek parts?
#. column 62: No doubt you're needed elsewhere, yes? Well, I'll be here for a little while longer, so let me know when you're free.
msgctxt "FateEvent:547:0:60"
msgid "That's the spirit! Now, if you grab as many parts as you can and bring them to me, I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr "Вот это разговор! Собери побольше деталей и принеси мне, а дальше я всё устрою."

#. ja: そ、そうか……。<br>別の任務でも受けていたのか？<br>いずれにせよ話を聞いてくれたこと、感謝するぞ。
#. de: Dann hast du wahrscheinlich Wichtigeres zu tun ... Auch gut, ich vertraue dir. Der Widerstand wird siegen!
#. fr: Je vois, vous avez d'autres priorités... Dans ce cas, il est plus sage pour moi de remettre cette opération à plus tard.
#. column 56: The imperials are using this battle as an opportunity to test their latest magitek. Of course, this gives us a chance to do a little research of our own!
#. column 57: If we can gather up as many examples of their technology as possible, the Ironworks'll be able to uncover its secrets.
#. column 58: What do you say? Can you spare the time to help me?
#. column 59: Assist in collecting magitek parts?
#. column 60: That's the spirit! Now, if you grab as many parts as you can and bring them to me, I'll take care of the rest.
msgctxt "FateEvent:547:0:62"
msgid "No doubt you're needed elsewhere, yes? Well, I'll be here for a little while longer, so let me know when you're free."
msgstr "Наверное, у тебя есть дела поважнее? Я ещё побуду здесь, так что дай знать, когда освободишься."

#. ja: 「新兵器部材」は……<br>持っていないようだな。
#. de: Du hast keine Waffenteile gefunden?
#. fr: Hein, vous n'avez toujours pas récupéré la moindre pièce<nbsp>!?
#. column 57: You can either pick up the pieces that have fallen off during testing, or if you're feeling adventurous, you can even try reducing those warmachina to scrap and claiming the parts for the Resistance!
msgctxt "FateEvent:548:0:56"
msgid "Having trouble finding the parts?"
msgstr "Не можешь найти детали?"

#. ja: 撃破した魔導兵器からブン取るか、<br>周辺に散乱しているものを回収するか……<br>とにかく、たくさん集めてきてくれ！
#. de: Sie liegen auf dem Schlachtfeld verstreut und können von zerstörten Maschinen erbeutet werden. Bring mir so viel, wie du kannst.
#. fr: Vous pouvez détruire des armes magitek pour en récupérer, ou bien ramasser celles qui jonchent le sol. Quoi qu'il en soit, faites vite, mes hommes ne tiendront pas éter<shy>nel<shy>le<shy>ment<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Having trouble finding the parts?
msgctxt "FateEvent:548:0:57"
msgid "You can either pick up the pieces that have fallen off during testing, or if you're feeling adventurous, you can even try reducing those warmachina to scrap and claiming the parts for the Resistance!"
msgstr "Их можно подобрать на месте испытаний или снять с разбитых боевых машин. Если осмелишься, можешь сам превратить эти махины в груду металлолома и забрать детали для Сопротивления!"

#. ja: さすが解放者殿……見事な手際だ！
#. de: Gut gemacht, <if $gn4>Befreierin<else>Befreier</if>! Das ist es, was wir brauchen.
#. fr: Des pièces d'arme magitek<nbsp>? Je prends<nbsp>!
#. column 60: But to be honest, we'll probably need to give the engineers a little more to work with. Do you think you could rustle up some more?
msgctxt "FateEvent:549:0:56"
msgid "These are just the ticket!"
msgstr "Вот то, что надо!"

#. ja: だが、もっとたくさんの「新兵器部材」があれば、<br>より多くの情報を得ることができるはず……。<br>この調子で、もっと集めてきてくれ！
#. de: Aber wir brauchen noch mehr Waffenteile. Alles, was uns einen Hinweis auf mögliche Schwachstellen gibt, rettet Leben.
#. fr: Il nous en faudrait davantage pour faciliter le travail de nos ingénieurs. Continuez comme ça<nbsp>!
#. column 56: These are just the ticket!
msgctxt "FateEvent:549:0:60"
msgid "But to be honest, we'll probably need to give the engineers a little more to work with. Do you think you could rustle up some more?"
msgstr "Но, если честно, инженерам понадобится побольше материала. Не добудешь ещё?"

#. ja: さすが解放者殿……実に見事な手際だ！
#. de: Hervorragende Arbeit, <if $gn4>Befreierin<else>Befreier</if>!
#. fr: Quelle efficacité<nbsp>! Bravo<nbsp>!
#. column 57: This'll keep our friends at the Ironworks busy. But while we're here, maybe we can gather up a few pieces? This is definitely a case of “more is more.”
#. column 58: I'll be right here if you've got any more parts to give me.
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "FateEvent:550:0:56"
msgid "Excellent work, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>!"
msgstr "Отличная работа, клинок <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>!"

#. ja: これだけの量が確保できれば、<br>敵の新兵器について、十分な情報が得られそうだ。
#. de: Wir haben schon viele Waffenteile erbeutet. Bestimmt werden wir eine Schwachstelle ausfindig machen können.
#. fr: Avec tous ces composants, les armes ennemies n'auront bientôt plus de secrets pour nous<nbsp>! Enfin, je l'espère.
#. column 56: Excellent work, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>!
#. column 58: I'll be right here if you've got any more parts to give me.
msgctxt "FateEvent:550:0:57"
msgid "This'll keep our friends at the Ironworks busy. But while we're here, maybe we can gather up a few pieces? This is definitely a case of “more is more.”"
msgstr "Наши друзья из Гарлондских мастерских будут заняты этим не один день. Но раз уж мы здесь, может, соберём ещё деталей? Чем больше, тем лучше."

#. ja: もう少しだけ、ここに留まるつもりだ。<br>もし、また「新兵器部材」を見つけたら、<br>わたしのところに持ってきてくれ！
#. de: Sammle noch ein paar Waffenteile und bring sie mir. Jedes Detail hilft!
#. fr: Si vous vous sentez de m'apporter d'autres pièces, surtout n'hésitez pas.
#. column 56: Excellent work, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>!
#. column 57: This'll keep our friends at the Ironworks busy. But while we're here, maybe we can gather up a few pieces? This is definitely a case of “more is more.”
msgctxt "FateEvent:550:0:58"
msgid "I'll be right here if you've got any more parts to give me."
msgstr "Я ещё немного побуду здесь. Найдёшь ещё детали — приноси."

#. ja: さすが解放者殿……実に見事な手際だ！
#. de: Hervorragende Arbeit, <if $gn4>Befreierin<else>Befreier</if>!
#. fr: Quelle efficacité<nbsp>! Bravo<nbsp>!
#. column 60: This'll keep our friends at the Ironworks busy. But while we're here, maybe we can gather up a few pieces? This is definitely a case of “more is more.”
#. column 61: I'll be right here if you've got any more parts to give me.
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "FateEvent:551:0:56"
msgid "Excellent work, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>!"
msgstr "Отличная работа, клинок <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>!"

#. ja: これだけの量が確保できれば、<br>敵の新兵器について、十分な情報が得られそうだ。
#. de: Mit so vielen Waffenteilen werden wir sicher eine Schwachstelle finden.
#. fr: Avec tous ces composants, les armes ennemies n'auront bientôt plus de secrets pour nous<nbsp>! Enfin, je l'espère.
#. column 56: Excellent work, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>!
#. column 61: I'll be right here if you've got any more parts to give me.
msgctxt "FateEvent:551:0:60"
msgid "This'll keep our friends at the Ironworks busy. But while we're here, maybe we can gather up a few pieces? This is definitely a case of “more is more.”"
msgstr "Наши друзья из Гарлондских мастерских будут заняты этим не один день. Но раз уж мы здесь, может, соберём ещё деталей? Чем больше, тем лучше."

#. ja: もう少しだけ、ここに留まるつもりだ。<br>もし、また「新兵器部材」を見つけたら、<br>わたしのところに持ってきてくれ！
#. de: Aber je mehr Informationen wir haben, desto besser. Wenn du wieder Waffenteile findest, dann bring sie mir.
#. fr: Si vous vous sentez de m'apporter d'autres pièces, surtout n'hésitez pas.
#. column 56: Excellent work, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>!
#. column 60: This'll keep our friends at the Ironworks busy. But while we're here, maybe we can gather up a few pieces? This is definitely a case of “more is more.”
msgctxt "FateEvent:551:0:61"
msgid "I'll be right here if you've got any more parts to give me."
msgstr "Я ещё немного побуду здесь. Найдёшь ещё детали — приноси."

#. ja: 投降してきた帝国兵を保護したんだ。<br>彼女が言うには、実験動物の扱いに耐えかねて、そのモノセロスとかいう奴を連れて逃げてきたらしい。
#. de: Wir haben eine feindliche Kämpferin gefangen genommen. Sie konnte nicht ertragen, was die Wissenschaftler ihrem liebgewonnen Versuchsobjekt alles antun wollten und ist auf dem Monozeros geflohen.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Grande libératrice<else>Grand libérateur</if>, j'ai un service à vous demander. Cette jeune Miqo'te est une déserteuse, voyez-vous. Selon ses dires, elle ne supportait plus la façon dont les Impériaux traitaient ce... poulain cornu, alors elle a filé en douce avec lui. Et maintenant, elle voudrait rejoindre la résistance.
#. column 57: She says it was created through experiments, so the imperials will no doubt want it back at all costs. Look, there's no time. Will you help them escape?
#. column 58: Repel the imperial pursuers?
#. column 62: Oh, that's a little more mean-spirited than I was expecting. If you have a change of heart─and I hope you do─we'll be hiding here for a while.
msgctxt "FateEvent:552:0:56"
msgid "It may look like I'm consorting with the enemy, but hear me out. This is Llofii, and she's leaving the Empire behind and bringing this...whatever it is with her."
msgstr "Может показаться, будто я сошёлся с врагом, но выслушай меня. Это Ллофи, она бежит из Империи и забирает с собой вот это... существо."

#. ja: 稀少な実験動物ゆえに、帝国軍も奪還に動くだろう。<br>自分は拠点に戻り、急ぎ受け入れの準備を整える。<br>すまないが、彼女らの護衛を頼めないか？
#. de: Sie muss so schnell wie möglich ins Lager gebracht werden. Wirst du sie eskortieren?
#. fr: Il faudrait que j'aille en discuter avec nos camarades, mais les Impériaux risquent de lui tomber dessus entre-temps. Pourriez-vous jouer les gardes du corps en mon absence<nbsp>?
#. column 56: It may look like I'm consorting with the enemy, but hear me out. This is Llofii, and she's leaving the Empire behind and bringing this...whatever it is with her.
#. column 58: Repel the imperial pursuers?
#. column 62: Oh, that's a little more mean-spirited than I was expecting. If you have a change of heart─and I hope you do─we'll be hiding here for a while.
msgctxt "FateEvent:552:0:57"
msgid "She says it was created through experiments, so the imperials will no doubt want it back at all costs. Look, there's no time. Will you help them escape?"
msgstr "Она говорит, что его создали в ходе экспериментов, так что имперцы наверняка захотят вернуть его любой ценой. Времени нет. Поможешь им бежать?"

#. ja: 護衛を引き受けますか？
#. de: Die Gefangene eskortieren?
#. fr: Protéger la déserteuse<nbsp>?
#. column 56: It may look like I'm consorting with the enemy, but hear me out. This is Llofii, and she's leaving the Empire behind and bringing this...whatever it is with her.
#. column 57: She says it was created through experiments, so the imperials will no doubt want it back at all costs. Look, there's no time. Will you help them escape?
#. column 62: Oh, that's a little more mean-spirited than I was expecting. If you have a change of heart─and I hope you do─we'll be hiding here for a while.
msgctxt "FateEvent:552:0:58"
msgid "Repel the imperial pursuers?"
msgstr "Отбить преследователей-имперцев?"

#. ja: そうか……。<br>君たちにも、自分の任務があるはずだものな。<br>残念だが、ここで増援を待つことにするよ。
#. de: Hm, verstehe. Dann warte ich auf Verstärkung. Hoffentlich entwischt sie uns nicht ...
#. fr: Vous ne pouvez pas<nbsp>? Tant pis... Je vais attendre l'arrivée de renforts dans ce cas.
#. column 56: It may look like I'm consorting with the enemy, but hear me out. This is Llofii, and she's leaving the Empire behind and bringing this...whatever it is with her.
#. column 57: She says it was created through experiments, so the imperials will no doubt want it back at all costs. Look, there's no time. Will you help them escape?
#. column 58: Repel the imperial pursuers?
msgctxt "FateEvent:552:0:62"
msgid "Oh, that's a little more mean-spirited than I was expecting. If you have a change of heart─and I hope you do─we'll be hiding here for a while."
msgstr "Не думал, что ты окажешься таким бессердечным. Если передумаешь — а я надеюсь, что передумаешь, — мы ещё побудем здесь."

#. ja: この子を……モノセロスを助けてください！<br>治癒の力があるからって、ひどい扱いを受けてきたんです……！<br>私、レジスタンスに協力するから……お願いです！
#. de: Bitte hilf meiner kleinen Süßen ... meinem Monozeros! Sie musste schon so viel ertragen ... Dann helfe ich auch dem Widerstand, versprochen!
#. fr: Pauvre monocéros...  Pour exploiter ses pouvoirs curatifs, les scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ques de la 4e légion lui ont fait subir d'horribles expériences... Je vous en prrrie, aidez-moi à le protéger<nbsp>! Je suis prête à rejoindre votre camp s'il le faut<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:553:0:56"
msgid "Please, you must see this monoceros to safety! He has the power to heal injuries, which is why the Empire is so desperate to have him back. But I cannot allow it, not after the way they have treated him!"
msgstr "Пожалуйста, помогите этому монокеросу добраться до безопасного места! Он умеет лечить раны, поэтому Империя так хочет вернуть его. Но я не могу этого допустить после того, как они с ним обращались!"

#. ja: ブルルルル……。
#. de: \<schnauf>
#. fr: (grogne)
msgctxt "FateEvent:554:0:56"
msgid "\\<whinny>"
msgstr "<i>И-го-го!</i>"

#. ja: アアアアア……思い出せなイ……<br>なぜ、オレは……こんなところにいるんダ……？
#. de: Ich ... kann mich nicht erinnern ... Was ... mache ich hier?
#. fr: Uuurgh... Rien à faire, je ne me souviens pas... Comment ai-je fait pour atterrir ici<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Who's there!? What do you want!?<br>The...the mediciiiiiine!
#. column 58: Haaah... Haaah...<br>Yes. I...remember. My orders. My mission.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:555:0:56"
msgid "Where am I?<br><i>What</i> am I?"
msgstr "Где я?<br><i>Кто</i> я?"

#. ja: だ、誰ダ……オレに命令するのハ……<br>く、薬を飲め……？
#. de: Da war ein Gebräu ... Sie haben mich gezwungen, es zu trinken ...
#. fr: ... Qu-qui me parle<nbsp>!? Qu'est-ce que vous me voulez<nbsp>!?<nbsp>... P-prendre quoi<nbsp>? Mon “médicament”<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Where am I?<br><i>What</i> am I?
#. column 58: Haaah... Haaah...<br>Yes. I...remember. My orders. My mission.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:555:0:57"
msgid "Who's there!? What do you want!?<br>The...the mediciiiiiine!"
msgstr "Кто здесь!? Чего вам нужно!?<br>Лекарст... лекарствО-О-О!"

#. ja: スゥ、ハァ……スゥ、ハァ……<br>落ち着いてきタ……任務を遂行しまス……。
#. de: \<keuch> ... Ich bin ganz ruhig. Ganz ruhig. Ich muss an die Mission denken.
#. fr: (respire pro<shy>fon<shy>dé<shy>ment) J-je me sens plus serein... Bien... Je vais accomplir ma mission.
#. column 56: Where am I?<br><i>What</i> am I?
#. column 57: Who's there!? What do you want!?<br>The...the mediciiiiiine!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:555:0:58"
msgid "Haaah... Haaah...<br>Yes. I...remember. My orders. My mission."
msgstr "Ха-а... ха-а...<br>Да. Я... вспомнил. Приказы. Моя миссия."

#. ja: 敵補給路の寸断に<br>どうか協力を！
#. de: Hilf uns, die feindliche Versorgung zu stören!
#. fr: Nous allons couper la ligne de ra<shy>vi<shy>tail<shy>le<shy>ment ennemie<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:556:0:56"
msgid "We need to cut off the enemy supply chain!"
msgstr "Нужно перерезать врагу пути снабжения!"

#. ja: おお、貴方は解放者様ッ！<br>実は偵察中に敵の通信を傍受したのです！
#. de: <if $gn4>Befreierin<else>Befreier</if>! Unsere Spione haben eine Übertragung des Feindes abgehört.
#. fr: Ah, <if $gn4>la grande libératrice<else>le grand libérateur</if>, en chair et en os<nbsp>! Vous arrivez à point nommé. Nous avons intercepté une communication fort intéressante.
#. column 57: In fact, they'll be here any moment now! Not only is this the perfect chance to deprive them of their precious resources, but we'll be able to claim them for ourselves.
#. column 58: Trouble is, the imperials'll arrive before I can send for more troops to assist me. Do you think you could help in their place?
#. column 59: Assist in requisitioning imperial supplies?
#. column 60: That's good to hear! Once you've got your hands on some of those resources, bring them to me and I'll do my best to keep the enemy away from them.
#. column 62: Oh. Well, I understand that you're probably needed elsewhere. I'll just have to make do as best I can!
msgctxt "FateEvent:557:0:56"
msgid "I've important news for you! I've received information that the enemy will be moving a large shipment of supplies through this area."
msgstr "У меня важные новости! Разведка донесла, что враг повезёт через эти места крупный груз припасов."

#. ja: その内容によると、この近辺に、<br>敵軍の補給部隊がやってきているようなのです！<br>これを叩くことができれば、戦局に好影響を与えるでしょう！
#. de: Wir haben erfahren, dass der Feind hier in der Nähe eine Versorgungsstation errichten will.
#. fr: Apparemment, une unité de ra<shy>vi<shy>tail<shy>le<shy>ment impériale devrait passer par ici sous peu. Si nous parvenions à lui barrer la route, cela aurait un impact sur l'ensemble des forces ennemies de la région.
#. column 56: I've important news for you! I've received information that the enemy will be moving a large shipment of supplies through this area.
#. column 58: Trouble is, the imperials'll arrive before I can send for more troops to assist me. Do you think you could help in their place?
#. column 59: Assist in requisitioning imperial supplies?
#. column 60: That's good to hear! Once you've got your hands on some of those resources, bring them to me and I'll do my best to keep the enemy away from them.
#. column 62: Oh. Well, I understand that you're probably needed elsewhere. I'll just have to make do as best I can!
msgctxt "FateEvent:557:0:57"
msgid "In fact, they'll be here any moment now! Not only is this the perfect chance to deprive them of their precious resources, but we'll be able to claim them for ourselves."
msgstr "Они будут здесь с минуты на минуту! Отличный шанс лишить их припасов и забрать их себе."

#. ja: 今から援軍を要請していては間に合いません！<br>どうか、解放者様、敵補給部隊への攻撃に参加し、<br>「帝国軍の補給物資」を奪取してきてください！
#. de: Wir müssen schnell handeln! Wenn wir jetzt angreifen und Versorgungsmaterial erbeuten, kann das die Schlacht entscheiden.
#. fr: Nous n'avons pas le temps d'attendre les renforts, hélas. Mais qu'importe, puisque vous êtes là<nbsp>! Voulez-vous bien nous aider à piller leurs provisions<nbsp>?
#. column 56: I've important news for you! I've received information that the enemy will be moving a large shipment of supplies through this area.
#. column 57: In fact, they'll be here any moment now! Not only is this the perfect chance to deprive them of their precious resources, but we'll be able to claim them for ourselves.
#. column 59: Assist in requisitioning imperial supplies?
#. column 60: That's good to hear! Once you've got your hands on some of those resources, bring them to me and I'll do my best to keep the enemy away from them.
#. column 62: Oh. Well, I understand that you're probably needed elsewhere. I'll just have to make do as best I can!
msgctxt "FateEvent:557:0:58"
msgid "Trouble is, the imperials'll arrive before I can send for more troops to assist me. Do you think you could help in their place?"
msgstr "Беда в том, что имперцы прибудут раньше, чем я успею запросить подкрепление. Поможешь мне вместо них?"

#. ja: 作戦に協力しますか？
#. de: Bei der Operation helfen?
#. fr: Livrer des caisses de provisions impériales aux résistants<nbsp>?
#. column 56: I've important news for you! I've received information that the enemy will be moving a large shipment of supplies through this area.
#. column 57: In fact, they'll be here any moment now! Not only is this the perfect chance to deprive them of their precious resources, but we'll be able to claim them for ourselves.
#. column 58: Trouble is, the imperials'll arrive before I can send for more troops to assist me. Do you think you could help in their place?
#. column 60: That's good to hear! Once you've got your hands on some of those resources, bring them to me and I'll do my best to keep the enemy away from them.
#. column 62: Oh. Well, I understand that you're probably needed elsewhere. I'll just have to make do as best I can!
msgctxt "FateEvent:557:0:59"
msgid "Assist in requisitioning imperial supplies?"
msgstr "Помочь захватить имперские припасы?"

#. ja: ご協力いただけるのですね、感謝します！<br>敵補給部隊は、この先に展開しておりますので、<br>どうか、よろしくお願いします！
#. de: Danke. Der Feind ist bereits in der Nähe. Tu, was du kannst!
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Tenez, quand on parle du loup... À l'attaque<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I've important news for you! I've received information that the enemy will be moving a large shipment of supplies through this area.
#. column 57: In fact, they'll be here any moment now! Not only is this the perfect chance to deprive them of their precious resources, but we'll be able to claim them for ourselves.
#. column 58: Trouble is, the imperials'll arrive before I can send for more troops to assist me. Do you think you could help in their place?
#. column 59: Assist in requisitioning imperial supplies?
#. column 62: Oh. Well, I understand that you're probably needed elsewhere. I'll just have to make do as best I can!
msgctxt "FateEvent:557:0:60"
msgid "That's good to hear! Once you've got your hands on some of those resources, bring them to me and I'll do my best to keep the enemy away from them."
msgstr "Отлично! Как только добудете припасы, приносите их мне. Я постараюсь не подпустить к ним врага."

#. ja: そ、そうですか……。<br>ですが、無理強いはできませんね。<br>後のことは、我々にお任せください！
#. de: D-Das ist bedauerlich. Aber gut. Wir tun unser Bestes. Dir viel Glück, <if $gn4>Befreierin<else>Befreier</if>!
#. fr: Dommage, votre force aurait été un sérieux atout. Tant pis, nous ferons sans.
#. column 56: I've important news for you! I've received information that the enemy will be moving a large shipment of supplies through this area.
#. column 57: In fact, they'll be here any moment now! Not only is this the perfect chance to deprive them of their precious resources, but we'll be able to claim them for ourselves.
#. column 58: Trouble is, the imperials'll arrive before I can send for more troops to assist me. Do you think you could help in their place?
#. column 59: Assist in requisitioning imperial supplies?
#. column 60: That's good to hear! Once you've got your hands on some of those resources, bring them to me and I'll do my best to keep the enemy away from them.
msgctxt "FateEvent:557:0:62"
msgid "Oh. Well, I understand that you're probably needed elsewhere. I'll just have to make do as best I can!"
msgstr "А, понятно. Наверное, у вас есть дела поважнее. Ничего, справлюсь как-нибудь сам!"

#. ja: 「帝国軍の補給物資」を見かけませんでしたか？<br>敵補給部隊を叩き、奪取を試みてください！
#. de: Hast du keine Versorgungskisten gefunden? Greif den Feind an und wer weiß, vielleicht erbeutest du etwas!
#. fr: Vous ne trouvez pas de provisions ennemies<nbsp>? Je vois des caisses au sol. Vous pouvez sinon tenter de dévaliser directement les ravitailleurs.
msgctxt "FateEvent:558:0:56"
msgid "No luck so far? That's all right, I'll sure there'll be plenty of supplies for us to swipe!"
msgstr "Пока безуспешно? Ничего, припасов для нас тут ещё наверняка полно!"

#. ja: 「帝国軍の補給物資」の奪取に成功したのですか？
#. de: Hast du dem Feind Versorgungsmaterial entreißen können?
#. fr: Alors, le pillage avance<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Haha! That's the stuff! I'm sure Bajsaljen and the others will be chuffed to bits.
#. column 61: Still, I reckon we can gather up even more supplies before the imperials are beyond our reach. See if you can grab some more loot!
msgctxt "FateEvent:559:0:56"
msgid "Any luck?"
msgstr "Ну как, есть успехи?"

#. ja: お見事です！<br>補給物資の中身も、まだ使えそうですよ！
#. de: Ausgezeichnet! Frische Unterhosen und trockene Socken. Die können wir gebrauchen.
#. fr: Beau travail<nbsp>! Et le contenu est en parfait état<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Any luck?
#. column 61: Still, I reckon we can gather up even more supplies before the imperials are beyond our reach. See if you can grab some more loot!
msgctxt "FateEvent:559:0:60"
msgid "Haha! That's the stuff! I'm sure Bajsaljen and the others will be chuffed to bits."
msgstr "Ха-ха! Вот это добыча! Уверен, Байсальен и остальные будут просто в восторге."

#. ja: ですが、まだ補給部隊を壊滅させたわけではありません！<br>引き続き「帝国軍の補給物資」の奪取を、お願いします！
#. de: Aber wir brauchen noch mehr. Bring mir so viele Versorgungskisten, wie du finden kannst.
#. fr: M'est avis qu'on peut leur faire encore plus mal<nbsp>! Continuez de les dépouiller<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Any luck?
#. column 60: Haha! That's the stuff! I'm sure Bajsaljen and the others will be chuffed to bits.
msgctxt "FateEvent:559:0:61"
msgid "Still, I reckon we can gather up even more supplies before the imperials are beyond our reach. See if you can grab some more loot!"
msgstr "Но, думаю, мы успеем прихватить ещё припасов, пока имперцы не ушли. Попробуйте добыть ещё немного!"

#. ja: 「帝国軍の補給物資」を見かけませんでしたか？
#. de: Hast du keine Versorgungskisten?
#. fr: Vous avez ramassé d'autres caisses<nbsp>?
#. column 57: That's alright, we have enough as it is. I'd say our work here is more or less done.
#. column 58: Having said that, I think I can afford to stay here a little longer before the imperials chase me away. If you do happen across any more supplies, I'll be happy to take them off your hands.
msgctxt "FateEvent:560:0:56"
msgid "Oh, nothing to give me?"
msgstr "Ничего мне не принесли?"

#. ja: すでに、こちらでは十分な量を確保しております。<br>どれだけレジスタンスの仲間が喜ぶことか……！
#. de: Gut, wir haben ja bereits eine gute Menge erbeutet. Die Kameraden wird's freuen.
#. fr: Une vraie razzia<nbsp>! Ce sont nos camarades qui vont être contents<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh, nothing to give me?
#. column 58: Having said that, I think I can afford to stay here a little longer before the imperials chase me away. If you do happen across any more supplies, I'll be happy to take them off your hands.
msgctxt "FateEvent:560:0:57"
msgid "That's alright, we have enough as it is. I'd say our work here is more or less done."
msgstr "Ничего, нам и так хватит. Пожалуй, на этом наша работа почти закончена."

#. ja: 私は、そろそろ奪取した品をまとめ帰還します。<br>それまでに、また「帝国軍の補給物資」を入手したら、<br>渡しにきてくださいね！
#. de: Ich werde die Beute ins Lager bringen. Wenn du noch mehr Material findest, kannst du es später wieder bei mir abliefern.
#. fr: Je vais rassembler notre butin, puis nous pourrons déguerpir. Bien sûr, si vous m'amenez d'autres caisses d'ici là, je ne cracherai pas dessus<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh, nothing to give me?
#. column 57: That's alright, we have enough as it is. I'd say our work here is more or less done.
msgctxt "FateEvent:560:0:58"
msgid "Having said that, I think I can afford to stay here a little longer before the imperials chase me away. If you do happen across any more supplies, I'll be happy to take them off your hands."
msgstr "А всё же я ещё немного побуду здесь, пока имперцы меня не прогнали. Если найдёте ещё припасов, приносите, я с радостью их заберу."

#. ja: 「帝国軍の補給物資」の奪取に成功したのですか？
#. de: Hast du Versorgungskisten finden können?
#. fr: Vous avez ramassé d'autres caisses<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Haha, that's what I like to see!
#. column 61: I'll be here a little while longer, so if you manage to liberate any more of the imperials' resources, bring them to me.
msgctxt "FateEvent:561:0:56"
msgid "Got any more supplies?"
msgstr "Ещё припасов нашли?"

#. ja: これだけの量があれば、<br>どれだけレジスタンスの仲間が喜ぶことか……！
#. de: Bei der Menge werden sich die Kameraden mächtig freuen.
#. fr: Une vraie razzia<nbsp>! Ce sont nos camarades qui vont être contents<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Got any more supplies?
#. column 61: I'll be here a little while longer, so if you manage to liberate any more of the imperials' resources, bring them to me.
msgctxt "FateEvent:561:0:60"
msgid "Haha, that's what I like to see!"
msgstr "Ха-ха, вот это я понимаю!"

#. ja: 私は、そろそろ奪取した品をまとめ帰還します。<br>それまでに、また「帝国軍の補給物資」を入手したら、<br>渡しにきてくださいね！
#. de: Ich werde die Beute jetzt ins Lager bringen. Wenn du noch mehr Material findest, kannst du es später wieder bei mir abliefern.
#. fr: Je vais rassembler notre butin, puis nous pourrons déguerpir. Bien sûr, si vous m'amenez d'autres caisses d'ici là, je ne cracherai pas dessus<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Got any more supplies?
#. column 60: Haha, that's what I like to see!
msgctxt "FateEvent:561:0:61"
msgid "I'll be here a little while longer, so if you manage to liberate any more of the imperials' resources, bring them to me."
msgstr "Я ещё немного побуду здесь. Если удастся добыть ещё имперских припасов, приносите мне."

#. ja: 冒険者どの、お待ちしておりました。<br>これより、降神祭を祝う演目として荒神楽を催します。<br>ぜひ、武者役として出演をお願いします。
#. de: <if $gn4>Mutige Abenteurerin<else>Mutiger Abenteurer</if>, deine Ankunft wurde sehnlichst erwartet. Der Himmelswende-Kagura beginnt in Kürze. Bist du bereit, in die Rolle des Tigerbezwingers zu schlüpfen?
#. fr: Je vous attendais<nbsp>! L'Ara-kagura va débuter. J'ai hâte de vous voir dans le rôle d<if $gn4>e la<else>u</if> guerri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>!
#. column 57: It is quite simple. We shall summon forth an apparition of the mighty tora from a folding screen and you simply need slay it. Can we count on your aid?
#. column 58: Help with the ritual?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I see. Well, that is a shame indeed.
msgctxt "FateEvent:562:0:56"
msgid "Ah, adventurer. Good to see you once more. Preparations for the ritual are finished at last. We would like to request you play the role of the noble warrior."
msgstr "А, искатель приключений! Рад снова вас видеть. Подготовка к обряду наконец завершена. Просим вас сыграть роль благородного воина."

#. ja: 私たちが秘術を用いて、屏風に描かれた虎の絵を、<br>具現化いたしますゆえ、これを倒していただきたいのです。<br>ぜひぜひ、御力添えを……！
#. de: Ich werde dem Wandschirmtiger mit meinen geheimen Kräften Leben einhauchen. Danach musst du schnell und entschlossen handeln, sonst landen wir alle im Rachen des Tigers!
#. fr: Votre tâche est simple<nbsp>: il vous suffit de battre l'illusion de tigre que je vais faire apparaître. Un jeu d'enfant<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ah, adventurer. Good to see you once more. Preparations for the ritual are finished at last. We would like to request you play the role of the noble warrior.
#. column 58: Help with the ritual?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I see. Well, that is a shame indeed.
msgctxt "FateEvent:562:0:57"
msgid "It is quite simple. We shall summon forth an apparition of the mighty tora from a folding screen and you simply need slay it. Can we count on your aid?"
msgstr "Всё просто. Мы вызовем из ширмы призрак могучего тигра, а вам останется его одолеть. Поможете нам?"

#. ja: 荒神楽に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Beim Himmelswende-Kagura mitmachen? <br><br> <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le prêtre onmyo<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Ah, adventurer. Good to see you once more. Preparations for the ritual are finished at last. We would like to request you play the role of the noble warrior.
#. column 57: It is quite simple. We shall summon forth an apparition of the mighty tora from a folding screen and you simply need slay it. Can we count on your aid?
#. column 62: I see. Well, that is a shame indeed.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:562:0:58"
msgid "Help with the ritual?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь с обрядом?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうですか……かしこまりました。<br>事情もおありでしょうから、致し方ありませんね。
#. de: Auch wenn ich mir eine andere Antwort erhofft habe, respektiere ich deinen Entschluss. Du wirst dafür deine Gründe haben und es steht mir nicht an, dich zu verurteilen.
#. fr: Vraiment<nbsp>? Je vois... J'imagine que vous avez d'autres choses à faire...
#. column 56: Ah, adventurer. Good to see you once more. Preparations for the ritual are finished at last. We would like to request you play the role of the noble warrior.
#. column 57: It is quite simple. We shall summon forth an apparition of the mighty tora from a folding screen and you simply need slay it. Can we count on your aid?
#. column 58: Help with the ritual?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:562:0:62"
msgid "I see. Well, that is a shame indeed."
msgstr "Понятно... Очень жаль."

#. ja: さあさあ、お立ち会い……！<br>降神祭を祝う演目、荒神楽を催していますよ！<br>武者役として、参加していただけませんか？
#. de: Willkommen beim Himmelswende-Kagura! Würdest du uns die Ehre erweisen und die Rolle des Kriegers über<shy>nehmen?
#. fr: Approchez, approchez<nbsp>! Qui veut interpréter le rôle du fier guerrier dans notre pièce d'Ara-kagura<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:567:0:56"
msgid "Now, what say you? Are you willing to play the part of the noble warrior in our Heavensturn ritual?"
msgstr "Подходите, подходите! Кто хочет сыграть роль благородного воина в обряде Перехода в новый год?"

#. ja: この演目は、「テンゼンの鬼退治」という、<br>東方でもっとも有名な英雄譚を、引用したもの……。<br>秘術で具現化した虎を討ち、邪気払いとするのですよ！
#. de: Das Stück beruht auf dem fernöstlichen Heldenepos „Tenzen und die Vertreibung des garstigen Dämons“. Deine Rolle besteht darin, den zum Leben erweckten Tiger zu bezwingen und damit das Böse zu vertreiben.
#. fr: Notre pièce est tirée du plus célèbre conte héroïque oriental<nbsp>: “Tenzen, le tueur de démons.” Battez notre illusion de tigre pour éloigner les mauvais esprits<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:568:0:56"
msgid "The ceremony itself is based on the Tale of Tenzen. Of course, he fought an actual ferocious tiger, whereas you will merely be taking on an apparition."
msgstr "Обряд основан на «Сказании о Тэндзэне». Правда, он сразился с настоящим свирепым тигром, а вам предстоит лишь одолеть его призрак."

#. ja: 回収した卵があれば、預かりますよ！
#. de: Ich kümmere mich gut um die Eier, die du einsammelst!
#. fr: Je garde vos œufs bien au chaud<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Splendid! I'll do my utmost to see these treasures remain intact...
#. column 62: Ah. Do be careful not to drop any, then─cracked eggs are no yolking matter!
msgctxt "FateEvent:569:0:56"
msgid "Any eggs you collect will be safe with me!"
msgstr "Если соберёте яйца, приносите их мне. Я сохраню их в целости!"

#. ja: お手伝いありがとうございます！<br>卵が割れてしまわないよう、守っておきます……！
#. de: Prima! Ich werde diese Schätze behandeln wie ... rohe Eier. Denn das sind sie ja.
#. fr: Merci beaucoup pour votre aide<nbsp>! Ne vous inquiétez pas je prendrai soin de ces œufs... comme une vraie maman poule<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Any eggs you collect will be safe with me!
#. column 62: Ah. Do be careful not to drop any, then─cracked eggs are no yolking matter!
msgctxt "FateEvent:569:0:60"
msgid "Splendid! I'll do my utmost to see these treasures remain intact..."
msgstr "Прекрасно! Я сделаю всё, чтобы эти сокровища остались целы..."

#. ja: あれ、いいんですか？<br>回収した卵が割れてしまわないよう、気をつけてくださいね！
#. de: Lass die Eier nicht fallen. Sie sind sehr zerbrechlich!
#. fr: Ah, vous êtes certain<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>? Veillez à ne pas les faire tomber quand même...
#. column 56: Any eggs you collect will be safe with me!
#. column 60: Splendid! I'll do my utmost to see these treasures remain intact...
msgctxt "FateEvent:569:0:62"
msgid "Ah. Do be careful not to drop any, then─cracked eggs are no yolking matter!"
msgstr "А, согласились? Только смотрите, не уроните яйца! Разбитые яйца — дело совсем не шуточное."

#. ja: 冒険者さん、いいところに！<br>そろそろメンドリたちが、卵を産みそうなんです。
#. de: Gut, dass du hier bist! Die Hennen sind dabei, ihre Eier zu legen.
#. fr: Aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>, vous tombez à pic<nbsp>! Les poules ont fini de pondre.
#. column 57: It's just that the roosters are in an, ahem, “excitable” mood. We could use a quick─and preferably armored─hand to assist with the collecting...
#. column 58: Assist with the egg collecting?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Not keen, then...? Can't say I blame you, but do let me know if you change your mind.
msgctxt "FateEvent:570:0:56"
msgid "I am so glad you're here, adventurer! From the looks of things, the hens are about to start laying their eggs."
msgstr "Как хорошо, что вы здесь, искатель приключений! Похоже, куры вот-вот начнут нестись."

#. ja: ただ、興奮状態のオンドリたちが、<br>今にも乱入してきそうな気配でして……。<br>どうか、「産みたて卵」を回収してもらえませんか？
#. de: Die Hähne sind allerdings etwas auf Krawall gebürstet. Hoffentlich hast du deine Rüstungshandschuhe dabei.
#. fr: Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, elles sont très protectrices envers leurs petits et les coqs du poulailler tout autant, il va falloir ruser si vous souhaitez mettre la main sur leurs œufs.
#. column 56: I am so glad you're here, adventurer! From the looks of things, the hens are about to start laying their eggs.
#. column 58: Assist with the egg collecting?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Not keen, then...? Can't say I blame you, but do let me know if you change your mind.
msgctxt "FateEvent:570:0:57"
msgid "It's just that the roosters are in an, ahem, “excitable” mood. We could use a quick─and preferably armored─hand to assist with the collecting..."
msgstr "Петухи, кхм, что-то уж больно разошлись. Нам быстрая помощь не помешала... желательно, в крепкой броне. Не поможете собрать яйца?"

#. ja: 「産みたて卵」集めを手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Kannst du uns helfen, die Eier einzusammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Dieses FATE ist für Stufe <num $n1> empfohlen.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Commencer la collecte des œufs<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I am so glad you're here, adventurer! From the looks of things, the hens are about to start laying their eggs.
#. column 57: It's just that the roosters are in an, ahem, “excitable” mood. We could use a quick─and preferably armored─hand to assist with the collecting...
#. column 62: Not keen, then...? Can't say I blame you, but do let me know if you change your mind.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:570:0:58"
msgid "Assist with the egg collecting?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать яйца?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうですか……<br>もし気が変わったら、また声をかけてくださいね。
#. de: Nein? Ich kann's dir nicht verübeln. Aber vielleicht änderst du ja noch deine Meinung.
#. fr: Ah, c'est bien dommage... Revenez me voir si jamais vous changez d'avis.
#. column 56: I am so glad you're here, adventurer! From the looks of things, the hens are about to start laying their eggs.
#. column 57: It's just that the roosters are in an, ahem, “excitable” mood. We could use a quick─and preferably armored─hand to assist with the collecting...
#. column 58: Assist with the egg collecting?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:570:0:62"
msgid "Not keen, then...? Can't say I blame you, but do let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "Не хотите? Не могу вас винить. Но если передумаете, дайте знать."

#. ja: 冒険者さんのおかげで、<br>立派な卵がたくさん集まりました！<br>預かった卵は、鶏舎の外に運んでおかないと……。
#. de: Danke! Wir haben jetzt so viele Eier, wie wir nur tragen können. Jetzt müssen wir sie nur noch in Sicherheit bringen ...
#. fr: Grâce à vous, nous avons suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment d'œufs pour le festival. Bon, je dois les amener jusqu'à l'amphithéâtre maintenant...
#. column 57: You will be back to help out again later, won't you!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:571:0:56"
msgid "Thanks to you, we've gathered all the eggs we can carry! Now if we can just sneak them out the door without further incident..."
msgstr "Благодаря вам мы собрали столько яиц, сколько смогли унести! Осталось только незаметно вынести их отсюда..."

#. ja: よかったら、また手伝ってくださいねー！
#. de: Du hilfst uns doch später wieder, oder?
#. fr: Si vous avez un peu de temps, revenez nous donner un coup de main, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Thanks to you, we've gathered all the eggs we can carry! Now if we can just sneak them out the door without further incident...
msgctxt "FateEvent:571:0:57"
msgid "You will be back to help out again later, won't you!?"
msgstr "Загляните ещё, поможете нам снова?"

#. ja: 回収した卵があれば、預かりますよ！
#. de: Ich kümmere mich gut um die Eier, die du einsammelst!
#. fr: Je garde vos œufs bien au chaud<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Yes, that should be enough for the time being. We wouldn't wish to agitate the hens any more than is strictly necessary.
#. column 61: Let's call it a day, but do stop by later if you fancy another lap around the run!
#. column 62: Ah. Do be careful not to drop any, then─cracked eggs are no yolking matter!
msgctxt "FateEvent:572:0:56"
msgid "Any eggs you collect will be safe with me!"
msgstr "Если соберёте яйца, приносите их мне. Я сохраню их в целости!"

#. ja: おかげさまで、卵はじゅうぶん集まりました！<br>長時間続けると、メンドリたちのストレスに繋がるので、<br>卵の回収はこのあたりで終わったほうがよさそうです。
#. de: Gut, das sollte erstmal reichen. Wir wollen die Hennen nicht zu sehr fordern.
#. fr: Grâce à votre aide, nous avons suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment d'œufs pour le festival. C'est tout aussi bien pour les cocottes... Pauvres petites, elles doivent être tendues à forcer d'être autant sur leurs gardes...
#. column 56: Any eggs you collect will be safe with me!
#. column 61: Let's call it a day, but do stop by later if you fancy another lap around the run!
#. column 62: Ah. Do be careful not to drop any, then─cracked eggs are no yolking matter!
msgctxt "FateEvent:572:0:60"
msgid "Yes, that should be enough for the time being. We wouldn't wish to agitate the hens any more than is strictly necessary."
msgstr "Да, пока хватит. Не стоит лишний раз тревожить кур."

#. ja: よかったら、また手伝ってくださいねー！
#. de: Meld dich später wieder ... wenn du dich traust.
#. fr: C'est assez pour l'instant, mais nous avons toujours besoin de plus d'œufs, alors n'hésitez pas à repasser pour nous donner un coup de main<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Any eggs you collect will be safe with me!
#. column 60: Yes, that should be enough for the time being. We wouldn't wish to agitate the hens any more than is strictly necessary.
#. column 62: Ah. Do be careful not to drop any, then─cracked eggs are no yolking matter!
msgctxt "FateEvent:572:0:61"
msgid "Let's call it a day, but do stop by later if you fancy another lap around the run!"
msgstr "На сегодня хватит. Загляните попозже, если захотите ещё раз пробежаться по курятнику!"

#. ja: あれ、いいんですか？<br>回収した卵が割れてしまわないよう、気をつけてくださいね！
#. de: Lass die Eier nicht fallen. Sie sind sehr zerbrechlich!
#. fr: Ah, vous êtes certain<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>? Veillez à ne pas les faire tomber quand même...
#. column 56: Any eggs you collect will be safe with me!
#. column 60: Yes, that should be enough for the time being. We wouldn't wish to agitate the hens any more than is strictly necessary.
#. column 61: Let's call it a day, but do stop by later if you fancy another lap around the run!
msgctxt "FateEvent:572:0:62"
msgid "Ah. Do be careful not to drop any, then─cracked eggs are no yolking matter!"
msgstr "А, согласились? Только смотрите, не уроните яйца! Разбитые яйца — дело совсем не шуточное."

#. ja: 「ヤクの毛」を運んできてくださったんですかー？<br>では、確認させていただきますね！
#. de: Hast du Yak-Wolle mitgebracht? Zeig her!
#. fr: Vous m'avez apporté de la laine de yak<nbsp>? Laissez-moi jeter un coup d'œil<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Excellent, exactly three sacks of fleece! Ahhh, it's so irresistibly soft and fluffy...
#. column 61: Well done, you've earned a point! And there's more to be had if you bring me more fleece!
#. column 62: What!? You better not be hoarding all that fluffy goodness for yourself!
msgctxt "FateEvent:573:0:56"
msgid "Brought me yak fleece, have you? Let's have a look!"
msgstr "Принесли мне шерсть яка? Давайте посмотрю!"

#. ja: たしかに規定量の「ヤクの毛」がありますねー！<br>うーん、モッフモフ！
#. de: Oh, ja! Drei Körbe mit Yak-Wolle. Und es ist ja sooo unwiderstehlich flauschig und wunderbar fluffig!
#. fr: Mais oui, c'est ce qu'il me fallait<nbsp>! Trois paniers de laine toute douce<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Brought me yak fleece, have you? Let's have a look!
#. column 61: Well done, you've earned a point! And there's more to be had if you bring me more fleece!
#. column 62: What!? You better not be hoarding all that fluffy goodness for yourself!
msgctxt "FateEvent:573:0:60"
msgid "Excellent, exactly three sacks of fleece! Ahhh, it's so irresistibly soft and fluffy..."
msgstr "Отлично, ровно три мешка шерсти! Ах, какая она мягкая и пушистая..."

#. ja: これで得点獲得ですー！<br>また「ヤクの毛」を刈り取ったら、持ってきてくださいねー！
#. de: Du hast dir deinen Punkt redlich verdient. Aber ich will noch meeehr Yak-Wolle! Bekommst auch noch mehr Punkte!
#. fr: Bravo, vous avez marqué un point<nbsp>! Et n'hésitez pas à m'en apporter davantage pour améliorer votre score<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Brought me yak fleece, have you? Let's have a look!
#. column 60: Excellent, exactly three sacks of fleece! Ahhh, it's so irresistibly soft and fluffy...
#. column 62: What!? You better not be hoarding all that fluffy goodness for yourself!
msgctxt "FateEvent:573:0:61"
msgid "Well done, you've earned a point! And there's more to be had if you bring me more fleece!"
msgstr "Отлично, вы заработали очко! Принесёте ещё шерсти — получите ещё!"

#. ja: な、なんで……！？<br>さてはモッフモフを独占するつもりですねー！！
#. de: Wie bitte? Keine Yak-Wolle für mich?! Wehe du hortest die wunderbar fluffige Wolle!
#. fr: Hein, mais pourquoi<nbsp>!? Ne me dites pas que vous avez l'intention de garder toute cette laine pour vous<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Brought me yak fleece, have you? Let's have a look!
#. column 60: Excellent, exactly three sacks of fleece! Ahhh, it's so irresistibly soft and fluffy...
#. column 61: Well done, you've earned a point! And there's more to be had if you bring me more fleece!
msgctxt "FateEvent:573:0:62"
msgid "What!? You better not be hoarding all that fluffy goodness for yourself!"
msgstr "Что?! Только не говорите, что хотите оставить всю эту пушистую прелесть себе!"

#. ja: 隠されたぬいぐるみは、見つかったぁー？<br>「アタリのぬいぐるみ」を持ってたら、僕まで納品おねがいね！
#. de: Wie sieht es aus? Hast du einen Glücksmogry gefunden?
#. fr: Alors, vous avez trouvé la peluche gagnante<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Oh yes, this is a lucky toy, and no mistake! Well found, my friend!
#. column 61: Have a point for your efforts, and keep up the good work!
#. column 62: What? You'd rather keep the toy than earn a point? I can only assume you have a mania for them...
msgctxt "FateEvent:574:0:56"
msgid "How goes the hunt? Have you found the lucky toy?"
msgstr "Ну как, нашли счастливую игрушку?"

#. ja: うん、間違いない……！<br>これで得点獲得だよぉー！
#. de: Ja, das ist einer! Ein Glücksmogry. Ausgezeichnet!
#. fr: Oui<nbsp>! Aucun doute, c'est bien elle<nbsp>! Ça fait un point de plus dans votre escarcelle<nbsp>!
#. column 56: How goes the hunt? Have you found the lucky toy?
#. column 61: Have a point for your efforts, and keep up the good work!
#. column 62: What? You'd rather keep the toy than earn a point? I can only assume you have a mania for them...
msgctxt "FateEvent:574:0:60"
msgid "Oh yes, this is a lucky toy, and no mistake! Well found, my friend!"
msgstr "Да, точно она! Вот это удача, друг мой!"

#. ja: またプレゼントボックスを見つけたら、<br>中身を確認してみてねぇー！
#. de: Hier der versprochene Punkt! Weiter so!
#. fr: Libre à vous de continuer à ouvrir les paquets cadeaux pour obtenir un meilleur score<nbsp>!
#. column 56: How goes the hunt? Have you found the lucky toy?
#. column 60: Oh yes, this is a lucky toy, and no mistake! Well found, my friend!
#. column 62: What? You'd rather keep the toy than earn a point? I can only assume you have a mania for them...
msgctxt "FateEvent:574:0:61"
msgid "Have a point for your efforts, and keep up the good work!"
msgstr "За старания вам очко! Так держать!"

#. ja: なんでぇ！？<br>もしかして君、無類のぬいぐるみ好きだねぇ！？
#. de: Wie, du willst die süßen Flattermänner doch nicht etwa behalten? Sag bloß, du sammelst Mogrys?
#. fr: C'est pas sympa, ça<nbsp>! Qu'est-ce que vous allez faire avec cette peluche<nbsp>?
#. column 56: How goes the hunt? Have you found the lucky toy?
#. column 60: Oh yes, this is a lucky toy, and no mistake! Well found, my friend!
#. column 61: Have a point for your efforts, and keep up the good work!
msgctxt "FateEvent:574:0:62"
msgid "What? You'd rather keep the toy than earn a point? I can only assume you have a mania for them..."
msgstr "Что, решили оставить игрушку себе, а не заработать очко? Похоже, вы их просто обожаете..."

#. ja: それにしても、あの興奮状態のオンドリたち……<br>とてもではありませんが、近づく勇気がありません。<br>どうか気をつけて、卵を回収してくださいね！
#. de: Die Hähne sind wirklich sehr streitlustig. Ich frag mich, was Meister Pawlin ihnen gegeben hat?
#. fr: Par les Douze<nbsp>! Ces poules sont vraiment farouches... Vous êtes bien courag<if $gn4>euse<else>eux</if> de vous en approcher comme ça. Attention aux coups de bec<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:575:0:56"
msgid "Those certainly are some unruly roosters. What has Master Pawlin been feeding them, I wonder...?"
msgstr "Петухи и правда какие-то буйные. Чем их, интересно, кормит мастер Поллин?.."

#. ja: 解放者殿……お聞きください！<br>この先で、機械化歩兵大隊が魔導兵器に補給するため、<br>物資を集積しているようです。
#. de: Eine Magitek-Einheit wurde gesichtet, die große Mengen Vorräte gehortet hat!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Grande libératrice<else>Grand libérateur</if><nbsp>! Nous avons un coup à jouer. Les Impériaux stockent le carburant qu'utilise leur cohorte d'infanterie mécanisée tout près d'ici
#. column 57: Among the supplies are tanks of ceruleum intended for their machina, but the fuel would serve to sustain our barrier just as well.
#. column 58: To that end, we intend to launch a raid to seize the ceruleum. Can we depend on your help?
#. column 59: Help to seize the ceruleum?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What ceruleum you obtain, I will take off your hands!
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but worry not─we'll take care of it one way or another.
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "FateEvent:584:0:56"
msgid "Hear me, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! A magitek unit has been sighted replenishing its supplies nearby!"
msgstr "Послушайте, клинок <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! Неподалёку заметили имперский отряд, пополняющий запасы!"

#. ja: 多少の守備戦力があるようですが、<br>これを打ち破れば、青燐水を強奪できるでしょう。
#. de: Darunter befinden sich auch Erdseim-Fässer, mit denen sie ihre mörderischen Maschinen füttern. Die könnten wir gut gebrauchen!
#. fr: Ces réserves sont défendues, bien sûr, mais faiblement. Nous pourrions leur subtiliser quelques batteries au céruleum avant que leurs renforts n'arrivent.
#. column 56: Hear me, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! A magitek unit has been sighted replenishing its supplies nearby!
#. column 58: To that end, we intend to launch a raid to seize the ceruleum. Can we depend on your help?
#. column 59: Help to seize the ceruleum?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What ceruleum you obtain, I will take off your hands!
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but worry not─we'll take care of it one way or another.
msgctxt "FateEvent:584:0:57"
msgid "Among the supplies are tanks of ceruleum intended for their machina, but the fuel would serve to sustain our barrier just as well."
msgstr "Среди припасов есть бочки с синим топливом для их магитека, но оно пригодится и для поддержания нашего барьера."

#. ja: 青燐水は、疑似青龍壁の維持には欠かせません。<br>どうか我々の急襲作戦に協力し、<br>「軍用青燐水バレル」を集めて頂けないでしょうか？
#. de: Wir greifen an und holen uns den Treibstoff. Bist du dabei?
#. fr: En outre, maître Cid disait que ce précieux liquide était nécessaire pour le bon fonc<shy>tion<shy>ne<shy>ment du champ de force qui protège notre avant-poste. Pourriez-vous nous aider à en récupérer un peu<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Hear me, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! A magitek unit has been sighted replenishing its supplies nearby!
#. column 57: Among the supplies are tanks of ceruleum intended for their machina, but the fuel would serve to sustain our barrier just as well.
#. column 59: Help to seize the ceruleum?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What ceruleum you obtain, I will take off your hands!
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but worry not─we'll take care of it one way or another.
msgctxt "FateEvent:584:0:58"
msgid "To that end, we intend to launch a raid to seize the ceruleum. Can we depend on your help?"
msgstr "Мы собираемся совершить налёт и захватить топливо. Можем рассчитывать на вашу помощь?"

#. ja: 青燐水奪取に協力しますか？
#. de: Hilfst du, den Erdseim zu erbeuten?
#. fr: Aider à voler des batteries au céruleum<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Hear me, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! A magitek unit has been sighted replenishing its supplies nearby!
#. column 57: Among the supplies are tanks of ceruleum intended for their machina, but the fuel would serve to sustain our barrier just as well.
#. column 58: To that end, we intend to launch a raid to seize the ceruleum. Can we depend on your help?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What ceruleum you obtain, I will take off your hands!
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but worry not─we'll take care of it one way or another.
msgctxt "FateEvent:584:0:59"
msgid "Help to seize the ceruleum?"
msgstr "Помочь захватить синее топливо?"

#. ja: ご協力に感謝いたします！<br>「軍用青燐水バレル」を入手したら、私にお渡しください！
#. de: Danke. Bringe alle Erdseim-Fässer, die du finden kannst, zu mir.
#. fr: Merci beaucoup, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Apportez-moi toutes les batteries que vous parviendrez à subtiliser. Je me chargerai de les faire parvenir à bon port<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Hear me, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! A magitek unit has been sighted replenishing its supplies nearby!
#. column 57: Among the supplies are tanks of ceruleum intended for their machina, but the fuel would serve to sustain our barrier just as well.
#. column 58: To that end, we intend to launch a raid to seize the ceruleum. Can we depend on your help?
#. column 59: Help to seize the ceruleum?
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but worry not─we'll take care of it one way or another.
msgctxt "FateEvent:584:0:60"
msgid "We're in your debt! What ceruleum you obtain, I will take off your hands!"
msgstr "Мы у вас в долгу! Что бы вы ни добыли, приносите мне!"

#. ja: ぬ、ぬう……仕方ありません。<br>では、ここは我らにお任せください……！
#. de: Ich verstehe, du hast andere Dinge zu tun. Aber keine Sorge, wir schaffen das schon.
#. fr: V-vous avez une mission plus pressante<nbsp>? Tant pis, nous essaierons de faire sans vous. Merci quand même<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Hear me, Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! A magitek unit has been sighted replenishing its supplies nearby!
#. column 57: Among the supplies are tanks of ceruleum intended for their machina, but the fuel would serve to sustain our barrier just as well.
#. column 58: To that end, we intend to launch a raid to seize the ceruleum. Can we depend on your help?
#. column 59: Help to seize the ceruleum?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What ceruleum you obtain, I will take off your hands!
msgctxt "FateEvent:584:0:62"
msgid "I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but worry not─we'll take care of it one way or another."
msgstr "Понимаю... С вашей помощью нам было бы куда легче, но не волнуйтесь — мы как-нибудь справимся."

#. ja: むっ……「軍用青燐水バレル」は、集まっていないようですね。<br>敵の魔導兵器を破壊するか、物資集積地の周辺を捜索するか、<br>いずれかの方法で奪取してきてください！
#. de: Hast du was gefunden? Wenn du nicht genug Erdseim in den Vorräten findest, zerstöre feindliche Kampf<shy>maschinen, um an mehr zu kommen.
#. fr: Vous ne trouvez pas de céruleum<nbsp>? Des batteries traînent un peu partout, mais vous pouvez aussi détruire des armes magitek et extraire celles qui les alimentent, j'imagine. Vous allez y arriver, j'en suis certain<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:585:0:56"
msgid "How goes the collecting? If you do not find ceruleum on the ground, you should be able to obtain it from their supply ships."
msgstr "Как продвигаются поиски? Если не найдёте синее топливо на земле, попробуйте добыть его с имперских транспортов."

#. ja: 解放者殿……ご無事で！<br>もしや、「軍用青燐水バレル」を手に入れたので？
#. de: Und? Hast du Erdseim erbeutet?
#. fr: Vous m'apportez du céruleum à ce que je vois<nbsp>! Je vais vous en débarrasser<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Ah yes, this is the ceruleum, and no mistake! You have my thanks!
#. column 61: Please keep it coming─we can never have too much ceruleum for the cause.
msgctxt "FateEvent:586:0:56"
msgid "There you are! Do you have some ceruleum for me?"
msgstr "Вот вы где! Нашли для меня синее топливо?"

#. ja: さすがは解放者殿！<br>実に見事な働きぶり、感服いたします！
#. de: Ja, das ist Erdseim! Vielen Dank!
#. fr: Merci bien<nbsp>! Vous vous acquittez de votre mission avec brio, comme d'habitude<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There you are! Do you have some ceruleum for me?
#. column 61: Please keep it coming─we can never have too much ceruleum for the cause.
msgctxt "FateEvent:586:0:60"
msgid "Ah yes, this is the ceruleum, and no mistake! You have my thanks!"
msgstr "Да, это оно, синее топливо! Спасибо вам!"

#. ja: しかし、未だに青燐水は不足しております！<br>「軍用青燐水バレル」を、また見つけた場合は私の下へ！
#. de: Bring alles, was du finden kannst. Wir können nicht genug davon haben.
#. fr: Toutefois, il nous faudrait encore quelques batteries pour appeler ça un succès<nbsp>! Essayer d'en trouver un peu plus, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There you are! Do you have some ceruleum for me?
#. column 60: Ah yes, this is the ceruleum, and no mistake! You have my thanks!
msgctxt "FateEvent:586:0:61"
msgid "Please keep it coming─we can never have too much ceruleum for the cause."
msgstr "Но топлива нам всё ещё мало! Если найдёте ещё бочки с военным синим топливом, приносите мне."

#. ja: 青燐水を確保することに成功しました！<br>しかし、備蓄物資は多ければ多いほど良いもの！<br>「軍用青燐水バレル」を、また見つけた場合は私の元へ！
#. de: Wir haben schon viele Fässer erbeutet, aber wenn du noch mehr hast, nehme ich sie dir alle ab.
#. fr: Nous devrions avoir de quoi faire avec ce qu'on a déjà<nbsp>! Mais plus on en a, mieux c'est. Amassons-en un maximum avant que les renforts ennemis n'arrivent<nbsp>!
#. column 60:
msgctxt "FateEvent:587:0:56"
msgid "We've seized a good many tanks of ceruleum already, but if there's more to be had, then we should take it. To wit, please keep it coming!"
msgstr "Мы уже захватили немало бочек с синим топливом, но лишним оно не будет. Продолжайте приносить!"

#. column 56: We've seized a good many tanks of ceruleum already, but if there's more to be had, then we should take it. To wit, please keep it coming!
msgctxt "FateEvent:587:0:60"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 解放者殿……ご無事で！<br>もしや、「軍用青燐水バレル」を手に入れたので？
#. de: Und? Hast du Erdseim erbeutet?
#. fr: Vous m'apportez du céruleum à ce que je vois<nbsp>! Je vais vous en débarrasser<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Excellent! With this many tanks, I believe we can declare our mission a success!
#. column 61: That being said, if there's more to be had, then we should take it while we still can. That's to say, keep it coming!
msgctxt "FateEvent:588:0:56"
msgid "There you are! Do you have some ceruleum for me?"
msgstr "Вот вы где! Нашли для меня синее топливо?"

#. ja: 任務完了です！<br>みなさん、協力に感謝いたします！
#. de: Ausgezeichnet! Die Mission ist ein voller Erfolg!
#. fr: Excellent<nbsp>! Nous aurons ce qu'il nous faut avec ça<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There you are! Do you have some ceruleum for me?
#. column 61: That being said, if there's more to be had, then we should take it while we still can. That's to say, keep it coming!
msgctxt "FateEvent:588:0:60"
msgid "Excellent! With this many tanks, I believe we can declare our mission a success!"
msgstr "Прекрасно! С таким запасом бочек можно считать задание выполненным!"

#. ja: しかし、備蓄物資は多ければ多いほど良いもの！<br>「軍用青燐水バレル」を、また見つけた場合は私の元へ！
#. de: Aber bring mir alles, was du noch finden kannst. Wir können nicht genug von dem Treibstoff haben.
#. fr: Mais plus on en a, mieux c'est. Amassons-en un maximum avant que les renforts ennemis n'arrivent<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There you are! Do you have some ceruleum for me?
#. column 60: Excellent! With this many tanks, I believe we can declare our mission a success!
msgctxt "FateEvent:588:0:61"
msgid "That being said, if there's more to be had, then we should take it while we still can. That's to say, keep it coming!"
msgstr "Но чем больше запасов, тем лучше! Если найдёте ещё бочки с военным синим топливом, приносите мне."

#. ja: エーテルクリッパーで刈った、<br>モッフモフの「ヤクの毛」をお待ちしてます！
#. de: Ich sehe schon voller Vorfreude der Lieferung der fluffigen Yak-Wolle entgegen!
#. fr: Allez donc tondre ce yak et apportez-moi sa laine<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:589:0:56"
msgid "I eagerly await your deliveries of fluffy yak fleece!"
msgstr "С нетерпением жду пушистую шерсть яка!"

#. ja: 隠されたぬいぐるみは、見つかったぁー？<br>「アタリのぬいぐるみ」を持ってたら、僕まで納品おねがいね！
#. de: Wie sieht es bei der Jagd aus? Schon das Glücksspielzeug gefunden?
#. fr: Apportez-moi la peluche gagnante quand vous l'aurez trouvée<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:590:0:56"
msgid "How goes the hunt? Have you found the lucky toy?"
msgstr "Ну как, нашли счастливую игрушку?"

#. ja: 美しき光景ですねぇ……！
#. de: Wie schön!
#. fr: Tout le monde a le cœur en feste<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:591:0:56"
msgid "Hehe, what fun!"
msgstr "Хе-хе, вот это веселье!"

#. ja: 立派なもんだ。
#. de: Alles ist so wunderbar lebhaft!
#. fr: Quel énorme paquet cadeau<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:592:0:56"
msgid "Well, isn't this lively!"
msgstr "Ну и оживлённо тут!"

#. ja: にぎやかなもんだなぁ！
#. de: Was für ein prächtiges Fest!
#. fr: Vous pensez vraiment que c'est pour moi<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:594:0:56"
msgid "Jolly good show!"
msgstr "Вот это представление!"

#. ja: 楽しい街ですね！
#. de: Die Himmelsstadt ist ein wahres Juwel!
#. fr: Décidément, Azurée est vraiment un endroit charmant<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:595:0:56"
msgid "An exciting place, this Firmament!"
msgstr "Увлекательное местечко — Небосвод!"

#. ja: わー！　英雄さまだ！
#. de: Boah, <if $gn4>die Heldin<else>der Held</if> Ishgards!
#. fr: Ouah, <if $gn4>l'héroïne<else>le héros</if> d'Ishgard, en chair et en os<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:597:0:56"
msgid "Ooh, it's the savior of Ishgard!"
msgstr "О-о! Это же спаситель Ишгарда!"

#. ja: がんばってー！
#. de: Viel Glück!
#. fr: Ça va, c'est pas trop lourd<nbsp>?
msgctxt "FateEvent:598:0:56"
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr "Удачи!"

#. ja: 解放者殿……いいところに！<br>ドマの忍、オボロ殿のおかげで、この先に帝国軍部隊が、<br>展開していることが判明したのです。
#. de: Du kommst genau zur rechten Zeit! Meister Oboro und seine Shinobi haben eine garleische Einheit aufgespürt.
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Vous voyez cette silhouette qu'on distingue à peine là-bas<nbsp>? C'est celle d'Oboro, un shinobi de renom que Doma nous a envoyé en renfort. C'est lui qui a repéré les nouvelles armes magitek qui nous entourent.
#. column 57: What's more, it appears that this unit includes a new kind of magitek weapon. If we were to neutralize them now, we could obtain their components and study their weakness.
#. column 58: Won't you help us to gather these components?
#. column 59: Help to gather magitek components?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What pieces you find, I will take off your hands.
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but we'll take care of it one way or another.
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "FateEvent:600:0:56"
msgid "Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, you've come at a good time! Master Oboro and his shinobi have sighted an imperial unit nearby!"
msgstr "Клинок <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, как хорошо, что вы пришли! Мастер Оборо и его синоби заметили неподалёку имперский отряд!"

#. ja: しかも、新型の魔導兵器を配備しているようでしてね。<br>今のうちに奴らを倒し、その部品を入手して調査すれば、<br>その弱点などを解析できるやもしれません。
#. de: Die Einheit verfügt über eine neuartige Magitek-Waffe. Wenn wir den Feind stellen, können wir vielleicht Bauteile der Magitek-Waffe erbeuten und etwas über ihre Schwächen herausfinden.
#. fr: Nous sommes intéressés par leurs composants, qui eux aussi doivent être plus avancés que ceux des précédents modèles. En les analysant, nous pourrions sûrement déceler leur point faible.
#. column 56: Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, you've come at a good time! Master Oboro and his shinobi have sighted an imperial unit nearby!
#. column 58: Won't you help us to gather these components?
#. column 59: Help to gather magitek components?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What pieces you find, I will take off your hands.
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but we'll take care of it one way or another.
msgctxt "FateEvent:600:0:57"
msgid "What's more, it appears that this unit includes a new kind of magitek weapon. If we were to neutralize them now, we could obtain their components and study their weakness."
msgstr "Похоже, у них есть новый вид магитека. Если уничтожить их сейчас, мы сможем добыть детали и изучить слабые места оружия."

#. ja: 今後の戦局を有利に運ぶためにも、オボロ殿らと共に、<br>「新型の魔導部品」を集めて頂けないでしょうか？
#. de: Wirst du uns helfen, Teile der Magitek-Waffe einzusammeln?
#. fr: Nous pourrions dès lors prendre l'ascendant sur ces machines. Qu'en dites-vous<nbsp>? Voulez-vous bien nous aider à récupérer quelques-unes de ces pièces<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, you've come at a good time! Master Oboro and his shinobi have sighted an imperial unit nearby!
#. column 57: What's more, it appears that this unit includes a new kind of magitek weapon. If we were to neutralize them now, we could obtain their components and study their weakness.
#. column 59: Help to gather magitek components?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What pieces you find, I will take off your hands.
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but we'll take care of it one way or another.
msgctxt "FateEvent:600:0:58"
msgid "Won't you help us to gather these components?"
msgstr "Поможете нам собрать эти детали?"

#. ja: 部品回収に協力しますか？
#. de: Hilfst du, die Magitek-Bauteile zu sammeln?
#. fr: Aider l'officier à récupérer des composants magitek de nouvelle génération<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, you've come at a good time! Master Oboro and his shinobi have sighted an imperial unit nearby!
#. column 57: What's more, it appears that this unit includes a new kind of magitek weapon. If we were to neutralize them now, we could obtain their components and study their weakness.
#. column 58: Won't you help us to gather these components?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What pieces you find, I will take off your hands.
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but we'll take care of it one way or another.
msgctxt "FateEvent:600:0:59"
msgid "Help to gather magitek components?"
msgstr "Помочь собрать детали магитека?"

#. ja: ご協力に感謝いたします！<br>「新型の魔導部品」を入手したら、私にお渡しください！
#. de: Danke! Bring alle Bauteile zu mir!
#. fr: Excellent<nbsp>! Apportez-moi tout ce que vous trouverez<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, you've come at a good time! Master Oboro and his shinobi have sighted an imperial unit nearby!
#. column 57: What's more, it appears that this unit includes a new kind of magitek weapon. If we were to neutralize them now, we could obtain their components and study their weakness.
#. column 58: Won't you help us to gather these components?
#. column 59: Help to gather magitek components?
#. column 62: I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but we'll take care of it one way or another.
msgctxt "FateEvent:600:0:60"
msgid "We're in your debt! What pieces you find, I will take off your hands."
msgstr "Мы у вас в долгу! Всё, что найдёте, приносите мне."

#. ja: ぬ、ぬう……仕方ありません。<br>では、ここは我らにお任せください……！
#. de: Du bist beschäftigt, ich verstehe das. Wir werden tun, was wir können.
#. fr: Non<nbsp>!? Je comprends... <if $gn4>Une femme<else>Un homme</if> de votre talent a pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment d'autres chats à fouetter. Nous nous en sortirons seuls, ne vous en faites pas<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Blade <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, you've come at a good time! Master Oboro and his shinobi have sighted an imperial unit nearby!
#. column 57: What's more, it appears that this unit includes a new kind of magitek weapon. If we were to neutralize them now, we could obtain their components and study their weakness.
#. column 58: Won't you help us to gather these components?
#. column 59: Help to gather magitek components?
#. column 60: We're in your debt! What pieces you find, I will take off your hands.
msgctxt "FateEvent:600:0:62"
msgid "I see... We would've been much bolstered for your presence, but we'll take care of it one way or another."
msgstr "Понимаю... С вашей помощью нам было бы куда легче, но мы как-нибудь справимся."

#. ja: むっ……「新型の魔導部品」は、集まっていないようですね。<br>敵魔導兵器を破壊し、入手を試みてください！
#. de: Kommst du voran? Wenn du keine Bauteile findest, zerstöre ein paar der Magitek-Waffen.
#. fr: Vous n'avez aucun composant sur vous<nbsp>!? N'oubliez pas de les ramasser. Il y en a qui traîne un peu partout, mais vous pouvez aussi mettre en pièce les armes magitek que vous croisez pour en obtenir.
msgctxt "FateEvent:601:0:56"
msgid "How goes the collecting? You may have to destroy some weapons in order to obtain the components."
msgstr "Как продвигаются поиски? Возможно, чтобы добыть детали, придётся уничтожить несколько боевых машин."

#. ja: 解放者殿……ご無事で！<br>もしや、「新型の魔導部品」を手に入れたので？
#. de: Und? Hast du Magitek-Bauteile gefunden?
#. fr: Beau travail<nbsp>! Faites-moi voir combien vous en avez récupéré.
#. column 60: Ah yes, this is precisely what we're looking for! You have my thanks!
#. column 61: Please keep the components coming─our engineers need more in order to do their work.
msgctxt "FateEvent:602:0:56"
msgid "There you are! Do you have some components for me?"
msgstr "Вот вы где! Нашли для меня детали?"

#. ja: さすがは解放者殿！<br>実に見事な働きぶり、感服いたします！
#. de: Ja, das wird uns weiterhelfen! Vielen Dank.
#. fr: Parfait, nos ingénieurs seront ravis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There you are! Do you have some components for me?
#. column 61: Please keep the components coming─our engineers need more in order to do their work.
msgctxt "FateEvent:602:0:60"
msgid "Ah yes, this is precisely what we're looking for! You have my thanks!"
msgstr "Да, именно это нам и нужно! Спасибо вам!"

#. ja: しかし、未だに調査対象は不足しております！<br>「新型の魔導部品」を、また見つけた場合は私の下へ！
#. de: Bring mir weiter alle Bauteile, die du findest. Unsere Techniker interessieren sich brennend dafür.
#. fr: Plus nous en aurons, mieux ce sera, continuez donc de m'en rapporter, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There you are! Do you have some components for me?
#. column 60: Ah yes, this is precisely what we're looking for! You have my thanks!
msgctxt "FateEvent:602:0:61"
msgid "Please keep the components coming─our engineers need more in order to do their work."
msgstr "Продолжайте приносить детали. Они нужны нашим инженерам для работы."

#. ja: むっ……「新型の魔導部品」は、集まっていないようですね。<br>既に多くの部品が集まっていますが、調査対象は多いほど良い。<br>「新型の魔導部品」を、また見つけた場合は私の下へ！
#. de: Wir haben schon viele Bauteile gesammelt, aber je mehr, desto besser. Ich nehme alle, die du findest.
#. fr: Vous n'avez aucun composant pour moi<nbsp>? Ce n'est pas grave, nous avons déjà ce qu'il nous faut. Toutefois, plus nous en aurons, plus nous en apprendrons sur le fonc<shy>tion<shy>ne<shy>ment de ces nouvelles armes magitek. Récupérez donc plus de leurs composants si vous pouvez, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:603:0:56"
msgid "We've amassed a good many components, but we can never have too many. Please bring me more if you can."
msgstr "Мы уже собрали немало деталей, но лишними они не будут. Если найдёте ещё, приносите мне."

#. ja: 解放者殿……ご無事で！<br>もしや、「新型の魔導部品」を手に入れたので？
#. de: Und? Hast du Magitek-Bauteile gefunden?
#. fr: Beau travail<nbsp>! Faites-moi voir combien vous en avez récupéré.
#. column 60: Excellent! With this many components, I believe we can declare our mission a success!
#. column 61: That being said, our engineers wouldn't object to having more pieces to study. That's to say, keep it coming!
msgctxt "FateEvent:604:0:56"
msgid "There you are! Do you have some components for me?"
msgstr "Вот вы где! Нашли для меня детали?"

#. ja: さすがは解放者殿！<br>実に見事な働きぶり、感服いたします！
#. de: Ausgezeichnet. Diese Mission ist ein wahrer Erfolg!
#. fr: Bravo<nbsp>! Je n'en attendais pas tant<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There you are! Do you have some components for me?
#. column 61: That being said, our engineers wouldn't object to having more pieces to study. That's to say, keep it coming!
msgctxt "FateEvent:604:0:60"
msgid "Excellent! With this many components, I believe we can declare our mission a success!"
msgstr "Прекрасно! С таким количеством деталей можно считать задание выполненным!"

#. ja: しかし、調査対象は多ければ多いほど良いもの！<br>「新型の魔導部品」を、また見つけた場合は私の元へ！
#. de: Aber bring mir weiter alle Bauteile, die du findest. Unsere Techniker interessieren sich brennend dafür.
#. fr: Nous avons ce qu'il nous faut, je pense. Mais plus nous en aurons, mieux ce sera. Continuez donc de m'en rapporter, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There you are! Do you have some components for me?
#. column 60: Excellent! With this many components, I believe we can declare our mission a success!
msgctxt "FateEvent:604:0:61"
msgid "That being said, our engineers wouldn't object to having more pieces to study. That's to say, keep it coming!"
msgstr "Но чем больше деталей, тем лучше. Если найдёте ещё, приносите мне!"

#. ja: こ、困ったことになりました……。<br>ソクレス園長に届けなくちゃならない大切な観察記録を、<br>いたずら者のオピオタウロスに奪われてしまったんです。
#. de: Oje! Ein paar Ophiotauren haben mir meine Notizbücher gestohlen! Darin befinden sich wichtige Auf<shy>zeich<shy>nun<shy>gen über Beobachtungen, auf die Sokles schon ungeduldig wartet.
#. fr: J'ai eu le malheur de faire tomber des feuilles d'observation que Soclès m'a réclamées, et ces coquins d'ophiotauros me les ont volées.
#. column 57: I do not know to whom you belong, familiar, but I beg you: return to me my lost documentation! Slay the ophiotauroi to get them back, if you must─I do not care.
#. column 58: Help retrieve the stolen documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, thank you! I'm not much for swords and sorcery, I confess, so if you hadn't come along... Well, anyway, find the reports and bring them to me.
#. column 62: Oh, yes, of course. Forgive me, I should have known better than to ask. I will manage on my own...somehow.
msgctxt "FateEvent:605:0:56"
msgid "Oh, this is terrible. Just terrible! Some observation reports meant for Overseer Sokles were ripped straight out of my hands by some naughty little ophiotauroi!"
msgstr "Ужас! Просто ужас! Какие-то проказливые опиотавры вырвали у меня из рук отчёты для смотрителя Соклеса!"

#. ja: 使い魔さん、どなたが主かは存じませんが……<br>「奪われた観察記録」を取り戻してはくれませんか？<br>オピオタウロスを倒したり、拾い集めたりしてほしいんです！
#. de: Bitte, Familiar. Ich habe niemanden, der mir helfen kann. Kannst du nicht meine Notizbücher zurückholen? Aber nimm dich vor den Ophiotauren in Acht.
#. fr: Pourrais-tu me les récupérer en abattant ces chenapans et en ramassant celles qui sont encore au sol près d'eux<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Oh, this is terrible. Just terrible! Some observation reports meant for Overseer Sokles were ripped straight out of my hands by some naughty little ophiotauroi!
#. column 58: Help retrieve the stolen documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, thank you! I'm not much for swords and sorcery, I confess, so if you hadn't come along... Well, anyway, find the reports and bring them to me.
#. column 62: Oh, yes, of course. Forgive me, I should have known better than to ask. I will manage on my own...somehow.
msgctxt "FateEvent:605:0:57"
msgid "I do not know to whom you belong, familiar, but I beg you: return to me my lost documentation! Slay the ophiotauroi to get them back, if you must─I do not care."
msgstr "Не знаю, кому вы служите, фамильяр, но умоляю: верните мне потерянные отчёты! Убейте опиотавров, если понадобится, — мне всё равно, только найдите бумаги!"

#. ja: 観察記録の回収に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Holst du die Notizbücher zurück?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'observateur à récupérer ses feuilles<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, this is terrible. Just terrible! Some observation reports meant for Overseer Sokles were ripped straight out of my hands by some naughty little ophiotauroi!
#. column 57: I do not know to whom you belong, familiar, but I beg you: return to me my lost documentation! Slay the ophiotauroi to get them back, if you must─I do not care.
#. column 60: Oh, thank you! I'm not much for swords and sorcery, I confess, so if you hadn't come along... Well, anyway, find the reports and bring them to me.
#. column 62: Oh, yes, of course. Forgive me, I should have known better than to ask. I will manage on my own...somehow.
