msgctxt "FateEvent:605:0:58"
msgid "Help retrieve the stolen documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь вернуть украденные документы?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>戦いが不得手な私は、ここで待機しておりますので、<br>「奪われた観察記録」を回収できたら持ってきてください！
#. de: Danke! Ich bin nicht gut im Kämpfen. Aber du, du schaffst es bestimmt, meine geraubten Notizbücher zurückzuholen!
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Ces ophiotauros ne feraient qu'une bouchée de moi, alors je préfère rester ici. Rapporte-moi autant de feuilles que possible, s'il te plaît.
#. column 56: Oh, this is terrible. Just terrible! Some observation reports meant for Overseer Sokles were ripped straight out of my hands by some naughty little ophiotauroi!
#. column 57: I do not know to whom you belong, familiar, but I beg you: return to me my lost documentation! Slay the ophiotauroi to get them back, if you must─I do not care.
#. column 58: Help retrieve the stolen documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, yes, of course. Forgive me, I should have known better than to ask. I will manage on my own...somehow.
msgctxt "FateEvent:605:0:60"
msgid "Oh, thank you! I'm not much for swords and sorcery, I confess, so if you hadn't come along... Well, anyway, find the reports and bring them to me."
msgstr "О, спасибо! Признаюсь, я не силён в сражениях, так что без вас... Ладно, найдите отчёты и принесите мне."

#. ja: そ、そうですか……わかりました。<br>自分が撒いた種ですから、自分でどうにかしてみます……。
#. de: Hm, verstehe. D-Dann muss ich wohl selber ...
#. fr: Ah... Bon, eh bien... C'est ma res<shy>pon<shy>sa<shy>bi<shy>li<shy>té, alors je vais essayer de me débrouiller tout seul...
#. column 56: Oh, this is terrible. Just terrible! Some observation reports meant for Overseer Sokles were ripped straight out of my hands by some naughty little ophiotauroi!
#. column 57: I do not know to whom you belong, familiar, but I beg you: return to me my lost documentation! Slay the ophiotauroi to get them back, if you must─I do not care.
#. column 58: Help retrieve the stolen documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, thank you! I'm not much for swords and sorcery, I confess, so if you hadn't come along... Well, anyway, find the reports and bring them to me.
msgctxt "FateEvent:605:0:62"
msgid "Oh, yes, of course. Forgive me, I should have known better than to ask. I will manage on my own...somehow."
msgstr "А, ну что ж... Простите, не следовало просить вас о помощи. Попробую справиться сам... как-нибудь."

#. ja: 大切な観察記録を、奪われてしまうだなんて……。
#. de: Man hat mir meine Notizbücher geraubt ... Sie sind voller wichtiger Auf<shy>zeich<shy>nun<shy>gen über meine Beobachtungen.
#. fr: J'aurais dû faire plus attention. Quel maladroit...
msgctxt "FateEvent:606:0:56"
msgid "How could I have lost such important documents? Curse those ophiotauroi!"
msgstr "Как я мог потерять такие важные документы? Проклятые опиотавры!"

#. ja: さっそく取り戻してきてくれたんですね？<br>さあ、「奪われた観察記録」を渡してください……！
#. de: Da bist du ja wieder! Hast du meine Notizbücher gefunden?
#. fr: Tu as récupéré des feuilles<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Thank you, familiar. Your efforts will not be soon forgotten.
#. column 61: Alas, a number of documents still elude me. If you happen upon any of my wayward papers, I beg you return them to me as soon as you are able.
#. column 62: You wish to keep the documents? Oh dear, this is highly irregular. However will I explain myself to Overseer Sokles?
msgctxt "FateEvent:607:0:56"
msgid "You've returned─so soon? Oh, and with my documents in hand! Quickly now, give them here."
msgstr "Вы уже вернулись? Да ещё и с моими документами! Скорее, отдайте их мне."

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>感謝しますよ、使い魔さん……！
#. de: Danke, Familiar! Ich bin gerettet!
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You've returned─so soon? Oh, and with my documents in hand! Quickly now, give them here.
#. column 61: Alas, a number of documents still elude me. If you happen upon any of my wayward papers, I beg you return them to me as soon as you are able.
#. column 62: You wish to keep the documents? Oh dear, this is highly irregular. However will I explain myself to Overseer Sokles?
msgctxt "FateEvent:607:0:60"
msgid "Thank you, familiar. Your efforts will not be soon forgotten."
msgstr "Спасибо, фамильяр. Я не забуду, что вы для меня сделали."

#. ja: ですが、まだ数が足りないようです。<br>引き続き「奪われた観察記録」の回収に、<br>ご協力いただけると助かります！
#. de: Aber das sind noch nicht alle. Bitte bring mir alle, die du finden kannst!
#. fr: Il en manque encore. Continue de les récupérer et apporte-les-moi, s'il te plaît.
#. column 56: You've returned─so soon? Oh, and with my documents in hand! Quickly now, give them here.
#. column 60: Thank you, familiar. Your efforts will not be soon forgotten.
#. column 62: You wish to keep the documents? Oh dear, this is highly irregular. However will I explain myself to Overseer Sokles?
msgctxt "FateEvent:607:0:61"
msgid "Alas, a number of documents still elude me. If you happen upon any of my wayward papers, I beg you return them to me as soon as you are able."
msgstr "Но это ещё не все документы. Если найдёте остальные бумаги, пожалуйста, принесите их мне."

#. ja: えっ、それを持ち帰ってどうしようというんですか？<br>使い魔さんにまで、観察記録を取られたとしたら、<br>どうやってソクレス園長に弁明すれば……。
#. de: Was willst du denn mit meinen Aufzeichungen? Sie haben doch keinen Nutzen für dich. Oje, Sokles wird mir nie verzeihen<nbsp>...
#. fr: Ça ne te servirait à rien de les garder, tu sais. Si même les familiers me volent mes affaires, maintenant...
#. column 56: You've returned─so soon? Oh, and with my documents in hand! Quickly now, give them here.
#. column 60: Thank you, familiar. Your efforts will not be soon forgotten.
#. column 61: Alas, a number of documents still elude me. If you happen upon any of my wayward papers, I beg you return them to me as soon as you are able.
msgctxt "FateEvent:607:0:62"
msgid "You wish to keep the documents? Oh dear, this is highly irregular. However will I explain myself to Overseer Sokles?"
msgstr "Вы хотите оставить документы себе? Но... это же совершенно неправильно. Как я теперь объясню всё смотрителю Соклесу?"

#. ja: もしや、君はアゼム様の使い魔か！？<br>それなら手を貸してくれないか？
#. de: Sag mal, bist du Azems Familiar? Könntest du mir vielleicht bei einer Sache helfen?
#. fr: Serais-tu le familier d'Azem<nbsp>!? J'ai besoin d'aide<nbsp>!
#. column 57: I am tasked with the observation of a new breed of monoceros, though unfortunately some voracious harpuiai assail them nigh constantly. Might you deal with those nasty fellows?
#. column 58: Deal with those nasty harpuiai?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Thank you! To be frank, I thought you might agree─you are Azem's familiar, after all.
#. column 62: Oh, of course. As Azem's familiar, I'm sure you've more important matters to be attending to. Still, it would be good to find someone who might help...
msgctxt "FateEvent:608:0:56"
msgid "Why, you're Azem's familiar, are you not? Then perhaps you might help me."
msgstr "Погодите, вы ведь фамильяр Азема? Может, поможете мне?"

#. ja: 私が観察を担当している新種のモノセロスが、<br>貪欲なハルピュイアたちに狙われているようなんだ。<br>撃退してもらえないだろうか。
#. de: Ich soll neu geschaffene Monozerosse beobachten, aber ein paar Harpurien haben es auf sie abgesehen. Kannst du die hungrigen Biester verscheuchen?
#. fr: Des harpyia affamées attaquent les monocéros expérimentaux dont j'ai la charge. Pourrais-tu les éliminer<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Why, you're Azem's familiar, are you not? Then perhaps you might help me.
#. column 58: Deal with those nasty harpuiai?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Thank you! To be frank, I thought you might agree─you are Azem's familiar, after all.
#. column 62: Oh, of course. As Azem's familiar, I'm sure you've more important matters to be attending to. Still, it would be good to find someone who might help...
msgctxt "FateEvent:608:0:57"
msgid "I am tasked with the observation of a new breed of monoceros, though unfortunately some voracious harpuiai assail them nigh constantly. Might you deal with those nasty fellows?"
msgstr "Я наблюдаю за новой породой моноцеросов, но на них без конца нападают прожорливые гарпуйи. Не могли бы вы прогнать этих мерзавцев?"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Wirst du die hungrigen Harpurien beseitigen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider l'observateur des monocéros<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Why, you're Azem's familiar, are you not? Then perhaps you might help me.
#. column 57: I am tasked with the observation of a new breed of monoceros, though unfortunately some voracious harpuiai assail them nigh constantly. Might you deal with those nasty fellows?
#. column 60: You will? Thank you! To be frank, I thought you might agree─you are Azem's familiar, after all.
#. column 62: Oh, of course. As Azem's familiar, I'm sure you've more important matters to be attending to. Still, it would be good to find someone who might help...
