msgctxt "FateEvent:608:0:58"
msgid "Deal with those nasty harpuiai?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Разобраться с этими гарпуйями?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: あ、ありがとう……！<br>さすがはアゼム様の使い魔だ！<br>ハルピュイアは獰猛だから、くれぐれも気をつけて！
#. de: Danke! Auf ein Familiar von Azem ist natürlich Verlass. Aber nimm dich in Acht, die Harpurien sind gefährlich, besonders wenn sie Hunger haben.
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Fais attention, ces harpyia sont féroces<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Why, you're Azem's familiar, are you not? Then perhaps you might help me.
#. column 57: I am tasked with the observation of a new breed of monoceros, though unfortunately some voracious harpuiai assail them nigh constantly. Might you deal with those nasty fellows?
#. column 58: Deal with those nasty harpuiai?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, of course. As Azem's familiar, I'm sure you've more important matters to be attending to. Still, it would be good to find someone who might help...
msgctxt "FateEvent:608:0:60"
msgid "You will? Thank you! To be frank, I thought you might agree─you are Azem's familiar, after all."
msgstr "Правда поможете? Спасибо! Честно говоря, я так и думал — вы ведь фамильяр Азема."

#. ja: くっ……やはり主であるアゼム様でなければ、<br>使い魔の君には、頼み事はできないのかい？<br>これは困ったぞ……。
#. de: Ach ... Vielleicht bist du ja gar nicht Azems Familiar? Tja, was mach ich denn jetzt ...
#. fr: J'imagine que tu n'acceptes des requêtes que d'Azem en personne... Qu'est-ce que je vais faire...<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Why, you're Azem's familiar, are you not? Then perhaps you might help me.
#. column 57: I am tasked with the observation of a new breed of monoceros, though unfortunately some voracious harpuiai assail them nigh constantly. Might you deal with those nasty fellows?
#. column 58: Deal with those nasty harpuiai?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Thank you! To be frank, I thought you might agree─you are Azem's familiar, after all.
msgctxt "FateEvent:608:0:62"
msgid "Oh, of course. As Azem's familiar, I'm sure you've more important matters to be attending to. Still, it would be good to find someone who might help... "
msgstr "А, ну конечно. У фамильяра Азема наверняка найдутся дела поважнее. Но всё же хорошо бы найти кого-нибудь, кто поможет..."

#. ja: 異国の民らしいが、力を貸してくれないか？<br>俺たちの避難先の動力源が壊れてしまってな……。<br>修理用の部品が必要なんだ。
#. de: <if $gn4>Fremde<else>Fremder</if>, kannst du mal mit anpacken? Unsere Energiequelle ist ausgefallen. Um die Maschine zu reparieren, brauchen wir ein neues Bauteil.
#. fr: Dites, vous qui ne semblez pas du coin, vous voudriez bien nous donner un coup de main<nbsp>? Le moteur qui alimente ce lieu en énergie est endommagé et nous avons besoin de pièces pour le réparer.
#. column 57: I've spotted a few items of note in this vicinity, though it's rather difficult to get any closer with all the automated weaponry blocking my path. If you're able to forcibly deactivate the machina, we can retrieve useful parts from the wreckage!
#. column 58: Help find ceruleum engine parts?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: How very kind! Now, in terms of how we'll actually go about this enterprise, perhaps it's best if I stay out of your way, and focus my efforts on sorting through the various pieces you bring me. I shall await your gleanings with bated breath!
#. column 62: Ah...well, that's to be expected, I suppose. Only the bravest and most proficient of warriors would dare face such an intimidating foe. I'll stay here and observe the situation for a little longer, should you suddenly pluck up the courage.
msgctxt "FateEvent:609:0:56"
msgid "Excuse me, stranger, could you lend a hand? I'm attempting to repair the magitek that supplies power to our...ah, domicile, but lack the necessary parts. I was hoping you'd help me salvage them, if at all possible."
msgstr "Простите, чужеземец, не поможете? Я пытаюсь починить магитек, который снабжает энергией наше... кхм, жилище, но нужных деталей не хватает. Не могли бы вы помочь их добыть?"

#. ja: 戦闘があったのか、この辺りには部品が散らばっているんだが、<br>無人型の魔導兵器が徘徊していて、俺では回収できん。<br>頼む……部品集めを手伝ってくれ！
#. de: Auf den Schlachtfeldern sollten die richtigen Teile zu finden sein, aber da draußen schwirren noch so viele Kampf<shy>maschinen herum, dass es für uns einfach zu gefährlich ist, sie einzusammeln. Bitte übernimm du das für uns!
#. fr: On en trouve éparpillées un peu partout dans les parages... J'aimerais bien aller en récupérer moi-même, mais avec toutes ces armes sans pilotes qui pa<shy>trouil<shy>lent, je m'en sens pas capable. Vous voudriez pas vous en charger à ma place<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Excuse me, stranger, could you lend a hand? I'm attempting to repair the magitek that supplies power to our...ah, domicile, but lack the necessary parts. I was hoping you'd help me salvage them, if at all possible.
#. column 58: Help find ceruleum engine parts?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: How very kind! Now, in terms of how we'll actually go about this enterprise, perhaps it's best if I stay out of your way, and focus my efforts on sorting through the various pieces you bring me. I shall await your gleanings with bated breath!
#. column 62: Ah...well, that's to be expected, I suppose. Only the bravest and most proficient of warriors would dare face such an intimidating foe. I'll stay here and observe the situation for a little longer, should you suddenly pluck up the courage.
msgctxt "FateEvent:609:0:57"
msgid "I've spotted a few items of note in this vicinity, though it's rather difficult to get any closer with all the automated weaponry blocking my path. If you're able to forcibly deactivate the machina, we can retrieve useful parts from the wreckage!"
msgstr "Я приметил неподалёку несколько подходящих деталей, но к ним не подобраться: дорогу преграждают автоматические орудия. Если вы выведете магитек из строя, мы сможем забрать полезные детали из обломков!"

#. ja: 「青燐機関の部品」を回収する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Erdseim-Maschinenbauteile einsammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aller récupérer les pièces de moteur à céruleum<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Excuse me, stranger, could you lend a hand? I'm attempting to repair the magitek that supplies power to our...ah, domicile, but lack the necessary parts. I was hoping you'd help me salvage them, if at all possible.
#. column 57: I've spotted a few items of note in this vicinity, though it's rather difficult to get any closer with all the automated weaponry blocking my path. If you're able to forcibly deactivate the machina, we can retrieve useful parts from the wreckage!
#. column 60: How very kind! Now, in terms of how we'll actually go about this enterprise, perhaps it's best if I stay out of your way, and focus my efforts on sorting through the various pieces you bring me. I shall await your gleanings with bated breath!
#. column 62: Ah...well, that's to be expected, I suppose. Only the bravest and most proficient of warriors would dare face such an intimidating foe. I'll stay here and observe the situation for a little longer, should you suddenly pluck up the courage.
