msgctxt "FateEvent:609:0:58"
msgid "Help find ceruleum engine parts?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь найти детали двигателя на синем топливе?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 協力してくれるのか、ありがとう……！<br>必要な「青燐機関の部品」は、辺りに散らばっている。<br>徘徊している魔導兵器を破壊しても、手に入るだろう。
#. de: Danke! Du findest die Erdseim-Bauteile hier in der Gegend. Du kannst aber auch Magitek-Maschinen zerlegen, wenn dir das mehr Spaß macht.
#. fr: Vous voulez bien m'aider<nbsp>? Alors là, vous me sauvez<nbsp>! Vous trouverez facilement ces pièces de moteur à céruleum dans les environs<nbsp>; elles jonchent le sol des rues environnantes. Autre possibilité<nbsp>: les récupérer sur les carcasses des armes que vous aurez détruites<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Excuse me, stranger, could you lend a hand? I'm attempting to repair the magitek that supplies power to our...ah, domicile, but lack the necessary parts. I was hoping you'd help me salvage them, if at all possible.
#. column 57: I've spotted a few items of note in this vicinity, though it's rather difficult to get any closer with all the automated weaponry blocking my path. If you're able to forcibly deactivate the machina, we can retrieve useful parts from the wreckage!
#. column 58: Help find ceruleum engine parts?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Ah...well, that's to be expected, I suppose. Only the bravest and most proficient of warriors would dare face such an intimidating foe. I'll stay here and observe the situation for a little longer, should you suddenly pluck up the courage.
msgctxt "FateEvent:609:0:60"
msgid "How very kind! Now, in terms of how we'll actually go about this enterprise, perhaps it's best if I stay out of your way, and focus my efforts on sorting through the various pieces you bring me. I shall await your gleanings with bated breath!"
msgstr "Как мило с вашей стороны! Думаю, лучше я не буду мешаться и займусь разбором деталей, которые вы принесёте. Буду с нетерпением ждать вашей добычи!"

#. ja: あの魔導兵器を見れば、<br>誰だって恐怖を感じて、尻込みしちまうよな……。<br>話を聞いてくれて、ありがとうよ。
#. de: Das verstehe ich. Die Kampf<shy>maschinen sind wirklich furcht<shy>ein<shy>flö<shy>ßend. Dann warte ich auf jemand anders. Leb wohl!
#. fr: Oh, je m'y attendais... Il faut vraiment faire partie de la race des guerriers sans peur pour ne pas reculer à la vue de ces maudites machines... et encore<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Excuse me, stranger, could you lend a hand? I'm attempting to repair the magitek that supplies power to our...ah, domicile, but lack the necessary parts. I was hoping you'd help me salvage them, if at all possible.
#. column 57: I've spotted a few items of note in this vicinity, though it's rather difficult to get any closer with all the automated weaponry blocking my path. If you're able to forcibly deactivate the machina, we can retrieve useful parts from the wreckage!
#. column 58: Help find ceruleum engine parts?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: How very kind! Now, in terms of how we'll actually go about this enterprise, perhaps it's best if I stay out of your way, and focus my efforts on sorting through the various pieces you bring me. I shall await your gleanings with bated breath!
msgctxt "FateEvent:609:0:62"
msgid "Ah...well, that's to be expected, I suppose. Only the bravest and most proficient of warriors would dare face such an intimidating foe. I'll stay here and observe the situation for a little longer, should you suddenly pluck up the courage."
msgstr "А... ну, чего ещё ждать. Только самые смелые и умелые воины осмелятся сразиться с таким грозным врагом. Я пока останусь здесь и понаблюдаю. Вдруг вы всё-таки наберётесь храбрости."

#. ja: 避難先の動力源を修理するには、<br>「青燐機関の部品」が、かなりの数必要なんだ……。<br>部品集めを手伝ってもらえると、ありがたい。
#. de: Wir brauchen ziemlich viele Erdseim-Maschinenbauteile, um die Energiequelle zu reparieren. Es wäre gut, wenn du uns etwas helfen könntest.
#. fr: Il va nous falloir un paquet de pièces pour réparer le moteur qui alimente ce lieu en énergie. Ca m'aiderait beaucoup que vous m'en rapportiez... Mais prenez garde aux armes magitek qui rôdent<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:610:0:56"
msgid "If you see an opening to grab the parts lying on the ground, I suggest you seize the opportunity. Otherwise, it might be wise to give the machina a good bash first to give yourself a bit of room to breathe."
msgstr "Если увидите возможность схватить детали с земли, не упускайте её. А если нет, сначала хорошенько врежьте магитеку — так у вас появится передышка."

#. ja: その手に持っているものは……！<br>「青燐機関の部品」を集めてきてくれたんだな！？
#. de: Das ... Das ist doch ein Erdseim-Maschinenbauteil in deiner Hand!
#. fr: Je rêve pas, ce sont bien des pièces de moteur à céruleum que vous avez là<nbsp>!?
#. column 60: An impressive haul, and most gratefully received!
#. column 61: But even so, I require more parts if I am to have any hope of restoring our power. Could you please bring me a few more?
msgctxt "FateEvent:611:0:56"
msgid "Oh yes, that looks very promising!"
msgstr "О, да, похоже, это именно то, что нужно!"

#. ja: 俺たちが、この部品をどれだけ求めていたか……！<br>感謝するぞ、異国の友よ！
#. de: Wir haben sehnsüchtig auf so ein Maschinenbauteil gewartet. Danke, <if $gn4>Fremde<else>Fremder</if>!
#. fr: Eh ben, ça nous en fait un bon paquet<nbsp>! Merci à vous<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh yes, that looks very promising!
#. column 61: But even so, I require more parts if I am to have any hope of restoring our power. Could you please bring me a few more?
msgctxt "FateEvent:611:0:60"
msgid "An impressive haul, and most gratefully received!"
msgstr "Вот это добыча! Огромное вам спасибо!"

#. ja: だが、避難先の動力源を修理するには、<br>「青燐機関の部品」が、かなりの数必要なんだ……。<br>もしも、また見つけたら、持ってきてくれ。
#. de: Aber um unsere Energiequelle zu reparieren, brauchen wir davon noch mehr. Bitte, kannst du nicht welche für uns auftreiben?
#. fr: Vous savez, il va nous falloir davantage de pièces pour réparer le moteur. Je compte sur vous<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh yes, that looks very promising!
#. column 60: An impressive haul, and most gratefully received!
msgctxt "FateEvent:611:0:61"
msgid "But even so, I require more parts if I am to have any hope of restoring our power. Could you please bring me a few more?"
msgstr "Но и этого недостаточно: чтобы восстановить источник энергии, мне нужно ещё деталей. Не принесёшь немного, если найдёшь?"

#. ja: どうにか必要なだけ部品が集まったよ。<br>だが、予備があるなら、それにこしたことはないからな。<br>また「青燐機関の部品」を見つけたら、持ってきてくれ。
#. de: Wir haben jetzt alle Maschinenbauteile, die wir für die Reparatur brauchen. Aber besser, wir haben ein paar auf Vorrat. Du bringst uns doch noch welche, oder?
#. fr: On dirait bien qu'on a juste assez de pièces pour réparer le moteur. Mais n'hésitez pas à m'en rapporter davantage, histoire qu'on ait du stock<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:612:0:56"
msgid "Thanks to your bravery, I now have sufficient materials to repair our ceruleum generator. Nevertheless, there is no such thing as too many spare parts, and I will be happy to accept any extras you might bring my way!"
msgstr "Благодаря твоей отваге материалов для ремонта генератора теперь хватает. Но запасные детали лишними не бывают, так что буду рад всему, что принесёшь!"

#. ja: その手に持っているものは……！<br>「青燐機関の部品」を集めてきてくれたんだな！？
#. de: Das ... Das ist doch ein Erdseim-Maschinenbauteil in deiner Hand!
#. fr: Encore<nbsp>? On ne vous arrête plus<nbsp>!
#. column 60: My word, this is all I could've dreamed of, and more!
#. column 61: But why stop there? As you're having a run of good luck, let's make the most of it!
msgctxt "FateEvent:613:0:56"
msgid "Ah, my friend, with this magitek you are really spoiling me!"
msgstr "Друг мой, да ты меня балуешь такими магитековыми деталями!"

#. ja: 俺たちが、この部品をどれだけ求めていたか……！<br>感謝するぞ、異国の友よ！
#. de: Wir haben sehnsüchtig auf so ein Maschinenbauteil gewartet. Danke, <if $gn4>Fremde<else>Fremder</if>!
#. fr: Si vous saviez à quel point j'ai attendu de mettre la main sur ces pièces<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ah, my friend, with this magitek you are really spoiling me!
#. column 61: But why stop there? As you're having a run of good luck, let's make the most of it!
msgctxt "FateEvent:613:0:60"
msgid "My word, this is all I could've dreamed of, and more!"
msgstr "Вот это да! Я и мечтать о таком не смел!"

#. ja: だが、予備があるなら、それにこしたことはないからな。<br>また「青燐機関の部品」を見つけたら、持ってきてくれ。
#. de: Aber um unseren Vorrat aufzufüllen, brauchen wir davon noch mehr. Bitte, kannst du nicht welche für uns auftreiben?
#. fr: N'hésitez pas à m'en rapporter encore, plus on a de stock, mieux c'est<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ah, my friend, with this magitek you are really spoiling me!
#. column 60: My word, this is all I could've dreamed of, and more!
msgctxt "FateEvent:613:0:61"
msgid "But why stop there? As you're having a run of good luck, let's make the most of it!"
msgstr "Но почему бы не продолжить? Раз уж удача тебе улыбается, надо этим воспользоваться!"

#. ja: 小さき者よ……。<br>そなたからは強者の気配を感じる……。<br>我の友、アル・アインに誇りを取り戻させてやってはくれぬか？
#. de: Oh, du bist von kleinem Wuchs, doch ich spüre eine große Macht in dir. Willst du Ahl Ein die Gelegenheit geben, seinen vergangenen Ruhm wie<shy>der<shy>her<shy>zu<shy>stel<shy>len?
#. fr: Je ressens une puissance démesurée en toi, petit être... Pourrais-tu la mettre à profit afin de redonner un peu de fierté à un ami cher à mes yeux<nbsp>?
#. column 57: I forged many bonds on the field of battle...but none so strong as with Ahl Ein, my closest of kin.
#. column 58: He yearneth to return to those days...but neither honor nor glory is to be found in besting this old, withered soul. Wilt thou spar with him in my stead?
#. column 59: Accept the old dragon's request?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Kind art thou, little one.
#. column 62: I see... My closest of kin doth present a most formidable challenge. 'Tis no surprise thou wouldst cower before his might.
msgctxt "FateEvent:614:0:56"
msgid "Thou burnest, little one... Thou burnest with the passion of a warrior. As did I, once..."
msgstr "Ты пылаешь, малютка... Пылаешь боевым задором. Когда-то и я был таким..."

#. ja: 我とアル・アインは、<br>互いに強さを求め戦い合い、友情を深めた仲なのだが……<br>老いた我に戦う力は残されておらぬのだ……。
#. de: Ahl Ein und ich sind alte Freunde und haben oft gegeneinander gekämpft. Doch nun bin ich alt und kein würdiger Gegner mehr für ihn.
#. fr: Son nom est Ahl Ein. Lui et moi avons tissé une amitié indéfectible en nous défiant l'un l'autre au fil des époques. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, c'est précisément le temps qui m'a affaibli au point de ne plus satisfaire sa soif d'excitation.
#. column 56: Thou burnest, little one... Thou burnest with the passion of a warrior. As did I, once...
#. column 58: He yearneth to return to those days...but neither honor nor glory is to be found in besting this old, withered soul. Wilt thou spar with him in my stead?
#. column 59: Accept the old dragon's request?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Kind art thou, little one.
#. column 62: I see... My closest of kin doth present a most formidable challenge. 'Tis no surprise thou wouldst cower before his might.
msgctxt "FateEvent:614:0:57"
msgid "I forged many bonds on the field of battle...but none so strong as with Ahl Ein, my closest of kin."
msgstr "На поле боя я завёл немало друзей... Но никого не любил так, как Аль-Эйна, моего самого близкого сородича."

#. ja: ふたたび強者と全力で相まみえることができれば、<br>我が友、アル・アインの心は震え立つはず……。<br>どうか、戦ってやってくれぬだろうか？
#. de: Im Kampf gegen dich wird sein Herz Kraft schöpfen. Bist du bereit, ihm diese Ehre zu erweisen?
#. fr: Je suis certain qu'<if $gn4>une combattante<else>un combattant</if> chevronné<if $gn4>e</if> comme toi pourrait à nouveau éveiller son côté batailleur. Accepterais-tu de l'y aider<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Thou burnest, little one... Thou burnest with the passion of a warrior. As did I, once...
#. column 57: I forged many bonds on the field of battle...but none so strong as with Ahl Ein, my closest of kin.
#. column 59: Accept the old dragon's request?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Kind art thou, little one.
#. column 62: I see... My closest of kin doth present a most formidable challenge. 'Tis no surprise thou wouldst cower before his might.
msgctxt "FateEvent:614:0:58"
msgid "He yearneth to return to those days...but neither honor nor glory is to be found in besting this old, withered soul. Wilt thou spar with him in my stead?"
msgstr "Он мечтает вернуться в те дни... Но ни чести, ни славы не будет в том, чтобы одолеть старую развалину вроде меня. Сразишься с ним вместо меня?"

#. ja: 決闘を受けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du gegen Ahl Ein kämpfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Accepter de défier Ahl Ein<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Thou burnest, little one... Thou burnest with the passion of a warrior. As did I, once...
#. column 57: I forged many bonds on the field of battle...but none so strong as with Ahl Ein, my closest of kin.
#. column 58: He yearneth to return to those days...but neither honor nor glory is to be found in besting this old, withered soul. Wilt thou spar with him in my stead?
#. column 60: Kind art thou, little one.
#. column 62: I see... My closest of kin doth present a most formidable challenge. 'Tis no surprise thou wouldst cower before his might.
