msgctxt "FateEvent:614:0:59"
msgid "Accept the old dragon's request?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Принять просьбу старого дракона?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 戦ってくれるか……！<br>感謝するぞ、小さき者よ……。
#. de: Das ist mutig von dir. Viel Glück!
#. fr: Tu acceptes<nbsp>!? Je t'en remercie, petit être...
#. column 56: Thou burnest, little one... Thou burnest with the passion of a warrior. As did I, once...
#. column 57: I forged many bonds on the field of battle...but none so strong as with Ahl Ein, my closest of kin.
#. column 58: He yearneth to return to those days...but neither honor nor glory is to be found in besting this old, withered soul. Wilt thou spar with him in my stead?
#. column 59: Accept the old dragon's request?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I see... My closest of kin doth present a most formidable challenge. 'Tis no surprise thou wouldst cower before his might.
msgctxt "FateEvent:614:0:60"
msgid "Kind art thou, little one."
msgstr "Добрая душа ты, малютка."

#. ja: ふむ……我が友、アル・アインを前に恐れを抱くか。<br>それも無理からぬことよな……。
#. de: Du fürchtest dich wohl vor Ahl Ein. Ich kann es dir nicht verdenken.
#. fr: Je ne te jette pas la pierre. Tu n'es pas <if $gn4>la première<else>le premier</if> à qui mon ami inspire la peur...
#. column 56: Thou burnest, little one... Thou burnest with the passion of a warrior. As did I, once...
#. column 57: I forged many bonds on the field of battle...but none so strong as with Ahl Ein, my closest of kin.
#. column 58: He yearneth to return to those days...but neither honor nor glory is to be found in besting this old, withered soul. Wilt thou spar with him in my stead?
#. column 59: Accept the old dragon's request?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Kind art thou, little one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:614:0:62"
msgid "I see... My closest of kin doth present a most formidable challenge. 'Tis no surprise thou wouldst cower before his might."
msgstr "Понимаю... Мой родич и впрямь грозный противник. Неудивительно, что ты устрашился его силы."

#. ja: あ、あなたは誰……！？<br>いや、誰だっていいんだ、助けておくれよ……！<br>兄弟たちが、絶望した竜に追いかけられているんだ！
#. de: Wer ... bist du?! Ach, wer auch immer du bist, bitte rette meine Brüder!
#. fr: T-t'es qui, toi<nbsp>? Qu'est-ce que tu fais là<nbsp>!?<br>Oh et puis peu importe<nbsp>! Je t'en prie, aide-moi<nbsp>! Des dragons en proie au désespoir s'en prennent à mes frères et sœurs de couvée<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Our elders say that we must perish to be spared greater pain, but we shall not heedeth them! We are too young to die─and I am still learning mine words!
#. column 58: Save the dragonets?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thou art a life-savior!
#. column 62: Th-Thou wouldest leave us to die? But we are so very small...
msgctxt "FateEvent:615:0:56"
msgid "Wh-Who art thou? Nay, 'tis of no matter! Whoever thou art, I beg thee aidest my nest-brethren!"
msgstr "К-кто ты? Впрочем, неважно! Кто бы ты ни был, прошу, помоги моим братьям и сёстрам по гнезду!"

#. ja: 自分たちで竜という種を終わらせるんだって……！<br>そんなの絶対にイヤだよ、死にたくなんてないんだ！
#. de: Aus lauter Ver<shy>zweif<shy>lung wollen einige Drachen unsere ganze Art auslöschen! Das darf nicht unser Schicksal sein!
#. fr: Ils veulent mettre fin à leur douleur en annihilant le peu de dragonnets qu'il reste<nbsp>! Ils peuvent en finir si ça leur chante, mais qu'ils nous laissent tranquilles<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Wh-Who art thou? Nay, 'tis of no matter! Whoever thou art, I beg thee aidest my nest-brethren!
#. column 58: Save the dragonets?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thou art a life-savior!
#. column 62: Th-Thou wouldest leave us to die? But we are so very small...
msgctxt "FateEvent:615:0:57"
msgid "Our elders say that we must perish to be spared greater pain, but we shall not heedeth them! We are too young to die─and I am still learning mine words!"
msgstr "Старшие говорят, что мы должны погибнуть, чтобы избавить себя от ещё большей боли. Но мы их не послушаем! Мы слишком малы, чтобы умирать, да я ещё и слова не все выучил!"

#. ja: ミク・ネールを助けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du Myhk Nehr helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Myhk Nehr et sa fratrie<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Wh-Who art thou? Nay, 'tis of no matter! Whoever thou art, I beg thee aidest my nest-brethren!
#. column 57: Our elders say that we must perish to be spared greater pain, but we shall not heedeth them! We are too young to die─and I am still learning mine words!
#. column 60: Thou art a life-savior!
#. column 62: Th-Thou wouldest leave us to die? But we are so very small...
