msgctxt "FateEvent:615:0:58"
msgid "Save the dragonets?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Спасти дракончиков?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: えっ、本当かい！？<br>ありがとう、どうか兄弟たちを助けておくれ！
#. de: Wirklich? Ich danke dir! Rette meine Brüder!
#. fr: Tu vas nous aider<nbsp>!? Pour de vrai<nbsp>!? Merci<nbsp>! Je te fais confiance<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Wh-Who art thou? Nay, 'tis of no matter! Whoever thou art, I beg thee aidest my nest-brethren!
#. column 57: Our elders say that we must perish to be spared greater pain, but we shall not heedeth them! We are too young to die─and I am still learning mine words!
#. column 58: Save the dragonets?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Th-Thou wouldest leave us to die? But we are so very small...
msgctxt "FateEvent:615:0:60"
msgid "Thou art a life-savior!"
msgstr "Ты спаситель!"

#. ja: うぅ……それじゃあ、兄弟たちは死ぬしか……<br>永遠に終わらなくちゃいけないっていうのかい？
#. de: Oh, willst du meine Brüder wirklich ihrem Schickal überlassen? Das bedeutet ihren sicheren Tod.
#. fr: Mais... mes frères et sœurs... ils vont tous mourir... Pourquoi les dragons doivent être condamnés...<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Wh-Who art thou? Nay, 'tis of no matter! Whoever thou art, I beg thee aidest my nest-brethren!
#. column 57: Our elders say that we must perish to be spared greater pain, but we shall not heedeth them! We are too young to die─and I am still learning mine words!
#. column 58: Save the dragonets?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thou art a life-savior!
msgctxt "FateEvent:615:0:62"
msgid "Th-Thou wouldest leave us to die? But we are so very small..."
msgstr "Т-ты бросишь нас умирать? Но мы ведь такие маленькие..."

#. ja: 廃墟を探し回って生活物資を掻き集めたんだが、<br>食料の匂いを嗅ぎつけたヨトゥンどもが、追いかけてきてるんだ。<br>た、頼む……どうか助けてくれ！
#. de: Wir haben so viele Lebensmittel aus den Ruinen geborgen wie möglich. Aber der Geruch lockt gefährliche Jötnar an! Bitte, so hilf uns doch!
#. fr: On a beau avoir mis la main sur des fournitures nécessaires à notre survie, des jötunn n'ont pas tardé à s'approcher, attirés par l'odeur de nourriture qui s'en dégage. Maintenant, on a peur qu'ils nous prennent tout<nbsp>! Vous voulez bien nous débarrasser d'eux<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Fend off the jotnar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Exactly the response I should've expected. I was a fool to think otherwise.
msgctxt "FateEvent:616:0:56"
msgid "I and some of the other civilians have scraped together a few crates' worth of provisions, but the smell has attracted the jotnar. Please, will you help fend them off?"
msgstr "Мы с другими мирными жителями кое-как набрали несколько ящиков припасов, но запах привлёк ётунов. Прошу, поможешь нам отбиться от них?"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Schützt du die Lebensmittel vor den Jötnar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Éliminer les jötunn<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I and some of the other civilians have scraped together a few crates' worth of provisions, but the smell has attracted the jotnar. Please, will you help fend them off?
#. column 62: Exactly the response I should've expected. I was a fool to think otherwise.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
