#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:616:0:57"
msgid "Fend off the jotnar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Отогнать ётунов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そ、そうか……。<br>帝国の民がどうなろうと、君たちには関係がない話か……。<br>こうなったら、命がけで足掻いてみるだけだな。
#. de: Ach so ... Na gut, da kann man wohl nichts machen. Ist ja nicht dein Problem, wenn die Jötnar unsere Lebensmittel auffressen. Und uns gleich mit.
#. fr: Oh, je vois. Il est vrai que le sort des garlemaldais ne vous concerne pas vraiment. À nous de nous défendre, même au péril de notre vie.
#. column 56: I and some of the other civilians have scraped together a few crates' worth of provisions, but the smell has attracted the jotnar. Please, will you help fend them off?
#. column 57: Fend off the jotnar?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:616:0:62"
msgid "Exactly the response I should've expected. I was a fool to think otherwise."
msgstr "Именно такого ответа я и ждал. Зря только надеялся на другое."

#. ja: フーッ、フーッ……<br>ヌルヌルがほしい、ヌルヌルの粘液が……。
#. de: Seufz ... Wie schön der Schleim im Mondsand glänzt ... Ach, wie gern ich noch einmal darin baden würde.
#. fr: ♪ La la lala lala<nbsp>! Le gluant, c'est trop marrant<nbsp>! Le visqueux, ça me rend heureux<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Ah! You wouldn't happen to be that intrepid adventurer from Etheirys, would you? If so, I'd like to enlist your help collecting some mousse slime.
#. column 58: That slimy sensation has stuck with me ever since I first laid my paws on it... The stuff is fiercely corrosive─so much so that it'll melt my fur off if I bathe in it too long─but that risk is part of the fun!
#. column 59: Agree to get your hands sticky?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Splendid! You can acquire the slime by defeating the mousse or by scooping up the extract they leave behind─the choice is yours, adventurer!
#. column 62: B-But...how can I ever enjoy that sticky sensation from ear to paw without more of that mousse slime!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:617:0:56"
msgid "Mwahaha... I must needs make that mousse slime mine..."
msgstr "Мвахаха... Эта слизь мусов должна стать моей..."

#. ja: ハッ……アナタはもしや、<br>アーテリスから来た強いヒトでは？<br>突然ですが「ムースの粘液」集め、手伝っていただけませんか？
#. de: Sag, bist du nicht <if $gn4>eine dieser starken Kriegerinnen<else>einer dieser starken Krieger</if> von Ætheris, die es mit jedem Monster aufnehmen können? Es wäre so nett von dir, wenn du mir beim Sammeln von Mousse-Schleim helfen könntest!
#. fr: Oh<nbsp>! C'est vous l'humain<if $gn4>e</if> très costaud<if $gn4>e</if> venu<if $gn4>e</if> d'Ætherys, <if $gn4>celle<else>celui</if> dont tous les Loporrites parlent<nbsp>? Vous tombez bien<nbsp>! Vous pouvez m'aider à récolter du mucus de mousse, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Mwahaha... I must needs make that mousse slime mine...
#. column 58: That slimy sensation has stuck with me ever since I first laid my paws on it... The stuff is fiercely corrosive─so much so that it'll melt my fur off if I bathe in it too long─but that risk is part of the fun!
#. column 59: Agree to get your hands sticky?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Splendid! You can acquire the slime by defeating the mousse or by scooping up the extract they leave behind─the choice is yours, adventurer!
#. column 62: B-But...how can I ever enjoy that sticky sensation from ear to paw without more of that mousse slime!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:617:0:57"
msgid "Ah! You wouldn't happen to be that intrepid adventurer from Etheirys, would you? If so, I'd like to enlist your help collecting some mousse slime."
msgstr "Ах! Вы случайно не <if $gn4>та самая отважная искательница приключений<else>тот самый отважный искатель приключений</if> из Этерисы? Если так, не могли бы вы помочь мне собрать слизь муса?"

#. ja: あのヌルヌルした感触が忘れられなくて……<br>強酸性なので長く浸ると、毛が溶けちゃうんですけど、<br>そのスリルがまた、最高なんですよぉ～！
#. de: Dieses Prickeln auf der Haut ... dieses glitschige Glibbern hinter den Ohren! Manche sagen, ich sei verrückt, weil die Säure das Fell wegätzt, aber die haben alle das schönste Gefühl der Welt noch nicht erlebt!
#. fr: Jamais je n'oublierai le jour où je suis tombé dans une flaque de mucus de mousse... Comme j'aimerais pouvoir me baigner tous les jours dedans<nbsp>! C'est très corrosif, donc il ne faut pas rester longtemps en contact avec, au risque d'y laisser des poils... mais c'est justement ce frisson qui me rend tout chose<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Mwahaha... I must needs make that mousse slime mine...
#. column 57: Ah! You wouldn't happen to be that intrepid adventurer from Etheirys, would you? If so, I'd like to enlist your help collecting some mousse slime.
#. column 59: Agree to get your hands sticky?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Splendid! You can acquire the slime by defeating the mousse or by scooping up the extract they leave behind─the choice is yours, adventurer!
#. column 62: B-But...how can I ever enjoy that sticky sensation from ear to paw without more of that mousse slime!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:617:0:58"
msgid "That slimy sensation has stuck with me ever since I first laid my paws on it... The stuff is fiercely corrosive─so much so that it'll melt my fur off if I bathe in it too long─but that risk is part of the fun!"
msgstr "Я с тех пор не могу забыть это склизкое ощущение... Она такая едкая, что, если слишком долго в ней купаться, шерсть растворится. Но в этом-то и весь азарт!"

#. ja: 「ムースの粘液」を回収する？<br><br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du Mousse-Schleim für Thrillingway sammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Thrillingway<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Mwahaha... I must needs make that mousse slime mine...
#. column 57: Ah! You wouldn't happen to be that intrepid adventurer from Etheirys, would you? If so, I'd like to enlist your help collecting some mousse slime.
#. column 58: That slimy sensation has stuck with me ever since I first laid my paws on it... The stuff is fiercely corrosive─so much so that it'll melt my fur off if I bathe in it too long─but that risk is part of the fun!
#. column 60: Splendid! You can acquire the slime by defeating the mousse or by scooping up the extract they leave behind─the choice is yours, adventurer!
#. column 62: B-But...how can I ever enjoy that sticky sensation from ear to paw without more of that mousse slime!?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:617:0:59"
msgid "Agree to get your hands sticky?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Согласиться испачкать руки?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: や、やったー！<br>「ムースの粘液」は、ムースを倒すか、這いずった跡から、<br>回収できるので、よろしくお願いしますねぇ～！
#. de: Da-Danke! Oh, ich freu mich so! Allein kann ich mich mit den Mousses ja gar nicht anlegen! Um an den Schleim zu kommen, kannst du sie besiegen, oder einfach aufsammeln, was sie hinter sich herziehen!
#. fr: Youpiii<nbsp>! Pour obtenir du mucus de mousse, abattez des mousses acides ou ramassez le mucus qu'elles laissent traîner derrière elles. Rapportez-m'en plein, plein, plein<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Mwahaha... I must needs make that mousse slime mine...
#. column 57: Ah! You wouldn't happen to be that intrepid adventurer from Etheirys, would you? If so, I'd like to enlist your help collecting some mousse slime.
#. column 58: That slimy sensation has stuck with me ever since I first laid my paws on it... The stuff is fiercely corrosive─so much so that it'll melt my fur off if I bathe in it too long─but that risk is part of the fun!
#. column 59: Agree to get your hands sticky?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: B-But...how can I ever enjoy that sticky sensation from ear to paw without more of that mousse slime!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:617:0:60"
msgid "Splendid! You can acquire the slime by defeating the mousse or by scooping up the extract they leave behind─the choice is yours, adventurer!"
msgstr "Чудесно! Слизь можно добыть, победив муса, или собрать оставшийся после него экстракт. Выбирай сам, искатель приключений!"

#. ja: そ、そんな……！<br>じゃあ、ボクはどうやってヌルヌルに……<br>「ムースの粘液」に浸かればいいっていうんだよぉ～！
#. de: D-Du willst nicht? Dann ... muss ich mich wohl von einem Mousse absorbieren lassen. Ja, das mache ich! Ich muss dieses Prickeln einfach noch mal erleben!
#. fr: Mais pourquoi-euuuh<nbsp>? Je ne demande pas grand-chose, pourtant... juste que vous risquiez votre vie pour me rapporter une matière hautement acide qui n'est pas faite pour jouer avec<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Mwahaha... I must needs make that mousse slime mine...
#. column 57: Ah! You wouldn't happen to be that intrepid adventurer from Etheirys, would you? If so, I'd like to enlist your help collecting some mousse slime.
#. column 58: That slimy sensation has stuck with me ever since I first laid my paws on it... The stuff is fiercely corrosive─so much so that it'll melt my fur off if I bathe in it too long─but that risk is part of the fun!
#. column 59: Agree to get your hands sticky?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Splendid! You can acquire the slime by defeating the mousse or by scooping up the extract they leave behind─the choice is yours, adventurer!
msgctxt "FateEvent:617:0:62"
msgid "B-But...how can I ever enjoy that sticky sensation from ear to paw without more of that mousse slime!?"
msgstr "Н-но... как же мне насладиться этим липким ощущением с головы до лап, если у меня больше нет слизи мусов?!"

#. ja: フーッ、フーッ……<br>ヌルヌルがほしい、ヌルヌルの粘液が……。<br>目の前にあるのに……！
#. de: Seufz ... Wie schön der Schleim im Mondsand glänzt ... So nah und doch so fern ...
#. fr: ♪ La la lala lala<nbsp>! Tout ce mucus poisseux, c'est rien que pour moi<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:618:0:56"
msgid "Mwahaha... I must needs make that mousse slime mine... It's so close, yet so far!"
msgstr "Мвахаха... Эта слизь мусов должна стать моей... Она так близко, но всё же так далеко!"

#. ja: フーッ、フーッ……！<br>そ、それは「ムースの粘液」なのでは！？
#. de: J-Ja! Das ist er! Echter, duftender, flutschender Mousse-Schleim!
#. fr: Du mucus de mousse<nbsp>!? C'est pour moi, hein<nbsp>? Hein<nbsp>!? HEIN<nbsp>!?
#. column 60: Ah, this is the blissfully slimy sensation I've been dreaming of! Although I'll need more if I'm to soak my entire fluffy body in it...
#. column 61: Just a little more... A little more mousse slime is all I require! Won't you collect some for me?
msgctxt "FateEvent:619:0:56"
msgid "Mwahaha... W-Wait! Is that the mousse slime I've been after!?"
msgstr "Мвахаха... П-погоди! Это та самая слизь мусов, которую я искал?!"

#. ja: 嗚呼、夢にまで見たヌルヌルだぁ～！<br>で、でも、足の先から耳の先まで、どっぷりと浸るには、<br>まだ量が足りませんね……。
#. de: Oh, am liebsten würde ich sofort reinspringen und mich drin wälzen! Aber ... ich glaube, dafür reicht es nicht ganz ...
#. fr: Ouaaah, c'est plus que je n'en rêvais<nbsp>! Mais pas encore assez pour m'immerger depuis le bout des pattes jusqu'aux pointes des oreilles...
#. column 56: Mwahaha... W-Wait! Is that the mousse slime I've been after!?
#. column 61: Just a little more... A little more mousse slime is all I require! Won't you collect some for me?
msgctxt "FateEvent:619:0:60"
msgid "Ah, this is the blissfully slimy sensation I've been dreaming of! Although I'll need more if I'm to soak my entire fluffy body in it..."
msgstr "Ах, эта блаженная склизкость, о которой я мечтал! Но её всё ещё мало, чтобы окунуться с головы до лап..."

#. ja: あと少し……もう少しでいいんです！<br>「ムースの粘液」の回収をお願いできませんか？
#. de: Kannst du noch ein bisschen mehr sammeln? Nur noch ein klein wenig mehr, bitte!
#. fr: Il me faut encore un peu de mucus de mousse... juste encore un peu<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Mwahaha... W-Wait! Is that the mousse slime I've been after!?
#. column 60: Ah, this is the blissfully slimy sensation I've been dreaming of! Although I'll need more if I'm to soak my entire fluffy body in it...
msgctxt "FateEvent:619:0:61"
msgid "Just a little more... A little more mousse slime is all I require! Won't you collect some for me?"
msgstr "Ещё чуть-чуть... Совсем немного! Не поможешь собрать ещё слизи мусов?"

#. ja: フーッ、フーッ……<br>ヌルヌルがほしい、もっとヌルヌルの粘液が……。
#. de: ♪ Glibber auf der Nase ... Glibber auf den Pfoten ... Glibber überall! ♪
#. fr: ♪ La la lala lala<nbsp>! Le gluant, c'est trop marrant<nbsp>! Le visqueux, ça me rend heureux<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:620:0:56"
msgid "Mwahaha... I've made that mousse slime mine...but I must needs have more!"
msgstr "Мвахаха... Теперь слизь мусов моя... но мне нужно ещё!"

#. ja: フーッ、フーッ……！<br>そ、それは「ムースの粘液」なのでは！？
#. de: J-Ja! Das ist er! Echter, duftender, flutschender Mousse-Schleim!
#. fr: Du mucus de mousse<nbsp>!? C'est pour moi, hein<nbsp>? Hein<nbsp>!? HEIN<nbsp>!?
#. column 60: Ah, this is the blissfully slimy sensation I've been dreaming of! And now I have enough to soak my entire fluffy body in it!
#. column 61: Nothing compares to the excitement of hopping into a gooey bath, wondering how much fur I might lose... Why, I'm getting a tingle just thinking about it!
msgctxt "FateEvent:621:0:56"
msgid "Mwahaha... W-Wait! Is that the mousse slime I've been after!?"
msgstr "Мвахаха... П-погоди! Это та самая слизь мусов, которую я искал?!"

#. ja: 嗚呼、夢にまで見たヌルヌルだぁ～！<br>これだけの量の粘液があれば、<br>足の先から耳の先まで、どっぷりと浸れますよぉ～！
#. de: Das ist genug, um mich von oben bis unten einzureiben! Glibbriges Kribbeln bis zwischen die Zehen! Hach, mein Traum wird wahr!
#. fr: Ouaaah, c'est plus que je n'en rêvais<nbsp>! J'en ai maintenant assez pour m'immerger depuis le bout des pattes jusqu'aux pointes des oreilles<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Mwahaha... W-Wait! Is that the mousse slime I've been after!?
#. column 61: Nothing compares to the excitement of hopping into a gooey bath, wondering how much fur I might lose... Why, I'm getting a tingle just thinking about it!
msgctxt "FateEvent:621:0:60"
msgid "Ah, this is the blissfully slimy sensation I've been dreaming of! And now I have enough to soak my entire fluffy body in it!"
msgstr "Ах, эта блаженная склизкость, о которой я мечтал! Теперь слизи хватит, чтобы окунуться в неё с головы до лап!"

#. ja: この粘液、ヌルヌルした感触が最高なんです！<br>強酸性だから長く浸ると、毛が溶けちゃうんですけど、<br>そのスリルがまた、たまらないんですよぉ～！
#. de: Da können die anderen mich noch so sehr warnen, mir würde das Fell ausfallen. Die werden es nie verstehen! Es ist das schönste Prickeln der Welt!
#. fr: Je ne connais rien au monde de plus gluant, visqueux et poisseux... sans oublier corrosif<nbsp>! C'est même tout ce qui fait son sel<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Mwahaha... W-Wait! Is that the mousse slime I've been after!?
#. column 60: Ah, this is the blissfully slimy sensation I've been dreaming of! And now I have enough to soak my entire fluffy body in it!
msgctxt "FateEvent:621:0:61"
msgid "Nothing compares to the excitement of hopping into a gooey bath, wondering how much fur I might lose... Why, I'm getting a tingle just thinking about it!"
msgstr "Нет ничего лучше, чем нырнуть в вязкую жижу и гадать, сколько шерсти на этот раз останется... У меня даже сейчас всё внутри щекочет от одной мысли!"

#. ja: <if $gn4>お姉さん<else>お兄さん</if>、力を貸してくれないかな？<br>僕が卵から育てたナンカを、海に帰してやりたいんだ。<br><br>でも、海岸に向かうには、<br>怪鳥の縄張りを抜けていかなくちゃいけなくて……。<br>頼むよ、あいつらから、この子を守っておくれよ！
#. de: Hallo, <if $gn4>große Heldin<else>großer Held</if>! Kannst du uns helfen? Ich habe meinem kleinen Freund hier aus seinem Ei geholfen und will ihn nun zum Meer bringen. Aber auf dem Weg lauern diese doofen Vögel. Beschützt du uns?
#. fr: <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if>, vous pouvez me donner un coup de main<nbsp>? J'aimerais emmener le nanka que j'ai aidé à éclore jusqu'à la mer, mais il faut passer par un coin infesté d'oiseaux voraces. Protégez-le, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Lend the boy your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, thank you so much! I'd go with you, but...I'd probably just get in the way. If it's okay with you, I'll cheer you and the nanka on from here.
#. column 62: ...I understand. You're a grown-up, and grown-ups have more important things to do than help a silly little boy and his silly little nanka. It's okay. We'll manage somehow...
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:622:0:56"
msgid "Oh, hello there, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>. Do you think you can help me? The other day, I found a little nanka egg. Well, it hatched and now it's a little nanka! I want to take it to the beach so it can go live with its nanka friends, but lately these big, scary birds have made their home there. Could you please protect my little nanka from their scary beaks and claws?"
msgstr "О, здравствуй, <if $gn4>сударыня<else>сударь</if>! Не поможешь мне? Недавно я нашёл маленькое яйцо нанки. Оно вылупилось, и теперь у меня есть маленький нанка! Хочу отнести его на пляж, чтобы он жил там со своими сородичами, но в последнее время там поселились большие страшные птицы. Защитишь моего нанку от их ужасных клювов и когтей?"

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Eskortierst du den Nanka?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le jeune garçon<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, hello there, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>. Do you think you can help me? The other day, I found a little nanka egg. Well, it hatched and now it's a little nanka! I want to take it to the beach so it can go live with its nanka friends, but lately these big, scary birds have made their home there. Could you please protect my little nanka from their scary beaks and claws?
#. column 60: Oh, thank you so much! I'd go with you, but...I'd probably just get in the way. If it's okay with you, I'll cheer you and the nanka on from here.
#. column 62: ...I understand. You're a grown-up, and grown-ups have more important things to do than help a silly little boy and his silly little nanka. It's okay. We'll manage somehow...
