msgctxt "FateEvent:622:0:57"
msgid "Lend the boy your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь мальчику?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとう！<br>僕がついていくと足手まといだから……<br>ここから応援しているね。
#. de: Wirklich? Klasse! Ich halte aber besser Abstand und feuere dich aus sicherer Entfernung an!
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Je ne ferais que vous ralentir si je vous accompagnais, alors je vous encourage d'ici<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh, hello there, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>. Do you think you can help me? The other day, I found a little nanka egg. Well, it hatched and now it's a little nanka! I want to take it to the beach so it can go live with its nanka friends, but lately these big, scary birds have made their home there. Could you please protect my little nanka from their scary beaks and claws?
#. column 57: Lend the boy your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: ...I understand. You're a grown-up, and grown-ups have more important things to do than help a silly little boy and his silly little nanka. It's okay. We'll manage somehow...
msgctxt "FateEvent:622:0:60"
msgid "Oh, thank you so much! I'd go with you, but...I'd probably just get in the way. If it's okay with you, I'll cheer you and the nanka on from here."
msgstr "Ой, спасибо тебе! Я бы пошёл с тобой, но... только помешаю. Если ты не против, я поболею за тебя и нанку отсюда."

#. ja: そっか……わかったよ。<br>変なこと頼んじゃって、ごめんね……。
#. de: Du hilfst uns nicht? Ach so ... Das ist wirklich schade. Wie soll ich jetzt meinen Freund hier sicher ins Meer kriegen?
#. fr: Ah... D'accord... Désolé de vous avoir embêté<if $gn4>e</if>.
#. column 56: Oh, hello there, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>. Do you think you can help me? The other day, I found a little nanka egg. Well, it hatched and now it's a little nanka! I want to take it to the beach so it can go live with its nanka friends, but lately these big, scary birds have made their home there. Could you please protect my little nanka from their scary beaks and claws?
#. column 57: Lend the boy your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, thank you so much! I'd go with you, but...I'd probably just get in the way. If it's okay with you, I'll cheer you and the nanka on from here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:622:0:62"
msgid "...I understand. You're a grown-up, and grown-ups have more important things to do than help a silly little boy and his silly little nanka. It's okay. We'll manage somehow..."
msgstr "...Понимаю. Ты уже взрослый человек, и у тебя есть дела поважнее, чем помогать глупому мальчишке и его глупому нанке. Ничего, мы как-нибудь справимся..."

#. ja: ああ……ありがたいわ、こんなところで人に会えるなんて！<br>私、負傷した父のため、秘薬の材料を採りにきたのですが……<br>先程から、魔猿たちに後をつけられているようなのです。
#. de: Ach, welch ein Glück. Jemand, der mir helfen kann! Ich muss für die Medizin meines Vaters Heilkräuter sammeln. Aber diese freche Bande von Affen lässt mir einfach keine Ruhe!
#. fr: Oh je suis tellement contente de tomber sur quelqu'un par ici<nbsp>! J'ai besoin d'herbes médicinales pour mon père, mais une bande de singes agressifs a décidé de me prendre pour cible et je ne peux pas faire ma cueillette tran<shy>quil<shy>le<shy>ment...
#. column 57: I'm afraid of what the mischievous fiends might do to me, but I can't go home empty-handed. Could you please scare the creatures off, that I might tend to my errand in peace?
#. column 58: Lend the maiden your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you! And thank the gods for sending a kind stranger like you to my aid!
#. column 62: Oh, whatever will I do? I must have the herbs for my father, but those awful langurs... \<whimper>
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:623:0:56"
msgid "Oh, please help me, good <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>! I'm out to gather herbs to treat my wounded father, but some langurs are following me around..."
msgstr "Ой, помогите мне, добрая <if $gn4>госпожа<else>господин</if>! Я собираю травы для лечения раненого отца, но за мной увязались лангуры..."

#. ja: 安全に薬草を探せるように、<br>魔猿たちを追い払っていただけませんか？
#. de: Du siehst stark und mutig aus. Würdest du mir helfen, diese Affen zu verscheuchen, damit ich in Ruhe meine Kräuter sammeln kann?
#. fr: Voulez-vous bien m'en débarrasser<nbsp>? Je vous en serai vraiment très re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sante<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh, please help me, good <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>! I'm out to gather herbs to treat my wounded father, but some langurs are following me around...
#. column 58: Lend the maiden your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you! And thank the gods for sending a kind stranger like you to my aid!
#. column 62: Oh, whatever will I do? I must have the herbs for my father, but those awful langurs... \<whimper>
msgctxt "FateEvent:623:0:57"
msgid "I'm afraid of what the mischievous fiends might do to me, but I can't go home empty-handed. Could you please scare the creatures off, that I might tend to my errand in peace?"
msgstr "Боюсь, эти проказливые твари могут со мной что-нибудь сделать, но без трав домой возвращаться нельзя. Не прогонишь их, чтобы я спокойно закончила своё дело?"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du der jungen Dame?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la jeune femme<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, please help me, good <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>! I'm out to gather herbs to treat my wounded father, but some langurs are following me around...
#. column 57: I'm afraid of what the mischievous fiends might do to me, but I can't go home empty-handed. Could you please scare the creatures off, that I might tend to my errand in peace?
#. column 60: Thank you! And thank the gods for sending a kind stranger like you to my aid!
#. column 62: Oh, whatever will I do? I must have the herbs for my father, but those awful langurs... \<whimper>
