msgctxt "FateEvent:623:0:58"
msgid "Lend the maiden your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь девушке?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>ひとりで森に入ったことを後悔しかけていましたが、<br>あなたに出会えて幸運でした……！
#. de: Vielen Dank! Ich hatte schon bedauert, dass ich alleine in den Wald bin. Aber die Götter hatten Erbarmen und haben dich geschickt!
#. fr: Mille mercis<nbsp>! J'ai eu beaucoup de chance que vous passiez par là<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh, please help me, good <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>! I'm out to gather herbs to treat my wounded father, but some langurs are following me around...
#. column 57: I'm afraid of what the mischievous fiends might do to me, but I can't go home empty-handed. Could you please scare the creatures off, that I might tend to my errand in peace?
#. column 58: Lend the maiden your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, whatever will I do? I must have the herbs for my father, but those awful langurs... \<whimper>
msgctxt "FateEvent:623:0:60"
msgid "Thank you! And thank the gods for sending a kind stranger like you to my aid!"
msgstr "Спасибо! И богам спасибо за то, что послали мне на помощь такого доброго незнакомца!"

#. ja: いきなり言われても、そうですよね。<br>すみません、ひとりでなんとか……できるかな……。
#. de: Oh, ich verstehe ... Ich schätze, ich muss es wohl irgendwie ... alleine schaffen ...
#. fr: Oui, je comprends. Ce n'est pas grave, je vais... me débrouiller...
#. column 56: Oh, please help me, good <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>! I'm out to gather herbs to treat my wounded father, but some langurs are following me around...
#. column 57: I'm afraid of what the mischievous fiends might do to me, but I can't go home empty-handed. Could you please scare the creatures off, that I might tend to my errand in peace?
#. column 58: Lend the maiden your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you! And thank the gods for sending a kind stranger like you to my aid!
msgctxt "FateEvent:623:0:62"
msgid "Oh, whatever will I do? I must have the herbs for my father, but those awful langurs... \\<whimper>"
msgstr "Ох, что же мне делать? Мне нужны травы для отца, но эти ужасные лангуры... <i>Хнык...</i>"

#. ja: 我が心は、絶望に屈した。<br>もはや強者に挑み続けていた頃の誇りは、残されていない。
#. de: Einst kämpfte ich gegen die Stärksten, doch mein Ruhm ist längst vergangen.
#. fr: Je me rappelle cette glorieuse époque où je me mesurais aux plus forts. Ce temps est toutefois tristement révolu... Ma fierté a trop été entamée et je n'ai plus le cœur à me battre...
msgctxt "FateEvent:624:0:56"
msgid "My heart hath succumbed... The pride I once fought for shall never be mine again..."
msgstr "Моё сердце пало духом... И гордость, за которую я сражался, мне уже не вернуть..."

#. ja: アナタ、旅の人ネ……？<br>なんだかとっても強そうだけど、<br>ちょっと力を貸してくれないかナ？
#. de: He, du! Du siehst aus, als schrecken dich keine Monster. Hast du Lust, mir etwas zur Hand zu gehen?
#. fr: Tu as l'air vraiment fort<if $gn4>e</if>, voyageu<if $gn4>se<else>r</if>... Tu n'aurais pas cinq petites minutes à m'accorder<nbsp>?
#. column 57: But alas, I lack the most vital ingredient─a particularly sweet-smelling flower known as the vihara blossom.
#. column 58: It grows in abundance here, but in areas where nasty and vicious living trees are wont to roam. Might you go pick some blossoms in my stead?
#. column 59: Agree to pick vihara blossoms for the alchemist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, how kind you are! You may harvest vihara blossoms straight from the ground, or pluck them from the bodies of those saplings you see─of course, you'll have to fell them first, and that might prove tricky...
#. column 62: ...I see. Do not worry─I understand that you are tired like all of us. Pray take care of yourself, and go safely in your travels.
msgctxt "FateEvent:625:0:56"
msgid "With all the suffering in the land, our people grow weary and weak, no? And so I would fashion a lovely perfume─a healing fragrance to soothe both the body and mind. It is my own secret recipe!"
msgstr "Ты, должно быть, путешественник? С виду ты очень силён. Не поможешь мне немного?"

#. ja: ホラ、ここ最近の出来事で、<br>ミンナ、心身ともに疲れ切ってるでショ？<br>だから、癒やしの効果があるお香を調合したいんダ！
#. de: Diese Angst, die in letzter Zeit um sich greift, ist eine Plage! Da dachte ich mir, da muss man was machen! Also habe ich dieses Parfüm entwickelt, dessen Duft eine stark beruhigende Wirkung hat.
#. fr: Tout le monde a beaucoup souffert des récents événements... Je sais que ce n'est pas grand-chose mais j'aimerais fabriquer un parfum à l'arôme apaisant pour calmer le cœur et les angoisses de tous.
#. column 56: With all the suffering in the land, our people grow weary and weak, no? And so I would fashion a lovely perfume─a healing fragrance to soothe both the body and mind. It is my own secret recipe!
#. column 58: It grows in abundance here, but in areas where nasty and vicious living trees are wont to roam. Might you go pick some blossoms in my stead?
#. column 59: Agree to pick vihara blossoms for the alchemist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, how kind you are! You may harvest vihara blossoms straight from the ground, or pluck them from the bodies of those saplings you see─of course, you'll have to fell them first, and that might prove tricky...
#. column 62: ...I see. Do not worry─I understand that you are tired like all of us. Pray take care of yourself, and go safely in your travels.
msgctxt "FateEvent:625:0:57"
msgid "But alas, I lack the most vital ingredient─a particularly sweet-smelling flower known as the vihara blossom."
msgstr "Но, увы, мне не хватает самого важного ингредиента — особенно душистого цветка вихары."

#. ja: でもネ……それには「ヴィハーラの花」、いっぱい必要。<br>その香りに誘われてサップリングも集まっていて……<br>集めるの協力してくれないかナ？
#. de: Eigentlich eine geniale Idee. Leider brauche ich dafür Vihara-Blüten, die offenbar auch bei den einheimischen Sprösslingen beliebt sind. Sie verteidigen sie allerdings wie ihre eigene Brut! Könntest du mir beim Sammeln helfen?
#. fr: Pour ça, j'ai besoin d'un bon paquet de fleurs de vihara, mais il semble que je ne sois pas la seule qui s'intéresse à ces délicates plantes. Pourrais-tu me débarrasser de ces pousses odoriférantes afin que je puisse récolter mes fleurs<nbsp>?
#. column 56: With all the suffering in the land, our people grow weary and weak, no? And so I would fashion a lovely perfume─a healing fragrance to soothe both the body and mind. It is my own secret recipe!
#. column 57: But alas, I lack the most vital ingredient─a particularly sweet-smelling flower known as the vihara blossom.
#. column 59: Agree to pick vihara blossoms for the alchemist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, how kind you are! You may harvest vihara blossoms straight from the ground, or pluck them from the bodies of those saplings you see─of course, you'll have to fell them first, and that might prove tricky...
#. column 62: ...I see. Do not worry─I understand that you are tired like all of us. Pray take care of yourself, and go safely in your travels.
msgctxt "FateEvent:625:0:58"
msgid "It grows in abundance here, but in areas where nasty and vicious living trees are wont to roam. Might you go pick some blossoms in my stead?"
msgstr "Здесь они растут повсюду, но как раз там, где бродят злобные живые деревья. Не соберёшь цветы вместо меня?"

#. ja: ヴィハーラの花を集める？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du beim Sammeln der Vihara-Blüten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la parfumeuse à rassembler les fleurs<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: With all the suffering in the land, our people grow weary and weak, no? And so I would fashion a lovely perfume─a healing fragrance to soothe both the body and mind. It is my own secret recipe!
#. column 57: But alas, I lack the most vital ingredient─a particularly sweet-smelling flower known as the vihara blossom.
#. column 58: It grows in abundance here, but in areas where nasty and vicious living trees are wont to roam. Might you go pick some blossoms in my stead?
#. column 60: Oh, how kind you are! You may harvest vihara blossoms straight from the ground, or pluck them from the bodies of those saplings you see─of course, you'll have to fell them first, and that might prove tricky...
#. column 62: ...I see. Do not worry─I understand that you are tired like all of us. Pray take care of yourself, and go safely in your travels.
