msgctxt "FateEvent:625:0:59"
msgid "Agree to pick vihara blossoms for the alchemist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Согласиться собрать цветы вихары для алхимика?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: わあ、優しいネ！<br>「ヴィハーラの花」は自生しているのを摘むか、<br>「アロマ・サップリング」を倒せば手に入るヨ！
#. de: Hervorragend! Die Blumen wachsen hier wie Unkraut. Bitte kümmere dich um die Aroma-Sprösslinge. Die kleinen Biester liegen im Gras auf der Lauer und beißen jedem in die Hacken, der sich den Blumen nähert!
#. fr: Oh, tu es si gentil<if $gn4>le</if><nbsp>! Tu peux soit cueillir les fleurs directement, ou en récupérer sur les pousses que tu auras tuées<nbsp>!
#. column 56: With all the suffering in the land, our people grow weary and weak, no? And so I would fashion a lovely perfume─a healing fragrance to soothe both the body and mind. It is my own secret recipe!
#. column 57: But alas, I lack the most vital ingredient─a particularly sweet-smelling flower known as the vihara blossom.
#. column 58: It grows in abundance here, but in areas where nasty and vicious living trees are wont to roam. Might you go pick some blossoms in my stead?
#. column 59: Agree to pick vihara blossoms for the alchemist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: ...I see. Do not worry─I understand that you are tired like all of us. Pray take care of yourself, and go safely in your travels.
msgctxt "FateEvent:625:0:60"
msgid "Oh, how kind you are! You may harvest vihara blossoms straight from the ground, or pluck them from the bodies of those saplings you see─of course, you'll have to fell them first, and that might prove tricky..."
msgstr "Ой, как мило с твоей стороны! Цветы вихары можно собрать прямо с земли или сорвать с тех саженцев — только сначала придётся их одолеть, а это может оказаться непросто..."

#. ja: 仕方ないネ……。<br>アナタもきっと心身とても疲れてるのかナ？<br>体調管理には気をつけてネ？
#. de: Das war wohl etwas zu viel verlangt. Ist dein Herz vielleicht auch etwas erschöpft? Bitte ruh dich ein wenig aus und erhole dich, ja?
#. fr: Je vois... J'imagine que tu dois être fatigué<if $gn4>e</if>, toi aussi, c'est normal. Prends soin de toi, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. column 56: With all the suffering in the land, our people grow weary and weak, no? And so I would fashion a lovely perfume─a healing fragrance to soothe both the body and mind. It is my own secret recipe!
#. column 57: But alas, I lack the most vital ingredient─a particularly sweet-smelling flower known as the vihara blossom.
#. column 58: It grows in abundance here, but in areas where nasty and vicious living trees are wont to roam. Might you go pick some blossoms in my stead?
#. column 59: Agree to pick vihara blossoms for the alchemist?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, how kind you are! You may harvest vihara blossoms straight from the ground, or pluck them from the bodies of those saplings you see─of course, you'll have to fell them first, and that might prove tricky...
msgctxt "FateEvent:625:0:62"
msgid "...I see. Do not worry─I understand that you are tired like all of us. Pray take care of yourself, and go safely in your travels."
msgstr "...Понятно. Не переживай, ты, как и все мы, наверняка устал. Береги себя и счастливого пути."

#. ja: スンスン……その香りは、<br>「ヴィハーラの花」、持ってきてくれたのネ！
#. de: \<schnüff> \<schnüff> Rieche ich da etwa Vihara-Blüten?!
#. fr: (renifle) Cette odeur... Tu m'apportes des fleurs de vihara, pas vrai<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Ahh, I could recognize that divine aroma anywhere! You have brought me vihara blossoms, yes? And yet, I am sad to say I will require more than this to brew up a full batch of my signature fragrance. You will bring me more if you find them, yes?
#. column 62: No doubt you, too, find yourself enthralled by the alluring aroma of the vihara blossom? It is truly one of the most divine fragrances in all the realm!
msgctxt "FateEvent:626:0:56"
msgid "Is that the sweet, sweet aroma of vihara blossoms I smell? Oh, many thanks to you, my friend!"
msgstr "Это же сладкий-сладкий аромат цветов вихары! Спасибо тебе, друг мой!"

#. ja: わあ、素敵な香り……ありがとうネ！<br>でもネ、充分な量のお香を作るには、もう少し必要かナ……。<br>また見つけたら、持ってきてネ！
#. de: Hach, was für ein herrlicher Duft! Aber für die Essenzen des Parfüms benötige ich noch mehr Blüten. Wenn du noch mehr in die Finger bekommst, weißt du ja, wo du mich findest.
#. fr: Elles sentent tellement bon<nbsp>! Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment... ce n'est pas une quantité suffisante pour que je puisse fabriquer mon parfum... Si tu en trouves d'autres, apporte-les-moi, s'il te plaît<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Is that the sweet, sweet aroma of vihara blossoms I smell? Oh, many thanks to you, my friend!
#. column 62: No doubt you, too, find yourself enthralled by the alluring aroma of the vihara blossom? It is truly one of the most divine fragrances in all the realm!
msgctxt "FateEvent:626:0:60"
msgid "Ahh, I could recognize that divine aroma anywhere! You have brought me vihara blossoms, yes? And yet, I am sad to say I will require more than this to brew up a full batch of my signature fragrance. You will bring me more if you find them, yes?"
msgstr "Ах, этот божественный аромат ни с чем не спутаешь! Ты принёс мне цветы вихары, да? Но, боюсь, этого мало, чтобы приготовить целую порцию моего фирменного благовония. Если найдёшь ещё, принесёшь?"

#. ja: あら、アナタも「ヴィハーラの花」が気に入ったのかナ？<br>とてもイイ香りだからネ……！
#. de: Huch? Sag bloß, du hast jetzt auch Gefallen am Duft der Blumen gefunden? Schon verständlich. Er ist einfach wunderbar beruhigend!
#. fr: Alors toi aussi tu les aimes ces fleurs, hein<nbsp>? Leur senteur est tellement addictive...
#. column 56: Is that the sweet, sweet aroma of vihara blossoms I smell? Oh, many thanks to you, my friend!
#. column 60: Ahh, I could recognize that divine aroma anywhere! You have brought me vihara blossoms, yes? And yet, I am sad to say I will require more than this to brew up a full batch of my signature fragrance. You will bring me more if you find them, yes?
msgctxt "FateEvent:626:0:62"
msgid "No doubt you, too, find yourself enthralled by the alluring aroma of the vihara blossom? It is truly one of the most divine fragrances in all the realm!"
msgstr "Ты тоже влюбился в аромат цветов вихары? Он и правда один из самых чудесных на свете!"

#. ja: 「ヴィハーラの花」は自生しているのを摘むか、<br>「アロマ・サップリング」を倒せば手に入るヨ！<br>集めて、持ってきてほしいナ！
#. de: Die Blumen wachsen hier wie Unkraut. Du musst nur an den Aroma-Sprösslingen vorbeikommen. Die kleinen Biester beißen einem gern in die Hacken!
#. fr: Les fleurs de vihara peuvent soit être récoltées, soit être récupérées sur les pousses odoriférantes que tu auras tuées. Je compte sur toi pour m'en apporter plein, hein<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:627:0:56"
msgid "There are two ways to harvest vihara blossoms: by picking them straight from the ground, or by plucking them from the limbs of any aromatic saplings you fell. The latter may prove to be a bit more dangerous."
msgstr "Цветы вихары можно собрать прямо с земли или сорвать с веток поверженных ароматных саженцев. Второй способ опаснее, так что будь осторожен."

#. ja: うん、これで充分ネ！<br>いっぱいお香が作れそうだヨ！<br>そろそろ帰って、作業しなくっちゃネ！
#. de: Das sollte reichen. Wunderbar. Wie schön sie doch duften. Damit kann ich einige Fläschchen meines beruhigenden Parfüms herstellen. Auf wiedersehen, <if $gn4>werte Heldin<else>werter Held</if>!
#. fr: Ouah, il y en a tellement<nbsp>! Merci beaucoup, avec ça je vais pouvoir fabriquer des litres de parfum<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:628:0:56"
msgid "Look at all these blossoms! Yes, this will make for a whole, whopping batch of perfume! I must return to my workshop at once!"
msgstr "Сколько цветов! Да, этого хватит на целую уйму духов! Пора возвращаться в мастерскую и приниматься за работу!"

#. ja: スンスン……その香りは、<br>「ヴィハーラの花」、持ってきてくれたのネ！
#. de: \<schnüff> \<schnüff> Rieche ich da etwa Vihara-Blüten?!
#. fr: (renifle) Cette odeur... Tu m'apportes des fleurs de vihara, pas vrai<nbsp>?
#. column 60: With all that you've picked for me, I'll be able to make a whole batch of my finest perfume! Why, I must return to my workshop at once.
#. column 62: No doubt you, too, find yourself enthralled by the alluring aroma of the vihara blossom? It is truly one of the most divine fragrances in all the realm!
msgctxt "FateEvent:629:0:56"
msgid "Is that the sweet, sweet aroma of vihara blossoms I smell? Oh, thank you my friend!"
msgstr "Это же сладкий-сладкий аромат цветов вихары! Спасибо тебе, друг мой!"

#. ja: これだけあれば、いっぱいお香が作れそうだヨ！<br>そろそろ帰って、作業しなくっちゃネ！
#. de: Das sollte reichen. Wunderbar. Wie schön sie doch duften. Damit kann ich einige Fläschchen meines beruhigenden Parfüms herstellen. Auf wiedersehen, <if $gn4>werte Heldin<else>werter Held</if> !
#. fr: Ouah, il y en a tellement<nbsp>! Merci beaucoup, avec ça je vais pouvoir fabriquer des litres de parfum<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Is that the sweet, sweet aroma of vihara blossoms I smell? Oh, thank you my friend!
#. column 62: No doubt you, too, find yourself enthralled by the alluring aroma of the vihara blossom? It is truly one of the most divine fragrances in all the realm!
msgctxt "FateEvent:629:0:60"
msgid "With all that you've picked for me, I'll be able to make a whole batch of my finest perfume! Why, I must return to my workshop at once."
msgstr "Теперь я смогу приготовить целую партию лучших духов! Пора возвращаться в мастерскую!"

#. ja: あら、アナタも「ヴィハーラの花」が気に入ったのかナ？<br>とてもイイ香りだからネ……！
#. de: Huch? Sag bloß, du hast jetzt auch Gefallen am Duft der Blumen gefunden? Schon verständlich. Er ist einfach wunderbar beruhigend!
#. fr: Alors toi aussi tu les aimes ces fleurs, hein<nbsp>? Leur senteur est tellement addictive...
#. column 56: Is that the sweet, sweet aroma of vihara blossoms I smell? Oh, thank you my friend!
#. column 60: With all that you've picked for me, I'll be able to make a whole batch of my finest perfume! Why, I must return to my workshop at once.
msgctxt "FateEvent:629:0:62"
msgid "No doubt you, too, find yourself enthralled by the alluring aroma of the vihara blossom? It is truly one of the most divine fragrances in all the realm!"
msgstr "Ты тоже влюбился в аромат цветов вихары? Он и правда один из самых чудесных на свете!"

#. ja: これで、大部分は回収できたはずです。<br>もしも、ほかに「奪われた観察記録」を見つけましたら、<br>私のところに持ってきてくださいね。
#. de: Das sollten die meisten der Notizbücher sein. Wenn du noch welche findest, dann bring sie mir bitte.
#. fr: Tu as retrouvé les plus importantes. Ceci dit, si tu pouvais en récupérer encore plus, je ne t'en serais que plus re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sant.
msgctxt "FateEvent:630:0:56"
msgid "That should be most of it, now. If you happen upon any more of my documents, please return them to me posthaste. They are vital to our research, you see."
msgstr "Похоже, теперь это почти все документы. Если найдёшь ещё мои записи, пожалуйста, как можно скорее принеси их мне. Они очень важны для наших исследований."

#. ja: おや、まだ「奪われた観察記録」が残っていたんですね！
#. de: Da waren also wirklich noch Notizbücher? Danke, Familiar.
#. fr: Tu en as trouvé d'autres<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Oh you are too good! Thank you. With most of the documents back in my hands, I will be able to face Overseer Sokles and offer my apologies.
#. column 62: A-And where is it you intend to go with those, exactly? Do give them back. I will never be able to face Overseer Sokles again were it known a familiar made off with my documents!
msgctxt "FateEvent:631:0:56"
msgid "Oh gracious me, my missing documents are still, well, missing!"
msgstr "Ах, боже мой! Мои пропавшие документы всё ещё пропали!"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>これで大部分は回収できたはずですから、<br>ソクレス園長には、なんとか弁明できそうですよ……！
#. de: Das sollten jetzt beinah alle der Notizbücher sein. Gut, dann kann Sokles ja nicht mehr allzu böse auf mich sein.
#. fr: Formidable<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh gracious me, my missing documents are still, well, missing!
#. column 62: A-And where is it you intend to go with those, exactly? Do give them back. I will never be able to face Overseer Sokles again were it known a familiar made off with my documents!
msgctxt "FateEvent:631:0:60"
msgid "Oh you are too good! Thank you. With most of the documents back in my hands, I will be able to face Overseer Sokles and offer my apologies."
msgstr "Ах, ты просто чудо! Спасибо. Теперь, когда большая часть документов снова у меня, я смогу предстать перед смотрителем Соклесом и извиниться."

#. ja: えっ、それを持ち帰ってどうしようというんですか？<br>使い魔さんにまで、観察記録を取られたとしたら、<br>どうやってソクレス園長に弁明すれば……。
#. de: Was willst du denn mit meinen Aufzeichungen? Sie haben doch keinen Nutzen für dich. Oje, Sokles wird mir nie verzeihen ...
#. fr: Ça ne te servirait à rien de les garder, tu sais. Si même les familiers me volent mes affaires, maintenant...
#. column 56: Oh gracious me, my missing documents are still, well, missing!
#. column 60: Oh you are too good! Thank you. With most of the documents back in my hands, I will be able to face Overseer Sokles and offer my apologies.
msgctxt "FateEvent:631:0:62"
msgid "A-And where is it you intend to go with those, exactly? Do give them back. I will never be able to face Overseer Sokles again were it known a familiar made off with my documents!"
msgstr "И-и куда это ты собрался с ними? Верни их, пожалуйста! Если станет известно, что фамильяр унёс мои документы, я больше не смогу смотреть смотрителю Соклесу в глаза!"

#. ja: 小官は、黒渦団の技術将校であります！<br>亡命帝国人でもあるガーロンド社のエブレルノ氏と共に、<br>秘密任務に従事していたのですが、一大事に……！
#. de: Ich bin Technikoffizierin des Mahlstroms. Zusammen mit Ebrelnaux, der als Geflohener bei den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken untergekommen ist, bin ich in ... geheimer Mission unterwegs. Es handelt sich um eine Mission von allergrößter Wichtigkeit!
#. fr: Aidez-moi<nbsp>! J'étais censée veiller sur Ebrelnaux et l'accompagner dans une mission secrète, mais à un moment, il a aperçu une arme magitek à l'abandon et, avant que j'ai pu faire quoi que ce soit, s'est mis à courir dans sa direction<nbsp>!
#. column 57: He climbed aboard that warmachina to gather some important parts, thinking it was deactivated, only for it come alive with him still inside! Please, you've got to help him!
#. column 58: Rescue Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you. I'll try rallying more of our troops, but for now, that warmachina is all yours!
#. column 62: If that is your decision, then so be it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:632:0:56"
msgid "It's an emergency! I'm supposed to be guarding Ebrelnaux, but he ran off before I could stop him!"
msgstr "Тревога! Я должна была охранять Эбрельно, но он убежал, пока я пыталась его остановить!"

#. ja: 氏が調査のために、放棄されていた魔導兵器に乗り込んだところ、<br>なんと暴走状態に陥ってしまったのです！<br>どうか、あの暴走兵器を止めていただけないでしょうか！
#. de: Im Rahmen dieser Mission hat mein Partner eine Magitek-Maschine bestiegen, um sie zu untersuchen ... und anscheinend total die Kontrolle verloren! Die Maschine läuft Amok! Jemand muss sie zerstören und ihn retten!
#. fr: Il voulait inspecter la machine. Seulement, celle-ci s'est sou<shy>dai<shy>ne<shy>ment mise en marche et a commençé à agir de façon erratique. J'aimerais que vous alliez la mettre à l'arrêt pour délivrer Ebrelnaux.
#. column 56: It's an emergency! I'm supposed to be guarding Ebrelnaux, but he ran off before I could stop him!
#. column 58: Rescue Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you. I'll try rallying more of our troops, but for now, that warmachina is all yours!
#. column 62: If that is your decision, then so be it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:632:0:57"
msgid "He climbed aboard that warmachina to gather some important parts, thinking it was deactivated, only for it come alive with him still inside! Please, you've got to help him!"
msgstr "Он забрался в эту магитековую машину за важными деталями, думая, что она отключена, но та вдруг ожила, пока он был внутри! Прошу, помоги ему!"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Hilfst du bei der streng geheimen Mission?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aller mettre l'arme folle à l'arrêt<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: It's an emergency! I'm supposed to be guarding Ebrelnaux, but he ran off before I could stop him!
#. column 57: He climbed aboard that warmachina to gather some important parts, thinking it was deactivated, only for it come alive with him still inside! Please, you've got to help him!
#. column 60: Thank you. I'll try rallying more of our troops, but for now, that warmachina is all yours!
#. column 62: If that is your decision, then so be it.
