#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:632:0:58"
msgid "Rescue Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Спасти Эбрельно?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ご協力に感謝いたします！<br>それでは各グランドカンパニーの冒険者部隊と協力し、<br>目標を強制停止させてください！
#. de: Danke! Verbünde dich mit den anderen Abenteurern der Staatlichen Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaften und schalte die Magitek-Maschine aus!
#. fr: Merci pour votre aide<nbsp>! Des membres des grandes compagnies éorzéennes vous prêteront main-forte, mais je compte d'abord sur vous pour arrêter cette machine<nbsp>!
#. column 56: It's an emergency! I'm supposed to be guarding Ebrelnaux, but he ran off before I could stop him!
#. column 57: He climbed aboard that warmachina to gather some important parts, thinking it was deactivated, only for it come alive with him still inside! Please, you've got to help him!
#. column 58: Rescue Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: If that is your decision, then so be it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:632:0:60"
msgid "Thank you. I'll try rallying more of our troops, but for now, that warmachina is all yours!"
msgstr "Спасибо. Попробую собрать побольше наших солдат, а пока эта боевая машина — твоя забота!"

#. ja: そ、そうですか……。<br>では、別の友軍部隊に協力を求めることにします。
#. de: Na gut. Dann muss ich mich eben auf die anderen Abenteurer verlassen.
#. fr: Je... je comprends. Je vais demander de l'aide ailleurs, dans ce cas.
#. column 56: It's an emergency! I'm supposed to be guarding Ebrelnaux, but he ran off before I could stop him!
#. column 57: He climbed aboard that warmachina to gather some important parts, thinking it was deactivated, only for it come alive with him still inside! Please, you've got to help him!
#. column 58: Rescue Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you. I'll try rallying more of our troops, but for now, that warmachina is all yours!
msgctxt "FateEvent:632:0:62"
msgid "If that is your decision, then so be it."
msgstr "Раз таково твоё решение, что ж, быть по сему."

#. ja: エブレルノ氏が亡命前に、強制的に研究させられていた、<br>危険な軍事技術を破棄することが目的だったのです。
#. de: Vor seiner Flucht wurde Ebrelnaux dazu gezwungen, brutalste Waffentechniken zu konstruieren. Das Ziel unserer Mission war es, diese Technologie zu zerstören.
#. fr: Autrefois, Ebrelnaux a été intégré de force dans un groupe de recherche sur de dangereuses technologies à usage militaire. Mais il a fini par déserter pour détruire ces armes de destruction qu'il a contribué malgré lui à développer.
#. column 57: In fact, that warmachina and many others employ the technology that he himself created. His determination to eliminate this threat stems from his desire to atone for his past.
msgctxt "FateEvent:633:0:56"
msgid "Ebrelnaux was once forced to cooperate in designing magitek for the imperial military, which is what led to him defecting from the Empire."
msgstr "Когда-то Эбрельно заставили участвовать в разработке магитека для имперской армии. Это и привело к его бегству из Империи."

#. ja: どうやら、あの魔導兵器には、<br>エブレルノ氏の技術が用いられているらしく……<br>その辺りを調査している最中だったのです！
#. de: Diese Kampfmaschine basierte auf seiner gefürchteten Technologie ... Doch jetzt hat der Schrecken endlich ein Ende.
#. fr: Il semble que ces machines folles soient équipées de technologies qui n'auraient pas vu le jour sans ses recherches... Vous l'aurez compris, nous sommes ici pour les détruire.
#. column 56: Ebrelnaux was once forced to cooperate in designing magitek for the imperial military, which is what led to him defecting from the Empire.
msgctxt "FateEvent:633:0:57"
msgid "In fact, that warmachina and many others employ the technology that he himself created. His determination to eliminate this threat stems from his desire to atone for his past."
msgstr "На самом деле эта и многие другие боевые машины работают на магитеке, который создал он сам. Он хочет уничтожить эту угрозу, чтобы искупить своё прошлое."

#. ja: ヒトの冒険者さん！<br>外からダイナマイトが流れ込んできたんだ！<br>退治するのを手伝ってくれないかな？
#. de: <if $gn4>Frau Abenteurerin<else>Herr Abenteurer</if>! Die Dynamits haben es irgendwie geschafft, von draußen hereinzukommen! Bitte hilf mir, es sind viel zu viele!
#. fr: Nous sommes attaqués, <if $gn4>Madame l'humaine<else>Monsieur l'humain</if><nbsp>! Des dynamites ont réussi à s'infiltrer entre nos murs<nbsp>! Pouvez-vous m'aider à neutraliser cette menace<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Help defuse the situation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: B-But I can't possibly take on all these fiery fiends by myself!
msgctxt "FateEvent:634:0:56"
msgid "Oh, d-dear... A swarm of dynamite has drifted inside the burrow! You must help us get rid of them before they blow this place to smithereens!"
msgstr "Ой, б-беда! В логово пробрался целый рой динамитов! Помогите нам избавиться от них, пока они не взорвали всё вокруг!"

#. ja: 退治を手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Warringway helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Warringway<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, d-dear... A swarm of dynamite has drifted inside the burrow! You must help us get rid of them before they blow this place to smithereens!
#. column 62: B-But I can't possibly take on all these fiery fiends by myself!
