msgctxt "FateEvent:634:0:57"
msgid "Help defuse the situation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь уладить ситуацию?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: えっ、駄目なの？<br>ボクひとりじゃ、とても全部退治できないよ～！
#. de: Du willst nicht helfen?! Und lässt mich kleinen Loporrit allein in den Kampf ziehen?!
#. fr: Vous voudriez que je les repousse à moi seul<nbsp>!? Tout stratège qui se respecte sait pourtant qu'on ne gagne pas une bataille sans armée<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh, d-dear... A swarm of dynamite has drifted inside the burrow! You must help us get rid of them before they blow this place to smithereens!
#. column 57: Help defuse the situation?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:634:0:62"
msgid "B-But I can't possibly take on all these fiery fiends by myself!"
msgstr "Н-но мне одному не справиться со всеми этими огненными чудовищами!"

#. ja: 私はね、新しい創造生物の概念を生み出したいんだ。<br>だが、なかなかどうして斬新な閃きが得られなくてね。<br>そこで既存の生物を参考にしようと思う。
#. de: Ich möchte ein neues Konzept ersinnen, aber es fehlt mir an Ideen. Ich glaube, ich sollte mich von einem anderen Geschöpf inspirieren lassen.
#. fr: Je réfléchis à un nouveau concept, mais aucune idée novatrice ne me vient à l'esprit, alors j'ai décidé de m'inspirer de créatures existantes pour le moment.
#. column 57: Which is where you come in. Perhaps you, my new familiar friend, might go toe to...hoof against aigokerotes? Observing their fight-or-flight responses will surely be of great help to me and my currently unimaginative mind.
#. column 58: Help inspire Meletos?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I knew you would oblige me! Thank you kindly. Now, see if there are any others about who might assist you.
#. column 62: You've other duties to be getting on with, then? Very well. I'm sure your master keeps you busy... I shall seek help elsewhere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:636:0:56"
msgid "My creativity has all but stagnated. If creativity were a well, mine would be bone dry─worthless! So, I hoped to use existing creations to inspire me─replenish my water supply, as it were!"
msgstr "Моё воображение совсем иссякло. Будь оно колодцем, тот давно бы высох — ни капли пользы! Я надеялся вдохновиться уже существующими творениями и пополнить свои запасы, так сказать!"

#. ja: 使い魔クン、これより私が創造するエゴーケロスと戦って、<br>その戦いぶりを観察させてもらえないだろうか？<br>どうかよろしく頼むよ。
#. de: Liebes Familiar, würdest du gegen die von mir geschaffenen Aigokeros kämpfen? Ich werde dir dabei zusehen und auf Inspiration warten.
#. fr: Dis-moi, familier, pourrais-tu te battre contre des aigokeros que je vais créer afin que j'observe leurs capacités de combat<nbsp>?
#. column 56: My creativity has all but stagnated. If creativity were a well, mine would be bone dry─worthless! So, I hoped to use existing creations to inspire me─replenish my water supply, as it were!
#. column 58: Help inspire Meletos?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I knew you would oblige me! Thank you kindly. Now, see if there are any others about who might assist you.
#. column 62: You've other duties to be getting on with, then? Very well. I'm sure your master keeps you busy... I shall seek help elsewhere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:636:0:57"
msgid "Which is where you come in. Perhaps you, my new familiar friend, might go toe to...hoof against aigokerotes? Observing their fight-or-flight responses will surely be of great help to me and my currently unimaginative mind."
msgstr "Вот тут ты и пригодишься. Может, мой новый друг-фамильяр, сразишься с айгокеротами? Если понаблюдать за их реакцией на опасность, это наверняка поможет моему бедному воображению."

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Kämpfst du gegen die Aigokeros?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Combattre des aigokeros pour aider Mélétos<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: My creativity has all but stagnated. If creativity were a well, mine would be bone dry─worthless! So, I hoped to use existing creations to inspire me─replenish my water supply, as it were!
#. column 57: Which is where you come in. Perhaps you, my new familiar friend, might go toe to...hoof against aigokerotes? Observing their fight-or-flight responses will surely be of great help to me and my currently unimaginative mind.
#. column 60: I knew you would oblige me! Thank you kindly. Now, see if there are any others about who might assist you.
#. column 62: You've other duties to be getting on with, then? Very well. I'm sure your master keeps you busy... I shall seek help elsewhere.
