msgctxt "FateEvent:636:0:58"
msgid "Help inspire Meletos?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь вдохновить Мелетоса?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 手伝ってくれるか、ありがたい……！<br>では、ほかにも協力者がいないか呼びかけてみよう。
#. de: Danke. Ich werde sehen, ob noch andere bereit sind, zu helfen.
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Je vais voir si d'autres collaborateurs pourraient aider également.
#. column 56: My creativity has all but stagnated. If creativity were a well, mine would be bone dry─worthless! So, I hoped to use existing creations to inspire me─replenish my water supply, as it were!
#. column 57: Which is where you come in. Perhaps you, my new familiar friend, might go toe to...hoof against aigokerotes? Observing their fight-or-flight responses will surely be of great help to me and my currently unimaginative mind.
#. column 58: Help inspire Meletos?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You've other duties to be getting on with, then? Very well. I'm sure your master keeps you busy... I shall seek help elsewhere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:636:0:60"
msgid "I knew you would oblige me! Thank you kindly. Now, see if there are any others about who might assist you."
msgstr "Я знал, что ты не откажешь! Большое спасибо. А теперь поищи, нет ли поблизости других желающих помочь."

#. ja: 主から、別の使命を与えられているのかな……？<br>ならば仕方あるまい、別の協力者を探すとしよう。
#. de: Bist du mit anderen Dingen beschäftigt? Dann kann man nichts machen. Ich warte auf jemand anderen.
#. fr: Si tu as des choses à faire, je ne voudrais pas t'empêcher de remplir ta mission. Je vais chercher d'autres collaborateurs.
#. column 56: My creativity has all but stagnated. If creativity were a well, mine would be bone dry─worthless! So, I hoped to use existing creations to inspire me─replenish my water supply, as it were!
#. column 57: Which is where you come in. Perhaps you, my new familiar friend, might go toe to...hoof against aigokerotes? Observing their fight-or-flight responses will surely be of great help to me and my currently unimaginative mind.
#. column 58: Help inspire Meletos?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I knew you would oblige me! Thank you kindly. Now, see if there are any others about who might assist you.
msgctxt "FateEvent:636:0:62"
msgid "You've other duties to be getting on with, then? Very well. I'm sure your master keeps you busy... I shall seek help elsewhere."
msgstr "У тебя, значит, есть дела поважнее? Что ж, понимаю. Наверное, хозяин не даёт тебе передышки... Поищу помощи в другом месте."

#. ja: 新しい創造生物の概念を生み出すために、<br>既存の生物、エゴーケロスを参考にしようと思ってね。<br>戦ってみせてくれる者を求めているんだ。
#. de: Ich möchte ein neues Leben kreieren, das auf dem Aigokeros basiert. Dafür suche ich jemanden, der für mich gegen einen kämpft.
#. fr: Affronte des aigokeros, que je puisse observer leurs capacités de combat. Cela devrait m'aider à imaginer un nouveau concept.
msgctxt "FateEvent:637:0:56"
msgid "I am on the hunt for a capable fighter who might do battle with a number of aigokerotes. Observing the creatures' combat prowess may inspire future concepts, you see."
msgstr "Ищу умелого бойца, который сразится с несколькими айгокеротами. Наблюдение за их боевыми навыками может подсказать мне новые идеи."

#. ja: イヒ、イヒヒヒヒ……！<br>ちょっとばかしイジったら、マシンが暴走しちまってな。<br>オマエラの力でブッ壊してくれや。
#. de: Hihi! Diese Maschinchen sind schon lustig! Man braucht nur ein paar Schräubchen drehen und sie geraten außer Rand und Band! Haust du sie kaputt? Sonst passiert am Ende noch was Schlimmes, hihihi ...!
#. fr: Hé hé hé hé hé... Les machines sont de petites choses si délicates. On bidouille un ou deux boulons, et hop<nbsp>! leur système s'emballe. J'assumerai bien la res<shy>pon<shy>sa<shy>bi<shy>li<shy>té de mes actes, mais mon cerveau n'est pas fait pour ce genre de corvée primitive. Je préfère vous laisser vous en charger, hé hé hé...
#. column 57: Destroy the menacing machines?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, you're too kind...eheheh.
#. column 62: What─scared of a few aggressive automata? Because I'm downright terrified! Eheheh...
msgctxt "FateEvent:638:0:56"
msgid "Could you spare a moment? You see, I was tinkering with some of these mechanical marvels, and they, er, got a bit boisterous...eheheh. Mind dismantling them for me?"
msgstr "Не найдётся минутки? Я тут немного повозился с этими чудесами механики, и они... э-э... слегка разбушевались. Не поможешь разобрать их на части?"

#. ja: 暴走マシンを破壊する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Die Maschinen zerstören?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Détruire les machines déréglées<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Could you spare a moment? You see, I was tinkering with some of these mechanical marvels, and they, er, got a bit boisterous...eheheh. Mind dismantling them for me?
#. column 60: Oh, you're too kind...eheheh.
#. column 62: What─scared of a few aggressive automata? Because I'm downright terrified! Eheheh...
