msgctxt "FateEvent:640:0:57"
msgid "Dismantle his masterpiece?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Разобрать его шедевр?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: イヒ、イヒヒヒヒ……！<br>それじゃあ、任せたぜ～？
#. de: Schön draufhauen, bis es raucht, kihihi!
#. fr: Hé hé hé hé hé... Montrez-moi un beau spectacle<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Eheheh... Well, the good news is I succeeded in increasing the supercarrot's output to 260%! The bad news is it's gone haywire. Mind shutting it down for me?
#. column 57: Dismantle his masterpiece?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: What─scared of my greatest creation? Well, then that makes two of us! Eheheh...
msgctxt "FateEvent:640:0:60"
msgid "Excellent! Then I'll leave you to it...eheheh."
msgstr "Отлично! Тогда предоставляю это тебе... хе-хе-хе."

#. ja: イヒ、イヒヒヒヒ……！<br>なんだよ、ビビっちまったのか？<br>ま、それもわからん話じゃないがな！
#. de: Hast du etwa Angst vor der Klapperkiste? Kehehe ... dann hat sich das Herumschrauben ja geloh... ähm, ich meine, das ist total verständlich!
#. fr: Hé hé hé hé hé... Eh bien alors, on a les chocottes<nbsp>? Je ne vous en veux pas, va. Après tout, j'ai configuré cet appareil exprès pour le rendre aussi destructeur que possible<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Eheheh... Well, the good news is I succeeded in increasing the supercarrot's output to 260%! The bad news is it's gone haywire. Mind shutting it down for me?
#. column 57: Dismantle his masterpiece?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent! Then I'll leave you to it...eheheh.
msgctxt "FateEvent:640:0:62"
msgid "What─scared of my greatest creation? Well, then that makes two of us! Eheheh..."
msgstr "Что, испугался моего величайшего творения? Ну, значит, нас уже двое! Хе-хе-хе..."

#. ja: イヒヒ、派手に戦ってくれよ～？<br>データを収集して、キャロット機関の出力を、<br>さらに上げるためのヒントを掴むんだからな～！
#. de: Kehehe! Na los, etwas mehr Elan! Ich brauche so viele Daten wie möglich, um das nächste Modell zu per<shy>fek<shy>tio<shy>nie<shy>ren!
#. fr: Hé hé hé... Ne retenez pas vos coups, surtout<nbsp>! J'ai besoin d'autant de données que possible pour per<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner le modèle suivant<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:641:0:56"
msgid "Do be sure to give it your all, won't you? That'll provide me with the combat data I need to further improve the supercarrot's output! Eheheh..."
msgstr "Постарайся как следует, ладно? Мне нужны боевые данные, чтобы ещё сильнее увеличить мощность суперморковки! Хе-хе-хе..."

#. ja: フォリングウェイの噂は聞いたことがあるよ。<br>機械いじりが好きで、すごい改造をすることもあれば、<br>暴走させちゃうこともあるんだって……。
#. de: Manche Loporrit sagen, um so viel aus den Maschinen herauszuholen wie Fallingway, muss man irgendetwas zwischen genial und wahnsinnig sein. Aber der Wahnsinn überwiegt schon ein wenig ...
#. fr: Les autres Loporrites m'avaient décrit Fallingway comme un inventeur mi-fou mi-génie, capable de réaliser aussi bien des prodiges que des catastrophes... mais pour le moment, j'ai surtout assisté aux catastrophes<nbsp>!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:642:0:56"
msgid "Fallingway's...<i>tinkering</i> is well known among us Loporrits. Unfortunately, for every experiment that bears fruit, another one backfires spectacularly. "
msgstr "О том, как Fallingway... <i>возится</i> с механизмами, среди нас, лопорритов, ходят легенды. Увы, на каждую удачную задумку приходится другой опыт, который заканчивается громким провалом."

#. ja: 新しい創造生物の概念を生み出すために、<br>最新の魔法生物、イーオーを参考にしようと思ってね。<br>戦って見せてくれる者を求めているんだ。
#. de: Ich möchte ein neues Leben kreieren, das auf der Io basiert. Dafür suche ich jemanden, der für mich gegen eine kämpft.
#. fr: Affronte cette copie de l'io afin que j'observe ses capacités de combat. Cela devrait m'aider à imaginer un nouveau concept.
msgctxt "FateEvent:643:0:56"
msgid "The io, a new creation of ours, has something about it─something that fascinates me, though I'm not sure what. Perhaps you could hurt it a bit. Maybe that will help me understand."
msgstr "В этой нашей новой форме, ио, есть что-то... что-то, что меня завораживает, хотя я и не пойму, что именно. Может, немного её побьёшь? Вдруг тогда я разберусь."

#. ja: 私の名は、エブレルノ……<br>現在はシド会長の下で働く、ガーロンド社の社員ですが、<br>かつては、ここにあった研究所に所属していました。
#. de: Es ist eine Ehre, dich zu treffen. Mein Name ist Ebrelnaux und ich arbeite für deinen Freund Cid Garlond bei den Metallwerken. Das war allerdings nicht immer so. Früher war ich Magitek-Ingenieur, und zwar genau hier.
#. fr: Je m'appelle Ebrelnaux. Je suis ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment employé des forges de Garlond, dirigées par Cid Garlond. Mais ça n'a pas toujours été le cas. En effet, j'étais autrefois chercheur dans le laboratoire qui se trouvait ici-même.
#. column 57: My area of expertise was the automation of machina used in everyday life, that it may be used by the common man. Eventually, the military expressed an interest in my work and requisitioned it for their own ends. The warmachina that haunt these ruins are driven by the magitek I created, though it has changed much since my defection.
#. column 58: I seek to gain a greater understanding of the latest Garlean technological advances, in order to silence these instruments of destruction. Will you grant me your protection while I scour the area for research materials?
#. column 59: Protect Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Understood. I shall look to other members of our contingent for aid. With luck, someone will pass through ere long.
msgctxt "FateEvent:644:0:56"
msgid "It's an honor to meet you, Warrior of Light. My name is Ebrelnaux, and I serve under your friend Cid Garlond in the Ironworks, but it wasn't always this way. I was once a magitek engineer, stationed right at this very location."
msgstr "Для меня честь встретить вас, Воин Света. Меня зовут Эбрено, я служу у вашего друга Сида в Гарлондских мастерских. Но так было не всегда. Раньше я был инженером магитека и работал прямо здесь."

#. ja: 当時、私が民生用に研究していた、<br>自動制御技術を、軍に徴発されてしまいましてね。<br>今では魔導兵器の無人化に応用されているようです。
#. de: Ich habe die ver<shy>schie<shy>den<shy>sten alltäglichen Gegenstände entworfen. Doch irgendwann hat sich das Militär für meine Anwendungen interessiert und sie für seine Zwecke vereinnahmt. Die Kriegsmaschinen, welche diese Ruinen noch immer unsicher machen, basieren auch auf meinen Erfindungen.
#. fr: À l'origine, mes recherches sur la technologie magitek étaient destinées à améliorer la vie quotidienne du peuple. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, l'armée impériale a eu vent de cela et m'a enrôlé de force afin que mes trouvailles servent ses intérêts guerriers. Aujourd'hui, ce que j'ai aidé à développer est utilisé dans les armes magitek sans pilotes.
#. column 56: It's an honor to meet you, Warrior of Light. My name is Ebrelnaux, and I serve under your friend Cid Garlond in the Ironworks, but it wasn't always this way. I was once a magitek engineer, stationed right at this very location.
#. column 58: I seek to gain a greater understanding of the latest Garlean technological advances, in order to silence these instruments of destruction. Will you grant me your protection while I scour the area for research materials?
#. column 59: Protect Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Understood. I shall look to other members of our contingent for aid. With luck, someone will pass through ere long.
msgctxt "FateEvent:644:0:57"
msgid "My area of expertise was the automation of machina used in everyday life, that it may be used by the common man. Eventually, the military expressed an interest in my work and requisitioned it for their own ends. The warmachina that haunt these ruins are driven by the magitek I created, though it has changed much since my defection."
msgstr "Я специализировался на автоматизации машин для повседневных нужд, чтобы ими мог пользоваться простой народ. Со временем армия заинтересовалась моими разработками и присвоила их. Боевые машины, что бродят по этим руинам, работают на магитеке, созданном мной, хотя с тех пор, как я дезертировал, он сильно изменился."

#. ja: これに関連した最新の技術資料を回収できれば、<br>帝都で暴れまわる魔導兵器を止めることも可能なはずです。<br>どうか捜索中の護衛をお願いできないでしょうか？
#. de: Doch es gab Neuerungen in der Magitek. Um diese Maschinen des Todes zu vernichten, muss ich sie studieren. Würdest du mich beschützen, während ich die Gegend nach Material für meine Forschung durchkämme?
#. fr: Si je récupère les documents ayant trait à cette technologie, je devrais pouvoir être capable d'arrêter toutes les machines folles qui errent dans la capitale.
#. column 56: It's an honor to meet you, Warrior of Light. My name is Ebrelnaux, and I serve under your friend Cid Garlond in the Ironworks, but it wasn't always this way. I was once a magitek engineer, stationed right at this very location.
#. column 57: My area of expertise was the automation of machina used in everyday life, that it may be used by the common man. Eventually, the military expressed an interest in my work and requisitioned it for their own ends. The warmachina that haunt these ruins are driven by the magitek I created, though it has changed much since my defection.
#. column 59: Protect Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Understood. I shall look to other members of our contingent for aid. With luck, someone will pass through ere long.
msgctxt "FateEvent:644:0:58"
msgid "I seek to gain a greater understanding of the latest Garlean technological advances, in order to silence these instruments of destruction. Will you grant me your protection while I scour the area for research materials?"
msgstr "Я хочу изучить последние достижения гарлеанских технологий, чтобы остановить эти орудия разрушения. Не защитишь меня, пока я обыскиваю местность в поисках исследовательских материалов?"

#. ja: エブレルノたちの護衛を引き受けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Wirst du Ebrelnaux beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Assurer la protection d'Ebrelnaux<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: It's an honor to meet you, Warrior of Light. My name is Ebrelnaux, and I serve under your friend Cid Garlond in the Ironworks, but it wasn't always this way. I was once a magitek engineer, stationed right at this very location.
#. column 57: My area of expertise was the automation of machina used in everyday life, that it may be used by the common man. Eventually, the military expressed an interest in my work and requisitioned it for their own ends. The warmachina that haunt these ruins are driven by the magitek I created, though it has changed much since my defection.
#. column 58: I seek to gain a greater understanding of the latest Garlean technological advances, in order to silence these instruments of destruction. Will you grant me your protection while I scour the area for research materials?
#. column 62: Understood. I shall look to other members of our contingent for aid. With luck, someone will pass through ere long.
