msgctxt "FateEvent:644:0:59"
msgid "Protect Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Защитить Эбрельно?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 仕方ありませんね……。<br>他に派遣団に所属する者が、<br>通り掛かることに期待することにしましょう……。
#. de: Na gut. Ich werde mich an jemand anders wenden. Wenn mich nicht vorher eine von diesen Maschinen erwischt ...
#. fr: Tant pis... Je n'ai plus qu'a espérer qu'un membre d'une délégation passe à proximité et accepte de m'aider.
#. column 56: It's an honor to meet you, Warrior of Light. My name is Ebrelnaux, and I serve under your friend Cid Garlond in the Ironworks, but it wasn't always this way. I was once a magitek engineer, stationed right at this very location.
#. column 57: My area of expertise was the automation of machina used in everyday life, that it may be used by the common man. Eventually, the military expressed an interest in my work and requisitioned it for their own ends. The warmachina that haunt these ruins are driven by the magitek I created, though it has changed much since my defection.
#. column 58: I seek to gain a greater understanding of the latest Garlean technological advances, in order to silence these instruments of destruction. Will you grant me your protection while I scour the area for research materials?
#. column 59: Protect Ebrelnaux?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:644:0:62"
msgid "Understood. I shall look to other members of our contingent for aid. With luck, someone will pass through ere long."
msgstr "Понимаю. Попрошу о помощи других участников нашей экспедиции. Надеюсь, кто-нибудь скоро будет проходить мимо."

#. ja: エブレルノ氏は、ガーロンド社の中でも、<br>暗号解析の第一人者としても知られています。
#. de: Seit Ebrelnaux den Metallwerken beigetreten ist, hat er viel dazu beigetragen, geheime Daten des Kaiserreichs zu entschlüsseln.
#. fr: De tous les employés de Garlond, Ebrelnaux est connu pour être celui qui savait le mieux décoder des com<shy>bi<shy>nai<shy>sons de chiffres.
#. column 57: From what I hear, he has even helped uncover information relating to the Meteor project from records made prior to the Seventh Umbral Calamity. Though that has little relevance to the task at hand, it does illustrate how vital Ebrelnaux is to Eorzea and her allies. He must be protected at all costs.
msgctxt "FateEvent:645:0:56"
msgid "Since joining the Ironworks, Ebrelnaux has contributed a great deal to decrypting data deemed sensitive by the Empire."
msgstr "С тех пор как Эбрено поступил в Гарлондские мастерские, он немало помог расшифровать данные, которые Империя держала в секрете."

#. ja: 亡命後は、その知見を活かして、<br>第七霊災直前にもメテオ計劃の秘密を暴くために、<br>貢献しておられたのだとか……。
#. de: Man sagt sogar, er habe Informationen über Projekt Meteor in Auf<shy>zeich<shy>nun<shy>gen entdeckt, die vor der Siebten Katastrophe gemacht wurden. Das hilft uns hier zwar nicht viel, zeigt aber, wie wichtig Ebrelnaux' Arbeit für Eorzea ist. Sein Leben muss um jeden Preis beschützt werden.
#. fr: Après son exil et juste avant le septième fléau, on dit qu'il a œuvré pour que soit révélé au grand jour le projet Météore.
#. column 56: Since joining the Ironworks, Ebrelnaux has contributed a great deal to decrypting data deemed sensitive by the Empire.
msgctxt "FateEvent:645:0:57"
msgid "From what I hear, he has even helped uncover information relating to the Meteor project from records made prior to the Seventh Umbral Calamity. Though that has little relevance to the task at hand, it does illustrate how vital Ebrelnaux is to Eorzea and her allies. He must be protected at all costs."
msgstr "Говорят, ему даже удалось найти сведения о проекте «Метеор» в документах, составленных до Седьмого Умбрального бедствия. К нынешнему делу это отношения не имеет, но показывает, насколько Эбрельно важен для Эорзеи и её союзников. Его нужно защитить любой ценой."

#. ja: 聞いてくれ、ついに新たな創造生物のイデアが完成したんだ！<br>ぜひ、私の斬新な新作と戦ってみてくれないか……！<br>いかなる戦いぶりを示すのか観察したいんだ！
#. de: Ich habe ein neues Konzept ersonnen! Möchtest du das neue Leben nicht einem Test unterziehen? Kämpfe und lass mich dabei zusehen.
#. fr: J'ai enfin terminé mon nouveau concept<nbsp>! Pourrais-tu te battre contre quelques prototypes, afin de le tester<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Discover the known unknown?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: So you will, then? What a helpful familiar you are! Now then, let us get down to business.
#. column 62: Ah, of course. I suppose, as a familiar, your time is not your own. Well, so be it. I shall find another more willing participant.
msgctxt "FateEvent:646:0:56"
msgid "Oh, what genius I am capable of. At last, my latest creation is complete─and my greatest one, too! Would you care to test it? Please say you will. I must see how it behaves in combat."
msgstr "Какой же я гений! Мой новый шедевр наконец готов — и это величайшее из моих творений! Не хочешь его испытать? Скажи, что согласен. Я должен увидеть, как он поведёт себя в бою."

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Kämpfst du gegen das neue Leben?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Combattre des prototypes du nouveau concept de Mélétos<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh, what genius I am capable of. At last, my latest creation is complete─and my greatest one, too! Would you care to test it? Please say you will. I must see how it behaves in combat.
#. column 60: So you will, then? What a helpful familiar you are! Now then, let us get down to business.
#. column 62: Ah, of course. I suppose, as a familiar, your time is not your own. Well, so be it. I shall find another more willing participant.
