msgstr "Помочь выполнить задание?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 応援要請の受諾を確認……協力に感謝する。<br>作戦行動プロトコル起動、広域への通信を開始する。
#. de: Unterstützungsanfrage bestätigt. Strategieprotokoll eingeleitet. Aktiviere Kommunikator.
#. fr: Merci pour votre coopération.<br>Lancement des protocoles stratégiques en cours...<br>Activation des haut-parleurs.
#. column 56: Greetings! This unit's directive is to recover memory from siege unit Chi. However, analysis indicates that the current communications device is insufficient to make contact. Mission assistance requested.
#. column 57: Provide mission assistance?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Resuming emergency distress projection...
msgctxt "FateEvent:651:0:60"
msgid "Request acceptance confirmed...gratitude protocol active. Initiating transmission. "
msgstr "Запрос о помощи принят... Протокол благодарности активирован. Начинаю передачу."

#. ja: 応援要請の拒否を確認……<br>引き続き、緊急通信を発しつつ、応援を待つ。
#. de: Unterstützungsanfrage abgelehnt. Sende weiter Notsignal und warte auf Unterstützung.
#. fr: Refus de coopération... confirmé.<br>Poursuite de l'émission du signal de détresse.
#. column 56: Greetings! This unit's directive is to recover memory from siege unit Chi. However, analysis indicates that the current communications device is insufficient to make contact. Mission assistance requested.
#. column 57: Provide mission assistance?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Request acceptance confirmed...gratitude protocol active. Initiating transmission.
msgctxt "FateEvent:651:0:62"
msgid "Rejection acknowledged. Resuming emergency distress projection..."
msgstr "Отказ принят. Возобновляю передачу сигнала бедствия..."

#. ja: スキャニング終了……目標物を未所持と判断。<br>「レアマテリアル」の回収を要請する。
#. de: Scan abgeschlossen. Zielvorgabe nicht erreicht. Bauteile zur Aufrüstung des Kommunikators benötigt.
#. fr: Vision X activée... Absence des objets requis confirmée.<br>Veuillez récupérer les matériaux rares demandés.
msgctxt "FateEvent:652:0:56"
msgid "Scanning... Target not detected. Collection of precious scrap requested."
msgstr "Сканирование... Цель не обнаружена. Требуется собрать ценный металлолом."

#. ja: スキャニング終了……目標物を所持と判断。<br>当機への「レアマテリアル」の引き渡しを要請する。
#. de: Scan abgeschlossen. Zielvorgabe nicht erreicht. Erbitte Lieferung der Kommunikator-Bauteile.
#. fr: Vision X activée... Présence des objets requis confirmée.<br>Veuillez remettre les matériaux rares demandés.
#. column 60: Preciousness of scrap confirmed. Reinitiating gratitude protocol.
#. column 61: For best results, further provision of precious scrap is requested. This unit thanks you in advance.
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Disappointment levels increasing...
msgctxt "FateEvent:653:0:56"
msgid "Scanning... Target detected. Transfer of precious scrap to this unit requested."
msgstr "Сканирование... Цель обнаружена. Требуется передать этому подразделению ценный металлолом."

#. ja: 状況通知：「レアマテリアル」を確認……<br>作戦への献身的な協力に感謝する。
#. de: Statusmeldung: Kommunikator-Bauteile erhalten. Danke für den wichtigen Beitrag.
#. fr: État d'avancement<nbsp>: composants rares bien reçus.<br>Merci pour votre coopération.
#. column 56: Scanning... Target detected. Transfer of precious scrap to this unit requested.
#. column 61: For best results, further provision of precious scrap is requested. This unit thanks you in advance.
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Disappointment levels increasing...
msgctxt "FateEvent:653:0:60"
msgid "Preciousness of scrap confirmed. Reinitiating gratitude protocol."
msgstr "Ценность металлолома подтверждена. Повторно активирую протокол благодарности."

#. ja: しかし、通信機を拡張するには、<br>未だ相当量の「レアマテリアル」が不足していると判断する。<br>応援要請：回収任務の継続、以上！
#. de: Ergebnis der Analyse: Weitere Bauteile werden benötigt. Erbitte weitere Unterstützung bei der Beschaffung.
#. fr: Notez que plus de composants sont nécessaires afin d'améliorer mon détecteur. Votre aide reste donc requise. Veuillez poursuivre votre mission<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Scanning... Target detected. Transfer of precious scrap to this unit requested.
#. column 60: Preciousness of scrap confirmed. Reinitiating gratitude protocol.
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Disappointment levels increasing...
msgctxt "FateEvent:653:0:61"
msgid "For best results, further provision of precious scrap is requested. This unit thanks you in advance."
msgstr "Для успешного выполнения задания требуется дополнительный ценный металлолом. Это подразделение заранее выражает благодарность."

#. ja: 要請の拒否を確認……<br>再度、当機への「レアマテリアル」の引き渡しを要請する。
#. de: Unterstützungsanfrage abgelehnt. Erbitte weiterhin Lieferung der Kommunikator-Bauteile.
#. fr: Refus de livraison confirmé...<br>Je requiers toujours des composants rares. Veuillez me les remettre.
#. column 56: Scanning... Target detected. Transfer of precious scrap to this unit requested.
#. column 60: Preciousness of scrap confirmed. Reinitiating gratitude protocol.
#. column 61: For best results, further provision of precious scrap is requested. This unit thanks you in advance.
msgctxt "FateEvent:653:0:62"
msgid "Rejection acknowledged. Disappointment levels increasing..."
msgstr "Отказ принят. Уровень разочарования повышается..."

#. ja: スキャニング終了……目標物を未所持と判断。<br>「レアマテリアル」を発見した場合は、当機への引き渡しを要請する。
#. de: Analyseergebnis: Zielvorgabe nicht erreicht. Erbitte Lieferung der Kommunikator-Bauteile.
#. fr: Vision X activée... Absence des objets requis confirmée.<br>Veuillez récupérer les matériaux rares demandés.
msgctxt "FateEvent:654:0:56"
msgid "Scanning... Target not detected. Collection of precious scrap requested."
msgstr "Сканирование... Цель не обнаружена. Требуется собрать ценный металлолом."

#. ja: スキャニング終了……目標物を所持と判断。<br>当機への「レアマテリアル」の引き渡しを要請する。
#. de: Scan abgeschlossen. Zielvorgabe nicht erreicht. Erbitte Lieferung der Kommunikator-Bauteile.
#. fr: Vision X activée... Présence des objets requis confirmée.<br>Veuillez remettre les matériaux rares demandés.
#. column 60: Preciousness of scrap confirmed. Reinitiating gratitude protocol and increasing output to maximum.
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Disappointment levels increasing...
msgctxt "FateEvent:655:0:56"
msgid "Scanning... Target detected. Transfer of precious scrap to this unit requested."
msgstr "Сканирование... Цель обнаружена. Требуется передать этому подразделению ценный металлолом."

#. ja: 状況通知：「レアマテリアル」を確認……<br>作戦への献身的な協力に感謝する。
#. de: Statusmeldung: Kommunikator-Bauteile erhalten. Danke für den wichtigen Beitrag.
#. fr: État d'avancement<nbsp>: composants rares bien reçus.<br>Merci pour votre coopération.
#. column 56: Scanning... Target detected. Transfer of precious scrap to this unit requested.
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Disappointment levels increasing...
msgctxt "FateEvent:655:0:60"
msgid "Preciousness of scrap confirmed. Reinitiating gratitude protocol and increasing output to maximum."
msgstr "Ценность металлолома подтверждена. Повторно активирую протокол благодарности с максимальной громкостью."

#. ja: 要請の拒否を確認……<br>再度、当機への「レアマテリアル」の引き渡しを要請する。
#. de: Unterstützungsanfrage abgelehnt. Erbitte weiterhin Lieferung der Kommunikator-Bauteile.
#. fr: Refus de livraison confirmé...<br>Je requiers toujours des composants rares. Veuillez me les remettre.
#. column 56: Scanning... Target detected. Transfer of precious scrap to this unit requested.
#. column 60: Preciousness of scrap confirmed. Reinitiating gratitude protocol and increasing output to maximum.
msgctxt "FateEvent:655:0:62"
msgid "Rejection acknowledged. Disappointment levels increasing..."
msgstr "Отказ принят. Уровень разочарования повышается..."

#. ja: 連日、深夜に及ぶ研究開発で、<br>肌荒れに悩む研究者や職員は多い……。<br>そこで私は考えたのだ！
#. de: Viele Forscher führen bis tief in die Nacht Experimente durch. Darunter leidet ihre Haut. Ich habe eine Idee, wie wir da Abhilfe schaffen können!
#. fr: Jour après jour, de nombreux chercheurs et autres employés du Labyrinthos souffrent de problèmes de peau sèche, causés par le stress et les nuits blanches à répétition... mais j'ai trouvé la solution<nbsp>!
#. column 57: For this new batch, I require fresh fragments from these perpetually moist somas. Quickly now─my colleagues are in dire need of dermal rehydration!
#. column 58: Help collect soma fragments?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Let the harvesting commence! Collect samples directly from the somas if you are feeling bold─if not, the fragments they shed upon the ground will serve just as well.
#. column 62: What? You have bigger things to worry about? That's what they all say until the flaking starts!
msgctxt "FateEvent:656:0:56"
msgid "Poring over research papers until the early hours does one's pores no favors...which is why I began a new study on moisturizers!"
msgstr "Чтение научных трудов до глубокой ночи вредно для пор! Поэтому я и занялся разработкой увлажняющих средств!"

#. ja: ソーマから剥落した欠片を用いて、<br>新機軸の保湿液を作ればいいとね……！<br>さあ、収集を手伝ってくれたまえ！
#. de: Die Soma sondern eine natürliche Feuchtigkeit ab. Aus ihnen möchte ich eine wirkungsvolle Hautsalbe entwickeln. Bitte besorge einige Soma-Splitter für mich!
#. fr: Je vais fabriquer une lotion hydratante ré-vo-lu-tion-naire à partir des petits éclats que les somas laissent tomber derrière eux. Allons, prêtez-moi main-forte pour le bien des épidermes fragilisés<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Poring over research papers until the early hours does one's pores no favors...which is why I began a new study on moisturizers!
#. column 58: Help collect soma fragments?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Let the harvesting commence! Collect samples directly from the somas if you are feeling bold─if not, the fragments they shed upon the ground will serve just as well.
#. column 62: What? You have bigger things to worry about? That's what they all say until the flaking starts!
msgctxt "FateEvent:656:0:57"
msgid "For this new batch, I require fresh fragments from these perpetually moist somas. Quickly now─my colleagues are in dire need of dermal rehydration!"
msgstr "Для новой партии мне нужны свежие осколки этих постоянно влажных сом. Живее! Моим коллегам срочно нужно увлажнить кожу!"

#. ja: ソーマの欠片を集めますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du der hübschen Forscherin helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la chercheuse à ramasser des éclats de soma<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Poring over research papers until the early hours does one's pores no favors...which is why I began a new study on moisturizers!
#. column 57: For this new batch, I require fresh fragments from these perpetually moist somas. Quickly now─my colleagues are in dire need of dermal rehydration!
#. column 60: Let the harvesting commence! Collect samples directly from the somas if you are feeling bold─if not, the fragments they shed upon the ground will serve just as well.
#. column 62: What? You have bigger things to worry about? That's what they all say until the flaking starts!
