msgctxt "FateEvent:656:0:58"
msgid "Help collect soma fragments?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать осколки сом?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: フフフ……君も私の研究の重要さを認識したようだね。<br>潤いたっぷりのモイスチャー・ソーマを倒すか、<br>周囲に剥落している欠片を集めてくれたまえ！
#. de: Ach, du bist ein Schatz! Es freut mich sehr, dass du meine Forschung unterstützt. Also, wie gesagt, ich brauche Soma-Splitter!
#. fr: Je me réjouis de voir que vous saisissez l'importance vitale de mes recherches. Et maintenant, au travail<nbsp>! Terrassez les somas givrés ou ramassez les éclats de soma éparpillés au sol<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Poring over research papers until the early hours does one's pores no favors...which is why I began a new study on moisturizers!
#. column 57: For this new batch, I require fresh fragments from these perpetually moist somas. Quickly now─my colleagues are in dire need of dermal rehydration!
#. column 58: Help collect soma fragments?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: What? You have bigger things to worry about? That's what they all say until the flaking starts!
msgctxt "FateEvent:656:0:60"
msgid "Let the harvesting commence! Collect samples directly from the somas if you are feeling bold─if not, the fragments they shed upon the ground will serve just as well."
msgstr "Приступим к сбору! Если не боишься — добывай образцы прямо из сом. А если не хочется рисковать, подойдут и осколки, которые они сбрасывают на землю."

#. ja: なん……だと……！？<br>私の研究の重要さが認識できないというのか！
#. de: Wie bitte?! Hältst du meine Forschung etwa für überflüssig?!
#. fr: Tss<nbsp>! Dire qu'il existe des personnes incapables de reconnaître un projet d'utilité publique quand elles en voient un...
#. column 56: Poring over research papers until the early hours does one's pores no favors...which is why I began a new study on moisturizers!
#. column 57: For this new batch, I require fresh fragments from these perpetually moist somas. Quickly now─my colleagues are in dire need of dermal rehydration!
#. column 58: Help collect soma fragments?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Let the harvesting commence! Collect samples directly from the somas if you are feeling bold─if not, the fragments they shed upon the ground will serve just as well.
msgctxt "FateEvent:656:0:62"
msgid "What? You have bigger things to worry about? That's what they all say until the flaking starts!"
msgstr "Что? У тебя есть дела поважнее? Все так говорят, пока кожа не начинает шелушиться!"

#. ja: おぉ、見事な潤い……！<br>その「ソーマの欠片」を提供していただけるかな？
#. de: Na, <if $gn4>du Gute<else>du Guter</if>! Bringst du mir Soma-Splitter?
#. fr: M'apportez-vous des éclats de soma<nbsp>? Comme j'ai hâte de sentir leur fraîcheur hydratante entre mes mains<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Yes, this will form the perfect base for the lotion I have in mind. But I will need more fragments for my experiments! More fragments, I say!
#. column 62: What is this mutiny? Are...are you stealing my research premise!? Soma-based lotion is MY idea!
msgctxt "FateEvent:657:0:56"
msgid "Ah, such a wondrous source of moisture! Now, if you'll just surrender your samples to me..."
msgstr "Ах, сколько влаги! А теперь отдай-ка мне свои образцы..."

#. ja: 素晴らしい……！<br>これがあれば保湿液の開発が捗りそうだ！<br>もし、また見つけたら持ってきてくれたまえよ！
#. de: Wundervoll! Genau, was ich für die neue Hautsalbe brauche. Davon kann ich noch mehr gebrauchen!
#. fr: Merveilleux<nbsp>! Je sens que le résultat sera à la hauteur de mes espérances. Si vous en trouvez d'autres, je suis preneuse<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ah, such a wondrous source of moisture! Now, if you'll just surrender your samples to me...
#. column 62: What is this mutiny? Are...are you stealing my research premise!? Soma-based lotion is MY idea!
msgctxt "FateEvent:657:0:60"
msgid "Yes, this will form the perfect base for the lotion I have in mind. But I will need more fragments for my experiments! More fragments, I say! "
msgstr "Да, из этого получится идеальная основа для моего лосьона. Но для экспериментов нужно больше осколков! Ещё осколков, говорю!"

#. ja: ハッ……まさか、その「ソーマの欠片」を使って、<br>私に対抗する保湿液を開発するつもりか！？<br>アイディアの盗用は許さんぞ！
#. de: Was?! Du willst doch nicht etwa ein Konkurrenzprodukt herstellen, oder?! Ideendiebstahl wird hart bestraft!
#. fr: Ah, je vois<nbsp>! Vous voulez fabriquer votre propre lotion hydratante pour me faire de l'ombre<nbsp>!? C'était <i>mon</i> idée, je vous signale<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ah, such a wondrous source of moisture! Now, if you'll just surrender your samples to me...
#. column 60: Yes, this will form the perfect base for the lotion I have in mind. But I will need more fragments for my experiments! More fragments, I say!
msgctxt "FateEvent:657:0:62"
msgid "What is this mutiny? Are...are you stealing my research premise!? Soma-based lotion is MY idea!"
msgstr "Что это ещё за бунт? Ты... ты что, собираешься украсть мою идею?! Лосьон на основе сом — МОЯ задумка!"

#. ja: 新機軸の保湿液を作るために、<br>潤いたっぷりの「ソーマの欠片」を求めている。<br>ぜひ、回収に協力してくれたまえ！
#. de: Ich benötige die Soma-Splitter, um daraus eine feuchtigkeitsspendende Hautsalbe zu entwickeln. Ich zähl auf deine Hilfe!
#. fr: J'ai besoin d'éclats de soma pour fabriquer une lotion hydratante. Toute aide sera la bienvenue<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:658:0:56"
msgid "Empty hands means dry skin! Please, I must have those soma fragments!"
msgstr "Без осколков сом кожа сохнет! Прошу, мне нужны эти осколки!"

#. ja: これだけの量があれば新機軸の保湿液も……。<br>もしも、また「ソーマの欠片」を見つけたなら、<br>私が研究に戻る前に渡してくれたまえよ？
#. de: Sehr gut, das reicht für den Anfang. Falls du noch mehr Soma-Splitter findest, nehme ich sie dir gerne ab.
#. fr: Avec tous ces éclats de soma, mon projet pourrait bien devenir réalité... mais si vous en trouvez plus, n'hésitez pas à me les remettre avant que je retourne à mon laboratoire<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:659:0:56"
msgid "This should be enough samples to develop my new line of lotions, but I can spare a few moments for a healthy surplus. Bring me all the fragments you can!"
msgstr "Этого должно хватить, чтобы разработать новую линейку лосьонов, но я не откажусь и от запаса. Собери все осколки, какие найдёшь!"

#. ja: おぉ、見事な潤い……！<br>その「ソーマの欠片」を提供していただけるかな？
#. de: Na, <if $gn4>du Gute<else>du Guter</if>! Bringst du mir Soma-Splitter?
#. fr: M'apportez-vous des éclats de soma<nbsp>? Comme j'ai hâte de sentir leur fraîcheur hydratante entre mes mains<nbsp>!
#. column 60: My sample bag overfloweth! Thanks to your assistance, I will soon perfect the formula for a miracle moisturizer!
#. column 62: What is this mutiny? Are...are you stealing my research premise!? Soma-based lotion is MY idea!
msgctxt "FateEvent:660:0:56"
msgid "Ah, such a wondrous source of moisture! Now, if you'll just surrender your samples to me..."
msgstr "Ах, сколько влаги! А теперь отдай-ка мне свои образцы..."

#. ja: うむ、これくらいの量があれば充分だろう。<br>新機軸の保湿液が完成する日は近いぞ！<br>協力に感謝する！
#. de: Perfekt, das reicht für die Entwicklung der neuen Hautsalbe. Vielen Dank für deine Hilfe!
#. fr: Parfait<nbsp>! Je devrais en avoir largement assez pour mener mes recherches à bien. La révolution cutanée est en marche<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ah, such a wondrous source of moisture! Now, if you'll just surrender your samples to me...
#. column 62: What is this mutiny? Are...are you stealing my research premise!? Soma-based lotion is MY idea!
msgctxt "FateEvent:660:0:60"
msgid "My sample bag overfloweth! Thanks to your assistance, I will soon perfect the formula for a miracle moisturizer!"
msgstr "Чудесно! Благодаря тебе у меня скоро будет идеальная формула чудодейственного увлажняющего средства!"

#. ja: ハッ……まさか、その「ソーマの欠片」を使って、<br>私に対抗する保湿液を開発するつもりか！？<br>アイディアの盗用は許さんぞ！
#. de: Was?! Du willst doch nicht etwa ein Konkurrenzprodukt herstellen, oder?! Ideendiebstahl wird hart bestraft!
#. fr: Ah, je vois<nbsp>! Vous voulez fabriquer votre propre lotion hydratante pour me faire de l'ombre<nbsp>!? C'était <i>mon</i> idée, je vous signale<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Ah, such a wondrous source of moisture! Now, if you'll just surrender your samples to me...
#. column 60: My sample bag overfloweth! Thanks to your assistance, I will soon perfect the formula for a miracle moisturizer!
msgctxt "FateEvent:660:0:62"
msgid "What is this mutiny? Are...are you stealing my research premise!? Soma-based lotion is MY idea!"
msgstr "Что это ещё за бунт? Ты... ты что, собираешься украсть мою идею?! Лосьон на основе сом — МОЯ задумка!"

#. ja: ひぃぃっ、大変だぁぁ！<br>君、すまない……散らばった書類を回収してくれないか！？<br>アニラたちに、風で吹き飛ばされてしまったんだ！
#. de: Oje, die Sturm-Anilas haben meine Dokumente in alle Himmels<shy>rich<shy>tungen verteilt. Bitte, hilf mir, sie wieder einzusammeln!
#. fr: Aaaaah, c'est la paniiiique<nbsp>!!! Ces fichus anilas des tempêtes ont éparpillé les documents que je transportais<nbsp>!
#. column 57: These documents are <i>extremely</i> sensitive. If someone were to find and read that information, the repercussions could end my career!
#. column 58: Help collect the confidential documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Scholar! Please, hand all the papers you find directly to me, and <i>only</i> me!
#. column 62: Then I'm doomed. I'll never recover all those papers before someone stumbles across them...
msgctxt "FateEvent:661:0:56"
msgid "Oh gods, you have to help me! I was walking past those anilas and they erupted into gale-force winds! Now my papers are scattered all over the place..."
msgstr "О боги, помоги мне! Я проходил мимо этих анил, как вдруг они подняли ураганный ветер! Теперь мои бумаги разлетелись повсюду..."

#. ja: あれには機密情報が書かれていて、<br>もし他の人に見られたら、私の命が……！<br>お願いだ、回収を手伝ってくれないか！？
#. de: Die Dokumente enthalten strenggeheime Konstruktionspläne. Wenn sie in fremde Hände fallen, bin ich geliefert!
#. fr: Ces papiers contiennent des in<shy>for<shy>ma<shy>tions strictement confidentielles. Si jamais des personnes non autorisées tombent dessus, je suis un homme mort... Pitié, aidez-moi à les ramasser<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh gods, you have to help me! I was walking past those anilas and they erupted into gale-force winds! Now my papers are scattered all over the place...
#. column 58: Help collect the confidential documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Scholar! Please, hand all the papers you find directly to me, and <i>only</i> me!
#. column 62: Then I'm doomed. I'll never recover all those papers before someone stumbles across them...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:661:0:57"
msgid "These documents are <i>extremely</i> sensitive. If someone were to find and read that information, the repercussions could end my career!"
msgstr "Эти документы <i>чрезвычайно</i> секретны. Если кто-нибудь найдёт их и прочтёт, последствия могут стоить мне карьеры!"

#. ja: 最重要機密書類を回収する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du die Geheimdokumente einsammeln?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le chercheur à ramasser les documents<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh gods, you have to help me! I was walking past those anilas and they erupted into gale-force winds! Now my papers are scattered all over the place...
#. column 57: These documents are <i>extremely</i> sensitive. If someone were to find and read that information, the repercussions could end my career!
#. column 60: Praise the Scholar! Please, hand all the papers you find directly to me, and <i>only</i> me!
#. column 62: Then I'm doomed. I'll never recover all those papers before someone stumbles across them...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
