#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:661:0:58"
msgid "Help collect the confidential documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать секретные документы?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとう……！<br>集めた「最重要機密書類」は、私に直接手渡してくれ。<br>それじゃ、頼んだよ！
#. de: Tausend Dank! Bitte bring mir alle Geheimdokumente, die du findest!
#. fr: Vous me sauvez la vie<nbsp>! Rapportez-moi directement tous les documents ultra-confidentiels que vous trouverez. Et in<shy>ter<shy>dic<shy>tion de les lire avant<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh gods, you have to help me! I was walking past those anilas and they erupted into gale-force winds! Now my papers are scattered all over the place...
#. column 57: These documents are <i>extremely</i> sensitive. If someone were to find and read that information, the repercussions could end my career!
#. column 58: Help collect the confidential documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then I'm doomed. I'll never recover all those papers before someone stumbles across them...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:661:0:60"
msgid "Praise the Scholar! Please, hand all the papers you find directly to me, and <i>only</i> me!"
msgstr "Да пребудет с нами учёность! Прошу, все найденные бумаги отдавай лично мне и <i>только</i> мне!"

#. ja: 嗚呼、そんな……<br>あの「最重要機密書類」の内容が世間にバレたら……<br>私の命は……いったい、どうすればいいんだ！
#. de: Nein?! Aber was soll ich denn jetzt bloß tun? Die Dokumente dürfen auf keinen Fall in fremde Hände fallen!
#. fr: Quoi<nbsp>!? Mais je n'arriverai jamais à tous les ramasser à moi seul<nbsp>! Et si jamais ces in<shy>for<shy>ma<shy>tions fuitent... Hiiii, je ne veux même pas imaginer ce qui m'arrivera<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh gods, you have to help me! I was walking past those anilas and they erupted into gale-force winds! Now my papers are scattered all over the place...
#. column 57: These documents are <i>extremely</i> sensitive. If someone were to find and read that information, the repercussions could end my career!
#. column 58: Help collect the confidential documents?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Praise the Scholar! Please, hand all the papers you find directly to me, and <i>only</i> me!
msgctxt "FateEvent:661:0:62"
msgid "Then I'm doomed. I'll never recover all those papers before someone stumbles across them..."
msgstr "Тогда мне конец. Я не успею собрать бумаги, пока кто-нибудь на них не наткнулся..."

#. ja: そ、その手に持っているのは……！
#. de: Was hast du gefunden?
#. fr: Ces papiers que vous tenez à la main, est-ce bien ce que je pense<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Yes, this was part of the report I was charged with filing. Please keep looking! The rest of it is still out there!
#. column 62: You don't mean to <i>read</i> them, do you? Not after everything I told you! Your very life could be forfeit!
msgctxt "FateEvent:662:0:56"
msgid "Is that...? Did you find them!?"
msgstr "Это... Ты их нашёл?!"

#. ja: 間違いない、飛ばされた「最重要機密書類」だ！<br>ありがとう、まだまだあるはずだから、引き続き頼むよ！
#. de: Ja, das ist ein Teil der Geheimdokumente! Vielen Dank! Es fehlen aber noch einige. Bitte schau nach, ob du sie findest.
#. fr: Oui, c'est bien une partie des documents que j'ai fait tomber<nbsp>! Mais il en reste encore beaucoup... Ne relâchez pas vos efforts<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Is that...? Did you find them!?
#. column 62: You don't mean to <i>read</i> them, do you? Not after everything I told you! Your very life could be forfeit!
msgctxt "FateEvent:662:0:60"
msgid "Yes, this was part of the report I was charged with filing. Please keep looking! The rest of it is still out there!"
msgstr "Да, это часть отчёта, который мне поручили сдать. Продолжай поиски! Остальные листы ещё где-то там!"

#. ja: なんだって……！？<br>その「最重要機密書類」の中身に目を通すつもりじゃないよね？<br>やめたほうがいい……君の命だって危なくなるぞ！？
#. de: Du hast doch nicht etwa vor, die Geheimdokumente zu lesen, oder?! Das könnte dein Leben gefährden!
#. fr: A-attendez... vous ne voulez quand même pas les garder pour vous<nbsp>!? Ne rigolez pas avec ces choses-là, certains ont mal fini pour moins que ça<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Is that...? Did you find them!?
#. column 60: Yes, this was part of the report I was charged with filing. Please keep looking! The rest of it is still out there!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:662:0:62"
msgid "You don't mean to <i>read</i> them, do you? Not after everything I told you! Your very life could be forfeit!"
msgstr "Ты ведь не собираешься их <i>читать</i>? После всего, что я тебе рассказал! Тебе же это жизнью грозит!"

#. ja: 力を貸してくれ！<br>「最重要機密書類」が散らばってしまったんだ！<br>回収してくれたら、必ず礼はしよう！
#. de: Hilfe, einige Geheimdokumente wurden in der Gegend verstreut. Bitte sammle sie schnell ein! Ich werde dich dafür belohnen!
#. fr: Pitié, aidez-moi à ramasser ces documents ultra-confidentiels<nbsp>! Je vous promets de vous récompenser<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:663:0:56"
msgid "I must recover those documents! Gather all the papers you can, and I swear, I'll make it worth your while!"
msgstr "Мне нужно вернуть эти документы! Собери все бумаги, какие найдёшь, и я обещаю щедро тебя отблагодарить!"

#. ja: これだけあれば、もう大丈夫だろう……。<br>回収を手伝ってくれたこと、本当に感謝するよ！
#. de: Das reicht. Vielen Dank für deine Hilfe!
#. fr: Je crois avoir récupéré les documents les plus essentiels... Merci mille fois pour votre aide<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:664:0:56"
msgid "Well done─I think we've recovered all the most important sections. Now I can breathe again..."
msgstr "Отлично! Кажется, мы нашли все самые важные части. Теперь можно выдохнуть..."

#. ja: そ、その手に持っているのは……！
#. de: Was hast du gefunden?
#. fr: Ces papiers que vous tenez à la main, est-ce bien ce que je pense<nbsp>?
#. column 60: You have my gratitude! I don't think we're missing any vital information, but it doesn't hurt to be thorough!
#. column 62: You don't mean to <i>read</i> them, do you? Not after everything I told you! Your very life could be forfeit!
msgctxt "FateEvent:665:0:56"
msgid "You found more papers?"
msgstr "Нашёл ещё бумаги?"

#. ja: ありがとう……！<br>これで大半の「最重要機密書類」は揃ったはずだ……！
#. de: Vielen Dank! Damit ist ein Großteil der Geheimdokumente gerettet!
#. fr: Oui, c'est bien une partie des documents que j'ai fait tomber<nbsp>! Grâce à vous, je les ai quasiment tous récupérés<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You found more papers?
#. column 62: You don't mean to <i>read</i> them, do you? Not after everything I told you! Your very life could be forfeit!
msgctxt "FateEvent:665:0:60"
msgid "You have my gratitude! I don't think we're missing any vital information, but it doesn't hurt to be thorough!"
msgstr "Спасибо тебе! Вроде бы ничего важного не пропало, но лишняя проверка не помешает!"

#. ja: なんだって……！？<br>その「最重要機密書類」の中身に目を通すつもりじゃないよね？<br>やめたほうがいい……君の命だって危なくなるぞ！？
#. de: Du hast doch nicht etwa vor, die Geheimdokumente zu lesen, oder?! Das könnte dein Leben gefährden!
#. fr: A-attendez... vous ne voulez quand même pas les garder pour vous<nbsp>!? Ne rigolez pas avec ces choses-là, certains ont mal fini pour moins que ça<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You found more papers?
#. column 60: You have my gratitude! I don't think we're missing any vital information, but it doesn't hurt to be thorough!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:665:0:62"
msgid "You don't mean to <i>read</i> them, do you? Not after everything I told you! Your very life could be forfeit!"
msgstr "Ты ведь не собираешься их <i>читать</i>? После всего, что я тебе рассказал! Тебе же это жизнью грозит!"

#. ja: すみません……助けてください！<br>消化液を撒き散らすスナップウィードの大群が、<br>放牧地に迫っているんです。
#. de: Zu Hilfe! Schnappkräuter haben es auf meine lieben Merinos abgesehen!
#. fr: Aidez-moi, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>! Une horde de balsamines écumeuses se dirige par ici, juste au moment où les mérinos sont au pré<nbsp>!
#. column 57: We have to protect the sheep, or all that fluffy wool they've been growing will be ruined before we can shear it. Ruined, I tell you!
#. column 58: Help protect the sheep?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! My clothes are not exactly acid resistant, so I'll just cower over there while you take care of things, shall I?
#. column 62: ...Allergic to digestive acids? I quite understand, but what am I to do about my flock!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:666:0:56"
msgid "Please, I need your help! Our pastures are under siege by an acid-spitting mob of snapweeds!"
msgstr "Прошу, помоги! Наши пастбища атакует целая стая плевел, брызгающихся кислотой!"

#. ja: このままでは、メリノたちが蓄えた、<br>毛刈り前のフワフワの毛が台無しに……！<br>どうかフロシング・スナップウィードを追い払ってください！
#. de: Sie verspucken ein Ver<shy>dau<shy>ungs<shy>se<shy>kret, durch das die flauschige Wolle unbrauchbar wird. Bitte vertreibe die Schnappkräuter, ehe sie meine Merinos zersetzen!
#. fr: Les balsamines ont la sale manie de cracher leur suc digestif sur tout ce qui bouge. Elles vont abîmer la toison soyeuse que les mérinos ont fait pousser sur toute une année... Je vous en prie, chassez ces mauvaises graines<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Please, I need your help! Our pastures are under siege by an acid-spitting mob of snapweeds!
#. column 58: Help protect the sheep?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! My clothes are not exactly acid resistant, so I'll just cower over there while you take care of things, shall I?
#. column 62: ...Allergic to digestive acids? I quite understand, but what am I to do about my flock!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:666:0:57"
msgid "We have to protect the sheep, or all that fluffy wool they've been growing will be ruined before we can shear it. Ruined, I tell you!"
msgstr "Надо защитить овец, иначе их пушистая шерсть испортится ещё до стрижки. Совсем испортится, говорю тебе!"

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du die Merinos retten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le berger<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Please, I need your help! Our pastures are under siege by an acid-spitting mob of snapweeds!
#. column 57: We have to protect the sheep, or all that fluffy wool they've been growing will be ruined before we can shear it. Ruined, I tell you!
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! My clothes are not exactly acid resistant, so I'll just cower over there while you take care of things, shall I?
#. column 62: ...Allergic to digestive acids? I quite understand, but what am I to do about my flock!?
