#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:666:0:58"
msgid "Help protect the sheep?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь защитить овец?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとう！<br>私のかわいいメリノたちを守ってやってください！
#. de: Danke! Bitte beschütze meine Lieblinge!
#. fr: Oh, merci<nbsp>! Je compte sur vous pour protéger mes petits mérinos<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Please, I need your help! Our pastures are under siege by an acid-spitting mob of snapweeds!
#. column 57: We have to protect the sheep, or all that fluffy wool they've been growing will be ruined before we can shear it. Ruined, I tell you!
#. column 58: Help protect the sheep?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: ...Allergic to digestive acids? I quite understand, but what am I to do about my flock!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:666:0:60"
msgid "Thank you kindly! My clothes are not exactly acid resistant, so I'll just cower over there while you take care of things, shall I?"
msgstr "Спасибо! Моя одежда не очень-то устойчива к кислоте, так что я постою вон там, а ты уж разберись с ними, ладно?"

#. ja: そ、そうですか……。<br>どうしよう、他に誰かいないものか……！
#. de: Na schön ... Hoffentlich hilft mir jemand anderes.
#. fr: Vous devez être occupé<if $gn4>e</if>, je comprends... Mais qui va protéger mes petits mérinos, alors<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Please, I need your help! Our pastures are under siege by an acid-spitting mob of snapweeds!
#. column 57: We have to protect the sheep, or all that fluffy wool they've been growing will be ruined before we can shear it. Ruined, I tell you!
#. column 58: Help protect the sheep?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! My clothes are not exactly acid resistant, so I'll just cower over there while you take care of things, shall I?
msgctxt "FateEvent:666:0:62"
msgid "...Allergic to digestive acids? I quite understand, but what am I to do about my flock!?"
msgstr "...Аллергия на пищеварительную кислоту? Понимаю, конечно, но что же мне делать со стадом!?"

#. ja: あっ、ヤツらが来ました！<br>お願いします、メリノたちを守りながら、<br>フロシング・スナップウィードを追い払ってください！
#. de: D-Da sind sie! Schnell, die Schnappkräuter dürfen meinen armen Merinos nichts antun!
#. fr: Voilà ces satanées balsamines<nbsp>! Vite, chassez-les tout en protégeant les mérinos<nbsp>!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:667:0:56"
msgid "Scholar preserve us, they're here! Cut them, slash them, <i>burn</i> them if you must, but keep my merino wool pristine!"
msgstr "Учёные, спасите! Они здесь! Режьте, рубите, хоть <i>сожгите</i> их — только защитите шерсть моих мериносов!"

#. ja: 当機は、オミクロンN-6205、通信への応答に感謝する。<br>侵略兵器「カイ」のメモリーを回収するため、作戦遂行中……<br>護衛を要請する。
#. de: Omikron N-6205. Zugriff auf Datenbank der Angriffswaffe Chi eingeleitet. Erbitte Schutz.
#. fr: Merci d'avoir établi une transmission avec moi. Je me nomme N-6205. Ma mission actuelle demande que je récupère la banque de données de l'unité d'invasion Khi. Votre aide est sollicitée, mais non exigée.
#. column 57: Provide combat support?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Request acceptance confirmed...gratitude enhanced. This unit appreciates you most sincerely. Initiating transmission.
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Resuming emergency distress projection...
msgctxt "FateEvent:668:0:56"
msgid "Response to emergency projection detected... Gratitude protocol active. This unit's current mission is to retrieve the memory of siege unit Chi. Combat support requested."
msgstr "Ответ на сигнал бедствия обнаружен... Протокол благодарности активирован. Текущая задача этого подразделения — извлечь память осадного орудия «Кхи». Требуется боевая поддержка."

#. ja: N-6205に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du N-6205 beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider N-6205<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Response to emergency projection detected... Gratitude protocol active. This unit's current mission is to retrieve the memory of siege unit Chi. Combat support requested.
#. column 60: Request acceptance confirmed...gratitude enhanced. This unit appreciates you most sincerely. Initiating transmission.
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Resuming emergency distress projection...
