msgctxt "FateEvent:668:0:57"
msgid "Provide combat support?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Оказать боевую поддержку?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 応援要請の受諾を確認……協力に感謝する。<br>作戦行動プロトコル起動、広域への通信を開始する。
#. de: Unterstützungsanfrage bestätigt. Strategieprotokoll eingeleitet. Aktiviere Kommunikator.
#. fr: Merci pour votre coopération.<br>Lancement des protocoles stratégiques en cours...<br>Activation des haut-parleurs.
#. column 56: Response to emergency projection detected... Gratitude protocol active. This unit's current mission is to retrieve the memory of siege unit Chi. Combat support requested.
#. column 57: Provide combat support?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Rejection acknowledged. Resuming emergency distress projection...
msgctxt "FateEvent:668:0:60"
msgid "Request acceptance confirmed...gratitude enhanced. This unit appreciates you most sincerely. Initiating transmission."
msgstr "Запрос о помощи принят... Благодарность усилена. Это подразделение искренне ценит вашу помощь. Начинаю передачу."

#. ja: 応援要請の拒否を確認……<br>引き続き、緊急通信を発しつつ、応援を待つ。
#. de: Unterstützungsanfrage abgelehnt. Sende weiter Notsignal und warte auf Unterstützung.
#. fr: Refus de coopération... confirmé.<br>Poursuite de l'émission du signal de détresse.
#. column 56: Response to emergency projection detected... Gratitude protocol active. This unit's current mission is to retrieve the memory of siege unit Chi. Combat support requested.
#. column 57: Provide combat support?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Request acceptance confirmed...gratitude enhanced. This unit appreciates you most sincerely. Initiating transmission.
msgctxt "FateEvent:668:0:62"
msgid "Rejection acknowledged. Resuming emergency distress projection..."
msgstr "Отказ принят. Возобновляю передачу сигнала бедствия..."

#. ja: ガーロンド社のエブレルノ氏と共に、<br>彼が亡命前に研究していた技術の資料を求めて、<br>この魔導工廠に調査にやってきました。
#. de: Gut, dass du da bist! Ebrelnaux hat seine Arbeit im Feld fortgesetzt. So sind wir auf die Munitionsfabrik gestoßen.
#. fr: J'ai suivi Ebrelnaux jusqu'à l'usine de munitions. Il voulait récupérer les documents dont il se servait pour ses recherches, avant sa fuite de Garlemald.
#. column 57: This is where the existing weaponry underwent the automation process, allowing it to fight entirely independently...which is precisely what it's doing now.
#. column 58: These smaller units apparently don't have the parts Ebrelnaux is after, but we'll need to destroy them before we can proceed any further. Will you help us?
#. column 59: Vanquish the automated magitek?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your cooperation is much appreciated. I'll try enlisting the aid of more of our comrades while you set about tackling these security drones. May the Navigator guide your hand!
#. column 62: You are needed elsewhere, then. Very well, we'll attempt to fight our way through as best we can.
msgctxt "FateEvent:670:0:56"
msgid "Thank goodness you're here! Ebrelnaux is continuing his field research, and it's brought us to the munitions factory."
msgstr "Как хорошо, что ты пришёл! Эбрельно продолжает полевые исследования, и они привели нас на завод боеприпасов."

#. ja: 問題は、その技術が魔導兵器の無人化に、<br>応用されてしまっていたということ……。
#. de: Hier wurden Kriegsmaschinen automatisiert, damit sie unabhängig kämpfen können. Genau das ist der Grund, warum sie uns jetzt noch das Leben schwer machen.
#. fr: Le problème, c'est que la technologie qu'il a aidé à concevoir a servi au développement d'armes magitek sans pilotes... et pour être autonomes, elles le sont<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Thank goodness you're here! Ebrelnaux is continuing his field research, and it's brought us to the munitions factory.
#. column 58: These smaller units apparently don't have the parts Ebrelnaux is after, but we'll need to destroy them before we can proceed any further. Will you help us?
#. column 59: Vanquish the automated magitek?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your cooperation is much appreciated. I'll try enlisting the aid of more of our comrades while you set about tackling these security drones. May the Navigator guide your hand!
#. column 62: You are needed elsewhere, then. Very well, we'll attempt to fight our way through as best we can.
msgctxt "FateEvent:670:0:57"
msgid "This is where the existing weaponry underwent the automation process, allowing it to fight entirely independently...which is precisely what it's doing now."
msgstr "Здесь оружие автоматизировали, чтобы оно могло сражаться без участия человека... И теперь оно как раз этим и занимается."

#. ja: すでに危険な魔導兵器が無人化され、<br>起動してしまっているようです。<br>迎撃に協力していただけないでしょうか？
#. de: Die kleineren Einheiten verfügen zwar nicht über die Teile, an denen Ebrelnaux interessiert ist, aber sie müssen aus dem Weg geräumt werden. Hilfst du uns dabei?
#. fr: Il va nous falloir nous en débarrasser. Acceptez-vous de nous y aider<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Thank goodness you're here! Ebrelnaux is continuing his field research, and it's brought us to the munitions factory.
#. column 57: This is where the existing weaponry underwent the automation process, allowing it to fight entirely independently...which is precisely what it's doing now.
#. column 59: Vanquish the automated magitek?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your cooperation is much appreciated. I'll try enlisting the aid of more of our comrades while you set about tackling these security drones. May the Navigator guide your hand!
#. column 62: You are needed elsewhere, then. Very well, we'll attempt to fight our way through as best we can.
msgctxt "FateEvent:670:0:58"
msgid "These smaller units apparently don't have the parts Ebrelnaux is after, but we'll need to destroy them before we can proceed any further. Will you help us?"
msgstr "Похоже, в этих малых машинах нет деталей, которые нужны Эбрельно. Но прежде чем двигаться дальше, придётся их уничтожить. Поможешь нам?"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Beseitigst du die Magitek-Maschinen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider à vaincre les armes magitek<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Thank goodness you're here! Ebrelnaux is continuing his field research, and it's brought us to the munitions factory.
#. column 57: This is where the existing weaponry underwent the automation process, allowing it to fight entirely independently...which is precisely what it's doing now.
#. column 58: These smaller units apparently don't have the parts Ebrelnaux is after, but we'll need to destroy them before we can proceed any further. Will you help us?
#. column 60: Your cooperation is much appreciated. I'll try enlisting the aid of more of our comrades while you set about tackling these security drones. May the Navigator guide your hand!
#. column 62: You are needed elsewhere, then. Very well, we'll attempt to fight our way through as best we can.
