msgctxt "FateEvent:670:0:59"
msgid "Vanquish the automated magitek?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Уничтожить автоматические магитех-машины?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ご協力に感謝いたします！<br>それでは各グランドカンパニーの冒険者部隊と協力し、<br>魔導兵器たちの迎撃をお願いします！
#. de: Danke. Ich werde noch mehr Hilfe organisieren. Aber bitte, halte dich nicht zurück und beginne damit, die Maschinen zu dezimieren.
#. fr: Je suis heureuse que vous acceptiez<nbsp>! Des membres des grandes compagnies éorzéennes vous aideront également à abattre ces armes<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Thank goodness you're here! Ebrelnaux is continuing his field research, and it's brought us to the munitions factory.
#. column 57: This is where the existing weaponry underwent the automation process, allowing it to fight entirely independently...which is precisely what it's doing now.
#. column 58: These smaller units apparently don't have the parts Ebrelnaux is after, but we'll need to destroy them before we can proceed any further. Will you help us?
#. column 59: Vanquish the automated magitek?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: You are needed elsewhere, then. Very well, we'll attempt to fight our way through as best we can.
msgctxt "FateEvent:670:0:60"
msgid "Your cooperation is much appreciated. I'll try enlisting the aid of more of our comrades while you set about tackling these security drones. May the Navigator guide your hand!"
msgstr "Большое спасибо за помощь! Пока ты разберёшься с охранными дронами, я попробую собрать побольше наших товарищей. Да направит тебя Мореплаватель!"

#. ja: そ、そうですか……。<br>では、別の友軍部隊に協力を求めることにします。
#. de: Dann müssen wir es alleine schaffen. Hoffentlich halten sich die Verluste in Grenzen.
#. fr: Vous refusez<nbsp>? Dans ce cas, je me passerai de vos services et demanderai de l'aide à d'autres troupes alliées.
#. column 56: Thank goodness you're here! Ebrelnaux is continuing his field research, and it's brought us to the munitions factory.
#. column 57: This is where the existing weaponry underwent the automation process, allowing it to fight entirely independently...which is precisely what it's doing now.
#. column 58: These smaller units apparently don't have the parts Ebrelnaux is after, but we'll need to destroy them before we can proceed any further. Will you help us?
#. column 59: Vanquish the automated magitek?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your cooperation is much appreciated. I'll try enlisting the aid of more of our comrades while you set about tackling these security drones. May the Navigator guide your hand!
msgctxt "FateEvent:670:0:62"
msgid "You are needed elsewhere, then. Very well, we'll attempt to fight our way through as best we can."
msgstr "Тогда ты нужен в другом месте. Что ж, попробуем пробиться сами, как сможем."

#. ja: 廃墟となった帝都をうろつく、<br>無人型魔導兵器の群れを見ましたか？
#. de: Die autonomen Kriegsmaschinen, welche die Straßen unsicher machen, bereiten uns weiterhin große Sorgen.
#. fr: Avez-vous vu toutes ces armes sans pilotes qui errent dans les rues dévastées de la capitale<nbsp>?
#. column 57: As we understand it, the safety measures in place to prevent it targeting its own allies were disabled during the civil war, allowing it to attack Garlean troops. Even now, it still treats every living being as a foe.
msgctxt "FateEvent:671:0:56"
msgid "The automated magitek that roams this city continues to be a thorn in our side."
msgstr "Автоматические магитех-машины, бродящие по городу, всё ещё не дают нам покоя."

#. ja: 内戦時に本来は友軍であるはずの敵対勢力を、<br>攻撃するために、安全装置が解除されたようでしてね。<br>近づく者を無差別に攻撃してくるんです。
#. de: Während des Bürgerkriegs wurden die Sicher<shy>heits<shy>maß<shy>nahmen entfernt, welche eigentlich vermeiden sollten, dass Garlear attackiert werden. Jetzt wird auf alles geschossen, was sich bewegt.
#. fr: Il semble que le dispositif de sécurité mis en place pour qu'elles évitent de s'en prendre à leurs alliés a été désactivé. À présent, elles s'attaquent à tout ce qui passe à leur portée.
#. column 56: The automated magitek that roams this city continues to be a thorn in our side.
msgctxt "FateEvent:671:0:57"
msgid "As we understand it, the safety measures in place to prevent it targeting its own allies were disabled during the civil war, allowing it to attack Garlean troops. Even now, it still treats every living being as a foe."
msgstr "Похоже, во время гражданской войны отключили защитные механизмы, которые не давали машинам нападать на своих. Теперь они атакуют гарлеанцев, а заодно считают врагом любое живое существо."

#. ja: 私は、誰もが魔導技術の恩恵を受けられるよう、<br>機械から複雑な操作を取り払いたかったのです。
#. de: In meinen Zeiten als Magitek-Ingenieur wollte ich Maschinen entwickeln, die das tägliche Leben vereinfachen. Ich wollte, dass jeder Bürger des Kaiserreiches sie zu dessen Wohl einsetzen kann.
#. fr: En tant que scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>que, je m'étais proposé de simplifier au maximum les commandes des machines utilisant la technologie magitek afin de rendre cette dernière accessible au plus grand nombre.
#. column 57: This led me to pursue automation of certain processes, only for my research to be used for military purposes. I had never intended for my work to be used for such destructive ends, and when my protestations fell on deaf ears, I defected to Eorzea.
#. column 58: In my absence, the selfsame technology I created has brought untold misery upon my former compatriots. This automated machina must be stopped, and for that, I require all the information I can gather.
msgctxt "FateEvent:672:0:56"
msgid "During my days as an imperial magitek engineer, I sought to simplify the methods for operating the machina used in daily life, so that the average citizen could more easily contribute towards the Empire's technological revolution."
msgstr "Когда я работал имперским инженером по магитехнике, я хотел упростить управление машинами, которыми пользовались в повседневной жизни, чтобы каждый житель мог внести свой вклад в технологический прогресс Империи."

#. ja: そのための自動操縦を研究していたのですが、<br>魔導兵器の無人化のために徴用され……<br>やがて反発して、エオルゼアへと亡命したのです。
#. de: Aus diesem Grund hatte ich die ver<shy>schie<shy>den<shy>sten Automatisierungsprozesse entwickelt - die dann für militärische Zwecke eingesetzt wurden. Ich protestierte, aber das brachte mir nur Ärger ein. Also entschloss ich mich, nach Eorzea überzulaufen.
#. fr: Toutes ces recherches sur l'automatisation... et finir par devoir travailler pour l'armée sur le développement d'armes magitek sans pilote. Quand j'ai décidé que trop c'était trop, je me suis exilé en Éorzéa.
#. column 56: During my days as an imperial magitek engineer, I sought to simplify the methods for operating the machina used in daily life, so that the average citizen could more easily contribute towards the Empire's technological revolution.
#. column 58: In my absence, the selfsame technology I created has brought untold misery upon my former compatriots. This automated machina must be stopped, and for that, I require all the information I can gather.
msgctxt "FateEvent:672:0:57"
msgid "This led me to pursue automation of certain processes, only for my research to be used for military purposes. I had never intended for my work to be used for such destructive ends, and when my protestations fell on deaf ears, I defected to Eorzea."
msgstr "Я занялся автоматизацией некоторых процессов, но мои исследования использовали в военных целях. Я вовсе не хотел, чтобы моя работа служила разрушению. Когда мои протесты остались без ответа, я бежал в Эорзею."

#. ja: 帝都復興を成し遂げるためにも、<br>無人型魔導兵器を停止させる方法を見つけなければ……。<br>そのための技術情報を得たいのです。
#. de: Während meiner Abwesenheit hat meine Technologie großes Unheil unter meinen Mitbürgern angerichtet. Diese Maschinen müssen aufgehalten werden, und dafür muss ich mehr darüber wissen, wie sie weiterentwickelt wurden.
#. fr: Si l'on veut rebâtir cette capitale, il faut trouver un moyen de mettre ces armes hors d'état de nuire. Ce sont les documents auxquels je pense qui me le fourniront.
#. column 56: During my days as an imperial magitek engineer, I sought to simplify the methods for operating the machina used in daily life, so that the average citizen could more easily contribute towards the Empire's technological revolution.
#. column 57: This led me to pursue automation of certain processes, only for my research to be used for military purposes. I had never intended for my work to be used for such destructive ends, and when my protestations fell on deaf ears, I defected to Eorzea.
msgctxt "FateEvent:672:0:58"
msgid "In my absence, the selfsame technology I created has brought untold misery upon my former compatriots. This automated machina must be stopped, and for that, I require all the information I can gather."
msgstr "Пока меня не было, созданная мной технология принесла моим бывшим соотечественникам немало бед. Эти автоматические машины нужно остановить, и для этого мне нужны все сведения, какие только удастся собрать."

#. ja: あの機体は、元は有人機として設計されたようです。<br>それを私が亡命前に研究していた技術を応用することで、<br>無人機に改造したのでしょう。
#. de: Die Kriegsmaschinen wurden einst von Soldaten gesteuert, jetzt agieren sie voll automatisch. Ich habe dies mitzuverschulden, also muss ich mein Wissen einbringen, um diesem Schrecken ein Ende zu setzen.
#. fr: Cette machine était à l'origine conçue pour être pilotée par un soldat, mais peut agir à présent de façon autonome. Nul doute qu'ils ont récupéré ma technologie pour créer ces saletés...
#. column 57: By analyzing the parts added to replace a living pilot, I should be able to find a method for deactivating similar machina.
msgctxt "FateEvent:674:0:56"
msgid "That warmachina was once a manned vehicle, but is now fully automated. The technology I helped create prior to my defection has become the driving force behind that monstrosity, so I must use my knowledge to end this menace once and for all."
msgstr "Когда-то эта боевая машина управлялась человеком, а теперь действует полностью автоматически. Технология, над которой я работал до побега, стала основой этого чудовища. Я должен использовать свои знания, чтобы раз и навсегда покончить с этой угрозой."

#. ja: その制御系に使われている、<br>コアユニットを回収して、解析することができれば、<br>無人型魔導兵器を止める方法もわかるはずです。
#. de: Bestimmt kann ich ihre autonome Steuerung ausschalten, wenn ich herausfinde, mit welcher Technologie die Piloten ersetzt wurden.
#. fr: En récupérant puis en analysant les composants utilisés comme unité de contrôle des armes magitek, on devrait pouvoir trouver le moyen de les arrêter.
#. column 56: That warmachina was once a manned vehicle, but is now fully automated. The technology I helped create prior to my defection has become the driving force behind that monstrosity, so I must use my knowledge to end this menace once and for all.
msgctxt "FateEvent:674:0:57"
msgid "By analyzing the parts added to replace a living pilot, I should be able to find a method for deactivating similar machina."
msgstr "Если разобрать детали, которыми заменили живого пилота, и изучить их, я, вероятно, смогу найти способ отключить другие машины."

#. ja: 技術将校である小官が前に出ても、<br>かえって足手まといになってしまうことでしょう。
#. de: Als Offizier des Mahlstroms bin ich normalerweise mit Bewaffnung und Ausrüstung der Truppen beschäftigt. Ich habe schon viele Schlachten gesehen, aber bei einem Feind wie diesem würde ich nur im Weg stehen.
#. fr: J'ai beau être un officier du Maelstrom, je ne pense pas pouvoir faire quoi que ce soit pour aider à vaincre ces machines...
#. column 57: Once you've felled the brute, I'll watch Ebrelnaux's back while he retrieves the necessary parts from the wreckage. Best of luck, my friend.
msgctxt "FateEvent:675:0:56"
msgid "While I'm an officer of the Maelstrom, I'm normally charged with overseeing our armaments and equipment. I'm no stranger to the battlefield, but against an opponent such as this, it's plain to see I'd only get in your way."
msgstr "Хоть я и офицер Мальстрёма, обычно мне поручают следить за оружием и снаряжением. За плечами у меня немало битв, но против такого врага я вам только помешаю."

#. ja: 悔しいですが、残骸からコアユニットを探し出し、<br>解析することで貢献したく思います。<br>どうか、お気をつけて……！
#. de: Sobald der stärkste Gegner bezwungen ist, werde ich Ebrelnaux beschützen, während er im Feld nach den Maschinenteilen sucht, die er braucht. Hoffen wir das Beste!
#. fr: Une fois que vous aurez réglé son compte à l'arme magitek, Ebrelnaux voudra cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment fouiller sa carcasse à la recherche des composants dont il a besoin. Il faut bien que quelqu'un assure ses arrières, et ce quelqu'un, ce sera moi...
#. column 56: While I'm an officer of the Maelstrom, I'm normally charged with overseeing our armaments and equipment. I'm no stranger to the battlefield, but against an opponent such as this, it's plain to see I'd only get in your way.
msgctxt "FateEvent:675:0:57"
msgid "Once you've felled the brute, I'll watch Ebrelnaux's back while he retrieves the necessary parts from the wreckage. Best of luck, my friend."
msgstr "Когда одолеешь эту громадину, я прикрою Эбрельно, пока он будет вытаскивать нужные детали из обломков. Удачи, друг!"

#. ja: ぜえ、はぁ……エッグハント成功のために、<br>なんとしても、しあわせうさぎを捕まえないと……。
#. de: Puh<nbsp>... \<ächz> Man kriegt diese Glückshasen einfach nicht zu fassen! Dabei brauchen wir sie doch unbedingt für die Wundereiersuche!
#. fr: Hah... Il faut absolument attraper ces lapins du bonheur pour que la chasse aux Prœufs soit un succès<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Alas, a veritable horde of angry chickens is chasing them down as we speak. Will you lend us your aid?
#. column 58: Aid in this bunny-nabbing endeavor?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: ...I see. Well, should you have a change of heart, you know where to find us.
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "FateEvent:676:0:56"
msgid "\\<huff> \\<huff> ...We have to catch those bunnies, lest this year's Hatching<hyphen>tide end in utter disaster!"
msgstr "<i>Пых-пых...</i> ...Надо поймать этих кроликов, иначе в этом году Праздник гнездования закончится полным провалом!"

#. ja: ニワトリに追い込まれた、しあわせうさぎが、<br>続々とこの付近に集まってきていると報告があった。<br>すまないが、君も捕獲に力を貸してくれないか……！
#. de: Wie es scheint, ist nun schon eine ganze Horde Hühner hinter ihnen her. Wir brauchen dringend deine Hilfe beim Einfangen der Hasen, bevor die Hühner Ernst machen!
#. fr: Comme vous pouvez le voir, un groupe de poules a rassemblé plusieurs lapins du bonheur par ici. Nous avons vraiment besoin d'aide pour les capturer<nbsp>!
#. column 56: \<huff> \<huff> ...We have to catch those bunnies, lest this year's Hatching<hyphen>tide end in utter disaster!
#. column 58: Aid in this bunny-nabbing endeavor?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: ...I see. Well, should you have a change of heart, you know where to find us.
msgctxt "FateEvent:676:0:57"
msgid "Alas, a veritable horde of angry chickens is chasing them down as we speak. Will you lend us your aid?"
msgstr "Увы, за ними уже гонится целая орава разъярённых куриц. Поможешь нам?"

#. ja: しあわせうさぎの捕獲を手伝う？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Willst du beim Einfangen der Glückshasen helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les organisateurs de la chasse aux Prœufs à attraper les lapins du bonheur<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: \<huff> \<huff> ...We have to catch those bunnies, lest this year's Hatching<hyphen>tide end in utter disaster!
#. column 57: Alas, a veritable horde of angry chickens is chasing them down as we speak. Will you lend us your aid?
#. column 62: ...I see. Well, should you have a change of heart, you know where to find us.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:676:0:58"
msgid "Aid in this bunny-nabbing endeavor?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь поймать кроликов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: そうか……やむを得まい。<br>気が変わったら、また声をかけてくれ……！
#. de: Wie? Jihli sagte, du würdest uns helfen<nbsp>... Wie sollen wir das ohne dich schaffen? Bitte sag Bescheid, falls du deine Meinung änderst!
#. fr: D'accord... Je comprends. Venez me trouver si vous changer d'avis<nbsp>!
#. column 56: \<huff> \<huff> ...We have to catch those bunnies, lest this year's Hatching<hyphen>tide end in utter disaster!
#. column 57: Alas, a veritable horde of angry chickens is chasing them down as we speak. Will you lend us your aid?
#. column 58: Aid in this bunny-nabbing endeavor?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:676:0:62"
msgid "...I see. Well, should you have a change of heart, you know where to find us."
msgstr "...Понятно. Если передумаешь, ты знаешь, где нас найти."

#. ja: おお、来てくれて助かるぜ！<br>エッグハントのためにアルコンエッグを運んできた魔法人形が、<br>この先でシルフ族に囲まれて、立ち往生しているんだ。
#. de: Oh, ein Glück, dass du da bist! Die magischen Marionetten wurden bei der Auslieferung unserer schönen Saliah-Eier von Sylphen umzingelt!
#. fr: Merci d'être <if $gn4>venue<else>venu</if><nbsp>! Des poupées magiques sont immobilisées par des Sylphes un peu plus loin.
#. column 57: Don this holy guise to frighten off the mischief-makers, then deliver the cargo to me. \<heavy breathing> The moment of truth is upon us, tonberry. Are you prepared?
#. column 58: Are you prepared, tonberry?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I understand. Much is expected of you, after all. \<snort> Take a moment to calm your nerves─I shall wait for as long as you require.
msgctxt "FateEvent:677:0:56"
msgid "You've arrived! \\<snort> As you can see, the caravan and delivery mammet stand defenseless against those plundering sylphs. We must make haste!"
msgstr "Вы успели! <i>Пф-ф!</i> Видите? Караван и маммет, который везёт груз, беззащитны перед этими сильфами-грабителями. Надо спешить!"

#. ja: オレが用意したトンベリスーツを身につければ、<br>いたずら者のシルフ族を「驚かせ」ることができるはず。<br>そのスキに、アルコンエッグの回収を頼みたい！
#. de: Hier, zieh dir schnell dieses Tomberry-Kostüm an, das wird diese kleinen Störenfriede das Fürchten lehren! Sammle dann anschließend die Saliah-Eier ein und bring sie zu mir, ja?
#. fr: Grâce aux costumes de tomberry, on pourra les effrayer et en profiter pour récupérer les Prœufs.
#. column 56: You've arrived! \<snort> As you can see, the caravan and delivery mammet stand defenseless against those plundering sylphs. We must make haste!
#. column 58: Are you prepared, tonberry?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I understand. Much is expected of you, after all. \<snort> Take a moment to calm your nerves─I shall wait for as long as you require.
msgctxt "FateEvent:677:0:57"
msgid "Don this holy guise to frighten off the mischief-makers, then deliver the cargo to me. \\<heavy breathing> The moment of truth is upon us, tonberry. Are you prepared?"
msgstr "Наденьте этот священный наряд, чтобы напугать проказников, а потом доставьте мне груз. <i>Тяжёлое дыхание...</i> Момент истины настал, тонберри. Готовы?"

#. ja: アルコンエッグの回収を開始する？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dabei helfen, die Saliah-Eier in Sicherheit zu bringen?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Récupérer les Prœufs dispersés<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You've arrived! \<snort> As you can see, the caravan and delivery mammet stand defenseless against those plundering sylphs. We must make haste!
#. column 57: Don this holy guise to frighten off the mischief-makers, then deliver the cargo to me. \<heavy breathing> The moment of truth is upon us, tonberry. Are you prepared?
#. column 62: I understand. Much is expected of you, after all. \<snort> Take a moment to calm your nerves─I shall wait for as long as you require.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:677:0:58"
msgid "Are you prepared, tonberry?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Ты готов, томберри?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: なんだ、急ぎの用事でも思い出したか？<br>オレはここで待ってるから、<br>準備ができ次第、また声をかけてくれよ！
#. de: Ich verstehe schon. Das Schicksal der Wundereiersuche hängt von dir ab, da lastet jede Menge Verantwortung auf deinen Schultern.  Komm hierher zurück, wenn du dich bereit fühlst!
#. fr: Tu as une autre affaire à régler<nbsp>? Je t'attends là, reviens me voir quand tu seras <if $gn4>prête<else>prêt</if>.
#. column 56: You've arrived! \<snort> As you can see, the caravan and delivery mammet stand defenseless against those plundering sylphs. We must make haste!
#. column 57: Don this holy guise to frighten off the mischief-makers, then deliver the cargo to me. \<heavy breathing> The moment of truth is upon us, tonberry. Are you prepared?
#. column 58: Are you prepared, tonberry?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "FateEvent:677:0:62"
msgid "I understand. Much is expected of you, after all. \\<snort> Take a moment to calm your nerves─I shall wait for as long as you require."
msgstr "Понимаю. На вас ведь лежит большая ответственность. <i>Пф-ф!</i> Переведите дух, я подожду, сколько потребуется."

#. ja: アルコンエッグは回収できたか！？
#. de: Konntest du die Saliah-Eier retten?!
#. fr: Tu as réussi à récupérer les Prœufs<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Yes, tonberry! Yes! \<snort> Show me more. Bring me more! Unleash your full potential!
#. column 62: Oh, but mind the tail, will you? Broken eggs are but broken dreams to the valiant, after all. Tread carefully and bring me what you've gathered!
msgctxt "FateEvent:678:0:56"
msgid "Have you retrieved the eggs!?"
msgstr "Яйца удалось вернуть?"

#. ja: おお、さすがは冒険者だぜ！<br>この調子で、トンベリが活躍する勇姿を、<br>たっぷりと見せつけてやれ……！
#. de: Du bist wahrhaftig <if $gn4>eine heldenhafte Abenteurerin<else>ein heldenhafter Abenteurer</if>! Weiter so! Alle sollen von den tapferen Heldentaten der Tomberrys erfahren!
#. fr: Super<nbsp>! Tu n'as pas usurpé ton titre d'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! Montrons à tous à quel point les tomberrys sont vaillants<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you retrieved the eggs!?
#. column 62: Oh, but mind the tail, will you? Broken eggs are but broken dreams to the valiant, after all. Tread carefully and bring me what you've gathered!
msgctxt "FateEvent:678:0:60"
msgid "Yes, tonberry! Yes! \\<snort> Show me more. Bring me more! Unleash your full potential!"
msgstr "Да, тонберри! Вот так! <i>Пф-ф!</i> Покажите ещё! Несите ещё! Высвободите всю свою силу!"

#. ja: ただ、ドタバタやってるうちに、<br>アルコンエッグが割れちまったら大変だ。<br>頃合いを見て、オレに渡すのを忘れずにな！
#. de: Aber werde bitte nicht übermütig, ja? Unsere schönen Saliah-Eier dürfen auf keinen Fall Schaden nehmen! Bring sie am besten direkt zu mir.
#. fr: Prends garde à ce que les Prœufs ne se cassent pas dans la pré<shy>ci<shy>pi<shy>ta<shy>tion<nbsp>! Attends le bon moment avant de me les remettre.
#. column 56: Have you retrieved the eggs!?
#. column 60: Yes, tonberry! Yes! \<snort> Show me more. Bring me more! Unleash your full potential!
msgctxt "FateEvent:678:0:62"
msgid "Oh, but mind the tail, will you? Broken eggs are but broken dreams to the valiant, after all. Tread carefully and bring me what you've gathered!"
msgstr "Только хвостом не зацепи, ладно? Для доблестных героев разбитые яйца — разбитые мечты. Осторожнее и неси всё, что собрал!"

#. ja: おっと、アルコンエッグを持っていないみたいだな。<br>大変だとは思うが、どうにか回収してきてくれ！
#. de: Du konntest bisher keine Saliah-Eier bergen? Uff<nbsp>... Ich kann mir vorstellen, dass das nicht einfach ist, aber du darfst auf keinen Fall aufgeben! Ich zähle auf dich!
#. fr: Oh, tu n'en as aucun dans ta besace<nbsp>! J'imagine que ce n'est pas évident, mais continue de chercher les Prœufs<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:679:0:56"
msgid "Where are the eggs, tonberry!? \\<heavy breathing> Bring me the eggs!"
msgstr "Где яйца, тонберри!? <i>Тяжёлое дыхание...</i> Несите их мне!"

#. ja: アルコンエッグは回収できたか！？
#. de: Konntest du die Saliah-Eier retten?!
#. fr: Tu as réussi à récupérer les Prœufs<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Phenomenal, tonberry! \<snort> Thanks to you, we now metaphorically sit upon a proverbial treasure trove of quite literal Archon eggs.
#. column 62: I will begin making preparations to return to Gridania, but call upon me should you have any eggy additions.
msgctxt "FateEvent:680:0:56"
msgid "Have you retrieved the eggs!?"
msgstr "Великолепно, томберри! \\<фырканье> Благодаря тебе у нас теперь целое сокровище настоящих архонских яиц — если говорить образно."

#. ja: よしよし！<br>キミががんばってくれたおかげで、<br>アルコンエッグをかなり取り戻せたぜ！
#. de: Hervorragend! Dank deiner Hilfe konnten wir jede Menge Saliah-Eier in Sicherheit bringen!
#. fr: Génial<nbsp>! On en a retrouvé pas mal grâce à tes efforts<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you retrieved the eggs!?
#. column 62: I will begin making preparations to return to Gridania, but call upon me should you have any eggy additions.
msgctxt "FateEvent:680:0:60"
msgid "Phenomenal, tonberry! \\<snort> Thanks to you, we now metaphorically sit upon a proverbial treasure trove of quite literal Archon eggs."
msgstr "Молодец! Благодаря тебе мы вернули немало архонских яиц!"

#. ja: オレはそろそろ、回収した分をグリダニアへ運ぶつもりだ。<br>まだ持っているアルコンエッグがあるなら、<br>早めに声をかけてくれよ！
#. de: Ich werde sogleich mit den Vor<shy>bereitungen für die Rückkehr nach Gridania beginnen. Wenn du noch mehr findest, bring sie so schnell wie möglich zu mir!
#. fr: Je ne vais pas tarder à les rapporter à Gridania. S'il en reste d'autres, amène-les-moi au plus vite.
#. column 56: Have you retrieved the eggs!?
#. column 60: Phenomenal, tonberry! \<snort> Thanks to you, we now metaphorically sit upon a proverbial treasure trove of quite literal Archon eggs.
msgctxt "FateEvent:680:0:62"
msgid "I will begin making preparations to return to Gridania, but call upon me should you have any eggy additions."
msgstr "Я скоро повезу собранные яйца в Гриданию. Если у тебя ещё остались, поскорее дай мне знать!"

#. ja: おかげさまで、アルコンエッグがだいぶ集まったぜ！<br>オレはそろそろ回収できた分をグリダニアへ運ぶから、<br>まだ拾えたら、早めに声をかけてくれよ！
#. de: Ich werde sogleich mit den Vor<shy>bereitungen für die Rückkehr nach Gridania beginnen. Wenn du noch mehr findest, bring sie so schnell wie möglich zu mir!
#. fr: Je ne vais pas tarder à les rapporter à Gridania. S'il en reste d'autres, amène-les-moi au plus vite.
msgctxt "FateEvent:681:0:56"
msgid "You've done more than enough, tonberry! \\<snort> I will begin making preparations to return to Gridania, but call upon me should you have any eggy additions."
msgstr "Вы и так сделали больше чем достаточно, тонберри! <i>Пф-ф!</i> Я уже готовлюсь возвращаться в Гриданию, но если найдёте ещё яиц, сразу дайте знать."

#. ja: あなた、おありですか……戦いの心得が！？<br>でしたらどうか、あの化物を、<br>ここで食い止めていただけませんでしょうか？
#. de: Großgütige, bitte sag mir, dass du kämpfen kannst! Jemand muss die Stellung halten!
#. fr: Vous... Dites-moi que vous savez vous battre<nbsp>!? On a besoin d'aide<nbsp>!
#. column 57: You see it too, right? That flaming fiend will slaughter everyone in Wachunpelo if we let it. I beg of you, keep it occupied while I go and call for reinforcements!
#. column 58: Defend Wachunpelo? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, I can't begin to thank you... I swear on my life, I won't stop running until I find help. May the winds keep you!
#. column 62: Oh... Well, that's all right. Can't ask you to put your life on the line, after all... Gods, I hope it's not heading for Wachunpelo...
msgctxt "FateEvent:682:0:56"
msgid "Sweet gods of mercy, please tell me you have combat training! Someone's got to hold the line!"
msgstr "О милостивые боги, скажи, что умеешь сражаться! Кто-нибудь должен удержать его!"

#. ja: 見てのとおり危険でしょうから無理は言いませんが、<br>あれが人里に下りてきては大変です！<br>いますぐ応援を呼んできますので、どうか……！
#. de: Dieser flammende Albtraum wird Wachunpelo komplett einäschern, wenn ihn niemand aufhält! Garantiert! Du musst ihn beschäftigen, während ich Verstärkung hole! Bitte, bitte!
#. fr: La situation est critique, nous devons empêcher ce monstre de détruire le village<nbsp>! Je vais chercher du soutien, ne le laissez pas avancer<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Sweet gods of mercy, please tell me you have combat training! Someone's got to hold the line!
#. column 58: Defend Wachunpelo? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, I can't begin to thank you... I swear on my life, I won't stop running until I find help. May the winds keep you!
#. column 62: Oh... Well, that's all right. Can't ask you to put your life on the line, after all... Gods, I hope it's not heading for Wachunpelo...
msgctxt "FateEvent:682:0:57"
msgid "You see it too, right? That flaming fiend will slaughter everyone in Wachunpelo if we let it. I beg of you, keep it occupied while I go and call for reinforcements!"
msgstr "Ты ведь тоже это видишь? Если не остановить это огненное чудовище, оно перебьёт всех в Вачунпело. Прошу, задержи его, пока я не приведу подмогу!"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Wachunpelo verteidigen? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le marcheur de Tsivli<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Sweet gods of mercy, please tell me you have combat training! Someone's got to hold the line!
#. column 57: You see it too, right? That flaming fiend will slaughter everyone in Wachunpelo if we let it. I beg of you, keep it occupied while I go and call for reinforcements!
#. column 60: Oh, I can't begin to thank you... I swear on my life, I won't stop running until I find help. May the winds keep you!
#. column 62: Oh... Well, that's all right. Can't ask you to put your life on the line, after all... Gods, I hope it's not heading for Wachunpelo...
