msgstr "Защитить Вачунпело?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとう……！<br>なるべく早く応援を呼びますので、<br>どうか無理しないで……！！
#. de: Danke, danke, vielen Dank! Ich renne, so flink mich meine Beine tragen, ja ja!
#. fr: Oh, merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Je vais chercher de l'aide<nbsp>! Tenez bon<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Sweet gods of mercy, please tell me you have combat training! Someone's got to hold the line!
#. column 57: You see it too, right? That flaming fiend will slaughter everyone in Wachunpelo if we let it. I beg of you, keep it occupied while I go and call for reinforcements!
#. column 58: Defend Wachunpelo? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh... Well, that's all right. Can't ask you to put your life on the line, after all... Gods, I hope it's not heading for Wachunpelo...
msgctxt "FateEvent:682:0:60"
msgid "Oh, I can't begin to thank you... I swear on my life, I won't stop running until I find help. May the winds keep you!"
msgstr "Даже не знаю, как тебя благодарить... Клянусь, буду бежать, пока не найду помощь. Да хранят тебя ветра!"

#. ja: 危険ですものね、仕方ないです……。<br>嗚呼……でも、あれが人里に下りたら！
#. de: Oh ... Na gut. Kann schließlich nicht erwarten, dass du dein Leben riskierst, nein, nein. Hoffentlich geht das fürchterliche Ding nicht nach Wachunpelo<nbsp>...
#. fr: Je comprends, c'est très dangereux, après tout... Aaah, mais le village est en danger...<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Sweet gods of mercy, please tell me you have combat training! Someone's got to hold the line!
#. column 57: You see it too, right? That flaming fiend will slaughter everyone in Wachunpelo if we let it. I beg of you, keep it occupied while I go and call for reinforcements!
#. column 58: Defend Wachunpelo? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Oh, I can't begin to thank you... I swear on my life, I won't stop running until I find help. May the winds keep you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:682:0:62"
msgid "Oh... Well, that's all right. Can't ask you to put your life on the line, after all... Gods, I hope it's not heading for Wachunpelo..."
msgstr "О... Ну, ничего страшного. Не могу же я просить тебя рисковать жизнью... Боги, только бы оно не направилось к Вачунпело..."

#. ja: その出で立ち、手練れの方とお見受けしました！<br>商品を狙われているんです、狼たちに！<br>どうか追い払ってはいただけませんか？
#. de: Sehen meine Augen da etwa <if $gn4>eine erfahrene Kämpferin<else>einen erfahrenen Kämpfer</if>? Welch ein Glück! Unsere Wagen sind in Gefahr! Die da hinter uns! Die verdammten Wölfe haben es auf den Proviant abgesehen!
#. fr: Oh, vous m'avez l'air de savoir vous battre, vous<nbsp>! Notre cargaison est menacée par des loups, vous pouvez nous aider à les faire fuir<nbsp>?
#. column 57: If we lose this cargo, a lot of people will go hungry tonight! Please, is there anything you can do!?
#. column 58: Defend the wagons? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have our utmost gratitude, traveler! Remember, wolves work in tandem with one another, so take care not to let them surround you!
#. column 62: Th-There isn't...? Oh gods, our delivery is doomed...
msgctxt "FateEvent:683:0:56"
msgid "Do mine keen eyes spot a veteran of battle!? Praise be! Our wagons are in danger─the damned wolves are after our delivery of provisions!"
msgstr "Неужто передо мной опытный боец!? Слава богам! Наши повозки в опасности — проклятые волки охотятся за провизией!"

#. ja: この食料が届かなければ、<br>お客さんたちも、とても困るはず……！<br>どうかどうか、助けてください！
#. de: Wenn wir die Ladung verlieren, müssen eine Menge Leute heute Abend mit knurrendem Magen ins Bett. Kannst du nicht irgendwas tun?
#. fr: Notre cargaison doit absolument arriver à bon port, nos clients comptent beaucoup dessus<nbsp>! Je vous en prie<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Do mine keen eyes spot a veteran of battle!? Praise be! Our wagons are in danger─the damned wolves are after our delivery of provisions!
#. column 58: Defend the wagons? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have our utmost gratitude, traveler! Remember, wolves work in tandem with one another, so take care not to let them surround you!
#. column 62: Th-There isn't...? Oh gods, our delivery is doomed...
msgctxt "FateEvent:683:0:57"
msgid "If we lose this cargo, a lot of people will go hungry tonight! Please, is there anything you can do!?"
msgstr "Если потеряем этот груз, сегодня вечером многие останутся голодными! Прошу, неужели нельзя что-нибудь сделать!?"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Wagen beschützen? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les marchands pelupelu<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Do mine keen eyes spot a veteran of battle!? Praise be! Our wagons are in danger─the damned wolves are after our delivery of provisions!
#. column 57: If we lose this cargo, a lot of people will go hungry tonight! Please, is there anything you can do!?
#. column 60: You have our utmost gratitude, traveler! Remember, wolves work in tandem with one another, so take care not to let them surround you!
#. column 62: Th-There isn't...? Oh gods, our delivery is doomed...
