msgstr "Защитить повозки?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этой F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>あいつらは群れて行動するので、<br>どうかお気を付けて、囲まれないように……！
#. de: Danke, vielen Dank! Denk daran, dass Wölfe immerim Rudel angreifen. Lass dich nicht in die Klemme nehmen!
#. fr: Oh, merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Ils se déplacent toujours en meute, faites attention à ne pas vous retrouver encerclé<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>!
#. column 56: Do mine keen eyes spot a veteran of battle!? Praise be! Our wagons are in danger─the damned wolves are after our delivery of provisions!
#. column 57: If we lose this cargo, a lot of people will go hungry tonight! Please, is there anything you can do!?
#. column 58: Defend the wagons? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Th-There isn't...? Oh gods, our delivery is doomed...
msgctxt "FateEvent:683:0:60"
msgid "You have our utmost gratitude, traveler! Remember, wolves work in tandem with one another, so take care not to let them surround you!"
msgstr "Премного благодарны, путник! Волки нападают стаей, так что смотри, не дай им окружить себя!"

#. ja: そ、そんなあ……。<br>諦めるしかないのか、商品を……！
#. de: Nichts? Gar nichts? Ojemine, dann sind wir verloren<nbsp>...
#. fr: Oh, je vois... Je crois qu'on peut dire au revoir à nos mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses...
#. column 56: Do mine keen eyes spot a veteran of battle!? Praise be! Our wagons are in danger─the damned wolves are after our delivery of provisions!
#. column 57: If we lose this cargo, a lot of people will go hungry tonight! Please, is there anything you can do!?
#. column 58: Defend the wagons? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You have our utmost gratitude, traveler! Remember, wolves work in tandem with one another, so take care not to let them surround you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:683:0:62"
msgid "Th-There isn't...? Oh gods, our delivery is doomed..."
msgstr "Н-ничего? Совсем ничего? О боги, нам конец..."

#. ja: 困った困った、困ったよ……！<br>もの凄い数が集まってくるんだ、<br>コーヒービーンを食い荒らす鳥たちが！
#. de: Oh weh, oh weh, das sind zu viele! Und sie haben es auf die Kaffeebohnen abgesehen!
#. fr: Misère de misère de misère<nbsp>! Ces oiseaux de malheur ne cessent de rappliquer<nbsp>! Ils vont becqueter nos grains de café jusqu'au dernier<nbsp>!
#. column 57: We have to do something before they eat through our entire harvest! You there, traveler─please, grant us your succor!
#. column 58: Aid the farmer? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, thank you, thank you! Whatever you do, don't let those glorified buzzards bust open our crates, alright!?
#. column 62: Look, I'm sorry to be pushy, but these beans are our livelihood─the birds mustn't be allowed near them!
msgctxt "FateEvent:684:0:56"
msgid "Oh gods, no! There's too many of them! And they're coming for our coffee beans!"
msgstr "О боги, нет! Их слишком много! И все лезут к нашим кофейным зёрнам!"

#. ja: このままじゃ、<br>収穫したぶん全部食べられちゃうよ！<br>お願い旅の人、あいつらを追い払って！
#. de: Irgendjemand muss etwas tun, bevor sie die ganze Ernte verputzen! Wie wär's mit dir, <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>? Bitte, bitte!
#. fr: Notre précieuse récolte va partir en fumée à ce rythme... Je vous en prie, <if $gn4>voyageuse<else>voyageur</if>, faites quelque chose<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oh gods, no! There's too many of them! And they're coming for our coffee beans!
#. column 58: Aid the farmer? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, thank you, thank you! Whatever you do, don't let those glorified buzzards bust open our crates, alright!?
#. column 62: Look, I'm sorry to be pushy, but these beans are our livelihood─the birds mustn't be allowed near them!
msgctxt "FateEvent:684:0:57"
msgid "We have to do something before they eat through our entire harvest! You there, traveler─please, grant us your succor!"
msgstr "Нужно что-то сделать, пока они не слопали весь урожай! Эй, путник, прошу, помоги нам!"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Kaffeebauern helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Repousser les oiseaux<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oh gods, no! There's too many of them! And they're coming for our coffee beans!
#. column 57: We have to do something before they eat through our entire harvest! You there, traveler─please, grant us your succor!
#. column 60: Thank you, thank you, thank you! Whatever you do, don't let those glorified buzzards bust open our crates, alright!?
#. column 62: Look, I'm sorry to be pushy, but these beans are our livelihood─the birds mustn't be allowed near them!
