msgstr "Прогнать газелей?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとうございます……<br>と言っているそばから、ガゼルが現れました！<br>どうぞ、よろしくお願いいたします！
#. de: Danke, <if $gn4>Fremde<else>Fremder</if>. Ich stehe tief in deiner Schuld. Und da sind sie auch schon! Ich bringe mich lieber in Sicherheit!
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Tenez, en voici justement quelques-unes qui accourent<nbsp>! À VOUS de jouer<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Not often do I see travelers in these parts. I take it you have at least a passing interest in historical sites, then?
#. column 57: Perhaps you're just the kind soul I've been looking for. As vigilkeeper of these ruins, I have a problem in desperate need of a solution.
#. column 58: It's the gazelles, you see. They like to hone their horns against hard rock, and if left unchecked, they could cause irreparable damage to the stonework here. If you see any, could you drive them away?
#. column 59: Deter the gazelles? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Not to worry─I understand. Perhaps there is another way I can still protect the ruins...
msgctxt "FateEvent:685:0:60"
msgid "Thank you, stranger. Truly, I am in your debt─ah, but speak of the devils! I will pray for your success from a safe distance!"
msgstr "Спасибо, незнакомец. Я у тебя в долгу... Ах, а вот и они! Буду молиться за твою победу из безопасного места!"

#. ja: 無理強いはできませんな。<br>しかし、このままでは遺跡が……。
#. de: Verstehe, kein Problem. Vielleicht fällt mir ja noch ein Weg ein, wie ich die Mauern beschützen kann.
#. fr: Je ne veux pas vous forcer la main. Mais nos vestiges vont être fortement DÉGRADÉS si rien n'est fait...
#. column 56: Not often do I see travelers in these parts. I take it you have at least a passing interest in historical sites, then?
#. column 57: Perhaps you're just the kind soul I've been looking for. As vigilkeeper of these ruins, I have a problem in desperate need of a solution.
#. column 58: It's the gazelles, you see. They like to hone their horns against hard rock, and if left unchecked, they could cause irreparable damage to the stonework here. If you see any, could you drive them away?
#. column 59: Deter the gazelles? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, stranger. Truly, I am in your debt─ah, but speak of the devils! I will pray for your success from a safe distance!
msgctxt "FateEvent:685:0:62"
msgid "Not to worry─I understand. Perhaps there is another way I can still protect the ruins..."
msgstr "Ничего, понимаю. Может, найдётся другой способ защитить руины..."

#. ja: むう、どうしたものか……。<br>先日の大嵐の影響か、風の精が荒ぶっているようだ。
#. de: Ich hatte es ja befürchtet. Der jüngste Sturm hat die Wind-Exergone angestachelt.
#. fr: C'est FÂCHEUX... Depuis la récente tempête, les esprits de vent sont ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment AGITÉS...
#. column 57: If nothing is done, their gusts will erode the glyphs from our ancestors' gravestones, and the world will lose all memory that they lived. To a Yok Huy, that is death's true form.
#. column 58: Would you have mercy on this old-timer and soothe the wind sprites in my stead? Please, save our ancestors from certain death...
#. column 59: Soothe the sprites? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I am in your debt!
#. column 62: Hrmmm... Very well. I shall have to keep an eye on them until they regain their composure...
msgctxt "FateEvent:686:0:56"
msgid "I feared as much... It seems the recent storm has agitated the wind sprites."
msgstr "Так я и думал... Похоже, недавняя буря разбушевала духов ветра."

#. ja: このままでは、父祖の墓に刻まれた絵文字が削られ、<br>彼が生きた証、その記憶が失われてしまう。<br>それこそヨカフイ族の死だ。
#. de: Wenn nichts unternommen wird, werden die Inschriften von den Grabsteinen unserer Ahnen durch ihre Böen erodieren und alle Erinnerungen an sie auslöschen. Für uns Yok Huy ist erst das der wahre Tod.
#. fr: Ils risquent d'éroder les ins<shy>crip<shy>tions sur les tombes de nos ancêtres, la PREUVE même de leur existence. Ce serait pour eux la MORT au sens où nous l'entendons...
#. column 56: I feared as much... It seems the recent storm has agitated the wind sprites.
#. column 58: Would you have mercy on this old-timer and soothe the wind sprites in my stead? Please, save our ancestors from certain death...
#. column 59: Soothe the sprites? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I am in your debt!
#. column 62: Hrmmm... Very well. I shall have to keep an eye on them until they regain their composure...
msgctxt "FateEvent:686:0:57"
msgid "If nothing is done, their gusts will erode the glyphs from our ancestors' gravestones, and the world will lose all memory that they lived. To a Yok Huy, that is death's true form."
msgstr "Если ничего не предпринять, их порывы сотрут письмена с могил наших предков, и мир забудет, что они жили. Для йок-хуи это и есть настоящая смерть."

#. ja: お客人よ、年老いたわしに代わり、<br>荒ぶる風の精を鎮めてはもらえぬだろうか？<br>祖父を死から救うために……。
#. de: Bitte erbarme dich eines alten Mannes und besänftige die Exergone an meiner statt. Rette unsere Ahnen vor dem sicheren Tod.
#. fr: Je suis trop VIEUX pour intervenir, mais VOUS, vous pourriez peut-être les calmer, et par là même sauver l'existence de nos aïeux...
#. column 56: I feared as much... It seems the recent storm has agitated the wind sprites.
#. column 57: If nothing is done, their gusts will erode the glyphs from our ancestors' gravestones, and the world will lose all memory that they lived. To a Yok Huy, that is death's true form.
#. column 59: Soothe the sprites? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I am in your debt!
#. column 62: Hrmmm... Very well. I shall have to keep an eye on them until they regain their composure...
msgctxt "FateEvent:686:0:58"
msgid "Would you have mercy on this old-timer and soothe the wind sprites in my stead? Please, save our ancestors from certain death..."
msgstr "Пожалей старика, утихомирь духов ветра за меня. Прошу, спаси наших предков от верной смерти..."

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Exergone besänftigen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Éliminer les élémentaires de vent<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I feared as much... It seems the recent storm has agitated the wind sprites.
#. column 57: If nothing is done, their gusts will erode the glyphs from our ancestors' gravestones, and the world will lose all memory that they lived. To a Yok Huy, that is death's true form.
#. column 58: Would you have mercy on this old-timer and soothe the wind sprites in my stead? Please, save our ancestors from certain death...
#. column 60: I am in your debt!
#. column 62: Hrmmm... Very well. I shall have to keep an eye on them until they regain their composure...
