msgstr "Утихомирить духов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: お客人よ、恩に着るぞ……！
#. de: Ich stehe tief in deiner Schuld.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Voyageuse<else>Voyageur</if>, je ne sais comment vous remercier<nbsp>! BON COURAGE à vous<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I feared as much... It seems the recent storm has agitated the wind sprites.
#. column 57: If nothing is done, their gusts will erode the glyphs from our ancestors' gravestones, and the world will lose all memory that they lived. To a Yok Huy, that is death's true form.
#. column 58: Would you have mercy on this old-timer and soothe the wind sprites in my stead? Please, save our ancestors from certain death...
#. column 59: Soothe the sprites? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Hrmmm... Very well. I shall have to keep an eye on them until they regain their composure...
msgctxt "FateEvent:686:0:60"
msgid "I am in your debt!"
msgstr "Я твой должник!"

#. ja: むう、やむを得まい。<br>風の精が静まるまで、見守るしか……。
#. de: Nun, wie du meinst. Dann werde ich sie im Auge behalten müssen, bis sie sich wieder beruhigt haben.
#. fr: Tant pis. Je n'ai plus qu'à prier pour que les esprits se calment d'EUX-MÊMES...
#. column 56: I feared as much... It seems the recent storm has agitated the wind sprites.
#. column 57: If nothing is done, their gusts will erode the glyphs from our ancestors' gravestones, and the world will lose all memory that they lived. To a Yok Huy, that is death's true form.
#. column 58: Would you have mercy on this old-timer and soothe the wind sprites in my stead? Please, save our ancestors from certain death...
#. column 59: Soothe the sprites? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: I am in your debt!
msgctxt "FateEvent:686:0:62"
msgid "Hrmmm... Very well. I shall have to keep an eye on them until they regain their composure..."
msgstr "Хм-м... Что ж, придётся присматривать за ними, пока они не угомонятся..."

#. ja: やあやあ旅の方、あなたも温泉へ？<br>湯加減といい景観といい最高ですから、<br>ぜひ、堪能してみてください。
#. de: Oh, so trifft man sich wieder! Hier, um dich aufzuwärmen? Ich kann es gar nicht genug empfehlen, besonders mit dem tollen Blick, den man aus dem Wasser hat, ja ja!
#. fr: Oh, voyageu<if $gn4>se<else>r</if><nbsp>! N'hésitez à profiter de l'eau chaude et du magnifique paysage que proposent nos sources<nbsp>!
#. column 57: By the way, I don't suppose you've heard the urban legend about this place, have you? I'll clue you in, if you're curious...
#. column 58: Are you curious? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent! Now, rumor has it a terrible monster preys upon anyone walking home after a long soak in the spring. Yes, a great winged beast like that one there... Wait, what!?
#. column 62: Oh, come on! You're not afraid of a harmless little spooky story, are you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:687:0:56"
msgid "Oho, we meet again, traveler! Here for a dip in the hot springs? I can't recommend it enough, especially with that lovely view from the water!"
msgstr "О, опять встретились, путник! Пришёл искупаться в горячих источниках? Очень советую, особенно ради чудесного вида прямо из воды!"

#. ja: ときに、あなたはご存じですか？<br>この辺りで囁かれている、こわーい噂……<br>もし興味がおありなら、話して差し上げますよ。
#. de: Kennst du übrigens die Legende, die sich um diesen Ort rankt? Wenn du möchtest, kann ich sie dir gerne erzählen.
#. fr: Par contre, vous avez entendu l'histoire effrayante qui circule<nbsp>? Je peux vous la raconter si ça vous intéresse<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oho, we meet again, traveler! Here for a dip in the hot springs? I can't recommend it enough, especially with that lovely view from the water!
#. column 58: Are you curious? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent! Now, rumor has it a terrible monster preys upon anyone walking home after a long soak in the spring. Yes, a great winged beast like that one there... Wait, what!?
#. column 62: Oh, come on! You're not afraid of a harmless little spooky story, are you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:687:0:57"
msgid "By the way, I don't suppose you've heard the urban legend about this place, have you? I'll clue you in, if you're curious..."
msgstr "Кстати, слышал местную страшилку про это место? Если интересно, расскажу..."

#. ja: 話を聞きますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Geschichte hören? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Écouter la rumeur<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oho, we meet again, traveler! Here for a dip in the hot springs? I can't recommend it enough, especially with that lovely view from the water!
#. column 57: By the way, I don't suppose you've heard the urban legend about this place, have you? I'll clue you in, if you're curious...
#. column 60: Excellent! Now, rumor has it a terrible monster preys upon anyone walking home after a long soak in the spring. Yes, a great winged beast like that one there... Wait, what!?
#. column 62: Oh, come on! You're not afraid of a harmless little spooky story, are you?
