msgstr "Интересно послушать?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 実はですね、出るんですって……<br>温泉帰りでほっこり気分の人たちを襲う、怪物が！<br>まあ、ただの怪談でしょうけど……って、なんだか風が……。
#. de: Also, angeblich lauert eine schreckliche Bestien Badenden auf dem Heimweg auf, ja ja. Ein großes geflügeltes Ungeheuer genau wie das da, meine ich. Äh, wie bitte<nbsp>...?!
#. fr: Il paraît qu'un terrible monstre s'attaquerait à ceux qui rentreraient chez eux après une petite baignade dans ces sources. Une grande créature ailée, un peu comme celle-là, justement... Euh, attendez un peu<nbsp>!?
#. column 56: Oho, we meet again, traveler! Here for a dip in the hot springs? I can't recommend it enough, especially with that lovely view from the water!
#. column 57: By the way, I don't suppose you've heard the urban legend about this place, have you? I'll clue you in, if you're curious...
#. column 58: Are you curious? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, come on! You're not afraid of a harmless little spooky story, are you?
msgctxt "FateEvent:687:0:60"
msgid "Excellent! Now, rumor has it a terrible monster preys upon anyone walking home after a long soak in the spring. Yes, a great winged beast like that one there... Wait, what!?"
msgstr "Говорят, после купания на обратном пути людей поджидает страшное чудовище. Большая крылатая тварь, вроде вон той... Постой, что?!"

#. ja: それは残念……<br>おもしろい話なんですけどねえ。
#. de: Ach, komm schon! Du hast doch wohl nicht Angst vor einer harmlosen Spukgeschichte?
#. fr: Dommage... Attendez, me dites pas que vous avez peur, quand même<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Oho, we meet again, traveler! Here for a dip in the hot springs? I can't recommend it enough, especially with that lovely view from the water!
#. column 57: By the way, I don't suppose you've heard the urban legend about this place, have you? I'll clue you in, if you're curious...
#. column 58: Are you curious? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent! Now, rumor has it a terrible monster preys upon anyone walking home after a long soak in the spring. Yes, a great winged beast like that one there... Wait, what!?
msgctxt "FateEvent:687:0:62"
msgid "Oh, come on! You're not afraid of a harmless little spooky story, are you?"
msgstr "Да ладно! Неужели ты боишься безобидной страшилки?"

#. ja: 嗚呼、そこ行く旅人さん……<br>どうか力を貸してくれませんか？<br>蛾の幼虫が湧いてるんです、牧草地に！
#. de: Du da, <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>, ich brauche deine Hilfe! Schnell, schnell! Diese Weide ist von Urco-Wamouracampas überrannt worden. Die fressen alles auf, was ihnen vor die Nase kommt!
#. fr: Aidez-moi voyageu<if $gn4>se<else>r</if><nbsp>! Mes pâturages sont envahis d'insectes nuisibles<nbsp>!
#. column 57: This grass has all the necessary nutrients for our alpacas to grow up healthy and strong─we can't let the bugs have it! Please, will you exterminate them!?
#. column 58: Exterminate the urqocampae? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you so much! I need to go and ensure the other fields are untouched. May the winds keep you!
#. column 62: Oh... I see... I suppose I should go and call for help, then...
msgctxt "FateEvent:688:0:56"
msgid "You there, passing traveler─I need your help! The pasture's overrun with urqocampae, and they're eating everything in sight!"
msgstr "Эй, путник! Помоги! Луг заполонили гусеницы уркокамп, они всё вокруг пожирают!"

#. ja: アルパカの健やかな成長には、おいしい牧草がとっても大事！<br>だからどうか、あの害虫を駆除してもらえないでしょうか？
#. de: Unsere Alpakas brauchen das Gras, um groß und stark zu werden. Wir dürfen es diesen Schädlingen nicht überlassen! Bitte, bitte, du musst sie vernichten!
#. fr: Une herbe de bonne qualité est très importante pour la croissance des alpagas<nbsp>! Pouvez-vous m'aider à me débarrasser de ces parasites<nbsp>?
#. column 56: You there, passing traveler─I need your help! The pasture's overrun with urqocampae, and they're eating everything in sight!
#. column 58: Exterminate the urqocampae? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you so much! I need to go and ensure the other fields are untouched. May the winds keep you!
#. column 62: Oh... I see... I suppose I should go and call for help, then...
msgctxt "FateEvent:688:0:57"
msgid "This grass has all the necessary nutrients for our alpacas to grow up healthy and strong─we can't let the bugs have it! Please, will you exterminate them!?"
msgstr "Альпакам нужна питательная трава, чтобы расти здоровыми и сильными. Нельзя отдавать её жукам! Пожалуйста, уничтожь их!"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Urco-Wamouracampas bekämpfen? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le marcheur de Tsivli<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You there, passing traveler─I need your help! The pasture's overrun with urqocampae, and they're eating everything in sight!
#. column 57: This grass has all the necessary nutrients for our alpacas to grow up healthy and strong─we can't let the bugs have it! Please, will you exterminate them!?
#. column 60: Thank you so much! I need to go and ensure the other fields are untouched. May the winds keep you!
#. column 62: Oh... I see... I suppose I should go and call for help, then...
