msgctxt "FateEvent:688:0:58"
msgid "Exterminate the urqocampae? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Уничтожить уркокамп?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとう……<br>僕らは確認に行ってきます、他の牧草地に！<br>どうか無理のない範囲で、虫退治をお願いします！
#. de: Vielen Dank! Ich sehe nach, ob auf den anderen Wiesen alles in Ordnung ist. Möge der Wind dich beschützen!
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>! On va aller inspecter les autres pâturages en attendant, faites attention à vous<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You there, passing traveler─I need your help! The pasture's overrun with urqocampae, and they're eating everything in sight!
#. column 57: This grass has all the necessary nutrients for our alpacas to grow up healthy and strong─we can't let the bugs have it! Please, will you exterminate them!?
#. column 58: Exterminate the urqocampae? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh... I see... I suppose I should go and call for help, then...
msgctxt "FateEvent:688:0:60"
msgid "Thank you so much! I need to go and ensure the other fields are untouched. May the winds keep you!"
msgstr "Большое спасибо! Пойду проверю, не тронули ли другие поля. Пусть ветра хранят тебя!"

#. ja: あう……そうですよねえ、やっぱり。<br>呼びにいったほうがいいだろうか……応援を。
#. de: Oh weh, ich versteh<nbsp>... Dann werde ich wohl Hilfe holen müssen.
#. fr: Ah, bon, ben d'accord... Je vais aller chercher de l'aide ailleurs, alors...
#. column 56: You there, passing traveler─I need your help! The pasture's overrun with urqocampae, and they're eating everything in sight!
#. column 57: This grass has all the necessary nutrients for our alpacas to grow up healthy and strong─we can't let the bugs have it! Please, will you exterminate them!?
#. column 58: Exterminate the urqocampae? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you so much! I need to go and ensure the other fields are untouched. May the winds keep you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:688:0:62"
msgid "Oh... I see... I suppose I should go and call for help, then..."
msgstr "Ох... Понятно... Пожалуй, пойду позову кого-нибудь на помощь..."

#. ja: 聞け、小さき者！<br>オルコ・パチャ、聖地、俺たちのもの！
#. de: Halt, <if $gn4>schwächliche Fremde<else>schwächlicher Fremdling</if>! Das geweihte Land Urqopacha gehört den Chirwagur!
#. fr: PETIT ÊTRE écouter moi<nbsp>! Urqopacha être terre sacrée des Yok Huy<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Problem with that? We talk with fists! Challenge you to duel!
#. column 58: Accept the challenge? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Puny outsider... Soon you will know true ruler of Tural!
#. column 62: Gahahaha! Puny outsider has no guts. Feeling nice today, so we let you escape with your life!
msgctxt "FateEvent:689:0:56"
msgid "Halt, puny outsider! Divine land of Urqopacha belongs to Chirwagur!"
msgstr "Стой, слабый чужак! Священная земля Уркопачи принадлежит чирвагурам!"

#. ja: 異論ある者、力、示せ！<br>俺たち、お前たち、勝負、挑戦！
#. de: Wenn du das anders siehst, lassen wir gerne die Fäuste sprechen!
#. fr: Si pas content, alors montrer FORCE<nbsp>! Combattre nous<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Halt, puny outsider! Divine land of Urqopacha belongs to Chirwagur!
#. column 58: Accept the challenge? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Puny outsider... Soon you will know true ruler of Tural!
#. column 62: Gahahaha! Puny outsider has no guts. Feeling nice today, so we let you escape with your life!
msgctxt "FateEvent:689:0:57"
msgid "Problem with that? We talk with fists! Challenge you to duel!"
msgstr "Не нравится? Решим кулаками! Вызываю тебя на бой!"

#. ja: 挑戦を受けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Heraus<shy>forde<shy>rung annehmen? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Relever le défi du Yok Huy<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Halt, puny outsider! Divine land of Urqopacha belongs to Chirwagur!
#. column 57: Problem with that? We talk with fists! Challenge you to duel!
#. column 60: Puny outsider... Soon you will know true ruler of Tural!
#. column 62: Gahahaha! Puny outsider has no guts. Feeling nice today, so we let you escape with your life!
