msgctxt "FateEvent:689:0:58"
msgid "Accept the challenge? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Принять вызов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 小さき者！<br>知れ、トラル、支配者、誰か！
#. de: <if $gn4>Närrin<else>Narr</if>! Lerne die wahren Herrscher von Urqopacha kennen!
#. fr: Petit être bientôt reconnaître VRAIS MAÎTRES du Tural<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Halt, puny outsider! Divine land of Urqopacha belongs to Chirwagur!
#. column 57: Problem with that? We talk with fists! Challenge you to duel!
#. column 58: Accept the challenge? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Gahahaha! Puny outsider has no guts. Feeling nice today, so we let you escape with your life!
msgctxt "FateEvent:689:0:60"
msgid "Puny outsider... Soon you will know true ruler of Tural!"
msgstr "Слабый чужак... Скоро узнаешь, кто истинный властитель Турала!"

#. ja: グハハハ……小さき者、肝、小さい！<br>俺たち、寛大、見逃す、逃げ帰れ！
#. de: Hahahaha! Nicht nur schwach, sondern auch noch feige! Du bist meines Stahls nicht würdig.
#. fr: Guahahaha<nbsp>! Petit être se dégonfler<nbsp>! RIDICULE et INSIGNIFIANT<nbsp>! Hors de notre vue<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Halt, puny outsider! Divine land of Urqopacha belongs to Chirwagur!
#. column 57: Problem with that? We talk with fists! Challenge you to duel!
#. column 58: Accept the challenge? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Puny outsider... Soon you will know true ruler of Tural!
msgctxt "FateEvent:689:0:62"
msgid "Gahahaha! Puny outsider has no guts. Feeling nice today, so we let you escape with your life!"
msgstr "Га-ха-ха! У чужака кишка тонка. Сегодня мы добры, так что можешь уйти живым!"

#. ja: 現在、当該区域に小動物が大量発生中です。<br>「希少植物の種子」の回収に協力いただけますか？
#. de: Empfange Berichte über rasante Vermehrung kleinerer Lebensformen in der Gegend. Sende Unterstützungsgesuch für Bergung von Pflanzensamen.
#. fr: Des petites créatures nuisibles ont infesté les environs. Pourriez-vous recouvrer les graines de plantes rares<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Help gather rare plant seeds?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your assistance is appreciated. Please bring any seeds you recover to me.
#. column 62: Request for assistance denied... Please enjoy the rest of your time in Windspath Gardens.
msgctxt "FateEvent:690:0:56"
msgid "The sudden emergence of foraging organisms has put the flora in this district at risk. We require assistance in gathering seeds of the rarer specimens before they are eaten into extinction."
msgstr "В округе расплодилось множество существ, пожирающих растения. Помогите собрать семена редких видов, пока они не исчезли совсем."

#. ja: 「希少植物の種子」の回収に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Bei der Bergung der seltenen Pflanzensamen helfen? <br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Récupérer les graines<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: The sudden emergence of foraging organisms has put the flora in this district at risk. We require assistance in gathering seeds of the rarer specimens before they are eaten into extinction.
#. column 60: Your assistance is appreciated. Please bring any seeds you recover to me.
#. column 62: Request for assistance denied... Please enjoy the rest of your time in Windspath Gardens.
