msgctxt "FateEvent:690:0:57"
msgid "Help gather rare plant seeds?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать семена редких растений?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 要請の受諾を確認、感謝します。<br>集めた種子は、一定期限内に当機にお渡しください。
#. de: Unterstützungsgesuch wurde angenommen. Bitte um sofortige Bergung der Pflanzensamen.
#. fr: Vous avez accepté ma requête, merci. Vous pourrez me remettre toutes les graines que vous aurez récupérées dans le temps imparti.
#. column 56: The sudden emergence of foraging organisms has put the flora in this district at risk. We require assistance in gathering seeds of the rarer specimens before they are eaten into extinction.
#. column 57: Help gather rare plant seeds?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Request for assistance denied... Please enjoy the rest of your time in Windspath Gardens.
msgctxt "FateEvent:690:0:60"
msgid "Your assistance is appreciated. Please bring any seeds you recover to me."
msgstr "Благодарю за помощь. Принесите мне собранные семена."

#. ja: 要請の拒否を確認……。<br>引き続き、ウィンドパスガーデンでのひとときを、<br>お楽しみください。
#. de: Unterstützungsgesuch wurde abgelehnt. Viel Vergnügen noch in den Windpfadgärten.
#. fr: Vous avez refusé ma requête. Profitez du reste de votre visite des jardins de Soufflevent.
#. column 56: The sudden emergence of foraging organisms has put the flora in this district at risk. We require assistance in gathering seeds of the rarer specimens before they are eaten into extinction.
#. column 57: Help gather rare plant seeds?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your assistance is appreciated. Please bring any seeds you recover to me.
msgctxt "FateEvent:690:0:62"
msgid "Request for assistance denied... Please enjoy the rest of your time in Windspath Gardens."
msgstr "Запрос о помощи отклонён... Приятного отдыха в садах Виндспас."

#. ja: 「希少植物の種子」は、地面に落ちているものの取得、<br>もしくは小動物からの奪取で入手可能……。<br>回収方法は一任します。
#. de: Pflanzensamen können geborgen werden, indem sie vom Boden aufgelesen oder direkt aus einer kleinen Lebensform entnommen werden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez ramasser les graines tombées par terre ou les arracher directement aux créatures. Je vous laisse libre de choisir la méthode que vous préférez.
msgctxt "FateEvent:691:0:56"
msgid "You can find the seeds scattered about the ground, or if you're brave enough, you can slay the creatures and take the seeds straight from their mouths. I leave the means of gathering them up to you."
msgstr "Семена можно найти на земле, а если хватит смелости — убить существ и достать их прямо из пасти. Способ сбора выбирайте сами."

#. ja: 「希少植物の種子」をお持ちでしたら、<br>当機にお渡しください。
#. de: Erbitte die Übergabe der Pflanzensamen im Besitz <if $gn4>der Unterstützerin<else>des Unterstützers</if>.
#. fr: Si vous avez des graines de plantes rares, vous pouvez me les remettre.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of seeds... Your assistance is appreciated.
#. column 61: However, the number is insufficient to regrow what has been lost. Your further assistance is kindly requested.
#. column 62: Your objective remains to be the recovery of rare plant seeds.
msgctxt "FateEvent:692:0:56"
msgid "Please return any seeds you gather to me."
msgstr "Если собрали семена, отдайте их мне."

#. ja: 当該の種子を確認……<br>協力に感謝します。
#. de: Pflanzensamenüberprüfung eingeleitet. Danke für die Unterstützung.
#. fr: Remise de graines détectée... Merci pour votre aide.
#. column 56: Please return any seeds you gather to me.
#. column 61: However, the number is insufficient to regrow what has been lost. Your further assistance is kindly requested.
#. column 62: Your objective remains to be the recovery of rare plant seeds.
msgctxt "FateEvent:692:0:60"
msgid "Confirming receipt of seeds... Your assistance is appreciated."
msgstr "Семена получены... Благодарю за помощь."

#. ja: しかし、確保数は未だ既定値未満……<br>引き続きの回収、よろしくお願いします。
#. de: Anzahl der geborgenen Pflanzensamen unterschreitet den Vorgabewert. Bitte um Fortsetzung der Bergung!
#. fr: Confirmation de l'aide reçue. Continuez ainsi.
#. column 56: Please return any seeds you gather to me.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of seeds... Your assistance is appreciated.
#. column 62: Your objective remains to be the recovery of rare plant seeds.
msgctxt "FateEvent:692:0:61"
msgid "However, the number is insufficient to regrow what has been lost. Your further assistance is kindly requested."
msgstr "Но семян пока недостаточно, чтобы восстановить утраченное... Продолжайте сбор."

#. ja: 支援者の方針を確認……。<br>引き続きの回収、よろしくお願いします。
#. de: Überprüfe Zielsetzung <if $gn4>der Unterstützerin<else>des Unterstützers</if>. Bitte um Fortsetzung der Bergung!
#. fr: Nombre de graines insuffisant. Essayez d'en rapporter d'autres.
#. column 56: Please return any seeds you gather to me.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of seeds... Your assistance is appreciated.
#. column 61: However, the number is insufficient to regrow what has been lost. Your further assistance is kindly requested.
msgctxt "FateEvent:692:0:62"
msgid "Your objective remains to be the recovery of rare plant seeds."
msgstr "Ваша задача — собрать редкие семена."

#. ja: 確保数が既定値に到達……。<br>余剰分があればぜひ当機に納品願います。
#. de: Anzahl der geborgenen Pflanzensamen hat den Vorgabewert erreicht. Bitte um Übergabe verbleibender Pflanzensamen.
#. fr: Nombre de graines reçues suffisant. Si vous en avez d'autres, n'hésitez pas à me les remettre quand même.
msgctxt "FateEvent:693:0:56"
msgid "You have recovered enough seeds to ensure the survival of this district's rare plant life. However, a surplus is preferable, so I request that you bring any additional seeds gathered to me."
msgstr "Собранных семян хватит, чтобы сохранить редкие растения в этом районе. Но чем больше, тем лучше, так что принесите мне и остальные."

#. ja: 確保数が既定値に到達……。<br>余剰分があればぜひ当機に納品願います。
#. de: Anzahl der geborgenen Pflanzensamen hat den Vorgabewert erreicht. Bitte um Übergabe verbleibender Pflanzensamen.
#. fr: Nombre de graines reçues suffisant. Si vous en avez d'autres, n'hésitez pas à me les remettre quand même.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of seeds... Your assistance is appreciated.
#. column 62: Your current objective is to go above and beyond to gather more seeds and deliver them here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:694:0:56"
msgid "You have recovered enough seeds to ensure the survival of this district's rare plant life. However, a surplus is preferable, so I request that you bring any additional seeds gathered to me."
msgstr "Собранных семян хватит, чтобы сохранить редкие растения в этом районе. Но чем больше, тем лучше, так что принесите мне и остальные."

#. ja: 「希少植物の種子」を確認……<br>協力に感謝します。
#. de: Pflanzensamenüberprüfung eingeleitet. Danke für die Unterstützung.
#. fr: Graines de plantes rares détectées... Merci pour votre aide.
#. column 56: You have recovered enough seeds to ensure the survival of this district's rare plant life. However, a surplus is preferable, so I request that you bring any additional seeds gathered to me.
#. column 62: Your current objective is to go above and beyond to gather more seeds and deliver them here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:694:0:60"
msgid "Confirming receipt of seeds... Your assistance is appreciated."
msgstr "Редкие семена получены... Благодарю за помощь."

#. ja: 支援者の方針を確認……。<br>余剰分があればぜひ当機に納品願います。
#. de: Überprüfe Zielsetzung <if $gn4>der Unterstützerin<else>des Unterstützers</if>. Bitte um Übergabe verbleibender Pflanzensamen.
#. fr: Si vous en avez d'autres, n'hésitez pas à me les remettre quand même.
#. column 56: You have recovered enough seeds to ensure the survival of this district's rare plant life. However, a surplus is preferable, so I request that you bring any additional seeds gathered to me.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of seeds... Your assistance is appreciated.
msgctxt "FateEvent:694:0:62"
msgid "Your current objective is to go above and beyond to gather more seeds and deliver them here."
msgstr "Ваша задача — собрать ещё семян и принести их сюда."

#. ja: おや、旅人さんですかな？<br>何を隠そうこの私、地元では名のしれた釣り名人でしてね！
#. de: Du bist nicht von hier, oder? Und trotzdem wusstest du gleich, wen du ansprechen musst, wenn du dem besten Fischer in der Umgebung über die Schulter schauen willst.
#. fr: Salut à toi, <if $gn4>voyageuse<else>voyageur</if>, hou<nbsp>! Sans doute l'ignores-tu, mais je suis célèbre dans cette région pour mes talents de pêcheur.
#. column 57: If you're willing to watch, I'll soon prove my skills!
#. column 58: Keep an eye on the Hanuhanu angler?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Lured you in, did I? Very good, very good! I'll have something on my line in no time!
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps you are none too fond of fish?
msgctxt "FateEvent:695:0:56"
msgid "A traveler, yes? Well, traveler, you are currently speaking to a rather accomplished angler!"
msgstr "Путник, верно? Перед тобой весьма искусный рыбак!"

#. ja: 少しお待ちいただければ、<br>それは見事な魚を釣り上げてご覧にいれましょう。<br>ぜひ、ぜひ、見守っていてください！
#. de: Falls du noch ein wenig Zeit hast, zeige ich dir gern, welchen großartigen Fang ich heute aus dem Wasser ziehe.
#. fr: Si tu as un peu de temps, je pourrais même t'en faire la dé<shy>mon<shy>stra<shy>tion en attrapant un magnifique poisson. Veux-tu bien veiller sur moi pendant que je lance ma ligne<nbsp>?
#. column 56: A traveler, yes? Well, traveler, you are currently speaking to a rather accomplished angler!
#. column 58: Keep an eye on the Hanuhanu angler?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Lured you in, did I? Very good, very good! I'll have something on my line in no time!
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps you are none too fond of fish?
msgctxt "FateEvent:695:0:57"
msgid "If you're willing to watch, I'll soon prove my skills!"
msgstr "Хочешь посмотреть? Скоро я докажу, на что способен!"

#. ja: 釣りの様子を見守りますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Hanuhanu-Fischer zuschauen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Veiller sur le pêcheur hanu hanu pendant qu'il pêche<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: A traveler, yes? Well, traveler, you are currently speaking to a rather accomplished angler!
#. column 57: If you're willing to watch, I'll soon prove my skills!
#. column 60: Lured you in, did I? Very good, very good! I'll have something on my line in no time!
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps you are none too fond of fish?
