msgid "Keep an eye on the Hanuhanu angler?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Понаблюдать за рыбаком ханухану?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: やはりやはり、気になるようですね。<br>ならばさっそく、釣り上げてみせましょう……！
#. de: Wer könnte da auch nein sagen? Sieh zu und staune, was ich gleich an der Angel habe!
#. fr: Hou, hou<nbsp>! Je savais que ça t'intéresserait<nbsp>! Dans ce cas, regarde-moi faire<nbsp>!
#. column 56: A traveler, yes? Well, traveler, you are currently speaking to a rather accomplished angler!
#. column 57: If you're willing to watch, I'll soon prove my skills!
#. column 58: Keep an eye on the Hanuhanu angler?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps you are none too fond of fish?
msgctxt "FateEvent:695:0:60"
msgid "Lured you in, did I? Very good, very good! I'll have something on my line in no time!"
msgstr "Попался на удочку, да? Вот и славно! Скоро что-нибудь клюнет!"

#. ja: これはこれは、残念です。<br>もしかして、旅人さんは魚嫌いなのですか？
#. de: Wie, du möchtest nicht? Sag bloß, du magst keine Fische?!
#. fr: Je vois, c'est bien dommage, hou<nbsp>! Mais si tu n'aimes pas le poisson, je n'y peux rien.
#. column 56: A traveler, yes? Well, traveler, you are currently speaking to a rather accomplished angler!
#. column 57: If you're willing to watch, I'll soon prove my skills!
#. column 58: Keep an eye on the Hanuhanu angler?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Lured you in, did I? Very good, very good! I'll have something on my line in no time!
msgctxt "FateEvent:695:0:62"
msgid "A pity. Perhaps you are none too fond of fish?"
msgstr "Жаль. Уж не рыбу ли ты не любишь?"

#. ja: これはこれは、いいところに……<br>あなた、狩りはお得意で？
#. de: Oh, na so was! Ich weiß zwar nicht, was dich in diese Gegend verschlägt, aber du siehst mir kräftig aus.
#. fr: Hou, hou<nbsp>! Tu tombes bien, <if $gn4>voyageuse<else>voyageur</if> sans plumes<nbsp>! Je devine que tu es <if $gn4>une bonne chasseuse<else>un bon chasseur</if>.
#. column 57: As it so happens, my field is plagued with ferocious fish. Would you be willing to thin their numbers and give my crop some respite?
#. column 58: Help the Hanuhanu farmer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Aha. Most excellent! I myself dread to go near the slimy beasts...
#. column 62: Unfortunate, but perhaps unsurprising. Whatever will I do with these fishy fiends...
msgctxt "FateEvent:696:0:56"
msgid "Aha. I sense my luck might be turning. You strike me as a capable hunter..."
msgstr "О, кажется, удача мне улыбнулась. Ты похож на умелого охотника..."

#. ja: 実は水田の近くに、葦の根を切る害魚が出没してまして……<br>よければ、退治に力を貸していただきたいのです。
#. de: Stell dir vor<nbsp>- in meinem Feld haben sich Fische eingenistet, die das ganze schöne Schilf zerstören. Könntest du dich nicht vielleicht darum kümmern?
#. fr: Il se trouve que des poissons mangeurs de roseaux sont apparus près de mes roselières. Veux-tu bien les éliminer pour moi avant qu'ils ne ruinent ma récolte<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Aha. I sense my luck might be turning. You strike me as a capable hunter...
#. column 58: Help the Hanuhanu farmer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Aha. Most excellent! I myself dread to go near the slimy beasts...
#. column 62: Unfortunate, but perhaps unsurprising. Whatever will I do with these fishy fiends...
msgctxt "FateEvent:696:0:57"
msgid "As it so happens, my field is plagued with ferocious fish. Would you be willing to thin their numbers and give my crop some respite?"
msgstr "В моё поле повадились свирепые рыбы. Не поможешь проредить их стаю, чтобы дать урожаю передышку?"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Hanuhanu-Farmer helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le fermier hanu hanu<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Aha. I sense my luck might be turning. You strike me as a capable hunter...
#. column 57: As it so happens, my field is plagued with ferocious fish. Would you be willing to thin their numbers and give my crop some respite?
#. column 60: Aha. Most excellent! I myself dread to go near the slimy beasts...
#. column 62: Unfortunate, but perhaps unsurprising. Whatever will I do with these fishy fiends...
