msgctxt "FateEvent:696:0:58"
msgid "Help the Hanuhanu farmer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь фермеру ханухану?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ああ、助かります！<br>アイツらヌメヌメしていて、どうにも苦手なんですよ……。
#. de: Ich danke dir! Es ist einfach nicht zu fassen, zu was für einer Plage sich diese glitschigen Viecher entwickelt haben.
#. fr: Hou, je t'en suis infiniment re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sant<nbsp>! Moi, j'ai tellement horreur de ces bestioles que la simple idée de m'en approcher me hérisse les plumes.
#. column 56: Aha. I sense my luck might be turning. You strike me as a capable hunter...
#. column 57: As it so happens, my field is plagued with ferocious fish. Would you be willing to thin their numbers and give my crop some respite?
#. column 58: Help the Hanuhanu farmer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Unfortunate, but perhaps unsurprising. Whatever will I do with these fishy fiends...
msgctxt "FateEvent:696:0:60"
msgid "Aha. Most excellent! I myself dread to go near the slimy beasts..."
msgstr "Вот это удача! Сам я боюсь даже близко подходить к этим скользким тварям..."

#. ja: 残念ですが仕方ありませんね。<br>さてさて、害魚をどうしたものか……。
#. de: Nun gut, es ist ja schließlich auch nicht dein Problem. Mal schauen, was ich da allein noch ausrichten kann<nbsp>...
#. fr: Tant pis, hou<nbsp>! Comment vais-je me débarrasser de ces méchants orobons<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Aha. I sense my luck might be turning. You strike me as a capable hunter...
#. column 57: As it so happens, my field is plagued with ferocious fish. Would you be willing to thin their numbers and give my crop some respite?
#. column 58: Help the Hanuhanu farmer?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Aha. Most excellent! I myself dread to go near the slimy beasts...
msgctxt "FateEvent:696:0:62"
msgid "Unfortunate, but perhaps unsurprising. Whatever will I do with these fishy fiends..."
msgstr "Жаль, но я не удивлён. Что же делать с этими рыбами-вредителями..."

#. ja: 当機はセントリーGX-0090、<br>現在、カナルタウンの定期調査中です。
#. de: Hier spricht Einheit GX-0090. Ich befinde mich momentan auf Patrouille in Kanalstadt.
#. fr: Je suis la sentinelle GX-0090, ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment en patrouille dans la Cité lacustre.
#. column 57: However, continuous assault of our patrol by roaming creatures has made progress impossible. We request assistance in combating them.
#. column 58: Assist the patrol?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Request for aid accepted. Please accompany us as we continue our patrol.
#. column 62: Request for aid denied. We must search for help elsewhere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:697:0:56"
msgid "Unit identification: GX-0090. We are currently undergoing our regular patrol of Canal Town."
msgstr "Идентификатор подразделения: GX-0090. Проводим плановое патрулирование Канал-Тауна."

#. ja: しかし、当該区画にて「トルバラン」による襲撃を受け、<br>任務を中断……<br>可能であれば、調査の支援を求めます。
#. de: Empfange Berichte über Sichtungen von Torbalan-Angriffen. Sende Unterstützungsgesuch.
#. fr: Cependant, à cause d'une attaque de torbalans survenue dans ce secteur, j'ai dû interrompre ma mission.
#. column 56: Unit identification: GX-0090. We are currently undergoing our regular patrol of Canal Town.
#. column 58: Assist the patrol?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Request for aid accepted. Please accompany us as we continue our patrol.
#. column 62: Request for aid denied. We must search for help elsewhere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:697:0:57"
msgid "However, continuous assault of our patrol by roaming creatures has made progress impossible. We request assistance in combating them."
msgstr "Но на патруль постоянно нападают бродячие существа, и мы не можем продвинуться дальше. Просим помочь отбиться от них."

#. ja: 手を貸しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Unterstützung anbieten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la sentinelle<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Unit identification: GX-0090. We are currently undergoing our regular patrol of Canal Town.
#. column 57: However, continuous assault of our patrol by roaming creatures has made progress impossible. We request assistance in combating them.
#. column 60: Request for aid accepted. Please accompany us as we continue our patrol.
#. column 62: Request for aid denied. We must search for help elsewhere.
