msgctxt "FateEvent:697:0:58"
msgid "Assist the patrol?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь патрулю?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 協力要請の受諾を確認……<br>これより、調査任務を再開します。
#. de: Unterstützungsgesuch wurde angenommen. Setze Patrouille fort.
#. fr: Demande d'aide acceptée. Reprise de la mission d'inspection.
#. column 56: Unit identification: GX-0090. We are currently undergoing our regular patrol of Canal Town.
#. column 57: However, continuous assault of our patrol by roaming creatures has made progress impossible. We request assistance in combating them.
#. column 58: Assist the patrol?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Request for aid denied. We must search for help elsewhere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:697:0:60"
msgid "Request for aid accepted. Please accompany us as we continue our patrol."
msgstr "Запрос о помощи принят. Продолжаем патрулирование. Просим следовать за нами."

#. ja: 協力要請の却下を確認……<br>引き続き、支援者を募ります。
#. de: Unterstützungsgesuch wurde abgelehnt. Suche nach Unterstützung wird fortgesetzt.
#. fr: Demande d'aide refusée. La recherche de collaborateurs va continuer.
#. column 56: Unit identification: GX-0090. We are currently undergoing our regular patrol of Canal Town.
#. column 57: However, continuous assault of our patrol by roaming creatures has made progress impossible. We request assistance in combating them.
#. column 58: Assist the patrol?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Request for aid accepted. Please accompany us as we continue our patrol.
msgctxt "FateEvent:697:0:62"
msgid "Request for aid denied. We must search for help elsewhere."
msgstr "Запрос о помощи отклонён. Придётся искать помощников в другом месте."

#. ja: 襲撃者「トルバラン」の出現を確認。<br>調査の障害を排除してください。
#. de: Torbalan gesichtet. Erbitte Beginn der Eliminierung.
#. fr: Présence de torbalans avérée dans le secteur. Mettez-les hors d'état de nuire.
msgctxt "FateEvent:698:0:56"
msgid "Aggressive organisms detected. Help us exterminate them so our patrol may proceed."
msgstr "Обнаружены агрессивные существа. Помогите уничтожить их, чтобы мы могли продолжить патрулирование."

#. ja: あなた、とっても強そうね！<br>もし時間があるなら、ちょっと頼みを聞いていただけないかしら？
#. de: Oh, du siehst kräftig und zugleich vertrauensvoll aus. Dürfte ich dich wohl um einen Gefallen bitten?
#. fr: Tu as l'air de quelqu'un de très fort, <if $gn4>voyageuse<else>voyageur</if><nbsp>! Veux-tu bien écouter mon problème, hou<nbsp>?
#. column 57: I have taken delivery of several crates of fruit we shall offer to the holy bird Kixaihih, but I fear the sweet scent will attract some unwanted attention...
#. column 58: If any toucalibri appear, I would ask that you swiftly dispatch them and keep the crates safe. Can I count on your aid?
#. column 59: Protect the bountiful offerings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Ah, this is a blessed day indeed. Kixaihih will be most pleased!
#. column 62: Ah, you must be busy, yes? Pray be careful of the birds as you go about your business...
msgctxt "FateEvent:699:0:56"
msgid "I say, you look rather strong and dependable! If you can spare the time, might I enlist your help in a small matter?"
msgstr "Судя по всему, ты сильный и надёжный человек! Если найдётся время, не поможешь мне с одним делом?"

#. ja: アタシたちが信仰している神鳥、<br>キシャイヒー様に奉納する果物が届いたんだけど、<br>それを狙って、厄介な鳥が集まるかもしれなくて……。
#. de: Ich habe hier ein paar Obstkisten, die ich unserem Gott Kixaihih darbringen möchte. Allerdings wird der Geruch sicherlich einige ungebetene Gäste anlocken.
#. fr: J'ai apporté des fruits pour les offrir à notre divinité Kixaihih, mais de vilains oiseaux vont sans doute essayer de me les voler.
#. column 56: I say, you look rather strong and dependable! If you can spare the time, might I enlist your help in a small matter?
#. column 58: If any toucalibri appear, I would ask that you swiftly dispatch them and keep the crates safe. Can I count on your aid?
#. column 59: Protect the bountiful offerings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Ah, this is a blessed day indeed. Kixaihih will be most pleased!
#. column 62: Ah, you must be busy, yes? Pray be careful of the birds as you go about your business...
msgctxt "FateEvent:699:0:57"
msgid "I have taken delivery of several crates of fruit we shall offer to the holy bird Kixaihih, but I fear the sweet scent will attract some unwanted attention..."
msgstr "Мне доставили несколько ящиков фруктов для священной птицы Кшайхихи. Боюсь, сладкий запах привлечёт непрошеных гостей..."

#. ja: トゥカリブリって鳥が現れたら、<br>撃退して、果物を守ってほしいの……。<br>お願いできないかな？
#. de: Daher würde ich dich gern bitten, jeden Tukalibri zu erledigen, der es wagt, sich den Opfergaben zu nähern.
#. fr: Si jamais tu vois des toucanlibris s'approcher, tu veux bien les chasser et protéger mes offrandes, s'il te plaît, hou<nbsp>?
#. column 56: I say, you look rather strong and dependable! If you can spare the time, might I enlist your help in a small matter?
#. column 57: I have taken delivery of several crates of fruit we shall offer to the holy bird Kixaihih, but I fear the sweet scent will attract some unwanted attention...
#. column 59: Protect the bountiful offerings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Ah, this is a blessed day indeed. Kixaihih will be most pleased!
#. column 62: Ah, you must be busy, yes? Pray be careful of the birds as you go about your business...
msgctxt "FateEvent:699:0:58"
msgid "If any toucalibri appear, I would ask that you swiftly dispatch them and keep the crates safe. Can I count on your aid?"
msgstr "Если появятся тукалибли, прогони их и защити ящики. Поможешь?"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Obstkisten beschützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la sibylle hanu hanu<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: I say, you look rather strong and dependable! If you can spare the time, might I enlist your help in a small matter?
#. column 57: I have taken delivery of several crates of fruit we shall offer to the holy bird Kixaihih, but I fear the sweet scent will attract some unwanted attention...
#. column 58: If any toucalibri appear, I would ask that you swiftly dispatch them and keep the crates safe. Can I count on your aid?
#. column 60: Ah, this is a blessed day indeed. Kixaihih will be most pleased!
#. column 62: Ah, you must be busy, yes? Pray be careful of the birds as you go about your business...
