msgctxt "FateEvent:699:0:59"
msgid "Protect the bountiful offerings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Защитить щедрые подношения?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 本当に本当に、ありがとう！<br>あなたの善意に、キシャイヒー様も喜んでくれるはずよ！
#. de: Ich danke dir. Möge Kixaihih dich segnen!
#. fr: Vraiment<nbsp>? Quelle chance d'être tombée sur une personne généreuse comme toi<nbsp>! Kixaihih te remerciera sûrement, hou<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I say, you look rather strong and dependable! If you can spare the time, might I enlist your help in a small matter?
#. column 57: I have taken delivery of several crates of fruit we shall offer to the holy bird Kixaihih, but I fear the sweet scent will attract some unwanted attention...
#. column 58: If any toucalibri appear, I would ask that you swiftly dispatch them and keep the crates safe. Can I count on your aid?
#. column 59: Protect the bountiful offerings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Ah, you must be busy, yes? Pray be careful of the birds as you go about your business...
msgctxt "FateEvent:699:0:60"
msgid "Ah, this is a blessed day indeed. Kixaihih will be most pleased!"
msgstr "Какой благословенный день! Кшайхихи будет очень доволен!"

#. ja: あらあら、お忙しいのね。<br>どうか、あなたも厄介な鳥たちには気をつけて……。
#. de: Natürlich, du bist schließlich <if $gn4>eine vielbeschäftigte Frau<else>ein vielbeschäftigter Mann</if>. Nimm dich bloß in Acht vor diesen gierigen Vögeln.
#. fr: Tu as sans doute mieux à faire, hou... En tout cas, fais bien attention aux oiseaux dangereux qui rôdent dans les environs, toi aussi, hou<nbsp>!
#. column 56: I say, you look rather strong and dependable! If you can spare the time, might I enlist your help in a small matter?
#. column 57: I have taken delivery of several crates of fruit we shall offer to the holy bird Kixaihih, but I fear the sweet scent will attract some unwanted attention...
#. column 58: If any toucalibri appear, I would ask that you swiftly dispatch them and keep the crates safe. Can I count on your aid?
#. column 59: Protect the bountiful offerings?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Ah, this is a blessed day indeed. Kixaihih will be most pleased!
msgctxt "FateEvent:699:0:62"
msgid "Ah, you must be busy, yes? Pray be careful of the birds as you go about your business..."
msgstr "Ах, ты, должно быть, занят. Будь осторожен с птицами, пока занимаешься своими делами..."

#. ja: 当該区画にて、僚機の大量破壊を確認。<br>調査のため、メモリーチップの回収に協力を求めます。
#. de: Empfange Berichte über zahlreiche beschädigte Maschinensoldaten in diesem Sektor. Speicherkarten müssen geborgen werden.
#. fr: Beaucoup de sentinelles en panne détectées dans ce secteur. Je recherche des collaborateurs pour récupérer leurs cartes mémoire.
#. column 57: Help recover the memory chips?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Request for aid accepted. Please stand by while I brief you the details of our request.
#. column 62: Request for aid denied. I must search for help elsewhere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:700:0:56"
msgid "We have received reports of numerous fallen sentries in this district. Their memory chips must be recovered, and we require aid to gather them all."
msgstr "Мы получили сообщения о множестве павших часовых в этом районе. Нужно собрать их чипы памяти. Нам требуется помощь."

#. ja: 「機械兵のメモリーチップ」の回収に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Bei der Bergung der Speicherkarten helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la sentinelle<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: We have received reports of numerous fallen sentries in this district. Their memory chips must be recovered, and we require aid to gather them all.
#. column 60: Request for aid accepted. Please stand by while I brief you the details of our request.
#. column 62: Request for aid denied. I must search for help elsewhere.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
