#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:700:0:57"
msgid "Help recover the memory chips?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь собрать чипы памяти?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 協力要請の受諾を確認……<br>これより、詳細な任務の説明を行います。
#. de: Unterstützungsgesuch wurde angenommen. Beginne mit Erläuterung der Einzelheiten.
#. fr: Demande d'aide acceptée. Laissez-moi vous expliquer la mission.
#. column 56: We have received reports of numerous fallen sentries in this district. Their memory chips must be recovered, and we require aid to gather them all.
#. column 57: Help recover the memory chips?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Request for aid denied. I must search for help elsewhere.
msgctxt "FateEvent:700:0:60"
msgid "Request for aid accepted. Please stand by while I brief you the details of our request."
msgstr "Запрос о помощи принят. Ожидайте, сейчас я объясню задачу."

#. ja: 協力要請の却下を確認……<br>引き続き、支援者を募ります。
#. de: Unterstützungsgesuch wurde abgelehnt. Suche nach Unterstützung wird fortgesetzt.
#. fr: Demande d'aide refusée. La recherche de collaborateurs va continuer.
#. column 56: We have received reports of numerous fallen sentries in this district. Their memory chips must be recovered, and we require aid to gather them all.
#. column 57: Help recover the memory chips?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Request for aid accepted. Please stand by while I brief you the details of our request.
msgctxt "FateEvent:700:0:62"
msgid "Request for aid denied. I must search for help elsewhere."
msgstr "Запрос о помощи отклонён. Придётся искать помощников в другом месте."

#. ja: 「機械兵のメモリーチップ」は、破損機体を調べるか、<br>破壊者であるガルガンチュアから奪還することで入手可能です。
#. de: Speicherkarten können geborgen werden, indem eine beschädigte Einheit untersucht oder ein angreifender Gargantua eliminiert wird.
#. fr: Vous pouvez récupérer les cartes mémoire sur les sentinelles cassées, ou les arracher aux gargantuas qui sont res<shy>pon<shy>sa<shy>bles de ces dégâts.
msgctxt "FateEvent:701:0:56"
msgid "The memory chips of the destroyed units are scattered across the ground, but you can also pry them from the hands the gargantuas─if you can kill them, that is."
msgstr "Чипы памяти разбитых машин разбросаны по земле. Можно также вырвать их из лап гаргантуа — если, конечно, сумеете их убить."

#. ja: 調査のため、メモリーチップの回収後は、<br>速やかに当機へお渡しください。
#. de: Erbitte die Übergabe der Speicherkarten im Besitz <if $gn4>der Unterstützerin<else>des Unterstützers</if>.
#. fr: Remettez-moi les cartes mémoire pour que je puisse avancer dans mon in<shy>ves<shy>ti<shy>ga<shy>tion, s'il vous plaît.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of memory chips... Your assistance is appreciated.
#. column 61: However, the amount is insufficient to perform a detailed analysis of events. Please continue to collect the chips.
#. column 62: Your mission continues to be the collection and delivery of memory chips.
msgctxt "FateEvent:702:0:56"
msgid "Return any recovered memory chips to me as soon as possible. They are required if we are to determine the cause of this destruction."
msgstr "Как можно скорее принесите мне все найденные чипы памяти. Они нужны, чтобы выяснить причину разрушений."

#. ja: 当該のメモリーチップを確認……<br>協力に感謝します。
#. de: Speicherkartenüberprüfung eingeleitet. Danke für die Unterstützung.
#. fr: Remise de cartes mémoire détectée... Merci pour votre aide.
#. column 56: Return any recovered memory chips to me as soon as possible. They are required if we are to determine the cause of this destruction.
#. column 61: However, the amount is insufficient to perform a detailed analysis of events. Please continue to collect the chips.
#. column 62: Your mission continues to be the collection and delivery of memory chips.
msgctxt "FateEvent:702:0:60"
msgid "Confirming receipt of memory chips... Your assistance is appreciated."
msgstr "Чипы памяти получены... Благодарю за помощь."

#. ja: しかし、確保数は未だ既定値未満……<br>引き続きの回収、よろしくお願いします。
#. de: Anzahl der geborgenen Speicherkarten unterschreitet den Vorgabewert. Bitte um Fortsetzung der Bergung!
#. fr: Confirmation de l'aide reçue. Continuez ainsi.
#. column 56: Return any recovered memory chips to me as soon as possible. They are required if we are to determine the cause of this destruction.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of memory chips... Your assistance is appreciated.
#. column 62: Your mission continues to be the collection and delivery of memory chips.
msgctxt "FateEvent:702:0:61"
msgid "However, the amount is insufficient to perform a detailed analysis of events. Please continue to collect the chips."
msgstr "Но чипов недостаточно, чтобы провести подробный анализ... Продолжайте сбор."

#. ja: 支援者の方針を確認……。<br>引き続きの回収、よろしくお願いします。
#. de: Überprüfe Zielsetzung <if $gn4>der Unterstützerin<else>des Unterstützers</if>. Bitte um Fortsetzung der Bergung!
#. fr: Nombre de cartes mémoire insuffisant. Essayez d'en rapporter d'autres.
#. column 56: Return any recovered memory chips to me as soon as possible. They are required if we are to determine the cause of this destruction.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of memory chips... Your assistance is appreciated.
#. column 61: However, the amount is insufficient to perform a detailed analysis of events. Please continue to collect the chips.
msgctxt "FateEvent:702:0:62"
msgid "Your mission continues to be the collection and delivery of memory chips."
msgstr "Ваша задача — собрать чипы памяти и доставить их мне."

#. ja: 確保数が既定値に到達……。<br>余剰分があればぜひ当機に納品願います。
#. de: Anzahl der geborgenen Speicherkarten hat den Vorgabewert erreicht. Bitte um Übergabe verbleibender Speicherkarten.
#. fr: Nombre de cartes mémoire reçues suffisant. Si vous en avez d'autres, n'hésitez pas à me les remettre quand même.
msgctxt "FateEvent:703:0:56"
msgid "The requisite number of memory chips has been collected. However, more will give us a clearer picture of events, so you are encouraged to bring me as many as you can."
msgstr "Нужное число чипов памяти собрано. Но чем больше их будет, тем яснее мы поймём, что произошло. Постарайтесь принести как можно больше."

#. ja: 確保数が既定値に到達……。<br>余剰分があればぜひ当機に納品願います。
#. de: Anzahl der geborgenen Speicherkarten hat den Vorgabewert erreicht. Bitte um Übergabe verbleibender Speicherkarten.
#. fr: Nombre de cartes mémoire reçues suffisant. Si vous en avez d'autres, n'hésitez pas à me les remettre quand même.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of memory chips... Your assistance is appreciated.
#. column 62: Your mission continues to be the collection and delivery of memory chips, that we might paint a full picture of what occurred here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:704:0:56"
msgid "The requisite number of memory chips has been collected. However, more will give us a clearer picture of events, so you are encouraged to bring me as many as you can."
msgstr "Нужное число чипов памяти собрано. Но чем больше их будет, тем яснее мы поймём, что произошло. Постарайтесь принести как можно больше."

#. ja: 「機械兵のメモリーチップ」を確認……<br>協力に感謝します。
#. de: Speicherkartenüberprüfung eingeleitet. Danke für die Unterstützung.
#. fr: Cartes mémoire de sentinelles détectées... Merci pour votre aide.
#. column 56: The requisite number of memory chips has been collected. However, more will give us a clearer picture of events, so you are encouraged to bring me as many as you can.
#. column 62: Your mission continues to be the collection and delivery of memory chips, that we might paint a full picture of what occurred here.
msgctxt "FateEvent:704:0:60"
msgid "Confirming receipt of memory chips... Your assistance is appreciated."
msgstr "Чипы памяти получены... Благодарю за помощь."

#. ja: 支援者の方針を確認……。<br>余剰分があればぜひ当機に納品願います。
#. de: Überprüfe Zielsetzung <if $gn4>der Unterstützerin<else>des Unterstützers</if>. Bitte um Übergabe verbleibender Speicherkarten.
#. fr: Si vous en avez d'autres, n'hésitez pas à me les remettre quand même.
#. column 56: The requisite number of memory chips has been collected. However, more will give us a clearer picture of events, so you are encouraged to bring me as many as you can.
#. column 60: Confirming receipt of memory chips... Your assistance is appreciated.
msgctxt "FateEvent:704:0:62"
msgid "Your mission continues to be the collection and delivery of memory chips, that we might paint a full picture of what occurred here."
msgstr "Ваша задача — собрать и принести сюда ещё чипов, чтобы мы могли восстановить полную картину произошедшего."

#. ja: ああ、そこの道行く強そうなお方！<br>助けてください、ぼくたちを！
#. de: Oh, du kommst wie gerufen! Du siehst aus, als könntest du uns helfen, so stark wie du bist.
#. fr: Ah, dis-moi, <if $gn4>voyageuse<else>voyageur</if>, toi qui parcours cette région, il se trouve que nous avons un grand besoin d'aide<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Those fellows claim to be from the Wing of Reflection─they accused us of tax evasion and threatened to seize our wares! Something just doesn't add up about their story, though...
#. column 58: I have an awful feeling they're the brigands the rumors speak of! Can we count on your aid?
#. column 59: Help the Pelupelu peddlers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, stranger! Pray do what you can to protect our parcels!
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps I was wrong to bank on your aid. Well, if the worse comes to worst, we'll just have to abandon our stock...
msgctxt "FateEvent:705:0:56"
msgid "You there, capable-looking stranger! We need your help!"
msgstr "Эй, незнакомец, ты выглядишь способным! Нам нужна помощь!"

#. ja: 理の院の税吏を名乗る連中に、<br>脱税がどうとか因縁をつけられて、荷箱を取られそうなんです。<br>でも、怪しいんですよ、どう見ても……ええ。
#. de: Ein paar Kämpfer haben uns tatsächlich Steuerhinterziehung vorgeworfen und grundlos unsere Waren konfisziert. Glaubt man das? Eine Un<shy>verschämt<shy>heit ist das, sag ich dir!
#. fr: Nous avons été pris à partie par des gens qui prétendent être des percepteurs d'impôt du ministère de la Raison. Ils veulent confisquer nos bagages<nbsp>! Mais tout ceci est bien trop louche<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You there, capable-looking stranger! We need your help!
#. column 58: I have an awful feeling they're the brigands the rumors speak of! Can we count on your aid?
#. column 59: Help the Pelupelu peddlers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, stranger! Pray do what you can to protect our parcels!
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps I was wrong to bank on your aid. Well, if the worse comes to worst, we'll just have to abandon our stock...
msgctxt "FateEvent:705:0:57"
msgid "Those fellows claim to be from the Wing of Reflection─they accused us of tax evasion and threatened to seize our wares! Something just doesn't add up about their story, though..."
msgstr "Эти люди называют себя служителями Крыла размышлений. Обвинили нас в уклонении от налогов и пригрозили конфисковать товар! Но в их рассказе что-то не сходится..."

#. ja: あいつらきっと、噂に聞く盗賊です。<br>どうか……助けてくれませんか！？
#. de: Angeblich arbeiten sie für den Flügel der Besinnung, aber das kommt mir komisch vor. Bestimmt sind das die Banditen, über die gerade so viele Gerüchte die Runde machen. Würdest du dich der Sache annehmen?
#. fr: J'ai la conviction que nous avons affaire à des brigands qui utilisent cette ruse pour détrousser les marchands et les voyageurs<nbsp>! Veux-tu bien nous prêter main-forte<nbsp>?
#. column 56: You there, capable-looking stranger! We need your help!
#. column 57: Those fellows claim to be from the Wing of Reflection─they accused us of tax evasion and threatened to seize our wares! Something just doesn't add up about their story, though...
#. column 59: Help the Pelupelu peddlers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, stranger! Pray do what you can to protect our parcels!
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps I was wrong to bank on your aid. Well, if the worse comes to worst, we'll just have to abandon our stock...
msgctxt "FateEvent:705:0:58"
msgid "I have an awful feeling they're the brigands the rumors speak of! Can we count on your aid?"
msgstr "У меня дурное предчувствие. Наверное, это те самые разбойники, о которых все говорят! Поможешь нам?"

#. ja: 助けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Pelupelu-Händlern helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les colporteurs pelupelu<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You there, capable-looking stranger! We need your help!
#. column 57: Those fellows claim to be from the Wing of Reflection─they accused us of tax evasion and threatened to seize our wares! Something just doesn't add up about their story, though...
#. column 58: I have an awful feeling they're the brigands the rumors speak of! Can we count on your aid?
#. column 60: Thank you, stranger! Pray do what you can to protect our parcels!
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps I was wrong to bank on your aid. Well, if the worse comes to worst, we'll just have to abandon our stock...
