#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:705:0:59"
msgid "Help the Pelupelu peddlers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь торговцам-пелупелу?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>どうか、ぼくらの荷箱を守ってください！
#. de: Vielen Dank, danke! Jetzt sehen wir sie vielleicht doch wieder, unsere Ware!
#. fr: Merci infiniment<nbsp>! Je t'en prie, fais tout pour les empêcher de voler nos bagages<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You there, capable-looking stranger! We need your help!
#. column 57: Those fellows claim to be from the Wing of Reflection─they accused us of tax evasion and threatened to seize our wares! Something just doesn't add up about their story, though...
#. column 58: I have an awful feeling they're the brigands the rumors speak of! Can we count on your aid?
#. column 59: Help the Pelupelu peddlers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: A pity. Perhaps I was wrong to bank on your aid. Well, if the worse comes to worst, we'll just have to abandon our stock...
msgctxt "FateEvent:705:0:60"
msgid "Thank you, stranger! Pray do what you can to protect our parcels!"
msgstr "Спасибо, незнакомец! Пожалуйста, сделай всё, чтобы защитить наши товары!"

#. ja: うう、わかりました……残念ですが。<br>い、いざとなったら、荷箱を捨てて逃げようと思います。
#. de: Nicht? Verstehe<nbsp>... Dann sehe ich wenig Hoffnung, dass wir unsere Ware je wiedersehen.
#. fr: Aaah... Tant pis, alors. C'est bien dommage, mais j'imagine que nous n'aurons qu'à prendre nos jambes à notre cou si ces gredins nous attaquent.
#. column 56: You there, capable-looking stranger! We need your help!
#. column 57: Those fellows claim to be from the Wing of Reflection─they accused us of tax evasion and threatened to seize our wares! Something just doesn't add up about their story, though...
#. column 58: I have an awful feeling they're the brigands the rumors speak of! Can we count on your aid?
#. column 59: Help the Pelupelu peddlers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you, stranger! Pray do what you can to protect our parcels!
msgctxt "FateEvent:705:0:62"
msgid "A pity. Perhaps I was wrong to bank on your aid. Well, if the worse comes to worst, we'll just have to abandon our stock..."
msgstr "Жаль. Похоже, зря я рассчитывал на твою помощь. Если дело станет совсем скверным, придётся бросить товар..."

#. ja: もしかしてあなた、傭兵さんだったりする？<br>そうなら助けて、僕らのことを！
#. de: Du stellst nicht zufällig dein Schwert in die Dienste anderer? Gern auch deinen Bogen oder Zauberstab, ich bin da nicht sehr wählerisch, ja ja.
#. fr: Hop, hop<nbsp>! Vous ne seriez pas mercenaire à tout hasard<nbsp>? J'ai besoin d'aide<nbsp>!
#. column 57: You see, the road to Luwateninyawawsa is simply crawling with yeheheceyaa looking for their next meal, and my poor darling alpaca here appears to be on the menu.
#. column 58: Assist the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Did you hear that, darling? Things are starting to look up!
#. column 62: Ah, well. We'll wait here a little longer. Perhaps the beasts will find another alpaca to eat.
msgctxt "FateEvent:706:0:56"
msgid "You wouldn't happen to be a sword for hire, would you? Though a bow and or wand would also suffice."
msgstr "Ты случайно не наёмник? Мечом, луком или посохом владеешь — да чем угодно!"

#. ja: 腹を空かせたエヘヘケヤーが、獲物を探してるみたいなんだ。<br>アルパカちゃんが襲われたら大変……<br>追っ払ってくれないかな、あいつらをさ！
#. de: Auf der Straße nach Luwateninyawawsa wimmelt es nämlich von Yeheheceyaa, und die scheinen mein Alpaka sehr zu mögen, also zum Fressen gern, will ich damit sagen!
#. fr: Une horde de yeheheceyaa affamés patrouille la route un peu plus loin. Et je n'ai pas envie qu'ils fassent croc croc avec mon alpaga<nbsp>! Vous voulez bien leur passer l'envie de traîner dans le coin<nbsp>?
#. column 56: You wouldn't happen to be a sword for hire, would you? Though a bow and or wand would also suffice.
#. column 58: Assist the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Did you hear that, darling? Things are starting to look up!
#. column 62: Ah, well. We'll wait here a little longer. Perhaps the beasts will find another alpaca to eat.
msgctxt "FateEvent:706:0:57"
msgid "You see, the road to Luwateninyawawsa is simply crawling with yeheheceyaa looking for their next meal, and my poor darling alpaca here appears to be on the menu."
msgstr "Дорога в Луватениньявовсу просто кишит голодными еэхехекья, которые ищут следующую добычу. И, похоже, моя бедная альпака им приглянулась."

#. ja: ペルペル族の行商人を助けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der Händlerin helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le marchand pelupelu<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You wouldn't happen to be a sword for hire, would you? Though a bow and or wand would also suffice.
#. column 57: You see, the road to Luwateninyawawsa is simply crawling with yeheheceyaa looking for their next meal, and my poor darling alpaca here appears to be on the menu.
#. column 60: Did you hear that, darling? Things are starting to look up!
#. column 62: Ah, well. We'll wait here a little longer. Perhaps the beasts will find another alpaca to eat.
