msgctxt "FateEvent:706:0:58"
msgid "Assist the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь погонщику?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとう……！<br>僕らはどうしても戦いが苦手だから、助かるよ。
#. de: Hast du gehört, mein Schatz? Unser Glück scheint sich zu wenden!
#. fr: Oh... merci<nbsp>! Je suis bien incapable de mettre ces bestioles en déroute moi-même<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You wouldn't happen to be a sword for hire, would you? Though a bow and or wand would also suffice.
#. column 57: You see, the road to Luwateninyawawsa is simply crawling with yeheheceyaa looking for their next meal, and my poor darling alpaca here appears to be on the menu.
#. column 58: Assist the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Ah, well. We'll wait here a little longer. Perhaps the beasts will find another alpaca to eat.
msgctxt "FateEvent:706:0:60"
msgid "Did you hear that, darling? Things are starting to look up!"
msgstr "Слышала, дорогая? Кажется, дело налаживается!"

#. ja: そっか、ごめん……急に言われても困るよね。<br>やっぱり引き返すべきかな……。
#. de: Also gut, dann werden wir noch etwas hier warten. Vielleicht finden die Biester ja ein anderes Alpaka, also zum Essen, mein ich.
#. fr: Ah... bon... Je vois... Désolé de vous avoir dérangé<if $gn4>e</if>. Il ne reste plus qu'à faire demi-tour alors.
#. column 56: You wouldn't happen to be a sword for hire, would you? Though a bow and or wand would also suffice.
#. column 57: You see, the road to Luwateninyawawsa is simply crawling with yeheheceyaa looking for their next meal, and my poor darling alpaca here appears to be on the menu.
#. column 58: Assist the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Did you hear that, darling? Things are starting to look up!
msgctxt "FateEvent:706:0:62"
msgid "Ah, well. We'll wait here a little longer. Perhaps the beasts will find another alpaca to eat."
msgstr "Ладно... Подождём ещё немного. Может, твари найдут себе другую альпаку на обед."

#. ja: 翼竜エヘヘケヤー……<br>「舞う翼」って意味らしいけど、<br>わざわざ通り道で舞わなくてもいいのにねえ。
#. de: Wusstest du, dass Yeheheceyaa so viel wie „tanzende Schwingen“ bedeutet? Eigentlich ganz hübsch, wenn sie nicht ständig versuchen würden, einen aufzufressen.
#. fr: J'ai entendu dire que “yeheheceyaa” signifiait “ailes dansantes”... C'est très poétique, mais s'ils pouvaient aller danser ailleurs que sur mon chemin, hein<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:707:0:56"
msgid "Did you know that yeheheceyaa means “wings that dance”? It's almost beautiful, I suppose...when they're not trying to eat you."
msgstr "А ты знал, что «йехехекея» значит «танцующие крылья»? Звучит почти красиво... если бы они не пытались тебя съесть."

#. ja: やあやあ、永久人の皆様！<br>大変長らくお待たせいたしました！
#. de: Hey, hey, hey! Ich habe euch schon viel zu lange warten lassen, meine lieben Endlosen!
#. fr: Bien le <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>bonsoir<else>bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>bonjour<else>bonsoir</if></if>, mes petits Éternels<nbsp>! Pardonnez-moi pour l'attente<nbsp>!
#. column 57: You there! You don't have to speak, for I can see it in your eyes. You wish to join the parade─no, you <i>yearn</i> to!
#. column 58: Join the parade?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hahaha, I knew it! Then take your place in our eternal march. But don't fall behind...or else!
#. column 62: Oh, you aren't ready yet? Worry not, for the eternal parade can wait for its most honored guest.
msgctxt "FateEvent:708:0:56"
msgid "Gather around, Endless one and all, for a spectacle that is sure to prove unforgettable!"
msgstr "Собирайтесь все, вечные! Вас ждёт зрелище, которое вы запомните навсегда!"

#. ja: 大丈夫、言わずともあなたの心は承知しております。<br>我らの奇妙で過激なパレードに、ご参加いただけるのですな？
#. de: Nein, sag jetzt nichts! Ich weiß schon, was du denkst. Du möchtest auch an dieser wundersamen, exzessiven Parade teilnehmen, nicht wahr?
#. fr: Non, ne dites rien<nbsp>! Je sais ce que votre cœur souhaite<nbsp>! Vous voulez participer à ma fantastique parade, pas vrai<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Gather around, Endless one and all, for a spectacle that is sure to prove unforgettable!
#. column 58: Join the parade?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hahaha, I knew it! Then take your place in our eternal march. But don't fall behind...or else!
#. column 62: Oh, you aren't ready yet? Worry not, for the eternal parade can wait for its most honored guest.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:708:0:57"
msgid "You there! You don't have to speak, for I can see it in your eyes. You wish to join the parade─no, you <i>yearn</i> to!"
msgstr "Эй, ты! Можешь ничего не говорить, я и так вижу всё по твоим глазам. Ты хочешь присоединиться к параду... нет, ты <i>мечтаешь</i> о нём!"

#. ja: パレードに参加しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: An der Parade teilnehmen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Participer à la parade<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Gather around, Endless one and all, for a spectacle that is sure to prove unforgettable!
#. column 57: You there! You don't have to speak, for I can see it in your eyes. You wish to join the parade─no, you <i>yearn</i> to!
#. column 60: Hahaha, I knew it! Then take your place in our eternal march. But don't fall behind...or else!
#. column 62: Oh, you aren't ready yet? Worry not, for the eternal parade can wait for its most honored guest.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
