msgctxt "FateEvent:708:0:58"
msgid "Join the parade?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Присоединиться к параду?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ハーッハッハ、良い、実に良い！<br>いざ、永遠と一瞬を巡る、奇妙で過激なパレードをはじめましょう！
#. de: Fantastisch, einfach fantastisch! So lasst uns denn beginnen!
#. fr: Ha ha ha<nbsp>! Fantastique<nbsp>! Eh bien il est temps de débuter notre étrange parade<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Gather around, Endless one and all, for a spectacle that is sure to prove unforgettable!
#. column 57: You there! You don't have to speak, for I can see it in your eyes. You wish to join the parade─no, you <i>yearn</i> to!
#. column 58: Join the parade?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, you aren't ready yet? Worry not, for the eternal parade can wait for its most honored guest.
msgctxt "FateEvent:708:0:60"
msgid "Hahaha, I knew it! Then take your place in our eternal march. But don't fall behind...or else!"
msgstr "Ха-ха-ха, я так и знал! Тогда занимай место в нашем вечном шествии. Только не отставай... а то пожалеешь!"

#. ja: おや、準備がお済みでない様子……<br>よろしい、ならば待つといたしましょう！
#. de: Oh, noch nicht bereit? Kein Problem, dann warten wir!
#. fr: Vraiment<nbsp>? Dans ce cas, je vais vous laisser vous préparer et je vous attendrai ici<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Gather around, Endless one and all, for a spectacle that is sure to prove unforgettable!
#. column 57: You there! You don't have to speak, for I can see it in your eyes. You wish to join the parade─no, you <i>yearn</i> to!
#. column 58: Join the parade?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Hahaha, I knew it! Then take your place in our eternal march. But don't fall behind...or else!
msgctxt "FateEvent:708:0:62"
msgid "Oh, you aren't ready yet? Worry not, for the eternal parade can wait for its most honored guest."
msgstr "О, ещё не готов? Ничего, вечный парад подождёт самого почётного гостя."

#. ja: 我らのパレードはいささか過激……<br>途中で離脱せぬよう、くれぐれもご注意を！
#. de: Unsere Parade ist nichts für jedermann. Pass auf, dass du zwischendurch nicht aus der Reihe fällst.
#. fr: Notre parade est un peu... par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>re<nbsp>! Disons que vous ne pouvez pas la quitter quand vous le voulez...
msgctxt "FateEvent:709:0:56"
msgid "Oh my, the parade has really picked up the pace! Keep in step, or be left behind for good!"
msgstr "Ого, парад набрал такой темп! Не отставай, а то навсегда останешься позади!"

#. ja: これはこれは旅の方……<br>ここで会えるとはなんと幸運！<br>よければ、少々手を貸してはくれんか？
#. de: Oh, das Glück hat mich doch nicht völlig verlassen! Du kommst genau richtig. Würdest du mir vielleicht etwas zur Hand gehen?
#. fr: Hou<nbsp>! Quelle chance de te rencontrer ainsi, <if $gn4>gentille voyageuse<else>gentil voyageur</if><nbsp>! J'aimerais te demander un petit service.
#. column 57: The recent storm wrought much havoc and damaged many of my wares. I've been trying to collect the materials I need to make repairs, but I can only cover so much ground alone.
#. column 58: I require stout branches and sturdy carapaces! The former you'll find scattered on the ground, and the latter, well, you'll have to prise from the backs of the beetles themselves...
#. column 59: Aid the Hanuhanu combmaker?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Such kindness! You have my wholehearted thanks. Now, when it comes to materials─the more the merrier, so make sure to bring back as much as you can find!
#. column 62: Perhaps I <i>was</i> a little impudent to ask such a favor of you. \<sigh> I shall have to gather what I need myself...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:710:0:56"
msgid "Oho, I am <i>most</i> pleased to see you, adventurer. Most pleased indeed! I have a favor to ask, you see."
msgstr "О, <i>как</i> же я рад тебя видеть, авантюрист! Очень рад! Видишь ли, у меня к тебе просьба."

#. ja: 先の大嵐で壊れた装飾を直すため、<br>素材を集めておったのだが……<br>私ひとりでは手が足りんでな。
#. de: Der große Sturm hat so viel zerstört. Ich sammle gerade Materialien, um wenigstens das Nötigste auszubessern. Doch allein komme ich nicht weit.
#. fr: Je suis en train de ramasser des matériaux pour fabriquer des peignes afin de remplacer ceux qui ont été abîmés par la grande tempête. Hélas, c'est beaucoup de travail pour un seul Hanu Hanu.
#. column 56: Oho, I am <i>most</i> pleased to see you, adventurer. Most pleased indeed! I have a favor to ask, you see.
#. column 58: I require stout branches and sturdy carapaces! The former you'll find scattered on the ground, and the latter, well, you'll have to prise from the backs of the beetles themselves...
#. column 59: Aid the Hanuhanu combmaker?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Such kindness! You have my wholehearted thanks. Now, when it comes to materials─the more the merrier, so make sure to bring back as much as you can find!
#. column 62: Perhaps I <i>was</i> a little impudent to ask such a favor of you. \<sigh> I shall have to gather what I need myself...
msgctxt "FateEvent:710:0:57"
msgid "The recent storm wrought much havoc and damaged many of my wares. I've been trying to collect the materials I need to make repairs, but I can only cover so much ground alone."
msgstr "Недавняя буря натворила бед и повредила немало моих товаров. Я собираю материалы для ремонта, но в одиночку много не успеваю."

#. ja: この辺りにおる甲虫の甲殻や、<br>落ちている太枝を集めてはもらえぬだろうか。<br>どうかどうか、力添えを……！
#. de: Was ich momentan am dringendsten brauche, sind Holz und Panzer. Panzer? Ja, du weißt schon, welche von den Insekten, die hier herumschwirren.
#. fr: Veux-tu bien m'aider en ramassant les carapaces d'insectes et les branches qui me serviront pour mon travail, hou<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Oho, I am <i>most</i> pleased to see you, adventurer. Most pleased indeed! I have a favor to ask, you see.
#. column 57: The recent storm wrought much havoc and damaged many of my wares. I've been trying to collect the materials I need to make repairs, but I can only cover so much ground alone.
#. column 59: Aid the Hanuhanu combmaker?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Such kindness! You have my wholehearted thanks. Now, when it comes to materials─the more the merrier, so make sure to bring back as much as you can find!
#. column 62: Perhaps I <i>was</i> a little impudent to ask such a favor of you. \<sigh> I shall have to gather what I need myself...
msgctxt "FateEvent:710:0:58"
msgid "I require stout branches and sturdy carapaces! The former you'll find scattered on the ground, and the latter, well, you'll have to prise from the backs of the beetles themselves..."
msgstr "Мне нужны крепкие ветви и прочные панцири! Ветви валяются на земле, а панцири придётся снимать со жуков..."

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Hanuhanu-Handwerker helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le fabriquant de peignes hanu hanu<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Oho, I am <i>most</i> pleased to see you, adventurer. Most pleased indeed! I have a favor to ask, you see.
#. column 57: The recent storm wrought much havoc and damaged many of my wares. I've been trying to collect the materials I need to make repairs, but I can only cover so much ground alone.
#. column 58: I require stout branches and sturdy carapaces! The former you'll find scattered on the ground, and the latter, well, you'll have to prise from the backs of the beetles themselves...
#. column 60: Such kindness! You have my wholehearted thanks. Now, when it comes to materials─the more the merrier, so make sure to bring back as much as you can find!
#. column 62: Perhaps I <i>was</i> a little impudent to ask such a favor of you. \<sigh> I shall have to gather what I need myself...
