msgctxt "FateEvent:710:0:59"
msgid "Aid the Hanuhanu combmaker?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь мастеру расчёсок ханухану?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: なんとなんと、ありがたい言葉……！<br>ぜひとも、たくさん集めてもらいたい！
#. de: Oh, du glaubst gar nicht, wie dankbar ich dir bin! Bitte sammle ganz viel, ja?
#. fr: Tu ne peux pas imaginer comme ta réponse me fait plaisir, hou<nbsp>! Je compte sur toi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Oho, I am <i>most</i> pleased to see you, adventurer. Most pleased indeed! I have a favor to ask, you see.
#. column 57: The recent storm wrought much havoc and damaged many of my wares. I've been trying to collect the materials I need to make repairs, but I can only cover so much ground alone.
#. column 58: I require stout branches and sturdy carapaces! The former you'll find scattered on the ground, and the latter, well, you'll have to prise from the backs of the beetles themselves...
#. column 59: Aid the Hanuhanu combmaker?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Perhaps I <i>was</i> a little impudent to ask such a favor of you. \<sigh> I shall have to gather what I need myself...
msgctxt "FateEvent:710:0:60"
msgid "Such kindness! You have my wholehearted thanks. Now, when it comes to materials─the more the merrier, so make sure to bring back as much as you can find!"
msgstr "Какая доброта! От всей души благодарю. Материалов много не бывает, так что принеси всё, что найдёшь!"

#. ja: あまりに不躾な頼みであったな。<br>なんとか独りで集めてみるとしよう……。
#. de: Oh, natürlich, verstehe. Ich werde es schon irgendwie allein schaffen<nbsp>...
#. fr: Ma demande était déplacée... Je te prie de m'en excuser, hou<nbsp>! Je vais me débrouiller tout seul alors.
#. column 56: Oho, I am <i>most</i> pleased to see you, adventurer. Most pleased indeed! I have a favor to ask, you see.
#. column 57: The recent storm wrought much havoc and damaged many of my wares. I've been trying to collect the materials I need to make repairs, but I can only cover so much ground alone.
#. column 58: I require stout branches and sturdy carapaces! The former you'll find scattered on the ground, and the latter, well, you'll have to prise from the backs of the beetles themselves...
#. column 59: Aid the Hanuhanu combmaker?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Such kindness! You have my wholehearted thanks. Now, when it comes to materials─the more the merrier, so make sure to bring back as much as you can find!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:710:0:62"
msgid "Perhaps I <i>was</i> a little impudent to ask such a favor of you. \\<sigh> I shall have to gather what I need myself..."
msgstr "Наверное, я и правда слишком бесцеремонно попросил вас о такой услуге. <i>Эх...</i> Придётся самому собрать всё необходимое..."

#. ja: 「ハヌハヌ細工の素材」を持っているようなら、<br>ぜひ、お譲りいただきたい。
#. de: Oh, hast du etwas sammeln können? Bitte, gib mir doch etwas von dem Material ab.
#. fr: Si tu as des matériaux d'artisanat, je veux bien que tu me les donnes.
#. column 60: Such exquisite materials! With more of these I'll be able to repair my wares, so please keep your eyes peeled!
#. column 62: Nothing to share? Forgive me if I fail to hide my disappointment...
msgctxt "FateEvent:711:0:56"
msgid "You come bearing crafting materials? Please do share what you have."
msgstr "Принёс материалы для ремесла? Покажи, что у тебя есть."

#. ja: これはこれは、見事な素材……<br>さらに多く集まれば装飾の修理もできるだろう！<br>また見つけたときには、ぜひ私に……！
#. de: Oh, das ist ja ganz ausgezeichnete Qualität! Damit sollte ich gut arbeiten können. Komm wieder, wenn du noch mehr findest, ja?
#. fr: Hou, hou<nbsp>! Ces carapaces et ces branches sont splendides<nbsp>! Si tu m'en rapportes plus, je n'aurai aucun mal à réparer mes peignes<nbsp>! Je compte sur toi pour continuer à m'aider.
#. column 56: You come bearing crafting materials? Please do share what you have.
#. column 62: Nothing to share? Forgive me if I fail to hide my disappointment...
msgctxt "FateEvent:711:0:60"
msgid "Such exquisite materials! With more of these I'll be able to repair my wares, so please keep your eyes peeled!"
msgstr "Какие чудесные материалы! С ними я смогу починить свои товары. Если найдёшь ещё, обязательно принеси!"

#. ja: 渡せるものはない、と。<br>残念ではあるが致し方あるまい。
#. de: Oh, du möchtest nichts abgeben? Das ist aber enttäuschend.
#. fr: Tu n'as pas de matériaux à me donner, on dirait. C'est dommage, mais tant pis, hou<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You come bearing crafting materials? Please do share what you have.
#. column 60: Such exquisite materials! With more of these I'll be able to repair my wares, so please keep your eyes peeled!
msgctxt "FateEvent:711:0:62"
msgid "Nothing to share? Forgive me if I fail to hide my disappointment..."
msgstr "Ничего не принесёшь? Не стану скрывать, я разочарован..."

#. ja: 「ハヌハヌ細工の素材」を得る方法はふたつ。<br>この辺りにおる甲虫を狩って甲殻を採るか、<br>落ちている太枝を集めるか、だ。
#. de: Du kannst mir das benötigte Material beschaffen, indem du herumliegendes Holz aufsammelst oder den Rhino-Käfern ihre Panzer abnimmst. Die Entscheidung überlasse ich ganz dir.
#. fr: Les matériaux d'artisanat dont j'ai besoin sont de deux sortes<nbsp>: les carapaces d'insectes et les grosses branches. Je compte sur toi pour m'aider à en ramasser plein, hou<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:712:0:56"
msgid "To obtain the crafting materials I seek, you may scour the ground for fallen branches, or do battle with the beetles and harvest their carapaces. The choice is yours, adventurer."
msgstr "Материалы для поделок можно найти на земле — например, подобрать упавшие ветки. Или сразиться с жуками и забрать их панцири. Выбирай сам, авантюрист."

#. ja: 旅の方、協力に深く深く感謝しよう。<br>おかげで十分な量の「ハヌハヌ細工の素材」が集まった。
#. de: Oh, ich kann dir gar nicht genug danken! Endlich habe ich genügend Materialien für meine Arbeit.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Gentille voyageuse<else>Gentil voyageur</if>, je te remercie infiniment pour ton aide, hou<nbsp>! Grâce à toi, j'ai suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment de matériaux pour pratiquer mon artisanat.
msgctxt "FateEvent:713:0:56"
msgid "You have my wholehearted thanks for this most plentiful supply of materials."
msgstr "От всей души благодарю за щедрую помощь!"

#. ja: 「ハヌハヌ細工の素材」を持っているようなら、<br>ぜひ、お譲りいただきたい。
#. de: Oh, hast du etwas sammeln können? Bitte, gib mir doch etwas von dem Material ab.
#. fr: Si tu as des matériaux d'artisanat, je veux bien que tu me les donnes.
#. column 60: I couldn't have selected better specimens myself! I now have enough crafting materials to begin my repairs in earnest. Thank you!
#. column 62: Nothing to share? Forgive me if I fail to hide my disappointment...
msgctxt "FateEvent:714:0:56"
msgid "You come bearing crafting materials? Please do share what you have."
msgstr "У тебя есть материалы для поделок? Поделись, пожалуйста, чем можешь."

#. ja: これはこれは、見事な素材……<br>十分な量が集まったことで装飾の修理も捗るだろう！<br>本当に助かった……！
#. de: Oh, das ist ja ganz ausgezeichnete Qualität! Damit sollte ich gut arbeiten können. Komm wieder, wenn du noch mehr findest, ja?
#. fr: Hou, hou<nbsp>! Ces carapaces et ces branches sont splendides<nbsp>! Grâce à toi, j'en ai désormais suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment pour faire mon travail. Merci beaucoup<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You come bearing crafting materials? Please do share what you have.
#. column 62: Nothing to share? Forgive me if I fail to hide my disappointment...
msgctxt "FateEvent:714:0:60"
msgid "I couldn't have selected better specimens myself! I now have enough crafting materials to begin my repairs in earnest. Thank you!"
msgstr "Лучше и не найти! Теперь материалов хватит, чтобы всерьёз взяться за ремонт. Спасибо!"

#. ja: 渡せるものはない、と。<br>残念ではあるが致し方あるまい。
#. de: Oh, du möchtest nichts abgeben? Das ist aber enttäuschend.
#. fr: Tu n'as pas de matériaux à me donner, on dirait. C'est dommage, mais tant pis, hou<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You come bearing crafting materials? Please do share what you have.
#. column 60: I couldn't have selected better specimens myself! I now have enough crafting materials to begin my repairs in earnest. Thank you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:714:0:62"
msgid "Nothing to share? Forgive me if I fail to hide my disappointment..."
msgstr "Нечем поделиться? Что ж, не стану скрывать, что огорчён..."

#. ja: もしかして　あなたがモール　やっつけた？<br>それならちょっと　話を聞くモブ！
#. de: Sag, warst du es, <if $gn4>die<else>der</if> die Mulle bekämpft hat? Diese Wühleschipper graben den ganzen Erdengrund um!
#. fr: Bssshhhoh<nbsp>! Est-ce que c'est <if $gn4>la brave voyageuse<else>le brave voyageur</if> qui a tapé les taupes<nbsp>? Si oui, le gentil Mobelin a un service à lui demander<nbsp>!
#. column 57: When the moles burrow up to the surface, all sorts of goodly earthgifts emerge with them!
#. column 58: Please collect any rare ores and shinystones you come across─prized materials for the potsworn!
#. column 59: Assist the Moblin forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! May you find manymuch earthgifts!
#. column 62: Oh, you are busy elsewhere perhaps? Mobbie will have to find another assistant!
msgctxt "FateEvent:715:0:56"
msgid "Was it you who gave hurtyprods to the pesky moles? Mobbie has another helptask for you!"
msgstr "Это ты проучил назойливых кротов? У Мобби для тебя есть ещё одно полезное дельце!"

#. ja: あいつら穴から　出てくる時に<br>地下深くから　いろいろ出てくる！
#. de: Bei ihrem Schaufelgegrabe fördern sie auch jede Menge Erdenedelgut zu Tage. Schau doch mal genau hin.
#. fr: Ces animaux font ressortir de précieux matériaux du sol lorsqu'ils kreusent leurs galeries souterraines<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Was it you who gave hurtyprods to the pesky moles? Mobbie has another helptask for you!
#. column 58: Please collect any rare ores and shinystones you come across─prized materials for the potsworn!
#. column 59: Assist the Moblin forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! May you find manymuch earthgifts!
#. column 62: Oh, you are busy elsewhere perhaps? Mobbie will have to find another assistant!
msgctxt "FateEvent:715:0:57"
msgid "When the moles burrow up to the surface, all sorts of goodly earthgifts emerge with them!"
msgstr "Когда кроты выбираются наверх, вместе с ними из земли всякие ценные дары появляются!"

#. ja: 希少な鉱石　キラキラ輝石！<br>どれも　これも　壺匠よろこぶ良質素材！<br>どうか集めて　お願いよ～！
#. de: Erze und Edelsteine zuhauf! Für unsere Torfmeister ist das vielwichtiges Material. Würdest du es sammeln und mir bringen?
#. fr: Il y a notamment des pierres brillantes et rares parmi eux<nbsp>! Elles sont parfaites pour le travail des mains-du-pot à La Fournée<nbsp>! L'<if $gn4>humaine<else>humain</if> veut bien en ramasser et les donner au petit Mobelin<nbsp>? Bssshhh...
#. column 56: Was it you who gave hurtyprods to the pesky moles? Mobbie has another helptask for you!
#. column 57: When the moles burrow up to the surface, all sorts of goodly earthgifts emerge with them!
#. column 59: Assist the Moblin forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! May you find manymuch earthgifts!
#. column 62: Oh, you are busy elsewhere perhaps? Mobbie will have to find another assistant!
msgctxt "FateEvent:715:0:58"
msgid "Please collect any rare ores and shinystones you come across─prized materials for the potsworn!"
msgstr "Собирай редкие руды и блестяшки, какие попадутся, — мастерам горшков это всё очень нужно!"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Moblin-Sammler helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le collecteur mobelin<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Was it you who gave hurtyprods to the pesky moles? Mobbie has another helptask for you!
#. column 57: When the moles burrow up to the surface, all sorts of goodly earthgifts emerge with them!
#. column 58: Please collect any rare ores and shinystones you come across─prized materials for the potsworn!
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! May you find manymuch earthgifts!
#. column 62: Oh, you are busy elsewhere perhaps? Mobbie will have to find another assistant!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:715:0:59"
msgid "Assist the Moblin forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь моблину-собирателю?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがと　ありがと　とてとて感謝！<br>ぜひぜひたくさん　持ってきて！
#. de: Großedank! Ich hoffe, du findest viel Erdenedelgut!
#. fr: Merci, merci<nbsp>! Le Mobelin savait qu'il pouvait kompter sur la générosité <if $gn4>de la voyageuse<else>du voyageur</if> serviable<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Was it you who gave hurtyprods to the pesky moles? Mobbie has another helptask for you!
#. column 57: When the moles burrow up to the surface, all sorts of goodly earthgifts emerge with them!
#. column 58: Please collect any rare ores and shinystones you come across─prized materials for the potsworn!
#. column 59: Assist the Moblin forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Oh, you are busy elsewhere perhaps? Mobbie will have to find another assistant!
msgctxt "FateEvent:715:0:60"
msgid "Thank you kindly! May you find manymuch earthgifts!"
msgstr "Спасибо тебе! Пусть найдёшь побольше даров земли!"

#. ja: そっかー　わかった　とてとて残念！<br>ほかの人に頼むモブ～！
#. de: Nein? Verstehe, dann muss ich einen anderen Gutleut finden.
#. fr: Bssshaaah... C'est dommage<nbsp>! Le pauvre Mobelin n'a plus qu'à trouver quelqu'un d'autre pour l'aider.
#. column 56: Was it you who gave hurtyprods to the pesky moles? Mobbie has another helptask for you!
#. column 57: When the moles burrow up to the surface, all sorts of goodly earthgifts emerge with them!
#. column 58: Please collect any rare ores and shinystones you come across─prized materials for the potsworn!
#. column 59: Assist the Moblin forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you kindly! May you find manymuch earthgifts!
msgctxt "FateEvent:715:0:62"
msgid "Oh, you are busy elsewhere perhaps? Mobbie will have to find another assistant!"
msgstr "А, ты, наверное, занят чем-то другим? Придётся Мобби искать помощника где-то ещё!"

#. ja: 製作素材　集まった？<br>採集　回収　渡してモブ～
#. de: Hast du etwas Erdenedelgut, das du mir abgeben kannst?
#. fr: Bssshhh... <if $gn4>L'humaine<else>L'humain</if> a ramassé des matériaux<nbsp>? Si oui, <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> doit les donner au gentil Mobelin<nbsp>!
#. column 60: You bring manymuch earthgifts, but there's plenty more to be found!
#. column 62: No earthgifts? Not to worry, there is still time to seeksearch!
msgctxt "FateEvent:716:0:56"
msgid "Have you goodly earthgifts for Mobbie?"
msgstr "Есть у тебя ценные дары земли для Мобби?"

#. ja: ありがと　ありがと　大感謝！<br>まだまだあるから　よろしくね！
#. de: Großedank! Bitte such noch mehr davon, ja?
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Le Mobelin est très kontent<nbsp>! Il kompte sur <if $gn4>la voyageuse<else>le voyageur</if> pour lui en apporter davantage<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you goodly earthgifts for Mobbie?
#. column 62: No earthgifts? Not to worry, there is still time to seeksearch!
msgctxt "FateEvent:716:0:60"
msgid "You bring manymuch earthgifts, but there's plenty more to be found!"
msgstr "Ты принёс много-много даров земли, а вокруг ещё полно!"

#. ja: 持ってない？<br>それならわかった　またあとで！
#. de: Kein Erdenedelgut? Zu schade<nbsp>... Vielleicht später?
#. fr: Bssshhhmm<nbsp>? <if $gn4>La voyageuse<else>Le voyageur</if> n'a rien à donner au Mobelin<nbsp>! Il kompte sur <if $gn4>elle<else>lui</if> pour lui apporter des matériaux<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you goodly earthgifts for Mobbie?
#. column 60: You bring manymuch earthgifts, but there's plenty more to be found!
msgctxt "FateEvent:716:0:62"
msgid "No earthgifts? Not to worry, there is still time to seeksearch!"
msgstr "Даров земли нет? Ничего, ещё успеешь поискать!"

#. ja: 「壺匠用の製作素材」が　ほしいモブ！<br>辺りに落ちてる石を拾うか　石喰い鉱虫倒して拾うか<br>とにかく集めて　お願いよ～
#. de: Wo du das Erdenedelgut finden kannst, das ich suche? Entweder kannst du es einfach vom Boden auflesen oder den Ruinen-Rüsselkäfern entreißen. Ganz, wie es dir beliebt.
#. fr: Le gentil Mobelin veut que <if $gn4>la brave voyageuse<else>le brave voyageur</if> lui apporte des matériaux pour mains-du-pot<nbsp>! Pour ça, <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> doit ramasser les pierres ou abattre les bestioles qui les mangent. Bssshhh...
msgctxt "FateEvent:717:0:56"
msgid "You'll find the materials Mobbie seeks on the ground! Or, if you have bravethoughts and stronghands, you might defeat the pesky weevils for their share of goodly earthgifts!"
msgstr "Нужные Мобби материалы лежат прямо на земле! А если ты храбрый и сильный, можешь одолеть назойливых долгоносиков и забрать их дары земли!"

#. ja: ありがと　ありがと　大感動！<br>製作素材　とてとていっぱい　良質素材　もりもりいっぱい！<br>それじゃあ　そろそろ撤収モブ～
#. de: Großedank! Großedank! Wahrhaft eindrucksvolles Erdenedelgut. Das wird unsere Topfmeister in höchstem Maße zufrieden stellen.
#. fr: Le petit Mobelin est très kontent<nbsp>! Grâce <if $gn4>à la gentille humaine<else>au gentil humain</if>, il a tout plein de matériaux de qualité pour les mains-du-pot à La Fournée<nbsp>! Il va aller leur apporter<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:718:0:56"
msgid "Such bountiful earthgifts! Mobbie offers you thanks with great joysmiles! Farewell!"
msgstr "Сколько даров земли! Мобби так рад, что даже улыбается во весь рот! Прощай!"

#. ja: 製作素材　集まった？<br>採集　回収　渡してモブ～
#. de: Hast du etwas Erdenedelgut, das du mir abgeben kannst?
#. fr: Bssshhh... <if $gn4>L'humaine<else>L'humain</if> a ramassé des matériaux<nbsp>? Si oui, <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> doit les donner au gentil Mobelin<nbsp>!
#. column 60: Thank you! The potsworn will be filled with joysmiles when they see these earthgifts!
#. column 62: No earthgifts to share? Oh. Perhaps we will meet again in futuretimes.
msgctxt "FateEvent:719:0:56"
msgid "Have you goodly earthgifts for Mobbie?"
msgstr "Есть у тебя ценные дары земли для Мобби?"

#. ja: ありがと　ありがと　大感謝！<br>壺匠たち　きっと喜ぶ　創作はかどり　モブも喜ぶ～
#. de: Großedank! Bitte such noch mehr davon, ja?
#. fr: Merci beaukoup<nbsp>! Avek ça, les mains-du-pot vont être très kontentes et pouvoir faire plein de poteries<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you goodly earthgifts for Mobbie?
#. column 62: No earthgifts to share? Oh. Perhaps we will meet again in futuretimes.
msgctxt "FateEvent:719:0:60"
msgid "Thank you! The potsworn will be filled with joysmiles when they see these earthgifts!"
msgstr "Спасибо! Мастера горшков так обрадуются этим дарам земли!"

#. ja: 持ってない？<br>それならわかった　またこんど！
#. de: Kein Erdenedelgut? Zu schade<nbsp>... Vielleicht später?
#. fr: <if $gn4>Elle<else>Il</if> a pas de matériaux<nbsp>? C'est pas grave. Ça sera pour une prochaine fois<nbsp>! Merci quand même<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you goodly earthgifts for Mobbie?
#. column 60: Thank you! The potsworn will be filled with joysmiles when they see these earthgifts!
msgctxt "FateEvent:719:0:62"
msgid "No earthgifts to share? Oh. Perhaps we will meet again in futuretimes."
msgstr "Делиться нечем? Ну... может, в другой раз увидимся."

#. ja: もしやアナタは　戦える？<br>そうなら緊急　頼みたい！
#. de: Sag, kannst du gut kämpfen? Dann möchte ich dich um eine Eiligsache bitten!
#. fr: Bssshhhah<nbsp>! <if $gn4>La voyageuse<else>Le voyageur</if> tombe bien<nbsp>! <if $gn4>Elle<else>Il</if> sait se battre, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>? Bagnobrok a un service urgent à lui demander<nbsp>!
#. column 57: The ground here is rich with craftclay, but the mushrooms have multiplied!
#. column 58: Too many mushrooms will turn the clay to plain old dirtsoil─no good for pots! Bagnobrok wants the mushrooms gone!
#. column 59: Offer your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: The outlander is generous with their lendhanding! Dispatch the mushrooms and save the craftclay!
#. column 62: Bagnobrok was blessed with handsomeface─how can you resist his talkcharms? Please reconsider!
msgctxt "FateEvent:720:0:56"
msgid "Outlander is a keen fighter, yes? Bagnobrok has a helptask for you!"
msgstr "Путник хорошо дерётся, да? У Багноброка есть для тебя дельце!"

#. ja: ここは　陶芸使う粘土　採れる場所！<br>でもでも　採集来てみたら　キノコ増殖　大繁殖！
#. de: Hier gibt es normalerweise guten Lehm zu holen, aber nun ist alles voller schlimmschlechter Pilze! Sie sind einfach überall!
#. fr: C'est ici que les habitants de La Fournée puisent l'argile qui sert au travail des mains-du-pot<nbsp>! Mais en venant ici, le gentil Mobelin a dékouvert que plein de vilains champignons s'y étaient installés<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Outlander is a keen fighter, yes? Bagnobrok has a helptask for you!
#. column 58: Too many mushrooms will turn the clay to plain old dirtsoil─no good for pots! Bagnobrok wants the mushrooms gone!
#. column 59: Offer your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: The outlander is generous with their lendhanding! Dispatch the mushrooms and save the craftclay!
#. column 62: Bagnobrok was blessed with handsomeface─how can you resist his talkcharms? Please reconsider!
msgctxt "FateEvent:720:0:57"
msgid "The ground here is rich with craftclay, but the mushrooms have multiplied!"
msgstr "Здесь добывают глину для горшков, но грибов стало слишком много!"

#. ja: このまま放置じゃ<br>養分吸われ　粘土スカスカ　ゴミになる～！<br>そんなこんなで　キノコ退治　どうかお願い頼らせて～！
#. de: Wenn niemand etwas unternimmt, wird der Boden völlig porös und unbrauchbar. Könntest du nicht bitte machen, dass die Pilze futschiweg sind?
#. fr: Si rien est fait, ils vont kontinuer de se multiplier et l'argile sera in<shy>uti<shy>li<shy>sa<shy>ble<nbsp>! <if $gn4>La gentille humaine<else>Le gentil humain</if> doit venir en aide à Bagnobrok et chasser les amanites tue-mouches<nbsp>! Bssshhh...
#. column 56: Outlander is a keen fighter, yes? Bagnobrok has a helptask for you!
#. column 57: The ground here is rich with craftclay, but the mushrooms have multiplied!
#. column 59: Offer your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: The outlander is generous with their lendhanding! Dispatch the mushrooms and save the craftclay!
#. column 62: Bagnobrok was blessed with handsomeface─how can you resist his talkcharms? Please reconsider!
msgctxt "FateEvent:720:0:58"
msgid "Too many mushrooms will turn the clay to plain old dirtsoil─no good for pots! Bagnobrok wants the mushrooms gone!"
msgstr "Если ничего не делать, грибы высосут из глины все соки — останется одна труха, для горшков не годная! Багноброк хочет, чтобы грибы исчезли!"

#. ja: 協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Deine Hilfe anbieten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider Bagnobrok<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Outlander is a keen fighter, yes? Bagnobrok has a helptask for you!
#. column 57: The ground here is rich with craftclay, but the mushrooms have multiplied!
#. column 58: Too many mushrooms will turn the clay to plain old dirtsoil─no good for pots! Bagnobrok wants the mushrooms gone!
#. column 60: The outlander is generous with their lendhanding! Dispatch the mushrooms and save the craftclay!
#. column 62: Bagnobrok was blessed with handsomeface─how can you resist his talkcharms? Please reconsider!
