msgctxt "FateEvent:720:0:59"
msgid "Offer your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 頼れる旅人　とっても素敵！<br>キノコなんて　蹴散らして～！
#. de: Großedank! Ich bin wirklich ein Glückspilz, dass ich dich getroffen habe!
#. fr: Merci, merci<nbsp>! Bssshhh... Bagnobrok savait que <if $gn4>la brave voyageuse<else>le brave voyageur</if> akcepterait de l'aider<nbsp>! Il kompte sur <if $gn4>elle<else>lui</if> pour éliminer les champignons en<shy>va<shy>his<shy>sants<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Outlander is a keen fighter, yes? Bagnobrok has a helptask for you!
#. column 57: The ground here is rich with craftclay, but the mushrooms have multiplied!
#. column 58: Too many mushrooms will turn the clay to plain old dirtsoil─no good for pots! Bagnobrok wants the mushrooms gone!
#. column 59: Offer your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Bagnobrok was blessed with handsomeface─how can you resist his talkcharms? Please reconsider!
msgctxt "FateEvent:720:0:60"
msgid "The outlander is generous with their lendhanding! Dispatch the mushrooms and save the craftclay!"
msgstr "Путник такой добрый, что готов помочь! Разгони грибы и спаси глину!"

#. ja: モブはモブリン　絶世の美男！<br>この顔　免じて　お願い聞いて！<br>考え直してくれないモブ？
#. de: Du kannst bei diesem Gesichtsanblick nein sagen? Willst du es dir nicht noch mal überlegen?
#. fr: Bssshaaah... Bagnobrok était pourtant persuadé que son charme suffirait à konvaincre <if $gn4>la brave voyageuse<else>le brave voyageur</if> de l'aider. <if $gn4>Elle<else>Il</if> est sûr<if $gn4>e</if> qu'<if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> veut pas changer d'avis<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Outlander is a keen fighter, yes? Bagnobrok has a helptask for you!
#. column 57: The ground here is rich with craftclay, but the mushrooms have multiplied!
#. column 58: Too many mushrooms will turn the clay to plain old dirtsoil─no good for pots! Bagnobrok wants the mushrooms gone!
#. column 59: Offer your aid?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: The outlander is generous with their lendhanding! Dispatch the mushrooms and save the craftclay!
msgctxt "FateEvent:720:0:62"
msgid "Bagnobrok was blessed with handsomeface─how can you resist his talkcharms? Please reconsider! "
msgstr "Багноброк — красавец из красавцев! Неужели его чары не помогут? Передумай, а? "

#. ja: あなたは……いや、この際誰でもいい、<br>イクブラーシャの防衛に力を貸してもらえないだろうか。<br>この付近で殺気立ったリーフマンティスの群れが目撃されたのだ。
#. de: Bei den Mantis steht die Paarungszeit an, und die Weibchen sammeln sich, um sich vor dem Eierlegen noch mal Reserven anzufuttern. Leider stürzen sie sich dabei auf alles, was sich bewegt.
#. fr: Vous êtes... Non, peu importe. Qui que vous soyez, j'ai besoin de votre aide pour protéger notre village ! De redoutables mantes végétales ont été repérées à proximité d'ici...
#. column 57: My partner and I have spotted a swarm no more than a stone's throw from this very watchtower and have put out the call to Iq Br'aax for reinforcements...but as you can see, they are slow to arrive.
#. column 58: I would normally not burden an outsider with the troubles of our people, but I fear my companion and I cannot hold this tower alone...and if we fall, the village may be next.
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your gesture may have just saved us all. My thanks, traveler.
#. column 62: Then I suggest you flee, for when the swarm comes, they will spare no one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:722:0:56"
msgid "Mantis mating season is upon us, when females gather in numbers to feed before they lay their eggs. Unfortunately, they have a taste for...well, anything that moves."
msgstr "Сезон спаривания богомолов на носу. Самки собираются целыми стаями, чтобы наесться перед кладкой яиц. Беда в том, что они нападают... на всё, что движется."

#. ja: 奴らは相手が誰だろうと襲い、捕食しようとする。<br>ここで食い止めなければ、集落が危ない……！
#. de: Mein Kamerad und ich haben einen Schwarm unweit dieses Turms gesichtet und in Iq Br'aax um Verstärkung gebeten, aber bis jetzt ist noch niemand eingetroffen.
#. fr: Ces sales bêtes s'en prennent à tous ceux qu'elles croisent pour les dévorer sans vergogne. Si on ne les arrête pas, elles vont décimer tout Iq Br'aax !
#. column 56: Mantis mating season is upon us, when females gather in numbers to feed before they lay their eggs. Unfortunately, they have a taste for...well, anything that moves.
#. column 58: I would normally not burden an outsider with the troubles of our people, but I fear my companion and I cannot hold this tower alone...and if we fall, the village may be next.
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your gesture may have just saved us all. My thanks, traveler.
#. column 62: Then I suggest you flee, for when the swarm comes, they will spare no one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:722:0:57"
msgid "My partner and I have spotted a swarm no more than a stone's throw from this very watchtower and have put out the call to Iq Br'aax for reinforcements...but as you can see, they are slow to arrive."
msgstr "Мы с напарником заметили стаю совсем рядом с этой сторожевой башней и отправили в Ик-Браакс за подмогой... Только, как видишь, подкрепление не спешит."

#. ja: ともに戦ってくれたなら、<br>我らは、最大限の敬意と感謝を示すだろう！
#. de: Normalerweise würde ich mich in solch einer Angelegenheit nicht an Außenstehende wenden, aber zu zweit können wir diesen Turm nicht halten. Und wenn er fällt, ist es um das Dorf geschehen.
#. fr: Je n'ai rien d'autre à vous offrir que notre gratitude éternelle mais... accepteriez-vous de les combattre à nos côtés ?
#. column 56: Mantis mating season is upon us, when females gather in numbers to feed before they lay their eggs. Unfortunately, they have a taste for...well, anything that moves.
#. column 57: My partner and I have spotted a swarm no more than a stone's throw from this very watchtower and have put out the call to Iq Br'aax for reinforcements...but as you can see, they are slow to arrive.
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your gesture may have just saved us all. My thanks, traveler.
#. column 62: Then I suggest you flee, for when the swarm comes, they will spare no one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:722:0:58"
msgid "I would normally not burden an outsider with the troubles of our people, but I fear my companion and I cannot hold this tower alone...and if we fall, the village may be next."
msgstr "Обычно я не стал бы обременять чужака бедами нашего народа, но боюсь, вдвоём с напарником нам башню не удержать... А если падём мы, следующей может стать деревня."

#. ja: シュバラール族の狩人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Xbr'aal beistehen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Venir en aide aux chasseurs xbr'aal ?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Mantis mating season is upon us, when females gather in numbers to feed before they lay their eggs. Unfortunately, they have a taste for...well, anything that moves.
#. column 57: My partner and I have spotted a swarm no more than a stone's throw from this very watchtower and have put out the call to Iq Br'aax for reinforcements...but as you can see, they are slow to arrive.
#. column 58: I would normally not burden an outsider with the troubles of our people, but I fear my companion and I cannot hold this tower alone...and if we fall, the village may be next.
#. column 60: Your gesture may have just saved us all. My thanks, traveler.
#. column 62: Then I suggest you flee, for when the swarm comes, they will spare no one.
