msgid "Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь шубраалам?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 恩に着る……！<br>奴らは間もなくここに到達するはずだ！
#. de: Womöglich bist du unser aller Rettung. Vielen Dank!
#. fr: Merci, vous nous sauvez la vie ! Restez dans le coin, elles vont arriver d'un instant à l'autre !
#. column 56: Mantis mating season is upon us, when females gather in numbers to feed before they lay their eggs. Unfortunately, they have a taste for...well, anything that moves.
#. column 57: My partner and I have spotted a swarm no more than a stone's throw from this very watchtower and have put out the call to Iq Br'aax for reinforcements...but as you can see, they are slow to arrive.
#. column 58: I would normally not burden an outsider with the troubles of our people, but I fear my companion and I cannot hold this tower alone...and if we fall, the village may be next.
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Then I suggest you flee, for when the swarm comes, they will spare no one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:722:0:60"
msgid "Your gesture may have just saved us all. My thanks, traveler."
msgstr "Ты, возможно, спасла нас всех. Спасибо тебе, путник."

#. ja: そうか……<br>いや、私からは何も言えまい。<br>奴らが現れる前に、応援が間に合えばいいのだが……。
#. de: Dann rate ich dir, zu fliehen. Denn wenn der Schwarm erst mal hier ist, wird er niemanden verschonen.
#. fr: Je vois... Je ne peux pas vous blâmer, c'est votre droit. J'espère simplement que les renforts arriveront à temps...
#. column 56: Mantis mating season is upon us, when females gather in numbers to feed before they lay their eggs. Unfortunately, they have a taste for...well, anything that moves.
#. column 57: My partner and I have spotted a swarm no more than a stone's throw from this very watchtower and have put out the call to Iq Br'aax for reinforcements...but as you can see, they are slow to arrive.
#. column 58: I would normally not burden an outsider with the troubles of our people, but I fear my companion and I cannot hold this tower alone...and if we fall, the village may be next.
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Your gesture may have just saved us all. My thanks, traveler.
msgctxt "FateEvent:722:0:62"
msgid "Then I suggest you flee, for when the swarm comes, they will spare no one."
msgstr "Тогда советую бежать. Когда прилетит стая, она никого не пощадит."

#. ja: あんた、腕が立ちそうだな！<br>よかったら駆除の任務を手伝ってくれないか？
#. de: Oh, du kommst genau richtig! Ich denke, du könntest es mit ihnen aufnehmen.
#. fr: Hé, toi<nbsp>! Tu m'as l'air plutôt fort<if $gn4>e</if>, tu ne veux pas m'aider<nbsp>?
#. column 57: It sounded like easy money, but I didn't expect there to be so many of the metal heads... If you're here to do the same, perhaps we could work together?
#. column 58: Join the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Well, let's get to it then...before the bastards find their way to the outskirts.
#. column 62: Ah, well. Suppose I'll head over to the outskirts then and see if there's anyone there willing to watch my back.
msgctxt "FateEvent:723:0:56"
msgid "There's been reports of faulty sentries firing on reforgers out here in the Thunderyards, and the Nine's offering a bounty to decommission the lot."
msgstr "Здесь, на Грозовых дворах, неисправные часовые стреляют в перековщиков. За их уничтожение Девятка обещает награду."

#. ja: そのあたりに、故障した機械兵が見えるだろ？<br>あれを排除する任務を受けたんだが、予想以上に数が多くてさ、<br>助っ人を呼びに行こうか迷ってたんだよ。
#. de: Du hast die defekten Maschinensoldaten auch schon gesehen, oder? Eigentlich hatte ich versprochen, mich allein um die Beseitigung zu kümmern, aber das ist doch eine Nummer zu groß für mich.
#. fr: Tu as repéré les sentinelles dé<shy>fec<shy>tueuses du coin<nbsp>? On m'a demandé de m'en charger, mais il y en a bien trop pour moi tout seul<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There's been reports of faulty sentries firing on reforgers out here in the Thunderyards, and the Nine's offering a bounty to decommission the lot.
#. column 58: Join the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Well, let's get to it then...before the bastards find their way to the outskirts.
#. column 62: Ah, well. Suppose I'll head over to the outskirts then and see if there's anyone there willing to watch my back.
msgctxt "FateEvent:723:0:57"
msgid "It sounded like easy money, but I didn't expect there to be so many of the metal heads... If you're here to do the same, perhaps we could work together?"
msgstr "Слышал, за это хорошо платят, но не думал, что этих жестянок так много... Ты тоже за ними охотишься? Может, объединимся?"

#. ja: 駆け出しの駆除人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Deine Hilfe anbieten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider cet exterminateur novice<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: There's been reports of faulty sentries firing on reforgers out here in the Thunderyards, and the Nine's offering a bounty to decommission the lot.
#. column 57: It sounded like easy money, but I didn't expect there to be so many of the metal heads... If you're here to do the same, perhaps we could work together?
#. column 60: Well, let's get to it then...before the bastards find their way to the outskirts.
#. column 62: Ah, well. Suppose I'll head over to the outskirts then and see if there's anyone there willing to watch my back.
