msgid "Join the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь охотнику?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: やってくれるか、ありがとよ！<br>アウトスカーツの人たちの安全のためだ、<br>気張って駆除しようぜッ！
#. de: Du würdest das echt tun? Ich danke dir! Dann können die Bewohner der Außenbezirke endlich wieder ruhig schlafen.
#. fr: Hourra<nbsp>! Merci, je vais pouvoir accomplir la mission qu'on m'a confiée grâce à toi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: There's been reports of faulty sentries firing on reforgers out here in the Thunderyards, and the Nine's offering a bounty to decommission the lot.
#. column 57: It sounded like easy money, but I didn't expect there to be so many of the metal heads... If you're here to do the same, perhaps we could work together?
#. column 58: Join the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Ah, well. Suppose I'll head over to the outskirts then and see if there's anyone there willing to watch my back.
msgctxt "FateEvent:723:0:60"
msgid "Well, let's get to it then...before the bastards find their way to the outskirts."
msgstr "Ну, за дело... пока эти ублюдки не добрались до окраин."

#. ja: おっと、そうか……。<br>やっぱり一度、ソリューション・ナインに戻って、<br>助っ人を呼びに行くべきかな……。
#. de: Verstehe<nbsp>... Dann werde ich wohl mal in Lösung Neun rumfragen, ob mir jemand helfen kann.
#. fr: Oh... c'est bien dommage. Bon il ne me reste plus qu'à retourner demander de l'aide à Solution Neuf.
#. column 56: There's been reports of faulty sentries firing on reforgers out here in the Thunderyards, and the Nine's offering a bounty to decommission the lot.
#. column 57: It sounded like easy money, but I didn't expect there to be so many of the metal heads... If you're here to do the same, perhaps we could work together?
#. column 58: Join the hunter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Well, let's get to it then...before the bastards find their way to the outskirts.
msgctxt "FateEvent:723:0:62"
msgid "Ah, well. Suppose I'll head over to the outskirts then and see if there's anyone there willing to watch my back."
msgstr "Что ж, тогда пойду на окраину. Может, там найдётся кто-нибудь, кто прикроет мне спину."

#. ja: なんてこった……。<br>壊れた機械兵を排除してひと安心と思ったら、<br>今度は、危険な魔物が群れで現れやがった。
#. de: Das darf doch alles nicht wahr sein! Kaum sind wir die Maschinensoldaten los, machen uns diese schrecklichen Ungeheuer wieder das Leben schwer!
#. fr: Pfff... Je pensais qu'en éliminant ces maudits robots on serait tranquilles... Résultat<nbsp>: voilà que ce sont les monstres qui nous envahissent<nbsp>!
#. column 57: If it's not one thing, it's another, right? Such is life under the dome.
#. column 58: Those katobleps will need to be put down...but they may stray to the nearby farms before we can deal with them all. Hmm...how about this─you keep the katobleps occupied while I go warn the farmers. Once they're safe in their cellars, I'll come back and we can finish off what remains together. Sound like a plan?
#. column 59: Do all the hard work?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Uh, I mean, yes. It's a solid plan. \<cough>
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I'll just have to keep the colony distracted for as long as I can...
msgctxt "FateEvent:724:0:56"
msgid "Would you look at that. Not a bell since the final sentry falls, and already the bloodthirsty katobleps are moving back in."
msgstr "Вот напасть. Не успел пасть последний часовой, как кровожадные катоблепы уже возвращаются."

#. ja: あいつら、以前から農地を狙っていてな。<br>壊れた機械兵たちに追われて、姿を消していたんだが、<br>安全になったと見て、舞い戻ってきたらしい。
#. de: Die hatten es früher schon auf unsere Felder abgesehen, aber wegen der Maschinensoldaten haben sie sich nicht mehr in die Nähe getraut. Aber nun sind sie wieder da!
#. fr: Ces sales bêtes devaient viser nos champs depuis le début. Maintenant que les machines ont été vaincues, il n'y a plus rien pour les gêner.
#. column 56: Would you look at that. Not a bell since the final sentry falls, and already the bloodthirsty katobleps are moving back in.
#. column 58: Those katobleps will need to be put down...but they may stray to the nearby farms before we can deal with them all. Hmm...how about this─you keep the katobleps occupied while I go warn the farmers. Once they're safe in their cellars, I'll come back and we can finish off what remains together. Sound like a plan?
#. column 59: Do all the hard work?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Uh, I mean, yes. It's a solid plan. \<cough>
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I'll just have to keep the colony distracted for as long as I can...
msgctxt "FateEvent:724:0:57"
msgid "If it's not one thing, it's another, right? Such is life under the dome."
msgstr "Одно за другим, да? Такая уж жизнь под куполом."

#. ja: 俺は、農地の守りに向かう！<br>だからあんたは、ここのカトブレプタを駆除してくれねえか？<br>無茶言ってるのはわかるが……どうか頼む！
#. de: Ich werde nach den Feldern sehen. Und du erschlägst jeden Katoblep, der auftaucht, ja? Bitte, ich schaffe das nicht allein!
#. fr: Je m'occupe de protéger les récoltes, si toi tu pouvais empêcher ces katobleps de tout ravager sur le passage... Tu es d'accord<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Would you look at that. Not a bell since the final sentry falls, and already the bloodthirsty katobleps are moving back in.
#. column 57: If it's not one thing, it's another, right? Such is life under the dome.
#. column 59: Do all the hard work?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Uh, I mean, yes. It's a solid plan. \<cough>
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I'll just have to keep the colony distracted for as long as I can...
msgctxt "FateEvent:724:0:58"
msgid "Those katobleps will need to be put down...but they may stray to the nearby farms before we can deal with them all. Hmm...how about this─you keep the katobleps occupied while I go warn the farmers. Once they're safe in their cellars, I'll come back and we can finish off what remains together. Sound like a plan?"
msgstr "С катоблепами надо покончить... Но пока мы перебьём их всех, они могут добраться до соседних ферм. Вот что: ты отвлеки их, а я предупрежу фермеров. Когда те спрячутся в погребах, вернусь, и вместе добьём оставшихся. Ну как, план?"

#. ja: 駆け出しの駆除人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Merzer helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider à nouveau l'exterminateur novice<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Would you look at that. Not a bell since the final sentry falls, and already the bloodthirsty katobleps are moving back in.
#. column 57: If it's not one thing, it's another, right? Such is life under the dome.
#. column 58: Those katobleps will need to be put down...but they may stray to the nearby farms before we can deal with them all. Hmm...how about this─you keep the katobleps occupied while I go warn the farmers. Once they're safe in their cellars, I'll come back and we can finish off what remains together. Sound like a plan?
#. column 60: You will? Uh, I mean, yes. It's a solid plan. \<cough>
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I'll just have to keep the colony distracted for as long as I can...
