msgstr "За меня всю работу сделаешь?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 恩に着る……！<br>すまんが、ここにいる群れのことは任せたぜ！
#. de: Ich danke dir von Herzen! Gemeinsam schaffen wir das!
#. fr: Je ne sais pas comment te remercier. Je te laisse t'occuper de la meute<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Would you look at that. Not a bell since the final sentry falls, and already the bloodthirsty katobleps are moving back in.
#. column 57: If it's not one thing, it's another, right? Such is life under the dome.
#. column 58: Those katobleps will need to be put down...but they may stray to the nearby farms before we can deal with them all. Hmm...how about this─you keep the katobleps occupied while I go warn the farmers. Once they're safe in their cellars, I'll come back and we can finish off what remains together. Sound like a plan?
#. column 59: Do all the hard work?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I'll just have to keep the colony distracted for as long as I can...
msgctxt "FateEvent:724:0:60"
msgid "You will? Uh, I mean, yes. It's a solid plan. \\<cough>"
msgstr "Правда? То есть... да, план отличный. <i>Кхе-кхе!</i>"

#. ja: そうか、無茶な頼みをして悪かった。<br>だが、ここを放置することもできはしないし……。
#. de: Nicht? Nun ja, ich habe zuge<shy>gebener<shy>maßen auch schon sehr viel von dir verlangt<nbsp>...
#. fr: Oui, je comprends que c'est un travail dangereux... Mais il faut agir vite, sinon...
#. column 56: Would you look at that. Not a bell since the final sentry falls, and already the bloodthirsty katobleps are moving back in.
#. column 57: If it's not one thing, it's another, right? Such is life under the dome.
#. column 58: Those katobleps will need to be put down...but they may stray to the nearby farms before we can deal with them all. Hmm...how about this─you keep the katobleps occupied while I go warn the farmers. Once they're safe in their cellars, I'll come back and we can finish off what remains together. Sound like a plan?
#. column 59: Do all the hard work?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? Uh, I mean, yes. It's a solid plan. \<cough>
msgctxt "FateEvent:724:0:62"
msgid "\\<sigh> Then I'll just have to keep the colony distracted for as long as I can..."
msgstr "<i>Эх...</i> Придётся отвлекать колонию сколько смогу..."

#. ja: あなた、いかにも歴戦の勇士って雰囲気ですね……！<br>よかったら、私たちの狩りを手伝ってくれませんか？
#. de: Du hast die Augen eines Jägers. Das sehe ich, denn wir sind selber welche.
#. fr: Vous m'avez l'air <if $gn4>d'une guerrière<else>d'un guerrier</if> qui a connu son lot de batailles<nbsp>! Souhaiteriez-vous nous accompagner à la chasse<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Today, we track the ibruq─nasty creatures who'll tear a man crotch to crown if you let them draw too close.
#. column 58: The jungle crawls with them, yet they're anything but easy prey. This is why we usually hunt the bastards in large bands, but as you can see, we currently number but four...which brings me to my request.
#. column 59: Join the Xbr'aal on their hunt?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: A fine answer! My brothers and sisters welcome you!
#. column 62: Of course. This is a matter for the Xbr'aal, and you are not one of us.
msgctxt "FateEvent:725:0:56"
msgid "You've the eyes of a hunter. I can tell. We're hunters ourselves."
msgstr "Вижу, у тебя взгляд охотника. Я таких узнаю. Мы и сами охотники."

#. ja: 最近、増えすぎたイブルク……野猪に森が荒らされているんです。<br>それで食料調達も兼ねて狩りに出たのですが、<br>思った以上に数が多く……。
#. de: Wir sind hier, um Ibruq zu jagen<nbsp>- grausame Bestien, die jeden zerreißen, der ihnen zu nahe kommt.
#. fr: Ces derniers temps, la forêt est dévastée par un troupeau d'ibruq à la prolifération débridée. Nous avons été envoyés pour contrer cette menace et rapporter leur viande par la même occasion, mais nous ne sommes pas assez nombreux pour leur faire face...
#. column 56: You've the eyes of a hunter. I can tell. We're hunters ourselves.
#. column 58: The jungle crawls with them, yet they're anything but easy prey. This is why we usually hunt the bastards in large bands, but as you can see, we currently number but four...which brings me to my request.
#. column 59: Join the Xbr'aal on their hunt?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: A fine answer! My brothers and sisters welcome you!
#. column 62: Of course. This is a matter for the Xbr'aal, and you are not one of us.
msgctxt "FateEvent:725:0:57"
msgid "Today, we track the ibruq─nasty creatures who'll tear a man crotch to crown if you let them draw too close."
msgstr "Сегодня выслеживаем ибруков — мерзких тварей. Подпустишь их близко — порвут с головы до ног."

#. ja: ですが、あなたが協力してくれるなら、<br>あの群れ相手でも、引けを取ることはないでしょう。<br>どうか、イブルク狩りにご助力いただきたい！
#. de: Im Wald wimmelt's nur so vor ihnen, und doch sind sie keine leichte Beute. Deswegen sind wir normalerweise in größeren Verbänden unterwegs, aber wie du sehen kannst, sind wir heute nur zu viert. Womit wir zu meiner Bitte kämen.
#. fr: Cependant, avec vous à nos côtés, j'ai le sentiment qu'aucune horde de bêtes sauvages ne pourra nous résister<nbsp>! Accepterez-vous de mettre votre arme au service de la forêt<nbsp>?
#. column 56: You've the eyes of a hunter. I can tell. We're hunters ourselves.
#. column 57: Today, we track the ibruq─nasty creatures who'll tear a man crotch to crown if you let them draw too close.
#. column 59: Join the Xbr'aal on their hunt?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: A fine answer! My brothers and sisters welcome you!
#. column 62: Of course. This is a matter for the Xbr'aal, and you are not one of us.
msgctxt "FateEvent:725:0:58"
msgid "The jungle crawls with them, yet they're anything but easy prey. This is why we usually hunt the bastards in large bands, but as you can see, we currently number but four...which brings me to my request."
msgstr "Джунгли ими кишат, но лёгкой добычей их не назовёшь. Поэтому обычно мы охотимся большой группой, а сегодня нас, как видишь, всего четверо... Вот к чему я веду."

#. ja: シュバラール族の狩人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Die Xbr'aal bei der Jagd unterstützen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les chasseurs xbr'aal<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You've the eyes of a hunter. I can tell. We're hunters ourselves.
#. column 57: Today, we track the ibruq─nasty creatures who'll tear a man crotch to crown if you let them draw too close.
#. column 58: The jungle crawls with them, yet they're anything but easy prey. This is why we usually hunt the bastards in large bands, but as you can see, we currently number but four...which brings me to my request.
#. column 60: A fine answer! My brothers and sisters welcome you!
#. column 62: Of course. This is a matter for the Xbr'aal, and you are not one of us.
