msgstr "Присоединиться к охоте шубраалов?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>ではさっそく、行きましょうか！
#. de: Überaus gütig von dir. Vielen Dank!
#. fr: Je vous remercie humblement<nbsp>! Sur ce, aux armes, chasseurs<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You've the eyes of a hunter. I can tell. We're hunters ourselves.
#. column 57: Today, we track the ibruq─nasty creatures who'll tear a man crotch to crown if you let them draw too close.
#. column 58: The jungle crawls with them, yet they're anything but easy prey. This is why we usually hunt the bastards in large bands, but as you can see, we currently number but four...which brings me to my request.
#. column 59: Join the Xbr'aal on their hunt?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Of course. This is a matter for the Xbr'aal, and you are not one of us.
msgctxt "FateEvent:725:0:60"
msgid "A fine answer! My brothers and sisters welcome you!"
msgstr "Отличный ответ! Братья и сёстры рады тебе!"

#. ja: そうですか……残念ですが、やむを得ませんね。<br>本来は我々の問題ですから、どうぞお気になさらず！
#. de: Natürlich. Dies ist eine Sache der Xbr'aal, und du gehörst nicht dazu.
#. fr: Je comprends... Après tout, nos problèmes ne vous concernent pas. Bonne chance dans la suite de vos voyages<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You've the eyes of a hunter. I can tell. We're hunters ourselves.
#. column 57: Today, we track the ibruq─nasty creatures who'll tear a man crotch to crown if you let them draw too close.
#. column 58: The jungle crawls with them, yet they're anything but easy prey. This is why we usually hunt the bastards in large bands, but as you can see, we currently number but four...which brings me to my request.
#. column 59: Join the Xbr'aal on their hunt?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: A fine answer! My brothers and sisters welcome you!
msgctxt "FateEvent:725:0:62"
msgid "Of course. This is a matter for the Xbr'aal, and you are not one of us."
msgstr "Понимаю. Это дело шубраалов, а ты не один из нас."

#. ja: そこの方……戦える人ですよね！？<br>すみません、助けてください！
#. de: Oh, dich schickt der Himmel! Du kannst doch kämpfen, oder?
#. fr: Ohé, vous savez vous battre<nbsp>? J'ai dé<shy>ses<shy>pé<shy>ré<shy>ment besoin d'aide<nbsp>!
#. column 57: We'd just finished our contract and were on our way back to Solution Nine when we were attacked by werebeasts. Used what souls we had left to fight 'em off, but now we can barely move, and the boys say they can hear howls in the distance...
#. column 58: It'll take time to see the wounded to safety, but if that pack returns...we're doomed.
#. column 59: Assist the hunters?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: If you can distract the cauahealoas for long enough, I can lead the injured away to where I can attend to their wounds. You're our only chance.
#. column 62: So you'd just leave us...to die?
msgctxt "FateEvent:726:0:56"
msgid "Please. We're in trouble here."
msgstr "Прошу, помоги. У нас тут беда."

#. ja: 別の駆除を終えた帰りに、人狼どもの襲撃を受けたんです。<br>私も負傷した仲間も、もう魂資源がなくて……。
#. de: Meine Kameraden und ich waren gerade auf dem Rückweg von der Jagd, als uns diese Bestien angefallen haben. Wir konnten uns schwer verletzt retten, aber noch einmal gegen sie anzutreten, wäre Wahnsinn.
#. fr: Les autres exterminateurs ont été encerclés par une meute de loups-garous... Et plus personne n'a d'âmes de réserve<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Please. We're in trouble here.
#. column 58: It'll take time to see the wounded to safety, but if that pack returns...we're doomed.
#. column 59: Assist the hunters?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: If you can distract the cauahealoas for long enough, I can lead the injured away to where I can attend to their wounds. You're our only chance.
#. column 62: So you'd just leave us...to die?
msgctxt "FateEvent:726:0:57"
msgid "We'd just finished our contract and were on our way back to Solution Nine when we were attacked by werebeasts. Used what souls we had left to fight 'em off, but now we can barely move, and the boys say they can hear howls in the distance..."
msgstr "Мы только закончили заказ и направлялись обратно в Решение Девять, когда на нас напали оборотни. Мы отбились, потратив последние души, но теперь едва можем двигаться, а ребята говорят, что издалека слышен вой..."

#. ja: だから……負傷者の撤退が完了するまで、<br>どうか連中を食い止めていてほしいのです……。<br>無理を承知でお願いいたします！
#. de: Könntest du sie nicht besiegen? Oder wenigstens so lange aufhalten, bis alle meine Kameraden in Sicherheit sind? Bitte, ich flehe dich an!
#. fr: Alors si vous pouviez détourner l'attention des monstres pendant que je m'occupe d'évacuer les blessés, vous nous sauveriez la vie<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Please. We're in trouble here.
#. column 57: We'd just finished our contract and were on our way back to Solution Nine when we were attacked by werebeasts. Used what souls we had left to fight 'em off, but now we can barely move, and the boys say they can hear howls in the distance...
#. column 59: Assist the hunters?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: If you can distract the cauahealoas for long enough, I can lead the injured away to where I can attend to their wounds. You're our only chance.
#. column 62: So you'd just leave us...to die?
msgctxt "FateEvent:726:0:58"
msgid "It'll take time to see the wounded to safety, but if that pack returns...we're doomed."
msgstr "Нужно время, чтобы увести раненых в безопасное место. Но если стая вернётся... нам конец."

#. ja: 危機に瀕した駆除人を助けますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Merzern helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Prêter main-forte à l'ex<shy>ter<shy>mi<shy>na<shy>tri<shy>ce alerte<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Please. We're in trouble here.
#. column 57: We'd just finished our contract and were on our way back to Solution Nine when we were attacked by werebeasts. Used what souls we had left to fight 'em off, but now we can barely move, and the boys say they can hear howls in the distance...
#. column 58: It'll take time to see the wounded to safety, but if that pack returns...we're doomed.
#. column 60: If you can distract the cauahealoas for long enough, I can lead the injured away to where I can attend to their wounds. You're our only chance.
#. column 62: So you'd just leave us...to die?
