msgctxt "FateEvent:726:0:59"
msgid "Assist the hunters?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь охотникам?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: すみません、助かります！<br>では、私たちは撤退の準備を……！
#. de: Vielen Dank, danke! Wir versuchen, es derweil bis nach Hause zu schaffen!
#. fr: Merci infiniment<nbsp>! Allons aider les autres<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Please. We're in trouble here.
#. column 57: We'd just finished our contract and were on our way back to Solution Nine when we were attacked by werebeasts. Used what souls we had left to fight 'em off, but now we can barely move, and the boys say they can hear howls in the distance...
#. column 58: It'll take time to see the wounded to safety, but if that pack returns...we're doomed.
#. column 59: Assist the hunters?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: So you'd just leave us...to die?
msgctxt "FateEvent:726:0:60"
msgid "If you can distract the cauahealoas for long enough, I can lead the injured away to where I can attend to their wounds. You're our only chance."
msgstr "Если сможешь задержать кауахеалоа, я уведу раненых туда, где смогу перевязать их. Ты наша последняя надежда."

#. ja: そうですか……<br>うう、しかしこのままでは……。
#. de: Hach, was sollen wir denn jetzt nur tun<nbsp>...?
#. fr: Je vois... Que faire<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Please. We're in trouble here.
#. column 57: We'd just finished our contract and were on our way back to Solution Nine when we were attacked by werebeasts. Used what souls we had left to fight 'em off, but now we can barely move, and the boys say they can hear howls in the distance...
#. column 58: It'll take time to see the wounded to safety, but if that pack returns...we're doomed.
#. column 59: Assist the hunters?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: If you can distract the cauahealoas for long enough, I can lead the injured away to where I can attend to their wounds. You're our only chance.
msgctxt "FateEvent:726:0:62"
msgid "So you'd just leave us...to die?"
msgstr "Значит, бросишь нас... умирать?"

#. ja: まさかヤツが……<br>ミユールルまでもが現れるとは……！
#. de: Wenn du die Ibruq schon schlimm fandest, dann habe ich eine schlechte Nachricht für dich. Der grausame Milyurrul ist zurückgekehrt<nbsp>...
#. fr: Oh non, c'est pas vrai... “Il” est revenu ! Le Milyurrul... !
#. column 57: It once attacked our village and killed ten of our best warriors before bounding back into the canopy with two poor souls between its jaws. We never found the bodies...only their spines.
#. column 58: If it has descended once again, then we are <i>all</i> in danger. The monster must be slain before it is lured by our village's cookfires. Alas, we hunters still number but four─a far cry from even the ten that fell victim before... \<expectant stare>
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: We are in your debt! Or at least will be, should we emerge victorious! Which we will, now that you have promised your aid. Surely!
#. column 62: Of course. It was not your brothers who were carried into the trees to have the marrow sucked from their bones.
msgctxt "FateEvent:727:0:56"
msgid "If you thought the ibruq were bad, then I have some terrible news. The dread Milyurrul is returned..."
msgstr "Если ибуруг показались вам опасными, то у меня для вас дурные вести. Вернулся ужасный Милюррул..."

#. ja: ヤツは、ヒトを好んで襲う獰猛な存在で、<br>幾人もの同胞が犠牲になっているのです。
#. de: Er hat mal unser Dorf angegriffen und zehn unserer besten Krieger getötet, bevor er sich mit zwei armen Seelen im Maul zurück in das Dickicht machte. Wir haben ihre Körper nie gefunden, nur die Wirbelsäulen.
#. fr: C'est une bête féroce assoiffée de sang ! À cause de lui, des dizaines de mes camarades sont morts !
#. column 56: If you thought the ibruq were bad, then I have some terrible news. The dread Milyurrul is returned...
#. column 58: If it has descended once again, then we are <i>all</i> in danger. The monster must be slain before it is lured by our village's cookfires. Alas, we hunters still number but four─a far cry from even the ten that fell victim before... \<expectant stare>
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: We are in your debt! Or at least will be, should we emerge victorious! Which we will, now that you have promised your aid. Surely!
#. column 62: Of course. It was not your brothers who were carried into the trees to have the marrow sucked from their bones.
msgctxt "FateEvent:727:0:57"
msgid "It once attacked our village and killed ten of our best warriors before bounding back into the canopy with two poor souls between its jaws. We never found the bodies...only their spines."
msgstr "Однажды он напал на нашу деревню и убил десятерых лучших воинов, а потом скрылся в кронах, унося в пасти двух несчастных. Тел мы так и не нашли... только позвоночники."

#. ja: このまま放置すれば、集落に被害が出るかもしれません。<br>しかし、あなたの助力があればきっと狩れるはず……<br>どうか力添えを、お願いいたします！
#. de: Wenn er zurück ist, dann schweben wir alle in Gefahr. Diese Bestie muss unschädlich gemacht werden, bevor unsere Kochfeuer sie anlocken. Doch wir sind weiterhin bloß vier, und wenn es damals schon mit zehn nicht geklappt hat<nbsp>...
#. fr: On ne peut pas le laisser comme ça, sinon il va s'en prendre au village... Avec votre aide, on devrait parvenir à le chasser. Vous voulez-bien m'aider ?
#. column 56: If you thought the ibruq were bad, then I have some terrible news. The dread Milyurrul is returned...
#. column 57: It once attacked our village and killed ten of our best warriors before bounding back into the canopy with two poor souls between its jaws. We never found the bodies...only their spines.
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: We are in your debt! Or at least will be, should we emerge victorious! Which we will, now that you have promised your aid. Surely!
#. column 62: Of course. It was not your brothers who were carried into the trees to have the marrow sucked from their bones.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:727:0:58"
msgid "If it has descended once again, then we are <i>all</i> in danger. The monster must be slain before it is lured by our village's cookfires. Alas, we hunters still number but four─a far cry from even the ten that fell victim before... \\<expectant stare>"
msgstr "Если чудовище вернулось, то в опасности <i>все</i>. Его надо убить, пока его не привлекли костры нашей деревни. Увы, нас, охотников, всего четверо. До десяти, погибших в прошлый раз, нам далеко... <i>Ну?</i>"

#. ja: シュバラール族の狩人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Xbr'aal helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider les chasseurs xbr'aal à vaincre la bête<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: If you thought the ibruq were bad, then I have some terrible news. The dread Milyurrul is returned...
#. column 57: It once attacked our village and killed ten of our best warriors before bounding back into the canopy with two poor souls between its jaws. We never found the bodies...only their spines.
#. column 58: If it has descended once again, then we are <i>all</i> in danger. The monster must be slain before it is lured by our village's cookfires. Alas, we hunters still number but four─a far cry from even the ten that fell victim before... \<expectant stare>
#. column 60: We are in your debt! Or at least will be, should we emerge victorious! Which we will, now that you have promised your aid. Surely!
#. column 62: Of course. It was not your brothers who were carried into the trees to have the marrow sucked from their bones.
