msgctxt "FateEvent:727:0:59"
msgid "Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь шубраалам?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとうございます！<br>頼りにさせてもらいますぞ！
#. de: Danke, wir sind dir was schuldig! Zumindest, wenn wir gewinnen! Äh, was wir natürlich werden! Versprochen!
#. fr: Merci infiniment ! Ravi de pouvoir compter sur vous !
#. column 56: If you thought the ibruq were bad, then I have some terrible news. The dread Milyurrul is returned...
#. column 57: It once attacked our village and killed ten of our best warriors before bounding back into the canopy with two poor souls between its jaws. We never found the bodies...only their spines.
#. column 58: If it has descended once again, then we are <i>all</i> in danger. The monster must be slain before it is lured by our village's cookfires. Alas, we hunters still number but four─a far cry from even the ten that fell victim before... \<expectant stare>
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Of course. It was not your brothers who were carried into the trees to have the marrow sucked from their bones.
msgctxt "FateEvent:727:0:60"
msgid "We are in your debt! Or at least will be, should we emerge victorious! Which we will, now that you have promised your aid. Surely!"
msgstr "Мы у тебя в долгу! Ну, будем, если выживем. А мы выживем, раз уж ты обещал помочь. Наверное!"

#. ja: 危険ですからね、無理もない。<br>しかし、みすみす見逃すというのも……<br>ううむ……。
#. de: Natürlich. Es waren ja nicht deine Brüder, die er in das Dickicht geschliffen hat, um ihnen das Mark aus den Knochen zu saugen.
#. fr: O-oui, je comprends, vous ne voulez pas risquer votre vie... Mais je ne peux définitivement pas le laisser agir à sa guise... Que faire...
#. column 56: If you thought the ibruq were bad, then I have some terrible news. The dread Milyurrul is returned...
#. column 57: It once attacked our village and killed ten of our best warriors before bounding back into the canopy with two poor souls between its jaws. We never found the bodies...only their spines.
#. column 58: If it has descended once again, then we are <i>all</i> in danger. The monster must be slain before it is lured by our village's cookfires. Alas, we hunters still number but four─a far cry from even the ten that fell victim before... \<expectant stare>
#. column 59: Aid the Xbr'aal?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: We are in your debt! Or at least will be, should we emerge victorious! Which we will, now that you have promised your aid. Surely!
msgctxt "FateEvent:727:0:62"
msgid "Of course. It was not your brothers who were carried into the trees to have the marrow sucked from their bones."
msgstr "Конечно. Это ведь не твоих братьев утащили в лес, чтобы высосать из их костей мозг."

#. ja: おうおう、お前さぁ……<br>ちょっと俺らの暇つぶしに付き合ってくれねえか？
#. de: Du siehst aus, als wärst du 'ne gütige Seele. Hättest du einen Moment Zeit für uns?
#. fr: Hé, toi. Ça te dirait de nous aider un peu à tuer le temps, ja ?
#. column 57: You see, I'm dealing with a bout of the melancholy, and could do to 'ave me spirits lifted.
#. column 58: It'd work like this: one, I stab you. Two, you get stabbed. Three, a great weight is lifted from me 'eavy 'eart. So what do you say?
#. column 59: Get stabbed?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Heh heh. I'll make it worth me while.
#. column 62: Too good to help a man, are we? I should stab you for that!
msgctxt "FateEvent:728:0:56"
msgid "You look the kindly sort. Might you spare a moment to 'elp a poor man in need?"
msgstr "На вид ты добрая душа. Не уделишь минутку бедолаге?"

#. ja: まあアレだ、俺ら最近、ちょっと気持ちが落ち込んでてよ？<br>お前に慰めてほしいんだわ。
#. de: Weißt du, wir sind gerade regelrecht erschlagen von Melancholie und könnten ein wenig Aufmunterung gebrauchen.
#. fr: Oh, rien de bien méchant, rassure-toi. Comme on est un peu déprimés en ce moment, on cherche quelqu'un pour nous consoler...
#. column 56: You look the kindly sort. Might you spare a moment to 'elp a poor man in need?
#. column 58: It'd work like this: one, I stab you. Two, you get stabbed. Three, a great weight is lifted from me 'eavy 'eart. So what do you say?
#. column 59: Get stabbed?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Heh heh. I'll make it worth me while.
#. column 62: Too good to help a man, are we? I should stab you for that!
msgctxt "FateEvent:728:0:57"
msgid "You see, I'm dealing with a bout of the melancholy, and could do to 'ave me spirits lifted."
msgstr "Понимаешь, на меня напала хандра, и не помешало бы немного взбодриться."

#. ja: 方法は簡単……俺らが殴る、お前は泣く！<br>そんだけで俺らは大いに楽しめるってわけだ……<br>なあいいだろ、いいよなァ！？
#. de: So funktioniert's! Erstens: Wir stechen dich. Zweitens: Du wirst erstochen. Drittens: Uns fällt ein Riesenstein von der Seele. Sehr simpel, nicht wahr?
#. fr: C'que je te propose est très simple : on te roue de coups, et tu pleurniches sans riposter ! Ça va nous remonter le moral comme jamais ! Alors, t'en dis quoi, ja !?
#. column 56: You look the kindly sort. Might you spare a moment to 'elp a poor man in need?
#. column 57: You see, I'm dealing with a bout of the melancholy, and could do to 'ave me spirits lifted.
#. column 59: Get stabbed?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Heh heh. I'll make it worth me while.
#. column 62: Too good to help a man, are we? I should stab you for that!
msgctxt "FateEvent:728:0:58"
msgid "It'd work like this: one, I stab you. Two, you get stabbed. Three, a great weight is lifted from me 'eavy 'eart. So what do you say?"
msgstr "Всё просто: раз — я тебя закалываю. Два — тебя закололи. Три — с моего тяжёлого сердца свалился камень. Ну что скажешь?"

#. ja: 荒くれを懲らしめますか？<br><br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dich erstechen lassen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Donner une correction aux voyous ?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You look the kindly sort. Might you spare a moment to 'elp a poor man in need?
#. column 57: You see, I'm dealing with a bout of the melancholy, and could do to 'ave me spirits lifted.
#. column 58: It'd work like this: one, I stab you. Two, you get stabbed. Three, a great weight is lifted from me 'eavy 'eart. So what do you say?
#. column 60: Heh heh. I'll make it worth me while.
#. column 62: Too good to help a man, are we? I should stab you for that!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
