msgctxt "FateEvent:728:0:59"
msgid "Get stabbed?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Дать себя заколоть?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ヒヒ、そうこなくちゃよォ！<br>なるべくいい声で泣きわめいてくれよ！？
#. de: Haha, genau das wollte ich hören!
#. fr: Hé hé, à la bonne heure, ja ! J'ai hâte de t'entendre chialer avec ta petite voix fluette, bwahaha !
#. column 56: You look the kindly sort. Might you spare a moment to 'elp a poor man in need?
#. column 57: You see, I'm dealing with a bout of the melancholy, and could do to 'ave me spirits lifted.
#. column 58: It'd work like this: one, I stab you. Two, you get stabbed. Three, a great weight is lifted from me 'eavy 'eart. So what do you say?
#. column 59: Get stabbed?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Too good to help a man, are we? I should stab you for that!
msgctxt "FateEvent:728:0:60"
msgid "Heh heh. I'll make it worth me while."
msgstr "Хе-хе. Я уж постараюсь, чтобы мне было весело."

#. ja: おう、コラぁ！<br>無視してんじゃねえぞおい！
#. de: Hältst dich wohl für was Besseres, hm? Dafür sollte ich dir meine Klinge zwischen die Rippen stoßen.
#. fr: Vas-y, d'où tu m'ignores comme ça, ja !?
#. column 56: You look the kindly sort. Might you spare a moment to 'elp a poor man in need?
#. column 57: You see, I'm dealing with a bout of the melancholy, and could do to 'ave me spirits lifted.
#. column 58: It'd work like this: one, I stab you. Two, you get stabbed. Three, a great weight is lifted from me 'eavy 'eart. So what do you say?
#. column 59: Get stabbed?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Heh heh. I'll make it worth me while.
msgctxt "FateEvent:728:0:62"
msgid "Too good to help a man, are we? I should stab you for that!"
msgstr "Что, слишком хорош, чтобы помочь бедняге? За такое я бы тебя и пырнул!"

#. ja: ちょっとあんた、手練れなんだろ？<br>あの男……賞金首のダーテカを倒しちゃくれないか？
#. de: Du machst lieber Kehrt, <if $gn4>Partnerin<else>Partner</if>. Diese Gegend wird von einem Banditen terrorisiert, der vor nichts und niemandem Halt macht.
#. fr: Dis donc, tu m'as l'air doué<if $gn4>e</if> de tes dix doigts<nbsp>! Le type là-bas... C'est Zawtekwa, un terrible bandit. Tu pourrais te charger de lui<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you're thinking of claiming the bounty on his head. Not that I'd recommend the endeavor.
#. column 58: Hunt the outlaw?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You're a braver man than I...but don't say that I didn't warn you.
#. column 62: I don't blame you. Better a belly full yellow than one dripping red with blood on account of a knife being stuck in it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:729:0:56"
msgid "You'd best turn back, friend. There's an outlaw on the loose, and not a single one of us are safe as long as he is."
msgstr "Лучше поворачивай назад, дружище. Тут разгуливает преступник, и пока он на свободе, никто из нас не в безопасности."

#. ja: ヤツは凶悪な強盗犯で、<br>放置しておけば新たな事件が起こることは間違いない。<br>荒野の平和のため、どうか頼むよ……！
#. de: Es sei denn, du bist scharf auf das Kopfgeld, wovon ich dir allerdings dringendst abraten würde.
#. fr: Il a déjà commis un paquet de braquages dans la région, et si personne ne l'arrête, ça ne fera qu'empirer<nbsp>! Je compte sur toi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You'd best turn back, friend. There's an outlaw on the loose, and not a single one of us are safe as long as he is.
#. column 58: Hunt the outlaw?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You're a braver man than I...but don't say that I didn't warn you.
#. column 62: I don't blame you. Better a belly full yellow than one dripping red with blood on account of a knife being stuck in it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:729:0:57"
msgid "Unless, that is, you're thinking of claiming the bounty on his head. Not that I'd recommend the endeavor."
msgstr "Если, конечно, ты не собираешься получить награду за его голову. Хотя я бы не советовал."

#. ja: 賞金首を討伐しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Banditen jagen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Affronter le hors-la-loi<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You'd best turn back, friend. There's an outlaw on the loose, and not a single one of us are safe as long as he is.
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you're thinking of claiming the bounty on his head. Not that I'd recommend the endeavor.
#. column 60: You're a braver man than I...but don't say that I didn't warn you.
#. column 62: I don't blame you. Better a belly full yellow than one dripping red with blood on account of a knife being stuck in it.
