msgctxt "FateEvent:729:0:58"
msgid "Hunt the outlaw?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Охотиться на преступника?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 引き受けてくれるか、ありがとう！<br>武運を祈るよ……！
#. de: Du bist mutiger, als ich dachte. Aber sag nicht, ich hätte dich nicht gewarnt.
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Que la chance soit avec toi, <if $gn4>étrangère<else>étranger</if><nbsp>!
#. column 56: You'd best turn back, friend. There's an outlaw on the loose, and not a single one of us are safe as long as he is.
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you're thinking of claiming the bounty on his head. Not that I'd recommend the endeavor.
#. column 58: Hunt the outlaw?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I don't blame you. Better a belly full yellow than one dripping red with blood on account of a knife being stuck in it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:729:0:60"
msgid "You're a braver man than I...but don't say that I didn't warn you."
msgstr "Ты храбрее меня... Но не говори потом, что я тебя не предупреждал."

#. ja: そうか、まあ怖いもんな……。<br>うーんでも、ヤツを見逃すわけには……。
#. de: Meinen Segen hast du. Lieber ein lebender Feigling als ein toter Held.
#. fr: Oui, moi aussi j'y réfléchirais à deux fois... Mais on ne peut pas le laisser agir à sa guise pour toujours...
#. column 56: You'd best turn back, friend. There's an outlaw on the loose, and not a single one of us are safe as long as he is.
#. column 57: Unless, that is, you're thinking of claiming the bounty on his head. Not that I'd recommend the endeavor.
#. column 58: Hunt the outlaw?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You're a braver man than I...but don't say that I didn't warn you.
msgctxt "FateEvent:729:0:62"
msgid "I don't blame you. Better a belly full yellow than one dripping red with blood on account of a knife being stuck in it."
msgstr "Не осуждаю. Лучше уж живот от страха сводит, чем кровь из него льётся, потому что туда нож воткнули."

#. ja: ヤツは死を偽装するのが上手くて、<br>何度も自警団の目をごまかしてきたんだ。<br>この機を逃す手はないよ。
#. de: Zawtekwa ist ein Meister der Verkleidung. Deshalb hatten es die Kopfgeldjäger beim ersten Mal so schwer, ihn zu finden und unschädlich zu machen.
#. fr: Il est sacrément doué pour se faire passer pour mort, c'est comme ça qu'il a réussi à tromper la milice jusque-là<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:730:0:56"
msgid "Zawtekwa is known to be a master of disguise. It's why the bounty hunters had such a hard time finding him and killing him the first time!"
msgstr "Завтеква — мастер маскировки. Потому охотникам за головами в прошлый раз и было так трудно его найти и прикончить!"

#. ja: これはこれは……<br>このような僻地で人と会えるとは、なんたる幸運。<br>少々、お力を貸してはいただけませんか？
#. de: Na, so was! Heute muss mein Glückstag sein, dass ich in so einer abgelegenen Gegend <if $gn4>eine starke Abenteurerin<else>einen starken Abenteurer</if> wie dich treffen würde<nbsp>...!
#. fr: Tiens, tiens... Je ne m'attendais pas à tomber sur quelqu'un ici. C'est bien ma veine<nbsp>! Vous voulez bien m'aider<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Me, I have been coming to this spot since I was a youth, as has my family for generations, for here is where we gather cloud dill for our poultices. Yet, in all my years, never have I found the place so infested with vermin.
#. column 58: I have some skill with the knife, but I am but a provider by trade, and could not stand against the deadly swarm that congregates here now. Might I ask <i>your</i> assistance?
#. column 59: Assist the provider?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You've a kind soul, traveler, and have my thanks. I shall keep my distance from the myrmeleons and gather what herbs I can, but if you happen to find any while slaying the vilekin, I would gladly reward you for your efforts.
#. column 62: I understand. I shall keep from the swarm then and gather what I can. Good travels.
msgctxt "FateEvent:731:0:56"
msgid "Greetings. It is rare to meet another this deep in Yyasulani, such are the dangers of the journey."
msgstr "Приветствую. Редко встретишь кого-то в такой глуши Яасулани — уж больно опасен путь сюда."

#. ja: この先に、先祖伝来の薬の原料となる草が生えているのですが、<br>魔物が巣を作ってしまい、手が出せないのです。
#. de: Sag, würdest du mir vielleicht etwas zur Hand gehen? Hier wächst nämlich ein gewisses Gras, das ich als Zutat für meine Heilmedizin brauche. Leider direkt neben einem Nest von Ungeheuern.
#. fr: Il y a une variété de plante médicinale que nous utilisons depuis des générations qui pousse un peu plus loin d'ici. Des monstres se sont installés tout près et je ne peux plus rien récolter.
#. column 56: Greetings. It is rare to meet another this deep in Yyasulani, such are the dangers of the journey.
#. column 58: I have some skill with the knife, but I am but a provider by trade, and could not stand against the deadly swarm that congregates here now. Might I ask <i>your</i> assistance?
#. column 59: Assist the provider?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You've a kind soul, traveler, and have my thanks. I shall keep my distance from the myrmeleons and gather what herbs I can, but if you happen to find any while slaying the vilekin, I would gladly reward you for your efforts.
#. column 62: I understand. I shall keep from the swarm then and gather what I can. Good travels.
msgctxt "FateEvent:731:0:57"
msgid "Me, I have been coming to this spot since I was a youth, as has my family for generations, for here is where we gather cloud dill for our poultices. Yet, in all my years, never have I found the place so infested with vermin. "
msgstr "Я с юности прихожу сюда, как и мои предки из поколения в поколение. Здесь мы собираем облачный укроп для припарок. Но за все годы я ни разу не видел, чтобы это место так кишело вредителями."

#. ja: どうにか、奴らをかわしつつ薬草を集めたい……。<br>もしあなたに自信がおありでしたら、<br>お願いしたいのですが、いかがでしょう？
#. de: Vielleicht kannst du sie bezwingen und mir dann welche von den Gräsern bringen? Meinst du, du wärst dazu in der Lage?
#. fr: Pourriez-vous en ramasser à ma place<nbsp>? Tout en repoussant les créatures, cela va de soi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Greetings. It is rare to meet another this deep in Yyasulani, such are the dangers of the journey.
#. column 57: Me, I have been coming to this spot since I was a youth, as has my family for generations, for here is where we gather cloud dill for our poultices. Yet, in all my years, never have I found the place so infested with vermin.
#. column 59: Assist the provider?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You've a kind soul, traveler, and have my thanks. I shall keep my distance from the myrmeleons and gather what herbs I can, but if you happen to find any while slaying the vilekin, I would gladly reward you for your efforts.
#. column 62: I understand. I shall keep from the swarm then and gather what I can. Good travels.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:731:0:58"
msgid "I have some skill with the knife, but I am but a provider by trade, and could not stand against the deadly swarm that congregates here now. Might I ask <i>your</i> assistance?"
msgstr "Ножом я владею неплохо, но я всё-таки сборщик трав, а с целой стаей опасных тварей мне не справиться. Не поможешь <i>ты</i>?"

#. ja: 農務役のトナワータ族に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Tonawawta-Bauern helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le fournisseur tonawawta<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Greetings. It is rare to meet another this deep in Yyasulani, such are the dangers of the journey.
#. column 57: Me, I have been coming to this spot since I was a youth, as has my family for generations, for here is where we gather cloud dill for our poultices. Yet, in all my years, never have I found the place so infested with vermin.
#. column 58: I have some skill with the knife, but I am but a provider by trade, and could not stand against the deadly swarm that congregates here now. Might I ask <i>your</i> assistance?
#. column 60: You've a kind soul, traveler, and have my thanks. I shall keep my distance from the myrmeleons and gather what herbs I can, but if you happen to find any while slaying the vilekin, I would gladly reward you for your efforts.
#. column 62: I understand. I shall keep from the swarm then and gather what I can. Good travels.
