msgctxt "FateEvent:731:0:59"
msgid "Assist the provider?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь сборщику трав?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: おお……ありがとうございます。<br>「ヤースラニの薬草」が採れましたら、<br>ぜひ私までお届けください！
#. de: Ja, wunderbar, vielen Dank! Bring mir alle Heilkräuter, die du finden kannst, ja?
#. fr: Oh, merci bien<nbsp>! Confiez-moi tout ce que vous pouvez ramasser, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Greetings. It is rare to meet another this deep in Yyasulani, such are the dangers of the journey.
#. column 57: Me, I have been coming to this spot since I was a youth, as has my family for generations, for here is where we gather cloud dill for our poultices. Yet, in all my years, never have I found the place so infested with vermin.
#. column 58: I have some skill with the knife, but I am but a provider by trade, and could not stand against the deadly swarm that congregates here now. Might I ask <i>your</i> assistance?
#. column 59: Assist the provider?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: I understand. I shall keep from the swarm then and gather what I can. Good travels.
msgctxt "FateEvent:731:0:60"
msgid "You've a kind soul, traveler, and have my thanks. I shall keep my distance from the myrmeleons and gather what herbs I can, but if you happen to find any while slaying the vilekin, I would gladly reward you for your efforts."
msgstr "Добрая у тебя душа, путник. Спасибо. Я буду держаться подальше от муравьиных львов и соберу, что смогу. А если во время охоты на тварей найдёшь травы, с радостью заплачу тебе за них."

#. ja: そうですか……わかりました。<br>無理を言ってしまい、申し訳ございません。
#. de: Verstehe. Entschuldige, dass ich dich um so etwas gebeten habe.
#. fr: Très bien, je ne voudrais pas m'imposer non plus...
#. column 56: Greetings. It is rare to meet another this deep in Yyasulani, such are the dangers of the journey.
#. column 57: Me, I have been coming to this spot since I was a youth, as has my family for generations, for here is where we gather cloud dill for our poultices. Yet, in all my years, never have I found the place so infested with vermin.
#. column 58: I have some skill with the knife, but I am but a provider by trade, and could not stand against the deadly swarm that congregates here now. Might I ask <i>your</i> assistance?
#. column 59: Assist the provider?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You've a kind soul, traveler, and have my thanks. I shall keep my distance from the myrmeleons and gather what herbs I can, but if you happen to find any while slaying the vilekin, I would gladly reward you for your efforts.
msgctxt "FateEvent:731:0:62"
msgid "I understand. I shall keep from the swarm then and gather what I can. Good travels."
msgstr "Понимаю. Тогда буду держаться подальше от стаи и соберу, что смогу. Счастливого пути."

#. ja: 「ヤースラニの薬草」は、集まっておりますか？
#. de: Oh, hast du schon Heilkräuter sammeln können?
#. fr: Alors, vous avez pu récupérer des herbes médicinales<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Yes, this will serve, though I will need to collect more before returning.
#. column 62: It can be difficult to find, yes.
msgctxt "FateEvent:732:0:56"
msgid "Have you any of the herb?"
msgstr "Нашёлся облачный укроп?"

#. ja: おお……助かります！<br>備蓄のため、もう少々あると嬉しいですね！
#. de: Fantastisch! Würde es dir etwas ausmachen, noch mehr zu sammeln? Ich lege gern Vorräte an.
#. fr: Ah, parfait<nbsp>! Il m'en faudrait encore un peu plus pour en avoir assez<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Have you any of the herb?
#. column 62: It can be difficult to find, yes.
msgctxt "FateEvent:732:0:60"
msgid "Yes, this will serve, though I will need to collect more before returning."
msgstr "Вот это помощь! Но для запаса мне бы ещё немного собрать."

#. ja: かしこまりました。<br>引き続き、お待ちしておりますね。
#. de: Verstehe. Ich warte einfach hier.
#. fr: Ce n'est rien, je vous attends ici quoi qu'il arrive.
#. column 56: Have you any of the herb?
#. column 60: Yes, this will serve, though I will need to collect more before returning.
msgctxt "FateEvent:732:0:62"
msgid "It can be difficult to find, yes."
msgstr "Понимаю. Я подожду здесь."

#. ja: 無理を言ってしまいすみませんが、<br>薬草の採集、どうかよろしくお願いいたします。
#. de: Verzeih, dass ich um diese Sache gebeten habe, aber ich brauche diese Heilkräuter wirklich unbedingt.
#. fr: Je sais que ce n'est pas une mission aisée, mais je compte sur vous<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:733:0:56"
msgid "No luck? Do not blame yourself. I have been gathering cloud dill for many summers, and still there are days I return home empty-handed."
msgstr "Не нашёл? Не вини себя. Я собираю облачный укроп уже много лет, и всё равно порой возвращаюсь домой с пустыми руками."

#. ja: 「ヤースラニの薬草」は、集まっておりますか？
#. de: Oh, hast du schon Heilkräuter sammeln können?
#. fr: Alors, vous avez pu récupérer des herbes médicinales<nbsp>?
#. column 60: I truly cannot begin to thank you. Never could I have collected this much without you. My village is in your debt.
#. column 62: Fortunately, my pack is nearly full, and I can return to my village soon. Though, if you happen to gather any more before I leave, I would be more than happy to accept it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:734:0:56"
msgid "Might you have brought more?"
msgstr "Принёс ещё?"

#. ja: ありがとうございます。<br>あなたのおかげで備蓄用も確保できましたし、<br>十分な成果です！
#. de: Wunderbar. Jetzt habe ich endlich genug Heilkräuter zusammen. Ich kann mir sogar einen kleinen Vorrat anlegen.
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Grâce à vous, j'ai tout ce qu'il me faut à présent<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Might you have brought more?
#. column 62: Fortunately, my pack is nearly full, and I can return to my village soon. Though, if you happen to gather any more before I leave, I would be more than happy to accept it.
msgctxt "FateEvent:734:0:60"
msgid "I truly cannot begin to thank you. Never could I have collected this much without you. My village is in your debt."
msgstr "И не знаю, как тебя благодарить. Без тебя я бы столько не собрал. Вся деревня у тебя в долгу."

#. ja: おかげさまで、十分な数が集まりました。<br>そろそろ引き上げようと思いますので、<br>渡しそびれたものがあれば、引き取りますね。
#. de: Wunderbar. Jetzt habe ich endlich genug Heilkräuter zusammen. So langsam werde ich mich auch auf den Weg nach Hause machen, also gib mir gern alles, was du noch hast.
#. fr: Je ne vais pas tarder à rentrer, s'il vous reste des herbes, donnez-les-moi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Might you have brought more?
#. column 60: I truly cannot begin to thank you. Never could I have collected this much without you. My village is in your debt.
msgctxt "FateEvent:734:0:62"
msgid "Fortunately, my pack is nearly full, and I can return to my village soon. Though, if you happen to gather any more before I leave, I would be more than happy to accept it."
msgstr "У меня почти полный мешок, скоро уже пора возвращаться в деревню. Но если до моего ухода найдёшь ещё травы, я с радостью их приму."

#. ja: おかげさまで、十分な数が集まりました。<br>そろそろ引き上げようと思いますので、<br>渡しそびれたものがあれば、引き取りますね。
#. de: Wunderbar. Jetzt habe ich endlich genug Heilkräuter zusammen. So langsam werde ich mich auch auf den Weg nach Hause machen, also gib mir gern alles, was du noch hast.
#. fr: Je ne vais pas tarder à rentrer, s'il vous reste des herbes, donnez-les-moi<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:735:0:56"
msgid "My pack is nearly full and the day grows short. I should be heading back to my village soon. Though, if you happen to gather any more before I leave, I would be more than happy to accept it."
msgstr "Мешок почти полон, да и день клонится к вечеру. Скоро пора возвращаться в деревню. Но если до моего ухода найдёшь ещё травы, я с радостью их приму."

#. ja: あんた、もしや駆除人さんかい？<br>いや、手練れであれば何でも構わない……<br>機械兵の排除に、力を貸してもらえないか？
#. de: Bist du etwa <if $gn4>eine Merzerin<else>ein Merzer</if>? Ach, solange du kämpfen kannst, spielt das eigentlich auch keine Rolle. Es gibt hier nämlich ein Problem mit defekten Maschinensoldaten.
#. fr: Toi, là<nbsp>! Tu serais pas <if $gn4>ex<shy>ter<shy>mi<shy>na<shy>tri<shy>ce<else>exterminateur</if> par hasard<nbsp>? Tu peux m'aider<nbsp>?
#. column 57: You see, we've got ourselves a sentry problem. Damnable iron devils are on the fritz and the army engineers are nowhere to be seen.
#. column 58: Suppose they have their hands full, what with...whatever it is they do, so it's us little people who have to do all the heavy lifting. Might I interest <i>you</i> in some heavy lifting?
#. column 59: Heavy lift?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Alright, just don't hit them <i>too</i> hard. I can remove and resell the cores that aren't damaged.
#. column 62: Aye. Can't say that I blame you.
msgctxt "FateEvent:736:0:56"
msgid "You a hunter? Can't say you dress much like one, but you've got that look─the one a coeurl gives a fawn just before it leaps."
msgstr "Ты охотник? На охотника не похож, но взгляд у тебя такой... как у куэрла перед прыжком на оленёнка."

#. ja: 落雷のせいか壊れちまった機械兵みたいでさ、<br>近くを通ろうとしたら、いきなり撃たれかけたんだ。
#. de: Die müssen wohl einen Blitzschlag oder so was abbekommen haben, jedenfalls spielen sie völlig verrückt. Die haben mich vorhin aus heiterem Himmel angegriffen.
#. fr: Les sentinelles mécaniques du coin ont perdu la boule à cause des éclairs... Je marchais tranquille quand elles m'ont attaqué sans raison<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You a hunter? Can't say you dress much like one, but you've got that look─the one a coeurl gives a fawn just before it leaps.
#. column 58: Suppose they have their hands full, what with...whatever it is they do, so it's us little people who have to do all the heavy lifting. Might I interest <i>you</i> in some heavy lifting?
#. column 59: Heavy lift?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Alright, just don't hit them <i>too</i> hard. I can remove and resell the cores that aren't damaged.
#. column 62: Aye. Can't say that I blame you.
msgctxt "FateEvent:736:0:57"
msgid "You see, we've got ourselves a sentry problem. Damnable iron devils are on the fritz and the army engineers are nowhere to be seen."
msgstr "Тут у нас с часовыми беда. Проклятые железные дьяволы барахлят, а армейских инженеров и след простыл."

#. ja: このままにしておいたら、どんな被害が出るか……。<br>だからどうか頼むよ、あいつらを駆除して、<br>安全を確保してほしいんだ！
#. de: Wer weiß, was als Nächstes geschieht! Irgendwer muss dem Einhalt gebieten.
#. fr: Quelqu'un de moins vif que moi s'en serait moins bien sorti... Il faut les éliminer avant qu'il n'y ait des blessés<nbsp>! Tu veux bien t'en occuper<nbsp>?
#. column 56: You a hunter? Can't say you dress much like one, but you've got that look─the one a coeurl gives a fawn just before it leaps.
#. column 57: You see, we've got ourselves a sentry problem. Damnable iron devils are on the fritz and the army engineers are nowhere to be seen.
#. column 59: Heavy lift?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Alright, just don't hit them <i>too</i> hard. I can remove and resell the cores that aren't damaged.
#. column 62: Aye. Can't say that I blame you.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:736:0:58"
msgid "Suppose they have their hands full, what with...whatever it is they do, so it's us little people who have to do all the heavy lifting. Might I interest <i>you</i> in some heavy lifting?"
msgstr "У них там, наверное, своих забот полно... чем бы они ни занимались. Вот нам, простым людям, и приходится делать всю тяжёлую работу. Не хочешь <i>ты</i> немного поработать?"

#. ja: 途方に暮れた拾得人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Wiederschaffer deine Hilfe anbieten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Prêter main-forte au détecteur perplexe<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You a hunter? Can't say you dress much like one, but you've got that look─the one a coeurl gives a fawn just before it leaps.
#. column 57: You see, we've got ourselves a sentry problem. Damnable iron devils are on the fritz and the army engineers are nowhere to be seen.
#. column 58: Suppose they have their hands full, what with...whatever it is they do, so it's us little people who have to do all the heavy lifting. Might I interest <i>you</i> in some heavy lifting?
#. column 60: Alright, just don't hit them <i>too</i> hard. I can remove and resell the cores that aren't damaged.
#. column 62: Aye. Can't say that I blame you.
