#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:736:0:60"
msgid "Alright, just don't hit them <i>too</i> hard. I can remove and resell the cores that aren't damaged."
msgstr "Ладно, только не бей их <i>слишком</i> сильно. Целые ядра я смогу вытащить и перепродать."

#. ja: そうか……いやすまん、<br>通りがかりの人に頼むようなことじゃなかったな。<br>いつ来るかわからんが、駆除人に正式な依頼を出すとするよ。
#. de: Natürlich, das ist kein Gefallen, um den man schnell mal <if $gn4>eine Reisende<else>einen Reisenden</if> bitten sollte. Ich werde versuchen, die Merzer zu beauftragen.
#. fr: Ah... En même temps, je demande l'impossible à la première personne que je croise, j'aurais dû m'en douter. Je vais aller chercher des exterminateurs...
#. column 56: You a hunter? Can't say you dress much like one, but you've got that look─the one a coeurl gives a fawn just before it leaps.
#. column 57: You see, we've got ourselves a sentry problem. Damnable iron devils are on the fritz and the army engineers are nowhere to be seen.
#. column 58: Suppose they have their hands full, what with...whatever it is they do, so it's us little people who have to do all the heavy lifting. Might I interest <i>you</i> in some heavy lifting?
#. column 59: Heavy lift?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Alright, just don't hit them <i>too</i> hard. I can remove and resell the cores that aren't damaged.
msgctxt "FateEvent:736:0:62"
msgid "Aye. Can't say that I blame you. "
msgstr "Ага. Не могу тебя винить."

#. ja: すまない、不測の事態につき、助けてはもらえないだろうか。<br>荷を運んでいたところ、魔物に追われてしまってね……<br>これ以上は走れず、どうしたものかと思っていたところなんだ。
#. de: Du bist auf deinem Weg hierher nicht zufällig ein paar, äh, aggressiv aussehenden Pflanzen begegnet?
#. fr: Pardon, étrang<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>, j'aurais besoin de ton aide, ja. J'ai été attaqué par des monstres alors que je transportais des mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses... Plus précisément de l'engrais pour favoriser la culture de najool.
#. column 57: Was set upon by a─what do you reckon one calls a group of man-eating flowers? A bushel? A bale? A bouquet? Aye, let's go with bouquet─a bouquet of man-eating flowers while making the run from Whetstone. It was all I could do to make it here to this clearing.
#. column 58: Damn things must have been drawn to the scent of my cargo. You see, I'm a porter, and I <i>need</i> to get this delivery of soil sweetener into the hands of the najool tenders at Golmajiik, but I don't think I can either outrun <i>or</i> outduel those things I saw. Might I ask your help?
#. column 59: Aid the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You're a saint! I think I can already hear the “bouquet” approaching!
#. column 62: Fine... I don't want to abandon my cargo but...
msgctxt "FateEvent:737:0:56"
msgid "You didn't happen to see any...er...fierce-looking flora on your way here, did you?"
msgstr "По дороге сюда тебе случайно не попались... э-э... свирепые растения?"

#. ja: 私が運んでいた積荷は、<br>ナジュールの発育を促す秘薬……。<br>おそらく、それに興味を示した草木の魔物が襲ってきたんだろう。
#. de: Mir ist eine ganze Horde davon auf dem Weg von Schuppenschliff aufgelauert. Habe es gerade noch so bis zu dieser Lichtung geschafft.
#. fr: J'imagine que c'est ce qui a attiré la curiosité des créatures végétales environnantes. En tout cas, me voilà maintenant blessé et incapable de défendre ma livraison con<shy>ve<shy>na<shy>ble<shy>ment, ja...
#. column 56: You didn't happen to see any...er...fierce-looking flora on your way here, did you?
#. column 58: Damn things must have been drawn to the scent of my cargo. You see, I'm a porter, and I <i>need</i> to get this delivery of soil sweetener into the hands of the najool tenders at Golmajiik, but I don't think I can either outrun <i>or</i> outduel those things I saw. Might I ask your help?
#. column 59: Aid the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You're a saint! I think I can already hear the “bouquet” approaching!
#. column 62: Fine... I don't want to abandon my cargo but...
msgctxt "FateEvent:737:0:57"
msgid "Was set upon by a─what do you reckon one calls a group of man-eating flowers? A bushel? A bale? A bouquet? Aye, let's go with bouquet─a bouquet of man-eating flowers while making the run from Whetstone. It was all I could do to make it here to this clearing."
msgstr "На меня напала... как это назвать — стая цветов-людоедов? Пучок? Охапка? Букет? Ладно, пусть будет букет. Они набросились на меня по дороге из Уэтстоуна. Я едва успел добраться до этой поляны."

#. ja: このままでは魔物に荷を奪われる……<br>すまないが、積荷を守ってはもらえないだろうか？
#. de: Vermutlich wurden sie vom Geruch meiner Fracht angelockt. Ich habe Dünger geladen, der unbedingt zu den Najool-Züchtern im Golmajiik-Hain gebracht werden muss. Allerdings fürchte ich, weder auf der Flucht noch im Kampf wäre ich diesen Biestern gewachsen. Könntest du mir vielleicht helfen?
#. fr: Ce serait une catastrophe de perdre ma marchandise, ja... Puis-je te demander de la protéger ?
#. column 56: You didn't happen to see any...er...fierce-looking flora on your way here, did you?
#. column 57: Was set upon by a─what do you reckon one calls a group of man-eating flowers? A bushel? A bale? A bouquet? Aye, let's go with bouquet─a bouquet of man-eating flowers while making the run from Whetstone. It was all I could do to make it here to this clearing.
#. column 59: Aid the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You're a saint! I think I can already hear the “bouquet” approaching!
#. column 62: Fine... I don't want to abandon my cargo but...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:737:0:58"
msgid "Damn things must have been drawn to the scent of my cargo. You see, I'm a porter, and I <i>need</i> to get this delivery of soil sweetener into the hands of the najool tenders at Golmajiik, but I don't think I can either outrun <i>or</i> outduel those things I saw. Might I ask your help?"
msgstr "Проклятые твари, должно быть, почуяли запах моего груза. Я грузчик, и мне <i>непременно</i> нужно доставить подкормку для почвы садоводам найджула в Голмаджике. Но тех тварей, что я видел, мне не обогнать <i>и</i> не одолеть в бою. Поможешь?"

#. ja: フビゴ族の荷運び人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Träger helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Venir en aide au transporteur hoobigo ?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: You didn't happen to see any...er...fierce-looking flora on your way here, did you?
#. column 57: Was set upon by a─what do you reckon one calls a group of man-eating flowers? A bushel? A bale? A bouquet? Aye, let's go with bouquet─a bouquet of man-eating flowers while making the run from Whetstone. It was all I could do to make it here to this clearing.
#. column 58: Damn things must have been drawn to the scent of my cargo. You see, I'm a porter, and I <i>need</i> to get this delivery of soil sweetener into the hands of the najool tenders at Golmajiik, but I don't think I can either outrun <i>or</i> outduel those things I saw. Might I ask your help?
#. column 60: You're a saint! I think I can already hear the “bouquet” approaching!
#. column 62: Fine... I don't want to abandon my cargo but...
