msgctxt "FateEvent:737:0:59"
msgid "Aid the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь грузчику?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 助かるよ……！<br>奴らはすぐに追いついてくるはずだ！
#. de: Danke! Ich glaub, ich kann sie schon hören!
#. fr: Oh, merci beaucoup, ja... ! Reste sur tes gardes, je suis sûr qu'ils ne vont pas tarder à revenir !
#. column 56: You didn't happen to see any...er...fierce-looking flora on your way here, did you?
#. column 57: Was set upon by a─what do you reckon one calls a group of man-eating flowers? A bushel? A bale? A bouquet? Aye, let's go with bouquet─a bouquet of man-eating flowers while making the run from Whetstone. It was all I could do to make it here to this clearing.
#. column 58: Damn things must have been drawn to the scent of my cargo. You see, I'm a porter, and I <i>need</i> to get this delivery of soil sweetener into the hands of the najool tenders at Golmajiik, but I don't think I can either outrun <i>or</i> outduel those things I saw. Might I ask your help?
#. column 59: Aid the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Fine... I don't want to abandon my cargo but...
msgctxt "FateEvent:737:0:60"
msgid "You're a saint! I think I can already hear the “bouquet” approaching!"
msgstr "Ты меня спас! Кажется, я уже слышу, как приближается мой «букет»!"

#. ja: そうか……勝手なことを頼んで悪かった。<br>だが、どうすれば……。
#. de: Verstehe. Dann muss ich die Fracht wohl aufgeben<nbsp>...
#. fr: Oui, désolé, je comprends, ja... Mais comment vais-je bien pouvoir me sortir de cette situation...
#. column 56: You didn't happen to see any...er...fierce-looking flora on your way here, did you?
#. column 57: Was set upon by a─what do you reckon one calls a group of man-eating flowers? A bushel? A bale? A bouquet? Aye, let's go with bouquet─a bouquet of man-eating flowers while making the run from Whetstone. It was all I could do to make it here to this clearing.
#. column 58: Damn things must have been drawn to the scent of my cargo. You see, I'm a porter, and I <i>need</i> to get this delivery of soil sweetener into the hands of the najool tenders at Golmajiik, but I don't think I can either outrun <i>or</i> outduel those things I saw. Might I ask your help?
#. column 59: Aid the porter?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You're a saint! I think I can already hear the “bouquet” approaching!
msgctxt "FateEvent:737:0:62"
msgid "Fine... I don't want to abandon my cargo but..."
msgstr "Ладно... Не хочется бросать груз, но..."

#. ja: おや、こんなところに旅人とは珍しい。<br>私はトライヨラからキノコ採りに来たんだが、<br>マムークの同族に手伝いを断られちゃってね。
#. de: Ah, <if $gn4>eine weitere Reisende<else>ein weiterer Reisender</if>! Ich bin aus Tuliyollal gekommen, um Ik'iit-Ohren zu sammeln. Nein, nicht die echten, sondern eine seltene Pilzart, die genauso aussieht.
#. fr: Ça alors, ja. Il est rare de croiser des voyageurs dans ce coin ! Je suis venu de Tuliyollal pour cueillir des champignons... Seul, car les autres Mamool Ja n'ont pas voulu m'aider.
#. column 57: What I did not expect was to be greeted with so many <i>other</i> varieties...namely ones that are trying to eat me.
#. column 58: If you've nothing pressing, I could certainly use a hand collecting the ears, as well as ridding the area of any hungry fungi.
#. column 59: Assist the forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent! Bring me whatever you can find, no matter how small or ill-shaped. Every sliver will help save lives!
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I fear I have wasted a journey...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:738:0:56"
msgid "Ah, another traveler! I, myself, have journeyed from Tuliyollal to gather ik'iit ears. No, not their <i>actual</i> ears, but a rare variety of mushroom that resembles them, hence the name."
msgstr "А, ещё один путник! Я сам приехал из Тулийоллала собирать уши ик'иит. Нет, не <i>настоящие</i> уши, а редкую разновидность грибов, которые на них похожи. Отсюда и название."

#. ja: しかし、彼らも断るはずだよ。<br>こんなにもキノコの魔物が繁殖しているんだから……。
#. de: Womit ich nicht gerechnet habe, sind die anderen Sorten<nbsp>... Die, die mich auffressen wollen!
#. fr: Enfin, je peux les comprendre, ja... Il n'y a pas que les champignons qui ont proliféré, les monstres aussi.
#. column 56: Ah, another traveler! I, myself, have journeyed from Tuliyollal to gather ik'iit ears. No, not their <i>actual</i> ears, but a rare variety of mushroom that resembles them, hence the name.
#. column 58: If you've nothing pressing, I could certainly use a hand collecting the ears, as well as ridding the area of any hungry fungi.
#. column 59: Assist the forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent! Bring me whatever you can find, no matter how small or ill-shaped. Every sliver will help save lives!
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I fear I have wasted a journey...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:738:0:57"
msgid "What I did not expect was to be greeted with so many <i>other</i> varieties...namely ones that are trying to eat me."
msgstr "А вот чего я не ожидал, так это встретить столько <i>других</i> грибов... Тех, что пытаются меня съесть."

#. ja: ところで、もし君が腕に覚えがあるなら、<br>「ヤクテルの霊茸」集めに付き合ってもらえないかな？<br>地面を探るもよし、動く子実体を倒すもよし、方法は任せるよ。
#. de: Wenn du etwas Zeit erübrigen könntest, könnte ich deine Hilfe beim Sammeln und Vertreiben gut gebrauchen.
#. fr: Tu m'as l'air costaud<if $gn4>e</if>, toi. Ça te dirait de m'aider à récolter des fongus mystiques de Yak T'el ? Tu peux les cueillir sur le sol ou les récupérer sur les monstres, à toi de voir, ja.
#. column 56: Ah, another traveler! I, myself, have journeyed from Tuliyollal to gather ik'iit ears. No, not their <i>actual</i> ears, but a rare variety of mushroom that resembles them, hence the name.
#. column 57: What I did not expect was to be greeted with so many <i>other</i> varieties...namely ones that are trying to eat me.
#. column 59: Assist the forager?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Excellent! Bring me whatever you can find, no matter how small or ill-shaped. Every sliver will help save lives!
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I fear I have wasted a journey...
msgctxt "FateEvent:738:0:58"
msgid "If you've nothing pressing, I could certainly use a hand collecting the ears, as well as ridding the area of any hungry fungi."
msgstr "Если у тебя нет срочных дел, помоги мне собрать эти грибные ушки и прогнать отсюда голодные грибы."

#. ja: フビゴ族の採集人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Wildbeuter helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Venir en aide au cueilleur hoobigo？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Ah, another traveler! I, myself, have journeyed from Tuliyollal to gather ik'iit ears. No, not their <i>actual</i> ears, but a rare variety of mushroom that resembles them, hence the name.
#. column 57: What I did not expect was to be greeted with so many <i>other</i> varieties...namely ones that are trying to eat me.
#. column 58: If you've nothing pressing, I could certainly use a hand collecting the ears, as well as ridding the area of any hungry fungi.
#. column 60: Excellent! Bring me whatever you can find, no matter how small or ill-shaped. Every sliver will help save lives!
#. column 62: \<sigh> Then I fear I have wasted a journey...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
