msgstr "Защитить корзины рыбака?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ありがとう……！<br>魚籠は3つあるから、奪われないように守ってくれ！
#. de: Recht so! Wenn man den Strolchen keinen Riegel vorschiebt, ist man schnell ihr nächster Happen!
#. fr: Merrrci à toi<nbsp>! J'ai trois paniers à défendre, veille à ce qu'on ne les chaparde pas<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Do you see these baskets!? Well, do you? They're practically bursting with bream and bass─bream and bass the lake's denizens would devour if they could! But we cannot let that happen, can we!?
#. column 57: Volunteer to protect the angler's baskets?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: And you would have those creatures just take everything I worked so hard for? For shame, adventurer. FOR SHAME!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:748:0:60"
msgid "Exactly! Let the raptors eat my fish, and what's next? Before you know it, they'll be devouring our daughters, inhaling our in-laws! Protect those baskets with your life, adventurer, or <i>you</i> may be next!"
msgstr "Вот именно! Сначала ящеры сожрут мою рыбу, а потом что? Не успеешь оглянуться, как они примутся за наших дочерей и проглотят всю родню! Защити корзины любой ценой, искатель приключений, а то следующей добычей станешь <i>ты</i>!"

#. ja: そんなこと言わずに、頼むよ～！<br>せっかく釣った魚を諦めるなんて、癪じゃないか～！
#. de: Du willst diesen elenden Biestern die Früchte meiner harten Arbeit einfach so überlassen? Schande über dich, aber mal wirklich!
#. fr: Oh non, je t'en prrrie<nbsp>! Ne me laisse pas tomber, j'ai passé un temps fou avec ma canne ici, et ça n'aura servi à rien...
#. column 56: Do you see these baskets!? Well, do you? They're practically bursting with bream and bass─bream and bass the lake's denizens would devour if they could! But we cannot let that happen, can we!?
#. column 57: Volunteer to protect the angler's baskets?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Exactly! Let the raptors eat my fish, and what's next? Before you know it, they'll be devouring our daughters, inhaling our in-laws! Protect those baskets with your life, adventurer, or <i>you</i> may be next!
msgctxt "FateEvent:748:0:62"
msgid "And you would have those creatures just take everything I worked so hard for? For shame, adventurer. FOR SHAME!"
msgstr "И ты позволишь этим тварям отнять всё, над чем я так трудился? Позор тебе, искатель приключений! ПОЗОР!"

#. ja: あいつら、意外と賢くてさ……。<br>釣人を襲えば、楽に魚が得られると知って、<br>ジッと水中に隠れて狙ってたみたいなんだ。
#. de: Ich muss schon sagen, diese Schelme sind schlauer, als wir ihnen zugestehen. Statt selber auf die Jagd zu gehen, warten sie einfach, bis wir die Arbeit für sie erledigt haben. Ganz schön dreist.
#. fr: Ces créatures étaient plus fûtées qu'il n'y paraît... Elles savent qu'en visant les pêcheurs, elles obtiendront plus de proies qu'en chassant à la rrrégulière.
msgctxt "FateEvent:749:0:56"
msgid "I do say those foul raptors are far more clever than we give them credit for. Instead of endeavoring to catch fish on their own, they wait until I've done all the work for them!"
msgstr "Должен сказать, эти мерзкие ящеры куда умнее, чем мы о них думали. Вместо того чтобы ловить рыбу самим, они ждут, пока я всё сделаю за них!"

#. ja: ああ、そこ行く強そうなお方！<br>助けてください！
#. de: He, du da! Du bist doch <if $gn4>eine starke Abenteurerin<else>ein starker Abenteurer</if>, oder?
#. fr: Ah<nbsp>! Vous m'avez l'air plutôt doué<if $gn4>e</if> pour le combat, non<nbsp>?
#. column 57: Not a quarter bell out of the driftdowns and we're set upon by a pack of ruttin' gomphs. Trampled us from the left, then turned around and trampled us from the right.
#. column 58: Would have trampled us front and back hadn't a freak bolt of lightning spooked 'em. Problem is, the beasts are still mucking about, right along the path home...meaning there's no way I can get the other reforgers back to the outskirts.
#. column 59: Help the reforgers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? You've saved us all...well, that is if you can manage to keep the gomphs' collective eyes on you while I sneak the others around back. Good luck! <i>We'll</i> need it!
#. column 62: Could you at least go and get someone who would, then? No?
msgctxt "FateEvent:750:0:56"
msgid "Are you the reinforcements we called in for? No? Well, be a good soul and hear me out before you go wandering off into the wastes."
msgstr "Ты подкрепление, которое мы звали? Нет? Тогда будь добр, выслушай меня, прежде чем отправиться куда глаза глядят."

#. ja: 資材を拾いに行こうとしたところ、<br>ゴンフォテリウムの群れに遭遇してしまいまして……<br>立ち往生していたんですよ。
#. de: Wir wollten gerade ein paar Materialien sammeln, als wir plötzlich auf eine Gomphotherium-Horde gestoßen sind! Und jetzt kommen wir hier nicht mehr weg.
#. fr: Moi et mes compagnons étions partis récupérer des matériaux quand nous sommes tombés sur une meute de gomphoteriums...
#. column 56: Are you the reinforcements we called in for? No? Well, be a good soul and hear me out before you go wandering off into the wastes.
#. column 58: Would have trampled us front and back hadn't a freak bolt of lightning spooked 'em. Problem is, the beasts are still mucking about, right along the path home...meaning there's no way I can get the other reforgers back to the outskirts.
#. column 59: Help the reforgers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? You've saved us all...well, that is if you can manage to keep the gomphs' collective eyes on you while I sneak the others around back. Good luck! <i>We'll</i> need it!
#. column 62: Could you at least go and get someone who would, then? No?
msgctxt "FateEvent:750:0:57"
msgid "Not a quarter bell out of the driftdowns and we're set upon by a pack of ruttin' gomphs. Trampled us from the left, then turned around and trampled us from the right."
msgstr "Не успели мы и четверти часа отойти от Дрейфующих низин, как на нас налетела стая проклятых гомфотериев. Затоптали сначала слева, потом развернулись и затоптали справа."

#. ja: どうかすみません……！<br>負傷した仲間を逃がすまでの間、<br>あの獣たちを食い止めてはいただけませんか？
#. de: Könntest du diese Bestien nicht kurz ablenken, um meinen verletzten Kumpanen die Flucht zu ermöglichen?
#. fr: Les autres sont toujours coincés<nbsp>! Vous pouvez détourner l'attention de ces monstres pendant que je m'occupe de secourir mes compagnons<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Are you the reinforcements we called in for? No? Well, be a good soul and hear me out before you go wandering off into the wastes.
#. column 57: Not a quarter bell out of the driftdowns and we're set upon by a pack of ruttin' gomphs. Trampled us from the left, then turned around and trampled us from the right.
#. column 59: Help the reforgers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? You've saved us all...well, that is if you can manage to keep the gomphs' collective eyes on you while I sneak the others around back. Good luck! <i>We'll</i> need it!
#. column 62: Could you at least go and get someone who would, then? No?
msgctxt "FateEvent:750:0:58"
msgid "Would have trampled us front and back hadn't a freak bolt of lightning spooked 'em. Problem is, the beasts are still mucking about, right along the path home...meaning there's no way I can get the other reforgers back to the outskirts."
msgstr "И спереди бы, и сзади затоптали, если бы их не спугнула молния. Беда в том, что звери всё ещё слоняются у дороги домой... Других восстановителей мне никак не провести к окраине."

#. ja: ドリフトダウンズの拾得人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Wiederschaffern helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider la détectrice de La Dérive<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Are you the reinforcements we called in for? No? Well, be a good soul and hear me out before you go wandering off into the wastes.
#. column 57: Not a quarter bell out of the driftdowns and we're set upon by a pack of ruttin' gomphs. Trampled us from the left, then turned around and trampled us from the right.
#. column 58: Would have trampled us front and back hadn't a freak bolt of lightning spooked 'em. Problem is, the beasts are still mucking about, right along the path home...meaning there's no way I can get the other reforgers back to the outskirts.
#. column 60: You will? You've saved us all...well, that is if you can manage to keep the gomphs' collective eyes on you while I sneak the others around back. Good luck! <i>We'll</i> need it!
#. column 62: Could you at least go and get someone who would, then? No?
