msgid "Help the reforgers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь восстановителям?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ううっ、助かります！<br>倒してしまっても問題ございませんので、<br>どうかよろしくお願いします！
#. de: Oh, hab vielen Dank! Wenn du es schaffst, kannst du sie auch umlegen und nicht nur aufhalten. Hauptsache, wir kommen hier lebend weg!
#. fr: Oh, quelle chance que vous soyez passé<if $gn4>e</if> par ici<nbsp>! Merci<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Are you the reinforcements we called in for? No? Well, be a good soul and hear me out before you go wandering off into the wastes.
#. column 57: Not a quarter bell out of the driftdowns and we're set upon by a pack of ruttin' gomphs. Trampled us from the left, then turned around and trampled us from the right.
#. column 58: Would have trampled us front and back hadn't a freak bolt of lightning spooked 'em. Problem is, the beasts are still mucking about, right along the path home...meaning there's no way I can get the other reforgers back to the outskirts.
#. column 59: Help the reforgers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Could you at least go and get someone who would, then? No?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:750:0:60"
msgid "You will? You've saved us all...well, that is if you can manage to keep the gomphs' collective eyes on you while I sneak the others around back. Good luck! <i>We'll</i> need it!"
msgstr "Правда поможешь? Ты нас всех спасёшь... Если сумеешь отвлечь на себя всех гомфотериев, пока я тайком выведу остальных в обход. Удачи! Она <i>нам</i> пригодится!"

#. ja: ううっ、そうですか……！<br>でもこのままじゃ……。
#. de: Oh, verstehe<nbsp>... Tja, aber was machen wir denn nun?
#. fr: Oh, euh... Ah, bien... Je vais aller chercher de l'aide ailleurs.
#. column 56: Are you the reinforcements we called in for? No? Well, be a good soul and hear me out before you go wandering off into the wastes.
#. column 57: Not a quarter bell out of the driftdowns and we're set upon by a pack of ruttin' gomphs. Trampled us from the left, then turned around and trampled us from the right.
#. column 58: Would have trampled us front and back hadn't a freak bolt of lightning spooked 'em. Problem is, the beasts are still mucking about, right along the path home...meaning there's no way I can get the other reforgers back to the outskirts.
#. column 59: Help the reforgers?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: You will? You've saved us all...well, that is if you can manage to keep the gomphs' collective eyes on you while I sneak the others around back. Good luck! <i>We'll</i> need it!
msgctxt "FateEvent:750:0:62"
msgid "Could you at least go and get someone who would, then? No?"
msgstr "Тогда хотя бы найди кого-нибудь, кто согласится. Нет?"

#. ja: こんなところまで来てるってことは、<br>君はきっと、駆除人だよね？<br>よかった、頼みたいことがあるんだ！
#. de: Die Tatsache, dass du hier herumläufst, lässt vermuten, dass du <if $gn4>eine Merzerin<else>ein Merzer</if> bist. Könnte ich dich wohl um etwas bitten?
#. fr: Si tu traînes dans le coin, c'est que tu dois être <if $gn4>ex<shy>ter<shy>mi<shy>na<shy>tri<shy>ce<else>exterminateur</if>, non<nbsp>?
#. column 57: How can I be so heartless, you ask? Have you ever even seen a <i>woolback</i>! They're absolutely horrific creatures with teeth as sharp as razors, and horns as sharp as their teeth! They'll gore you slowly so the blood stays warm as they drink it, and then they'll trample your empty corpse until it's flat and use it to line their nests.
#. column 58: Well? Do you still need more convincing, or are you going to help rid the road of these deadly nuisances?
#. column 59: Kill for the courier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Well then get to it! Before they set their eyes on <i>me</i>!
#. column 62: No? Did you not hear the part about the trampling? The blood drinking?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:751:0:56"
msgid "Tell me, have you experience <i>killing things</i>? Good, because I just so happen to have several things that need killing quick."
msgstr "Скажи, ты умеешь <i>убивать всякую живность</i>? Отлично, мне как раз нужно кое-кого поскорее прикончить."

#. ja: 僕は配達の仕事中なんだけど……<br>ウールバックが、なぜか街道にいるのを見つけてさ。
#. de: Eigentlich sollte ich etwas ausliefern, aber an so einem Wollrücken mitten auf dem Weg ist einfach kein Vorbeikommen.
#. fr: J'étais en chemin pour effectuer ma livraison quand je me suis retrouvé face à un groupe de dos-laineux me barrant le chemin.
#. column 56: Tell me, have you experience <i>killing things</i>? Good, because I just so happen to have several things that need killing quick.
#. column 58: Well? Do you still need more convincing, or are you going to help rid the road of these deadly nuisances?
#. column 59: Kill for the courier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Well then get to it! Before they set their eyes on <i>me</i>!
#. column 62: No? Did you not hear the part about the trampling? The blood drinking?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:751:0:57"
msgid "How can I be so heartless, you ask? Have you ever even seen a <i>woolback</i>! They're absolutely horrific creatures with teeth as sharp as razors, and horns as sharp as their teeth! They'll gore you slowly so the blood stays warm as they drink it, and then they'll trample your empty corpse until it's flat and use it to line their nests."
msgstr "Спрашиваешь, как я могу быть такой бессердечной? Ты вообще видел <i>шерстеспина</i>?! Это жуткие твари с зубами острее бритв, а рога у них ещё острее зубов! Они медленно пронзают жертву, чтобы кровь оставалась тёплой, пока они её пьют, а потом топчут пустую оболочку, пока та не станет плоской, и выстилают ею гнёзда."

#. ja: このままじゃ、どう見ても危険でしょ？<br>だから、あいつら駆除してほしいんだけど……<br>お願いできないかな？
#. de: Könntest du vielleicht kurzen Prozess machen mit diesen Viechern? Bitte, sonst komm ich doch hier nicht weiter!
#. fr: C'est trop risqué de s'aventurer plus loin, alors tu veux bien t'occuper d'eux pour moi<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Tell me, have you experience <i>killing things</i>? Good, because I just so happen to have several things that need killing quick.
#. column 57: How can I be so heartless, you ask? Have you ever even seen a <i>woolback</i>! They're absolutely horrific creatures with teeth as sharp as razors, and horns as sharp as their teeth! They'll gore you slowly so the blood stays warm as they drink it, and then they'll trample your empty corpse until it's flat and use it to line their nests.
#. column 59: Kill for the courier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Well then get to it! Before they set their eyes on <i>me</i>!
#. column 62: No? Did you not hear the part about the trampling? The blood drinking?
msgctxt "FateEvent:751:0:58"
msgid "Well? Do you still need more convincing, or are you going to help rid the road of these deadly nuisances?"
msgstr "Ну? Тебе всё ещё нужны доводы или поможешь очистить дорогу от этих опасных тварей?"

#. ja: 怯えた配達人に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem verängstigten Lieferanten helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider le livreur apeuré<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Tell me, have you experience <i>killing things</i>? Good, because I just so happen to have several things that need killing quick.
#. column 57: How can I be so heartless, you ask? Have you ever even seen a <i>woolback</i>! They're absolutely horrific creatures with teeth as sharp as razors, and horns as sharp as their teeth! They'll gore you slowly so the blood stays warm as they drink it, and then they'll trample your empty corpse until it's flat and use it to line their nests.
#. column 58: Well? Do you still need more convincing, or are you going to help rid the road of these deadly nuisances?
#. column 60: Well then get to it! Before they set their eyes on <i>me</i>!
#. column 62: No? Did you not hear the part about the trampling? The blood drinking?
