msgctxt "FateEvent:751:0:59"
msgid "Kill for the courier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Прикончить тварей ради курьера?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 助かるう！<br>それじゃ、パパっとよろしくね！
#. de: Vielen Dank, großartig! Und beeil dich bitte, ja?
#. fr: Excellente nouvelle<nbsp>! Je compte sur toi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Tell me, have you experience <i>killing things</i>? Good, because I just so happen to have several things that need killing quick.
#. column 57: How can I be so heartless, you ask? Have you ever even seen a <i>woolback</i>! They're absolutely horrific creatures with teeth as sharp as razors, and horns as sharp as their teeth! They'll gore you slowly so the blood stays warm as they drink it, and then they'll trample your empty corpse until it's flat and use it to line their nests.
#. column 58: Well? Do you still need more convincing, or are you going to help rid the road of these deadly nuisances?
#. column 59: Kill for the courier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: No? Did you not hear the part about the trampling? The blood drinking?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:751:0:60"
msgid "Well then get to it! Before they set their eyes on <i>me</i>!"
msgstr "Ну так за дело! Пока они не нацелились на <i>меня</i>!"

#. ja: そっかあ、忙しいかあ。<br>あらためて駆除人に依頼してみるかな……。
#. de: Zu beschäftigt, was? Verstehe schon. Ich hänge ja auch total im Zeitplan hinterher<nbsp>...
#. fr: Je vois... Bien, je vais aller chercher quelqu'un d'autre alors...
#. column 56: Tell me, have you experience <i>killing things</i>? Good, because I just so happen to have several things that need killing quick.
#. column 57: How can I be so heartless, you ask? Have you ever even seen a <i>woolback</i>! They're absolutely horrific creatures with teeth as sharp as razors, and horns as sharp as their teeth! They'll gore you slowly so the blood stays warm as they drink it, and then they'll trample your empty corpse until it's flat and use it to line their nests.
#. column 58: Well? Do you still need more convincing, or are you going to help rid the road of these deadly nuisances?
#. column 59: Kill for the courier?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Well then get to it! Before they set their eyes on <i>me</i>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:751:0:62"
msgid "No? Did you not hear the part about the trampling? The blood drinking?"
msgstr "Нет? Ты не слышал про то, как они топчут жертв? И пьют кровь?"

#. ja: 唐突にすみません、助けてくださいませんか……！<br>ロネークを狙い、凶暴な肉食獣の群れが現れたようなんです！
#. de: Du siehst aus, als hättest du schon einige Schlachten geschlagen. Jemanden wie dich könnten wir gebrauchen.
#. fr: Excusez-moi, je suis désolée de vous demander ceci si sou<shy>dai<shy>ne<shy>ment, mais... des monstres se sont attaqués à un trrroupeau de rroneeks<nbsp>!
#. column 57: Lunyucaua'pyas─terrible hulking creatures─have descended from the hills and frightened off our rroneek. But the herd will not have gone far, which means they're still in danger!
#. column 58: Help the Hhetsarro herder?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you! And please take care. There were...more than one. <i>Many</i> more than one.
#. column 62: I see. Then I shall pray to the gods that the monsters do not find the herd, for it would mean my people starve...
msgctxt "FateEvent:752:0:56"
msgid "Friend! Your scars tell the tale of many battles, and the Hhetsarro are in need of a great warrior today."
msgstr "Друг! По твоим шрамам видно, что ты прошёл через множество битв. Сегодня хетсарро нужен отважный воин."

#. ja: ロネークの群れは、ここからそう離れていない……<br>餌食になる前に、どうか肉食獣を追い返してほしいんです！
#. de: Ein paar Lunyucaua'pya, schreckliche und riesige Kreaturen, sind von den Hügeln hinabgekommen und haben unsere Rroneek verscheucht. Aber die Herde ist sicher nicht weit, was bedeutet, dass sie weiterhin in Gefahr ist!
#. fr: Ils ne sont pas loin d'ici... Pourriez-vous chasser ces prrrédateurs avant qu'ils ne dévorent tous les rroneeks<nbsp>?
#. column 56: Friend! Your scars tell the tale of many battles, and the Hhetsarro are in need of a great warrior today.
#. column 58: Help the Hhetsarro herder?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Thank you! And please take care. There were...more than one. <i>Many</i> more than one.
#. column 62: I see. Then I shall pray to the gods that the monsters do not find the herd, for it would mean my people starve...
msgctxt "FateEvent:752:0:57"
msgid "Lunyucaua'pyas─terrible hulking creatures─have descended from the hills and frightened off our rroneek. But the herd will not have gone far, which means they're still in danger!"
msgstr "Луныукауа'пья — огромные и страшные твари — спустились с холмов и распугали наших рронеков. Но стадо далеко не уйдёт, а значит, оно всё ещё в опасности!"

#. ja: ヘイザ・アロ族の女性に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der Hhetsarro-Hirtin helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Aider cette femme hhetsarro<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: Friend! Your scars tell the tale of many battles, and the Hhetsarro are in need of a great warrior today.
#. column 57: Lunyucaua'pyas─terrible hulking creatures─have descended from the hills and frightened off our rroneek. But the herd will not have gone far, which means they're still in danger!
#. column 60: Thank you! And please take care. There were...more than one. <i>Many</i> more than one.
#. column 62: I see. Then I shall pray to the gods that the monsters do not find the herd, for it would mean my people starve...
