msgctxt "FateEvent:754:0:59"
msgid "Aid the reforger?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Помочь восстановительнице?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ええっ、本当にいいのかい？<br>せっかくだから、お言葉に甘えるとしようか……。<br>「旧市街の資材」を拾ったら、あたしに届けておくれよ。
#. de: Das würdest du wirklich tun? Du glaubst nicht, wie dankbar ich dir bin! Falls du Baumaterial findest, bring es mir bitte, ja?
#. fr: Oh, c'est vrai<nbsp>? Dans ce cas, j'aimerais que tu ailles me récupérer des matériaux dans la Rive noyée<nbsp>!
#. column 56: If you're from the camp, you can slog off because I've already claimed this spot for salvage. Reforger's rights say I've got a good six bells left. It's there in the charter.
#. column 57: You're <i>not</i> here for salvage? Well, my apologies. I've had to deal with more than a few knobs trying to jump my claim today...not to mention these damn bolt hounds.
#. column 58: Speaking of which, if you're not here to <i>ruin</i> my life, might I interest you in making it a little better? I could definitely use a hand collecting scrap, as well as scaring off the curs...and I can pay.
#. column 59: Aid the reforger?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: Well, you can't fault a girl for asking, can you? Now, if you don't mind, you can kindly get the hell off my claim.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:754:0:60"
msgid "Wonderful. Now as for what <i>exactly</i> to collect, well...it's not like all scrap has a helpful sign above it that says “useful” and “useless,” so you'll just have to bring me everything you find and let me be the judge. Happy hunting!"
msgstr "Замечательно! А что <i>именно</i> собирать... Ну, у лома ведь нет табличек «годится» и «не годится», так что принеси мне всё, что найдёшь, а я уж разберусь. Удачи!"

#. ja: そうそう、知らない他人のために危険を負うべきじゃないさ。<br>あたしのことは気にせず、自分の仕事をしておくれ。
#. de: Das ist mehr als verständlich. Wer hat schon Zeit, sich um anderer Leute An<shy>ge<shy>legen<shy>heiten zu kümmern?
#. fr: Je comprends, moi non plus je me vois mal accepter la requête d'une parfaite inconnue... Bon, je vais tenter d'y retourner toute seule...
#. column 56: If you're from the camp, you can slog off because I've already claimed this spot for salvage. Reforger's rights say I've got a good six bells left. It's there in the charter.
#. column 57: You're <i>not</i> here for salvage? Well, my apologies. I've had to deal with more than a few knobs trying to jump my claim today...not to mention these damn bolt hounds.
#. column 58: Speaking of which, if you're not here to <i>ruin</i> my life, might I interest you in making it a little better? I could definitely use a hand collecting scrap, as well as scaring off the curs...and I can pay.
#. column 59: Aid the reforger?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Wonderful. Now as for what <i>exactly</i> to collect, well...it's not like all scrap has a helpful sign above it that says “useful” and “useless,” so you'll just have to bring me everything you find and let me be the judge. Happy hunting!
msgctxt "FateEvent:754:0:62"
msgid "Well, you can't fault a girl for asking, can you? Now, if you don't mind, you can kindly get the hell off my claim."
msgstr "Ну, не вини девушку за то, что спросила. А теперь, если не возражаешь, убирайся с моего участка к чёрту."

#. ja: どうだい、「旧市街の資材」は拾えたかい？
#. de: Und, hast du schon etwas Baumaterial gefunden?
#. fr: Alors, tu as réussi à récupérer des morceaux de matériau de la Rive noyée<nbsp>?
#. column 60: Why...it's <i>all</i> of use. How did you do that? You know, I don't care, as long as you can bring me more!
#. column 62: Thinking of keeping it yourself now, are you? I've got my eye on you.
msgctxt "FateEvent:755:0:56"
msgid "Let me see that scrap of yours and I'll tell you whether or not it's of any use."
msgstr "Покажи-ка свой лом, и я скажу, пригодится он или нет."

#. ja: ああ、こりゃまだ使えそうだ！<br>あんた目がいいねえ、助かるよ。
#. de: Ja, das sieht noch ganz brauchbar aus. Du hast wirklich einen guten Blick!
#. fr: Ah, parfait<nbsp>! Tu as l'œil, dis donc<nbsp>!
#. column 56: Let me see that scrap of yours and I'll tell you whether or not it's of any use.
#. column 62: Thinking of keeping it yourself now, are you? I've got my eye on you.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:755:0:60"
msgid "Why...it's <i>all</i> of use. How did you do that? You know, I don't care, as long as you can bring me more!"
msgstr "Да... Пригодится <i>всё</i>. Как тебе это удалось? Хотя знаешь что, мне всё равно, лишь бы приносил ещё!"

#. ja: あんたの親切には、心から感謝してるよ。<br>できる範囲で大丈夫さ。
#. de: Ich bin dir sehr dankbar für deine Freundlichkeit. Schau einfach, was sich machen lässt.
#. fr: C'est déjà bien gentil de t'être porté<if $gn4>e</if> volontaire.
#. column 56: Let me see that scrap of yours and I'll tell you whether or not it's of any use.
#. column 60: Why...it's <i>all</i> of use. How did you do that? You know, I don't care, as long as you can bring me more!
msgctxt "FateEvent:755:0:62"
msgid "Thinking of keeping it yourself now, are you? I've got my eye on you."
msgstr "Надумал оставить находки себе? Я за тобой слежу."

#. ja: 資材が見つからなくても、気にする必要はないさ。<br>できる範囲で大丈夫だからね。
#. de: Gräme dich nicht, falls du nichts findest. Schau einfach, was sich machen lässt.
#. fr: Si tu ne trouves rien, ne t'en fais pas trop non plus<nbsp>! C'est déjà bien gentil d'y aller à ma place<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:756:0:56"
msgid "Found nothing yet? Don't get too down on yourself. Takes a good reforger a dozen years in the field to hone her craft. You keep trying, though. I'll be right here to assay anything you find."
msgstr "Пока ничего не нашёл? Не расстраивайся. Хорошему восстановителю нужны годы практики, чтобы отточить мастерство. Продолжай искать, а я буду здесь и оценю всё, что найдёшь."

#. ja: どうだい、「旧市街の資材」は拾えたかい？
#. de: Konntest du etwa noch mehr Baumaterial finden?
#. fr: Alors, tu as réussi à récupérer des morceaux de matériau de la Rive noyée<nbsp>?
#. column 60: I'll say, for a greenhorn, you've got quite the nose for scrap. You should consider joining the camp and salvaging your own claims. That is, after you've finished helping me with this one.
#. column 62: My bells are almost up, and I reckon a new reforger will be along to stake her claim soon enough. I'll stay as long as I can, though, if you're still game.
msgctxt "FateEvent:757:0:56"
msgid "You still at it, then?"
msgstr "Всё ещё ищешь?"

#. ja: おかげさまで、十分な資材が集まったよ。<br>見ず知らずの人間のためにここまでしてくれるとは、<br>あんたの人が良すぎて、ちょっと心配になるくらいさ。
#. de: Dank deiner Hilfe habe ich nun genug beisammen. Dass es so herzensgute Helfer wie dich noch gibt<nbsp>...
#. fr: Parfait<nbsp>! J'ai tout ce qu'il me faut à présent. Merci d'avoir accordé ton aide à une parfaite inconnue<nbsp>! C'est presque trop gentil de ta part.
#. column 56: You still at it, then?
#. column 62: My bells are almost up, and I reckon a new reforger will be along to stake her claim soon enough. I'll stay as long as I can, though, if you're still game.
msgctxt "FateEvent:757:0:60"
msgid "I'll say, for a greenhorn, you've got quite the nose for scrap. You should consider joining the camp and salvaging your own claims. That is, after you've finished helping me with this one."
msgstr "Для новичка у тебя отличное чутьё на лом. Подумай, может, вступишь в лагерь и займёшься поиском собственных участков. Конечно, сначала помоги мне с этим."

#. ja: おかげさまで、十分な資材が集まったよ。<br>そろそろ引き上げようと思うから、<br>もし荷物になりそうなものがあるなら、引き取るよ。
#. de: Nun habe ich endlich genug Mateial zusammen. So langsam werde ich mich wieder nach Hause machen, also gib mir gern alles, was dir zu schwer werden könnte.
#. fr: Grâce à toi j'ai tout ce qu'il me faut. Je vais bientôt rentrer, donc s'il te reste des matériaux, donne-les-moi<nbsp>!
#. column 56: You still at it, then?
#. column 60: I'll say, for a greenhorn, you've got quite the nose for scrap. You should consider joining the camp and salvaging your own claims. That is, after you've finished helping me with this one.
msgctxt "FateEvent:757:0:62"
msgid "My bells are almost up, and I reckon a new reforger will be along to stake her claim soon enough. I'll stay as long as I can, though, if you're still game."
msgstr "Моё время почти вышло, скоро сюда заявится новый восстановитель и займёт участок. Но пока я здесь, буду ждать, если ты ещё не передумал."

#. ja: おかげさまで、十分な資材が集まったよ。<br>そろそろ引き上げようと思うから、<br>もし荷物になりそうなものがあるなら、引き取るよ。
#. de: Nun habe ich endlich genug Material zusammen. So langsam werde ich mich wieder nach Hause machen, also gib mir gern alles, was dir zu schwer werden könnte.
#. fr: Grâce à toi j'ai tout ce qu'il me faut. Je vais bientôt rentrer, donc s'il te reste des matériaux, donne-les-moi<nbsp>!
msgctxt "FateEvent:758:0:56"
msgid "My bells are almost up, and I reckon a new reforger will be along to stake her claim soon enough. I'll stay as long as I can, though, if you're still game."
msgstr "Моё время почти вышло, скоро сюда заявится новый восстановитель и займёт участок. Но пока я здесь, буду ждать, если ты ещё не передумал."

#. ja: ゼェ、ゼェ……すまない、そこのあんた……。<br>見たところ、戦いに慣れてそうな雰囲気だけど……<br>暴れロネークを鎮めてくれないか？
#. de: \<keuch> \<keuch><nbsp>... Bitte<nbsp>... Hör mich an. Eines unserer etwas <i>ambitionierteren</i> Männchen hat heute den Leitbullen herausgefordert und wurde von ihm zurechtgewiesen.
#. fr: (halète)... (halète)... Hé oh... Toi, là<nbsp>! T'as l'airrr de savoir bien manier ton arme. Tu veux pas m'aider à calmer un rroneek enragé<nbsp>?
#. column 57: This behavior is not at all uncommon, but in this particular instance, the male─we call him Hwittaeki─did not take well his humbling, and has grown...let's say, “agitated.” So much so, I fear for the safety of the calves and cows.
#. column 58: Aid the herder in calming the unruly rroneek?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Once in a frenzy such as this, I'm afraid the only thing that will calm a rroneek is a good cuffing. But please be careful. Just because he lost to the bull, doesn't make him any less dangerous.
#. column 62: I cannot say I blame you for wanting to keep a wide berth. I've seen a good too many of my friends gored.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "FateEvent:759:0:56"
msgid "\\<pant> \\<pant><br>Please... A moment...<br>Earlier today, one of our herd's more...<i>ambitious</i> males challenged the dominant bull, and was thoroughly humiliated."
msgstr "<i>Тяжело дышит...</i><br>Постойте... Минутку...<br>Сегодня один из наших самых... <i>амбициозных</i> самцов бросил вызов главному быку и потерпел сокрушительное поражение."

#. ja: 群れのボスの座を賭けて挑んだ若いロネークが、<br>敗れた末に、暴れだしちまって……。<br>このままじゃ、周囲に被害が及ぶはずだ！
#. de: Das kommt häufiger vor, aber in diesem speziellen Fall ist dem Männchen seine Niederlage ziemlich sauer aufgestoßen. Jetzt wütet es herum und ich fürchte um die Kälber und Kühe.
#. fr: C'est un jeunot qui a tenté de devenirrr chef de meute. Mais après sa défaite, il a vu rouge<nbsp>! Si on le laisse faire, il va tout détruire sur son passage.
#. column 56: \<pant> \<pant><br>Please... A moment...<br>Earlier today, one of our herd's more...<i>ambitious</i> males challenged the dominant bull, and was thoroughly humiliated.
#. column 58: Aid the herder in calming the unruly rroneek?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Once in a frenzy such as this, I'm afraid the only thing that will calm a rroneek is a good cuffing. But please be careful. Just because he lost to the bull, doesn't make him any less dangerous.
#. column 62: I cannot say I blame you for wanting to keep a wide berth. I've seen a good too many of my friends gored.
msgctxt "FateEvent:759:0:57"
msgid "This behavior is not at all uncommon, but in this particular instance, the male─we call him Hwittaeki─did not take well his humbling, and has grown...let's say, “agitated.” So much so, I fear for the safety of the calves and cows."
msgstr "Такое случается нередко, но в этот раз самец по имени Хвиттаэки не смог смириться с унижением и... скажем так, «разошёлся». Боюсь, он может навредить телятам и самкам."

#. ja: ヘイザ・アロ族の男性に協力しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※このF.A.T.E.の推奨レベルは<num $n1>です。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Dem Hirten beim Beruhigen des Rroneek helfen?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Empfohlene Stufe: <num $n1></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Prêter main-forte à cet homme hhetsarro<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* Le niveau recommandé pour cet ALÉA est <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 56: \<pant> \<pant><br>Please... A moment...<br>Earlier today, one of our herd's more...<i>ambitious</i> males challenged the dominant bull, and was thoroughly humiliated.
#. column 57: This behavior is not at all uncommon, but in this particular instance, the male─we call him Hwittaeki─did not take well his humbling, and has grown...let's say, “agitated.” So much so, I fear for the safety of the calves and cows.
#. column 60: Once in a frenzy such as this, I'm afraid the only thing that will calm a rroneek is a good cuffing. But please be careful. Just because he lost to the bull, doesn't make him any less dangerous.
#. column 62: I cannot say I blame you for wanting to keep a wide berth. I've seen a good too many of my friends gored.
