msgctxt "FateEvent:768:0:58"
msgid "Collect Blood of the Land for Br'uk Vaw?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Собрать Кровь земли для Брук Вава?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Рекомендуемый уровень для этого события F.A.T.E. — <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: ワシも元は狩人じゃが、もはや身体がまともに動かん。<br>唐突な願いを受け入れてくれて、感謝するぞい。
#. de: Aspisvipern werden vom Blut des Bodens angezogen. Je mehr wir davon haben, desto mehr Schlangen können wir niederstrecken. Ich werde danach suchen, doch meine müden Beine tragen mich nicht sehr weit.
#. fr: J'ai beau être un ancien rôdeur vipère, avec l'âge on perd en endurance. Je te remercie d'avoir accepté de me prêter main-forte.
#. column 56: We cannot know when the Serpentlord will next awaken, but by the time he has risen, it will already be too late. No, if we are to take down the fiend, we must lure him forth that we might fight on <i>our</i> terms.
#. column 57: And how might we do that, you ask? Why, by taking what is most dear to him─his children. And that will require the <i>Blood of the Land</i>.
#. column 58: Collect Blood of the Land for Br'uk Vaw?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 62: That is...unfortunate. However, I shall not abandon hope. I will gather what I can and face the Serpentlord myself, if I must.
msgctxt "FateEvent:768:0:60"
msgid "Asps of the Shaaloani are drawn to this crystal, so the more we collect, the more of the snakes we can slay. I will do my best to search, but my tired legs can only carry me so far."
msgstr "Аспиды из Шаалоани тянутся к этим кристаллам. Чем больше соберём, тем больше змей сможем перебить. Я тоже постараюсь поискать, но ноги уже не те, далеко не уйду."

#. ja: そうか……まあ仕方あるまい。<br>ワシは必ずやヤツを狩らねばならんからの、<br>地道に集めてみるとしよう。
#. de: Das ist bedauerlich. Doch ich werde die Hoffnung nicht aufgeben. Ich werde sammeln, so viel ich kann, und mich dem Schlangenkönig notfalls alleine stellen.
#. fr: Très bien, je comprends. Je ne dévierai pas de ma mission tant qu'elle ne sera pas terminée. Tu sais où me trouver si tu changes d'avis.
#. column 56: We cannot know when the Serpentlord will next awaken, but by the time he has risen, it will already be too late. No, if we are to take down the fiend, we must lure him forth that we might fight on <i>our</i> terms.
#. column 57: And how might we do that, you ask? Why, by taking what is most dear to him─his children. And that will require the <i>Blood of the Land</i>.
#. column 58: Collect Blood of the Land for Br'uk Vaw?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※The recommended level for this FATE is <num $n1>.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 60: Asps of the Shaaloani are drawn to this crystal, so the more we collect, the more of the snakes we can slay. I will do my best to search, but my tired legs can only carry me so far.
msgctxt "FateEvent:768:0:62"
msgid "That is...unfortunate. However, I shall not abandon hope. I will gather what I can and face the Serpentlord myself, if I must."
msgstr "Жаль... Но я не теряю надежды. Соберу сколько смогу и, если придётся, сам встречусь со Змеиным владыкой."
